camssa:12e6edf4-bd8c-41d7-96cc-5cb40c0d6fd3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the first star corresponds to the publication of data on the web as open data. The EIF specification encourages Member States to make their open government data available on the web in any format. Therefore, the specification facilitates the publication of open data.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:be1ebcc4-6a03-4a96-8277-a09fd3d1c448 .

