camssa:1cfdcae5-1815-457e-b29a-c0c4e7282ba0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There exists an EIF community where any stakeholder has the opportunity to contribute to the development\r
of the EIF. This contribution requires to create a Joinup (European Commission's EU Login) account.\r
Besides, there are purpose-driven consultations held from time to time, and there is the possibility to provide\r
feedback on the specification through public channels (e.g., webinars).\r
\r
EIF community reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/solution/eif-toolbox\r
/eif-community\r
\r
EIF webinars reference:\r
