camssa:22c98222-a238-4fdf-b215-f3b14b404cd1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The recommentation #5 of the EIF specification is to enable the exposure of European public services\r
interfaces. Following this recommendation, in combination with the appropriate specifications, can enable\r
the exposure of such interfaces.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8b37785c-8a44-4274-9160-56316a395ad3 .

