camssa:2d83d6ed-c477-4c42-8dfb-e2884c8f3df7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is a wide community that provides public support to the EIF specification. The ISA2 Programme deals\r
with the specification maintenance, and offers training opportunities and public support on interoperability\r
aspects, particularly on the EIF recommendations. Moreover, there is also the National Interoperability\r
Framework Observatory (NIFO) that is entirely dedicated to provide support to national public\r
administrations.\r
\r
ISA2 reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/actions/continuously-updating-european-interoperability-strategy_en\r
\r
NIFO reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e37db2f5-07bc-42ad-8117-93dd30ef0140 .

