        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF specification addresses data protecion and is fully aligned with the EU Directives 2016/680 and 2007/2/EC, and the Regulation (EU) 910/2014 and 2016/679.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
