camssa:4eccd3c6-1dd1-415e-9553-e414c44144a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIF specification has been developed and deployed by the European Commission; therefore, the\r
specification is a European Standard.\r
\r
ISA2 Programme reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1343f68-d8e9-4197-a6e4-60c429f66fa8 .

camssa:500d8d70-508b-46eb-b24e-68213e2b66fd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF recommendation #17 encourages the use and application of digital channels for the delivery of\r
European public services. Besides, the specification widely promotes its coexistence with the physical ones.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:61db14ab-035b-4212-bc05-0ff321855677 .

