camssa:7dc0a447-a9ce-46a2-8cdf-862b7f82bf94 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The domain of application of the EIF is the interoperability domain in the context of the public sector. Moreover, the EIF specification could be used 'as-is' to other domains, such as the location information domain. It is the case of the European Union Location Framework (EULF) Blueprint, also within the ISA2 Programme, which is intended to provide a guidance framework for using location information in policy and digital public services.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\r
\r
EULF Blueprint reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/elise-european-location-interoperability-solutions-e-government/solution/eulf-blueprint/about\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f217164b-1f04-42d5-9b74-77c20594f7e3 .

