camssa:837c8270-6c13-4b5a-8b4e-52d44dbc81ab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF specification encourages the modelling of business processes and suggests how these processes\r
should be aligned when delivering European public services; however, it does not facilitate any specific\r
technique.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:441eae00-3091-434e-b7af-df920f14b252 .

camssa:84a56646-a338-45da-b51a-0176b87392eb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ISA and ISA2 Programmes have been promoting the creation of cross-sectorial communities, openly\r
creating and sharing relevant information and practices within the European Union. In the ISA2 Programme\r
homepage, there are recorded presentations and disseminations on how EU Member States have\r
implemented the EIF specification in their governments, and how they have perceived their experience.\r
\r
ISA2 Programme reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6762b83f-b460-4802-94f7-da537d9f19fc .

