camssa:8e399a73-4450-41b9-85c8-7e1e5bd11a26 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF recommendation #17 encourages the use and simplification of digital channels for the delivery of\r
European public services. The specification advocates for the availability of at least one digital channel for accessing a European public service, and ensures the co-existence of both the digital and physical channels in order to make digitisation progress and real.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:33b7b6e7-8cd4-49fe-852e-a2cbe0e92904 .

camssa:90363c11-75c7-4b44-97c5-9eaf891aed08 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIF specification was developed by a large community within the European Commission (EC) and all\r
the EC patents are available with any restrictions related to (F)RAND.\r
\r
EC (ISA2), Communication (COM(2017)134) reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0fd1acce-4021-4374-b701-f763a06fcd89 .

