camssa:9367e08f-7b46-4730-bb1c-5b408da64869 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIF specification does not provide the precise requirements in order to facilitate organisational\r
interoperability agreements; however, the specification eases the drafting of such agreements in the CEF\r
(Connecting Europe Facility) Building Blocks context, which is focused on the delivery of digital public\r
services across Europe. There is no evidence, nor final report of any building block having been reviewed by\r
the EIF though.\r
\r
COM(2016) 179 final, section 3;\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/en/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A52016DC0179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e017bb5e-d485-4a7b-93d3-4cb2ad909c46 .

camssa:948303af-99dc-4efc-8437-bd0da8e49133 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF recommendations #46 and #47 promote the secure and trustworthy processing of data, and provides a set of security processes and management functions to this end by means of requirements and services.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b5c12c41-c295-4992-a8fe-90d24df61682 .

