camssa:a3a47bd9-f9f8-4b01-afc1-ab74c41deaaf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF specification (recommendation #18) oversees long-term preservation of electronic resources, and this is forseen and specified in all the EU Communication and Decision documentations legally supporting the preservation of data, information and knowledge from public administrations' processes.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4407de1a-0f91-46cc-aee4-69f886ea7bbf .

camssa:a5e8e7b5-20ed-49a8-b6b1-07ab096e3880 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The recommentation #5 of the EIF specification is to promote and provide guidance in the provision of\r
comprehensibility in European public services. Comprehensibility is achievable by combining appropriate\r
specifications, and such comprehensibility should manifest itself in public services interfaces as described in\r
the EIF.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f835f642-b29c-4cce-9209-b3ffe77af0b4 .

