camssa:a6fe7ba1-7a6c-46c5-be24-bc3fabba9fa9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF does not allow the amendment of any of its recommendations; recomendations are met or are not.\r
Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2bb38164-cd94-4fd8-9904-a08c2fd625d0 .

camssa:a8375464-9b91-411b-9395-568c3250d520 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"According to the reference study on the EIF components evaluation, the specification pursues broad\r
objectives, and its recommendations are rather general and lack the detail necessary for a more successful\r
implementation of such framework. Despite the absence of measurable metrics, there are also the\r
Cartography Tools, the Interoperability Test Bed and the IMAPS Solution that seek to facilitate the\r
comparison and the evaluation of today's solutions in European public services.\r
\r
EIF components evaluation, page 8:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/29d694d4-4696-11ec-89db-01aa75ed71a1/language-en\r
\r
Joinup Cartography Tools reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/solution/eif-toolbox\r
/solutions-0\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1c790c3-ddef-4f9f-91fa-9d6783976127 .

