camssa:ac16b204-20b3-427e-b77d-358d6f769d5f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF recommendation #9 advocates for ensuring data portability within European public services. Thus, the EIF specification explicitly addresses and enables data portability in the context of supporting the evolution of public administration services.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dd68cf9e-9631-4d40-ae51-a66c6da4c65c .

