camssa:aeaadc36-f038-49be-b5e5-83f130dc78c2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF specification encourages public services to use multilingual solutions or promotes their use.\r
However, the specification does not provide nor suggest which solutions, information systems or technical\r
architectures should be used.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:204b0c14-94dc-42df-b3c2-5bc8ee43bcd3 .

