camssa:b10a03d5-1efc-47bd-8703-4b50efc71b49 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIF specification is not included in any open repository/catalogue of standards at European level, even\r
though the former and later ISA Programmes (ISA and ISA2, respectively) has been offering relevant\r
guidelines, and Joinup itself, the EIF Toolbox.\r
\r
ISA2 Programme reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\r
\r
Joinup EIF Toolbox:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/solution/eif-toolbox\r
/eif-toolbox'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1b703c2-13e1-4458-ae5b-ad0e4b0ac2c8 .

camssa:b1732b27-74e6-429f-88dd-028aa6e08038 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIF specification was developed by a large community within the European Commission (EC) and all\r
the EC patents are available on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
EC (ISA2), Communication (COM(2017)134) reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4cac8438-2286-4718-81fb-e6aa67288a79 .

