camssa:cdbfa2bb-bd87-4dfb-a0b7-58914fb0c2a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF specification are a set of recommendations that can be met or not. As far as these\r
recommendations are met, there exists the possibility of further contextualising one or other\r
recommendation. In this sense, the EIF specification allows extension.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:af724c97-d7db-4f7e-bfae-132af5df3787 .

