camssa:f55e4f23-7de0-41ca-ac26-59916c39b692 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EIF specification supports the reuse of data (recommendation #13) for all scenarios. However, much of the effort would depend on the context where the user will make the operations and transactions.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46557bbe-f7ad-4b77-bad7-5e9318b12378 .

