camssa:f79acdb9-5209-4016-a11c-fc3c0f657a2b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIF specification is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications\r
(ELIS). More specifically, EIF can define the interoperability aspects of the Service, Interoperability Strategy,\r
Shared Governance Framework, Interoperability Skill, Interoperability Governance, Interoperability\r
Framework, Interoperable Digital Public Service, Service Delivery Model ABBs of the EIRA Organisational\r
View; and the Legislation On Data Information And Knowledge Exchange ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v110'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:574f4a0d-a6f8-4796-8bf9-b24ae51a668a .

