camssa:fec93fea-fb6e-494b-b116-b03de17ff675 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the first star corresponds to the publication of data on the web as open data. The EIF specification refers to open public data as the idea that all public data should be freely available for use and reuse by others, unless restrictions apply, for example, for personal data protection, confidentiality or intellectual property rights. Therefore, in addition to the requirements stated in the previous answer, the specification supports published data as Linked Data.\r
\r
EIF reference, 'EIF brochure' document:\r
ttps://ec.europa.eu/isa2/eif_en\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fb4866f3-0e20-4f2a-9965-4145374c8e80 .

camssa:0002401c-6dbf-463a-895a-10c4627db53d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0003c936-da09-4732-8b77-42b2b9eb1d43 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "No evidence has been found of the specification being included in a formal interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6e26936e-7afe-4668-a47b-4d8e92eef486 .

camssa:000579e8-138e-4107-96e9-e31280e30721 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification does not relate to data authenticity, but its DNS Security Extensions (DNSSEC) can be used to ensure the authenticity of DNS responses, preventing attacks by signing DNS data cryptographically.

DNS IETF reference:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8499'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6e319fcc-eafd-4064-ba16-df64c976fbb7 .

camssa:000c3029-6c9d-498c-a5cc-b39fa0326dfc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The FTP is used in the context of the CIRCABC, a cross-border initiative that provides a web application enabling collaboration, communication and document exchange between European Union stakeholders. \r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/circabc.pdf \r
https://circabc.europa.eu/faces/jsp/extension/wai/navigation/container.jsp"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1eaab4f4-902a-459d-95cf-aee134c78925 .

camssa:000f740d-a333-4404-a11e-0e4bdbcd2e0e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 is included in one national catalogue of recommended specifications. This catalogue is: Malta.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards

Malta List of Standards:
https://www.mccaa.org.mt/Section/Content?contentId=1243'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fd217045-8fb6-4603-b4a5-f6f1aa225bbd .

camssa:001288d8-f74d-4e8f-9f5b-320027df02b6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ceebc7042ff4b3525981f67e306167d9711ac0bce6ea07a067cdb4881854db97 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0013994d-d5bb-47e3-a2e0-ff719eef24a5 a cav:Score,
