camssa:001650a4-d874-41d8-90f2-f01c10f91001 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI registries or nodes depend on WSDL to complete the data exchange transaction and provide the requester with information. Additionally, UDDI relies on SOAP to enable the service invoke by the requester. 

UDDI and WSDL reference:
https://www.ibm.com/docs/es/rsm/7.5.0?topic=uddi-relationship-between-wsdl'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:191894f0-5be3-460c-9a6c-b6ace4c44af4 .

camssa:0018369c-17f4-4299-ab74-293d3b2be05a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """LegalRuleML is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:307cffa1-defb-4792-b6f7-e38851acd360 .

camssa:001e063f-e22d-4fb1-adab-47fdf1a2320d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification was standardised officially in 2018 by OASIS, it was developed using the LegalDocML TC which is focused on promoting a common legal document standard (based on Akoma Ntoso-UN). \r
\r
The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standardisation and in the related standardisation activities of the same rolling plan, more spcifically under the focus of eGovernment (1) Policy and Legislation; (2) Requested Actions. Due to this recommendation it can be considered that the specification is sufficiently mature for its use in the developments of products and services.\r
\r
Moreover, LEOS project and pilot wich aims to ease the creation and management of Legal text is using it as basis. \r
\r
Akoma Ntoso: \r
http://www.akomantoso.org/ \r
\r
The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-single-market/en/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation\r
\r
LEOS: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/justice-law-and-security/solution/leos-open-source-software-editing-legislation/application-architecture"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fdcc6fa9-d417-4be8-88f1-6d0efc52abd0 .

camssa:001f71ad-0a62-41c3-9b21-7f3601380760 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specification is not related to the availability interfaces. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eef28bdc-62c1-4e29-8046-c27e65609264 .

camssa:002086cc-0d51-4169-a10d-e675fa187cec a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d9b9ce1d270550422a8ea6097d2ffa1d923267fd681c56280e3b7810a14a580a ;
    cav:value "20" .

