camssa:005a4349-524a-43cc-9044-24b8730e95c0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SHACL has been designed to enhance the semantic and technical interoperability layers of ontologies expressed as RDF graphs. RDF is a European Standard used by public administrations.\r
\r
Furthermore, SHACL is implemented for data validation purposes by DCAT-AP,  which is a specification that describes public sector datasets with the aim to enable cross-data portal search for datasets, and make this way public sector data easily searchable across borders and sectors.\r
DCAT-AP is used in the Open Data Support service initiated by the European Commission.\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/rdf_entity/http_e_f_fdata_ceuropa_ceu_fw21_fac376c94_b74cf_b4dd7_bade7_b267d6a4ec4dc/about"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e9316f1a-7115-4aca-9905-0373b5e8a00b .

camssa:005a9fc1-4ef2-4520-8b65-ef4d0a40826e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-52e41801b0db7274d934a229fee15e657273655d70d448d16706fcbe0e4f9746 ;
    cav:value "100" .

