        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS is recognised and integrated in the DNS4EU initiative, covering both European and national levels, especially those concerning privacy standards, policies and norms.

DNS IETF reference:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8499

DNS4EU Initiative
https://www.joindns4.eu/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8ea6a623-ddd2-4cc8-b5f7-22feae1b84a6 .

