camssa:00aeff52-a4b3-4ede-9ebc-25e0f1ac226d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OpenPM2 is publicly available for implementation and use for free on ISA2's webpage, and European Open Data Portal. Therefore, it can be reused by the organisations, administrations, open communities, etc. that developed it.\r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127  """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f3fc61f-5b68-4020-8539-634aa2b1cc1b .

camssa:00b09d2f-444a-406b-976b-4021470f72d4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TOSCA does not impose the use of any specific mechanism or technology for the long-term preservation of data/information/knowledge; data preservation aspects should be obtainable by the user infrastructure.\r
\r
TOSCA reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c84695b0-e3a3-4d75-8414-4b8d88b5c8f3 .

