camssa:01379fde-4585-4ba6-bb90-649f072d5005 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is a  DIDs working group tasked to provide support and contiue developing the specification. The mission of the Decentralized Identifier Working Group is two-fold. First, it maintains the Decentralized Identifiers (DIDs) specification and related Working Group Notes. Second, it seeks consensus around the best way to achieve effective interoperability through common requirements, algorithms, architectural options, and various considerations for the DID resolution and DID URL dereferencing processes.

DID Working Group:
https://www.w3.org/2019/did-wg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b6569692-ca81-49cc-b70e-d2ff03b9bc4c .

