camssa:017e3cf3-9074-43f7-8fe5-d42f43c0f66b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Better regulation toolbox is an internal European Commission resource designed as a complement to the Commission's Better regulation guideline. It provides more specific and operational guidance to those involved with various better regulation instruments. \r
\r
The construction of European Laws and policies aims to be proportionate to users needs, rights and duties. Also, the specification sets requirements, principles and recommendations for the development of public policies and laws supporting equality and their applicability in the most broader terms.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dc3c907f-ec0b-4809-9aa2-22504db867d9 .

