        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry is platform-agnostic, capable of operating across various operating systems, cloud environments, on-premises infrastructures, and deployment models. Its standardised protocols, consistent APIs, modular architecture, and broad integration capabilities ensure that it can provide comprehensive observability for applications running on any platform. 

OpenTelemetry: https://opentelemetry.netlify.app/docs/specs/otel/'"""@en ;
