camssa:01c4ddda-bcd7-43a1-832f-d9080545f25d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of e-signature is a medium through which administrations and stakeholders can exchange digital data reducing the amount of non-digital documents exchanged. Additionally, it fosters the reuse of data across borders, which as well takes part in administrative burden reduction.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 401 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319401/02.03.01_60/en_319401v020301p.pdf\r
\r
