https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:12fe7af8-0435-4374-b6f2-01c6bcb89d37 .

camssa:01c50849-f50b-44db-87c3-f2ca620a59fc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are not explicit studies or documentation regarding the effectiveness or efficiency of the Core Vocabulary Application Profile. However, an article on the usefulness of the AP for the publication of linked data from administrations. \r
\r
Study about ISA2 efficiency:\r
https://www.ceps.eu/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/NO0119341ENN.en_.pdf\r
\r
On using the core public sector vocabulary (CPSV) to publish a "citizen's guide" as linked data:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/325495548_On_using_the_core_public_sector_vocabulary_CPSV_to_publish_a_citizen's_guide_as_linked_data"""@en ;
