camssa:01f210b8-6714-4d80-8962-32ebddbe7ca7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification greatly enhances the exposure of interfaces for accessing public administration services. It provides a standardised framework for electronic business information exchange, ensuring interoperability between systems. The messaging services enable reliable and secure delivery of electronic business messages. The registry and repository components help in discovering and accessing services efficiently.

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7f4af70b-29de-4976-a432-8766e7f886b0 .

