camssa:025bd0c7-67e6-4376-8a96-bca0ce01faa9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing documentation and studies assessing the efficiency of IPsec. In "A cryptographic evaluation of IPsec" study, the IPsec eficiency is assessed. This study evaluates the efficiency of the IPsec protocol, specifically focusing on the ISAKMP identity protection exchange and the IKE main mode exchanges. It points out that the ISAKMP identity protection exchange can be shortened to four messages, and this reduction can also be applied to IKE main modes using signature or pre-shared key authentication.

"A cryptographic evaluation of IPsec" study: 
https://idorosen.com/mirrors/schneier.com/paper-ipsec.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42be968d-edcc-4cae-8a79-e8797accf54b .

camssa:025c2224-8493-41db-a12c-9df5ce5e7833 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
