camssa:025eb1fa-4671-4624-b5ef-6131333fe139 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of OpenPM2 as a mechanism for the standardisation of processes and steps within a project can help to reduce the harm when the size of projects varies increasing the volume. The use of OpenPM can ease the scalability of projects since it defines standardised methods for management independently of the scale of projects.\r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:988f567e-9600-4288-a363-6a114694268d .

