        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Registered Organization Vocabulary is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
