    cav:value "1" .

camssa:03030302-d003-4fd0-8f29-27c5aba26e79 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XML can be used to represent the data related to business processes, such as the steps involved, the roles and responsibilities of stakeholders, and the inputs and outputs of each step.\r
\r
XML Reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2006/REC-xml11-20060816/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:324f869d-5293-446c-859f-0e1bc0c40705 .

camssa:03034b6e-786f-4749-80a1-76ee0ebc9bab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no reference to WAI-ARIA and a European use case explicitly stating that the specification allows
relevant information and data to be reused. However, since WAI-ARIA can extend a host language, a grid
can reuse the elements and attributes of an HTML table element.

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0b76040f-4c86-4bc0-9c3a-ed651c7a2493 .

