camssa:030a292c-3b3b-4bc9-a492-e6074295ca9b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The main objective of WS-BPEL is the business process execution for web services, which helps to retrieve and consume data from different sources. However, the availability of interfaces is not the purpose of the specification, so this criterion is not applicable for this specification. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc4314ab-fa95-461d-8499-75e013affa1b .

