        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 3 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Examples of Member States including ASiC in their catalogues are France or the Netherlands.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9c982cb9-3ce5-4777-94db-aebf1c3a07eb .

camssa:03f6d680-b0f5-4eaa-ad25-ac79da51e7ac a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d28663fdb5deb361d5ad773d7b7ece3c6acf8d2eb7a1222a60cb08df4c93aac ;
    cav:value "1" .

