camssa:04601d2f-8ecf-4b64-9a80-46afb37cfe87 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Regarding the realisation of GITB (Global eBusiness Interoperability Test Beds) as a network of multiple Test Beds, SHACL supports the validation and interoperability of Test Bed components. Moreover, the robust validation mechanisms provided by SHACL contribute to the overall integrity and security of the data being tested.

CEN Workshop Agreement Global eBusiness Interoperability Test Beds GITB Phase 3:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-committee-standardization-cen/solution/cen-workshop-agreement-global-ebusiness-interoperability-test-beds-gitb-phase-3

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cb414ad9-fbba-469e-b0e1-43a47b7fdd53 .

