camssa:04ee221b-aa24-485f-8a89-14c67211bc8b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'All releases of the EIRA are publicly available and there are mechanisms and channels for providing feedback. Even though there is no creation of a public consultation of each release, the logic and philosophy of the action is that every stakeholder is able to provide feedback for improvements or fixes. Additionally, the Interoperable Europe Solutions action conducts Public Policy Support actions (pilots) with different Member States and its different levels, that are used to gather feedback while implementing the EIRA.

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:63c068e9-60e5-4297-8539-109d2527efbc .

