camssa:055bcf27-3a48-456b-bc2c-e461820ebb85 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The publiccode.yml could indirectly contribute to the preservation of software information by providing a consistent framework for cataloguing software metadata. Although it does not explicitly address archival standards, this structured metadata can serve as a useful record of software assets, ensuring that key information about software—such as its purpose, licensing, and dependencies—is retained for informational and historical purposes. This can aid in archiving efforts, as it preserves essential descriptive data that may support long-term retrieval and reference needs. While publiccode.yml provides a useful framework for cataloguing software, using it for long-term preservation would require adaptation to meet archival standards.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0f954f19-cbef-4555-b71f-45b6837f50b0 .

