        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Advanced Encryption Standard is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

AES Standard Reference:
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3d9e4462-d221-475d-8e35-06fd542c6668 .

camssa:056b36ea-7acb-46af-8372-8fe7fcffd869 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 itself does not guarantee authentication; it provides a framework that can be enhanced with additional protocols to ensure the authenticity and authentication of agents involved in data transactions. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:895cc29b-e4c8-4730-aff8-dd46d37360b0 .

