camssa:05b8f73e-0093-4bf0-b5c5-4a8caa38fbea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """UDDI has been selected several times for European administrations in order to make their web services available and discoverable for each other, and their stakeholders\r
An example of this kind UDDI use case is SELIS project, which aims to ease the eInvoicing processes. It is included within the Digital Single Market framework. \r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eprocurement/document/secure-electronic-invoicing-service-selis\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1930b310-cfcf-4429-8e74-a58d6813fc42 .

camssa:05ba3835-5dd1-4a5a-846e-6a0555e62055 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"In accordance with Common Patent Policy for ITU-T/ITU-R/ISO/IEC the ISO 639-2 is licensed under royalty-free basis. Although there are terms included that allow patent holder to apply specific costs. It is defined in IPR disclosures that can be found at ISO's webpage. \r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html\r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d752bc9e-63fd-44ce-ab37-5f554670fcf2 .

