        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xforms 2.0 is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, Xforms can define the interoperability aspects of the Forms Management Component", and  "Forms Management Service" ABBs of the EIRA Technical Infraestructure View.\r
