camssa:06e2948b-4760-46c8-a0a1-bc25dfea912e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 15948:2004 (PNG) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html\r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5395ab93-c311-4741-84ab-81bfdb0e7386 .

