camssa:06e75c39-f620-4389-91fe-ba5ea9c5e013 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is documentation stating that CCCEV is a good asset for efficient and effective data exchange across-border. The information found remarks on the importance of the CCCEV in the implementation of the Once-Only Principle.\r
\r
Joinup news page "CCCEV - a key enabler of the Once-Only Principle":\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/news/cccev-and-once-only-principle"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16efbb14-1cac-4241-8f97-2da10f1dde23 .

