camssa:075eaa2b-a99b-4eeb-aeba-c092406a806f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SOAP 1.2 has been included within several European cross-border initiatives as can be read in the European Interoperability Architecture (EIA) called Common Vision for an EIA. \r
\r
e-SENSE, e-PSOS or SPOCS are initiatives that implemented SOAP 1.2 in order to carry out their purposes. All the projects are related to the enhancement of interoperability between European administrations across borders and across sectors. \r
\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/isa_2.1_eia-finalreport-commonvisionforane\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_sr/019000_019099/019050/01.01.01_60/sr_019050v010101p.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b70a64aa-5d96-4dd8-a030-6cefc618023f .

camssa:076204dc-577b-48c7-873f-094d8a37e35c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, TSP is  a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. FTP is licensed on a F(RAND) basis.\r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d9ffe34-5c54-4cef-9851-565d6833fa2c .

camssa:076207fd-080d-45d9-9094-6276d6b0b4c7 a cav:Score,
