    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3c0edf049cd95575b46d688ed31be0ccce7a5822c5bcc22adf05d491f01f2780 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:07fe7966-4c5b-4879-ae6f-553dda7d8de2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The CPSV-AP allows describing public services in a standarised human and machine-readable format. This fact fosters the discoverability of the datasets containing the information of public services. Therefore, it enhances its reuse and visibility. That is the reason why CPSV-AP is implementing the EU Catalogue of Services. Moreover, it is recommended in the CarTool 3.1.0 as one of the Operational enablers for the Catalogue of Services Solution Architecture Template (SAT).\r
\r
CPSV-AP Joinup webpage:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile/release/22\r
\r
Catalogue of Services news page: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/catalogue-services-helping-eu-countries-catalogue-and-describe-public-services_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dec4ca49-1909-4aa5-a951-d55199a24939 .

camssa:0800e449-86f2-4ce4-89ea-693767224345 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no conformity test coming from the IETF, but there are existing IPv4 test suits for free and underpayment. \r
See:\r
http://www.qkdnetsim.info/doc/html/ipv4-test_8cc.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80881adb-55ea-4dfd-b562-a5f791172a12 .

camssa:0804e84e-1875-42df-9df7-5eb9e124810a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0805e5aa-5bec-401c-9215-b74688c2621c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:080c3b85-a488-440c-98a2-e45ea5a32c12 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "After carrying out a specific retrieval, no evidence has been found regarding already existing studies or documentation assessing PAdES Baseline Profile’s efficiency and effectiveness. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b7cd9a6-4e34-4362-97d0-04305d99c8d4 .

camssa:080d1701-8b4e-470d-a84e-fdf68821b8d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification has 14 previous releases, which is indicative of sufficient market acceptance for its use in the development of digital solutions/services. \r
There exists relevant independent reports which provide its market acceptance as an example the one on the European Case Law Identifier (ECLI).\r
\r
Independent report from ECLI:\r
https://e-justice.europa.eu/175/EN/european_case_law_identifier_ecli\r
\r
DCMI Version History:\r
https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dcmi-terms/release_history/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1567a39c-1f5d-4d8c-b311-6ac2d679ad55 .

camssa:081432a6-f043-4672-b45e-bbc1d5ea6ffc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8954ddabf37f4899562b9ea4c8f0bbf204f3e48c9203043bc231f368092396a2 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:08197085-9d53-415a-901b-441b2dd0b841 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26c3fa9eb08207b2dfbd8d7c3852f0c9db3fdc50491d24db5b2f2eb1acf68732 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:081a4b02-c28f-4f77-84ea-e3e54a36773e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData follows REST principles and there exists some data integrity mechanisms. Any modification of the data must respect the data integrity and as such is referred on the specification. In this sense the header return serves this purpose.

OData data modification reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.01/odata-v4.01-part1-protocol.html#sec_DataModification'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:66e52765-7b8e-4ac6-a00a-613ed57ceb0a .

camssa:0828c8e9-8afb-41b7-9427-ed2354f3cfde a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of CSV is not related  to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.                                  \r
\r
CSV reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eb479186-50fa-487d-a91d-486971203582 .

camssa:0828d7a9-cc3d-4b47-9b04-90d365638ff7 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b37687b8bb3dbd4c6f96969358cf5d70900d1ccd01402cea7668da6303bec4b4 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0828f68f-cb92-4c33-8b62-a7a715587fbb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is associated with EIRA ABB's in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). \r
It is associated with Data Access Service, Access Management Component from Technical Infrastructure and  Access Management Service, Authentication Service, Identification Component, Identity Management Service from Technical Application.\r
\r
ELIS link:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v501\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:51f5393a-884d-41c3-aacf-f7c99f631431 .

camssa:0831bd25-0bec-4f14-a4a8-635fd8a14b6f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:08348be2-f99b-47ad-a35d-cd1ef089e70f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 27001 has restricted IPR disclosures and requires payment to access it.\r
\r
ISO 27001 foreword:\r
https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:54534:en '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5c014973-b09d-4a7e-a020-92208595496c .

camssa:083a08fe-c844-4c2f-b544-3413ec68aa6f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ASiC Baseline Profile is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, ASiC Baseline Profile can define the interoperability aspects of “e-Seal Creation Service”, “e-Seal Verification and Validation Service”, “e-Signature Creation Service”, and “e-signature Verification and Validation Service” ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16c42172-9d6b-4c4d-aec7-4601672db943 .

camssa:0841c437-8726-4fcb-986d-93b916767ea2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPsec specification offers mechanisms to guarantee the authenticity of agents involved in data transactions. In this sense IPsec also provides mechanisms to allow or deny access to data. Moreover, the specification also provides mechanisms such as authenticating that data originates from a known sender.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html

IPsec authenticity:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/ip-security-ipsec/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0984750c-3a15-465b-b025-3edb63f5e981 .

camssa:08452e4a-76ea-4863-8a17-0e1c35101c19 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6fa642bc8eceff2b1d333dc1123748399264c028fde2fd78308f0a0209ae21b ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:0859ad18-27da-4641-9bb3-877390d919b0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0c9dd43038136296b52f50e05f9d6eef39f7b8018517224007990b15be2eb19e ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:085e16d6-058e-4d1d-93f2-9a1101cd70f9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"EuroVoc is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d96bf6a4-6509-41f5-b65d-213c8bb8d489 .

camssa:085f3b6f-2346-4fc9-a9da-9cb5db5310db a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "HTTPS (Hypertext Transfer Protocol Over TLS) is a Transfer Protocol used for communication over a computer network. It is used to transfer data between administrations."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:208c2b3e-8b89-422d-bb8a-dfea06588b41 .

camssa:085fed2b-2637-46b6-8529-130e5921d5ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By using the specification, digital service delivery channels can be guaranteed aswell as the quality. \r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f3fea5d-ac87-41ef-8299-da60f0e2f6dc .

camssa:086239db-5754-437d-94d8-3184561f7ffa a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-5a7323988b5d96da801e2abd4d95248af758fe9adbbafd09dd76114629567ff4 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0865397c-8555-45c3-9ff8-346220103aa6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the PROV family of documents does not directly address data processing accuracy, nonetheless, some of its specifications that can be serialised such as PROV-XML or PROV-JSON can indirectly contribute to assessing accuracy through traceability, decision-making transparency, and error detection. Ensuring data processing accuracy comprehensively involves utilizing appropriate techniques, processes, and methods specific to the domain or application requirements.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV Ontology:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-o-20130430/\r
\r
PROV Data Model:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-dm-20130430/'"""@en ;
