camssa:086dfd8d-9d9a-4911-b1d9-63044b9ba495 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ASiC Baseline profile has been selected within the CEF Digital Signature Service (hereby DSS), along with CAdES, XAdES and PAdES Baseline profiles.  \r
\r
Digital Signature Service is an open-source software library for electronic signature creation and validation supporting the interoperability of electronic signatures. The initiative is an enabler for cross borders interoperability between administrations and businesses.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/Standards+and+specifications\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=82773260\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a32cbeb6-9282-4bf5-bc74-7d1b261e84b9 .

camssa:087a20dc-4399-42b8-8467-d40b993825ae a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes TOSCA in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories: 1. Conceptual model for integrated public services provision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31fb6233-973a-4454-abd6-81bf8418783b .

