camssa:0882eff3-89c8-46cb-a2c4-583b198f09e6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Xforms is not related to the publication of public data as linked open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9364ae7f-9e20-4c62-b9cd-2589517ead51 .

camssa:0886a1b3-e6f9-45b6-80a6-fb88a279bdeb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2badaa9b-d567-4984-91f2-1b9f706fa00a .

