        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPsec is maintained and developed by IETF which is an international community developing open standards.\r
\r
IETF Landing Page:\r
https://www.ietf.org/about/\r
\r
IPSec reference, Conclusions:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4301#appendix-D.8 '"""@en ;
