camssa:089e37dc-42cb-49dc-ba65-24ccb8e2a100 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Technical Committee (TC) CYBER (Cybersecurity) provides public support to members and non-members alike, with different conditions depending on ETSI membership status. Besides, it dedicates a wiki page to disseminate the Global cybersecurity Ecosystem (constituted in a specification itself, TR 103 306) to help stakeholders, and anyone, discover and identify the components of global cybersecurity.\r
\r
ETSI TC CYBER reference:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/tb.aspx?tbid=824#/5068-home\r
\r
ETSI TC CYBER wiki:\r
https://cyberpublicwiki.etsi.org/index.php?title=ETSI\r
\r
ETSI TR 103 306 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103300_103399/103306/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d3175241-561c-43ae-b17f-b3852cf6fe42 .

camssa:089e814f-da56-4b5c-b7f1-25dac572ea60 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After carrying out information retrieval, no document or study has been found assessing the CLV in terms of efficiency or effectiveness. However, there is an ISA2 documentation where there are defined use cases and benefits of using its solutions, including the different Core Vocabularies. 

Use cases and benefits of ISA² specifications:
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/docs/publications/isa2_study_use_cases_and_benefits_of_isa2_specifications_january_2019.pdf

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4a68443-e11a-47b2-bad3-1a33b212e6f7 .

camssa:08a45b5e-33d7-40fd-84fa-2758eabefbac a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to section 5.3.2 of this specification, security is a key concern for all Cloud Service Commerces (CSCs) when using cloud services, both in terms of interoperability and also, in terms of data portability and application portability thus, it addresses the issue and proposes different recommendations.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:969db628-b813-4e44-9791-57e2346330c7 .

camssa:08a7a359-bc26-4ee8-9122-20c7400e6619 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DNS is not related to Data accuracy. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

DNS IETF reference:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8499'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:af2d8d26-d2ee-4ebb-91ec-6694e76e8516 .

