    cav:value "100" .

camssa:08b642d6-f0b3-4e0f-aca2-82a3e808b47c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Advanced Encryption Standard has been published and is maintained by the National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST). Moreover, there are specifications that extend AES in Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF).

IETF AES Reference:
https://mailarchive.ietf.org/arch/browse/smime/?q=Advanced%20Encryption%20Standard

National Institute of Standards and Technology (NIST):
https://www.nist.gov/

AES Standard Reference:
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16b2ba1e-160c-4fbb-b13f-18757823488b .

