camssa:08e09f1c-d8a2-4f14-9b7d-429384c6e6b1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no Member State that includes CAdES (ISO 14533-1:2014) in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28216a5d-18ee-4657-b118-88413d21f71b .

camssa:08e5eba2-ba1b-4e27-b8d0-c9e7dc9e938e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The term of PAdES was first introduced in 2009 as PDF Advanced Electronic Signatures (PAdES) on ETSI Technical specifications. The specification has got some updates and the latest version is 1.2.1, it was published in 2010. So, it is mature enough for its use in the development of products and services.\r
\r
ETSI TS 101 733 V1.6.3 (2009-07):\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cbea7b4f-d74b-4033-967f-87a68f239f22 .

camssa:08ed8b8a-2137-49c4-be7b-e3c36fc6b3a3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9420538a5a92af199b492414dd056ab7134e456f005895261b1a5b15a3f2814e ;
    cav:value "100" .

