        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv4 is already associated to EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, IPv4 can define the interoperability aspects of the "Data Exchange" and "Firewall" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/solution/elis/release/v610'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9382544d-3fa6-4e55-af71-7e93066d03e4 .

