        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SFIA is a framework for the ICT community that defines the skills and competencies required by business and technology professionals. The specification is intended to serve as an organisational framework within companies and public administrations as a kind of facilitator for the comprehensibility of organisational procedures.\r
\r
SFIA reference:\r
https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-8'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ddfffff5-3c88-4974-aa8c-89cace881674 .

