camssa:0a3cedd5-c734-4080-9146-cfc470512fcc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Customizing timestamping protocols involves setting up a publicly available, trusted timestamp management infrastructure. Moreover, this infrastructure collects, processes, and renews timestamps, and there is a list of schemes that offer customisation.

The Security Evaluation of Time Stamping Schemes: The Present Situation and Studies: 
https://www.imes.boj.or.jp/research/papers/english/01-E-18.pdf

Timestamp based Concurrency Control:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/timestamp-based-concurrency-control/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eec3d8ba-735b-4fc9-ba62-1d505a31a9e1 .

camssa:0a438d5a-a1a8-4067-af20-62e3f0774ebd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the assessments performed by CAMSS and the list of specifications identified by the MSP Multi-stakeholder-platform, no assessment verifying the compliance of the specification with the European standardisation regulation has been found. \r
\r
However, since is a specification developed by a European Institution it can be assumed that the asset has been developed and maintain in compliance with European Regulations.\r
\r
EuroVoc webpage: \r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/eurovoc\r
\r
EU Vocabularies: \r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:477429db-e446-47ff-85ea-5b529390f624 .

