camssa:0a4a47d7-4979-42eb-b775-f3a0adc80748 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """This Core Vocabulary is a business domain agnostic specification that can be reused in a cross-domain way.\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e313e526-440b-44ff-a1dd-07100ecda43e .

camssa:0a4ffbc1-f669-4b2a-ac6c-e7320a4a21c1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing the encoding of data and information through the different information systems and the internet, UTF-8 fosters the visibility of administration services and eases the decision-making of public administrations. \r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3629 \r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d9f54034-629b-4480-a00b-a062f16c381d .

camssa:0a51c1a9-4e90-4a3a-b6dd-e42529f1828c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ESPD can facilitate the publication of procurement data on the web given that the document information it provides can be easily processed and shared electronically by public authorities. The ESPD can play a role in facilitating the publication of procurement data on the web, which can help to increase transparency, promote competition, and improve the efficiency of public procurement processes.  Moreover, the ESPD can be modeled in XML, an open standard developed by the IETF.\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5 stars open data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b6582536-1b6b-4dd6-8a43-9287b4988b6f .

camssa:0a5c121e-1521-4b80-877f-10b95352b106 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'8 Member States are recommending XSD in their ICT National Catalogues. \r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edd378b4-2989-44ce-8f6b-6ee0d63548a0 .

