camssa:0a847682-b1d7-40db-b0d5-cae0e236d917 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) allows the stakeholders to adequate the specification to their needs, in this sense the specifications makes provisions for the customisation of identifiers in order to make easier the sharing of information and asset models. This can be seen described on the 4.3.5 section where the composition of the identifiers is explained. 

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8114ef41-2fad-422c-9bdd-dce704361df8 .

