camssa:0a91482b-1379-45b4-a608-b652331baae0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SMTP is not related to the publication of public data as linked open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321\r
\r
Five star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
