    cav:judgement """'The SFIA Foundation is a collaborative organisation responsible for the maintenance and distribution of SFIA. The entire SFIA maintenance process is open to public consultation. The organisation offers users various channels of communication, namely the SFIA User Forum via the LikedIn job platform.\r
\r
SFIA reference, About SFIA section:\r
https://sfia-online.org/en/about-sfia\r
\r
SFIA reference, LinkedIn:\r
https://www.linkedin.com/groups/1934300/'"""@en ;
