        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Syslog protocol is associated with EIRA ABB's in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, it is associated with the “Event Manager”, "Logger" and "Cloud Private Network" ABBs from the Technical-Infrastructure View.

