camssa:0af1ca74-3fc7-4bb5-828c-d7c1266bd786 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The iCalendar specification is technology agnostic. It is designed to be independent of any specific technology or platform, allowing it to be used across various software applications and systems for exchanging calendar data in a standardized format.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b04916ae-d5f9-4ad1-a2b6-5c0f06cff26c .

camssa:0af2eeb5-84b3-46af-a1b9-aefe7125b0a9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ELI specification enables e-accessibility. It is designed to facilitate the access, exchange, and
interconnection of information published in European, national, and global information systems.

BOE ELI reference:
https://www.boe.es/legislacion/eli.php

Technical Specification for the implementation of ELI in Spain reference:
https://www.elidata.es/documentacion_tecnica/especificacion_tecnica.php?lang=en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:21b350eb-fe7a-4572-93ae-b8206e47a467 .

