camssa:0b3c088a-5a51-4b08-b806-5a8d7f5bdde9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Core Location Vocabulary defines a core data model that allows the description of locations, geographical elements in a common way. In this sense, the use of a standardised vocabulary helps maintain the integrity of the data during exchange. This fact ensures a trustworthy reuse and data exchange among administrations and stakeholders.  

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:488d081f-8d6f-4a38-8d59-6b7673d23328 .

