camssa:0b4c7adc-2e8c-46fb-8e62-4a507eac09d7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox includes references to the relevance of Linked Open Data for the development of public policies. It is one of the principles or basis for the evidence-based development that the specification defines, however, the purpose of the specification is not related to the development and publication of Linked Open Data.\r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5ae27900-8bac-4ecc-aa64-02dc560d8511 .

camssa:0b534b1e-d0f5-4619-9faa-01ddba7adf0d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OASIS decision-making process for the approval of a specification is clearly defined. Decisions are taken based on votes requiring a Simple Majority Vote to pass. Furthermore, a public review is included in the TC process.

Review process OASIS:
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/tc-process-2017-05-26'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6b5be64e-d944-4d98-86f0-e2477aff6e4f .

