    cav:judgement """'The E-ARK CSIP has support from the The Digital Information LifeCycle Interoperability Standards Board (DILCIS Board), an international group of experts committed to maintain and sustain all the E-ARK specifications.\r
\r
About E-ARK\r
https://dilcis.eu/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2ea8a27f-bfd6-4a91-bd84-a12c36518fa0 .

