camssa:0ba09637-1577-4825-927f-14c495fe30b1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The application of the once-only principle in all EU Member States public administrations aims at reducing the administrative burden. To achieve this, interoperability between public administrations is a sine qua non condition.\r
\r
XSLT is a language for transforming XML documents, consequently it can be concluded that through this functions it promotes the once-only principle"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e299ed1c-a399-4d13-93ed-c8b59ec2dbe3 .

