        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTP is published on Joinup, the collaborative platform for reusable IT Solutions funded by the European Commission.\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/file-transfer-protocol/distribution/file-transfer-protocol"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:808ace4e-55df-4d3f-989f-2d7af21c3f65 .

