camssa:0c2962cf-d492-4c2d-9abf-eae8c3e4182b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"WAI-ARIA is not currently listed in its Information and Communication Technology (ICT) National Catalogue. Spain, as a Member State, recommends WAI-ARIA as an accessibility standard. This signifies Spain's recognition and endorsement of WAI-ARIA as a valuable framework for promoting web accessibility within the country.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards

PAe Accessibility Standards reference:
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Accesibilidad/pae_normativa/pae_eInclusion_Normas_Accesibilidad.html?idioma=en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f2cc2488-5932-482c-9c12-1df7ba0ea70a .

camssa:0c2a636c-487b-49e6-b563-a54e55ab2b01 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Core Public Organisation Vocabulary facilitates the process for institutions publishing data about public organisations. This Core Vocabulary fosters interoperability and impacts positively on the development of eGovernment.\r
\r
CPOV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:63e864ff-1027-41c3-b2bd-aa146b85ff6f .

