        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"By adhering to the E-ARK CSIP's metadata guidelines, organizations can enhance the portability of their data by ensuring that relevant information about the data is included in the information packages.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3856ef88-a1c8-49a8-9764-0ce1a14eefa5 .

