camssa:0c7b6753-b063-405a-b3aa-92827eb8f4d6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Taking the initial purpose of the specification, it can be considered that the specification is involved in fostering the comprehensibility of Public Administrations data, as well as relevant data produced for the decision-making process. \r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e76c0159-8de6-4fef-b5ba-abdffa3f7933 .

