        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Ogg is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, Ogg can define the interoperability aspects of the "Representation" ABB of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b56e8ae4-ca91-4ea5-aff4-a219136ddd06 .

