camssa:0d34e167-0b9f-44b0-b9c4-32a08bd770c6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification has been updated to its third version, introducing several improvements in functionality. As a result, it is now regarded as one of the most valuable tools for managing data and facilitating easier access. For example, IndexedDB is employed in projects such as Health360 to store data, enhancing both data integrity and availability. Moreover, IndexedDB also complies with the GDPR framework, addressing security concerns related to the processing of personal data.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/

Health360 project GDPR:
https://www.mdpi.com/2076-3417/12/17/8441'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:466da19c-a208-47b3-b941-ae0fdc3ed4d8 .

camssa:0d35179d-ab24-4b7f-b3c0-9f8bf9ace289 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-450e8a1f4cffbbf3de202e37bd642f098174559028df90ccc657473a6086bc0b ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:0d36fcc3-a048-477d-83ce-b8a6eb40d945 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The XFDL specification supports data processing accuracy by providing a structured, standardised format for forms, which minimises data entry errors. It ensures the integrity of the data through digital signatures, confirming that the data hasn't been tampered with after submission. This aligns with the XML Signature Syntax and Processing specification, which outlines how digital signatures can be applied to XML data to guarantee its integrity and authenticity, offering a reliable method for verifying that the data remains unchanged throughout the processing cycle.

XML Signature Syntax and Processing reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xmldsig-core1/

XFDL security reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL#button\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:77b5adc7-60f9-434e-921f-8cf4da1e05e2 .

camssa:0d37dc90-2fc6-4fe1-9ba5-11d9ceda335f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f70d8bc1b4b6e186d69ea3f7f8cc7b2d75314b84e7f481ebe13b4e6ed8b36598 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:0d3c10c1-f407-4835-8259-76e431b1a886 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Xforms is not related to the implementation of the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:650f74db-976e-4151-8840-7c64a0a6753a .

camssa:0d3c966d-f638-45d8-b6d4-f023a2888a71 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:0d3f408a-1ba8-4911-b1a1-ac0d80af3741 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b37687b8bb3dbd4c6f96969358cf5d70900d1ccd01402cea7668da6303bec4b4 ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:0d3f72eb-8bb8-4fff-914e-578acc5f5f8e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XML can be used independently from any other technical specifications or operating system.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2006/REC-xml11-20060816/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a0fea3b-672f-4a3d-96fe-f4be3660ff28 .

camssa:0d48420c-188e-4894-ae73-c4f8013b2a77 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0d499f57-3486-47b5-9f60-6efba6d275c9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Advanced Encryption Standard can be found in the VeraCrypt project. VeraCrypt encrypts partitions or storage devices, including those where Windows is installed. In this sense, encryption is automatic and fast, with hidden volumes for plausible deniability.

VeraCrypt AES project:
https://veracrypt.eu/en/Home.html

AES Standard Reference:
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8d215a8-9600-4797-bd72-668588e62049 .

camssa:0d4c6ac9-86f9-429f-ab2b-67b382fb4754 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0d5451c9-94c6-4f5b-8de9-7db9846ab18a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-83d21357ecad07668ab7f2010aefed3cebb92dab384eeae6eb7aa77def06cfc3 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:0d58712c-96a8-4e00-9648-fc281f6031d4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of SHACL is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5de216fe-3ba9-4295-b252-cbe9bc6b877c .

camssa:0d5d32da-9bc4-4230-a977-292b8a8c2b1b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-17a2b7a0ca372f407c300b69049faf9d92cbf274964290ba278b18cf10bf5dbf ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:0d5e29f7-3414-49ee-933a-cc10115be093 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0d6092ce-b53c-49b8-9b1b-b4d513ca6d4f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, DPV is a vocabulary enabling information systems to query data in a structured manner. As well as supporting the publication of data as open data, the specification facilitates the publication of public data (under the user consent) as open data since it fulfils all the requirements to generate Linked Data.\r
\r
DPV specification: \r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/dpv/\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data: \r
  https://5stardata.info/en/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aa68318e-381a-448c-9a73-d4c9ddf1608d .

camssa:0d614b7a-d39a-4923-aa63-6284adbf395e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, LDAPv3 has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision. During the evaluation process, all the Member States are invited to share their doubts. The positive evaluation of LDAPv3 and its identification is considered an interoperability agreement.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c781d4f-d9e8-4d26-9b3f-55806ee5b52f .

