camssa:0d7804dd-47ba-45f8-b769-7de007342c38 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The inclusion of JSON processing in XSLT is crucial for data portability. JSON being a common data exchange format, the ability to transform between XML and JSON directly using XSLT increases its utility across different environments (see Section 22).

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/#json'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a28c91df-f0a8-483e-96c7-0838f4c8fe5a .

