        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SAMM is not related to the comprehensibility of administrative information, data or services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c4e03b24-4273-484b-ad03-d04c8f1e0add .

