camssa:0f37ea35-ee39-4636-981e-586fa13a58db a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Registered Organization Vocabulary facilitates the publication of data on the web by providing a structured vocabulary for describing organisations that have gained legal entity status through formal registration.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab8e3f6b-27f0-40d9-b4ae-1aa0f1be3df9 .

camssa:0f37f89f-2861-4d67-a52d-7fd11b1e4359 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though SVG is supporting the first level of maturity from the Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for the Open data, it is not supporting the main principles for the publication of data as Linked Open Data.\r
\r
W3C Linked Data:\r
https://www.w3.org/wiki/LinkedData\r
\r
5 Stars sc:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c3e0e430-cb2d-432a-a3fc-2b0f9aecc6a8 .

