camssa:0f4bd280-e205-4404-b7b7-8d51041c33af a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification can be deployed in any operating system, thus the IPsec specification is platform agnostic.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6bf97f53-a9fb-4c6b-af1a-20a06ada8b7b .

camssa:0f4f0b8e-36cd-4e87-829b-db387c1f5d62 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Genericode specification can contribute to data portability between systems and applications. Genericode can be aligned with other European standards and initiatives related to data interoperability and portability. By adopting genericode as part of a broader strategy for standardising data formats and structures, European public services can ensure consistency, compatibility, and portability of data across different systems and organizations.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37d88a76-5cd0-4206-88af-ad6207d3042e .

camssa:0f523815-2fac-4792-ae9d-f7720754a7b6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP specification does not guarantee protection against unauthorized changes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:821e9393-b3e0-483e-8d4f-b5343ce7ada2 .

camssa:0f5a64f4-14bc-499f-8361-99dd77705e4e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s standards-making process has been clearly defined after years of experience. The organisation has adopted the open approach which means direct participation and consensus as a basis to develop standards. All the stakeholders have the opportunity to participate directly in the process of standardisation through the technical committees created to develop ETSI’s technical specifications and standards. The decision-making process includes a public review, where stakeholders involved can provide technical feedback in order to enhance and maximize the quality and accuracy of the standards. \r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/standards/standards-making"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf42d3f1-2934-4dd5-8b02-4575783eebd6 .

camssa:0f5cf334-b2a6-4d64-872a-5e85580c3bdc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3c0edf049cd95575b46d688ed31be0ccce7a5822c5bcc22adf05d491f01f2780 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:0f5eb1b6-996f-45ad-afea-076a26f4086e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is associated with EIRA ABB's in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). It is associated with API Catalogue Component, API Discovery And Catalogue Service, Data Publication Component, Data Publication Service, Metadata Management Component, Metadata Management Service, Shared Platform from the Technical View, and the Controlled Vocabulary Data, Data Model, Data Syntax, Forms Structure, Hash Code, Metadata, Ontology, Semantic Interoperability Agreement from Semantic View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v501\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:63a9deb4-0901-4e1e-980b-b6fb0ce8ec45 .

