camssa:0f89c652-ecfb-436b-9526-d4b2160c7259 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The publiccode.yml specification does not address data processing accuracy, nor does it include mechanisms to ensure data completeness and correctness. Its purpose is solely to document metadata for public code projects, and it lacks provisions for controlling or validating data accuracy during entry or dissemination. Therefore, it does not align with the data accuracy requirements referenced in EIF Recommendation 15.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5cb53f24-ac98-4de4-bca1-b91a2d453752 .

