camssa:0fa0a3d6-eacf-4b1d-849a-64cafb5f8bad a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the second star corresponds to make data available as structured data, an area of application of SOAP 1.2.\r
\r
In addition, SOAP 1.2 serialisation provides several advantages, especially if the Semantic Web is not just about providing meta data for existing web pages, but also about exchange of content that is machine-readable.  \r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
\r
RDF vs SOAP Paper Reference:\r
https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/dbf2/6496e5b3087b708d4c00883c6470b53ff8d8.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:59991881-80c5-48e6-8ec5-c3dfc647d2fe .

camssa:0fa6d6d6-e302-4719-ae1d-fe44ec3cd9e7 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:0faad3e8-b27f-4015-a120-f416d8707c96 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The information on (new) standardisation activities is widely announced via the IETF websites and working group activities. There also is a mailing list one can subscribe to for announcements. This so-called IETF Announce list receives announcements about IETF meetings, the activities and actions of the IESG, the RFC Editor, the NomCom, and other announcements of interest to the IETF community._x000D_\r
See:_x000D_\r
https://www.ietf.org/how/lists/announcement/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:18e90214-1e68-4f07-8d0f-5545339d9d78 .

camssa:0faeaa76-591d-4296-bf2e-ef118897874a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV is mentioned in Data quality in an e-Government perspective, from Norwegian Digitalistation Agency. In order to evaluate if a dataset is reusable, it is proposed descriptions of data quality. To establish standards/specifications for machine-readable description of quality of datasets it is suggested to extend DCAT-AP-NO with W3C/DQV (Data Quality Vocabulary).

Norwegian Digitalistation Agency:
https://eurogeographics.org/app/uploads/2019/06/6-SDQ2020-Data-quality-in-an-e-Government-perspective.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:44c3dbed-d182-4411-934f-5704f6cd7170 .

