camssa:10945d9b-9083-4a67-900e-b8c373b1ac93 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The implementation of eSignature is a mean that allows administrations and stakeholders to exchange digital data reducing the amount of non-digital documents exchanged. Additionally, it fosters the reuse of data across borders, which as well takes part on the administrative burden reduction. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e2841f54-fdf7-4aae-950b-8eb1cb80230a .

camssa:10a40e75-64c0-4901-a718-62d42dddccea a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:10a4c03c-3911-4ccf-9c6a-9662b01c8815 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Open reviews are an essential part of the verification process for eArchiving Building Block\r
specification documentation. A review is a systematic examination of a document by experts and\r
other stakeholders to find and remove errors early on in the specification life cycle. In addition, the release notes published in the E-ARK website keep track of the changes applied to the specifications over time.\r
\r
Open review guidelines for eArchiving Building Block specifications and documentation:\r
https://dilcis.eu/images/procedures/LC-001390244_CEF-TC_2019-3_M23c.pdf\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP release notes:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/release-notes/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5a048eed-3545-49f7-9ad6-fd8b46b96623 .

camssa:10ac91c5-f489-44ae-af85-171776f95ebf a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:10b27a79-04c2-41d7-90df-684db621282a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:10b5854c-433c-44a8-9896-17c4d97bfdb9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes the ETSI TS 119  512 in their national catalogue with Their National Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories 1. Conceptual model for integrated public servicesprovision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:733e9b39-3417-4109-b766-bf78a720442d .

camssa:10bb9aa8-6a1e-472e-9493-636f0642872e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the second star corresponds to make data available as structured data, an area of application of SOAP 1.2.\r
\r
In addition, SOAP 1.2 serialisation provides several advantages, especially if the Semantic Web is not just about providing meta data for existing web pages, but also about exchange of content that is machine-readable.  \r
\r
See:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
https://pdfs.semanticscholar.org/dbf2/6496e5b3087b708d4c00883c6470b53ff8d8.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fef20906-5f69-4b20-8b01-e7aa0ca74a17 .

camssa:10bcbcd1-57d7-4394-9a3b-bcd826cfdd67 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is not related to supporting the evolution of European public services, \r
therefore it does not promote or hinder it.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d5cb4b21-a84f-4933-a2e7-bf537ac2eb9c .

camssa:10c2eb29-20da-4b49-bae1-bbe5a51e8957 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:10c3d50f-27e8-4c73-944e-b676a1260bac a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PAdES is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
PAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/67937.html\r
\r
PAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:051fc11c-d387-4530-a3c5-03e30cfe250f .

camssa:10c7172f-7d23-4835-a869-a537dca84bbe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 depends on NIA 402 and ISAE 3000. ISAE 3402 states that assurance engagements should be \r
performed in accordance with the ISAE 3000 standard.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 exposure draft:\r
 https://www.ifac.org/system/files/uploads/Trans/ISAE%203402%20(definitiva%202013).pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:59de0bb9-3091-48be-abff-628e50fc0e99 .

camssa:10cb57bd-2b8f-4538-9bb7-56674e12de5c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:10d5faea-8d16-4abf-8918-96c45cc10007 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification defines an XML-based service metadata data model and a REST binding to retrieve service metadata. Even being XML-based, as XML is a widely adopted and supported specification, it does not hamper the interoperability of systems. Additionally,  is independent of any other specific vendor product and it is supported by open and commercial solutions\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/Background"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4b508a94-0bed-4721-a17f-8e82a0acd406 .

camssa:10d74c6c-bfc3-4354-a07d-7acc1357b0fb a owl:NamedIndividual,
        dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL "http://data.europa.eu/w21/1cc5e6e2-ca6a-4332-99bb-af53935ffe9e"^^xsd:anyURI .

