        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The purpose of SFIA is not related to the exposure of interfaces to access the public administration's services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
SFIA reference:\r
https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-8\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:67242902-04e0-41c2-8472-f0527a27a3b0 .

