camssa:1207eb41-2f94-4807-9083-b3d14e5fbfa9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox is an internal European Commission resource designed as a complement to the Commission's Better regulation guideline. Even though it could be extended or modified to fit other business requirements at the National level, for instance, there are no implementations that evidence the possibility of extension to other business domains than the development of public policies and laws.\r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2111c755-5ef7-41ec-9f4e-370461d825a0 .

camssa:1208faba-3634-4a32-8825-b127bdbaca51 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cc5bd9a7d0b2acc7f246522414fd5f5d579b977180bb04fa60a545cb35dae90f ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:12101a78-9165-4c86-885d-8f390a07087f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is designed to be platform agnostic. It operates at the application layer of the networking stack, and its implementation is independent of specific operating systems or platforms. This platform agnosticism allows for consistent usage across various devices and environments.

DoH specification: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8484'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3dd84e6f-ba1d-433c-8c91-8527cd009276 .

camssa:121083e0-d679-40a4-8081-f69566c5c6e8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-093c1e09f5a65e4cba0247dcab5a8f4854f3e512db336b1855b9a4c48d3659e0 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:12164720-890a-4b02-ac43-d2ce60dd58e6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry is not included in any initiative at European or National level covering privacy aspects. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

OpenTelemetry: https://opentelemetry.netlify.app/docs/specs/otel/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f45a58c7-98ca-451b-8eda-0535db86689d .

camssa:1218932d-5e65-4188-9064-36f5fc245cba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There are not specific assessments nor any deployment use case evaluating the specification's efficiency. \r
\r
TOSCA reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dbaf8935-0027-4e83-9fd1-267db030e2f1 .

