camssa:125edcb6-e5ae-4db4-b843-3c0085d0dce6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Not enough pieces of evidence have been found to answer if the specification purpose fits negatively or positively the one stated by the criterion. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fbc1b451-4984-4b04-b07c-4dd90f1a9735 .

camssa:126317f8-744a-4035-a57b-faf035665cc7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Some European projects using UBL have been found to conduct effectiveness assessments.  Such is the case of PEPPOL BIS Billing or ESPD.  In addition, There has been found an article assessing the impact of UBL implementation among SME's in developing countries.\r
\r
Suitable EAI architectures are necessary to fit interoperability challenges of SME's in less developed countries:\r
https://www.academia.edu/10858900/Suitable_EAI_architectures_are_necessary_to_fit_interoperability_challenges_of_SMEs_in_less_developed_countries\r
\r
Peppol BIS Billing 3.0\r
https://docs.peppol.eu/poacc/billing/3.0/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:818a9df6-2be9-4c45-a7dc-110b3b429b07 .

camssa:1269e496-f257-4c5d-9f97-b1c70bc3b32c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:126a2839-4357-4b01-baca-686c496282c2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"A review of catalogues found no evidence of RegOrg being formally included in Member States' recommended specifications or recognised at a European supra-national level.
Despite this, the Belgian Interoperability Framework (Belgif) includes the OSLO framework, which is used for semantic interoperability in Belgium. Within OSLO, various key elements and properties from RegOrg are still being utilised.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

CAMSS list of standards:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-andspecifications-camss/camss-list-standards

Belgian Interoperability Framework (Belgif):
https://www.belgif.be/page/specifications.en.html

OSLO Smart City Distribution - Application profile Reference: 
https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/slimme-stadsdistributie/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f5880f66-9a21-4870-8f02-cf95eb74b134 .

