camssa:1297dde7-6113-4a1c-bde0-b9c0a092a568 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The OData protocol is an application layer protocol for exchanging data through RESTful interfaces. In this sense, the specification enables exposure of any interface, including those interfaces providing access to public administration's services.\r
\r
OData reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/errata03/os/complete/part1-protocol/odata-v4.0-errata03-os-part1-protocol-complete.html#_Toc453752201\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7692e872-f081-4535-909c-220056ff0159 .

camssa:129c8bf7-b957-4d6e-8d13-70e523cb22fe a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-29023937877d658f898d48a06b2648e283306a041137cc58af4f79f061e1de4b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:129fdaeb-71c1-436d-bdaa-1327e6b78853 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 itself does not guarantee the protection against unauthorised changes since it focuses primarily on the physical and data link layers of Ethernet networks. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b891227-5c1a-472d-9fcc-c199b4c9e9cb .

camssa:12a126e7-9884-4aed-b9a3-d888f9bf14be a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification clearly encourages the creation of communities along with the sharing of their data and 
results as its purpose is to improve cloud computing portability and interoperability, thus improving 
communication between different actors. Furthermore, ISO/IEC 7498:1 has been included in different catalogues of ICT standards in a European level therefore, it is an important standard to consider.

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8a57e359-58ad-4f24-a4bd-dcac2a55c04b .

