camssa:12bbade8-9b94-46af-ab75-dd9a1de607ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the time of elaborating this assessment, MIME is not included in any EIRA ABB in the current EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS).\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2d1a83f5-1b65-4106-9b2a-0d49430e2721 .

camssa:12c09df6-bb77-4c49-a21e-e92eb2997f97 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "By allowing the digital document exchange including eSignatures, the CAdES Baseline profile avoids the non-digital data exchange. This fact is a key point in the reduction of administrative burden. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:96513df3-5a22-447c-ba54-85b97bff4b36 .

camssa:12c0bf4c-f819-4ae0-88ce-01f901769afa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although MIME itself does not foresee mechanisms for keeping the data integrity, its security extension (S/MIME) does include features that help guarantee data integrity, such as cryptographic techniques, to ensure that the content of an email messange remains unchanged during transmission.\r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045\r
\r
S/MIME specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5751.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b2d23235-7708-4f1f-ad81-16a6e0df811d .

camssa:12c1aa34-a97a-4803-b86d-710102f63a84 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox includes accessibility within the ICT requirements that ICT systems and solutions should cover for the proper implementation of a specific public policy (Tool #27). Therefore, it can be considered that taking the tools and methods, the specification can positively impact the e-accessibility of public services and solutions. \r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8eec5169-ee3b-4d87-8fd0-6501ea8fe130 .

camssa:12c5037a-1dc6-4e88-bd06-b3c0bac1a3dc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ef096f898c938883daab1b22e784cfaf985b5e5c855e170ecf6eab6f37b01b50 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:12c8c12a-585a-4c5a-a460-fd1755455d6b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "There is no national or European platform with the document, Data on the web best practices, available for free."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a8a7f1c8-55b3-4cbb-b329-398658756bdb .

camssa:12c9501a-5c11-4569-a50a-88275d122b8b a cav:Score,
