camssa:12fffdec-f4f3-4ca6-a93d-840000a2db99 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The primary goal of HTTPS is to establish a secure and encrypted connection between a client and a server, ensuring the confidentiality, integrity, and authenticity of data during transit. The secure processing of data involves additional considerations beyond the scope of HTTPS such as the compliance with data protection regulations between others.\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60506428-2028-4e74-9d9a-ee5beb743811 .

