        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Anyone developing software or policy for a public purpose can use this standard to work towards higher quality public services that are more cost effective, with less risk and more control, so it can be said that Standard for Public Code can be applied and developed in different domains and purposes without harming the interoperability of functinality of systems. \r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net/"""@en ;
