camssa:13c0a2f1-7f3e-4e00-82cd-d42eeb611784 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no Member State that includes Standard for Public Code in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a7df6bca-f7de-4251-835c-2062dd6be876 .

camssa:13c6a84e-8e07-4d17-9ec1-e1822a66bafd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"One of IDS' underlying objectives is to improve data interoperability and integrity. Therefore, it encourages 
the creation of communities along with the sharing of their data and results at European platforms (e.g. 
DBSA). Furthermore, IDS-G has public channels such as GitHub where users can discuss and ask any 
matter at hand.

The Data Spaces Business Alliance (DSBA): https://data-spaces-business-alliance.eu/

IDS-G DISCUSSIONS: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/discussions\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f47e01cf-987d-4cc4-8d77-fafa5f068a65 .

camssa:13c957ac-a195-41b1-8a21-2d277f0da7af a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'iCalendar does not provide specific provisions for the secure exchange of data; however, the specification introduces certain aspects that an implementer or an owner of the Personal Information Manager (PIM) should consider to secure the processing of data (e.g., when accepting and parsing such information).\r
\r
iCalendar Security Considerations:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545#section-7'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:48fc362d-b94e-4923-a5bc-b08be0f0e1f3 .

camssa:13cb388c-43ad-4ff7-b102-ed87824bae79 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "DCAT-AP has been developed to facilitate the publication of linked open data."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9d98e045-47fd-4263-8779-c4544bdbb535 .

