camssa:144888d1-7095-49e9-8b0b-82bf9c940c60 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT-AP has a significant market acceptance. The specification has been successfully implemented by several European Union Institutions such as the European Commission DG CONNECT with the European Data Portal, The Publications Office of the European Union with the European Union Open Data Portal or The German GovData Business Office with the German Data Portal.\r
\r
About DCAT Application Profile for data portals in Europe:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06254417-b04e-42be-a3ea-57b8d28f7133 .

