        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'REST has a wide-spread market acceptance as it is a common method to connect components in microservice architectures.  Among the top businessess who implement it we can find IBM or Amazon Web services.\r
\r
Amazon Web Services reference:\r
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/apigateway/latest/developerguide/apigateway-rest-api.html\r
\r
REST IBM reference:\r
https://www.ibm.com/es-es/cloud/learn/rest-apis'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:00be4ba5-074b-41a5-a8e8-f2813ad0b703 .

