camssa:14841a70-a156-4f69-b3f8-9164615c1e75 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification addresses semantic aspects thus data security and data privacy issues are addresses by\r
other means. The specification does not prevent the use of any security means.\r
Issues related to authorization and authentication of data are key to its secure processing, and XBRL GL\r
was designed with secure processing in mind.'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:10f31917-2cd6-446c-b4f9-56cf911a08cc .

