camssa:149dc103-85c5-4704-9e5f-e144a0bc61b2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """This common data model has been defined as a core vocabulary for criteria and evidences. A Core Vocabulary is a simplified, reusable, and extensible data model that captures the fundamental characteristics of an entity in a context-neutral fashion.\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:224784af-2643-495c-a955-ae98d226a2fd .

