        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of CPOV is not related to the provision of access control mechanism. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6e78fe59-ab54-4609-86d6-beceef2fb92c .

