camssa:14b4aa1b-569f-4513-b4bd-a437e9270a13 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTP Cookies can be customised by changing the attributes that define, for example, the lifetime of a Cookie, or by adding the "secure" attribute, which is meant to keep cookie communication limited to encrypted transmission. \r
\r
HTTP Cookies reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6265#section-5.2'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db1afa4d-c19e-4a34-93cb-2fa19f63879a .

