    cav:value "60" .

camssa:14b74349-70ce-49c6-bd98-e94f97044c5e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of this specification is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/ \r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dd686d5d-2035-47a8-8a6a-e747523fadfb .

camssa:14b7fab1-f9f1-4d82-9f86-32278969fdb8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of genericode is not related to covering privacy aspects at European nor National level. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:01203518-639c-4879-9b6c-5d91ebd43e46 .

camssa:14bbcece-0b71-4dad-82a3-c6d8efc0b1b6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The purpose of Advanced Encryption Standard is not related to enabling the exposure of interfaces 
to access the public administration's services. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

AES Standard Reference:
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dac282be-e02c-4767-9468-68dfe8ef0473 .

camssa:14bd53d0-5f86-4469-b926-dbae243691f2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"In the specification's documentation there is no mention to partial implementations, only the use of it as a whole.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:975a6786-ccfe-4553-83ae-287fd0c9da6d .

camssa:14d21992-7009-44f9-88bd-53b84709528d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"HTTP does contribute to secure data processing by enabling the implementation of security measures, primarily focused on controlling access and protecting data during transmission. However, they don't provide a complete framework for secure data processing.

HTTP/1.1, RFC 2616 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2616

HTTP/1.1 Authentication, RFC 9110 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110#name-http-authentication\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:22f4c227-60f2-43c4-b260-b7b9335f96f6 .

camssa:14d228f0-0bfd-4e40-9b9d-54216dc705d2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:14d423b8-345c-4958-9fa2-a178dddb4ff4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """MIME extends the format of email messages to support text in ASCII and non-ASCII characters, as well as attachments of audio, video, images, and application programs.\r
\r
MIME reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5dabf0fd-c265-421a-9a11-d01aa8b7421b .

camssa:14d82d5c-6167-475e-baf8-8fdb3aa0e033 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:14db875c-fa56-4054-a294-28e7f2616434 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-58010a47630ff9ea23336bf3fc558deff59905e0292551fcabc95740082cb378 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:14dc6a7f-dbfc-4691-b128-b8f3dbc1328a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ELI system allows for the reuse of material free of charge, even for commercial purposes, without
having to request permission. The information can be reproduced, adapted, translated, etc. However, this
reuse may be subject to conditions.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:013af05c-3d93-48a7-a523-1a2b65d27592 .

camssa:14e0686a-1ad5-4617-bfa0-9140e7d59456 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification can be migrated from older CSV versions to newer formats or standards to ensure that the data remains accessible and usable in the future. CSV can also implement robust storage and backup strategies, including redundancy, data replication, and regular backups, helps mitigate the risk of data loss or corruption. It is crucial to store CSV files in reliable and secure storage systems to ensure their long-term preservation.\r
\r
CSV reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:21338987-f41f-45c0-b356-9a761de29d85 .

camssa:14ec575a-5938-4648-b978-825d86f50b9e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the specification provides a framework for describing service endpoints, capabilities, and other relevant details, it does not specifically address the protection of personal data managed by public administrations.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:676e0827-e267-4904-a0b1-c337b6e8d036 .

camssa:14ec9009-35a8-45d8-8125-51023bc87610 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL "http://data.europa.eu/w21/20f50cfa-df10-4256-b438-7f8a9c4389a7"^^xsd:anyURI .

camssa:14f3b44f-c5ef-45f5-bd25-941c79c9bcef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAIS has currently undergone three major releases, the changes of whom are published in the CCSDS website, and in the ISO website. \r
\r
OAIS overview and release management:\r
https://cwe.ccsds.org/fm/Lists/Projects/DispFormDraft.aspx?ID=581'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50fcaf46-133a-432c-bb20-da943babc5f7 .

camssa:14f9518a-3e53-4175-b5c4-ae1c5b856dd0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, TLS 1.2 is  a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. FTP is licensed on a F(RAND) basis.\r
\r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/id/draft-gutmann-tls-lts-10.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7fdbbeef-2d30-4834-83f3-8e8166a217b5 .

camssa:14fb5f07-40f1-466a-85c5-f5053dc6f65f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Linked Data Event Streams (LDES) itself is a specification for representing and publishing real-time event data on the web using Linked Data principles. While the specification provides a framework for structuring event data, the multilingual support may be influenced by how the data within the events is represented and linked.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d373b3b6-38c3-44c0-8f81-34259429889b .

camssa:14fb85fd-906d-415e-8bdc-98662d725dc0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:15075815-3a82-4b03-9f2e-7c2f307dcb36 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is a protocol focused on the transaction of data. Even though it is related to data exchange, and it is aimed to ensure the delivery of data, it is not involved in data portability amongst systems fostering the European Public Services.\r
\r
The specification:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505000"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bd022d14-a25a-4fce-a1d2-1954d3f3700f .

camssa:15086644-94d3-47a3-bd57-52139038c260 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Verifiable Credentials is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF has a high performance on interoperability according to NIFO factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5f399a4e-1dd8-4eee-8c72-ffae1e84e7b9 .

