camssa:153962f0-97ea-4c5e-b3d4-9cb51f3c844f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "In the context of eSignatures and Seals, the European Commission has stated an Implementing decision (2015/1506) where urged the Member States and other Public services providers to recognise CAdES, PAdES, XAdES, and ASIC as formats for electronic signatures purposes."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b7921302-1884-4897-8246-ccef2b5baea7 .

camssa:153d9992-0016-4cb2-869d-fc44d179fd38 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ESPD is platform-agnostic, which means that it can be used with a wide range of digital platforms and systems. The ESPD is available in various formats, including electronic forms, PDF documents, and structured data formats such as XML, which allows it to be integrated into different digital platforms.\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:87f3699d-a0a0-41c8-a43e-089967e45602 .

