camssa:156a6e39-7f4d-47ae-98bf-d1ddc34b014e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is related to the delivery of multilingual public services. The use of this Core Vocabulary for electronic criterion and evidence allows for removing language barriers thereby improving the cross border exchange of information.\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9288e5ec-50c6-4c72-bd73-be85573405e3 .

camssa:156db847-a249-445d-8966-217f1b25e0cd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By easing the creation of secured web services, XACML contributes to the increment of digital public services between administrations and stakeholders and among administrations. This public services can include Secure Data Transfer amongst other services. One of the services that can help to simplify this delivery public services is Semiramis, which is a pilot infrastructure to provide e-services.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html

SEMIRAMIS project: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/semiramis/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ce598406-079b-4d9c-90a4-f74775f7f902 .

camssa:156e0ccf-7853-4a92-9317-669f0f12e8bd a cav:Score,
