camssa:15763e7a-daa2-40c4-90b8-b98f7346cbfd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "HTML5 is a business domain agnostic specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2cb2b2e3-7415-45e2-95a7-fbf0350d813b .

camssa:1585f180-a587-4ffe-a340-76a8dd9fab9e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Verifiable Credentials include several features to protect against unauthorized changes and ensure the integrity and security of the credentials. Verifiable Credentials are typically signed using digital signatures and its content is often hashed before signing. Also, the specification insists on the selective disclosure feature, which allows the holder to present only specific claims or attributes from a credential. This specification describes mechanisms for ensuring integrity of Verifiable Credentials and similar types of constrained digital documents using cryptography, especially through the use of digital signatures and related mathematical proofs.\r
\r
Verifiable Credentials Data Integrity: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-integrity/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b92cd7ff-130e-4746-aab6-92e94db5426c .

camssa:1588b7e4-66c3-4737-bb30-9ffc00f09fcc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ba46c76c10ad769a23ce4a9a34cb4d96a00407d5fc14ad1c791a870be7563c2b ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:15898e5b-1da8-4303-8398-d4e8be94af92 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-1624157830122d60825aa5aa88ab70d0b140b2e7e510086699f9a9773efef6bd ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:15899e05-7b0b-41fd-bc1d-cdd4656e24b2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"All SFIA releases are subject to public review. Although anyone can contribute to the development of the SFIA specification, it is worth to note that only the SFIA team and key stakeholders are involved in final decisions. The entire process is transparent, meaning that changes and all the supporting documents are publicly available in the dedicated SFIA-release section (see SFIA reference, Start of SFIA 8 consultation section).\r
\r
SFIA release reference, SFIA version 8, 'The story behind the content' section:\r
https://sfia-online.org/en/sfia-8#autotoc-item-autotoc-7\r
\r
SFIA reference, Start of SFIA 8 consultation section:\r
https://www.sfia-online.org/en/sfia-8/start-of-sfia-8-consultation?msclkid=59a790c2ba5711eca7d3c3c3b117d15a\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:303c11d4-4bfb-48d2-9dc0-e63e516fe4df .

camssa:158a8dca-4190-4a6e-887f-1c69b2cbc886 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c8a79448e829e27f47318879de4899c3a6404aa66d7d8954e7a680cf6e5d1ca2 ;
    cav:value "100" .

