camssa:15c27293-22e7-481c-9829-f85c248860ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 is mainly focused on establishing quality control processes in private sector companies, \r
administrations could benefit from implementing it for those procedures that require payments. This would \r
allow public administrations to clearly define and expose how their procedures are carried out and therefore, \r
enhance transparency and comprehensibility of data.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 website:\r
https://www.isae3402.com/ISAE3402_overview#'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:69038b4a-f4fa-4c7e-a50d-9eed6103282a .

camssa:15c29921-02f3-431f-9243-5eaef6a00ed9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XML is used to encode all communications between web services. Therefore, it fosters the visibility and comprehensibility of public administrations data and services. \r
\r
See:\r
https://esentool.ted.europa.eu/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a3f4617f-6f3b-4133-819a-9c6216266637 .

camssa:15c2997c-7e64-4663-b628-031f3db457a2 a cav:Score,
