camssa:15e4f35c-8f23-4ca3-903a-589be2ce2133 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As defined by the OASIS Technical Committee (TC), the UBL TC is involved in the release lifecycle of \r
the specification. External contribution to this committee is possible through open channels. Up-to-date, the \r
UBL TC has announced three public reviews; however, the topic selection of these reviews is independent \r
of the external contributors.\r
\r
UBL OASIS Technical Committee reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=ubl'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:75340d81-7a58-44de-a3b5-2ed9449ed8af .

camssa:15e94ce2-26d7-4a59-94ae-8cc61167a44c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Although JPEG is supporting the first level of maturity from the Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for the Open data, it is not supporting the main principles for the publication of data as Linked Open Data.  \r
\r
JEPG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/18902.html\r
\r
JPEG public reference:\r
https://jpeg.org/jpeg/\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:063ad3d5-65a0-4c08-aabe-bc5fc5c01f96 .

