        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OpenPM2 offers a set of guidelines and methods for the development of projects and aims to ensure the efficiency and effectiveness from the Project Management perspective. Since it is based on European Union and National Knowledge it can be useful when creating eGovernment innovative solutions. \r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127  """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46a10c41-87ee-4826-9d75-0f092d041808 .

