camssa:16c3c129-f4fd-45e5-b8c0-a9e1484a2350 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'A Linked Data Event Stream (LDES) is a new data publishing approach which allows you to publish any dataset as a collection of immutable objects. Each object is described in RDF. The focus of an LDES is to allow clients to replicate the history of a dataset and efficiently synchronise with its latest changes.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bdfe4eef-5e36-4533-9a10-496edb094d97 .

