camssa:16df4a57-7ea1-44ef-a8f1-3f102af0fa14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no conformity test coming from the IETF. However, there are several free online and offline tools to test an SMTP implementation which will prove its compliment. For example, Online Domain Tool, which can test an SMTP mail server implementation.\r
\r
Online Domain Tool:\r
http://mail-server-test.online-domain-tools.com/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8097842-7ff1-46a3-bf24-7ce68d7feba1 .

