        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of HTTPS is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:abb651ea-25e5-4cbe-8cc7-65032e19a99a .

