camssa:18221be0-8de7-451c-8ff1-0d44723e7ba0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 10 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Some examples of Member States including XSD on their catalogues are the Netherlands, Slovenia, Spain or Portugal.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c780e5ac-f944-485f-b951-526193b8e4b5 .

