camssa:18275f6e-4e42-4c63-88b3-38eae95b0401 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Syslog Protocol standard is maintained by the Internet Engineering Task Force (IETF). The development and maintenance of The Syslog protocol is carried out within the IETF's Syslog working group, which can be contacted according to section 10 of the protocol.

IETF Working Groups: https://www.ietf.org/how/wgs/

Syslog Protocol Working Group: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424#section-10\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15570306-e2d5-45ef-be71-cb292b1d338e .

