    cav:value "1" .

camssa:18309b63-c985-4f82-8b0a-296b34df9476 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ba46c76c10ad769a23ce4a9a34cb4d96a00407d5fc14ad1c791a870be7563c2b ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:18332b36-1fd0-4718-a78e-b5437c8c8fb7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary provides a standardised vocabulary for describing organisations, facilitating data exchange and interoperability, particularly within the European context. Its successor, CBV, is now the more actively supported specification for this purpose, encouraging data sharing and the creation of communities on national and European platforms.

Registered Organization Vocabulary specification reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

CBV GitHub Reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:434107ad-f795-4890-b3f4-cd37ce08d054 .

camssa:1835340e-0806-432a-beaa-e79a6333e001 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a81c4b8658f57e819297eb0b7977407f8d814c6fe749c74a8ac497277ca7d9d8 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:18358d21-ee03-4120-b5f3-2b54ea602dab a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-17a2b7a0ca372f407c300b69049faf9d92cbf274964290ba278b18cf10bf5dbf ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:183b52e0-fbea-4378-9845-570f4f9687c5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CPSV-AP is independent of any software, hardware, or operating system. So it can be said that the specification is independent of any specific technology or platform.\r
\r
CPSV-AP Joinup webpage:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile/release/22'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de4bda1f-5b9c-4e18-88ba-1206fbb9090b .

camssa:183ee005-9857-4fa8-a6f4-7e2bb6a3c797 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:1845005d-12c4-4033-b978-cc6415f67a98 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SCIM encourages collaboration in the realm of identity management as it was created by IETF, a non-profit and open organisation dedicated to standardisation. IETF encourages collaborative efforts that extend beyond the specifications themselves and include discussions, forums, and knowledge-sharing platforms where users can exchange ideas, experiences, and best practices related to SCIM. For instance, IETF has created discussions lists for their specifications that improve the development and specification of Internet technology through the general discussion of technical, procedural, operational, and other topics for which no dedicated mailing lists exist. 

SCIM: https://scim.cloud/
IETF Discussion Lists: https://www.ietf.org/how/lists/discussion/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:071e4946-6801-44b6-a601-c32863e616f3 .

camssa:184c09d0-7176-4eb4-bdde-64544c45759f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no Member States recommending LegalRuleML in their ICT National Catalogues.\r
 \r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:87de5ea3-ba9c-48f3-8810-48a13e9310b4 .

camssa:1858053c-bb82-431b-bd7e-b39234081ae3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7a18abe4842e04b608025fd70e54c3db5c2a10130c0dab0495479e7d5effb55d ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:1862e8b3-4531-41b1-bbf3-32fa07acb12c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"According to the schema.org project website, the schema.org specification provides a specific vocabulary that can be used by applications that publish, discover or integrate various types of data. Although the main purpose of schema.org is not related to data preservation, the specification can enable long-term preservation of data through additional file export mechanisms or by integrating schema.org into other data markup schemes (see Zotero reference, Forums section) that enable data preservation..\r
\r
Schema.org homepage reference, 'Data and Datasets overview' section:\r
https://schema.org/docs/data-and-datasets.html\r
\r
Zotero reference, Forums section:\r
https://forums.zotero.org/discussion/35992/export-to-schema-org-rdfa-and-or-microdata\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:625f889f-6f17-4fa9-99dd-9418dfd3cfad .

camssa:1865bd23-01e9-41bb-b309-f4a5be5fae64 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI EN 319 532-3 ensures the protection of data due to a new object (according to the REM message \r
structure) generated by the REM Service enclosing the original message and other contents generated by \r
the REM Service, who is responsible only for part of its contents (it is not responsible for the contents of the \r
original message).\r
If Trusted List (TL) is used to publish trust information about a REMS, then the section describing a REM \r
service shall be populated in conformance to ETSI TS 119 612.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3, Message/Dispatch, Page 9 and Page 25:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d7132f1e-3f42-4cc3-a0e7-6220b6391a6c .

camssa:186c547b-ee71-4e11-b5aa-10a06c5ea525 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CLV is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a113cef8-fb5e-4fd4-9e36-0b4bc557e0bb .

camssa:1870a22e-3a08-4e91-a346-1497c6a7ffb1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI EN 319 422 does simplify European public services by making the process of time-stamping secure by the side of both client and server.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ca89d153-d95b-4005-9a4d-fa48457a48b4 .

camssa:1875f6b2-5a4b-4e90-8fd5-733465ede8a0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of genericode is not related to ensuring the protection of personal data. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e61c6e66-c742-4856-ae1a-f66230d4d2d6 .

camssa:18773b2a-45f1-4025-801b-fd088dfe6acc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAIS has not been found in any initative covering privacy aspects neither at national, nor at European level.\r
\r
OAIS specification:\r
https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/650x0m2.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5d58787c-abf7-420d-89d5-e36123052b92 .

