        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'With a REST protocol you can do the following operations with data POST (creation), GET, PUT, DELETE. So in some way, it facilitates the publication of public data as open data. \r
\r
See this link for the justification: \r
https://www.bbvaapimarket.com/es/mundo-api/api-rest-que-es-y-cuales-son-sus-ventajas-en-el-desarrollo-de-proyectos/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1cdd451f-1b9c-4a80-8166-a2ae3091199b .

