        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As it happens with all the e-Government Vocabularies, it has the SEMIC action from the ISA2 as responsible for the maintenance of the development.\r
\r
SEMIC in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ccfffa3c-1b1d-4130-81c7-0d2fb6ed34f9 .

camssa:1a2f6fc3-38e0-4706-ba5b-ed78e7206e83 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As a vocabulary to describe assets within a Repository, it provides concepts and properties identifying the content creators and other informative metadata such as dates involved in the release of the solutions described. These facts increase the reliability of the exchanged data. \r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dc257a66-ea59-4830-925d-a0dd684045f4 .

