        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the assessments performed by CAMSS and the list of specifications identified by the MSP Multi-stakeholder-platform, no assessment verifying the compliance of the specification with the European standardisation regulation has been found.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:09a8b078-e661-4d49-880c-d453b3d476db .

camssa:1a9c4b90-ecd9-4180-80b5-3c13dcc0944c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS Queries over HTTPS (DoH) is recommended by the Spanish Agency of Data Protection. According to this public institution, to provide confidentiality in DNS queries, different alternatives have been developed, including DNS over TLS (DoT) and DNS over HTTPS (DoH). Both solutions are designed to mitigate the risk that DNS queries can be intercepted, and if they are that the information is illegible, contributing to improve confidentiality. 

AEPD Technical Note on DNS Privacy: https://www.aepd.es/guides/technical-note-dns-privacy.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50cb19f5-b3d5-4a5a-b56c-14d2f37c3c0c .

camssa:1a9dcdb8-aee4-40b7-814e-338a6ad140e5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:1aa52ac5-9c75-4ca4-9987-94cfb150968b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While XACML provides robust mechanisms for access control based on authenticated attributes, the specification itself does not directly handle the authentication of users or guarantee the authenticity of the roles and agents involved in data transactions. However, the specification provides features that in 
combination with other specifications enhances authentication methods.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15411d11-fdd6-4ea0-898a-be154ced1e31 .

