camssa:1abab852-6423-425d-958e-40fefec5667c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Indexed Database API specification does not make specific provisions for partial implementations. However, it is mentioned that some operations can be performed separately. In this context, different operations can be found, such as index retrieval operations or object store retrieval operations, which can be utilised separately.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:882da5fd-ef32-418d-bceb-706873a7cc11 .

