camssa:1b39d2ef-e0ea-4652-a422-133c57b0f563 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The establishment and implementation of an organization’s information security management system is influenced by the organization’s needs and objectives, security requirements, the organizational processes used and the size and structure of the organization. All of these influencing factors are expected to change over time.  ISO/IEC 27001, therefore, is designed to be implemented in accordance of any given organization's needs, allowing its customisation.\r
\r
ISO 27001 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso-iec:27001:ed-2:v1:en\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4b32411-9a28-4d25-a353-e6b4a78fad73 .

camssa:1b3ada14-fb34-4ae6-a936-1ca1d12c7107 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The motivation of DPV is to provide a 'data model' or a 'taxonomy' of concepts that act as a vocabulary for the interoperable representation and exchange of information about personal data and its processing.\r
\r
DPV specification: \r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/dpv/\r
\r
DPV primer document:\r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/#introduction\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b0880f2d-f7e5-479a-b7b9-f5ad68819171 .

