camssa:1b4ee1eb-74f3-49ac-9949-585b7715e2f8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Joinup offers several services that aim to help e-Government professionals share their experience with each 
other. Joinup supports them to find, choose, re-use, develop and implement interoperability solutions. DIDs
appears in many Joinup entries as a discussion topic.

Joinup DIDs:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/ssi-eidas-bridge'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d26c1897-f2ff-4bbf-ba75-44bbedf01c2c .

camssa:1b5419ae-037f-49ed-8eaa-7d18724746d9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of WSDL is not related to the long-term preservation of electronic records and other kinds of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dfb2dd3b-6fa1-423a-9c6c-79cda396e175 .

