        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of LDAP is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ecd2d02b-573d-47ad-9406-817deebc2240 .

