camssa:1bd87869-92a2-4341-bfde-ef3d60504d93 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While ISO standards, including ISO/IEC 7498:1, are internationally recognized and widely used, they are not European Standards in the sense of being developed and published by CEN or CENELEC specifically for the European region. 

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cb48f589-16ee-4503-99e9-48cbe55959c7 .

camssa:1be33593-a6f3-4261-acc5-3f8c4e22e06f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification was developed in 2015, and it has been evolving together with all the related European projects where CCCEV has an active role. Moreover, at the moment of performing the assessment, version 2.0 has not yet been developed in order to ensure that the CCCEV covers the needs of the different cross-border projects (e.g. eCertis, ESPD, etc).\r
\r
Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary reference (v1.0.0):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/release/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary-v100  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f46d8a84-ec0b-4f1b-9d2e-5fe21d607d22 .

