camssa:1c075e82-86a6-4402-937e-1b806022c667 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of XACML within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f9cc67b3-f736-48b0-804a-6f73640c6453 .

camssa:1c09c229-974d-4781-ba87-e415d6e9ac8c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XHTML is one of the main markup languages to develop web resources. XHTML files are used to exchange information through the web. So this fact proves that XHTML fosters data portability between systems and applications.\r
\r
XHTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65db3b34-7b9c-473e-ae6a-e7889c46e838 .

