        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'No tools assessing the conformity of implementations with the specification have been found.\r
\r
However, there are tools developed by the FTP community assessing FTP servers access. \r
\r
FTP Tool Assessing Server Performance: \r
https://ftptest.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97544895-aed3-4f53-ab20-dee3cf741faf .

