camssa:1c56177d-3e5d-4a8b-a061-b650e1306ae8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTTP is an internet protocol for the data exchange over an Internet network. It supports the first level of maturity defined in the Tim Berners-Lee´s  5 stars Open Data deployment scheme, "Make your data accessible on the web". \r
\r
See: \r
https://5stardata.info/en/ """@en ;
