camssa:1c724435-bedb-47ca-b48c-44b8e1e77250 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The purpose of EN 16234-1 e-CF is not related to the exposure of interfaces to access the public administration's services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
CEN reference, CEN/TC 428 - ICT Professionalism and Digital Competences (Published standards), EN 16234-1 e-CF:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=205:110:0::::FSP_PROJECT:67073&cs=15E62ED24D608A5F10D6BEE8E6D50FA10\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:51b5f9bf-95dc-4dd1-a80c-c2df2fbe67c4 .

camssa:1c72b535-ed8f-4fb7-b39e-0d622b037b07 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification plays a crucial role in enabling digital services delivery channels by providing a standardised framework for exchanging XML-based business messages. This framework ensures secure and reliable communication between different systems, facilitating seamless integration and interoperability.

ebXML techtarget:
https://www.techtarget.com/searchcio/definition/ebXML

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b4424b81-f32c-4b37-9615-0f4f32056694 .

camssa:1c7354dd-2ca0-468b-bcd3-32956f88cfab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ETSI ESI Portal provides public access to drafts review activity and contributions. However, drafts are \r
only publicly available over a registration process.\r
The decision-making process includes a public review, where stakeholders involved can provide technical \r
feedback in order to enhance and maximize the quality and accuracy of the standards.\r
\r
ETSI ESI Portal:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/tb.aspx?tbid=607&SubTB=607#/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b274e08b-b2ca-4cc0-977c-a97483bae799 .

camssa:1c739742-57ad-4e26-9a53-c58d9ab8836d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:1c76f4ae-de8e-46a4-a103-8643cb2704d3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PDF/A is highly adopted as a document format for exchange information, which is technological independent. These facts demonstrate the maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50342dab-4095-4e31-bf77-70fa08b66086 .

camssa:1c7e145c-c964-4394-9bea-6340ca72eb36 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Nowadays, at the moment of performing the assessment WSDL is widedy used specification involved in the implementation of the Service-Oriented Architectures (SOAs). SOAP along with REST are the main ways to build web services, the first one uses WSDL to describe services and guaranteeing access to them. Therefore, WSDL is involved in the development of solutions, including innovative ones.\r
\r
SOAP IBM  Documentation:\r
https://www.ibm.com/docs/en/radfws/9.7?topic=standards-soap\r
\r
REST IBM Documentation:\r
https://www.ibm.com/topics/rest-apis\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bd1c7452-04a6-4471-823b-cb766b857b23 .

