        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no mention of Odata in any official document stating its conformance in regards to Regulation 1025/2012.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en\r
\r
CENELEC and CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CEN:105::RESET::::'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ccc88af9-0678-448c-a540-00c9ce47e04c .

camssa:1ca813bd-4a45-4f26-a293-f02f9a3a0c00 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Such means as enabling the secure processing of data can be provided as SOAP extensions using the SOAP extensibility mode. The SOAP Messaging Framework does not directly provide any mechanism for dealing with it directly.\r
\r
SOAP Reference, section 7 Security Considerations:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/soap12/#secconsiderations'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e5e86310-5fda-4955-aba2-a4e6116b1cf8 .

