camssa:1cb811f9-f483-4d24-a77e-7ba0d8b995a0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 511 has been developed to provide services for the long-term preservation of data in general.\r
The specification fosters the implementation of the once-only principle by ensuring data is well preserved\r
and stored, and it can also be retrieved when needed.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:388ebde9-9d04-499c-9ace-1fefe913350a .

camssa:1cbd5a59-0642-4bc3-a720-bfa288dd1ba8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:1ccc8dec-e51a-4c34-bcea-d2e62384e070 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are existing studies assessing the effectiveness of DNS.\r
\r
See:                                                                                                                                                 https://ccronline.sigcomm.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/p36-hao.pdf        https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Alessio_Merlo/publication/221271469_A_Comparative_Performance_Evaluation_of_DNS_Tunneling_Tools/links/00b4951c1e5065b0e6000000/A-Comparative-Performance-Evaluation-of-DNS-Tunneling-Tools.pdf                                                                                                                 https://www.researchgate.net/publication/235996771_Performance_assessment_and_analysis_of_DNS_tunneling_tools                                                                      https://ccronline.sigcomm.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/p36-hao.pdf                                                                                                                                                        """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bb415978-5a45-40f5-bd21-206935a276b3 .

camssa:1cd1bf8c-a1e5-4cff-9a43-3cecd919d799 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary reference (v1.0.0):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/release/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary-v100  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9bb0e729-4b55-4164-a2a4-7ab5e41ffa41 .

camssa:1cd21596-ff07-48f6-b74f-8a7b3497d4b3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification can help with the reuse of information by defining different mechanisms. In this sense, the specification provides a way to register business process sequences with related message exchanges. Additionally, in the context of OOTS (Once-Only Technical System) the ebXML specification provides the standardised structure necessary for relevant information to be identifiable, efficiently transported, and usable by receiving systems.

ebXML information reuse OOTS:
https://code.europa.eu/oots/tdd/tdd_chapters/-/tree/86290aa801fb9a8e56486fc49019addcc1321a95/OOTS-EDM/xml/Request-Response%20Samples

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3c68b539-b766-4736-935c-d4a204a7f52f .

camssa:1cd63f5e-d5c1-46d0-9f5b-2301aaa79e2e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:1cdb8c2a-1008-415f-98c5-ea72bfa422e2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification does facilitate the publication of open data as it is a technical markup language which derives from the XML standard for representing legislative, executive and judicial documents in a structured manner.                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        \r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html\r
\r
AKN4EU reference: \r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b21454e-8448-4f1d-8e00-b985c68171ba .

camssa:1cdd451f-1b9c-4a80-8166-a2ae3091199b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e46f1a4a060cc7e143e32e4833c94af9164c37bc0d4c844bd1fa974ffb2ac225 ;
    cav:value "100" .

