        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Currently the specification is widely used in diverse group of projects and institutions and in particular in the Elementary Multiperspective Material Ontology (EMMO):

List of ontologies and institutions/groups using BFO:
https://basic-formal-ontology.org/users.html

Elementary Multiperspective Material Ontology (EMMO) GitHub:
https://github.com/emmo-repo/EMMO

