camssa:1cfc6bdd-61f9-484d-bb7a-91745818802d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While genericode itself is not a comprehensive solution for negotiating and implementing organisational interoperability agreements, its standardised representation of code lists and controlled values can provide a foundation for interoperability discussions. By adopting genericode-compliant formats and structures, organisations can establish common ground for data exchange, facilitate communication, and support interoperability efforts. 

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:331d7e3b-e099-4e79-ab98-627e5d1cf9aa .

camssa:1d02a53a-b531-4090-855e-f4ea938ef69c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'No, the specification is not yet a European Standard.          \r
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     See W3C Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2006/REC-xml11-20060816/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1f84837-77d9-45f3-8d6b-ab0fcfffe510 .

