camssa:1d993073-f0fd-4dcd-a4e4-a3aa7f482549 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"NUTS started to be used within the European Union's territory as a reference coding system in 1999, although its use dates back to the 1970's (see EUROSTAT reference, History of NUTS section, 'NUTS 1981 - MUTS 1999' document). This specification has gone through different amendments since1999, some of these changes resulting from the adhesion of new Member States and the consequent addition of new codes. All the documentation on NUTS releases is publicly available (see EUROSTAT reference, History of NUTS section, NUTS versions documents).\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, History of NUTS section, 'NUTS 1981 - MUTS 1999' document:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/history\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, History of NUTS section, NUTS versions documents:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/history\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1f350848-0213-4951-8a5d-b1faa3b9faef .

camssa:1d9d2aa8-4d43-4c6c-bbed-d0c6d3a8eea7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of JPEG is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
JEPG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/18902.html\r
\r
JPEG public reference:\r
https://jpeg.org/jpeg/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d1c7f98e-b15c-4b93-8368-535a4d9cd337 .

camssa:1d9d512f-4b0f-425b-a08d-0c936d02e3a4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes the DPV in their national catalogue with Their National \r
Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories 1. Conceptual model for integrated \r
public servicesprovision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2de031aa-e08c-4db8-827c-cf2e2d1261a3 .

