camssa:1df23927-7b5c-4c42-b6ed-ab544b7796f8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By allowing the exchange of digital documents, PDF/A avoids sharing non-digital documents and then helps to the reduction of administrative burden. Additionally, as a format fostering the preservation of digital information, ensures the possible reuse and exchange of data over time. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:64669ebe-079f-4fcc-8cd6-08a169b00948 .

