camssa:1e13fabc-76e5-4bb9-9992-63a073a76dcc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "CAdES Baseline profile is being used in the context of the European internal market to ensure interoperability across borders when AdES signatures are required. Hence, it can be considered as an element fostering the creation of innovative solutions fostering the implementation of Once-only Principle along with other capabilities enhancing the relationship between public administrations and stakeholders. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8d0ba409-b811-4e44-8c32-0b88806dbdad .

