camssa:1e4a9b1f-815b-40a7-8d27-db8a848bd339 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of genericode is not related to enabling digital service delivery channels. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:957fa1be-06bd-4e98-8dbc-cf3f2ac2d957 .

camssa:1e4c2f3c-e556-4fe7-b0a1-7096783b35a4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are not communities nor platforms for sharing and publishing iCalendar-related issues at national or European platforms. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d795ec3a-f5eb-4554-85f0-61d643c91175 .

camssa:1e5159f5-9246-402e-b2a5-fa3a0538f16f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of REM message structure on these header fields is to give immediate access to important \r
identification information instead of forcing the REMS to process the ERDS evidence. Also, ENISA is recommending the specification in a Signature Verification document.\r
\r
ENISA document:\r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/events/tsforum-caday-2018/presentations/C03_Rock.pdf\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference, section 6.2.1:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d2ba1f5b-6f63-4807-b0bc-f09f9be6b52b .

