camssa:1e65f8c8-e920-4bfa-a9ce-633d2fe9b3fd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is not related to provide an access control mechanism. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ef002939-e3a7-431b-8dd0-210734f17b31 .

camssa:1e6cb2f6-da4c-44ca-91be-7df69ef3790b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OAS points out some essential security aspects addressing the protection of personal data.  For example, the specification mentions security schemes that can be used by the operations, such as HTTP authentication, API key or OAuth.  Nonetheless, these personal data protection mechanisms rely on external protocols not specified by OAS.\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7a1ece86-2815-42a6-a389-14a22e34de78 .

camssa:1e745141-ada5-4a7c-ab46-556e27699bac a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of LegalDocML is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8ab9854-b29b-45b5-8683-7e714d241396 .

