camssa:1f05de47-29b9-44d3-80cd-4cf5153bcd6d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specificaton presents the standard to which all digital documents conform to improve the efficiency, interoperability, and readability of all documents/certificates. For instance, since it plays a major role within the European Blockchain Services Infrastructure (EBSI) ecosystem, it is helpful fostering the visibility of administrative data and supporting the decision-making process. \r
\r
Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/\r
\r
EBSI W3C Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/pages/viewpage.action?pageId=555222155'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f1ab8172-d652-4bd2-a10a-19de0326b000 .

