camssa:1f179d88-8d99-4873-88a9-fe87963b29d8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is used to encode and structure legal documents as XML, therefore it can help to the structured data exchange and the availability of interfaces with internal information. LEOS allows a common interface where this XML content is displayed in a user-friendly way to allow the creation and management of legal documents.\r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php\r
\r
LEOS: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/justice-law-and-security/solution/leos-open-source-software-editing-legislation"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:24b4bd0c-46f9-40cc-b820-f55cc21cad75 .

camssa:1f1b57a6-ebf4-4e12-9e11-0530cec88855 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of LDAP is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable \r
specification. \r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:303627b3-8013-49c7-9637-e8187df4c2e6 .

camssa:1f21e251-2b64-4aa9-8ffb-cbb089ebb491 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XML is already associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, XML can define the interoperability aspects of the "Machine to Machine Interface" and "Representation" ABBs from the EIRA Semantic and Technical views.\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0b83729d-17a9-4c75-b959-dcf99ab7e5bd .

camssa:1f2a308e-65b2-4707-a41c-34d77bdb675a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a60f86e868fe2bdcf0c5c47111455d1d5b59498172688e36f23a77baa347d916 ;
    cav:value "100" .

