        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 is currently included in the catalogue of standards of one Member State: Malta.

CAMSS list of standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards

Malta List of Standards:
https://www.mccaa.org.mt/Section/Content?contentId=1243

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
