camssa:1f52652e-29e8-442e-8633-5d6c9d19fa85 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IndexedDB allows to store information locally, and access data without the need of being connected to the internet. In this context, public administrations can store information locally, and continue delivering public services in poor connection moments. Thus, public services can be delivered in many complicated situations.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c0a3e1bf-cf6a-448e-a269-e34105b0a9b4 .

