https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f57d99f7-4c9f-4684-93b2-9b305695c742 .

camssa:1fdd26c9-59ad-43b6-920b-794e87877bab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1b890a4-73dd-4031-be46-4cdeea502608 .

camssa:1fe53c97-5a7e-4f16-8cc7-f2a50c1bbaa7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
