    cav:value "100" .

camssa:1ffaa896-d9a8-406b-8ed3-13c574241b9c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "CAdES Baseline profile is an independent standard that can be implemented without dependencies on other technologies or platforms. Therefore, the specification can be implemented without hampering the interoperability but avoiding vendor lock-in. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:765c0b56-7b39-433c-b5f2-6921e0561073 .

camssa:1ffe5837-d362-438a-bcd6-5346ffa3c5d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing documentation and studies assessing the effectiveness and efficiency of LDAP. It is a comparison between LDAP 2 and LDAP 3. As well, the study shows the improvement of the different versions over time as resulting in more efficient protocol. Moreover, there is documentation about the language used by LDAP and how it improves responses to user queries, as well as the effectiveness to access and organize data.

Difference between LDAP2 and LDAP3: 
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/desktop/ldap/differences-between-ldap-2-and-ldap-3

Assessment of LDAP services in high availability environment:
https://www.semanticscholar.org/paper/ASSESSMENT-OF-LDAP-SERVICES-IN-HIGH-AVAILABILITY-Marchel-Boldak/8c27ba354d6b70d803b2f56c4f3bcc2193efa879

Language efficiency of LDAP: 
https://www.fortinet.com/uk/resources/cyberglossary/ldap-authentication

Effectiveness of LDAP:
https://www.securew2.com/blog/ldap-explained'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:19472ff7-1453-46d4-a750-1cef52e0fe93 .

camssa:200040f2-7efd-4f8e-92b8-38993400ffb5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The ISO specifications are published to be able to respond to a market need which represent a consensus of an expert group. In 2005 PDF/A was published which specifies how to use the Portable Document Format (PDF) 1.4 for long-term preservation of electronic documents. These facts demonstrate the maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5d575775-b061-4498-9cf4-ff3327529b19 .

camssa:2010f0c6-65ec-4a97-a6ce-722ebb5a1483 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:2012c2b6-bac0-4d67-98a9-788c356e0662 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "HTTP (Hypertext Transfer Protocol ) is a Transfer Protocol used for communication over a computer network. It is used to transfer data between administrations."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:79bef6b1-22e8-41e2-9372-0375ca54fdd9 .

camssa:201a6782-b285-4011-9d34-f01a4aa2ff30 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e8b12513-1700-47ad-8896-d825b1a4c52d .

camssa:201b18c7-7896-437b-a96b-832e4d95d01f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"By implementing DQV, public administrations can assess the quality of the data they manage, including personal data. Ensuring high data quality is essential for maintaining the integrity and reliability of personal data, which contributes to protecting individuals' privacy and rights. DQV enables public administrations to identify and address data quality issues that could compromise the security or privacy of personal data.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:71e6744f-e783-41bf-8b62-72aa99a84255 .

camssa:201b1db4-d3df-47f1-afd9-1e155db158c1 a cav:Score,
