camssa:20893c1d-a1fd-47d3-af3e-d32e20136f82 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As specification fostering the interoperability between public administrations, RDF helps to enhance the data exchange and reuse in a cross-border way and impacts positively on the development of eGovernment. This fact includes the support to Once-only principle implementation."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b2349d82-f7e4-4a87-b93b-6ae14c64ac1b .

