camssa:20c09359-6aba-477d-886e-8fed68674ddc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WSDL is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, WSDL can define the interoperability aspects of the "Machine to machine interface" ABB of the EIRA Technical View.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxls"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f659daad-1449-4489-82d9-94ac675ef3e6 .

