camssa:20fdcabd-a19d-4182-bd2a-4186544e2543 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The application of the once-only principle in all EU Member States public administrations aims at reducing the administrative burden. EuroVoc fosters interoperability between public administrations, cross border services and impacts positively the development of eGovernment.\r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4af6ac8-441b-465d-97ff-04df3cdf7cb2 .

camssa:20fe4d56-b8fc-4798-9410-77eaa1da6918 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"EU Member States' trusted lists were established in EU and aimed primarily at supporting the validation of advanced electronic signatures supported by a qualified certificate and advanced electronic signature supported by both a qualified certificate and by a secure signature creation device, as far as they included as a minimum trust service providers supervised/accredited for issuing qualified certificates. This method can explicitly enable the secure and trustworthy processing of data as it is using an advanced electronic signature which is supported by a qualified certificate and a secure signature creation device.\r
\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 612 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf \""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:672c9eaa-0e5d-4622-a46f-26186c75062b .

camssa:2103a7b2-ebdc-4019-acc6-22fb8aec4bf9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is not directly designed to enable digital service delivery channels. Instead, DoH contributes to the security of DNS transactions. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

DoH specification: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8484'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7e577899-d604-44a4-848a-b7719d187f52 .

camssa:21063950-4aed-4a6f-a7b3-527ae90d8d18 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Every new version of the specification goes through a defined process with open and public consultations. Request for comments are not restricted to the RDA members but are open to all."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42e41d61-342d-44ef-a01e-0faf65a315e7 .

