camssa:21207401-6ea6-42e7-ba74-c30d7ea7bf04 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Working Group in charge of developing the specification initially provides a light-weight maintenance plan  however, it is not a complete maintenance and support process. \r
Additionally, it is worth noting that the projects who adopted the specification, are planning to maintain the specification. For instance, the EOSC-pillar project  will contribute to the maintenance of the specification for 3 years (from July 2019 to June 2022). However, such contributions are not enough to consider that the maintenance of the specification is guaranteed over a long time period\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1a576d1-767d-4b0f-bb6e-5ec3450b10d3 .

