camssa:2134f3fa-12b7-4a3e-8916-9b2480a73e8a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"TOSCA fosters and simplifies digital exchange in network specific domains. It is the case of CELAR and Indigo-DataCloud projects, which aim to provide a contact point for European research centers to discover, access, use and reuse a wide range of resources for advanced data-driven activities.\r
\r
TOSCA reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html\r
\r
CELAR reference, 'Translational cancer detection pipeline over CELAR Application and Evaluation' document:\r
https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/317790/reporting\r
\r
Indigo-DataCloud reference:\r
https://www.indigo-datacloud.eu/#history\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5af6c919-8fa7-4fb1-bcbb-c64c83cfb4e0 .

camssa:21371378-fd77-4e1d-9be1-e167bb3e280c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Apart from the TOSCA Technical Committee, there is active participation from external open communities that creates open information and encourages the publication of such data on international platforms (e.g. Github, Confluence), including European platforms.\r
\r
TOSCA-Github reference:\r
https://github.com/oasis-open/tosca-community-contributions\r
\r
TOSCA-Confluence reference:\r
https://wiki.onap.org/display/DW/TOSCA+Task+Force'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3809046d-87fe-4c90-896d-51dff97f5650 .

camssa:213ac9bf-8a70-46c2-a769-0049351221ae a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Although the EN 303 645 specification is not a Harmonised European Standard (HEN) following Radio Equipment Directive (RED) specification (see J. Pandza's presentation on the ENISA Cybersecurity Standardisation Event, and HEN reference), the specification is a European Standard (see EN 303 645 reference).\r
\r
EN 303 645 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/303600_303699/303645/02.01.01_60/en_303645v020101p.pdf\r
\r
ENISA Cybersecurity Standardisation Event 2021, Jasper Pandza presentation:\r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/events/cybersecurity_standardisation_2021/std-2021-presentations\r
\r
HEN reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/harmonised-standards_en#:~:text=A%20harmonised%20standard%20is%20a%20European%20standard%20developed,the%20European%20Commission%20to%20one%20of%20these%20organisations.\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7606f77c-6c5a-4a44-827a-8ebd0a136576 .

