camssa:21787538-7096-48c6-8b8a-5281bdb63931 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The primary goal of the Open Archival Information System (OAIS) is to provide a reference model for digital preservation systems, not for modeling business processes. However, the OAIS reference model can be used as a framework for developing digital preservation strategies and workflows, which may include business processes.\r
\r
OAIS specification:\r
https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/650x0m2.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2e953c3b-c69b-4f81-836b-fd91df276e8b .

