        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specification is not related to the delivery of multilingual services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dc3b427e-a1a8-4ed6-9255-e2895404cf5f .

camssa:21b8eb1c-a3bd-4596-996c-23a3df832fd9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, HTTPS is  a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. HTTPS is therefore licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b9d7f3dd-ec47-4621-9c29-f283ac7737f5 .

camssa:21bbf408-e739-4dcd-b8be-f8f5b824683d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'JSON can be an integral part of the data layer within the digital service delivery channels, facilitating the exchange of structured information between different components or layers of a digital service delivery system.\r
\r
JSON specification:\r
https://www.ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-404_2nd_edition_december_2017.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:272735db-11d7-4804-a418-c881bc045431 .

camssa:21c0df72-503b-4aac-9011-0c8b719cf75e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OAIS reference model has been widely adopted by the digital preservation community worldwide, including in Europe, where it is used as a framework for digital preservation activities in many organizations. However, it is not a formal European standard, nor is it recognized as a standard by the European Union.\r
\r
OAIS specification:\r
https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/650x0m2.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41d16fbd-6705-4a55-8be8-cb7526d810bb .

camssa:21c4815c-f21c-4880-b0b9-6cccefa811c4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6184fb705cfed44856c7b9594b492926f7a63a128a5a2be7b896294d8c79838 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:21c5d444-ca54-4b3b-9346-ccdcdfa01079 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a60f86e868fe2bdcf0c5c47111455d1d5b59498172688e36f23a77baa347d916 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:21d2161b-175d-46bf-bce5-4625cc2d2c48 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 was developed to provide an international standard of assurance in the context of information \r
security and confidentiality that could enable accountants to issue a report for use by user organizations and \r
their (user) auditors on controls of outsourced services that have an impact on financial information. In this \r
context, these same consultants / auditors also offer recommendations to improve the control of the \r
confidentiality of these services, improving, for example, software applications such as SAP.\r
\r
SAP trust center:\r
https://www.sap.com/about/trust-center/certification-compliance/sap-application-management-services-soc-isae3402-audit-report-2020-h1.html\r
\r
ISAE 3402 reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c276ed36-8f35-4e24-a5de-874c11db032b .

camssa:21d2b427-aa33-4391-9718-7840f7010e40 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6fa642bc8eceff2b1d333dc1123748399264c028fde2fd78308f0a0209ae21b ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:21d3d054-232b-4c28-9575-8d2e2aedb654 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are documents that compare different audio formats that forms Ogg. From there, it can be assessed the efficiency and effectiveness of the usage of Ogg. \r
\r
Audio formats comparison:\r
https://stsaz.github.io/fmedia/audio-formats/\r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5d571db8-099d-4120-bd37-80db911e6587 .

camssa:21d3f9e3-9e6f-4ca8-a185-077261e0ee58 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification is a family of XML-based standards that provides an open, XML-based infrastructure that enables the interoperable use of electronic business information. In this sense, ebXML is independent of any platform because XML it is so. Therefore, ebXML is platform-agnostic.\r
\r
ebXML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d0ddd69-2fc7-486f-a2fd-e595d2851afa .

camssa:21e1b167-71bb-44e7-90c5-f3270c441932 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification does not provide specific provisions for such agreements, but the core of the OSI is based on the idea to facilitate the interconnection of systems/processes via multiple layers, therefore it is possible to reach interoperability agreements per each layer (specially on the top ones like representation).

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a69cf22-a8e5-4bfe-8179-900b5127841d .

