    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary is designed to be extensible by allowing the inclusion of terms from other vocabularies and through the creation of application profiles that can introduce new classes and properties.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
