camssa:22a46c2e-ab31-4bf2-bb02-f5bc5cb79eb7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary is associated to "Controlled Vocabulary", "Data", "Data Model", "Hash Code", "Linked Data", "Linked Open Data", "Metadata" and "Open Data" ABB under the Semantic view in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS).

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v610'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:444dccf8-cbfa-4153-bfa1-268eb3a0858a .

