        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WS-BPEL is available for its study and use at OASIS’s webpage. Therefore, it can be reused by the organisations, administrations, open communities, etc. that developed it.\r
\r
WS-BPEL OASIS reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/wsbpel/2.0/OS/wsbpel-v2.0-OS.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:957b00d2-8201-4541-ae0a-2cb919b3364f .

