        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of WAI-ARIA is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8e91f544-0f34-4761-afb8-c5a8921b14f2 .

