camssa:23f70d19-a31e-43c4-8b7f-90e9c4b71bf4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is not an explicit assessment of the effectiveness and efficiency of OWL2. However, in the following link, there is a comparison of the different OWL2 profiles. This document describes three profiles of OWL2, each of which achieves efficiency differently and is useful in different application scenarios. _x000D_\r
Also, there are studies not directly related to the OWL effectiveness or efficiency that include disclosures about the relevance of OWL for the effective representation of knowledge in different knowledge domains._x000D_\r
\r
OWL2 Profiles W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-profiles/\r
\r
Use of ontologies for the effective representation of Knowledge:\r
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2210832717300649"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7be8b64d-8cbc-4f52-a6d4-94e400d47898 .

