camssa:2439d7ad-3423-4885-b200-d7c0b5b3b9c9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "XAdES is part of the electronic signature stack of specifications, this group of specifications are aimed to ensure the availability and validation of signed data. Concquently, the implementation of eSignatures reduces the administratives burdens of the administration."@en ;
