        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Within the Roy Fielding dissertation of REST you can find a chapter that addresses the experience and lessons learned from applying REST.  The evaluation of effectiveness, as outlined in the dissertation, is based on the versatility and domain-agnostic nature of REST.   \r
\r
R. Fielding dissertation.  Chapter 6: experience and evaluation.\r
https://www.ics.uci.edu/~fielding/pubs/dissertation/evaluation.htm'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f35c885-e7df-4197-8e50-88d48e4a5fc8 .

