        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XSLT is a language for transforming XML documents, compliant with the European Directive and included to the ISA programme. It is available for its reuse to developed it.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b480726-2700-4209-8789-c96485962d84 .

camssa:249be3c7-86e7-4d75-92cf-19d2d955a0e5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "At the moment of performing the assessment, SAML 2.0 is widely used to secure and authenticate access to the internal and external platforms as eases the single sign-on (SSO). These types of resources are included in the development of platforms and services, including innovative solutions. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9af9b7cd-39f9-45a0-a147-791078275d33 .

