camssa:24bd7503-5158-42cc-9ea2-fe6c1ebe9d0f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EuroVoc ensures and enables data processing accuracy as its original purpose was to provide the information management and dissemination services with a coherent indexing tool for the effective management of documentary resources produced by EU institutions. Moreover, its standardized terms helps ensure consistent and clear information categorization, indirectly improving data accuracy.\r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:49bb065f-43c2-400e-89ef-f4c552e040b7 .

camssa:24bf2e7f-7771-48e2-aa4e-a87099600ed8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSS is currently being used by the EUR-Lex, the European gateway to EU Law for the presentation of the different types of documents that it includes. EUR-Lex is run by the Publications Office of the European Union with the aim to provide official and comprehensive access to EU legal documents. \r
\r
Presentation style sheets EU Vocabulary:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/presentation-style-sheets\r
\r
EUR-Lex:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/homepage.html?locale=en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2e9da714-2a3a-410a-96ba-e25f41afbc8a .

