camssa:25192fb7-77f0-43d6-867a-6ef5b43d66fa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ESPD is primarily designed for use in public procurement, nonetheless, its basic principles and approach\r
could potentially be adapted to support data collection and standardization in other domains as well.\r
However, any such adaptations would require careful consideration of the specific requirements and needs\r
of the domain in question.\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2dee9a32-9ed3-4353-bb8b-b3c42e151f39 .

camssa:2519667f-cbba-4d42-9662-e183b7652ff4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including this specification.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:18c6a793-5874-44a2-82d8-8fbdcb61e4c6 .

camssa:252031ca-bc96-4c56-b67b-41c8941bf07b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAS is included in the catalogues of Malta and The Netherlands.  The national interoperability framework of The Netherlands is fully alligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.  Malta, nonetheless, does not have a high performance, being aligned only with two sections of the EIF. \r
\r
National Catalogue of The Netherlands:\r
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden\r
\r
National Catalogue of Malta:\r
https://mccaa.org.mt/Section/Content?contentId=1243\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2021'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:59db3172-fff9-4772-8578-c75645b4ae2b .

camssa:25223922-3123-4825-a6d1-670f79451a55 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As a vocabulary to describe assets within a Repository, it provides concepts and properties identifying the content creators and other informative metadata such as dates involved in the release of the solutions described. These facts increase the reliability of the exchanged data. \r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9b183701-c17b-4df2-9353-fb38beefb876 .

camssa:25258dde-29f4-40f0-bc99-6df5468c0d8a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c8a79448e829e27f47318879de4899c3a6404aa66d7d8954e7a680cf6e5d1ca2 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:252bd5c3-e3cc-4895-88c7-bfc141dff49f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Web Services Description Language (WSDL) itself does not inherently include features or mechanisms for ensuring the protection of personal data managed by public administrations or any other entities. WSDL is primarily focused on describing the interfaces and operations of web services, providing a standardized way to define the contract between service providers and consumers.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a0748a08-6194-40da-82a5-1b2f04ed0979 .

camssa:2530498c-0d18-4419-9080-0ec83a75562a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-39e7870e79b2999a8b61c97f0c356312b88174320d6464fce5639e57ec0de011 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:25318e21-ffc4-45bd-9762-30cb9a27ae3c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Currently, JSON is a widely used specification for data interchange between applications and platforms. It is used in a REST API applications in order to ensure data exchange, this application is extensively used for the creation of solutions, including innovative ones.\r
\r
JSON API specification:\r
https://jsonapi.org/\r
\r
Best practices for REST API design:\r
https://stackoverflow.blog/2020/03/02/best-practices-for-rest-api-design/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edddcfa8-74d7-4b8b-ba82-fd8e7e295243 .

camssa:2536fa02-543f-4f7a-8759-6064f55badbb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTTPS is publicly available for implementation and use for free on IETF's webpage.\r
\r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0d6cf3fb-6a3f-4fee-ab5c-c274738934dd .

