        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 itself does not provide the restriction of access to information or data, since it focuses primarily on the physical and data link layers of Ethernet networks.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a874a60e-e942-4bf7-8d38-fb472701b4cd .

