        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of the specification is not related to the comprehensibility of administrative rules, data, services, and the decision-making process. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification.\r
\r
XACML OASIS reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/errata01/xacml-3.0-core-spec-errata01.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2c8fa105-a360-4fe9-8f99-69da12441553 .

