    cav:value "0" .

camssa:25aaa65e-9b5c-4073-a7fc-9f443152607d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP defines a standard message format, including properties and sections for structuring data. This supports interoperability when exchanging information with public administration services.

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:57a6be54-233b-4f0b-8d72-8253ecc1edea .

camssa:25ac04e0-3a73-49ca-8e02-1cc2f7afead5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of LDAP is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. 

LDAP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:54f5aa6a-a309-4010-9b0d-25d37a06cde4 .

camssa:25b32f4b-4d1f-4d22-97f6-a267cd77d39c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though SVG is supporting the first and second level of maturity from the Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for the Open data, it can be considered that could foster the publication of open data but not directly, as the SVG is compatible with XSL.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ec201af-5434-4c2b-94e3-4ab0b3a707a5 .

camssa:25b94633-7c9e-46db-8c25-bcd6a21c1311 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ESPD is designed to ensure the protection of personal data by complying with data protection regulations, providing transparent information to suppliers and their representatives, and requiring contracting authorities to implement appropriate measures to ensure the security and confidentiality of personal data.\r
\r
ESPD data protection:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/espd-seminar-2020/privacy-statement\r
\r
ESPD business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d23bd12f-326a-46e9-a9c9-726c930d16cc .

