camssa:267a432f-5b9a-47e0-a80b-8f66fc67c661 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Coherence of the technical specification is evidenced by the fact that there is no existing European standard or technical specifications being under consideration to become a European standard that has a similar area of application.  "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:24a3964b-dd7c-46b3-b47b-747ef85546d6 .

camssa:267d4726-f156-4574-9608-f13e9b402ef2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is not a European standard, and nor is yet a W3C standard (the SDO developing the specification).\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en\r
\r
EUOS repository of standards:\r
https://www.standict.eu/standards-repository\r
\r
CENELEC and CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CEN:105::RESET::::\r
\r
