camssa:277cb16f-7dae-4269-9559-eba41cebd2c8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG is used by 76.6% of all the websites as image extension. It is not only used over the Internet, PNG is commonly used to store images, so they can be visualized anytime. So it is demonstrated that PNG has enough market acceptance as image extension.\r
\r
Usage of image file formats broken down by ranking:\r
https://w3techs.com/technologies/cross/image_format/ranking"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8799d17c-83d4-4a24-b15b-9fb099074d02 .

