camssa:27830421-8c61-4dd6-bffb-791c25bfb9c5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSLT can be mapped to the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS) in the "Data Mapping", "Data Mapping Catalogue", "Metadata Catalogue" and "Software Components Catalogue" under the Semantic View.

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-
specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v610'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e09b10fb-1814-438c-87e5-bb92d590d093 .

