        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SAMM is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:475269fa-61e0-43a4-a8a6-342ec148e688 .

