camssa:27ea6e2b-ef47-4d9d-9571-39e78e38c978 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specifications is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

TSP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ca88e2a8-2b96-49b3-a703-4afd3c110ae4 .

camssa:27f1de84-0c5c-41e7-8f2a-b18a9a3660f7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) queries and shares data across different systems via REST interfaces. REST APIs may be platform-agnostic, without any dependency on the environment or programming language being used, and in this case the Asset Administration Shell (AAS )primarily exists to expose data in a platform agnostic manner so that .NET, Java, Php, Python, REST, etc clients can all access the data. So, the specification is platform-agnostic.

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a51d4592-51b5-4567-8c9d-0f8a09699d58 .

camssa:27f2457a-4daa-44db-b54f-5ce3a7cb3120 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de8b8040-30c8-4ba4-a3e8-26bec061cb8d .

camssa:27f90e19-5d46-45be-9049-8f3674d2b9f4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is to facilitate the exchange of structured event data. By allowing to make the data available to other persons or organisations, this specification reduces the administrative burden and 
enables digital service delivery channels.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37595d65-55ab-4be9-b464-9db853b1f253 .

camssa:27ffa3f0-b327-4c38-aa8e-b6f2224db0c4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-583a0f52df591048a41be40620830a70260e77855364174d91ba159970d8488e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:28077ff3-c0f6-4374-8926-d16916f20b05 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """JSON is available for free at the European Collaborative Platform Joinup. \r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/json-rfc7159-javascript-object-notation-json/distribution/json-rfc7159-javascript-object-notation-json"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ff4cecf-dc64-440a-b8ee-e343fbefb393 .

