        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPsec is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to 
the specification.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:49151991-6b2c-4963-ae0e-960fd3574a04 .

camssa:2857830a-83c8-4b8b-9438-b86e4c4b7a53 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of CPOV is not related to the restriction of access to information/data. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bcefe0fa-7f7b-4fc5-8bc0-ea1650c902ea .

