camssa:287fa4a0-6deb-4586-a290-e1e16051d6c4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no Member State that includes Xforms 2.0 in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aca47e4e-2f78-4796-ae40-08168624b38d .

