        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS 1.3 specification offers robust tools for establishing the authenticity and performing the authentication of the agents involved in data transactions, with server authentication being a fundamental requirement and client authentication being a configurable option.

TLS 1.3 Handshake Protocol Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html#section-4'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1269e496-f257-4c5d-9f97-b1c70bc3b32c .

