camssa:293b4bde-2c9d-4517-bc38-f7796e315dcc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification is supported by ISO. In order to participate in creating standards, the user must be part of their national standards body (assuming their country is part of ISO). On the other hands, other groups that also support cloud computing standardisation include the Object Management Group (OMG).\r
\r
OMG: https://www.omg.org/cloud/deliverables/interoperability-and-portability-for-cloud-computing-a-guide.htm\r
\r
ISO Technical committees: https://www.iso.org/get-involved.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:77b6ee5a-9144-4f44-b411-00ea94ebc2ea .

