camssa:29749e2b-adbd-4014-ba97-7f1fc66d9a34 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although the specification cannot be found in any repository of standards at the European level, ebXML is mentioned in the "Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2022/2519 of 20 December 2022 on the technical specifications and standards for the e-CODEX system, including for security and methods for integrity and authenticity verification" as a specification to improve the security and privacy of data.

"Commission implementing decision (EU) 2022/2519 of 20 December 2022 on the technical specifications and standards for the e-CODEX system, including for security and methods for integrity and authenticity verification" document:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/ES/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32014D0771&qid=1743495780482

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b39e79e3-aa0d-4da0-ad06-b5801c86dfc3 .

camssa:2974db35-348f-46ed-9dc8-44a04ff64087 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPsec protocol, which is included in the IPv6 protocol, can help securely transfer data to ensure data accuracy. IPv6 specification can help accurately exchange information between public administrations or between public administrations and citizens. IPv6 supports authentication methods, verifying that the data received by the receiver from the sender is exactly what the sender sent and only came through the sender and not from a third party. In addition, IPv6 can encrypt the message at network layer even if the protocols of application layer at user level does not encrypt the message. These implementations can be useful to guarantee data processing accuracy.

Redhat IPsec protocol:
https://www.redhat.com/en/blog/ipv6-packets-and-ipsec

IPv6 encryption and authentication:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/internet-protocol-version-6-ipv6/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80a7b46e-5067-47cb-b5f0-0f041a7ddff2 .

camssa:29786074-47e4-4316-9479-f46471c13acb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "All of the RDA specifications are openly available and free of charge."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15aaceee-43c9-4bd2-b3b7-7712dae20857 .

camssa:2978803c-d8fd-428d-b976-64392089e16e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP was created in 1993 and quickly became one of the foundational authentication protocols used by IT \r
network. The fact that in 1998, OpenLDAP 1.0 was implemented as an open source version of LDAP made it \r
very popular. Therefore, it is demonstrated that LDAP has enough maturity for its use in the development of \r
digital solutions and services.\r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511\r
\r
OpenLDAP:\r
https://www.openldap.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b9b08c9c-946a-4992-893a-8d2598a653af .

