camssa:2996e3b0-35da-46dd-8f66-281db175b667 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Core Location Vocabulary is not related to provide an access control mechanism. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to the specification.

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
