camssa:2af8a9e4-5cb1-49d9-a46d-b3a2f2b7800a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GraphQL processes all data requests but only extensions (GraphQL-JS) or third APIs could be asked to resolve a response over an access control mechanism.\r
\r
GraphQL specification:\r
https://graphql.org/learn/schema/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:331ca596-5bbf-46ae-abe4-4235a643f6d2 .

camssa:2afdb135-62de-4bf1-ada7-a295005671c0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'At the moment of performing the assessment, UTF-8 is widely adopted in environments developing and implementing ICT solutions including innovative solutions. \r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3629\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:313534bf-f686-482a-960d-3bd341052d3c .

camssa:2afe87f1-c932-434a-96e9-b7dee64c243f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-1624157830122d60825aa5aa88ab70d0b140b2e7e510086699f9a9773efef6bd ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:2afed395-c5b6-48ad-bf00-c8b508bd148f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though the specification is related to the use and publication of metadata, it is not directly related to the publication of open data. The relation with metadata and its publication is focused on the availability and discoverability of access points and different parties for the exchange of data. \r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009\r
\r
Five star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a0d308b3-a33e-47e4-911c-2ac7ff7655e2 .

camssa:2affbe13-cb2b-4577-893a-113266841a36 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-624bc49501d58649e27cae4fb89fb5a56844685e54c5ce1625633894f8f752e1 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:2b02545a-6302-445e-b9ea-ce5f02fcfbb0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"DQV enables the representation of information about the quality of a set using the “Multilingual importing” quality metric. This metric applies to linksets between datasets that include SKOS concepts. It considers the concepts that have been matched and quantifies the information gain the links provide if one adds the preferred labels or the alternative labels of the concepts from the object dataset to the descriptions of the concepts from the subject dataset. Therfore, DQV supports multilingual metadata, using RDF's language tags to provide labels and descriptions in various languages.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/#ExpressQualLinkset\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6e4be6de-4bf1-4f08-9443-e93a3218518a .

camssa:2b092ab3-96a4-46b1-95c5-8c4c3b75e6d8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:2b0ad2ad-d20b-4af0-a080-1a586ceb960d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As an encoding specification it is being highly used by public administrations in order to encode data and services.  \r
An example of its use is ESCO, the vocabulary generated regarding the standardisation of the skills, competences, qualifications, and occupations at European level. \r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/esco/api/doc/esco_api_doc.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15c01ae7-7a8f-4938-a70c-670d989afb1e .

camssa:2b0ae1b0-d5cd-4975-a0f2-e7aab1e32adf a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:2b0fef35-0152-4538-abc4-75cd97cd61ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are clear guidelines for customisation and extensions for the specification.\r
\r
http://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2015-03-25/GLTFTA-REC-2015-03-25.html#section-how-to-create-extensions-within-the-gl-taxonomy-framework'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:688723d8-b58c-4214-838e-9af0a5b9e7b7 .

camssa:2b108ca8-d689-47e9-8dad-b91fd0ace1ec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OWL2 is based on elements of RDF and it adds more vocabulary for describing properties and classes. RDF is one of the proposed standards for the publication of data as Linked Open Data.\r
OWL2 and RDF are highly aligned with the principles for Linked Data promoted by W3C and Tim Berners-Lee.\r
\r
OWL2 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-overview/\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:98fa2bdb-eb53-4283-89e8-6a78eb286cf3 .

camssa:2b1181ff-72f0-424f-a5bf-19e560b9a5ef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of GraphQL is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
GraphQL specification:\r
https://spec.graphql.org/October2021/#sec-Overview'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:75bbbf15-b3da-443e-94bb-c2adc5b5e760 .

camssa:2b12fb38-7dbe-4d49-8299-20e041c4c357 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox has the support of the European Commission which is endorsed by the member states. The tool set is updated and distributed by the Commission for its use on the EU institutions and other stakeholders.
On the Report produced by the European Parliamentary Research Service multiple institutions in the UE have provided valuable feedback regarding the Better Regulation Framework, institutions such as the European Committee of the Regions called for a better representation of local and regional perspectives throughout the policy cycle. 

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

European Parliamentary Research Service briefing
https://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/BRIE/2022/699463/EPRS_BRI(2022)699463_EN.pdf

European Comission webpage:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3559ba8c-0e79-44b6-ae8d-928a47795330 .

