camssa:2b1ebd1b-65dc-404e-ae7f-346efdfae16c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTTPS is an internet protocol for the data exchange over an Internet network. It supports the first level of maturity defined in the Tim Berners-Lee´s  5 stars Open Data deployment scheme, "Make your data accessible on the web". \r
\r
See: \r
https://5stardata.info/en/ """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b432bf9-2024-4259-ae3c-1f5bb93f5c60 .

camssa:2b1f1c15-c298-4293-9900-6a135defbde0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:2b1fd547-6f95-4b77-ac95-ffc75ac8af10 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the forth star corresponds to represent data with URIs. OData follows REST principles, and as a consequence this specification supports the publication of data as open data. \r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
\r
Odata reference, section 2 Overview:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/errata03/os/complete/part1-protocol/odata-v4.0-errata03-os-part1-protocol-complete.html#_Toc453752201\r
\r
REST reference, 'What is a resource?' section:\r
https://restfulapi.net/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:395298be-e41d-44a3-8217-33cece9a02fd .

camssa:2b21454e-8448-4f1d-8e00-b985c68171ba a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "60" .

