        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of NUTS is not related to the visibility of administrative procedures, rules data and services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, History of NUTS section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/history'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39e6f98e-9b3e-40a6-bc45-4c89c55c7139 .

