        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of TIFF/IT is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
TIFF/IT ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/34342.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de06981f-72c9-4250-a7be-7815f5fbf66c .

