        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OASIS has defined a clear Technical Committee (hereby TC) process where all the stakeholders involved has the opportunity to participate in the development of the specification being formulated. \r
All the information related to a TC activity is hosted and can be consulted. \r
See: \r
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/tc-process-2017-05-26"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f2bcd4a8-9080-4814-bffd-1d65d1766a71 .

