camssa:2b9a19aa-1235-417e-83cc-fbb638afdcf8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP can indirectly support the modeling of business processes by providing a framework for managing and preserving the digital information associated with those processes. By utilizing the CSIP guidelines alongside business process modeling approaches, organizations can ensure that the digital information packages are aligned with the modeled business processes, enabling a more comprehensive representation of the end-to-end process.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6c649213-b95e-4e2a-96d3-a6822db1aa78 .

camssa:2ba28dc5-a9d8-43e9-abbd-68419dd94c1c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licences granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including CSS v2.1.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e286537f-ae88-40ef-9469-92152331af24 .

camssa:2ba34e50-1c47-4155-b4c3-4123d121a0d1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-4ac14cafe608f1dbe7e48f96edd7574c55f0aac2c2e99ede0418dae7225977af ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:2ba9b2d7-8c5a-48d4-9ec7-23262f406b00 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has not been found any community sharing their data and results on national platforms. However, ETSI TS 119 512 indirectly encourages the creation of communities on national platforms through ETSI membership and directives.

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:86229e25-bd6d-4866-afd1-6ef13f4939e0 .

camssa:2bab332b-2c5e-47dc-a144-5dc464c0ecf5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is domain agnostic, it is made to describe software independently from the domain of the solution. The Publiccode.yaml provide a basic but useful metadata schema that makes easy to describe solutions.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:48182183-25c6-4cae-adc7-f99bd5cfe12f .

camssa:2babb2bc-a79e-4f5d-aea1-e40ce19f8594 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While XHTML was once the recommended standard for web development, it has been largely replaced by
HTML5, which offers significant improvements in flexibility, functionality, and user experience. In fact,
HTML5 is now the dominant web standard for creating digital services.

XHTML W3C reference
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:375d128e-9bcf-4b5c-b68f-819b309d6029 .

