        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP specification is included in the StandICT European catalogue of standards.

StandICT Catalog Reference:
https://standict.eu/standards-repository/standard/advanced-message-queueing-protocol-amqp-v10'"""@en ;
