camssa:2c364b5c-5cac-4c92-a336-c9ba9aee45ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GITB TDL promotes an environment for the adoption and implementation of e-business standards and specifications. Therefore GITB TDL impacts positively in the creation or adoption of organisational interoperability agreements. GITB TDL promotes the adoption of common validation syntax within multiple services testbed APIS (e.g. ESPD and AS4 messaging)\r
\r
GITB reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/_downloads/0dc573d06adafa1a273edd793577016d/CEN_WS_GITB3_CWA_Final.pdf\r
\r
GITB TDL examples:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/examples/index.html#examples'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ac82f616-cf21-4381-9a0f-e2783b8f6cd5 .

