camssa:2c5f9f27-e9c4-4385-a697-80780c7127f9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"IEEE Std 802.3-2022 effectiveness is evaluated through industry feedback, testing, research, adoption, and ongoing updates. It's being tested in IEEE projects to ensure it meets requirements. The standard's adaptability allows the working group to address evolving needs. As a result, numerous new projects are currently being developed to leverage its capabilities.

IEEE Working Group Projects:
https://www.ieee802.org/3/

IEEE Working Group Details:
https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/802.3/10422/

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:965a2fde-c057-494a-a9d1-19122b2d84ec .

