camssa:2cccb40e-6454-4b61-89ca-2ed978c16398 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Given that EuroVoc is a multidisciplinary thesaurus that contains keywords organized in 21 domains and 127 \r
subdomains, it is possible to partially implement them depending on the user's needs. Its modular structure enables users to adopt specific segments or categories that align with their needs or systems without the need of incorporation of the entire thesaurus.\r
\r
EuroVoc Browser:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/browse/eurovoc.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:94041b78-de99-4bf2-b327-c64fe07ebe21 .

camssa:2cd00359-cba0-4c0e-94f9-63ffb3fb5d7f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 does not explicitly enable data portability but does contribute to the expanding the sharing of data among public administrations at national and European level. It is the case of the INSPIRE (Infrastructure for Spatial Information in the European Community) project which makes use of ISO 3166-1 to ensure the maintenance of spatial data sets and corresponding data services in the EU (see INSPIRE Legislation reference, Directive 2007/2/EC document, Article 14).\r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html \r
\r
