camssa:2d20d50c-7445-41ce-a7a7-1f282a93bb66 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes EN 16234-1 e-CF in their national catalogue with its National Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories: 1. Conceptual model for integrated public services provision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c3799ea7-40ba-4e9a-a3ce-c7874c020094 .

camssa:2d25cbff-6761-4124-87f4-4f4159e1adfa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Schema.org does not rely on other specifications, except for derivative projects such as Microdata, which leverages support from other specifications to extend its functionality. However, the specification can be considered technology-agnostic.\r
\r
Schema.org reference, Getting started with schema.org using Microdata section:\r
https://schema.org/docs/gs.html\r
\r
Schema.org-W3 Github reference, 'Improving schemas' section:\r
https://github.com/schemaorg/schemaorg/blob/main/README.md\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:25a2e7f2-e24e-4793-a79d-4a2ef955fa8b .

