camssa:2d33e929-b27b-4ca4-a8f0-6c2d73f1f8f6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of LegalDocML within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
