\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5e7a4c7f-357f-49ff-a5fb-f018b72e6ddc .

camssa:2d43f514-6cf4-429b-b532-7d48a1614dba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry is designed to be highly extensible. This extensibility allows developers to add custom functionality, integrate with various tools and systems, and adapt the observability framework to meet specific needs. Developers can create custom spans and add attributes to capture detailed information about specific operations or transactions within their applications.

OpenTelemetry: https://opentelemetry.netlify.app/docs/specs/otel/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b422321-4d45-47e5-9b9d-9d67f8577e87 .

