camssa:2dc30616-7dd3-4ddf-ab51-9837dc048ef4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI has provided a conformance testing tool for electronic signatures according to the European Commission Mandate 460. The conformity testing tool involves different standards applied in the development of eSignatures, including PAdES, CAdES, XAdES, and ASiC. \r
\r
See:\r
https://signatures-conformance-checker.etsi.org/pub/PAdESConformanceTestChecker_v1.0.pdf\r
https://signatures-conformance-checker.etsi.org/pub/index.shtml"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bac4fe88-ad64-44b9-a49d-6b330d38aaab .

