camssa:2e0807da-7e05-4dfb-b8d3-4d6571054931 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'One of the main purposes of YAML is to establish a common language that facilitates the exchange of data between organizations. Although YAML can contribute to improve the exchange of data, it is not adressed to guarantee security in this exchange. Despite this, YAML together with other specifications and applications can improve the security in data exchange.

YAML specification:
https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/#11-goals'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:33fdd645-0aad-4497-acf3-f0d4b7572294 .

