        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSS v2.1 is publicly available for implementation and use for free on W3C's webpage. Therefore, it can be reused by the organizations, administrations, open communities, etc. that developed it.\r
\r
CSS v2.1 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2011/REC-CSS2-20110607/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7976204e-d874-47f7-b8ad-e572e79128b0 .

