    cav:judgement """'XSLT includes features that allow extension by implementers or users, designed to maintain interoperability (see Section 3.2).

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/#extension-attributes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4f250b7-8508-4039-9c1c-12298a26d9ef .

