        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including SOAP 1.2.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7db3b64f-89b7-40d5-917e-8f6f91c2f97f .

camssa:2e3261c4-89e3-415f-9573-0c7ad34d4ed1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SHACL can significantly contribute to policy-based access control systems by defining rules that determine whether access to certain data should be granted or denied. By establishing these rules, SHACL indirectly helps protect information against unauthorised changes. 

"SHACL-ACL: Access Control with SHACL" study:
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-43458-7_4

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:857f9b8f-f3bc-4572-9483-b7e35f881bec .

camssa:2e32bbc2-63fc-40da-8927-1162e34e8e33 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, DNS has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision.\r
\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:acc5c578-4467-4f59-b987-86f928304808 .

camssa:2e3b92a1-d09f-427d-8642-26edc2fc4462 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of EuroVoc is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
EuroVoc webpage:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/eurovoc"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:74ef1047-b0d3-4482-ab99-9687018604c7 .

