        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s Intellectual Property Rights Policy is based on Standard Essential Patents (SEP). The policy implemented by the standardisation organisation seeks to reduce risks and ensures that the standards are available under (F) RAND basis and Royalty-free, meaning that there are free of charge. \r
\r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights"""@en ;
