        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though it is a very recent standard produced in 2019, it has a strong community supporting it with a clear process of development. However, there are not relevant implementations supporting a wide market acceptance of the specification at the moment of performing the assessment. \r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6f7927cc-8ee0-443b-9d2b-68758461051a .

