camssa:2fad43d0-179a-4979-86e9-c8f2ea46cfcd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, there is no Member State that includes XACML in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\r
\r
National Interoperability Framework Observatory:  \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:08faf703-321e-4f92-9183-be5cf95bb152 .

