camssa:2fb50000-71c3-4be8-a025-04f0f54a0ca1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While MIME itself is not a comprehensive solution for e-accessibility, it can be part of a broader strategy to create digital content and services that are inclusive and accessible to a wide range of users, including those with disabilities. \r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c226c1f3-7634-4026-8df9-e9bcfdc49775 .

camssa:2fb7011c-0d0a-42de-ba49-0cda5db5d82c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:2fb987a2-54df-484a-8e25-47e3414ef139 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The rules on European standardisation allow the European Commission to identify information and communication technology (ICT) technical specifications - that are not national, European or international standards - to be eligible for referencing in public procurement. This allows public authorities to make use of the full range of specifications when buying IT hardware, software and services, allowing for more competition in the field and reducing the risk of lock-in to proprietary systems.  After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, RDF has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision. During the evaluation process, all the Member States are invited to share their doubts. The positive evaluation of RDF and its identification is considered an interoperability agreement.\r
\r
Regulation on standardisation 1025/2012:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a3f86daf-91bd-40ba-90b4-a06c6af40d94 .

camssa:2fc73dfe-22ca-4672-9bf5-0883e83402f1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, FTPS is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. FTPS is therefore licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on the FTPS specification (RFC 4217).\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d8e74d5b-7eb1-41fc-b31f-ecbd8818dccf .

camssa:2fc7c62e-a84b-4dae-8efe-e22560952581 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is mentioned in "Metadata Quality Assessment Methodology" from "data.europa.eu". The Metadata Quality Assessment (MQA) measures the quality of various indicators, and the results of the checks are stored as Data Quality Vocabulary (DQV).

"Metadata Quality Assessment Methodology" reference:
https://data.europa.eu/mqa/methodology?locale=en

World Wide Web Consortium (W3C) reference:
https://www.w3.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:43b900b5-a642-4d3d-873b-7a351ec8feb4 .

camssa:2fcc9183-a422-4d78-b3db-39988406c6b5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WS-Security is available for its study and use at OASIS’s webpage. Therefore it can be reused by the organisations, administrations, open communities, etc. that developed it.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=WS-Security"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1f2cd804-766c-400e-9e41-2997ba78a0fe .

camssa:2fd757f0-ac7a-43c6-ad4e-92086b3e91d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'One of the goals of YAML is to ensure portability between programming languages. Its specification facilitates data exchange between organizations, promoting interoperability. This makes YAML ideal for implementing digital services, supporting the principle of digital-first by enabling seamless integration and efficient communication across various platforms and systems.

YAML specification:
https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c687699f-3d26-4deb-a7ba-0b12f268bef4 .

camssa:2fdf1943-ba0c-4e73-bf9f-e513154722e8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9420538a5a92af199b492414dd056ab7134e456f005895261b1a5b15a3f2814e ;
