camssa:2fe636f6-0596-4fc1-aa43-e83d519ff5f0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WAI-ARIA was conceived for assistive web technologies. Since this specification complements both HTML and SVG2, it can be implemented in any domain where one of these two other specifications coexist with. A good example is the Mozilla developer community, which has implemented this specification for HTML4 and HTML5, along with the functional specificities that characterise both implementations.\r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/\r
\r
Mozilla reference, ARIA section:\r
https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility/ARIA'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0f9b95d2-851c-4a12-be62-b0ffcfbfe499 .

camssa:2fec17ba-2c44-4387-bcbd-6c54bc36cc9f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including XML 1.1.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bc7f51af-6eb4-4ce8-b264-bbd21718b354 .

camssa:2fef64d4-7559-4a81-b037-d5214e6bf0b8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS is included in the national catalogues of recommended specifications for Cyprus, France, Germany, Greece, Malta, the Netherlands, Norway, and Spain. The National Interoperability Frameworks (NIF) of France and the Netherlands are aligned with at least three out of four scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring, according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.

France National Catalogue of Standards (Referentiel General Interoperabilite) Reference:
https://www.numerique.gouv.fr/uploads/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf

Netherlands National Catalogue of Standards TLS Reference:
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/tls

CAMSS list of standards:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-andspecifications-camss/camss-list-standards

NIFO factsheets:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2024'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f5fa30da-7622-4ebf-87af-c2ec565f371c .

