camssa:2ffb131e-6b6e-4bf3-9086-c0ab7366680e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The European Commission eArchiving community holds many events on which they discuss and promote the use of the eArchiving model. Among some of the standards this community shares their knowledge about their implementation results we can find the E-ARK specifications.\r
\r
eArchiving community:\r
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/activities/earchiving-community\r
\r
eArchiving latest news:\r
