camssa:300f315d-8412-4198-9a8d-8a55b4c23cee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is focused on providing guidelines, recommendations and mechanisms for the proper development of public policies and laws. Within the recommendations and mechanisms, there are no implications for long-term preservation or e-archiving. Therefore, it can be said that this is not the purpose of the specification and this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6da6e12e-07f0-413f-bb06-733d80f63795 .

