    cav:judgement """The adoption of this Core Vocabulary as data model does not hamper the scalability of systems. \r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1386305b-6263-4c49-a782-60e5b7813de8 .

