\r
XAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101900_101999/101903/01.04.02_60/ts_101903v010402p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a67e74ec-eecf-42c4-bf80-5f98bdc57c51 .

camssa:30bf445a-14f5-46b5-827c-8d8c2e92974b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification defines a flexible model, vocabulary and encoding mechanism for the representation of statements regarding de usage of datasets, services or other digital content. These mechanisms are reusable, extensible allowing their implementation independently of the business domain. \r
\r
Moreover, the Working Group in charge of its development has the aim to promote ODRL V2.2 to existing and new sectors/industries.\r
\r
W3C ODRL Community:\r
https://github.com/w3c/odrl"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b8ed0f84-2ca5-4911-bd2f-20af1e33707b .

