camssa:31614041-4729-40c4-8ab1-5e75848cb0d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Data processing accuracy  in RDF can be ensured using a variety of techniques, such as data validation, error checking, and data quality assessment. These techniques can be integrated with RDF data processing workflows to ensure that the data being processed is accurate and meets specific quality standards. \r
\r
ABECTO: Assessing Accuracy and Completeness of RDF Knowledge Graphs:\r
https://www.semantic-web-journal.net/content/abecto-assessing-accuracy-and-completeness-rdf-knowledge-graphs\r
\r
RDF primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e57139a5-d96f-4a2a-865d-4f9913f02633 .

