        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has not been found any platform to test conformance to ETSI TS 119 512. Nonetheless, the specification lists a set of requirements needed to comply with in order to be conformant can be checked manually wether or not applied. 

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8c55d9d8-baca-416e-9ab4-f634be560ef3 .

