camssa:32a78529-8f97-44b4-8344-aa3a90b7a16f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of TSP is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable specification. 

TSP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:217a3eb5-7b01-4ca4-941c-3c8bdef6c19e .

camssa:32a8b06f-db48-4961-be7b-423019bb1aeb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XFDL specification is a high-level, XML-based language. In this context, the XML entities allows to store information to reuse it again and again by referring to it, avoiding writing that information multiple times.

XML reuse of information reference:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dtd-entities/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bc65e5bb-cb9f-4753-9b64-c4d01c0be759 .

