camssa:3328c0e4-bcc2-4ecd-a431-50b7e8006aab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are different documentation and information that takes into account EuroVoc as part of the narrative and includes it as valuable. An example of a use case is for the Italian Chamber of Deputies. In here, the use case was presented in a EuroVoc conference to show the result and the effectiveness of using EuroVoc as the basis for the semi-automatic classification of documents.\r
\r
Eurovoc and parliamentary documents: A semi-automatic classification experience at the Italian Chamber of \r
Deputies:\r
https://expertsystem.com/expert-systems-cogito-semantic-platform-to-be-featured-at-eurovoc-conference'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a56e7959-cbe6-475a-aabf-2732ba76d2b7 .

