        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The European Space Agency is implementing ISO/IEC 27001 to ensure its data is protected and properly managed to reduce ISMS risks.\r
\r
European Space Agency case study:\r
https://publicsectorassurance.org/case-study/european-space-agency-uses-iso-27001-to-protect-its-data/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46f76c01-f3eb-497e-9820-45016f5b503c .

