        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of this document is not related to the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fa56b63b-3656-444e-96f6-e792d6fd6500 .

camssa:33438dad-8c87-4972-bcfb-58af682e98a3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """" While SAREF's scope is not explicitly directed towards administrative procedures, rules data, and services, the use of ontologies in general, including SAREF, can contribute to certain aspects of visibility in administrative procedures and related domains if they happen to describe smart appliances.

SAREF: 
https://saref.etsi.org/core/v3.1.1/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8bc2350-3ebb-4269-846d-cbb63efaf08e .

camssa:33452858-fe34-4729-89f2-44c527d163c6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """7 Member States are recommending UDDI in their ICT National Catalogues. \r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ce15aba5-b37c-4d53-b389-54e32af691c4 .

camssa:334c1593-2c0a-499e-92f7-c69a611c3f57 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Although the specification defines a set of principles to help implementers to be consistent, and even tools for this purpose, there are no conformity test or certifications that allow users to check the level of compliance with the requirements established."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:67603478-ab36-40c0-a557-b0135fe175e3 .

camssa:334c1cb3-fac6-4143-9537-93890cc0232d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xiph.Org Foundation is a non-profit corporation dedicated to protecting the foundations of Internet multimedia from control by private interests. Their main purpose is to support and develop free, open protocols and software to serve the public, developer, and business markets.\r
All stakeholders can contribute in the development of their specifications.\r
\r
XIPH contribution:\r
https://wiki.xiph.org/How_to_help"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b9e82c2b-3c0d-4613-bb5a-b377ba22a511 .

camssa:334d21b8-4294-42c7-abce-8fc7bb849a12 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:334ecea2-6eb8-4cb3-8d33-e08c74aefdca a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TIFF/IT is one of the safest image file types available. The most important security benefit is the transparent data of every TIFF image file. This fact makes possible to evaluate the information about the photo before opening and it prevents the chance of a virus hiding in the file. So the specification makes data exchange between citizens and public administrations secure and trustworthy.\r
\r
TIFF/IT ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/34342.html\r
\r
TIFF Image file explanation:\r
https://www.canto.com/blog/tiff-image-file/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:87001b74-4763-479b-a2ba-7d9a17207e5c .

camssa:33561830-e49b-4e95-888a-4663a47377c2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has provided a validator which allows testing and validate web documents including web documents in HTML.\r
\r
W3C validator:\r
https://validator.w3.org/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:adc879e2-701d-4956-894c-0512bba61d9c .

camssa:33611ad6-a778-43eb-b8f7-35446de0b240 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While Verifiable Credentials themselves do not guarantee long-term preservation, their use within a broader framework of standards and data archiving best practices can contribute to the sustainability and preservation of electronic records and information.\r
\r
Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5c1786b6-138f-40fa-bfcc-0f547de29674 .

camssa:3363b988-f5b4-4d93-8d95-7bb725818618 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"All major and minor releases foresee a public review during which collected feedback is publicly visible through Dataspace Protocol's GitHub, accesible to any user. The current version of the specification (2024-1) is the release candidate and considered to be stable. Further changes shall not affect conformity. The Dataspace Protocol is being constantly reviewed and improved thanks to the input of its users, who are invited to provide feedback as Issue in their GitHub repository.

IDSA Dataspace Protocol Specification: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme

IDSA Open Source: https://internationaldataspaces.org/make/open-source/

Dataspace Protocol GitHub Issues: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/ids-specification/issues\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:707074e1-b620-4089-834c-208cf49761f4 .

camssa:3368030d-e2dc-45be-ba2e-1f0e6dd2d7ea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI is a European standards development organisation, and as such, all the specifications developed within the organisation are available and can be accessed through its website repository.

ETSI standards repository:
https://www.etsi.org/standards#page=1&search=ETSI%20TS%20319%20422&title=1&etsiNumber=1&content=1&version=0&onApproval=1&published=1&withdrawn=1&historical=1&isCurrent=1&superseded=1&startDate=1988-01-15&endDate=2022-07-25&harmonized=0&keyword=&TB=&stdType=&frequency=&mandate=&collection=&sort=1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4316c17a-3460-4607-8e80-95378e290048 .

camssa:336c18e8-93a8-4153-ad37-318805493df7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OCSP defines a protocol useful in determining the current status of a digital certificate without requiring\r
CRLs. Therefore, it does not explicitly enable the delivery of any service, but can implicitly reduce the\r
administrative burden.\r
\r
OCSP reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2560'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c026da4-819a-4904-86ef-9df3155f5c2d .

