        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The specification is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1e2710e6-8341-4543-b945-791055142803 .

camssa:33aa0ea7-7719-485f-b1ff-dbc473437f6c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of SAML 2.0 is not related to the availability of interfaces. The specifications aim to authenticate and authorise access to resources or services. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b5f1a138-c65e-4591-ad60-903b292e2892 .

