        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 may help easing the creation and formalisation of Interoperability agreements; for example, the Reference And Management Of Nomenclatures (RAMON) is a self-declared organisational interoperability agreement which integrates ISO 3166-1 along with other international specifications.\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, RAMON data server:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/ramon/nomenclatures/index.cfm?TargetUrl=LST_CLS_DLD&StrNom=CL_GEO&StrLanguageCode=EN&msclkid=5b294654b00e11ecb0cfbc45e6ce9d20'"""@en ;
