camssa:33d7fac0-d103-41e4-8ceb-78eb90b6d36c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary has a good market acceptance. Some parts of this vocabulary have been used to develop European solutions, for example, ESPD-EDM (European Single Procurement Document - Exchange Data Model) which is the technical representation of the legal European Single Procurement Document. It is used to support interoperability between ESPD services provided all over Europe. Additionally, other projects/initiatives like The Once-Only Principle (TOOP), and the eCertis are based on the CCCEV.\r
\r
ESPD documentation:\r
https://docs.peppol.eu/pracc/espd/edm/\r
\r
Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary\r
\r
TOOP:\r
http://wiki.ds.unipi.gr/display/TOOP/Core+Vocabularies+and+Application+Profiles\r
\r
eCertis:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/tools/ecertis/#/about """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a2fa461-f18c-43af-b71b-c1ed03061094 .

camssa:33dbd7b5-1fe6-443c-8066-579d3fc26723 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b122f4f42ca2089ee158a31d932d6a0332aa3a4d04acce1e2e7aa140815a0ec ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:33f3ae31-0e9b-4d42-8f77-0b0adb877a40 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """This Core Vocabulary offers several services that aim to help e-Government professionals share their experience, and reuse data and services across borders. Specifically, the RegOrg vocabulary was used in the Business Registries Interconnection System (BRIS), which is aimed to facilitate the distribution of information from each of the Member States’ business registers to the registers of other Member States in a standard message format and in the relevant language version. \r
\r
JoinUp Webpage:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/\r
\r
Core Vocabularies in action:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/news/attachment/eu_core_vocabularies_in_action_using_core_business_vocabulary_in_the_eu_.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:676d7213-046a-43bc-a305-af8d7c57340c .

camssa:33f4d806-b900-4e69-a6ef-aa6c178066f1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-812668363d8f0cc562041fae6c588e1555372bf0bf5c16835be996dd72070013 ;
    cav:value "100" .

