camssa:3461dddc-66db-4d15-a30a-6c31e533ea5d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As a protocol for data exchange, HTTPS allows the exchange of information with interfaces of public administration systems."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a9746ddc-d8b1-4fe3-9e8f-fe0a60cf34db .

camssa:3467cd4b-8958-4256-a1b6-186a575816e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """According to the 5-star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, Ogg does not support the main principles for the publication of data as Linked Open Data.\r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:77adecfb-a51d-4c0c-930c-6241aeae49e1 .

camssa:3469549b-0e5c-4deb-9d3a-2ed0619250f4 a cav:Score,
