camssa:349fc237-22eb-4c93-a7b5-1dd8c2dbd03e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "XSD is a business domain agnostic specification that can be used at any business domain. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cefedb59-82ab-454c-a3c0-82fe65b5734b .

camssa:34a00f1a-c45d-4c7a-8346-fd19e242c84b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of the WAI-ARIA relies on specifications, such as HTML, and also on specialised APIs developed by some operating systems, such as the Microsoft Active Accessibility API. Dependence on these Accessibility APIs is a sign of platform dependence.\r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference, section 1.1:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b8ccdf30-2fe8-4330-a3a3-a0b6d4f3e675 .

camssa:34a05a67-beb1-4187-9483-e704193cf930 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is included in 8 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Some examples of Member States including UDDI on their catalogues are the Netherlands, Spain or Belgium.

Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fd28786c-c91d-493a-88e0-6865a6db04e3 .

camssa:34a38557-f1e2-46ca-9c33-249b50559497 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry, also known as OTel, is a vendor-neutral open source Observability framework for instrumenting, generating, collecting, and exporting telemetry data such as traces, metrics, and logs. As an industry-standard, OpenTelemetry is supported by more than 40 observability vendors, integrated by many libraries, services, and apps, and adopted by numerous end users.

OpenTelemetry Vendors: https://opentelemetry.io/ecosystem/vendors/

OpenTelemetry Integrations: https://opentelemetry.io/ecosystem/integrations/

OpenTelemetry Adopters: https://opentelemetry.io/ecosystem/adopters/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d2b6eafe-84a8-4075-820c-0e6161afdaf0 .

camssa:34ad9e8f-7c8f-44f7-b544-eb0a35faf793 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Joinup platform hosts several discussion forums about the implementation and usefulness of JSON regarding technical interoperability aspects and serialization methods.\r
\r
JSON discussion forums in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/search?keys=json&sort_by=relevance&f%5B0%5D=type%3Adiscussion'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:153e908b-da85-423a-adf0-e438e861c39f .

camssa:34b01e06-ae8b-42be-9c0f-2cc37208e769 a cav:Score,
