camssa:34ff82b7-86ba-47c1-a7f7-ae35e3117329 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The scalability and broad character of the specification can make possible the creation and the availability of solutions fostering the reuse and availability of information between administrations and citizens. This fact demonstrates that the specification can foster the implementation of the once-only principle while ensuring the security and trustworthy data exchanges. \r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/ \r
\r
SAMM Documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:851f73a4-2440-45b4-8ae6-d18ecf2c172b .

camssa:350dea75-80d1-413f-ac86-2ea2f16fa582 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WSDL itself does not address organizational interoperability agreements directly, it plays a key role in fostering technical interoperability between systems and services.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6c59a03b-bdc6-4bf5-a25a-45c2328e09da .

camssa:351b94b5-aaa8-4049-b35e-bdf648359ea8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a0101cb11c30c1bbf94adb74479472f2a40c53ccc4b442180fece91506c20a9d ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:351e46ce-4535-4492-b427-b759fd1b7a6d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XSLT is publicly available for implementation and study for free on W3C's webpage. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:563b5e5a-ce0b-4354-9c78-06cebc15c557 .

camssa:351e8ea9-1053-407f-8cfd-46c6c6cce87c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-29023937877d658f898d48a06b2648e283306a041137cc58af4f79f061e1de4b ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:3523dcc8-5dbf-4cb8-9965-ba05a20fdf5d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cf1de0bf03a8ee372af0deddf9ef5c4609f5a7bb9c7e001c89d887c6789eaf56 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:35268013-7d2f-4d3c-89ec-fea52af7d81d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is relevant for administrations and services providers to be compliant with eIDAS. It is recommended and used in several services related to eIDAS compliance. Therefore, it is a clear specification that can be the center of discussions for the improvement of it and the services implementing it. \r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:47da108b-0b14-40b0-8f7e-a92a705b869a .

camssa:352db08a-9141-4245-8554-7a733f0359a3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a schema for office documents it is an exchange format that allows sharing information over the internet, including content from the public administrations fostering the visibility of administration data and services.  \r
\r
ODF ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/66363.html\r
\r
ODF OASIS reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:89553288-743e-48dd-a419-bdbc6e37cbc9 .

camssa:353320b8-4caa-4919-909d-3f1b606c6748 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of ebXML is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
ebXML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:74daa779-aaa0-4a5d-9e9a-dc1778acb025 .

