        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 is not related to the restriction of access to information.  Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cb45a2f3-0d1b-4555-b06a-33c15e2fc63d .

camssa:355810df-267d-47c8-aba0-939a832ddcc5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"After having checked different sources, there is no evidence of the existence of studies directly assessing the schema.org specification's efficiency. This contrasts with the fact that there is a large community making use of this specification.\r
\r
Schema.org reference, Community Group and Steering Group section:\r
https://schema.org/docs/about.html\r
\r
Schema.org reference, Additional Resources section:\r
https://schema.org/docs/documents.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85e8b571-c2c2-426f-a3dc-f010b6ec55e4 .

