        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of XACML is not related  to the long-term preservation of electronic records and other kinds of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
XACML OASIS reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/errata01/xacml-3.0-core-spec-errata01.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42c1d273-2847-419a-b192-9c306df140fe .

