camssa:3633d7df-c9bc-4ca8-9f6a-8adb6939cd72 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Schema.org has been selected for its use to be implemented in existing solutions (see ELI reference) and as a semantic asset in the European Union Location Framework (EULF) project (see JRC repository reference, Architectures and Standards for Spatial Data Infrastructures and Digital Government document).\r
\r
ELI-Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eli-european-legislation-identifier/solution/eli-legislation-extension-schemaorg/about\r
\r
JRC repository reference, Architectures and Standards for Spatial Data Infrastructures and Digital Government document:\r
https://publications.jrc.ec.europa.eu/repository/handle/JRC121025\r
\r
European Union Location Framework (EULF) reference:\r
https://e3p.jrc.ec.europa.eu/publications/european-union-location-framework'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dbf57898-d997-4b10-851d-2377ec57e641 .

camssa:3634ae51-fffe-4f2a-8fa7-ebf8d4a046a8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no Member States recommending RegOrg in their ICT National Catalogues.\r
 \r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6de777a6-0354-4788-b6d8-47aa8dca2aeb .

camssa:3635ef28-5777-4b95-85f5-51e593ffe83a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The YAML is broadly useful for programming needs ranging from configuration files to internet messaging to object persistence to data auditing and visualization. YAML has been used in "Integrated Open Access Materials Modelling Innovation Platform for Europe" project to generate workflows based on a structured YAML data format.

YAML specification:
https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/

"Integrated Open Access Materials Modelling Innovation Platform for Europe" project:
https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/953167'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3afb040b-497b-4ba2-9970-5bec9a847355 .

