camssa:36b5dfc5-ce5d-4329-9597-529a3e2bd3b7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ELI offers many different possibilities for e-Government development focused on the reuse of information across borders reducing administrative burden while fostering collaboration between European public administrations. Since it is based on the European Union and National Knowledge it can be useful when creating eGovernment innovative solutions.\r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
\r
ELI Testimonials: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/testimonials.ht\r
\r
ELI highlights:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/index.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c56e4298-274b-406b-9235-02687fd4f1cc .

