        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion\r
of OCSP within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/ict-standardisation/ict-technicalspecifications_\r
en\r
\r
CENELEC and CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CEN:105::RESET::::'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:30b7454c-a5b4-43ee-a42b-f6ff59fa1a48 .

camssa:36d2e515-ab80-4f24-8a08-762e635426bd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Not enough information has been found to answer negatively or positively to this criterion. Moreover, it seems that the specification is not aimed to foster the implementation of the once-only principle amongst the European Institutions. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1e6163e-c2b6-4e20-a375-395e2f68d380 .

