        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the time of elaborating this assessment, there is not a direct link to the specification in the European Collaborative Platform, Joinup. However, there is an available extension of OWL2 called OWL 2 Web Ontology Language XML Serialization.\r
\r
