camssa:373a5eda-763d-4662-9547-3d3beff8bc4a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 639-2 helps easing the creation and formalisation of Interoperability agreements. E.g., the Interinstitutional Style Guide (*).\r
\r
Interinstitutional Style Guide reference:\r
https://publications.europa.eu/code/en/en-370200.htm#an1-cand\r
\r
(*) Note that the site refers to ISO 639-1, but actually links to the ISO 639-2 home page.'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:307989d6-0197-49a7-97fa-55d0063aa3ba .

