        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 511 is not related to the publication of open data; therefore, this criterion does not apply to the specification.\r
\r
ETSI specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39c1a1ab-3675-45d8-93b8-afa1fbe3abc6 .

camssa:37415838-760b-43ff-bd28-dc3e150042b6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XAdES is often adopted as a specification to preserve electronic documents for a long period of time. In the following link there is an example of integrating digital signatures like XAdES in a framework. These facts demonstrate the maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services.\r
\r
Digital signature service:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html \r
\r
XAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/56025.html\r
\r
XAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101900_101999/101903/01.04.02_60/ts_101903v010402p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1742890-5398-49eb-9cbd-0104ae0a2cc1 .

camssa:37469bce-21c0-4f35-badb-b9efb624da78 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing studies assessing the effectiveness of DNS.  Particularly, there seems to be a general interest on the effectiveness of DNS security extension mechanisms, and on the DNS Tunneling tools.  \r
\r
Exploring Domain Name-Based Features on the Effectiveness of DNS Caching:                                                                                                                                               https://ccronline.sigcomm.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/p36-hao.pdf  \r
\r
A Comparative Performance Evaluation of DNS Tunneling Tools:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Alessio_Merlo/publication/221271469_A_Comparative_Performance_Evaluation_of_DNS_Tunneling_Tools/links/00b4951c1e5065b0e6000000/A-Comparative-Performance-Evaluation-of-DNS-Tunneling-Tools.pdf    \r
\r
Performance assessment and analysis ofDNS tunneling tools:                                                                                                 https://www.researchgate.net/publication/235996771_Performance_assessment_and_analysis_of_DNS_tunneling_tools  \r
\r
A survey of domain name system vulnerabilities and attacks:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/345017736_A_survey_of_domain_name_system_vulnerabilities_and_attacks          '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:982dadbb-1dad-43c9-a894-cc7e636790ef .

camssa:37485691-42f0-42e2-a2a5-56c2e38d119e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Following the completion of the research into conformity tests and certifications, a tool has been identified that enables the testing of implementations. The YAML Test Suite repository contains data for testing the correctness of YAML processors. The tests come in two formats. The src directory contains files that encode all the YAML data using YAML. Additionally, the data from these tests is accessible in a format where each test is contained within its own directory.

YAML Test Suite:
https://github.com/yaml/yaml-test-suite'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:426ecf3d-744a-4905-8af6-3c64f020f5bd .

camssa:3748ec29-72ba-4f0c-9c96-cf9987e0597a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "There are no existing European standards with market uptake covering the same area with the same level of security as TLS 1.3."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b5d5cc3-7152-415e-ad29-ab68b27d0533 .

