camssa:375cc1a5-e7fc-45a8-9625-78cd58307476 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML5 is one of the main pillars for Open Web Platform, a full programming environment for cross-platform applications with access to device capabilities; video and animations; graphics; style, typography, and other tools for digital publishing; extensive network capabilities, among others. Moreover, developers can have stability in to implement and plan through HTML5.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/2012/12/html5-cr.html.en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:43e4b3bf-dae8-42c6-ae69-66c9316fcdfb .

