camssa:386a8117-b7b6-438e-a52c-67fee57249d5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ELI is a European Specification developed for its common reuse and to foster the shareability of legal document across borders. It is used within the EU Open Data Portal for the provision of data sets described
using the main requirements established by ELI. Doing so, European institutions, businesses and citizens
can access and reuse it in a machine-readable format.

Moreover, since ELI was developed taking Common Data Model (CMD) from the OP and the implementations require to be compliant with it, it ensures that the content is available from CELLAR, which is an access point to all the open data generated by the Publications office.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html

ELI technical Information:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/technical_information.html

EU Open Data Portal Data sets:
https://data.europa.eu/euodp/en/data/group/eli?groups=eli'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0f3ca7f6-4a79-4e23-ab8f-272cb615be99 .

camssa:38754a07-ab50-4abf-892c-84bd837d1e75 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:387b7714-ccef-47a9-b9eb-b200a1f9110c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of CAdES is to foster the use of electronic signature.  Therefore, it is clear that it reduces the administrative burden by making signing possible electronically.\r
\r
CAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/64756.html\r
\r
CAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101700_101799/101733/02.01.01_60/ts_101733v020101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b30753fd-f834-4977-ad64-8d470d5638aa .

camssa:38824809-285c-4197-a215-1ad7c6a67366 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7a18abe4842e04b608025fd70e54c3db5c2a10130c0dab0495479e7d5effb55d ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:388731ce-c205-4058-a216-fa594c1b3a4c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTP is an internet protocol for the exchange of data over an Internet network. It supports the first level of maturity defined in the Tim Berners-Lee´s  5 stars Open Data deployment scheme, "Make your data accessible on the web". \r
\r
See: https://www.w3c.es/Eventos/2013/Uruguay/Presentaciones/W3CdayMVD_LOD_LorenaEtcheverry2013.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e2dc27c8-79f3-4680-9328-3e9ae9398f6e .

