        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'7 Member States are recommending IPv6 in their ICT National Catalogues. This Member States are Austria, Croatia, France, Germany, Netherlands, Norway and Sweden. 

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:90ad3263-ce7f-4047-9d57-532407687fe2 .

