camssa:3919b354-3380-4103-9624-ba733c992c51 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including SOAP 1.2. WS-Security is a an extension of SOAP 1.2 it can be considered that is royalty-free basis. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC"""@en ;
