camssa:3924c176-1498-4f01-98af-226afd4860d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is currently implemented in several initiatives in the public sector. This is a key point that reflects the market acceptance of the specification by the public administrations and institutions in Europe. \r
Some implementations of the ADMS are Metadata Registry (MDR), ADMS-enabled description of a vocabulary implemented in PoolParty Thesaurus Manager 3.1.0, and the Implementation for the XRepository of the German Federal Ministry of the interior. \r
\r
ADMS in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4d530fa4-b0fc-438d-bfff-de67d7ef48f5 .

camssa:3925a8b7-5f42-4711-a7a4-8102a15f5d1d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary is designed to support the exchange of information between organisations or persons (more generally Agents) defining Requirements and organisations or persons responding to these Requirements by means of structured or unstructured Evidences. The specification also uses codelists which are a valuable feature to provide authentication.\r
\r
Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary reference (v1.0.0):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/release/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary-v100  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:730f2f91-b5b7-43d2-ab6e-e589f7340d2f .

camssa:39292da8-ce26-446a-887a-f90255559e84 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-1d35b341bcafc21377ae6ac358b9dc087e8ad32870012c2743e49e4566440f41 ;
    cav:value "2" .

