camssa:39f2e8b6-132a-4442-b736-1662e88627b4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP is already mapped into the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, it can define the interoperability aspects of the "e-archiving component" and "e-archiving service", ABB from the  ERIA Technical Application poit of view.\r
\r
ELIS reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v501'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ddd3f457-973a-470d-b24a-8ecf159ea770 .

camssa:39f528e8-bed0-4bbb-9956-c1350ae47985 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 main focus is not to ensure the protection of personal data, but it ensures the establishment, location, access and authentication of a trusted list that may contain personal data, so indirectly it does ensure it.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 612 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9f938698-2c21-4bb2-a24c-868500200899 .

camssa:39f89d7b-c8cd-4e98-98a9-adee628c08fe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XFDL specification might rely on specialised software such as IBM Forms to transform XFDL files into other formats such as PDF and HTML.

XFDL files format:
https://www.lifewire.com/xfdl-file-2622489#:~:text=A%20file%20with%20the%20XFDL%20file%20extension%20is,way%20to%20create%20secure%20and%20legal%20electronic%20forms.

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:66e164dd-c4c1-4033-817a-d2b9694a0c6a .

camssa:39fa6155-b781-4aa2-8acc-62fa582e907c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of ODF is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
ODF ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/66363.html\r
\r
ODF OASIS reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5906ed10-3239-4b3f-b245-3b6835964ee8 .

