camssa:3a5238e1-5309-4124-826b-4ede7f8fec75 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPv6 is maintained and developed by IETF which is an international community developing open standards\r
Moreover, the deployment of IPv6 is rapidly expanding in the Internet. Support for IPv6 in applications is lagging behind and endorse such as Apple are taking steps to rectify this situation and raise awareness to the problem.\r
\r
See: \r
https://www.ietf.org/about/ \r
https://community.cisco.com/t5/jive-developer-archive-documents/ipv6-for-application-developers-whitepaper/ta-p/3647032\r
"""@en ;
