camssa:3b4228f9-bbc5-4829-9e13-bc141289605a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 512 is part of the Electronic Signatures and Infrastructure (ESI) family of specifications, and is dependent on some of their protocols and semantics they convey, therefore, this specification is not technology agnostic.  \r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1abc0168-4888-4293-aef8-d881bdef7c8d .

camssa:3b45b48b-03c0-41ae-b483-0b3d660a4d8d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "No evidence has been found of the specification being included in an interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7eb8e116-26da-47e8-aee2-5f1df5cfa067 .

camssa:3b4d8024-944f-4550-b6c6-c0aad4aeaed7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 639-2 is intended to serve as a device to identify a language name. Users might mix different ISO 639 collections or create tailored code suites from this specification depending on their needs, but there does not exist any partial implementation as such.\r
\r
ISO 369-2 FAQs:\r
https://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/faq.html#7\r
\r
SIL reference:\r
https://iso639-3.sil.org/about/relationships'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:55e2730d-47ec-42e1-8c7f-429d213fb097 .

camssa:3b4f893d-57f5-46eb-bdc3-3edcbd619e44 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 19944-1 has not been found included in the National Catalogue of recommended specifications of any Member State.\r
\r
CAMSS List of standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a775ebe4-0202-4d5b-8a3f-59654ea63b14 .

