camssa:3b6c8711-d2e4-4463-b7d3-e50988ae9153 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and the approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fd58e935-cbfc-49f3-ad73-2a3e13f7e243 .

