camssa:3b6f82c2-9839-45a0-96b1-e1f6bb98e8d1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While genericode itself does not provide mechanisms for protecting information against unauthorised changes. Organizations can implement various measures to protect information against unauthorised changes which are included in genericode. Genericode supports the inclusion of metadata alongside code values, providing additional context and information. This metadata enhances the semantic clarity of the codes and ensures data integrity.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7e1030f1-de3d-4ce7-b31a-f19f2537789d .

