camssa:3b7b0ebc-a4ed-492a-bb3f-112dd966c896 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Interoperability Test Bed Team of DIGIT D.2. foresees the maintenance of the GITB software and specification based on the needs of the testing community and carries out evolutive maintenance with regular releases. In addition, the Test Bed team always prioritises user feedback for its change management. There is an open email whom anyone can address to propose a new issue or report a problem.\r
\r
JOINUP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/interoperability-test-bed-repository/solution/interoperability-test-bed/detailed-information#releases\r
\r
GITB TDL reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/introduction/index.html#how-is-it-maintained\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e76fab61-10fc-4ec9-b580-5ca12e3b8a84 .

camssa:3b7bf079-7f54-4443-9ee8-9362efe69c9b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-812668363d8f0cc562041fae6c588e1555372bf0bf5c16835be996dd72070013 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:3b7ce50e-188d-48ab-b3fb-b8e6672ba397 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "ASiC Baseline Profile is not directly related to the long-term preservation of electronic records or other items. Despite this, according to its purpose of ease the signed data, ASiC Baseline Profile has three level of conformance and the last one is the Long-Term Profile. In the case of the assessed specification, it does not include the profile in itself but invokes the requirements from CAdES and XAdES. Therefore, it helps to ensure the availability of electronic signatures over long time periods, easing interactions between administrations and stakeholders."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bb42c2a0-79b2-4c6c-906f-6b96e9a4b4dc .

camssa:3b7d8f8b-6f52-40c4-995c-d1709bdd752c a cav:Score,
