camssa:3bf5015c-f2c1-4701-83a0-3e87d1770849 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There are many tools assessing the conformance of DNS's implementations. For instance, the DNS 
Compliance Testing provides tools to allow Registries and Registrars (amongst others) to check the DNS 
protocol compliance of the servers they are delegating zones to.

GITHUB DNS Compliance Testing:
https://gitlab.isc.org/isc-projects/DNS-Compliance-Testing
\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:45e21a35-0326-4edf-84d9-422bc9dfd8f8 .

camssa:3bf81189-218a-4fc6-a962-b1702a5158c1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The SHACL specification has gained significant market acceptance and is driving innovative solutions across various industries. In this context, there are a lot of open solutions that implements shacl, such as dcat-ap validator (based in shacl) and shacl-based validator (iTestBed). In addition, other private solutions using SHACL can be found. Therefore, this highlights SHACL's versatility and its critical role in advancing data integrity and safety in diverse fields.

Netage projects reference:
https://blog.netage.nl/

Wimmics SHACL:
https://wimmics.github.io/corese/cli_ref/cli_shacl.html

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97402675-4fcb-4eaa-86b5-2f66cde864b6 .

