camssa:3c7ed9d5-3f5b-4403-9261-e48061a87a9a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData promotes the sharing of data and results, and begs for its approval as an ISO/IEC Standard to help accelerate the specification adoption throughout the international community, particularly within government agencies. In this sense, the specification encourages both the creation of communities and the sharing of their data and results on European and national platforms.

OData referenece, data exchange:
https://www.oasis-open.org/news/pr/iso-iec-jtc-1-approves-oasis-odata-standard-for-open-data-exchange/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6f9e19b9-38e6-45f1-928a-cd067a6375c8 .

camssa:3c7edecb-63f2-40b4-a69c-4fb350f98eb6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of the specification facilitates interoperability between public administrations and cross-border data exchange by allowing a seamless exchange of collections across borders. More specifically, the specification fosters technical interoperability by providing functional requirements for APIs foreseen to exchange collections.\r
The wide adoption of the specification would contribute to a harmonisation of the APIs provided by the various data portals and therefore, enhance the data discoverability of the datasets currently isolated within data portals, across borders """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:14276b38-460b-45b8-8189-f913f25442e0 .

