camssa:3c8de6a5-0cbb-4551-87b5-bb44b55d2d85 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """In Xiph organisation, there is a monthly meeting where everyone can assist and give their opinions about changes or improvements of the specifications. However, the final decision belongs to a committee that has to approve it.\r
\r
Monthly XIPH meetings:\r
https://wiki.xiph.org/MonthlyMeeting\r
\r
Admin process XIPH:\r
https://wiki.xiph.org/AdminProcesses"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b41fd37b-e21b-4b51-b7ba-0c0c9a46df44 .

camssa:3c8f19a2-f1cf-4cbf-8dca-f2e36656f288 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SOAP 1.2 can be used independently from any other technical specifications or operating system. SOAP can also be adopted by without problems by the OGC service.\r
\r
SOAP Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/soap12/   \r
\r
Inspire Network Services SOAP Framework, OGC service Reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/54a89f97-0835-48e8-bf3c-37239e982fbd/language-en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2dbc87aa-a928-4867-a077-08338acc82e5 .

camssa:3c8f84e2-037e-496d-91c8-0b288ac5732c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There exist some studies assessing digital solutions' effectiveness that are based on iCalendar; however, most of them are restricted to learning environments. For example, one of these assessments involves Google calendar and their effectiveness in how this Google application improves a learning platform.\r
\r
Google calendar in learning environments - Design and Implementation of a Study Room Reservation System: Lessons from a pilot program using Google Calendar:\r
https://research.library.fordham.edu/cgi/viewcontent.cgi?article=1002&context=lib_staffpubs\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2f89023f-855d-4609-af0c-bb5e4bbe6bb8 .

camssa:3c9139b3-c805-4ff6-a7e4-d70dc92843fe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The specification is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9a35184e-5382-4fd6-a4a7-f4e46818b2f9 .

camssa:3c944c40-9a01-4b22-b424-62b4b23bd48c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "IPv4 is the previous version of the Internet Protocol, but it is widely adopted and still prevailing. The newest has specific features and improves security aspects. Even the IPv6 it is being gradually implemented and included in new initiatives, the existing translation and transition mechanisms between versions avoid the interoperability hampering. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c92c85ad-c80b-4097-ab10-2425d3c78180 .

