camssa:3c9af4b2-31df-4853-b30d-26603b22e02e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The European Union promotes the usage of IPv6 and the public administration are able to reuse it.  "MS as for instance Germany could bring strong support to the deployment of IPv6 within the European public administrations." \r
Source: https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/ipv6_framework_for_european_governments_0.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0fee6cec-780b-4b8e-8bd7-5c7b397b9c9f .

