camssa:3cba0271-427b-4802-92e4-6188e4540d28 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'All releases of the specification are publicly reviewed but the feedback is not visible. It is worth mentioning that minor releases (fixes,..) are approved with minimal review while major releases have a more structured and well defined process.

Asset Administration Shell (AAS) Github 
https://github.com/admin-shell-io/aas-specs/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:669c7154-0aec-4957-bc80-37bcb4dd2262 .

camssa:3cbc0a6a-d3b6-45aa-ada2-8bded0aa84b7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML was the first mark up language to develop web resources. Its main purpose is to publish data on the web. By allowing the publication of administrative data on the web with various formats, HTML foster the visibility of administration data, and services.\r
\r
HTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b32eaf79-0aaa-428d-832e-60ced9b1445a .

camssa:3cbe0f1e-c74d-4122-b1fc-d904fd7fbea5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specification is to facilitate the exchange of structured data. By allowing to make the data available to other persons or organisations, XML reduces the administrative burden. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:08bd7422-6d19-4c17-8ba1-1109abec6252 .

