camssa:3d0d5ba9-bb3f-432c-8634-6e9ecd3b9bff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The DPV working group was created as an outcome of the W3C Workshop on Data Privacy Controls and Vocabularies in Vienna in 2017, and started on 25th May 2018 – the date of the enforcement of GDPR. Since then, the DPVCG has worked to fulfil its aims and objectives, and produced the Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV) as a deliverable.\r
\r
DPV primer document:\r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dcc7d692-3f8d-4653-9a3f-83f6ea78ecd0 .

