camssa:3d82d734-4d70-45a1-afaa-3c6f816bfa74 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS itself is the foundation of a safe and secure internet. It ensures that data is transmitted privately and without modifications, loss or theft. Without TLS, many online public services would be vulnerable to data tampering and impersonation, making their delivery unreliable and untrustworthy. 

TLS 1.3 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bedb6bd0-a023-46f0-a39c-d73b74d61ba6 .

