        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDES is included in the SEMIC community in Joinup. The Semantic Interoperability Community (SEMIC) 
develops solutions to help European public administrations perform seamless and meaningful cross-border 
and cross-domain data exchanges.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes

SEMIC working groups:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf111de3-f0f7-403f-bb83-a6bb0e207bd2 .

