camssa:3e7b41d8-e34a-4b09-bd8f-c492552ebde4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C provides a Markup Validation Service for free to validate SOAP 1.2 implementations.\r
\r
See:\r
https://validator.w3.org/feed/docs/soap.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3dff2141-9541-4ada-afb8-8bbd52d2e3d9 .

camssa:3e7c6dae-e258-4a13-ad63-26b2f73af41a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The standardized terms and concepts within EuroVoc can facilitate clearer communication and understanding between systems, which is beneficial for secure data exchange protocols. When different entities use the same standardized terms and classifications, it can reduce ambiguity and errors during data transmission, contributing to more secure and accurate exchanges.\r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8792fbd6-8b9b-4f50-ac45-eafea85aa4df .

camssa:3e7e7d60-fb71-45d5-ba7b-07d0b95af41d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Joinup platform comprises a large European community of developers, some of who are focused on UBL implementations.  Among the different issues addressed we can find tutorials, or discussion forums related to the specification.  \r
\r
Joinup: About OASIS Universal Business Language (UBL)\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eprocurement/solution/oasis-universal-business-language-ubl/about\r
\r
UBL in Github:\r
https://github.com/oasis-tcs/ubl'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7c715e1c-f79a-469c-b6e5-bf6066aac3a6 .

camssa:3e85adf9-1b8f-4ca7-bc3a-f254915b76da a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ebXML does not allow customisation nor provides any guidelines to customise any of the specification features.\r
\r
ebXML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fc3a925e-4b08-49f3-88b5-2f9298639ca1 .

camssa:3e86d3f3-096c-4296-9895-56cf98a44763 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, LDAPv3 has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dadb19ae-3b70-486e-b8f7-e5f0c574cbd2 .

