        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CSV makes sure content is available on the web, structures data and makes it usable in a non-proprietary open format. So it can be said that CSV is independent from any technology or platform.         \r
                                                 \r
CSV reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d1560e3f-dd8b-40e0-a283-81c9edd18ce3 .

