camssa:3f5838b9-f8e8-4ac0-a371-dab581c9002c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Administrative metadata within the CSIP can include information about access rights, permissions, and security measures associated with the information package. This metadata can be used to specify and enforce restrictions on who can access the information and under what conditions, therefore, addressing and enabling the implementation of confidentiality features.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0cfa9b4d-5f58-45cd-9028-6c74c9d3858b .

