    cav:value "20" .

camssa:3f5d8c52-6a88-40e0-b1d9-02377ea6b075 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 27001 is presented as an exhaustive set of requirements to be applied in any given Information Security Management system (ISMS), therefore, it does not allow extension.\r
\r
ISO 27001 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso-iec:27001:ed-2:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1b76030-27a7-45b2-b63a-2ad2892e8b9f .

camssa:3f650567-dbb4-4107-865b-851a99c60448 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Regarding eSignatures, CAdES includes features to the long-term preservation of data included in electronic signatures. The LTA-Level of requirements is covering the preservation, integrity of attributes and validation materials for the eSignatures ensuring the long-term accessibility. However, the specification is not strictly related to the functions of eArchiving. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0d5451c9-94c6-4f5b-8de9-7db9846ab18a .

