camssa:3ff827e0-be90-42f5-b559-9293d37f944c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EIRA was used to analyse and design a solution for the VAT in the Digital Age (ViDA). The work was done together with TAXUD. 

ViDA Success Story: 
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira/news/egoverac-success-vida-e-invoicing-requirements-dg-taxud

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8f589945-8ddf-4557-9ff2-f7305486a1a2 .

camssa:3ff86765-2611-431a-abe3-03c835d9b577 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The REM RI (Relay Interface) should be identified by a transport protocol, a hostname and a port number. \r
REM is a particular instance of Electronic Registered Delivery Service (ERDS) and makes interoperability \r
smooth and increases usability, at the same time, the application of additional security mechanisms ensures \r
integrity, confidentiality, and non-repudiation and protects against the risk of loss, theft, damage or any other \r
illegitimate modifications, which enhances the trustworthy exposure of interfaces.\r
Other techniques may be used either according to clause 6.1 of ETSI EN 319 522-3, peer-to-peer agreements \r
between REMSPs or based on the best practices recommended in Annex A of ETSI EN 319 532-4. \r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3, Routing Information, page 25 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7f7eafeb-ecfa-47ff-997e-22c4b593c362 .

camssa:3ffccb7b-2d1e-4a61-b310-d50918d4f29a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of W3C Best Practices is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d009995f-ed21-4405-9818-f275a20de989 .

camssa:3fff55dc-63e9-4c79-902f-9b1992ae2578 a cav:Score,
