        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EuroVoc has not been found included in any initiative neither at European nor on national level covering privacy aspects.\r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f974ed8-1cf4-479a-8038-0c1315c449e0 .

camssa:3ffff1e1-f0e1-4bc2-a7eb-408d6232c4b8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The main function of UDDI is to organize and catalog web services in a register, which can be applied to multiple domains such as the public sector. For example, UDDI can be used for the listing and description of government web services, thereby improving their discoverability and thus, enhancing the visibility of administrative services.

UDDI techtarget reference:
https://www.techtarget.com/whatis/definition/UDDI-Universal-Description-Discovery-and-Integration'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b4e52bcf-ae65-408b-852e-983d61631eae .

camssa:40024032-42c4-4402-b928-fb86242bde46 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'In order to meet the standard protocol requirements, LDAP can not be customised. \r
\r
Extension Mechanisms for DNS:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6891'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:13378dd0-7ea8-48f5-bd56-9e0288653b49 .

