camssa:4017c44f-a02b-4047-ad8e-2c540c50e91b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While IPv4 doesn’t inherently provide visibility into these business elements, it enables access to data and services that can make them visible, such as through supporting access to web applications or the interconnection of distributed systems.

IPv4 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc791'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a77aeab-a14d-4e96-b2c1-4fa65f8f9771 .

camssa:401af596-bdbf-4b71-b0b7-e9eb985357a0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 19944-1, focusing on cloud service management, has the potential to simplify the delivery of public services. By implementing the specification, public administrations can leverage cloud computing to achieve scalability, cost efficiency, accessibility, collaboration, and rapid deployment of digital services. ISO/IEC 19944-1 provides guidelines for effective cloud service management, allowing public administrations offer a more streamlined and efficient delivery of public services.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5476a4c5-bab6-481e-8a30-39de97f50391 .

camssa:4029c0d7-1bb7-42d4-b12a-e8a2d14038c4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IETF is a consensus-based group, and authority to act on behalf of the community requires a high degree of consensus and the continued consent of the community. The process of creating and Internet Standard is straightforward: a specification undergoes a period of development and several iterations of review by the Internet community and revision based upon experience, is adopted as a Standard by the appropriate body... and is published. In practice, the process is more complicated, due to (1) the difficulty of creating specifications of high technical quality; (2) the need to consider the interests of all the affected parties; (3) the importance of establishing widespread community consensus; and (4) the difficulty of evaluating the utility of a particular specification for the Internet community. The goals of the Internet Standards Process are:\r
- Technical excellence;\r
- prior implementation and testing;\r
- clear, concise, and easily understood documentation;\r
- openness and fairness; and\r
- timeliness.\r
The goal of technical competence, the requirement for prior implementation and testing, and the need to allow all interested parties to comment all require significant time and effort. The Internet Standards Process is intended to balance these conflicting goals. The process is believed to be as short and simple as possible without sacrificing technical excellence, thorough testing before adoption of a standard, or openness and fairness.\r
\r
Standard process IETF:\r
https://www.ietf.org/standards/process/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cf856dab-f190-4093-9c82-89f00ba45083 .

camssa:402a91cd-493d-4bd7-a14b-4052e893bab7 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7ede9122e530b12ca81694e3ce1f21fa7cf4d6d071d0edb0a2082a0e0d2ad8e4 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:402f7580-1953-4d58-bd49-aa86d16f241c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There is no evidence of any study directly assessing the effectiveness of the EN 303 645 specification. However, there are some organisations from the private sector, offering solutions based on the specification's performance with respect to the market, that indirectly assess the specification's effectiveness. It is the case of TÜV SÜD, which offers testing against the EN 303 645 specification.\r
\r
TÜV SÜD-EN 303 645 reference:\r
https://www.tuvsud.com/en-us/industries/consumer-products-and-retail/iot-cybersecurity/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f7f01d2f-4f94-4912-b79e-0f54fce042a8 .

camssa:4034dff0-6f8e-45e9-8bc0-7867ab99aec9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As a business domain agnostic specification, FTP can be used for the exchange of documents addressing any business domain.\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b2c4009d-c781-43a2-a64a-a7ef21f66b09 .

