        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPv6 is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to the specification.

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:871acd87-c5a8-42cf-9b20-cab9ccab30e0 .

