camssa:413006ee-0265-46ef-9656-7349b93279c1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d12b846c487e7201dbcf395866b5abc0bb5fa040b1f519127b6a5f56d447257 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:4133b6bd-d3c1-4b5e-978d-cef5c7d44999 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP is an application protocol for accessing and maintaining distributed directory information services over \r
the net, it is independent of implementation.\r
The specification allows many applications and services to connect to the LDAP server to validate users, \r
which reduces the administrative burden of the system administrators and the users. As it is widely \r
supported the implementation of the LDAP would not hamper the interoperability between systems and \r
services.\r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f0b06309-151a-4177-bb21-b29cbe5e8c64 .

camssa:41342ece-d790-400c-b1e0-6a287350af4d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XACML can be used independently from any other technical specifications. However, it is worth noting that since it is based on XML, it can be dependent on conventions and rules for the correct XML usage.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2ea64bf6-2e36-4c41-82d7-cccf582af7e9 .

camssa:4136194f-ec77-4ce1-8573-8820fcb5af0d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no Member States recommending SAMM in their ICT National Catalogues.\r
\r
The SAMM webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net/\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf \r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8faf1a43-c95c-45af-a235-2e2ac8878416 .

