camssa:41501edc-e090-40bd-bfef-0c59429d79b1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTPS is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, FTPS can define the interoperability aspects of the "Network", "Networking Service", "Public Network" and "Private Network" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d3bf4fbb-2157-4525-9325-e4bc8a2e42e5 .

