camssa:41651ecc-6b7f-4f39-806d-e81d93fa9076 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ETSI and any of its committees, in charge of the development of EN 303 645, operates under the ETSI Intellectual Property Rigths (IPRs) and IPR Policy. The specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights Policy, ETSI ownership of IPRs section: \r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9fc2bfab-c5b6-491d-94c4-42c75ca6df84 .

camssa:41658f61-bbe9-4ca9-857f-92d4e6ee32da a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Representing the graphical information from several sources as XML, it can help the comprehensibility of administrative data. In this sense, it can also help the decision-making process by displaying graphics and data that is relevant for the administration.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d9ef925a-8677-4532-877b-74d3b448407f .

camssa:41664418-4d1c-4992-a5f2-a99c6344d022 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of UTF-8 is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7e32a217-1320-4506-a260-d5c9dd188374 .

camssa:4169a3ed-621f-4848-bb1a-351b827df92e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The main purpose of RegOrg is to capture the typical details recorded by business registers and thereby facilitate information exchange between them. So it facilitates the comprehensibility of public administrations data.\r
\r
RegOrg about Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/registered-organization-vocabulary/about"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fc194e11-bb74-4f69-8856-1b2db57fa7c1 .

camssa:41988871-13c9-4928-a402-c5e62d924e5c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP  places a strong emphasis on enabling the long-term preservation of information. The CSIP provides guidelines and recommendations for packaging, managing, and preserving digital information to ensure its accessibility, integrity, and usability over extended periods of time.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4e491760-bb24-4f84-bf79-10d72b600c88 .

camssa:41999d23-aa1d-407d-9836-8958a14c42d8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including this specification.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50c88ce0-e91d-452e-9c44-f2d3adbb193b .

camssa:4199cfbb-67d3-4f4d-bbc9-ff1a8e59d7aa a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:419dd543-693b-480c-87b4-bf3ad40b0b3d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As Internet Protocol Stack, IPv6 is being selected gradually by different member states. The specification is the most used data exchange protocol over the internet. 
The European Union is willing to implement the IPV6 as it is stated in the following report: "The adoption of IPv6 in Europe, in particular within European public administrations, is still low, but the availability of IPv6 communication is vital for the economic development and the digitisation of European public administrations. The goals of the Digital Agenda for Europe and the Digital Single Market Strategy are based on stable and reliable data networks".  Therefore IPv6 fosters the visibility of data across borders.

"IPv6 framework for European Governments" reference:
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/ipv6_framework_for_european_governments_0.pdf

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41c04a84-0b50-4fca-a6be-a22a1b517fb0 .

camssa:419f83f4-b5fd-4eaa-b6f3-2b3c69f147e7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Several implementations are assessing the usefulness and exploring how the usage of this specification can
enhance the accessibility to digital platforms. Some of them are React Aria and Mozilla. However, this does
not extend to the European Public Service.

Mozilla reference, Accessibility with WAI-ARIA section:
https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Learn/Accessibility/WAI-ARIA_basics

React Aria reference, home page:
https://react-spectrum.adobe.com/react-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f19e6d9-6105-4e6c-b42e-eec39e4b0eb3 .

