        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XAdES is included in several national catalogues from Member States. A total of 7 countries listed the XAdES within their national catalogues.\r
\r
See CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8df13345-46f8-4052-b1b2-098c4a27e826 .

