camssa:428046c6-979d-4e4b-9e78-8911eef3f4c5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of TIFF/IT as high quality image format for exchanging data does not hamper the scalability of systems. It is widely adopted for this purpose because it is independent of any platform or software. \r
\r
TIFF/IT ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/34342.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:51c43648-3e2a-44e8-8a7c-2eca09a99a2d .

camssa:42809f12-7f33-4572-b677-e636dace2e18 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """JPEG is already associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, JPEG can define the interoperability aspects of the "Representation" ABB from the EIRA Semantic view. \r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a5ea17b-ac70-4dab-84ed-a9e410b423bf .

