        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPSec is to secure communications over a Network which does not simplify the delivery of European public services.\r
\r
IPSec reference, What IPSec Does:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4301#section-3.1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9ce9a4fe-68d2-46fb-98c6-b541d3b2c8f3 .

