        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'5 Member States are recommending IPsec in their ICT National Catalogues. This Member States are France, Greece, Malta, Netherlands and Spain.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:203ef15e-bd03-492b-9738-e00cf1d5099c .

