camssa:42d7ddf1-064e-4543-a566-07ec6d2e9c6d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, \r
the second star corresponds to the availability of data as structured data. ebXML is a standard that proposes \r
an XML-based infrastructure enabling the user to store data in a structured manner. Then, this specification \r
supports the publication of data as open data.\r
\r
ebXML reference, section 1:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html#__RefHeading__8798_474791649\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e2e9b199-765b-458a-9477-4bc121db96d1 .

camssa:42da3730-f870-4a29-a97e-5f3a98b67173 a cav:Score,
