camssa:42dfe6f2-06c6-4fe4-8306-4f7f3a043459 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are many documents that provide an overview of the usage and functionalities of MIME. Such is the case of a scholar paper which describes the effectiveness of the mechanisms provided by MIME for Internet multimedia mail.\r
\r
MIME: a portable and robust multimedia format for Internet mail:\r
https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/BF01210505'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06dd69e1-e635-4769-a92c-9afb2958ffc3 .

