        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-497a81dae06c1d53b4cfe96c1f998f6f65d46354d68a83d29a2950c984fc1166 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:42eb50fd-17ee-4ae9-97bf-6c6df8669061 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ebXML is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, ebXML can define the interoperability aspects of the Service Registration Service ABB of the \r
EIRA Technical View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v110'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d226036b-8e02-4a95-9bfb-58ed214a5155 .

camssa:42ed8a08-6f2c-4018-8ca8-a2f41f599b62 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS is recommended by 9 Member States, including France, Germany, Spain, Sweden, Malta, Cyprus, 
Greece, Croatia and the Netherlands.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ac360b9-5fc8-45be-a8ec-6396a8710f50 .

camssa:42eec908-5d6f-4d51-bb4b-2ee34d966e4f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DCAT-AP is not related to the protection of personal data, therefore this critierion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ca3ecbed-9f92-46f0-be60-ba5f296f49be .

camssa:42ef5b80-31eb-43c0-bf4b-de06a1421cd0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5efb3d75-b6de-4325-bb86-185c277c7c0b .

camssa:42f0dee4-aa27-43e6-b39c-41a06bd87e29 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a vocabulary, the implementation of CLV can be tested using methods like SHACL shapes and using semantic reasoners to ensure that the implementation is well-formed. These validation mechanisms can be used with open source tools or lite versions of tools like GrapghDB or Protégé.\r
\r
SHACL validation:\r
https://graphdb.ontotext.com/documentation/free/shacl-validation.html#what-is-shacl-validation\r
\r
Semantic Reasoners List:\r
http://owl.cs.manchester.ac.uk/tools/list-of-reasoners/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:caaf0c45-657e-46de-88d5-4f202b087ee4 .

