        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "After searching in the different official European websites, there is no evidence of any cross-border project that use HTML4 nor explicit agreements involving the usage of the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8dce4191-8671-4319-aa9b-7cc86ce8695c .

camssa:43974689-0407-4d16-a297-ff935f08c582 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv6 offers a larger address space compared to IPv4, allowing public services to have unique, globally routable IP addresses for every device. This can simplify direct access to various administrative services without the need for complex NAT (Network Address Translation) configurations.

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91bb5d19-8c47-49ce-82f2-e5e37a7471ba .

