camssa:43b1b6ae-7335-4e79-9033-faec42faf34b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'iCalendar provides sets of data values that are valid for each property and parametre. The conformance of such a property or parametre is defined as plain text and can be autmatically assessed by using the iCalendar Validator.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545\r
\r
iCalendar Validator:\r
https://icalendar.org/validator.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f43637b8-f091-4d00-98ad-e70eb45201a6 .

camssa:43b7c019-bbce-44c0-8f61-9dc7ea03d96b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XBRL International has a public reviewing period for all of its specifications.\r
XBRL GL consultations can be conducted by XBRL International members and " volunteers" using the "public working drafts".\r
\r
These public working drafts are available  in \r
https://specifications.xbrl.org/spec-group-index-xbrl-gl.html\r
\r
https://www.xbrl.org/the-consortium/get-involved/navigating-your-journey-as-a-volunteer/the-standards-development-process-overview/\r
\r
Please see also  further instructions on how to contribute or take part in the specification development:\r
https://specifications.xbrl.org/faq.htm'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:839a31a9-f746-498a-b064-658385694aaa .

