camssa:43bf5d99-f6d2-450e-aa1b-baa676a59ba2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG is an ISO standard and as all ISO standards, they have to be paid to access its content. However, it can be checked out in W3C website where the content is aligned with the ISO standard.\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5ad75e50-7936-43d4-9978-840646fdd5eb .

