    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:43d23f44-7c8c-4878-a48c-994baf254fab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UBL fosters data processing as it is a specification used to exchange information between systems and parties with a specific format. Therefore, by applying structure to documents and providing the data types expected, the usage of UBL can be useful for trustworthy data processing. In the case of security, there are no provisions.\r
\r
UBL v2.3 reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:260ac945-e7f6-4f97-9ef3-3c67e9318013 .

camssa:43d419e3-a627-4e13-9295-9f3a20413dc8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is included within the EIRA Interoperability Specification Library (ELIS) listed as a possible specification to be used for implementing two of EIRA's ABBs. Moreover, IETF 3161 Time Stamp Protocol (TSP) is considered as the basis of the European Standard Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI); Time-stamping protocol and time-stamp token profiles from ETSI. Within the document, it is recognised as the basis to which ETSI standard applied constraints.

ETSI Catalogue: 
https://www.etsi.org/standards-search#Pre-defined%20Collections

ETSI EN 319 422:
Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI);
Time-stamping protocol and time-stamp token profiles \""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:908eca68-21bd-4387-af7c-561eabd5781d .

camssa:43d66670-6ce7-4345-9e32-23677ec13952 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e9e0cf4a339c837607828404dd0e9b360d643528fcc1df488a95ca67166acea3 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:43d734e9-d911-4ed1-bc24-c0458ff9d378 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licences granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including W3C data on the web best practices.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39e28f78-0c04-482b-bc9b-c870167d00b2 .

camssa:43d873ae-382f-4ff1-b047-96275a57b8ab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There have been found some studies assessing UTF-8 in terms of effectiveness.  For example, ""A case study in SIMD text processing with parallel bit streams: UTF-8 to UTF-16 transcoding"" or a study on the influence of UTF coded data in HDB-3 operation efficiency.\r
\r
A case study in SIMD text processing with parallel bit streams: UTF-8 to UTF-16 transcoding:\r
https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/1345206.1345222\r
\r
Compatibility of UTF-8 Encoding System to HDB-3 Scrambling Method:\r
https://koreascience.kr/article/JAKO201322045164159.page\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc67536c-040d-401a-9504-ff092fcaf221 .

camssa:43e431be-6f3d-40e8-a3cb-744a76445ed3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of LegalDocML is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9d2461a7-706c-4d29-95e9-ff4f0d4002a9 .

