camssa:43fb85f9-2a91-45d5-aa34-b54658dedae3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are existing documentation and studies assessing the effectiveness and efficiency of SMTP. The document referenced below is a practical study assessing the e-mail communication thought SMTP. This document studies how SMTP makes e-mail communication more efficient.\r
\r
Practical study SMTP:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/227859099_A_Practical_Study_of_E-mail_Communication_through_SMTP"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:61e11bff-fff2-40a2-ae8b-3b9aec531ccf .

