    cav:value "60" .

camssa:4410ab13-63f2-4748-918f-1620670408b0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'One of REST's architectural properties is the modifiability of components to meet changing needs. The REST constraint "code on demand" applies when returning executable code is needed in order to support a part of the application.  Therefore the server can extend or customize the functionality of a client by transferring executable code: for example, compiled components such as Java applets, or client-side scripts such as JavaScript.\r
\r
REST "code on demand" reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/rest-architectural-constraints/#code-on-demand\r
\r
REST R. Fielding dissertation: Chapter 5\r
https://www.ics.uci.edu/~fielding/pubs/dissertation/rest_arch_style.htm'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1c6095a-3b47-4a49-b76e-09955473fedb .

camssa:44114701-76dc-4a83-a6d3-caa05fce0852 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PDF/A has the ISO community that supports the development of: International standards, Technical Specifications, Technical Report and Publicly Available Specification.\r
\r
The ISO standardization process:\r
http://www.isotc292online.org/projects/iso-process/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edd24064-b07c-47d2-b7a9-31a98ded7ec4 .

camssa:4414d30a-4475-4e9f-9b3a-e83a4e28309e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The DCAT specification reuses the ODRL specification, which was included in the SPECIAL initiative under the 2020 Horizon program.\r
\r
Scalable Policy-aware linked data architecture for privacy, transparency and compliance reference:\r
https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/731601/results \r
\r
DCAT (v2.0.0) reference:             \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:025e375e-fc3e-4eda-bcab-46b8bd4ceef0 .

