camssa:44d49a68-415c-4e06-b810-53e4e7664d8e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The Web Services Security (WS-Security) main function is to reinforce integrity and confidentiality of the messages used by SOAP specification. The purpose of SOAP 1.2 is to store, transport and exchange data through interoperable systems. Moreover WS-Security helps, SOAP 1.2 that uses XML which defines a set of rules for encoding documents in a human-readable format and machine-readable format enhancing the reusability of data and stimulating the interoperability of systems and services."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2c80a421-e577-4d96-9523-4be7edfb3a7e .

camssa:44e0de23-0785-4121-b6b9-e83ae953f419 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The ISO 14533-1:2014 which refers to CAdES is not available for free for everyone to study. Payment is needed to reach access to the standard.\r
\r
CAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/64756.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a8fac960-6374-4ff9-b72e-672dc5f0a3b8 .

camssa:44e1d60f-58bb-43c0-b819-08592cffe8da a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "There is no adoption of competing, new European Standards foreseen covering the same area with the same level of security as TLS 1.3.   "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e804913a-1f8e-46a1-86c3-30fddd7951df .

camssa:44e75505-a470-4ccf-8270-1f7d7d3cfb2f a cav:Score,
