camssa:4523fb04-720d-4fb4-b0a8-d0c45e15907b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Any cross-border project using internet, uses HTTP Cookies. An interesting example is Europeana, a project that aims to provide digital access to European cultural heritage material. Europeana uses HTTP Cookies to imporve the experience on the website, keeping the user signed in, and remembering navigation preferences.\r
\r
Europeana Cookies policy:\r
https://www.europeana.eu/en/rights/cookies-policy'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ec0bcad9-a45c-42f0-ad31-2b96856f487e .

camssa:452a3c62-1d8d-400d-98fa-e13a6e9af902 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTP Cookies is based on a set of syntax rules that define all the requirements met to provide the functionality. There are no extensions that can be added on top of the main functionalities HTTP Cookies is designed for.\r
\r
IEFT  Request for comments:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6265#section-4\r
\r
HTTP Cookies reference:\r
https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Cookies#creating_cookies'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5f0a8615-c678-4bb4-b7af-a460614a1861 .

camssa:452a8462-43b2-47a9-be3b-fe6a1d3c85f6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Assuming data is retained, the AMQP specification promotes information reuse through filter sets to efficiently reuse relevant information. (Refer to section 3.5.8 Filter Set)

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d26b2364-4c24-4487-a05c-7df28e4c513a .

camssa:452d4b66-750f-4727-ace2-d9b28ade72e3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The main purpose of PAdES baseline profile is not related to the preservation of digital information or items. Although, the different profiles defined by the specification are related to the long-term preservation of eSignatures and the materials related to the validation. This capability ensures the availability of signatures and related materials within a long period according to the needs of each implementer. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fceb77a8-0584-41d9-9082-49dbf6ea381e .

camssa:4539f34d-c257-4aa4-aa6d-10c9bf8a8281 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:453aae9f-4728-43bf-9578-9a30ac95cc71 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:453eddda-73ea-4c40-a997-0fcfe77525f3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """All specifications are publicly and openly referenced on the RDA web platform at https://www.rd-alliance.org/recommendations-outputs/adoption-recommendations\r
All specifications are deposited in official repositories and have DOIs\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:77c234ae-6282-4a41-b469-02682b418d3e .

camssa:453eeea0-6243-4115-a009-73771e3e5947 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Better Regulation Toolbox is an internal European Commission resource designed as a complement to the Commission's Better regulation guideline. It provides more specific and operational guidance to those involved with different elements regarding EU legislation
The construction of European Laws and policies aims to be proportionate to users needs, rights and duties,
in this sense the specifications allows the use of extensions as long as the core elements of the toolbox are
maintained.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:17bf0995-8fc0-48a1-b9d3-c0776be67a43 .

camssa:453f0944-21e8-4a2f-b663-0adf172a1e91 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of RegOrg is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
RegOrg Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/registered-organization-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:944f0705-6245-4477-ba0f-64d4a0c50b58 .

