camssa:4567391c-a3ed-4c91-b5e0-3469899927f1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are many online guidelines to assess the conformance of the HTTP Cookies implementation. Furthermore, there are also companies that offer services related to the assessment of HTTP Cookies in order to find vulnerabilities associated with personal data processing and assess the compliance against EU legislation. Nonetheless, no tools or platforms have been found that allow testing of implementations. \r
\r
HTTP Cookies IETF guide:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6265#section-4\r
\r
HTTP Cookies testing tutorial:\r
https://www.guru99.com/cookie-testing-tutorial-with-sample-test-cases.html\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b88fa3a-c694-4640-a00e-fabdae177d17 .

camssa:45705bde-2fa2-4f25-aa6e-a50cf5b35e69 a cav:Score,
