        "89%AssessmentScoreAverage" .

camssa:458747c0-9bd7-45cb-bb0c-96421f65df3c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OASIS Technical Committee, in charge of the development of OData, operates under RF (royalty-free) on RAND Mode of the OASIS IPR Policy. Therefore, the specification is licensed on a Royalty-free.\r
\r
OASIS Intellectual Property guidelines, section 5.2:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/ipr/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7089b792-f57a-4c0d-8b83-4ed0fad03b73 .

camssa:458897bb-d61e-47b0-85b3-9ec0a79ed94c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WS-Security is included in 5 national catalogue of recommended specifications. The The specification is fully aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1c459415-bc37-4b3a-acac-c2b1e92a33bb .

camssa:458af22e-60df-439b-b52c-79c827436e87 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ODRL is intended to be applicable across various platforms, including different operating systems, web \r
platforms, and other technology environments.Whether an application is running on Windows, macOS, \r
Linux, a web-based platform, or any other environment, developers can integrate ODRL support to manage \r
digital rights in a consistent and standardized manner.\r
\r
W3C specification: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:467f7505-3552-482d-bdc4-a346637c5e0f .

