camssa:45a10bde-5ef9-4973-8153-7bfb14c8ebb3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of IPv4 is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6b05a082-4e4d-429c-bd1a-6b3cc1e6e8ab .

camssa:45a30782-355d-47d5-b786-a4d13f1cea03 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the second star corresponds to the availability of data as structured data. WAI-ARIA is intended to be used to increase semantics in programming languages like HTML5 and vector image formats like SVG2, or to be used as an accessibility enhancement technology in other markup-based languages not including support for Accessible Rich Internet Applications (ARIA). Therefore, it eases the publication of open data.\r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference, section 1.1:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/		'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8fe41e0a-18b7-4367-91a0-045f4eecc073 .

camssa:45a31673-6650-42d3-b159-5bd42f96b16d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "PDF is a business agnostic document format that can be reused in a cross-domain way. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:784e8d35-ffca-491e-9f4a-2263ab2a962a .

camssa:45b2d072-9451-4aec-886d-c8aa9c359d9c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SOAP is included in 10 national catalogues of recommended specifications. Among those we can find Spain. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of these Member States is fully aligned with at least 2 out of 3 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets Spain:\r
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio\r
/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES\r
\r
NIFO factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2022\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a72bd53d-1111-481f-9368-5f417e9dda06 .

