camssa:466d4029-9d75-453d-b8a7-f0e29e897642 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"As a specification with the aim of helping to represent information which can be documents, persons, physical object or abstract objects, it helps administrations to provide information to stakeholders. Therefore, RDF fosters the visibility of the administration's data and services. As a way to make data reusable, it eases the decision-making process.\r
\r
RDF primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-primer/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:68397736-8f24-4da2-830a-c4c8edc5ebd4 .

