camssa:4676ef15-701b-4c31-922f-49fe6486b6ae a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The iCalendar document defines the data format and media type of text/calendar, which is independent of any calendar service or protocol, and barely gives provisions on the use of other specifications to mitigate possible privacy threads, and thus, protect personal data.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97cf5a37-a5d1-484a-99d4-9322e9525691 .

