camssa:4688ef10-7b23-4db5-9ea8-864f02d07c75 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has been included in an initiative covering privacy aspects, the Platform Industrie 4.0 initiative in Germany in the context of the Digital Twins initiative (IDTA). This initiative aims to create an environment where all partners can share manufacturing assets and define in a collaborative manner their specifications in order to make the overall process more integrated. 

Industrie 4.0 initiative:
https://www.plattform-i40.de/IP/Navigation/EN/Home/home.html

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5831a779-5806-4ff3-bed5-d7c960c36d54 .

