        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ECLI implements DCMI, as ECLI is a uniform identifier that has the same recognizable format for all Member States and EU courts.\r
It can contribute to the evolution of European public services as it can describe any web resource, helping and/or enhancing the European services further.\r
\r
\r
