camssa:46e329fd-20e7-45e1-bab9-34ba9a519b14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are some optional parts in the REM Structure which can make the structure effectively larger by \r
adding an extension.\r
In the REM-MD Evidence MIME section 0..N, the body is optional, and in the Original Message, the body is \r
optional too.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference, section 6:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0706e84c-0d65-4e43-a661-f7e7d67852aa .

