        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Xfoms 2.0 is not related to data portability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de13697e-b6ef-4187-9bfa-cf3b1c7420e2 .

