        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ba46c76c10ad769a23ce4a9a34cb4d96a00407d5fc14ad1c791a870be7563c2b ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:470378d8-d742-4d75-9550-548dd8254f4a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By providing a standardized format for representing calendar data, iCalendar ensures interoperability, making it easier to exchange scheduling and event information across different software and platforms. This facilitates seamless data sharing between European public services, supporting efficient collaboration and coordination among various entities. \r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9063da4e-0a96-4244-8493-2b127734cbeb .

camssa:47043efe-51f9-4a48-8b1a-98f9abe127f1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-52e41801b0db7274d934a229fee15e657273655d70d448d16706fcbe0e4f9746 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:4709ab00-eb11-433f-a685-62e06fb21eec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Following the completion of the research into conformity tests and certifications, a tool has been identified 
that enables the testing of implementations. The "IPsec Test Suite" can be used to test IPsec implementations for security flaws and robustness problems. Moreover, it also has been found the "MyIKEv2" tool, which is a testing tool for IKEv2/IPsec in Linux.

BlackDuck IPsec Test Suite:
https://www.blackduck.com/fuzz-testing/defensics/protocols/ipsec.html

"MyIKEv2" testing tool:
https://www.myikev2.net/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:71f05faf-cff9-4c85-a470-389d4cd7b933 .

camssa:470b8a63-3ed8-465d-9165-ce3d5cc769dc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Partial implementations of MIME are common, and they are designed to allow developers to tailor their applications to their specific requirements while still benefiting from the flexibility and compatibility that MIME provides for internet communication. For example, an email client may choose to support only basic text and HTML content types, omitting support for more specialized types like audio or video. \r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dbc9d71b-a5ba-400d-b6e6-0e30f7956528 .

camssa:470eab57-6ad6-48f1-aedf-c41ec2b4ae90 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ceebc7042ff4b3525981f67e306167d9711ac0bce6ea07a067cdb4881854db97 ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:470fac2c-a3a9-48ec-88de-f594725643ca a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The AKN4EU specification does address long-term preservation of data, information, or knowledge. It is designed to facilitate the exchange of legal and legislative information, it does include features that could potentially support long-term preservation efforts.\r
\r
AKN4EU reference: https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu            \r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7fd66e90-175d-473d-aaee-439d18ab883f .

