        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Core Location Vocabulary specification foresees some requirements that can be implemented incrementally, such as its properties. In this sense, the specification consists of properties and classes, which can be implemented incrementally, depending on the use case.

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7c8aa633-bb3c-4ce9-97e9-9907abc926f2 .

