camssa:4793bba6-0f2d-4f39-9e41-b7e5daaedd95 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41d261f5-46a6-4079-be21-d84f1b9b4179 .

camssa:4795c965-1bcf-4841-9674-c98ac6328993 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ISO 3166-1 specification is integrated in some Authority tables (e.g., Country) of the Publications Office (OP) of the European Union, but the specification as such is not included in any open repository of standards at European level.\r
\r
OP reference, Authority tables:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/authority-tables?msclkid=72f85375b00d11ec9c13d3f9f6befab0'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:728dd6d1-4ee5-4f13-b3b8-46621545cdaf .

camssa:47995db8-946e-4580-be81-e57b03a61806 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OAS is not related to multilingualism, therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.  \r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9b5fdae1-f5c5-469a-a7ed-05265f71dd36 .

