camssa:47a4817b-c968-4593-aebb-830efb0710e9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAIS provides a reference model framework from which to set responisbilities for organisations involved in the long-term preservation of Information archives.  The OAIS specification comprises different strategies in which it can be done, depending on the type of archives or the needs of the designated community, meaning that implementations of the reference model can vary, and therefore can be met partially.\r
\r
OAIS specification:\r
https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/650x0m2.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7c669975-dc8b-48e6-993e-c1779b191283 .

