camssa:47c0f162-a743-404a-aa19-6c77773dbf13 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the Dataspace Protocol is not involved in protection against unauthorised changes, some aspects of the entire group of IDS specifications, such as the IDS "Connector" concept and metadata provisioning, which improves data traceability and data integrity.

IDSA Dataspace Protocol: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:096aa7bc-9ab6-4bbd-bd44-a3b0fc547ed0 .

camssa:47c369ff-daff-4099-8d6a-21135c4dbf2d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAML 2.0 is a format that allows seamless cross-border interoperability between systems, independently of existing implementations.\r
\r
To demonstrate this fact is worth to take into account that in the context of Connecting Europe Facility (CEF), the CEF eID Building Block has been developed to support the (eiDAS) regulation. This building block includes technical specifications composing the “eiDAS eiD profile”.  Among these specifications, the eiDAS SAML Attribute Profile defines the SAML 2.0 attributes to be used for the assertion of natural and legal person identity between eIDAS nodes. \r
\r
Regulation (EU) No 2021/1153 Reference: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/en/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A32021R1153\r
\r
eID Building Block Reference:\r
https://hadea.ec.europa.eu/news/eid-discover-one-cef-building-blocks-2022-06-27_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e8b3394a-e97b-41bf-b901-a945a94b826a .

camssa:47c58f67-c87f-408c-bbc6-2be99a7a8957 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:47c6e6fb-4c44-46f8-bfe4-3f8e96a5caee a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b122f4f42ca2089ee158a31d932d6a0332aa3a4d04acce1e2e7aa140815a0ec ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:47cb2773-2e3f-4633-aca2-4d532c35ae4f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Better Regulation Toolbox is an internal European Commission resource designed as a complement to the Commission's Better regulation guideline. It provides more specific and operational guidance to those involved with different elements regarding EU legislation.
The construction of European Laws and policies aims to be proportionate to users needs, rights and duties, therefore the specification defines the development of public policies and laws with adaptability and applicability in multiple contexts at it's core. In this sense being able to implement the guidelines incrementally and separately is key.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8a53e615-3dc3-43de-a2e8-1fdc2d0351f5 .

camssa:47ce834d-d7f9-4beb-b72f-1cdfe8d2dd7c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:47d03218-7a6e-4e9f-b06b-f299ad5e0b76 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"GraphQL is mature enough to consider its use, or suitability, in the development of digital solutions and services. Although its ideonality will depend on the user's preferences, GraphQL is demonstrating its potential in data requests across multiple servers and systems. GraphQL is not a de facto specification intended to replace any other specification for data extraction and manipulation (such as OData or REST), as its implementation will depend on the type of service that incorporates it.\r
\r
GraphQL specification:\r
https://spec.graphql.org/October2021/#sec-Overview\r
\r
OData specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/errata03/os/complete/part1-protocol/odata-v4.0-errata03-os-\r
part1-protocol-complete.html#_Toc453752197\r
\r
REST API specification:\r
https://restfulapi.net\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:18d16cf3-465c-4638-9827-0b3ca4820c26 .

camssa:47da108b-0b14-40b0-8f7e-a92a705b869a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-1624157830122d60825aa5aa88ab70d0b140b2e7e510086699f9a9773efef6bd ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:47dadbd4-e0d9-48cf-a9c1-e0dd94c007e6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-483e8900c47b40bc67a6bd1cbfce07884b9ac5f2c85e0214f334cc37e4e65c35 ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:47e0beea-940d-4b48-86cf-434d96537f7b a cav:Score,
