camssa:4833ab0e-c26e-4ffd-8409-0ab3e1cf8a9d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The publiccode.yml specification does allow for customisation. It provides a flexible framework for documenting public sector software, with core fields to ensure consistency, while allowing optional fields to be adapted based on specific needs. This flexibility enables public administrations to tailor the metadata to reflect unique project or organisational requirements, without being overly prescriptive. As such, it supports EIF Recommendation 8 by providing a standard that can be adapted to different contexts rather than enforcing a rigid, technology-specific structure.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b0744aba-e96c-4b61-9284-2869b53c4379 .

camssa:483c2d1b-4620-4adf-bddc-dd7271f133da a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-5a7323988b5d96da801e2abd4d95248af758fe9adbbafd09dd76114629567ff4 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:483ef1d0-80a7-45f2-b42a-897db6577542 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ETSI TS 119 512 specifiction system architecture for preservation, includes a preservation interface that is provided by the preservation service and used by the client.

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2dc458ba-7625-444b-993d-2aca25d3793b .

