    cav:judgement """The purpose of PDF/A is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ee97f2d8-41ac-464e-82fa-ff895b2c7f08 .

