camssa:489a55b1-2682-4266-af4d-f0968f0e9345 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XML defines an abstract data model called "the XML Tree" that is used to structure XML documents. It is therefore reused when using XML for exchanging data across sectors.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3schools.com/xml/xml_tree.asp """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f36ffd03-f923-4b74-b062-01697fae5e8b .

camssa:489ac227-f1f3-4d4f-9f35-04d64a19f07f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DPV is not related to data access, therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e29871fe-ebd4-4da2-bc66-0c05cfb90f7d .

