camssa:4912c440-1e77-435a-b51e-637e3f313036 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CAdES Baseline Profile is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, CAdES Baseline Profile can define the interoperability aspects of “e-Seal Creation Service”, “e-Seal Verification and Validation Service”, “e-Signature Creation Service”, and “e-signature Verification and Validation Service” ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fa11d603-bd3c-4fae-8d33-fe1bb51b1bdd .

