camssa:4946e532-8d56-4eda-b808-6f8d206ff58a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPsec is included in 5 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to France, Greece, Malta, Netherlands and Spain. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Greece and Spain are aligned with at least 3 out of 4 scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets. 

CAMSS list of standards:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards

National Catalogue of France:
http://references.modernisation.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf

National Catalogue of Greece:
http://www.e-gif.gov.gr/portal/pls/portal/docs/1/211041.PDF

National Catalogue of Spain:
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES 

NIFO factsheets:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8dac6ba8-db5a-4979-9f53-d2d8b90ca5d0 .

camssa:494a5a2c-9cb3-4f83-82c8-e6d3296a4993 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

