        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b45c8f7e446b1343c6b6961290d2106768aa43c1f123f5e436d0255c003abb50 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:49504546-9db1-4847-b336-a7a9dfefe46c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Ogg is not related with data portability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2d2afeb4-9458-4ad2-a875-33b82e38e0d3 .

camssa:49515c6b-4566-4e35-9ca6-a0e37443176d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPv6 is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is 
considered not applicable to this specification.

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:acf746b3-6139-4ae2-9de0-c41b2bafd1ae .

camssa:4954f780-2bec-43c9-a5dc-ae2344705a1f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d28663fdb5deb361d5ad773d7b7ece3c6acf8d2eb7a1222a60cb08df4c93aac ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:495c6658-bf2a-4b17-92c2-480da9830ad2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The long-term preservation of data needs to be addresses by other standard means.\r
The use of XBRL GL in Turkey for example, leverages digital signatures and certificates so long-term data\r
does not need to be maintained centrally; authentication of data maintained at the enterprise is\r
accomplished through the certificates that prove the integrity of information provided at a later time.'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db799203-cf01-4158-8fab-1cd8ef23603c .

camssa:495d3a48-fbc8-427b-8d05-07edc8f073a6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GraphQL has many communities that support its maintenance and developments. The most important of them is the GraphQL technical steering committee (TSC) and the GraphQL community in Github, both of which are in constant communication and alltogether develop the specification.\r
\r
GraphQL TSC:\r
https://graphql.org/community/developers/#technical-governance\r
\r
GraphQL Github community:\r
https://github.com/graphql'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf12de23-9ce7-4f18-8238-1a63f1832c53 .

camssa:495dd145-35b2-42ee-b097-13f00533fd9c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has not been found any community sharing their data and results on national platforms. However,\r
ETSI TS 119 511 indirectly encourages the creation of communities on national platforms through ETSI\r
membership and directives.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1f01e21-c17b-474d-a967-7456cf02ba35 .

camssa:496a240f-17b9-45b7-989a-1d616db45bc2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSLT specification enables a variety of implementations, from those supporting only basic functionality to those implementing the full range of the specification’s features. (See Section 27.1-2 Example)

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/#basic-conformance'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:621ece5f-d49f-46d5-a515-f47980e97630 .

camssa:496ead1b-1478-40ff-814f-46b85a71f4fc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CIRCABC (Communication and Information Resource Centre for Administrations, Businesses and Citizens) is a collaborative platform that enables administrations, businesses and citizens to manage and share resources in private workplaces. This platform includes the WAI-ARIA specification, which is meant to facilitate the organisational aspects of this platform.

CIRCABC reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/communication-and-information-resource-centre-administrations-businesses-and-citizens-circabc/solution/circabc/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15cea047-e40f-4c02-bfdd-378e097c33f7 .

camssa:4970c900-e892-4537-8795-04c8bf91bb5b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3671439b412291ce208a0ade6313c64aeb2942059c7543ca39322c56458bcf96 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:4978a593-c09b-4cb7-b1d9-97815c2f1f7b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:497d5c39-dc40-4445-8e1a-d04da8df4d06 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By using ISO/IEC 27001, administrations can ensure that, when needed, data portability can be done ensuring the integrity of data and preserving the confidentiality of the information being exchanged. \r
\r
ISO 27001 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso-iec:27001:ed-2:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3ab2e6af-9958-48b0-a340-7ec8db95221c .

camssa:49806147-bbc2-440f-b544-26924a3e16a2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:4987cd8a-8d2e-448e-a2d9-721cd5942af7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of XHTML is to publish administrative data on the web. By allowing to publish custom data in
an understandable format, it fosters the comprehensibility of administrative data. Moreover, it also eases the
decision-making process by ensuring the data exchange and data reuse among stakeholders.

XHTML W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bc0be8d9-1c0c-4147-8401-2e05e8cf9b35 .

camssa:498a1ace-bba8-4699-82fa-ebb5997777ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDES is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF 
has a high performance on interoperability according to NIFO factsheets.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0e351c14-f091-42e7-aef6-0bac5c51c2c5 .

camssa:4992fb62-4eeb-42ad-aaba-952bb8f7660c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After searching in different European platforms, OAS has not been found to take part in the creation of communities along with the sharing of their data and results on European Platforms.\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e9643cbc-3105-404a-b334-3339d7d138fa .

camssa:4999d945-b9ab-4692-b696-a32396ed1141 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:49a225e1-1179-4846-9fd3-2237d52b2bf6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-58010a47630ff9ea23336bf3fc558deff59905e0292551fcabc95740082cb378 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:49a33aa1-13de-4145-823d-4b0f33e06dce a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cc272cd8a2e3e9c5e4edaa5ac7d59735c377a9db89d6958335a2cf0538761ab3 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:49a5cdce-d80a-4d4e-813b-d57bd99a4d17 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 allows for partial implementations, giving organisations flexibility in adopting specific elements based on their needs. For example, a manufacturer can implement only 10BASE-T or 1000BASE-T without needing to support all the possible Ethernet speeds and media types.

10BASE-T Reference:
https://www.techtarget.com/searchnetworking/definition/10BASE-T

1000BASE-T Reference:
https://www.techtarget.com/searchnetworking/definition/1000BASE-T

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a9d1780e-9689-4032-818d-c9fea417ffdb .

camssa:49ab4704-c06c-4d75-abf0-7ed018ea6ac5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP is developed by IETF which is based in the USA. Therefore, the specification cannot be regarded as a European Standard. 

IETF reference:
https://www.ietf.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ef481178-c710-4252-8b9e-3eb2354cd9b7 .

camssa:49ac7819-287d-4a8d-b47a-4b8583fb589f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 14533-1:2014 (CAdES) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html \r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8c97269-a91c-441f-b28a-f21433f9c112 .

