        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'iCalendar is based on a Multipurpose Internet Mail Extensions (MIME) content and relies on other specifications that enable formats and interoperability features for conveying calendaring and scheduling information between different systems.\r
\r
MIME:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2048\r
\r
iCalendar Basic Grammar and Conventions:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545#section-2'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d60a037f-524e-40da-9299-dd5c20b7b47b .

camssa:4a7484ae-b038-42a6-852e-70914d1ab730 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As defined on the OASIS Technical Committee (TC), only TC members are involved in the development of the OData specification. External contribution to this committee is possible through open channels.\r
\r
OData OASIS Technical Committee reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/comments/index.php?wg_abbrev=odata\r
\r
OData OASIS Technical Committee, Overview reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=odata#overview\r
\r
OData.org working groups:\r
https://www.odata.org/contribution/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b402cf8-069f-430c-9e97-5a9422a86abd .

