        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary (CCCEV) supports the exchange of information and the changes between organisations that define criteria and organisations that respond to these criteria by means of evidences.\r
\r
Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary reference (v1.0.0):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/release/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary-v100  '"""@en ;
