        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-5a7323988b5d96da801e2abd4d95248af758fe9adbbafd09dd76114629567ff4 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:4ad61cb6-9b07-49b2-b426-3c2b5b00298e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Core Location Vocabulary is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, CLV can define the interoperability aspects of the "Core Data Model" and "Data" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:52558b27-d9fb-44d1-9d32-dd0c94bc5aac .

camssa:4ad6cab0-f7e2-4306-a9c7-2a35a1dc1140 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The UDDI specification establishes a structured registry for web services, acting as a comprehensive repository that houses descriptions of web services, data on service providers, and details on accessing these services. This registry facilitates easy information sharing among administrators and stakeholders, enabling them to connect with minimal effort. Specifically, UDDI helps bridge the gap between requesters and providers, streamlining processes and fostering efficient service ecosystems.
Evidence of its implication on the OOP is that SELIS project is included within one of the main Building Blocks for the accomplishment of the once-only principle, eInvoicing. 

UDDI OASIS reference:
https://www.oasis-open.org/standard/uddi/

SELIS Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eprocurement/document/secure-electronic-invoicing-service-selis'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:17e48646-a5dc-40bd-ae67-cde3a27b6fef .

camssa:4ad9a455-3773-4e16-aa91-589fab98234f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fef5941bab92019b7692f8544de94715a42ed9ff76d89cbec4fb6f9821611925 ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:4adbf946-a743-42c1-80c4-1ab290422280 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cf1de0bf03a8ee372af0deddf9ef5c4609f5a7bb9c7e001c89d887c6789eaf56 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:4ae1028b-1ba9-4e10-b827-22270132d575 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Dataspace Protocol is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF has a high performance on interoperability according to the NIFO factsheets.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards

2023 NIFO factsheets: https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2023'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:266b0779-c547-47e0-9b76-079213992ca3 .

