camssa:4b60e5d0-a839-4ee9-ab82-c5b9a2751b12 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Dataspace Protocol aims to be versatile across various technologies by establishing rules and guidelines for data spaces. It provides frameworks that work with different technical setups, enabling smooth communication and management among diverse systems. Furthermore, the fact that the protocol uses widely spread standards such as HTTPS or ODRL confirms its technology agnostic status.

IDSA Dataspace Protocol Specification: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6f38856a-40d4-44f0-ad92-144ec2552be0 .

