        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PNG is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
