camssa:4b89213d-bede-4653-b242-87485c983854 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"PROV can indirectly support the visibility of administrative procedures, rules, data, and services by providing contextual information and traceability. By incorporating PROV into an organization's data management or governance framework, it becomes possible to capture and represent the lineage and history of administrative processes, data, and services. Provenance information can be used to document the steps and activities involved in administrative procedures, such as data collection, processing, and transformation.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV Ontology:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-o-20130430/\r
\r
PROV Data Model:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-dm-20130430/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c55a9b80-d724-4b4b-89eb-f6749d1d32f3 .

