camssa:4be3662e-5adc-4257-b08c-a62662e2bec8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of SVG as a document format for exchanging photographs helps citizens, businesses, and administrations to share information. Moreover, as it is stated in the specification document, as a graphics technology for the web it allows the scalability in terms of amounts of data, users, and different applications without hampering the interoperability nor scalability of systems.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b50365c-c1ba-4ed7-8e72-dd38ed30771e .

