        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 19941 mentions the importance of organisational policies in any scenario involving cloud computing interoperability and portability. It is detailed what possible organisational policies should be considered and incorporated thus, this could facilitate organisational interoperability agreements.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d6be80b8-13cf-42c8-bd07-e84c784d2994 .

