camssa:4ee0d990-e807-4690-a02a-d216db5dfba6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox was developed between 2015 and 2017 aiming to help those involved in the creation of public policies and laws across the European Union. Its market acceptance lies in the European Public sector which has set Better regulation and the toolbox as the tools for the development, implementation and assessment of the impact of public policies and laws.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf . """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:29727344-fa9e-41b1-8b36-456c89c556bb .

