        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'exbXML is included in 1 national catalogues of recommended specifications. It belongs to Norway. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Norway is aligned with at least 3 out of 4 scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.

