https://www.difi.no/fagomrader-og-tjenester/digitalisering-og-samordning/standarder

ebXBL RegRep reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
