        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WAI-ARIA deals with roles, states, and properties of user interface components to improve accessibility, particularly for assistive technologies. It does not specifically address data integrity or provide mechanisms to protect information against unauthorized changes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

