camssa:4f585a75-b8b4-45b0-9a4d-a36e08f56613 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ODRL does not directly help with the provision of application programming interfaces (APIs) or Web services.\r
\r
However, ODRL aims to ensure consistency when describing the rules and access conditions to datasets or services. By providing this machine-readable format information, the specification makes data more accessible and comprehensive allowing its proper reuse. \r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b10cd0c4-c077-48c1-af4a-3f2c5e7b2676 .

camssa:4f5b3140-f983-4dba-8e64-d83569169812 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification has been developed by European Institutions for its implementation across borders to enhance the law-making and the processes. It is involved in an organisational agreement between European Institutions "INTERINSTITUTIONAL AGREEMENT BETWEEN THE EUROPEAN PARLIAMENT, THE COUNCIL OF THE EUROPEAN UNION AND THE EUROPEAN COMMISSION ON BETTER LAW-MAKING - INTERINSTITUTIONAL AGREEMENT" that aims to enhance the law-making for efficiency and effectiveness of European processes.\r
\r
European Comission Webpage:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/index_en\r
\r
INTERINSTITUTIONAL AGREEMENT:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=uriserv:OJ.L_.2016.123.01.0001.01.ENG&toc=OJ:L:2016:123:TOC"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d3384c25-6886-462e-be8c-e6fb66d31967 .

camssa:4f5c3abf-6c29-4c1e-bad4-02f5eba2689f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 is a key component in the development of some European cross-border projects and initiatives. However, ISO 3166-1 does not encourage the creation of communities nor promotes the sharing of data and results in any European platform.\r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf1b7076-da63-4006-a24e-4ce1f74361b8 .

camssa:4f5eb14c-2d1f-4e8e-897b-dee520a68d0c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SVG is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:406194a1-3746-4ba8-9463-aa459165e2e7 .

camssa:4f609f70-8cb2-4631-b5cf-893f00c0805f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of GITB TDL is not related to the visibility of administrative procedures, rules data, and services. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
GITB TDL reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/introduction/index.html#what-is-the-gitb-tdl'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a619fd66-181f-4cf6-94b7-e1cad5c408db .

