        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of WAI-ARIA is not related to the secure processing of data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:68d35204-66db-4d33-8aef-b4aa23bebdf4 .

camssa:4f8c010d-1fce-4c66-a4ca-3d88d6009943 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData was approved as an OASIS Standard in 2014 and as an ISO standard in 2017. Currently, there is OData version 4.1. Microsoft, as other corporations (see OData ecosystem reference) and organisations such as the World Health Organization (WHO), are using this specification in some of their systems.\r
\r
Besides, the OData Technical committee is very active in terms of new releases.\r
\r
OData Blog:\r
https://www.odata.org/blog/OData-Published-as-an-ISO-Standard/\r
\r
OData Technical Committee:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=odata#technical\r
\r
OData ecosystem reference:\r
https://www.odata.org/ecosystem/\r
\r
Microsoft-OData reference:\r
https://docs.microsoft.com/es-es/odata/\r
\r
WHO reference:\r
https://www.who.int/data/gho/info/gho-odata-api'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6f0a133b-fc1c-4e27-80bd-a4a7bc341d94 .

camssa:4f8d65c5-35ed-4387-b732-25e4670b5630 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Core Public Organisation Vocabulary was released in December 2016. Since 2016, CPOV has released two major versions. Its first aspiration was to become a common data model for describing public organisations in the European Union. CPOV can therefore be considered mature enough for its use in the development of products and services.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary

CPOV github releases:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/CPOV/tree/master/releases'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f6b94ea7-1dee-4a75-831c-d05c6af50e81 .

camssa:4f974ed8-1cf4-479a-8038-0c1315c449e0 a cav:Score,
