        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary can be implemented using other technologies as well. This makes the specification usable across different platforms and systems.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:20990a62-6f0f-416e-9971-8a24417005c4 .

