camssa:4fc5b718-280d-4601-9bf6-d3b5266bf7b3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 512 protocols can be used in any business domains of the european public administrations. In this sense the use of different preservation schemes in the specification that build the so called preservation profiles. This capabilities make the specification truly domain agnostic.

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5757e484-c5b8-4e5e-8dc2-6afb81a138a5 .

