camssa:50073d1e-76da-44bc-847b-c73020b42e48 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSLT specification is designed to be technology-agnostic, focusing on data transformation and manipulation without being tied to any specific technology. (See Section 2.9)

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/#extensibility'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5510e09f-2c97-48f0-a766-52f83fe06af4 .

