camssa:5015212e-5517-426f-beed-9b5d7b71700a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Even though at the moment of elaborating the assessment the specification is used in the context of the cross-border reusability of interoperability solutions, the specification in itself is used to describe these solutions in a repository. Therefore, ADMS does not foster the creation of innovative solutions. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:87a4ad46-d47f-4a0d-a756-eff7313dd4f9 .

camssa:501781ce-bc54-44fe-a837-8a34500b9414 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP specification does not directly ensure or guarantee data processing accuracy. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:599a0e01-afa0-4411-8247-939a169e0154 .

camssa:501b275f-4853-4e0d-941e-d7044d0b0196 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is independent from any software, hardware, or operating system. It can be used and applied independently from other standards, or software requierements. \r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fd0e6cef-7a63-40c7-b380-b71bae87ef8d .

