camssa:50230422-9dd7-4a61-9aae-2440c6b55566 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification was initially developed in 2017 with its initial version 1.0. It was used as the basis for the development of European Specifications and building blocks enhancing the development of public services. It is being used in the SMP software for eDelivery.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009\r
\r
eDelivery software Reference: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/SMP+software'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:26547518-5715-4d6e-af0f-0122bb4b32b5 .

camssa:5029f75a-7321-40df-b46d-07472de8d40b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-41c6fd2dadb03cc64aad82cfa14f545c084f1a955a3ab7a61aab416a138c5dce ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:502f7c2c-13b8-4e88-b8e6-265c62f6e22e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The SOAP 1.2 is included in the  European Interoperability Architecture (EIA) study explores the need for a European interoperability architecture facilitating the establishment of European public services (cross border eGovernment services). The document includes references to the Reference Interoperability agreement(RIA), where SOAP can be mapped with the technical agreement for “ Agreement on the technical connection aspects for electronic data Exchange” in the context of epSOS Project. \r
\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/isa_2.1_eia-finalreport-commonvisionforaneia.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a6ff0e04-ac44-4d1f-ad88-97bce8f6adef .

camssa:5032fe10-051c-48e1-962f-f0fd5f836fb6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a16c678a586cf542d2ae1d6cd8a987bd6ed0b2af52ba0e04d8872fe616a9b7bd ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:50342dab-4095-4e31-bf77-70fa08b66086 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d129862d6c9639e131c7d5eef095af16ef94d57ec0d52f955bf909ba8ec688e8 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:50357f43-3055-49a3-8474-d075bb54d861 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"As is described in section 1 of the specification's document, the specification specifies a format and a mechanism for establishing, locating, accessing and authenticating a trusted list which makes available trust service status information so that interested parties may determine the status of listed trust services at a given time. 

ETSI TS 119 612:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fbd3244f-8b0e-49c5-9ec1-06cbb47a2644 .

camssa:5035ae2b-53ff-4723-bd89-5956c61aad7a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:50360950-5990-4333-b82a-54cac14dd272 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The Internet Protocol is a necessary specification for the implementation of the once-only-principle as it allows cross-border communications over the internet."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cd12ffb7-b98b-481c-b782-4d3fc71f22fb .

camssa:503ef2f2-e57f-4979-8bf7-6880cfbfe021 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:503fed9a-a990-4136-8e34-eb670cd3914b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification enables data portability to a certain extent, which can support the implementation or evolution of European public services. FTP provides a standardized protocol for transferring files between systems and applications, allowing data to be exchanged and shared.\r
\r
By adhering to the FTP specification, systems and applications supporting European public services can utilize FTP to transfer data in a consistent and interoperable manner. FTP can facilitate the exchange of various types of data, including documents, records, and datasets, which are integral to public service operations.\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc959'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c689f15c-3ceb-410c-a59c-bcd14897e589 .

camssa:50424a41-a505-4367-bf6d-4cc17f52dc6e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 12 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. These Member States including ODF on their catalogues are  Croatia, Denmark, Estonia, France, Greece, Ireland, Malta, Netherlands, Norway, Slovenia, Sweden and UK.\r
\r
Joinup Assessment Standards: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2f3a04f3-7988-4f0d-83ff-35488b30b91f .

camssa:50452245-72e0-4533-90f9-e0f7ad3a5ee3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-51782b9aa4b92f4aba322a549b9d3972e304ca68f9353073c29add782502d910 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:504604e3-d764-4e7e-86a3-55b6c85f910e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification builds on standards that are integrated within the ISO OSI model (ISO/IEC 7498-1:1994) layers, such as HTTPS. The primary aim of the OSI model standard is to delineate interactions between systems, regardless of these protocols, by providing clear and adaptable guidelines for implementation.

IDSA Dataspace Protocol Specification: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme

ISO/IEC 7498-1:1994: https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html?browse=tc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:127a2d45-3c3c-49ab-97c9-59253184d2fc .

camssa:50489bd5-4e34-4bb6-95db-48c60e79801a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

