    cav:value "100" .

camssa:507e58b9-68b0-48b5-8de3-a8874d91025f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is often evaluated through various means, including practical 
implementations and pilot projects. A 2019-paper related to the 17th International Conference on Emerging eLearning Technologies and Applications (ICETA) discusses DNS security in V2X networks and highlights DoH as a way to secure name services in V2X networks, which demonstrates the effectiveness of the specification.

An overview of DNS security in V2X networks: https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/9040111'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8071da33-4274-4647-bf8c-b463d37dd05a .

camssa:50801c88-7e26-402c-9fbc-fbc959b1e0dc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 can facilitate the modelling of business processes when it comes to anything related to trusted lists, as it can establish, locate, access and authenticate with security and makes available the trust service status information.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 612 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8685a2ee-1466-4bed-8a67-8c1d902ce0b8 .

