camssa:50ec634a-79d6-429e-a984-60e773747cb1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary helps to the enabling of visibility of administrative procedures, rules data, and services by providing a structured vocabulary for describing organisations that have gained legal entity status through a formal registration process. Furthermore, the Registered Organization Vocabulary, despite not being maintained anymore, is still used by the Open Standards for Linking Organizations (OSLO), more concrete in the application profile of "Slimme Stadsdistributie". 

The "Slimme Stadsdistributie" application profile reuses terms from the Registered Organization Vocabulary to represent the fundamental concept of a Geregistreerde Organisatie and its key properties, such as its registration identifier and its legal name. This ensures a common semantic understanding of what constitutes a registered organisation in the context of smart urban distribution.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

OSLO Smart City Distribution - Application profile Reference:
https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/slimme-stadsdistributie/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0262d1f9-2cae-4104-8063-a5ee0a97b459 .

