\r
Amazon Web Services reference:\r
https://docs.aws.amazon.com/apigateway/api-reference/\r
\r
Facebook reference:\r
https://zappysys.com/blog/get-data-from-facebook-in-ssis-using-rest-api/#:~:text=Facebook%20provides%20rich%20set%20of%20REST%20API%20to,popular%20programming%20languages%20%28e.g.%20C%23%2C%20Java%2C%20Ruby%2C%20Python%29.'"""@en ;
