camssa:514b6a22-6f5b-4150-9278-2b804b8a6747 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Domibus adheres to messaging standards such as the AS4 profile of the ebMS (ebXML Messaging Service) standard. This standardization promotes consistent data structures and formats during message exchange, which can aid in data portability by ensuring that data is correctly interpreted and processed by different systems.\r
\r
AS4 Profile of ebMS 3.0:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ebxml-msg/ebms/v3.0/profiles/AS4-profile/v1.0/AS4-profile-v1.0.html\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:427a72de-fbbc-4533-84e5-b708d6dce4a7 .

