camssa:517ac457-c62c-48e5-9675-b132ec726cde a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES (ISO 14533-3:2017) is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, it can define the interoperability aspects of the "e-Seal Preservation Service" and "e-Signature Preservation Service" ABBs of the EIRA Technical Infrastructure View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8ae2e5a6-bf72-4c2e-b1a6-35ec8ea63535 .

camssa:517af78f-1ef7-4daa-8d6a-0b743c9674c2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WS-BPEL is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, WS-BPEL can define the interoperability aspects of the "Orchestration Service", and "Orchestration component" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
\r
\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ddedcc7c-b39b-42dd-9d83-534ffa1d1b9b .

camssa:517e788e-ad5d-49ae-a229-3f291e80784e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15ac90f3-8af0-49d0-a72d-c0d940797730 .

camssa:517fa65a-957c-400c-b5a1-5e24e95bdc6b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cda14df3-4011-4674-a7c1-562dfd07e82b .

