camssa:51931764-f424-4ed4-a20b-786d6ca9cab4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is mature enough to consider its use in the development of digital solutions/services as its \r
documented use in an Italian government website mentioning the use of ETSI EN 319 532-3 in their Certified \r
Email (PEC), providing technical rules that envisage eIDAS Regulation.\r
ESI/REM service does not foresee to replace any other specification for exchanging transactions securily, as \r
it is the default framework in this domain.\r
\r
ESI Wiki Link not Public, Log required:\r
https://esiprivatewiki.etsi.org/\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf\r
\r
REM SERVICES - Criteri di adozione degli standard ETSI - Italy Policy IT:\r
https://www.agid.gov.it/sites/default/files/repository_files/rem_services_-_criteri_di_adozione_degli_standard_etsi_-_policy_it_1.0_28_maggio_2021.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42da3730-f870-4a29-a97e-5f3a98b67173 .

