        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Domibus can somehow contribute to facilitating organisational interoperability agreements given that it provides a common and standardised tool for the communication and data exchange between different entities. \r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus\r
'"""@en ;
