camssa:51b2a972-d705-4319-b9ab-178dfec93739 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "XAdES is part of the electronic signature stack of specifications, this group of specifications are aimed to ensure the availability and validation of signed data. Therefore, the implementation of eSignatures involving XAdES fosters secure and trustworthy data exchange. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aafe9b6b-f7ed-4ce0-b454-bdee4436ba26 .

