camssa:51c1e951-f573-4464-a8e9-8ed45a007e09 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SCIM protocol document explicitly addresses data protection and its aligment to relevant regulations. Some considerations include what to do in case of disclosure of sensitive information in URIs or secure storage and handling of sensitive data. However, the responsibility for ensuring compliance with data protection regulations rests on the organizations implementing SCIM and the broader ecosystem in which it is used.

SCIM Protocol: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc7644'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41dfb22a-2c8c-4bb3-a98c-9c593c755cb8 .

