camssa:51fe9d81-c925-4a97-a497-28c4f76298e7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The iCalendar specification allows for customization through the use of custom properties and parameters, enabling developers to add additional data and metadata specific to their application's requirements. This flexibility allows for tailoring the standard to suit various use cases and customizing the representation of calendar data as needed.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a4dc7f7d-6733-4738-aef8-811669262f40 .

