        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "SHACL is a web standard whose only purpose is RDF data graphs validation. Therefore, it is not a commonly accepted business process modelling standard or specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:798e4381-cf7d-42e6-95fb-8f8645f8a113 .

