camssa:5222fbc7-fa29-44d5-863b-2f803f6c4cb8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"While ISO/IEC 19944-1 does not delve into the technical details of implementing these mechanisms, it provides a foundation for organisations to establish appropriate confidentiality measures within their cloud environments. By adopting the classification scheme outlined in ISO/IEC 19944-1, organisations can identify and categorize data based on its sensitivity, including confidential information. This classification enables organisations to apply appropriate confidentiality mechanisms based on the data's classification.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a27c136e-a215-4824-bf33-163e0445e8af .

