        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 8 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. This Member States are Croatia, France, Malta, the Netherlands, Norway, Poland Spain and Sweden.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ff8fa3f9-e6b0-4217-8816-71dc159b6721 .

