camssa:5353a962-e92e-46ab-8f1a-f2676a0877d9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There is no direct assessment on the efficiency of the ebXML specification. However, according to the OASIS Technology Reports, several studies on different digital solutions from the public and private domain indirectly assess the specification's efficiency.\r
\r
OASIS Technology Reports reference: \r
http://xml.coverpages.org/ebXML.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bbb9b421-18ea-495f-a161-129baccec24c .

