camssa:535d02d4-e3e6-4c5e-bab9-33ad130e53d0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification eases the identification of parties capabilities and information to make proper and reliable data exchange between parties. Therefore, by implementing the specification administrative information is clearer and available to every party interested.\r
\r
The specification:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505000"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fdaaea8b-3c3c-4f46-adf0-ac5f934caa1b .

