camssa:536a299d-2a26-4647-a7d6-7c683c7474de a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Mime is already mapped in the EIRA Libary of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, MIME covers the "Data exchange" ABB of the EIRA technical view.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v501'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:56393011-a6b9-4631-84fe-aeb7f9f452ee .

camssa:536aac16-7e80-43e9-b372-0aebbf7c0be9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The French "General framework for improving accessibility" (RGAA) includes the WAI-ARIA specification in their e-accessibility policies. This implies a willingness to use this technology.\r
\r
RGAA reference: \r
https://www.numerique.gouv.fr/publications/rgaa-accessibilite/methode-rgaa/criteres/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ef87e109-d21b-4edc-b870-5ea4e2547be0 .

