camssa:537667d5-cf68-4013-90c7-b26abe0d5c1d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"IEEE Std 802.3-2022 efficiency is evaluated through industry feedback, testing, research, adoption, and ongoing updates. It's being tested in IEEE projects to ensure it meets requirements. The standard's adaptability allows the working group to address evolving needs. As a result, numerous new projects are currently being developed to leverage its capabilities.

IEEE Working Group Projects:
https://www.ieee802.org/3/

IEEE Working Group Details:
https://standards.ieee.org/ieee/802.3/10422/

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:415dd09f-8077-4902-b1e7-c7600b544ba6 .

camssa:5384ed53-31c2-461f-97dc-55b9f09d9039 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'REST is an architecture style that defines how different systems should interact. REST APIs generate a way of accessing web services in a simple and flexible way without having any processing, thus explicitly addressing and enabling e-accessibility\r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dba234e0-8603-416c-9452-59240061e4fb .

