camssa:53de80c7-aee2-4423-8240-bd7c740bb34b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary is a vocabulary built on established standards to facilitate interoperability. However, the inherent characteristics of RDF and the development of Core Business Vocabulary (CBV) suggest that there were areas where the approach could be further optimised for broader and more efficient data modeling of legal entities.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

Publication of the Core Business Vocabulary as RegOrg on the W3C standards track Reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/registered-organization-vocabulary/news/publication-core-busin

Core Business Vocabulary Reference:
https://semiceu.github.io/Core-Business-Vocabulary/releases/2.1.0/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:51e40191-cc58-4c2c-8b4b-b3e0fbd0ea91 .

