camssa:5499710b-e7f3-4b53-b1e6-05eb30e9d766 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry is associated with EIRA ABB's in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). 
More specifically, it is associated with the "Artificial Intelligence" and "Audit" ABBs from the "Technical-Application" View and the "Analytics" and "Telemetry" ABBs from the "Technical-Infrastructure" View of the current EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS).

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/solution/elis'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5e7f30f7-3f91-4624-ba96-d5f80a4c8376 .

