    cav:refersTo camssa:f2c7d7bc-a1dd-4ba9-837a-f8c98a12e01b .

camssa:54dc7d12-e743-4de8-84a4-c80dd9bed255 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s Intellectual Property Rights Policy is based on Standard Essential Patents (SEP). The policy implemented by the standardisation organisation seeks to reduce risks and ensure that the standards are available under (F) RAND basis and Royalty-free, it means with no cost or fee to be paid when possible. \r
\r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f087b16d-77d7-4ccf-91ba-4082c6b4be0c .

