camssa:551cd96b-aa23-4a01-aea1-2a61c2c8dace a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is independent of any software, hardware, or operating system. So it can be said that OpenPM2 is independent of any specific technology or platform. Additionally, OpenPM2 provides a set of tools that can be used for the development of projects implementing this methodology. \r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f172bdda-75d9-4266-a4e9-ea153eb73022 .

