        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WSDL provides a standardized way to define the inputs, outputs, and operations of a web service, it is not inherently a tool for modeling business processes.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b798e01-433e-4f24-bfa5-f6f09aba3508 .

