camssa:55fb81c2-19a4-469b-84af-9e35eb60307b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Publiccode.yaml is an Italian initiative. Italy has reached a good performance when it comes to the EIF
monitoring mechanisms, and specifically the last NIFO Factsheets. According to the specification
documentation, there is also Germany which is starting to use the standard for describing software. In this
case, Germany achieves good levels for the elements that there is data available, but exist a significant
quanity of principles that Germany does not have information to analyse it, therefore, it is difficult to consider
the results positive.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html

NIFO Factsheets Italy:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/inline-files/DPA_Factsheets_2021_Italy_vFINAL.pdf

NIFO Factsheets Germany:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/inline-files/DPA_Factsheets_2021_Germany_vFinal.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e9fffe81-544a-4f24-abfc-f93dfafb7c99 .

