        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Test Bed can be extended where needed to support domain-specific capabilities. For example, you can add processing handler extensions to the test bed's capabilities to undertake actions that it does not natively support. \r
\r
GITB TDL reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/introduction/index.html#processing-handlers\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f970afdf-5c8a-4022-967f-feddd9ef4d85 .

