        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification was developed in 2001, by OASIS. It has been evolved over the years demonstrating that it overcame the possible issues raised on the developement and implementation. Moreover, the version of the issue being assessed is the 3.0, which enforces the maturity of the spec for its use in the developement of products and services. \r
\r
XACML OASIS reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/errata01/xacml-3.0-core-spec-errata01.html"""@en ;
