camssa:57236e12-d615-4937-9665-4ad0e480074c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Contributions and improvements on the open-sorce community can be requested through the bitbucket and Github repository, where reviews of Domibus are held. Nonetheless, developers feedback is only visible with the prior registration on the eDelivery user community.\r
\r
eDelivery Developers community:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/eDelivery+Developers+Community+management\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus\r
\r
Domibus in Bitbucket:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/code/projects/EDELIVERY/repos/domibus/browse?at=9d8ec59fcdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f0f1b213-50e5-4e79-923e-645cfea18bae .

camssa:573250ef-4318-4a25-b3c2-10b07fb4e117 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The specification is included in eDelivery Service provided by CEF, which has the aim of providing a secure infrastructure and services for data exchanging. Additionally, eDelivery SMP 1.10 is based on the OASIS’s SMP 1.0 standard, which provides security features involving X509 encryption. Therefore, eDelivery SMP 1.10 eases the secure and trustworthy data exchange between different parties involved. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b5da9e3b-4f00-42e2-aacc-7c09f01bb4e2 .

camssa:57361492-93f0-4512-a158-f277e87a9cd5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:5740c13e-db4c-4c69-b303-1b97ae2ff189 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0e9bb259b84413d890a0fd548e40f255bb983a3add2eb7a737283f711e23d523 ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:57416863-173e-4668-a2fe-67c1abc54d9a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """LegalDocML is available at OASIS's web page for everyone to study. \r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4ecba98c-b67b-4e4a-8b5a-07235d2d31a2 .

camssa:57446b35-92c6-4f77-b964-644a444fbee3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 7498:1 is designed to be language-agnostic and can be used in a multilingual context. The OSI model is well-suited for use in a multilingual context, as its conceptual framework is independent of language, and it has been employed internationally in the development of network communication standards.

ISO/IEC 7498:1: https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dc7da1c6-6496-405c-8dcd-f86c6e9c2e3d .

camssa:5746cee7-03fc-4837-872c-81b33d3e477a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 is platform-agnostic, meaning it can be implemented across various hardware and software platforms, ensuring broad compatibility and interoperability. It provides a common framework for a wide range of technologies and applications, independent of any specific vendor or proprietary solution.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:23d1b3f2-b2aa-4495-b483-e5a89331f3fd .

