        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSV is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, CSV can define the interoperability aspects of the "Representation" ABB of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
