        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The E-ARK CSIP focuses on the organization and structure of digital information packages, the use of standard file formats, and the inclusion of descriptive metadata. These aspects are applicable to various domains and sectors that deal with digital records and archives, therefore it can be considered domain-agnostic.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ca503efe-4d5d-42f1-b6c8-e936fab3d584 .

