camssa:5922a74b-b0d3-4d01-99be-0fd2cb4a4ec0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TIFF/IT does not define a cross-sector reusable data model, but defines a computer file format for storing raster graphics images. \r
\r
TIFF/IT ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/34342.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70c7a5b9-2195-48af-b37b-4956899e604e .

camssa:5924cff6-7c2c-4699-9843-7d7f508d8034 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As long as there exists a time-stamping client and a time-stamping server that meets the requirements defined in IETF RFC 3161, the specification will be platform agnostic.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bd8135c5-d8a4-4ac9-9dd7-04333b78f84b .

