camssa:594592dc-c745-4ded-b283-0d3f3973394a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Secure processing of data generally involves additional security measures and technologies, such as encryption, access control and authentication. These security measures are implemented at the application level and are not part of the core MIME standard.\r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045\r
\r
S/MIME specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5751.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f318f099-4822-4da9-8c20-51432905849e .

