camssa:594f59f9-60b5-45a6-be03-4bda6103f33c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSS v2.1 has been used to develop innovative solutions in the past, but with the new version CSS3, all web solutions that want to be developed with CSS use the latest version because it is more efficient and has more features.\r
\r
CSS v2.1 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2011/REC-CSS2-20110607/\r
\r
CSS Color Module Level 3 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2018/REC-css-color-3-20180619/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28faae88-dce3-418b-bbfb-ad49f78a33bc .

