    cav:value "1" .

camssa:595da067-573d-4734-8e34-0071344d6623 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The registration process to join and participate in the W3C Verifiable Credentials Working Group depends on whether the stakeholder works for a W3C Member organization or not. If their employer is not able to join W3C and the stakeholder considers they have the expertise and availability to participate, they may request to participate as an Invited Expert.\r
\r
W3C Verifiable Credentials Working Group: \r
https://www.w3.org/groups/wg/vc/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:882bcc1e-2ff3-4a53-960c-aabc171512c1 .

camssa:595f8e78-ffbe-44b7-b966-dfe182c2eefb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TGF includes several principles and guidelines related to the secure exchange of data. It enphasises the importance of security, privacy and confidentiality in the development of digital solutions and services, promoting securty controls, use of cryptographic techniques, and the implementation of the service oriented architecture (SOA) security principles.\r
\r
TGF specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html\r
\r
SOA Specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/soa-rm/soa-ra/v1.0/cs01/soa-ra-v1.0-cs01.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97206661-f22d-4e77-ad8f-4bd3e2d4d1f8 .

