camssa:596cf10e-2d4c-4225-84a0-995ce848cc3e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Standard for Public Code is a set of criteria that supports public organizations in developing and maintaining software and policy together, so it can be said that Standard for Public code fosters the visibility of administrative rules, data, services and decision-making of a public administration. \r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:64b6a106-4bd2-42a9-ad15-e356e7c00b04 .

camssa:59700062-6b82-41b0-b503-bf8c563755ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT-AP is available for its implementation and use on Github and Joinup, the European Commission collaborative platform for the reuse of IT Solutions.\r
\r
See: \r
\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/about  \r
https://github.com/SEMICeu/DCAT-AP"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:62ab1a8b-c1a8-4b79-bf5f-06cae0e45dd2 .

