camssa:59740728-8329-49b0-9bb4-16e4fa382224 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """UDDI is not defining a data model per se, instead of providing a data model the specification provides an Information model with the features and constraints for using it. Each initiative or specific type of repository can map information from the informational model to build their own data model. \r
See: \r
uddi.org/pubs/uddi_v3.htm#_Toc85908471"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1dec495d-5afd-4f7c-80e2-fd558cbeb25d .

camssa:59783eef-7274-46b8-94c3-11087fb8dd2c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of W3C Best Practices within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1988cf6-47cc-41fd-85b6-f907e2bf90a5 .

