        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Extensible Forms Description Language specification permits extensibility including custom items, options and external code functions. 

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab4999c3-b3cd-439e-b3c3-45a9f59ff413 .

camssa:5992a4f9-dc9d-4caa-8f2a-eb7b6bff9266 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification is being directly used to create innovative solutions. For instance, it is included in AgroPortal, the homepage of ontologies and semantic artefacts in agri-food and related domains. In 2019, ETSI released a new SAREF ontology extension smart agriculture, thus why its involvement in AgroPortal.

AgroPortal SAREF: 
https://agroportal.lirmm.fr/ontologies/SAREF'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5cefd8c2-1929-49c9-b9fd-c6a52994f7d2 .

