        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PAdES is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
PAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/67937.html\r
\r
PAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db144ade-fd69-48d6-8119-a988c0d2ed0b .

camssa:5994bcb1-215a-4453-af33-85a353074b7c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Cryptographic algorithms are the basis of e-signatures encryption. ETSI TS 119 511 is furthermore\r
developed for trust service providers for the storing and retrieval of information and data that require a high\r
degree of security in their processing and exchange.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37d7327e-4797-4382-a426-fdfd8bbc3424 .

