        "89%StrengthOfAssessmentScoreAverage" .

camssa:5a179eda-19c1-4775-b1bf-84564c0f85ea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"While this specification's scope is not explicitly directed towards visibility of administrative procedures, rules data, and services, the new specification can improve it by defining a simple way to send or request data, using a serialization format (JSON-LD) which is very familiar to many developers so that rapid adoption is facilitated. NGSI-LD supports a wide range of administrative and operational tasks through its API, covering the creation, querying, subscription and management of entities and their data. This includes advanced geo-temporal queries and subscription mechanisms that notify users of changes, enabling dynamic and responsive administrative processes.

GS CIM 009: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/CIM/001_099/009/01.07.01_60/gs_CIM009v010701p.pdf

GS CIM 008: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gr/CIM/001_099/008/01.02.01_60/gr_CIM008v010201p.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2074c27b-862e-43a8-a8d6-2221ff700e26 .

camssa:5a18b752-5a57-4b58-860f-116f99fca3eb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents can provide valuable context and provenance information that aids in understanding how interfaces are utilized and their interactions with data and services. Organizations can utilize PROV in conjunction with other techniques and standards to enhance the exposure and documentation of interfaces. For example, PROV-AQ describes data access mechanisms and query services for working with provenance records associated with web pages, resources or other deployments, Such as the Prov-Store, a public provenance repository that enables a URI provenance that can be queried.\r
\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV-AQ\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-aq/\r
\r
ProvStore:\r
https://eprints.soton.ac.uk/365509/2/poster-abstract.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97d6d821-943e-4afa-a5e0-9054fc83bf75 .

camssa:5a18c414-e78e-4843-850d-e2c4141be32d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in the European collaborative platform for the development of ICT solution Joinup.  \r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/universal-description-discovery-and-integration/distribution/uddi-specification"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a289c507-41c4-464f-b1e2-e3cefa1aea18 .

camssa:5a1e12d2-1e23-4809-aaa0-180cd86b6bd1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OAS is to help with the development and documentation of APIs, with any kind of restrictions related to the domain it is to be applied; therefore, OAS is domain-agnostic and can be used in any domain.\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9775471b-ad04-4bed-a16d-84bd39d03f20 .

camssa:5a1f0574-980a-4525-b8bb-e30255728312 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES (ISO 14533-3:2017) has the ISO community that supports the development of: International standards, Technical Specifications, Technical Report and Publicly Available Specification.\r
\r
The ISO standardization process:\r
https://www.iso.org/stages-and-resources-for-standards-development.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06230707-9283-40e2-b50c-3981348c3c06 .

camssa:5a20ca3d-39c7-4e98-ab96-97e0ab8eccad a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to this specification cloud computing is defined as a paradigm for enabling network access to a scalable and elastic pool of shareable physical or virtual resources with self-service provisioning and administration on-demand. Therefore, information is only provided once-only and reused as needed.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1bbaafc-2e90-4d1c-b04d-b15b7d80b336 .

camssa:5a2c9ba9-33f8-4798-b9de-0872a38bfce1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV provides customisation options that enable users to tailor the specification to their particular needs. Users can define their own quality dimensions, metrics, and indicators, or extend existing ones to accommodate domain-specific requirements. This flexibility allows for partial implementations where only the necessary components are implemented or customised according to the specific context.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:975765a1-a691-4cc6-9112-633199f7098d .

camssa:5a36a489-7355-45bc-a82c-b79bda9a542f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are several existing mechanisms to assess JSON conformity. Different types of validators depending on users’ needs.\r
See: \r
https://github.com/nst/JSONTestSuite\r
https://jsoncompare.com/#!/simple/\r
https://jsonformatter.curiousconcept.com/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06386fb7-d499-43ed-9c26-7b234e6317a5 .

camssa:5a3dfdab-961e-4d96-8f6e-3a7b83f9a0e1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Kendo UI survey of more than 4000 developers showed the following resulting that justify the fostering of HTML5 toward innovative solution: 63%  indicate that they are actively developing with HTML5.\r
\r
See: https://www.w3.org/2012/12/html5-cr.html.en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a59709e0-fb8a-43b6-8b2d-d2d8da169fc4 .

