camssa:5a67a652-9c65-4d64-9ea0-5ab6042a1ee9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox fosters the secure and trustworthy data exchange between citizens, businesses and public administrations by proposing methods to ensure that ICT systems and solutions developed under the scope of public services include security regarding data exchanged between parties interested. Providing this checklist method helps the development of public policies that guarantee secure and trustworthy data exchange.\r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7f23c706-5a06-45ab-bcbd-e5002f7f2d2b .

camssa:5a68eddb-3477-4cd6-b17e-119fa8798f81 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OSI is not related to the reuse of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3cf453b9-2041-43ae-bd26-b9e27e3a00c1 .

camssa:5a699a35-00d5-4713-8217-0487fa2845bf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPsec is not related to the exposure of interfaces. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e2fb2f68-0013-4b7f-a504-9def8e154f8d .

camssa:5a70718f-0060-45e1-9ca5-ea981c679220 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of BFO is not related to access control. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5032fe10-051c-48e1-962f-f0fd5f836fb6 .

camssa:5a77bef9-b6e3-4555-a231-04e1ad6e87e2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OASIS has defined a clear process where all the stakeholders involved have the opportunity to participate in the development of the specification development process. Moreover, there is a public review in the TC process.\r
 \r
OASIS guideline:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/tc-process-2017-05-26"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9f6806be-eb42-49e8-a5dd-c4ab13ab5e84 .

