camssa:5aa1702c-6463-4a21-8bca-db3a76792293 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CAdES has been included within the European Public Service “Digital Signature Service” (hereby DDS). The initiative includes three main features: the digital signature, the extension a digital signature, and the validation. Moreover, it is worth to note that DSS initiative included in the Connecting Europe Facility Programme context which aims to fund projects and initiatives for enhancing European public services. \r
\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html\r
https://ec.europa.eu/inea/connecting-europe-facility/cef-telecom"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:927cfea9-7e04-4098-a3d1-a008e5347739 .

