camssa:5af35141-9fbc-4062-8117-404e7cad6d7a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'NFVI works on a hierarchical-interface basis. According to the NFVI documentation, hierarchical interfaces relates to peer level interfaces (e.g., transport interfaces, signalling interfaces, and routing protocol interfaces). However, this specification does not apply to client-server interfaces because it works on a peer-to-peer basis (that is, from server to server). As a consequence, the client interfaces may be re-built to conform to the NFVI container interface specification.\r
\r
NFVI Deliver, Infrastructure Overview section 6.5.1:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/NFV-INF/001_099/001/01.01.01_60/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a231a0f8-193f-41e0-8ffd-994759617b64 .

camssa:5af6c919-8fa7-4fb1-bcbb-c64c83cfb4e0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5af885f7-e99d-4f9c-8d1f-a16827c4f6ec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OASIS Technical Committee, in charge of the development of OData, operates under RF (royalty-free) \r
on RAND Mode of the OASIS IPR Policy. Therefore, the specification is licensed on a Royalty-free basis.\r
\r
OASIS Intellectual Property guidelines, section 5.2:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/ipr/\r
\r
UBL Intellectual Property Rights policy: \r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html#S-IPR-POLICY'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:48cbf2df-3033-41b5-a6ed-04a868c360b1 .

camssa:5afb6304-9871-49fa-be52-4d0913669769 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By adopting the E-ARK CSIP, organizations can choose the technology and systems that best suit their specific requirements, as long as they adhere to the specified standards and guidelines outlined by the specification. \r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a3e72909-4dfa-4961-8f75-e7be297ab25c .

