camssa:5b7daf20-5814-49c3-b394-4a237ad4f999 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing the authentication for using services SAML 2.0 can contribute and promote the comprehensibly of administrations by simplifying access to administrations’ services. Moreover, it can be used internally by public officers which enhances the decision-making process, but it is not its main purpose.    \r
\r
SAML 2.0 Reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/security/saml/Post2.0/sstc-saml-tech-overview-2.0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f37e671b-c1f5-4fcd-87da-7e29d87f57b1 .

camssa:5b7fe75f-bb29-4a54-a535-b7a567faab83 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Each test performed by the specification has a tag EUMS (European Union Member State) that varies \r
depending on the Member State or not Member State using the specification, so although not explicitly \r
recommended, there are Member States that use it.\r
This is supporting eIDAS implementations especifically for validating the requirements from ETSI TS 119 614-1 V1.1.1.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 614-1 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/11961401/01.01.01_60/ts_11961401v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edf811b4-67f5-48b8-94eb-0de19c6d29e3 .

camssa:5b83a3da-7b0b-4122-bc2f-0340f14eddcd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'PROV-XML has been found included in the Joinup repository, which is a European platform for sharing IT solutions and specifications.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV-XML in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/w3c-standards-and-technical-reports/solution/prov-xml-prov-xml-schema/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:53c631b6-1b54-4aae-b443-04936b98c78b .

