camssa:5bca7e06-c69b-4f9c-99d5-8d99081b0455 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TIFF/IT is used to send data for print-ready pages. This fact allows administrations to share digital content among others and with the stakeholders. \r
Although it is an image format excellent for printing, it is also used to store images and to avoid paper images, which reduces the administrative burden.\r
\r
TIFF/IT ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/34342.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c4725a53-5343-4955-b163-d465ef976352 .

