camssa:5be14c4e-788e-4838-9773-b9b043ce13bd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPsec specification is a set of rules used to establish secure network connections. In this context, the specification offers various mechanisms to ensure data protection, including those related to tunneling and confidentiality. Therefore, public administrations can use some of these mechanisms to safeguard personal data.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html

IPsec security reference:  
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/ip-security-ipsec/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b882a08-9385-405a-a5f1-2413b05c678f .

camssa:5be1e621-2d17-49a9-9c0c-03ef224aad0e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Registered Organization Vocabulary is no longer maintained by W3C; however, all its releases and related information can still be found on the W3C Working Group page. Development and community have since shifted towards the Core Business Vocabulary.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

Core Business Vocabulary Github reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/tree/master

Core Business Vocabulary Github Issue 51 - RegOrg maintenance reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/issues/51
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:98ae5821-ae7e-476b-99a3-f2b691d15c1f .

camssa:5be4dab3-460f-473c-a525-c28a684f6d99 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are different documentation and information that takes into account EuroVoc as part of the narrative and includes it as valuable. An article shows the efficiency of EuroVoc since it is included as the core of an application for the categorisation of documents:\r
\r
JRC EuroVoc Indexer JEX - A freely available multi-label categorisation tool:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/256846257_JRC_EuroVoc_Indexer_JEX_-\r
_A_freely_available_multi-label_categorisation_tool'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f3123ce9-9c6d-4fd8-a03b-29133a093a8b .

camssa:5be76ba2-3ed7-45e0-8378-23ebb02f2ce9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of CLV is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
CLV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-location-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5bf7b087-1eb0-489c-8e99-684ce61c01c9 .

camssa:5be87214-8bea-45a7-bc7f-0576d32e578c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "'The purpose of XML is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.'"@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b60297e2-fecb-4e19-b408-2b607dbdfa6e .

camssa:5be88e8a-7fb4-4a9f-a1d9-0f347cb7ca49 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is included in 13 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Some examples of Member States including RDF on their catalogues are the Netherlands, Slovenia, Spain or Sweden.\r
\r
CAMSS list of standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6bd939f6-9da5-4627-b34f-e09ab6ef4c12 .

