camssa:5bf546af-761d-4b31-9ecc-f6126b6d5903 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"According to the CEN-CENELEX Guide 8, all patents, including EN 16234-1 e-CF, are licensed on a royalty-free basis. However, the specification should be purchased from each of the national standardisation organisations' sales points.\r
\r
CEN-CENELEC Guide 8 reference, section 4.1:\r
https://www.cencenelec.eu/media/Guides/CEN-CLC/cenclcguide8.pdf\r
\r
National standardisation organisations reference:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=205:35:0::::FSP_SURR_WI:67073&cs=1D6A0AE3F4B33063EC3BB54B719082165\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70b93d59-b6ed-4a2c-bd57-3894ef8f78ce .

