camssa:5bfec55f-a413-49e4-8097-81c73e81d89b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As it is stated in the "implementation and specification document" the The goal of domain names is to\r
provide a mechanism for naming resources in such a way that the names are usable in different hosts,\r
networks, protocol families, internets, and administrative organizations. Therefore, by allowing the\r
association of information with domain names, DNS facilitates their comprehension of data and services in a\r
network.\r
\r
DNS IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1034  \r
\r
Domain Names - Implementation and Specification:                             \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1035    '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:83ccbd02-e339-4ec7-8246-758ed89b16e2 .

camssa:5c014973-b09d-4a7e-a020-92208595496c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-52e41801b0db7274d934a229fee15e657273655d70d448d16706fcbe0e4f9746 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:5c04b4c4-a34b-471d-9e34-666808dba766 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5c079ae2-95e0-4559-a457-4b52ae4ccc3c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAREF is designed to facilitate the publication of data on the web, particularly in the context of the Internet of Things (IoT). SAREF provides a standardised way to represent the semantics of information related to smart appliances and devices. This standardisation promotes interoperability and facilitates the sharing and publication of data on the web in a consistent and understandable manner.

SAREF Technical Specification: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/103200_103299/103264/03.01.01_60/ts_103264v030101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:adbce27b-cfed-4ea5-8a21-8d6f347c6c67 .

camssa:5c086879-b721-430c-acd2-ab31e548086e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e46f1a4a060cc7e143e32e4833c94af9164c37bc0d4c844bd1fa974ffb2ac225 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5c0fc165-bd76-4275-b2b1-6ff3eea26fef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"During the public review, the draft is shared with the public, allowing stakeholders and any interested party to provide feedback and suggest improvements. This process helps identify issues and gather diverse perspectives, ensuring the standard meets user and industry needs. The feedback can lead to revisions, enhancing the final standard's quality and relevance.

Participating in IEEE SA Public Review (Commenters):
https://standards-support.ieee.org/hc/en-us/sections/5747263044116-Participating-in-IEEE-SA-Public-Review-Commenters\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5333ecc1-9b05-4a95-8639-36479d3e76de .

