        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IETF has a defined set of processes for the modification and revocation of standards. _x000D_\r
_x000D_\r
See:_x000D_\r
https://www.ietf.org/standards/process/  _x000D_\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2026  """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e119a4aa-accf-43c0-8165-2ca6b54f8af1 .

camssa:5cc49587-0199-4aae-b788-e4ef4c162a31 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of XSD 1.1 is not related to business processes modelling. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:69796edf-be69-404b-a40e-da80dade0eaa .

camssa:5ccf80fb-7f67-49f3-9ee0-5f1ccd861890 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UBL appears in Joinup as one of the identiefied ICT specifications for e-procurement.\r
\r
Joinup distribution of UBL:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/ict-standards-procurement/identified-ict-specifications-procurement'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aa326ad9-bb24-4553-8da3-ac26b3a818bb .

camssa:5cd6535d-1384-4eb8-ad3e-9017954a6c1c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSS is a simple mechanism for adding style (fonts, colours, spacing...) to web documents, but by itself, it does not publish data on the web. Also, it does not comply with the other levels of maturity presented by Tim Berners-Lee's 5 stars for open data.\r
\r
CSS v2.1 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2011/REC-CSS2-20110607/\r
\r
Five star open data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4d0db6b9-e391-47af-9dff-086b585cdcf0 .

camssa:5cd877f0-2739-4219-bb0c-90bb9eca6c01 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As a key enabler for the data exchange and interchange between administrations and stakeholders, JSON enhances the communication and information exchange across borders between public administrations. Therefore, the adoption of the specification avoids citizens and businesses to provide information in several times."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b2b9f44a-972d-4321-9f35-987aa6ab3015 .

