camssa:5cfd0fab-aa95-4c4f-bc32-6dcaefc5c091 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, HTTP is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. HTTP 1.1 is therefore licensed on a royalty-free basis.                                                                    \r
\r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668                                                                                                                                        https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2616"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d65e23a4-f873-42ab-9f3c-efb39c77693d .

