        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification has been implemented several times and in different environments, such as in public administrations. An example of XACML implementation is Semiramis, which aims to provide e-services with the required underlying secure authentication and management approach. 

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:68933078-d578-4c7f-89b4-1b79319f3e3f .

