camssa:5d1afdcc-d5ee-4cae-91aa-40adcbd59624 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 is included in 10 national catalogues of recommended specifications, among which we can find the Netherlands and Sweden, whose National Interoperability Framework (NIF) is fully aligned with at least 2 out of 3 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aa7508e2-7b48-41af-aca0-8a2e21d9456f .

camssa:5d231442-5294-4f45-b174-f82e0630c425 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8954ddabf37f4899562b9ea4c8f0bbf204f3e48c9203043bc231f368092396a2 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:5d30cde0-19c0-482b-a8c8-82adef7058ca a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SMTP allows the connection between email servers providing the digitization of public administration communications and reduces the non-digital communication flows. So it reduces the administrative burden.\r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0bdbc04a-e4b9-4ea2-975d-8bcaee17acb6 .

camssa:5d3b6a8f-b6fd-4282-9c41-0e4da16a004a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XFDL specification does not directly address personal data protection. However, it provides a mechanism to secure personal data through the signature item. This feature includes a digital signature that verifies the authenticity of the form and encrypts the signed data using a hash algorithm specified in the form’s signformat option. By ensuring the integrity and authenticity of the data, XFDL helps protect personal data in public administration processes, particularly in ensuring that signed information remains tamper-proof.

XFDL privacy reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL#button'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:904c7773-38dc-4d82-82a6-a4c3ea1aaca6 .

camssa:5d4878e5-0466-45a7-8b68-a09f0d72a9f7 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5d48cf66-9568-448e-8488-0ab09a0579d2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9694ffda6be83e507b6d3395cb411581d91419db0107726873a0a9018eab6a54 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:5d4a6692-b3a1-4746-91da-3a607741b497 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:5d4c9f02-8ea2-4efb-8ff4-fbf259a18e21 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By securing data exchange through computer networks, TLS 1.2 allows the information exchange between administrations and its stakeholders. Thus, the adoption of TLS 1.2 avoids the analogical data exchange reducing the administrative burden. \r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1bf92046-1763-4e3f-83ad-6588feae8be1 .

camssa:5d4d74dd-2f8f-4af7-b881-a2afc8c6ac5c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XAdES Baseline Profile is built over XML and its constraints. Even though, as XML is an open standard widely used the implementation of the specification does not hamper the interoperability of systems. \r
See:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/103100_103199/103171/02.01.01_60/ts_103171v020101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:da113958-55b7-4468-afcc-4e80649db474 .

camssa:5d4dbbda-e9f7-47ff-85b4-36250a794dec a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b8f7f5098ef900044e245ff5b30832215e00204b1e244545d80a28013685c811 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5d5378ce-9ae2-43fd-90a4-65aac8abe9e4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV is a vocabulary for expressing data quality and according to the W3C Data on the Web Best Practices Working Group, it t is foreseen as an extension to the DCAT vocabulary [vocab-dcat] to cover the quality of the data, how frequently is it updated, whether it accepts user corrections, persistence commitments etc. Therefore, this specification incorportes open standards as it reuses an already existing RDF vocabulary.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fe5acb6d-1147-4289-87e2-50cf5fef9227 .

camssa:5d571db8-099d-4120-bd37-80db911e6587 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cc5bd9a7d0b2acc7f246522414fd5f5d579b977180bb04fa60a545cb35dae90f ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:5d575775-b061-4498-9cf4-ff3327529b19 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-6bedf555bffb837990b9eb353447fa116eb9d2384770b1dd3de46d3c5901d4f4 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:5d58201f-ffa7-48ff-b5fb-948c981a6dec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'eTwinning is a community for schools, an online space for teachers and school staff to collaborate and develop national and international projects. In this project, data in transit, management access and data transfers on platforms is secured and encrypted via TLS.

eTwinning. European School Education Platform Reference:
https://school-education.ec.europa.eu/en/etwinning

eTwinning Privacy Aspects TLS Reference:
https://school-education.ec.europa.eu/en/etwinning_privacy_policy?prefLang=es

TLS 1.3 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f9792ce4-9c71-44b7-bcdd-d493fde74bfc .

camssa:5d58787c-abf7-420d-89d5-e36123052b92 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-497a81dae06c1d53b4cfe96c1f998f6f65d46354d68a83d29a2950c984fc1166 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5d58cc9f-8dc6-4242-84e0-16e97f3651b9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS), Verifiable Credentials is included in the "Distributed Blockchain Network" ABB from the Technical Infrastructure view and the "Privacy" ABB from the technical Application view.  \r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/600'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:673d784a-d6d1-4581-b7f6-8ea995615bd4 .

camssa:5d59fd7e-697a-4a46-af29-5075f164f6e9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XSLT is included in 7 national catalogues. They belong to Member States which comply with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the EIF according to the NIFO factsheets. \r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41b3ea29-71a4-42f5-8bd0-0a06e1b8d343 .

camssa:5d5b50d7-459b-4ee6-99e0-eb0758aef903 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "No evidence has been found of the specification being included in a formal interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:912e13d5-998a-41c4-8b62-b3b18c2b0353 .

