camssa:5d63bc04-e8ee-4182-b996-36ded33bf479 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 14533-2:2012 is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html \r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5e9105b1-e4c3-4d81-910c-a4ebfe13dacb .

