camssa:5d79ebf9-eef0-46d3-85e0-52e4d51850d4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DCAT-AP it to support the implementation of European Public Services by enhancing the searchability and discoverability of datasets across borders. DCAT-AP is an interoperability enabler.\r
 \r
DCAT-AP - a key for European data publishers to reach the data consumers and create a European open data ecosystem:                                                                                                                                      \r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/dcat-ap-key-european-data-publishers-reach-data-consumers-and-create-european-open-data-ecosystem_en\r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:79fdd36c-a487-41b1-b072-0d72c4e9dc76 .

camssa:5d8431f8-0d1b-40e2-87dd-9e6d601bbebe a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5d85b777-2c88-4ce1-83ed-c0d1a54a1dbf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Syslog plays a specific role in IT and network management. While syslog itself is not directly designed for the delivery of public services, it can contribute to the overall efficiency, security, and reliability of IT systems, which may, in turn, impact European public services delivery. 

Syslog Protocol: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c0df75d5-a7d3-4166-bdc3-e8241caa73c4 .

camssa:5d85c665-5c7f-492c-b6e0-5956820b0c1e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b45c8f7e446b1343c6b6961290d2106768aa43c1f123f5e436d0255c003abb50 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:5d87c41b-c81b-4747-8360-cc614a312620 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5d938cff-9ee0-4387-b545-30c289ddc145 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ODRL is designed with flexibility and extensibility in mind, allowing users to create, share, and reuse digital \r
rights expressions efficiently. The specification provides mechanisms to support a modular and interoperable \r
approach to expressing digital rights, which facilitates the reuse of relevant information in diverse contexts.\r
\r
W3C ODRL Community:\r
https://github.com/w3c/odrl\r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:84752132-95de-4a0c-bb94-4eb944bdd4e0 .

camssa:5d96ac01-c1d7-475c-955b-68e7225fb3c6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of WS-BPEL is not related  to the long-term preservation of electronic records and other kinds of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e4d9e715-3dde-4001-b21d-97dd713a45e7 .

camssa:5d984fed-919e-4ee4-b78e-409c13e903d9 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5d99395f-a2bd-499d-873c-a911124246d3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OWL2 as an extension of RDF, defines a common language to express information that can be exchanged between applications without losing meaning. OWL 2 is designed to facilitate ontology development and sharing via the Web. So it fosters trustworthy data exchange between administrations and stakeholders.\r
\r
OWL2 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-overview/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c4777d62-e7ad-4c05-b401-120a5ab790f9 .

camssa:5d9d2e1e-13e5-45fa-91da-fb9d54df24eb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of ISAE 3402 could, for example, allow administrations to properly track how the \r
different organisations providing digital public services are distributing funds. Or also to ensure that the \r
procedures and transactions with stakeholders are properly mapped. ISAE 3402 auditing tool, therefore, is \r
designed to be imlemented in any domain.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 handbook reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7ff290c4-f7d2-4945-81cc-4f00d3a32216 .

camssa:5da11512-717f-4951-95b5-4629035b6992 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:5da19fdd-2559-44e1-b934-42d9ec2eb027 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the ESPD is not related to the secure exchange of data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
ESPD business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:173e4e9d-edee-4ed8-9ff8-62b04836c741 .

