camssa:5da2ad17-2345-4da1-bdfb-6c9def0350a4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification refers to the W3C Verifiable Credentials Data Model so, it is inherently abstract and can be implemented and/or used in any domain as long as it fulfills the requirements. Therefore, its use goes beyond a specific business domain.\r
\r
Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e772d52c-1934-40bc-bdc6-39606753e46a .

