        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of ADMS is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1a79e03-ffa3-473e-839b-6f7e6997f7e1 .

