        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 is focused on ensuring risk management regarding the security of information, therefore, \r
this criterion does not apply due to the scope of the specification.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 handbook reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf'"""@en ;
