camssa:5e93358b-aa0e-43ec-933c-d5501a8460d9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAS development is guided by the Techincal Steering Commitee (TSC) a group of committers in charge of implementing new versions of the specification.  Moreover, the OAS has support from the community in Github, where anyone interested is encouraged to pull requests and give feedback on its implementation.  \r
\r
OAS Github: participation\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f767f4c9-2f4c-4c81-b372-ae1a1f434005 .

camssa:5e935a20-0dc8-4b3b-8296-b68246b85a47 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of BFO is not related to privacy and as such is not included in any initiative both National and European level. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6aa6e68b-f704-48eb-8bed-b46ea7511cf1 .

camssa:5e93914c-2f7c-440e-96a2-7fa2f1301f4e a cav:Score,
