camssa:5ee09c1b-8bd2-4861-aefe-7da501dbd8d9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Extensible Forms Description Language (XFDL) specification is based on XML, which allows for efficient storage and reuse of information. While the XFDL specification itself is not specifically designed for the long-term preservation of data, it can contribute to this goal through XML's inherent capabilities, such as data reuse.

XML reuse of information reference:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/dtd-entities/

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ad035e7f-b20d-4b73-bffc-3c48f3714bf2 .

camssa:5ee5b38f-1d5c-444a-b1db-881d5023bc41 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-25deb65536af2c7e82f921c56df2c7e21093b2c06fdddd63021b4bccea0b9cd7 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:5eec68a9-67e8-4abc-8163-a09048f97b7b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ESPD has support from several communities and stakeholders involved in public procurement\r
processes, which suggests that it is a widely accepted and trusted document for use in public procurement.  Moreover, Github hosts the most active community of contributors to the improvement and development of the specification.\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html\r
\r
ESPD in Github:\r
https://github.com/OP-TED/ESPD-EDM'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f7af9313-17d7-48df-83fb-bdd275aa768b .

camssa:5eed7f3f-f0ae-4506-aaca-895288fc8122 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "CAdES is business agnostic and in consequence, its Baseline Profile can be considered business agnostic as well. CAdEs Baseline profile is an extension to provide interoperability when AdES signatures need to be interchanged across borders in the context of the EU internal market. Thus, it can be used in any business domain requiring interoperability features along with eSignature. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a0d6cfd-7ff4-4c26-8433-1badeeb1c82b .

camssa:5eee22b9-8410-4ee0-8f94-4d0405f8722f a cav:Score,
