        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-549e39fc635763b9466e09688714b2908fcf7a349d4f4f0fe2a761bd6f502733 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5f7e1ba6-4c8d-4074-8405-bf16e7a5c45d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"JSON is a specification used for data exchange between different platforms, this fact facilitates the visibility and comprehensibility of administration's data. Moreover, it eases the communication between administrations enhancing the decision-making process. \r
\r
JSON specification:\r
https://www.ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-404_2nd_edition_december_2017.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:da95efec-37af-4c0d-a8e0-bab1175f6a48 .

camssa:5f809ae7-6605-43b7-b220-58f523bca003 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """eDelivery SMP has diverse implications in terms of Intellectual Property Rights. On one hand, the SMP 1.0 specification which is under non-assertion IPR policy, from OASIS IPR Policy. On the other hand, the ministry of Justice and the European Commission are in charge of part of the specification content. The specification is  licensed under (F) RAND basis and Royalty-free basis. \r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eDelivery+SMP+-+1.10#eDeliverySMP-1.10-Ownership\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/ipr \r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a9d91f7-5f95-4424-9ba8-04a110c19c69 .

camssa:5f81309a-bbf8-4590-be17-e8e4caeff9c1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9694ffda6be83e507b6d3395cb411581d91419db0107726873a0a9018eab6a54 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5f82088a-41e9-423c-8b32-53fdbad52335 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"SHACL enables the definition of custom functions that can be utilised within constraints. This capability is particularly useful for performing complex calculations or validations that are not achievable with the built-in SHACL functions. For instance, to ensure that a person's age is greater than 18, a custom function can be defined to create a constraint that checks the person's birthdate and calculates their age.

SHACL Custom reference:
https://shacl.dev/article/advanced_SHACL_features_you_need_to_know.html

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:258df898-044f-48f2-8cea-c415a68d801a .

camssa:5f85422d-23e3-4124-9cf3-7cbea7f19466 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSS does not define a cross-sector reusable data model. Instead, it defines a set of conventions and rules to provide style to web documents. \r
\r
CSS v2.1 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2011/REC-CSS2-20110607/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:86f9aa28-88bb-4ff6-9251-dbb8f8a9e4f3 .

