        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SMP is maintained by OASIS which is an international community developing open standards. \r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:34f0e330-6d4c-4593-bd83-8d003677b2eb .

camssa:5fc8760d-dcd4-4f5d-a077-f0de10c28270 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"NFVI is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a8f851f3-97b5-4eb9-afd4-bdca52cdd509 .

camssa:5fcfd9e1-7321-4c57-83e5-aad424be6c5c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:5fd0549b-7eb2-433b-862f-8493918f334b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Domibus is not related to the long-erm preservation of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b253b9d5-334f-41de-a6db-90109526e485 .

camssa:5fd66d4c-84a3-41af-a407-c5f1e022b9fa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are no Member States recommending SAREF in their ICT National Catalogues.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c77440d8-227f-424a-aaa3-bc4d3caf953c .

camssa:5fd889c1-db06-4863-b580-fce31b1ac36d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OData is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
OData reference: \r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/odata-v4.0-part1-protocol.htm'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9238bd80-814e-43e4-a653-d0c3bfed035f .

camssa:5fdb1727-e1f3-4854-9eda-85aed76837be a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-17a2b7a0ca372f407c300b69049faf9d92cbf274964290ba278b18cf10bf5dbf ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:5fe237a7-5a27-46db-9b1b-1a6d889c0f82 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While iCalendar can include some limited administrative information in event descriptions and custom properties, it is not a comprehensive solution for managing administrative procedures, rules data, and services. Its primary purpose remains as a format for representing and exchanging calendar-related data, and organizations may need to integrate iCalendar with other dedicated systems to address their administrative needs comprehensively.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bcaca656-ca09-44ce-bace-8c04979eb8a6 .

camssa:5fe29a80-1883-4ea5-a95d-1132afab55a7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTP is publicly available for study and use at no cost on the IETF webpage. \r
\r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc959"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2782d2f4-0746-4dd5-9f61-8cc17a7851e7 .

camssa:5fea503e-8338-4d5f-ac22-3740ed3d213d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTPS itself is not technology-agnostic. It is a specific implementation of the HTTP protocol that adds security features through the use of SSL/TLS encryption. HTTPS relies on the SSL/TLS protocols to establish secure connections and encrypt data transmission.\r
\r
TLS specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:21e20bd2-d53f-4bc0-b658-2f5579722c83 .

camssa:5feb9728-aa8d-4823-a00e-f74db02a5a46 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0e9bb259b84413d890a0fd548e40f255bb983a3add2eb7a737283f711e23d523 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:5feea58f-bf04-4372-93a5-f23d6eb038b9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Registered Organization Vocabulary is a simplified, reusable and extensible data model that captures the fundamental characteristics of a legal entity.\r
\r
RegOrg Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/registered-organization-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7a87ddf6-b755-4d04-836d-ef37f3edc655 .

camssa:5ff54284-71de-41f8-a37b-ae6a52015967 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The main purpose of the ISO/IEC 27001 is to preserve the confidentiality, integrity and availability of information by applying a risk management process and to give confidence to interested parties that risks are adequately managed. Following the requirements set by ISO/IEC 27001 secures data portability between systems, and its scalable approach supports the evolution of european public services.\r
\r
ISO 27001 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/#iso:std:iso-iec:27001:ed-2:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3c2bfa67-32c6-4565-8dbe-6c55de0930c0 .

camssa:5ff554a6-5b60-43d0-9c54-328f50b85d03 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:5ffd3edb-fddc-4313-ae6f-a72a0af38583 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:600aac39-1c3f-419f-8fc9-5ac9cdbd2505 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT is a cross-sector and cross-border reusable vocabulary.\r
\r
In contexts where there are sector-specific or national requirements, the specification is extended (e.g. DCAT-AP-BE, DCAT-AP, StatDCAT-AP) \r
\r
See: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/#introduction """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:30db5b7a-18b6-4553-916f-8b28123cd03c .

camssa:60161222-abcc-408a-8b89-05679e619201 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-483e8900c47b40bc67a6bd1cbfce07884b9ac5f2c85e0214f334cc37e4e65c35 ;
    cav:value "0" .

