        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As ETSI EN 319 422 was released in 2015, it has more than 2 years of maturity and can be proof that demonstrates it has overcome possible difficulties.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf\r
\r
eIDAS Regulation reference: \r
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation\r
\r
Reference of Implementation of trusted services:\r
https://www.sede.fnmt.gob.es/documents/10445900/10536309/dpc_unidades_sellado_tiempo_english.pdf'"""@en ;
