        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the ESPD itself does not enable the visibility of administrative procedures, rules, data, and services, its\r
use in conjunction with digital solutions can help to increase transparency and visibility in public procurement processes, such as the e-certis tool, which helps contracting authorities to verify the certificates\r
and documentation submitted by suppliers in response to tender opportunities.\r
\r
e-certis and ESPD:\r
https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/single-market/public-procurement/digital-procurement/europeansingle-\r
procurement-document-and-ecertis_en\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5b331086-0c94-4535-a45b-cf2699cb2c17 .

