camssa:60e3fa22-be5b-4b73-9d50-56a44363d2af a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though JPEG is supporting the first level of maturity from the Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for the Open data, which allows the availability of the information over the internet, the specification cannot be considered as an asset to foster data as open data. \r
\r
JEPG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/18902.html\r
\r
JPEG public reference:\r
https://jpeg.org/jpeg/\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97435a9e-4c5b-4362-b386-41b114a3aaed .

