camssa:6189c190-e58e-472e-b027-ee40b460d92b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox only refers to the access control mechanisms in Tool 28 but is only recommended as best practice. In this sense the specification sets the legal framework for the provision of such features but does not set a definitive guide.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:43f8e66f-9e4a-485d-b989-2def915b2dba .

camssa:618bc2be-60a6-43cc-9f99-eeeb933204c7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard, including a public review.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9a4472be-7202-4ad1-bbda-3c401beb219f .

camssa:618cc4f3-0513-4ceb-8b7e-ba729e9d72de a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 is recommended by 10 Member States.\r
\r
CAMSS List of standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5f81309a-bbf8-4590-be17-e8e4caeff9c1 .

camssa:619532f8-3b39-4cf7-bad7-4b3731ec89d4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Technical Committee (TC) CYBER (Cybersecurity) collaborates with stakeholders (primarily, National Standards Organizations -NSOs, academics and governmental bodies) to develop standards that improve the privacy and security of organizations and citizens in Europe and all over the world (see ETSI Directives, Rules of Procedure section, and EN 303 645 homepage reference). As the EN 303 645 is a European Standard (EN), the specification has gone through (national) public enquiry and voting (see NSOs ETSI-partnerships, EN 303 645 Public enquiry, and ETSI TC CYBER Contribution references). However, public consultations on major and minor releases are not publicly visible.\r
\r
ETSI Directives, Rules of Procedure section:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/Resources/ETSI-Directives\r
\r
EN 303 645 homepage reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/consumer-iot-security\r
\r
EN 303 645 Public Enquiry reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/newsroom/press-releases/1789-2020-06-etsi-releases-world-leading-consumer-iot-security-standard\r
\r
NSOs ETSI-partnerships reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/about/our-partnerships\r
\r
ETSI TC CYBER, Contribution reference:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/tb.aspx?tbid=824#/50610-contributions'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5fafd362-9a86-4cd5-80fb-d448423ba52b .

camssa:61a51b7d-bcaf-4f5b-908f-8cec4be1284a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 639-2 is intended to identify a language name. This specification relates to metadata, and can be used in any system that ingests metadata. Therefore, it can be considered technology-agnostic.\r
\r
ISO 369-2 FAQs:\r
https://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/faq.html#5\r
\r
https://www.loc.gov/standards/iso639-2/faq.html#7'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b3b8f290-0609-47fa-adaa-6edd5077e9c4 .

camssa:61a72dbd-629f-45f5-9ded-6ae2bb2033b0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification was developed in 1992 and it has been broadly used. JPEG is supported as one of the main image file formats.\r
\r
Independent JPEG Group:\r
https://www.ijg.org/\r
\r
JPEG.org:\r
https://jpeg.org/jpeg/index.html """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9983c3ec-dc96-46fe-b91b-84a524562a44 .

