        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"OSI is associated to the ABB's Data Space Connector, Data Space Connector consumer and Data Space Provider in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS).

EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS)
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/version-610\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:67437193-b003-4185-a11f-bc07f1ac53d5 .

