camssa:61e30f37-25a6-46ff-8092-7d9374d32919 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 was published for the first time in 2009, which means that it has evolved from a \r
stable version and it is mature enough to consider it for the creation and development of solutions and \r
services. ISAE 3402 supersedes SAS 70 and puts more emphasis on procedures for the ongoing monitoring and evaluation of controls.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 history\r
https://www.isae3402.com/ISAE3402_history/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:869fba69-0e0b-4406-8452-80c901b9965f .

