    cav:judgement """'GraphQL has a large history of implementations, and its improvements are widely documented in github.  The specification has published documentation of its supporting processes in the Github platform, where anyone can access to the history of changes and the authors involved.  The link below shows all the changes implemented for the last release of 2021 and the developers involved in those changes.\r
\r
GraphQL changelog in Github:\r
https://github.com/graphql/graphql-spec/blob/main/changelogs/October2021.md'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:682b160c-2453-4a66-8936-38cc9fb1cae2 .

