camssa:6303e52b-d937-401e-b592-5102ceae41f6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The main objective of the Portable Document Format (PDF) is to allow text format and images to be independent and work for any software, hardware or operating system. So it can be said that PDF is independent from any specific technology of platform."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46e583fa-ee80-4830-a165-d892c370793d .

