        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no tools that assess the conformity of FTPS implementations. However, there are online tools developed by the FTP community, which assess FTP and FTPS servers performance. \r
\r
FileZilla tests FTPS implementation:\r
https://filezilla-project.org/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5062cb84-68c6-43e0-af69-5b72a43728bb .

