        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI EN 319 532-3 is to ensure a consistent form of service across Europe, especially with regard to the \r
form of evidence provided, in order to maximize interoperability even between e-mail domains governed by \r
different policy rules. \r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
