        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GITB TDL is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, GITB TDL can define the interoperability aspects of the Human Interface ABB of the EIRA Technical View.\r
