camssa:63dce341-23b7-4b2e-b214-3a1c89787f33 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, PDF/A is widely used in across sector manner. One of the main document format used for the document exchange between different parties, and to ensure the availability of documents' content over the time. A clear example of this are public administrations and the high usage of PDF as a document format to exchange information. However, it cannot be considered as an asset to build innovative solutions. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b800e7d4-c876-48a2-a961-080a4a446397 .

