camssa:640591c3-9008-4c5e-8e89-72f2d12e7e07 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The OpenPM2 is a specification that aims to increase the effective and efficient management of process helping them to the development of better solutions, products or services. However, its implementation is not strictly related to reach or foster the secure data exchange of the developed products and services. \r
\r
Nonetheless, the use of this specification can help to determine the certain KPI helping the proper evolution of projects, and therefore a better quality in the developed solution. In this sense, the application could help to enhance how data is exchanged. \r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60161222-abcc-408a-8b89-05679e619201 .

camssa:640a4265-27b9-4063-ac23-12254155badf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TrainingDML-AI Standard’s effectiveness has undergone a internal rigorous review and approval process.
The effectiveness of the standard would likely depend on factors such as its adoption rate, the performance
of AI/ML models trained using data prepared according to the standard, and feedback from the user
community.

OGC TrainingDML-AI Standard:
https://docs.ogc.org/is/23-008r3/23-008r3.html

OGC TrainingDML-AI approach for making EO training datasets ready in deep learning frameworks paper:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10233498'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1ce34b44-a5e7-4ab8-b853-d5a6065bbd5f .

