camssa:64478906-6f8d-462c-9b9f-5697513d9692 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"REST is a sofware architectural style which defines a set of costraints for how the architecture of an internet-scale distributed hypermedia system should behave. REST architectural constraints are designed to provide efficient and scalable client-server applications allowing for extensions and new adaptations when needed. In this regard, REST allows for a greater interoperability, explicitly addressing and enabling data portability between systems/applications.\r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/\r
\r
REST Introduction from Roy Fielding's dissertation:\r
https://www.ics.uci.edu/~fielding/pubs/dissertation/introduction.htm\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dbceb8be-101c-46ed-8499-b878e19d7c5c .

camssa:644a25d1-7ec1-4235-b67f-5a6ba8afea2d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The objective of the LegalRuleML TC is to extend RuleML with formal features specific to legal norms, guidelines, policies and reasoning; that is, the TC defines a standard (expressed with XML-schema and Relax NG) that is able to represent the particularities of the legal normative rules with a rich, articulated, and meaningful markup language. It can be concluded that the specification fosters defining organisational interoperability aspects.\r
\r
LegalRuleML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/legalruleml-core-spec/v1.0/legalruleml-core-spec-v1.0.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f57d5d25-8d44-4ef9-b432-b6e43b05df06 .

camssa:6454e1c0-1eb4-4439-b3bd-c82246956131 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """One of the main goals of the Better Regulation Toolbox is to enhance the transparency of the public policy and law-making, increasing the visibility of public administrations decision-making process.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf\r
\r
Objective of Better Regulation Toolbox: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/law/law-making-process/planning-and-proposing-law/better-regulation-why-and-how_en#objectives-of-the-better-regulation-agenda"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:007eb3ce-522b-4628-99c2-c7b92b82a614 .

