        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Through the identifiers, a decentralised and verifiable way of monitoring and managing administrative processes is provided. If each step in the administrative process can be associated with a did, the processes can be verified and made more visible and reliable, thus contributing to the visibility of administrative procedures.

DIDs W3C:
https://www.w3.org/TR/did-core/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c3723c01-aa3a-4c8d-a1d1-dc30f9922d11 .

