        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is independent from any particular software, hardware, or operating system. So, it can be 
said that the Dataspace Protocol is independent of any specific platform. 

IDSA Dataspace Protocol Specification: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:12ccdd08-0421-469c-8622-cecba73fa8a3 .

