camssa:64b444af-e629-4d02-8fbf-36e1b6edda5f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """' ISO/IEC 7498:1 does not prescribe specific hardware, operating systems, or platforms.The platform-agnostic nature of the OSI model allows for the development of network protocols and communication systems that can work across diverse platforms, operating systems, and hardware architectures.

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ff250d8e-7621-4141-ae47-0e517c93c6ab .

