camssa:64c5d995-6328-4282-846e-92c5164d13ba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"REST is a sofware architectural style which defines a set of costraints for how the architecture of an internet-scale distributed hypermedia system should behave. REST architectural constraints are designed to provide efficient and scalable client-server applications through a URI resource approach. In this regard, REST allows for a greater  interoperability, explicitly addressing and enabling data portability between systems/applications.\r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/\r
\r
REST Introduction from Roy Fielding's dissertation:\r
https://www.ics.uci.edu/~fielding/pubs/dissertation/introduction.htm\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c3d03432-2eb1-4efc-b03d-17bf365b2a79 .

camssa:64c66c34-2ba7-4d44-8d53-c4e7808dcc63 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are assessments that evaluate the effectiveness by evaluating digital solutions that involve the specification, as it shows in the following link:                                       \r
ADMS in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/adms     '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf33d665-161d-42c2-8190-6836147c37c4 .

camssa:64cd6a6a-5910-404c-b198-6bb45c8e40aa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at the supra-national level, the European Commission has listed it within Better Regulation Toolbox with all the specifications and resources produced and used by European Institutions. \r
\r
Even though the specification is not listed in the ICT standards catalogue, it can be considered that is included within a European Catalogue because it is included within the European Commission solutions stack for the development of better digital administrations.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox on European Comission webpage:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/law/law-making-process/planning-and-proposing-law/better-regulation-why-and-how/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox/better-regulation-toolbox_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b21525ce-fea7-4084-8f86-912ce15d07cb .

camssa:64cdb84f-cbab-4560-8251-7b3381da0f7d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:value "74%AssessmentScoreAverage",
        "84%StrengthOfAssessmentScoreAverage" .

camssa:64cf0d32-0044-40f0-a72f-2395d2685d0f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """eDelivery SMP 1.0 is available for free at CEF’s website, which is an open resource for the European development. \r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eDelivery+SMP+-+1.10"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50a87cb0-d012-4672-bfcd-27d9da47bc2a .

camssa:64d59251-422c-49a6-8a10-88d42df535d5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP gives access to distributed directory services according to the data and services models provides by the X.500 family of standards. Therefore, the specification facilitates the modeling of business processes.

LDAP IETF reference:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4511

X.500 reference:
https://www.itu.int/rec/dologin_pub.asp?lang=e&id=T-REC-X.500-201910-I!!PDF-E&type=items'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b7dc8807-8eae-417f-8aff-ffb4be2cbab5 .

camssa:64d6a507-bc9c-4483-b59f-b3aa71f7bf05 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML is publicly available for implementation and use for free on W3C's webpage. Therefore, it can be reused by the organisations, administrations, open communities, etc. that developed it.\r
\r
HTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/"""@en ;
