camssa:6558289f-8afc-4cf9-964e-d4039a590d84 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UBL conceptual model is based on modeling systems such as entity/relationship modeling and the unified modeling language.  The use of UBL has many benefits for the modelling of business processes, among which we can highlight that it provides detailed textual descriptions, explanations, and examples of each of its specified functions and messages, as well as clear rules for extension and a number of subsets and tool resources.\r
\r
The Meaning of UBL: The Value of a Semantic Data Model:\r
http://ubl.xml.org/forum/the-meaning-of-ubl-the-value-of-a-semantic-data-model'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:88648543-3d54-440e-843a-9e4b42314d2e .

camssa:655d4183-7054-4d67-9663-0e2a98856fee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """5 Member States are recommending PAdES in their ICT National Catalogues. \r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5fbcad69-a94c-4016-b8ff-deef56048d8c .

camssa:655eba14-e85a-48e9-8eb3-2ca35044619a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """LegalRuleML extends RuleML with formal features specific to legal norms, guidelines, policies and reasoning. The specification is also able to represent the particularities of the legal normative rules with a rich, articulated, and meaningful markup language. An example of this is the LEOS software, a tool for drafting legal documents at European Level. \r
\r
Moreover, its structured format and capabilities can help administrations at European Level to transpose legal documents into national law and vice versa easily. This fact is a key aspect to reduce the administrative burden.\r
\r
LegalRuleML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/legalruleml-core-spec/v1.0/legalruleml-core-spec-v1.0.html\r
\r
LEOS: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/justice-law-and-security/solution/leos-open-source-software-editing-legislation"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46f223c2-9837-4bcb-a4f8-3eb5f9c20427 .

