camssa:65c470aa-7a09-4645-b1aa-c1aed764d207 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV promotes transparency in data publishing by providing standardised metadata about data quality. When applied to public administration services, DQV can enhance transparency and accountability by making the quality of data used in service interfaces more visible to stakeholders, including service users, regulators, and auditors. This transparency fosters trust in public administration services and encourages responsible data management practices.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80bbdc76-fc0e-4e7c-9887-4a76ebb0d539 .

