camssa:65f5296c-5b37-414c-83c6-0ad5c40456b0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Verifiable Credentials explicitly adresses and enables data portability between systems/applications supporting the implementation or evolution of European public services by providing them with the means to issue, manage and verify fraud-proof credentials efficiently and securely and for users to maintain greater privacy and control over their personal data.\r
\r
Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07a87c7c-f2cb-4018-be09-bec95cf926be .

