        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox includes references to the relevance Open Data for the development of public policies. It is one of the principles or basis for the evidence-based development that the specification defines, however, the purpose of the specification is not related to the development and publication of Linked Open Data.\r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:24c599ef-b79d-4d6e-8775-78f89f9264c2 .

camssa:662de9a7-942c-45bf-8d1a-8e05f7e8259c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx allows for partial implementations in the sense that its functionalities can be  invoked separately.  For instance, it can be only used for serializing RDF data into JSON format, or into a concise human-readable compact syntax (ShExC), or it can only be used to validate RDF graphs.  \r
\r
ShEx primer document:\r
https://shexspec.github.io/primer/\r
\r
ShEx Community Group:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/shex/\r
\r
ShEx Github:\r
https://github.com/shexSpec/spec/issues'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:92172013-61aa-4804-ae42-e7e2aae8eb3c .

