    cav:judgement """'TSP is developed and maintained by IETF, a widely recognised open international community developing standards to enhance the internet. 

IETF Reference: 
https://www.ietf.org/

TSP IETF reference: 
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a9f72d70-791d-4fa4-9a92-d0dc9b149ce6 .

