        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 defines how digital certificates and public-key infrastructures (PKIs) are used in the authentication process, which inherently includes mechanisms for ensuring that access is only granted to entities possessing valid credentials.

ETSI TS 119 612:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
