camssa:669e084c-1e5a-4a24-9c2f-58c95c0141e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS queries over HTTPS (DoH) is developed by IETF, a standard development organisation based in the US. Moreover, the DNS queries over HTTPS (DoH) specification does not appear in any of the main European standard development bodies, therefore, the specification is not a European standard.

DoH specification: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8484'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7ea92a73-89a5-4dc8-9493-ae3b291883db .

camssa:669fcce6-eb2a-4a2e-9457-7bb02180b9f3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The FTP is used in the context of the CIRCABC, a cross-border initiative that provides a web application enabling collaboration, communication and document exchange between European Union stakeholders. \r
\r
CIRCABC isa2 Reference: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/circabc.pdf \r
\r
CIRCABC Reference:\r
https://circabc.europa.eu/faces/jsp/extension/wai/navigation/container.jsp'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d85237bc-edf5-4fbc-9557-4f4359e1fdfd .

