camssa:66b1961e-5f00-47c9-93f2-592360ff2033 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS over HTTPS (DoH) is a protocol that encrypts DNS queries and their responses to enhance privacy and security, therefore it is not directly related to the publication of data on the web. 

