        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Several developer platforms discuss YAML extensively, one prominent example being Stack Overflow. Stack Overflow operates as a community-driven forum where developers can ask questions, share insights, and provide solutions related to YAML. 

Stackoverflow YAML:
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/yaml'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ca3d76c5-8a0c-4e52-8a0e-d2ecf20df5f0 .

camssa:66e4028a-13f5-4347-907e-7225fd5a7cf8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although designed for use in business supply chains it can be (and has been) adapted for other contexts of use. This is because all the business document constructs in a UBL are drawn from a single library of reusable components. Therefore, UBL can be implemented across business domains.\r
\r
UBL v2.3 reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html\r
\r
Developer community OASIS. UBL functionalities:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=ubl#functionality'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:92cc726d-2194-4e88-aed5-d409e43c93f8 .

