        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML5 is not included in any catalogue of standards at supra-national level. However, it can be found within the European Colaborative platform, Joinup along with other extensions and versions of the specification. \r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/search?keys=HTML5&f%5B0%5D=type%3Asolution&page=0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c277bd4c-79e2-4527-bcab-bdf4778c481b .

