camssa:66f55d94-2e28-4e93-b1ab-03c8d0f4bb02 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'RDF provides the means to describe data in a highly expressive way. By enablig data integration from multiple sources, RDF allows multiple schemas to be applied, interlinked and queried as one, and modified withut changing the data instances, thus enabling digital service delivery channels.\r
\r
RDF Description services:\r
https://www.w3.org/1999/11/02-RDFServices/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fbc61d43-98fe-4fb4-90b1-eeb1f84093cd .

