camssa:670f3566-b6eb-4634-a5ab-06da72d677b7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The DCAT vocabulary has a strong support from the interest groups and is extensively used by public administrations’ for the exchange of data across borders and sectors. The specification also counts with a major release (v3.0.0) to further support the argument. \r
\r
Additionally, the specification is widely used by public administrations profiling or extending it to fit domain-specific or national requirements\r
- DCAT-AP: Application Profile for Public Sector Datasets.\r
- DCAT-AP-BE: Extension of DCAT-AP for Belgium specific requirements.\r
- StatDCAT-AP: Extension of DCAT-AP for the publication of statistical data.                                               \r
\r
DCAT (v2.0.0) reference:             \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b0ae1b0-d5cd-4975-a0f2-e7aab1e32adf .

