camssa:671e11c0-bbb3-4838-a68d-8820b224e86f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'FTP is included in 8 national catalogues of recommended specifications. Among those we can find the Netherlands. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of these Member States is fully aligned with at least 2 out of 3 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
NIFO factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2022\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards\r
\r
Netherlands NIFO Factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/inline-files/DPA_Factsheets_2022_Netherlands_vFinal_0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:99d739c1-9b70-447a-b594-35ce86db89e3 .

