camssa:67277d40-5c60-4fc9-8dbd-66c833d0b85c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SAMM aims to help organizations analyse their current software security practices. By following and implementing SAMM European Institutions can improve and develop software that allows data portability ensuring maximum security on these information transactions.\r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/ \r
\r
SAMM Documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9dbe3fa9-e8b8-44ee-a92c-c69b4b31b7eb .

