camssa:6729cb47-57e4-4041-b464-466d49295407 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The message returned by a Service Metadata Publisher service is signed using one or more XML-Signatures. Moreover, the purpose of the specification is to ease and ensure the discoverability of different parties to exchange the desired information. The specification defines a set of requirements regarding the authentication of parties that ensures secure and trustworthy data exchange.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d097d85f-2f54-42c2-86a7-191c2fdb7b86 .

