camssa:674bed47-bb83-4afe-a97c-dcf671e5b197 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'When it comes to the preservation mechanisms, ETSI TS 119 512 specifies a data structure "EvidenceExchange", which contains preservation objects and preservation evidences to support seamless export and import from one preservation service to another one using evidence records, therefore enhancing interoperability between systems and ensuring data portability.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf    '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:158a8dca-4190-4a6e-887f-1c69b2cbc886 .

