camssa:67689cb8-7629-426f-8cd3-3b756cf07ce1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'In the REST architectural style, data and functionality are considered resources and are accessed using Uniform Resource Identifiers (URIs).  \r
With a REST protocol you can do the following operations with data POST (creation), GET, PUT, DELETE. Thus, in some way, it facilitates the publication of public data as open data. \r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/\r
\r
See this link for the justification: \r
https://www.bbvaapimarket.com/es/mundo-api/api-rest-que-es-y-cuales-son-sus-ventajas-en-el-desarrollo-de-proyectos/ \r
\r
The 5-star of Tim Berners-Lee can be found in the following link: \r
https://5stardata.info/en/ \r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1bbc5e6e-06d4-4fca-af41-cbda221690a2 .

camssa:676bbd2c-766b-4653-85f2-f41ddfeca425 a cav:Score,
