camssa:68080f55-89d3-4ddb-8636-47446825f856 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML is maintained by W3C which is an international community developing open standards. \r
\r
Developer community W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/Consortium/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:58171e4e-0e94-4443-a88a-1b83ef6f6e23 .

camssa:680b3f43-0a7b-4ee9-a485-6d78aa32a190 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Douglas Crockford was the creator of JSON. The system was sold to Sun Microsystems, Amazon.com and EDS. The website of the specification was launched in 2002. JSON reuses conventions from other programming languages, in consequence, many libraries of programming use it. Therefore, it is demonstrated that JSON has enough maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.json.org/json-en.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d059ce27-266d-4ff0-8913-9102f50c0547 .

camssa:680cb7ec-fab2-4ef9-b85c-ad35e45c506f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XAdES Baseline Profile is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, ASiC Baseline Profile can define the interoperability aspects of “e-Seal Creation Service”, “e- Verification Seal and Validation Service”, “e-Signature Creation Service”, and “e-signature Verification and Validation Service” ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a4fdedb0-6265-4ef1-a80f-99cf5f9612cf .

camssa:6814c059-3d74-43f6-97e8-16f776bca8cd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SOAP 1.2 is maintained by W3C which is an international community developing open standards. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/Consortium/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f9d80410-c65a-45df-91be-d57046130914 .

camssa:68183c59-632e-4551-8315-04f581bb542c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0e9bb259b84413d890a0fd548e40f255bb983a3add2eb7a737283f711e23d523 ;
    cav:value "100" .

