camssa:68547e63-6c12-47e2-bc75-b19d49fd1a83 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP can be used independently of any other technical specifications. As a network protocol, it can be implemented in any type of domain. For instance, it is widely used to complement Active Directory (AD) as a directory services protocol.

LDAP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511

LDAP with Active Directory: 
https://www.solarwindsmsp.com/blog/difference-between-ldap-ad'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fb3fe0d3-ae4d-4935-b354-efdf44931df9 .

