camssa:68781411-c3e2-4ce9-bb6b-b1eca2e28527 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CAdES is a business domain agnostic specification that can be reused in a cross-domain way. It can apply to any type of transaction, between an individual and a company, between two companies, between an individual and a governmental body, etc.\r
\r
CAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/64756.html\r
\r
CAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101700_101799/101733/02.01.01_60/ts_101733v020101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:227d38f2-8213-4e3a-91fe-3d49c71bb1cf .

camssa:687a8383-e719-460a-b13c-65f0182a0a88 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 supports many languages and can accommodate pages and forms in different cases including a mixture of these languages. The fact of allowing encoding with several languages allows the data consumption by the different linguistic groups that form the EU. Therefore,  UTF-8 fosters the delivery of European multilingual services.\r
\r
Choosing and applying character encoding: \r
https://www.w3.org/International/questions/qa-choosing-encodings.en \r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:13af9b42-0ffe-4897-9c80-4c6b2f74a311 .

camssa:6882f147-ad2c-4d82-a620-df0ce1a39c2d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XSLT specification is designed to transform data from XML into other formats, making it useful for handling administrative data. For example,  XSLT is used to convert into RDF Tenders European Daily XML dumps documents.

TED extractor Project:
https://github.com/opendatacz/TED_extractor/tree/master

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/#json-in-xml'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:807db6b3-9b50-4ccb-8853-283ab70d255f .

camssa:688723d8-b58c-4214-838e-9af0a5b9e7b7 a cav:Score,
