camssa:688d9aab-c21f-4cfc-82af-280b0667e4ef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DAPS is being directly used to create various innovative solutions. For instance, the specification plays a crucial role in Catena X, an initiative that aims to create a uniform standard for the data exchange across the entire automotive value chain. \r
\r
The Catena-X role of a company requesting some specific data is a foundation for the decision whether the requesting company is allowed to consume this specific data. DAPS is the component which is responsible\r
for the distribution of the described company attributes by issuing certificates including the attributes as well as the company identity to the EDCs, which are representing the companies.\r
\r
Catena-X: https://catena-x.net/en/about-us'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a161d84-36ed-4b27-be6f-b90945688f5d .

camssa:6890caac-3c18-488b-959e-145808dccbd6 a cav:Score,
