camssa:69043929-9aa7-4461-a57c-385f00b651a5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of WAI-ARIA involves various methods, such as usability studies, user testing, and evaluation against established accessibility standards. As the specification undergoes evaluation, numerous cases and studies investigate its utilization in web content for e-accessibility purposes.

NSU article about WAI-ARIA solutions:
https://www.nosolousabilidad.com/articulos/wai_aria.htm

ACM Digital Library WAI-ARIA reference:
https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/2461121.2461141

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0eac9b3f-289b-4d1b-92a0-df29d6a3c67e .

camssa:6905f043-5ffb-4a3b-87b6-a3fdb693ba21 a cav:Score,
