        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XACML specification provides a thorough and detailed framework that supports comprehensive and transparent management of access control policies, ensuring that administrative procedures, rules data, and 
services are all robustly covered.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2352dd8b-832e-44bb-b372-f77f952d8e1a .

