        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The standard or specification is included in 2 national catalogues that belong to Member States which comply with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the EIF according to the NIFO factsheets. (e.g. the Netherlands, Sweden)\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/lijst\r
http://www.avropa.se/dynamiska-sidor/sok/?query=standards&searchtype=web """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fc4196e1-56c5-45b9-8a78-3f739ce41c83 .

