camssa:6a180dc4-5a4c-40f0-adeb-7a408ba51b63 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSLT does not inherently provide secure exchange of data, secure data exchange can be achieved by integrating XSLT with other technologies and best practices, such as XML Signature, allowing to digitally sign XML data, ensuring the integrity and authenticity of the information.

XML Signature Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xmldsig-core1/

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c348223-e9c8-45e0-aa13-ec3be13193cb .

camssa:6a28fbac-9d86-40c2-93b6-b544a666d096 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 is a detailed specification for Ethernet networking. It supports various applications, from local area networks (LANs) to high-speed data centres, making it versatile for digital solutions. The standard includes detailed documentation about change management processes, including erratum and a list of versions, providing a robust foundation for current and future networking needs.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37c8a1f1-72cb-4f6c-a1d0-4f1c15ad4a3c .

camssa:6a292c0c-2263-4c94-9a6f-89a526d97e85 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e46f1a4a060cc7e143e32e4833c94af9164c37bc0d4c844bd1fa974ffb2ac225 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:6a326bfb-1020-465d-ae98-9f3d4ad7dcb1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """8 Member States are recommending TIFF in their ICT National Catalogues. This Member States are Estonia, France, Germany, Greece, Norway, Poland, Slovenia and Spain.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4b02ff58-70a7-478d-aea0-272df3a4f2d6 .

