        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Indexed Database API is not related to secure processing of data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7edc26e6-b678-4d77-a618-5fb9f3104307 .

