camssa:6abebf52-2a3f-48e0-ae20-f291ce343304 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents indirectly addresses data integrity by capturing and representing provenance information. The captured lineage and transformation details can be used to verify the integrity of data throughout its lifecycle. However, additional security measures and best practices are required to ensure comprehensive data integrity.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV Ontology:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-o-20130430/\r
\r
PROV Data Model:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-dm-20130430/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:52901111-d8d8-404d-931a-92638f6962bd .

