        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is not related to the authenticity and authentication of the role agents involved in data transactions. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile'"""@en ;
