camssa:6b2ce4c7-d90d-4c83-9e10-1a01150e6a5d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification introduces certain aspects that can contribute to provide means for restriction of access to information or data, as in the implementation of CESOP Legislative Package , which monitor the payees of cross-border payments and transmit information.\r
\r
XSD Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2012/REC-xmlschema11-1-20120405/\r
\r
Legislative Package CESOP Reference:\r
https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/taxation-1/central-electronic-system-payment-information-cesop_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:445138fe-f7a3-4f47-8a8c-8e56c9ddc43f .

camssa:6b2dae3c-2abf-4043-9cc7-0f56991ff12c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'One of the main keys of LDAP is that it is useful for organisations to protect and manage information. In addtion, there are measures that can help to the protection of personal data. While SASL improves security, implementing a single sign-on system using LDAP is another method that can enhance security aspects.

LDAP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511

LDAP Wirex reference:
https://wirexsystems.com/resource/protocols/ldap'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3a4b19c9-646f-48c8-baf9-f187d3f4e64c .

camssa:6b353515-6fb4-4d56-8e7c-e70012c04738 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "After searching in the different official European websites, there is no evidence of any cross-border project that use LDAP nor explicit agreements involving the usage of the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b8c2647-4282-4a05-a630-8a51be6084ce .

