camssa:6b62e8db-8868-4e2e-b6e6-6a2dc2d4cb81 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, LDAP is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. LDAP is therefore licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3a03af21-dfd1-4eef-9402-fad07b0ff2b8 .

