camssa:6b75d3e4-3f11-4218-a51c-8c9b494a19f5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is focused on the discoverability of parties, involving the use of parties metadata and the identification of access points. This field is being developed by public administrations in order to create innovative solutions that work for the enhancement and digitalisation of administrations services. \r
\r
An element that can be related to the creation of innovative solutions is the CEF eDelivery Building Block, which can be considered an innovative solution in terms of eGovernment and the relation of Public Administrations with their stakeholders.\r
\r
The specification:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505000\r
\r
eDelivery: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eDelivery"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3fe60e72-d233-4563-b406-e4e643f571d3 .

camssa:6b7dcc29-e023-4a39-b0c1-b63e332238a6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "80" .

