        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML5 has been assessed by the CAMSS Team under the MSP scenario, which is fully compliant with the European Standardisation Regulation 1025/2012. \r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/camss-assessment-html5-msp-scenario"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:be94ab33-3e6f-4c3a-ad2b-311db425a039 .

