camssa:6c2a9cbe-432c-42e5-89d3-697b6815953c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI EN 319 422 has the support of various communities listed in the following link as "Supporting Organizations", including Universities, private and public companies. The ESI technical committee provides public support to members and non-members alike, with different conditions depending on ETSI membership status. This support helps to increase the use of the specification and the specification itself by detecting weaknesses in implementation or any other relevant aspect of the specification's functionalities.\r
\r
About ETSI:\r
https://www.etsi.org/about\r
\r
Portal ETSI reference:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/webapp/workprogram/Report_WorkItem.asp?WKI_ID=39422\r
\r
ETSI Technical committee reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/committee/1399-es.'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8ab35efc-359e-4908-97df-47595f7d6c62 .

