        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI EN 319 422 can be applied in any domain and context where the use of time-stamping protocol is realized. Therefore, the specification is usable beyond any business-specific domain and can be used in any kind of organisation.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
