        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of NUTS is not related to enabling the long-term preservation of data, information nor knowledge. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification. \r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Principles and Characteristics section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/principles-and-characteristics'"""@en ;
