camssa:6d0dad30-5c27-4e3d-8156-9df136ed917b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IAASB is dedicated to operating as transparently as possible. IAASB meetings are open to the public \r
and meeting agendas, agenda papers, and meeting highlights are posted on the website. In addition, the \r
website includes project histories, audio recordings of the IAASB meetings, IAASB Exposure Drafts and all \r
comments made on those drafts by stakeholders.\r
\r
IAASB reference:\r
https://www.iaasb.org/about-iaasb'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7fc3e8f0-1e03-4a61-add4-48247603b0e4 .

camssa:6d0ec4d8-fa6e-464d-b82b-4f8f19e52d1e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of LDAP is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. 

LDAP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a993c932-8c19-4219-958d-359d590dd89c .

camssa:6d128318-d7e1-43a1-97c0-03a29e26780e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XACML is a markup language that is used to declare access conditions stated on Security Policies. It can be adapted to ensure that web services are compliant with security policies, and therefore, ensure the data trustworthy exchange. \r
\r
XACML OASIS reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/errata01/xacml-3.0-core-spec-errata01.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e638250d-8818-44bd-896a-6209030d43ff .

camssa:6d14023c-6318-4cb6-a7d2-c14f912d538b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is aimed to participate in the evaluation of access policies, participating in authentication processes that can ease the secure and trustworthy exchange of data. For security reasons, the XForms Processor must not dereference the URI bound to this form control without explicit user permission.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:513891d8-6649-4f76-a63e-016d2874a3ce .

