camssa:6d706ece-2438-40ae-b82a-c0c9aed3c483 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although DCAT-AP itself does not provide means for the enabling of data integrity, the SEMIC Support Center has developed the DCAT-AP validator, a software tool to check metadata description of datsets for integrity and consistency.\r
\r
DCAT-AP validator:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-ap-validator'"""@en ;
