        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSLT specification includes several mechanisms for assessing its efficiency, primarily through testing and implementation reports. There are document of the European Commission assessing the suitability of XSLT specification.

Digital Signature Service:
 https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html#_xades_profiles

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91eba820-d5d1-451f-a99a-082c0796aa44 .

camssa:6d7d73ed-2982-4d5d-a222-d0667b06e48f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of the spefication to specify certified time stamps can be done independently from the amount of data. Several implementations can be used by administrations, citizens and businesses for the certification of documents. \r
\r
For instance,  TSP is the basis of ETSI EN 319 422 Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI); Time-stamping protocol and time-stamp token profiles, which use a European specification to ensure the time-stamp of documents and the requirements, including the Time Stamp RFC3161.\r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161\r
\r
DigiStamp:\r
https://www.digistamp.com/\r
\r
FreeTSA:\r
https://www.freetsa.org/index_en.php\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI); Time-stamping protocol and time-stamp token profiles: \r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7ecea193-c52f-4215-a12c-38e110c734ed .

camssa:6d7f295b-80f1-42b0-b960-3e8048db2138 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-5a7323988b5d96da801e2abd4d95248af758fe9adbbafd09dd76114629567ff4 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:6d8229e3-de3a-462b-9d4b-774fc7e18677 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are three Member States recommending UBL in their ICT National Catalogues. These Member \r
States are The Netherlands Malta and Greece.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:048e591c-c98a-4151-8c82-a54fd8bd7bd3 .

