camssa:6d882e34-d182-4097-83c3-8278f652642a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OWL2 has been used to develop innovative solutions in numerous cases. Some examples are integrating OWL2 with text editors such as Protégé 4, SWOOP. It has also been integrated with TopBraid Composer which is an enterprise-class modelling environment for developing Semantic Web ontologies. More innovative solutions can be seen at the following link in the 'Editors / Development Environments / APIs' section._x000D_\r
_x000D_\r
Also, it is worth to note that OWL is the basis for the creation of Ontologies, and therefore one of the basis for the development of the Semantic Web. _x000D_\r
_x000D_\r
OWL2 solutions:_x000D_\r
https://www.w3.org/2001/sw/wiki/OWL/Implementations"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:368c8dec-dc66-4e90-b9c6-73cd85f7f99b .

