camssa:6eb5ec9a-ca66-4314-98a0-9a032bb5849a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification allows certain functions to be executed, enabling an XFDL form to perform procedural operations. These operations are optional, not mandatory, which allows XFDL to adapt more effectively to various contexts.

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c9493126-8122-4289-8cdc-2f2ccd9530b1 .

