    cav:judgement """'WAI-ARIA has the Web Accessibility Initiative - Communities of Practice (WAI-COOP) platform for sharing results and best practices. Therefore, the specification encourages the creation of open information about the specification and encourages relevant communities to share their results at the European level.\r
