        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specification addresses and facilitates the exchanging of information. By allowing to make web services available and the data exchange between systems from administrations and stakeholders, SOAP fosters the reduction of administrative burden."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:56d61e2e-e4f2-4872-b53d-3be50a615860 .

