        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of this specification is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
