camssa:6fd77a01-7a68-44f1-945d-40cc39f95b74 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of ODF is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
ODF ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/66363.html\r
\r
ODF OASIS reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office"""@en ;
