        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Understanding data exchange as the publication by the administration of data for its later consumption by citizens, the specification facilitates the trustworthy data exhange in RDF format by providing the means to validate RDF data graphs."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:df6c20a4-aa88-4e25-a438-3587559a9228 .

