camssa:7043408b-f1df-42fe-89c0-04dd27d1f626 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OpenPM2 is a Project Management Methodology developed by the European Commission. Its purpose is to enable Project Managers (PMs) to deliver solutions and benefits to their organisations by effectively managing the entire lifecycle of their project. PM2 has been created with the needs of European Union Institutions and projects in mind but is transferable to projects in any organisation.\r
\r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fd537153-4770-44cc-b94c-5d60176e7e39 .

