camssa:7063300e-4723-4d31-a201-fd242e91ea97 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of GITB TDL as a European standard.\r
\r
