camssa:706554e7-8e36-4d73-95da-512ce2e58105 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no national or European platform with the specification XAdES (ISO 14533-2:2012) available for free. However, there are some free documents in Joinup that covers XAdES digital signatures - Testing Conformance and Interoperability.\r
\r
XAdES Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/etsi-tr-119-134-series-electronic-signatures-and-infrastructures-esi-xades-digital-signatures"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:119607b7-c092-4893-a723-495bafa9f2d7 .

camssa:70684904-d0f3-4a8b-ac09-998abab9ab14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 7498:1 has a specific section called "Transport Layer" whose purpose is to provide transparent transfer of data between session-entities and relieves them from any concern with the detailed way in which reliable and cost effective transfer of data is achieved. 

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8b43a39c-0961-4fc0-98ba-6bb084bd034e .

