camssa:70c87693-df25-4f11-b362-911969e8e999 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is a widely used de-facto standard. Thus, it is sufficiently mature for the development of products and services. Since it's recommendation by W3c in 1996, XML has been used by many products and services.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2006/REC-xml11-20060816/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2f97d44a-b203-47a1-bc9f-221fa46bf540 .

