        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes ETSI EN 319 532-3 in their national catalogue with its National Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories: 1. Conceptual model for integrated public services provision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:33d37251-51ec-4161-9a4d-a0ffb3fb6ead .

