    cav:value "1" .

camssa:713a02d4-3847-48e6-9c82-0f1558a24a4a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"JSON is available for its use, study and implementation at Ecma International and IETF's webpages. Moreover, Ecma International's purpose is to make available the developed standards and specifications in a non-discriminatory and free of charges. Therefore, JSON is licensed under (F)RAND and Royalty-free basis. Terms and conditions for IPR disclosures can be found in Ecma's webpage. \r
\r
ECMA IPR:\r
http://www.ecma-international.org/memento/Ecma%20IPR%20policies.htm\r
\r
JSON specification in ECMA webpage:\r
https://www.ecma-international.org/publications/standards/Ecma-404.htm\r
\r
JSON specification in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc8259\r
\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:12a23928-5c2f-4960-a763-83233bb2db8c .

camssa:713bd549-bc52-41d4-85ce-31f7a02e783c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-847f0d7b5b56f9491b75fadd87efa1d6bdb112bcbb660d2ec7b6d786d403360f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:71476464-c9d5-46b8-b7db-041e0703e92c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The adoption of PDF/A as a document format for exchanging information does not hamper the scalability of systems. It is a widely adopted and used for this purpose and, moreover, it is independent of any platform or software. Therefore, PDF/A is proportionate to the users' needs and at the same time, it does not hamper the interoperability and scalability of systems.  "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:961e8195-2b9c-4955-a6d0-fcb225ea832d .

camssa:7148adc7-42b9-432f-9620-089c17578151 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s Intellectual Property Rights Policy is based on Standard Essential Patents (SEP). The policy implemented by the standardisation organisation seeks to reduce risks and ensure that the standards are available under (F) RAND basis and Royalty-free, it means with no cost or fee to be paid when possible. \r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:074586d7-30b9-4a72-8aba-0b5d14753a4d .

camssa:714d3c51-d2aa-4a61-ba7f-a473d6234b4b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG is a file format that allows to save images digitally. This fact allows administrations to share digital content among others and with the stakeholders. Allowing the exchange of visual information can help administrations to spread information all over the Internet avoiding having paper images, which reduces the administrative burden.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:112cf94f-15c4-49a4-83bc-2d262ae5a917 .

camssa:714f7cd9-1fd4-400e-8716-1ff7a6fdd0e2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2cedd44f05183dae5548108bdeace2c092b84c7c5d89c475b0741ddae7fc7b2 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:714feb54-8426-4db0-8c20-56be4a901a66 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7151a4d7-fafc-4684-8727-c1bcd3666f50 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Data Spaces Business Alliance (DSBA) aims to converge the best skills, assets, and experience in Europe into a one-stop-shop for data spaces, from inception to deployment. The Data Spaces Business Alliance are Gaia-X European Association for Data and Cloud AISBL, the Big Data Value Association (BDVA), FIWARE Foundation, and the International Data Spaces Association (IDSA), who created and currently maintains the Dataspace Protocol. With this cross-industry expertise, resources and know-how, the Alliance drives awareness, evangelizes technology, shapes standards, and enables integration across industries.

 Data Spaces Business Alliance (DSBA): https://data-spaces-business-alliance.eu/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ea616f7e-5561-4740-a484-02c930e57388 .

camssa:7152316c-252f-4ef1-b66a-94a7bbce638c a cav:Score,
