        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After researching there has been no success finding any assessments about the specification effectiveness.\r
\r
How the specification can help ensuring trustworthiness of information:\r
https://script-ed.org/article/blockchain-based-electronic-time-stamps-and-the-eidas-regulation-the-best-of-both-worlds/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ee925beb-a65e-48d7-b4f6-6f103be5a720 .

