camssa:71c36ba5-7b37-4391-a891-08fbe623cb5d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'To be able to make access control related decisions that are based on reliable identities and properties of Participants, a concept for Identity and Access Management (IAM) is mandatory. DAPS provides the International Data Spaces with identity management across companies according to modern standards with low organizational effort.\r
\r
DAPS: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/tree/main/Components/IdentityProvider/DAPS'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:415f5862-e273-4199-84a8-856afb928351 .

