        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification's schema is in rdf, which is one of the conditions to be linked open data.\r
\r
Dublin Core Ontology metadata using rdf:\r
https://www.dublincore.org/specifications/dublin-core/dc-rdf/\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/\""""@en ;
