    cav:judgement """'The specification proposes optional extensions. Therefore, it can be considered that OCSP allows for partial\r
implementation.\r
\r
OCSP reference, section 4:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2560'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7dbf40ce-4593-4771-aace-95773bc0e127 .

