camssa:71eec752-bfb5-405a-8aba-9f06a28fb175 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C has a page that collects implementations of the Data Quality Vocabulary, an RDF vocabulary which has been developed in the W3C Data on the Web Best Practices Group. For instance, a research group from the University of Leizpig has developed RDFUnit, which provides an API to generate DQV reports.

DQV Implementations: 
https://www.w3.org/2013/dwbp/wiki/List_of_DQV_implementations

RDFUnit:
https://github.com/AKSW/RDFUnit/tree/master/rdfunit-w3c-dqv'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31d9d3ed-21c1-4e84-b4c4-6680443ca299 .

camssa:71eff447-d80e-4d94-978a-fc2b714e5f5a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The scalability and broad character of the specification can make possible the creation and the availability of solutions fostering the reuse and availability of information between administrations and citizens. This fact demonstrates that the specification can foster the implementation of the once-only principle. \r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0fb319ee-f698-4cd6-a6ff-bbcb076cbbbb .

camssa:71f05faf-cff9-4c85-a470-389d4cd7b933 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6fa642bc8eceff2b1d333dc1123748399264c028fde2fd78308f0a0209ae21b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:71f46864-eb26-4799-9cd6-2cd169a6008b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, ISAE 3402 can define the interoperability aspects of the Privacy Framework ABB of the EIRA Organisational View.\r
\r
ELIS reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v110'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ed7055bb-393f-4134-be7c-7b20b91a4e20 .

camssa:71f937dd-c5c5-4f7b-911c-e5aadcebd106 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is domain-agnostic, its main purpose has to do with document exchange and therefore can \r
be implemented in either public administrations or any other kind of organization.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:513e31e0-b4d0-446f-822e-fd2ca1777013 .

camssa:71f9c722-c605-44ba-b883-5e1a728d0157 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """No evidence has been found of the specification being included in a formal interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision. \r
\r
However, LegalDocML has been included  within the European Commission's Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation and in the related standardisation activities of the same report.\r
\r
The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-single-market/en/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:72045afd-ac5c-488c-8342-fc8401594ecc .

camssa:71ffb033-30c9-4fae-b7d4-81232602d6c7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPv4 specification can utilise Access Control Lists (ACLs) to establish an access control mechanism and ensure that data is protected against unauthorised access. Packet filtering is a technique used to control network traffic and restrict access for specific users or devices. ACLs perform this filtering by evaluating traffic as it moves through a router or switch, allowing or blocking packets based on defined rules for specific interfaces or VLANs.

IPv4 ACL:
https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/switches/lan/catalyst2960l/software/15-2_6_e/configuration_guide/b_1526e_consolidated_2960l_cg/m_sec_acls_cg_danube_2960l_cdb.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cb430bc4-e881-4098-817e-d8de618e6425 .

camssa:720180ab-59fb-4093-be8f-6df14da0207d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:720382f9-5e52-4ec8-908a-a9ade72414a7 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-31bf959b6c4a983ec70eb87e0177f2739575ebce42c7c3b95b9012ef3bfe673e ;
    cav:value "1" .

