        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GiITB TDL simplifies the delivery of European Public Services by contributing to the adoption of a multi-channel delivery approach.  \r
\r
GITB TDL reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/introduction/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:147d69c6-2e86-4405-8c7a-6c116fb54058 .

camssa:7242e242-c8ce-4b5b-bebf-6c11e4f44cb1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of this document is not related with data portability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5b628f33-a582-4ba9-a462-fc67ae9e3b24 .

camssa:7247fd2f-ce5e-4d7d-a7af-043b657bdc3c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification provides a standard format for representing legal documents that can facilitate the reuse of relevant information when needed. By using a standardized format, legal documents can be exchanged and processed by different systems and applications, which can help to ensure interoperability and avoid compatibility issues.\r
\r
AKN4EU reference: https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ec0739c5-108b-46d9-86e8-cbbaaed81961 .

camssa:72489ca0-5ed8-4487-b218-e74c61d49f6c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
