    cav:value "1" .

camssa:72bb5547-2fa2-48f5-8002-ae8217e071f1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By providing interoperable vocabulary, model and encoding mechanisms, the specification contributes to the standardisation of the statements and conditions of use for public services and improves the comprehensibility of administrative services. It is a valuable tool for the cross-border decision-making process. \r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c3059958-52ae-4297-8f83-83bfdb1e5627 .

camssa:72bc82f0-7f42-4068-adf8-e1b47a8a6710 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS 1.3 offers several improvements over TLS 1.2. Major differences include a notably faster connection between client and server, the TLS handshake, and simpler, more secure cipher suites, sets of algorithms such as AEAD algorithms that secure a network connection during the handshake. It also introduces 0-RTT (Zero Round-Trip Time), enabling faster connection establishment for some data. These changes, amongst others, provide improved performance and stronger security between client and server.

At the time of doing this assessment, there is currently a draft from February 2025 pending to review. This draft aims to refine and improve the existing TLS 1.3 standard, ensuring it remains secure, efficient, and interoperable in the long term. 

TLS 1.3 2025 Draft Reference:
https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-tls-rfc8446bis-12.html

TLS 1.3 2018 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1f0dcf15-0f90-48ea-8690-b14e5f516384 .

camssa:72bcb6f4-f90a-4aad-b6a4-07f53f0079ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is aimed to represent public ontologies in order to be readable in both formats, machine-readable, and human-readable format. However, OWL2 does not help the availability of interfaces with internal information.\r
\r
OWL2 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-overview/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf709258-ea55-40ec-a2be-0210c42142e7 .

