camssa:72ed1dd8-1be7-4eb6-88f6-4fe38cd2897e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standardisation and in the related standardisation activities of the same rolling plan. The specification has sufficient market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services. The inclusion as basis for LEOS supports the fact that the specification has sufficient market acceptance according to the target audince. \r
\r
In addition, The LegalDocML TC works to advance worldwide best practices for the use of XML within a Parliaments', Assembly's or Congress' document management processes, within courts' and tribunals' judgment management systems, and generally in legal documents including contracts.\r
\r
The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-single-market/en/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation\r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91f60f1b-4209-48aa-86cb-ddece745a87f .

camssa:72f78745-a25e-4b8a-8e55-6f9db9cbb05b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPv6 is included in 4 national catalogues, which belong to Member States which comply with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the EIF according to the NIFO factsheets.\r
\r
See:                                                                                                                                               https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/lijst\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards                                  """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2411ccb7-9178-41f5-a156-e72c96692973 .

camssa:72fb295a-3392-4623-b896-3b250439f553 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Given that the aim of the DPV is to become a standard data model and vocabulary to be used across Europe, it is designed to support most of the languages used in the European Union.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0002401c-6dbf-463a-895a-10c4627db53d .

camssa:72fb6f75-a165-4234-a5e2-e071da6cb967 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The iCalendar specification allows for partial implementations, giving developers the flexibility to support specific subsets of the standard according to their application's needs.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:68b1984d-6261-4b38-995b-408de8b118a6 .

camssa:73092461-01ec-418f-86f6-3c9272be69b9 a owl:NamedIndividual,
