camssa:73362338-b562-4f72-9855-10bfe3172461 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the CSIP does not explicitly focus on the secure processing of data, its adherence to open standards, inclusion of administrative metadata, and alignment with best practices can indirectly support the secure processing of data. Organizations implementing the CSIP should complement it with appropriate security measures, encryption, access controls, and compliance with data protection regulations to ensure secure data processing.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4563eab6-5218-4235-bccc-89a2eb430f5a .

camssa:7336ea55-918f-4b00-bfd5-75f530b3910e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a60f86e868fe2bdcf0c5c47111455d1d5b59498172688e36f23a77baa347d916 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:73393091-93d1-4af7-9bf3-8be77a0beb13 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The puropse of ETSI TS 119 512 is not related to the publication of open data, therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2ea336e7-1982-46bc-b0d4-e1c3b7e007e5 .

camssa:733949fd-2585-4ac4-9c1a-9f72ade395df a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3c0edf049cd95575b46d688ed31be0ccce7a5822c5bcc22adf05d491f01f2780 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:733d16d0-efdf-4bff-bb6b-a647d8e8bb88 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XHTML has some features to prevent possible security vulnerabilities. Moreover, by allowing to exchange
data via online websites, XHTML fosters the secure and trustworthy data exchange between administrations
and stakeholders.

XHTML W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f0d9a57e-3512-465c-9816-b284f83c2af4 .

camssa:733e9b39-3417-4109-b766-bf78a720442d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-812668363d8f0cc562041fae6c588e1555372bf0bf5c16835be996dd72070013 ;
    cav:value "20" .

