camssa:73bc8d7a-865d-4777-a041-797f255efeef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'In ETSI TS 119 512, there are different profiles of preservation schemes, but without mentioning whether they can be implemented independently. Moreover a preservation service may support different preservation schemes, which define the general approach for preservation. 
 
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:24b614cf-5070-457a-a232-d4e349adb7b1 .

