camssa:73cbf6ec-5e83-4bb1-9e1f-115523c48514 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licences granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including Xforms 2.0.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:173e9e99-9cef-4a91-ab3b-e34d583b56c2 .

camssa:73cc46db-3019-469e-9752-2d44d0bd194d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The AMQP specification documentation suggests it is sufficiently mature for use in the development of digital solutions and services. The standard continues to be maintained and advanced by the OASIS AMQP TC. While companies like Microsoft, Red Hat, and Software AG support AMQP in their products and see it being used in various scenarios. Furthermore, AMQP has been approved for release as an ISO and IEC International Standard with the designation ISO/IEC 19464.

AMQP blog reference:
https://www.oasis-open.org/2014/05/01/iso-and-iec-approve-oasis-amqp-advanced-message-queuing-protocol/

AMQP TC reference:
https://groups.oasis-open.org/communities/tc-community-home2?CommunityKey=969c2da1-55c4-4bba-92d2-018dc7d3efe9

ISO/IEC 19464 reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/64955.html

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ce7d7f66-fb10-4012-8132-169538f6a33c .

camssa:73cecd4e-dbe2-411f-b01a-c5579b789736 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ADMS helps to search, identify, retrieve, compare semantic assets to be reused by public administrations, it can help to reduce the administrative burden related to the development and design of solutions. \r
\r
ADMS on Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/about\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:692079ee-665a-4156-90e0-8653d8d5bd98 .

camssa:73d002eb-07cc-47af-8765-480e70b35af1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6184fb705cfed44856c7b9594b492926f7a63a128a5a2be7b896294d8c79838 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:73d83105-8a1d-4641-b8c6-1c1e9565feb2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Currently no member state has included the specification on its national catalogue.

CAMSS list of standads:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
