camssa:7418aa17-62bb-4aed-90a1-d780ffc8c499 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TOSCA offers the possibility to manage and orchestrate resources for the provisioning of cloud applications and services. In this sense, when combined with other specifications, the specification enables visibility of data and services.\r
\r
TOSCA reference, section 1.2:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html#_Toc26969412'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2db19dd9-d27f-484e-850c-00aa3ccdb417 .

camssa:741cbfb5-dd72-439a-9d04-c854b9d3d8ec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are several studies assessing the adoption, strengths, weaknesses, effectiveness and efficiency of FTP.\r
\r
See: \r
https://dzone.com/articles/potential-downsides-of-using-an-ftp-solution \r
https://themanifest.com/development/how-evaluate-your-file-transfer-protocol-system \r
https://sapinsider.wispubs.com/Assets/Articles/2012/January/Using-FTP-Know-The-Risks """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9ff40434-9f1c-4e16-ae08-bc1856933439 .

camssa:741fe879-c97c-4d85-b79b-f064d46d492c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'In order to maintain the confidentiality, integrity and availability of information, ISO/IEC 27001 defines the standards on which the long-term preservation of data must be carried out so that it is stored in a secure manner in accordance with information security management systems.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 27001 reference website:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/54534.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de695946-ac1c-48b4-8576-9f1fe0eef052 .

