camssa:74621880-327f-452e-912d-2bc758e36bcd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is used for the certification of time-stamps, which provides information about the creation or modifications of certain documentation or data, it can be used when archiving electronic records as a manner to preserve the integrity of such data. Therefore, the IETF 3161 Time Stamp Protocol (TSP) fosters the preservation of electronic documents by providing a mechanism for clearly identify time stamps for these electronic documents. \r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e5f10c83-165c-4ac8-9783-f157356beec5 .

camssa:74665f22-595e-477d-98d3-f4b1da7bc092 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By allowing public administrations to have online forms to interact with the population, Xforms fosters the visibility and comprehensibility of public administrations and services.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7b9ade4d-c686-41d2-95bf-f5dae9cd6b5e .

camssa:746a35a7-9aeb-48b4-979a-963c69486614 a cav:Score,
