    cav:value "100" .

camssa:74877831-d39d-4077-8187-96465b42fe5c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of ISO/IEC 27001 within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:84db137f-829c-4bb3-88f6-6f6e6db20745 .

camssa:748b861f-ad41-4391-9c65-9ad6850e9b67 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b4f0d1b7f1d41c70797fa200c6fc73ac01f2f1659319e5cb1cebe8f5e79c1fcb ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:748c901a-2f1b-4db5-a0ac-1b9506262590 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTPS is maintained and developed by IETF which is an international community developing open standards. \r
\r
Developer community IETF: \r
https://www.ietf.org/about/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:67fa31a4-027c-4542-8aea-9dfd29e07dd6 .

camssa:7495a263-57cc-4cab-a9f7-c69eac9b918d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 432 specifies the protocols semantics for requesting the digital signatures creation to a remote server and for receiving the related response. For the semantics mentioned, the specification has two bindings, each one in a different format (XML and JSON). Both XML and JSON can be easily parsed and manipulated by programming languages and tools, making them machine-readable and ideal for exchanging data between different systems and platforms.

ETSI TS 119 432: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119400_119499/119432/01.02.01_60/ts_119432v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aad3db5c-35c6-4b75-8f2b-dae59f8f3f18 .

camssa:7495afcf-2e15-4f9f-8612-e045ca83d673 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData services are used by a large community of users. These services use a common data model, which allows any client to interact with the service in a well-defined way (see OData reference). In this sense, the specification is domain-agnostic. For example, there are the Cambridge Weather-Pyslet demo service and the City of Medicine Hat Open Data Portal, in the field of academics and medicine, respectively.\r
\r
OData ecosystem, Live services reference:\r
https://www.odata.org/ecosystem/\r
\r
OData reference, 4 Service model:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/errata03/os/complete/part1-protocol/odata-v4.0-errata03-os-part1-protocol-complete.html#_Toc453752204'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:887b668f-6cea-4aac-be6d-b73ea0eccf2b .

camssa:7495cfb6-97ca-4ab4-9baf-d65fbb52d014 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ODRL has an open community where stakeholders can participate in discussions, share experiences, and contribute to the evolution of the standard. Community engagement can foster the sharing of best practices, use cases, and insights related to the implementation of ODRL.\r
\r
ODRL github community:\r
https://github.com/w3c/odrl\r
\r
W3 ODRL community:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/odrl/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9c64bc3d-70dd-4904-8542-5ffe9dbc9775 .

camssa:74984316-bea1-4df4-9c38-1d579cd6eae8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of CPOV is not related to the protection of personal data. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b8297b9-fdc9-43c7-8cd6-0e1bbd2d5e95 .

camssa:749c3c03-4f9b-4d6b-a9d9-c9986a40d042 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) is not related to the secure processing of data. Therefore the criterion is not applicable.

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ae15fc2f-8e0d-4435-903f-24b5b1ff09a2 .

camssa:749f6429-8dc4-4474-b585-87123e88b20b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"EUROSTAT (European Commission) ensures the maintenance of the NUTS classification. However, NUTS does not encourage the creation of communities nor does not promote the sharing of data and results in any national platform, except for some (non-)European states that have individually shared their data and results on their respective national platforms (see EconStor Publications reference, Croatia's NUTS implementation document, and Scotland government reference, Scotland's NUTS implementation document).\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Principles and Characteristics section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/principles-and-characteristics\r
\r
EconStor Publications reference, Croatia's NUTS implementation document:\r
https://www.econstor.eu/bitstream/10419/115958/1/ERSA2003_096.pdf\r
\r
Scotland government reference, Scotland's NUTS implementation document:\r
https://www.gov.scot/publications/review-nomenclature-units-territorial-statistics-nuts-boundaries/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d47e0bcb-637a-4af5-bad4-e411271d00e3 .

camssa:74a10999-cf22-4b60-807c-e0cf5531153f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:74a51739-7616-4335-879b-84bf06432763 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By using ADMS to describe assets/solutions, the administrations ensure and enhance the visibility of these solutions and assets that are involved in the development of EU administrations’ activity. \r
\r
ADMS on Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/about\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2cc4c8a9-7eeb-415a-9e62-abeadf049868 .

camssa:74a63ce3-89c5-4ee9-b5b9-7dc3a6c20e9a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including this specification.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8344ec5-25cc-4073-8bd1-c9c6de387f76 .

camssa:74a91d9b-8529-4e77-a42f-d7b1a08d7c47 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a document exchange format, PDF/A is a valuable tool for sharing information through the internet. Allowing sharing data and information the standard foster the comprehensibility of administration data and services. Additionally, it eases the decision-making process within administrations. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0fcd27a4-35ae-48c9-b06e-dc712ed6843f .

camssa:74addffc-46dd-4a8f-bc1f-5c70748dd76b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-52e41801b0db7274d934a229fee15e657273655d70d448d16706fcbe0e4f9746 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:74b38e48-c004-453e-ba5a-0aa0de45dfe2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DCAT is not related to the implementation of authentication mechanisms. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable tot the specification.\r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc785a42-2684-47a5-bf47-97d8df7aed95 .

camssa:74b3ab0a-2233-40ac-a9f9-ee3c582009da a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 10918-1:1994 (JPEG) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html \r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db690293-292d-438f-9d2a-a6ee859db4d2 .

camssa:74b7e05b-ab6e-42a2-b952-a38d3d75f0ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ELI is designed to be technology-agnostic. This means that it is intended to work independently of specific
technological platforms or systems. The goal is to allow flexibility in its implementation across various
technology environments, making it adaptable to different systems and ensuring interoperability. This
approach facilitates the integration of ELI into diverse information systems and applications without being
tied to a particular technology stack.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:968e7a99-d352-4496-ba7f-71424ed7f06d .

camssa:74b97bcd-5968-45cc-b5fa-72a09ddd3340 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT is a domain-agnostic specification that can be reused for the description of any catalogue of dataset independently from the business domain addressed. For DCAT users having business-specific requirements, the specification is generally extended (e.g. StatDCAT-AP for statistical data). Therefore, the specification can be implemented across business domains.\r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200\r
\r
StatDCAT-AP:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/statdcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/101'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:672849f3-7424-4006-9984-a6d8a297ed20 .

camssa:74bb502c-40a4-4bd1-8750-c4377321c423 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPSec is already associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, IPSec can define the interoperability aspects of the "Network Service" and "Network Components" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91929e87-dca2-4260-bc0a-f7fd0cabd288 .

camssa:74bbe2a2-8db8-4df0-9fa8-bda820f717a2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6184fb705cfed44856c7b9594b492926f7a63a128a5a2be7b896294d8c79838 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:74bf871f-2729-4570-b6e7-9f42642ee5d8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:74c30e4a-4142-499a-bf07-02573cabc415 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 does simplify the delivery of European public services as TLSOs shall define, maintain and implement appropriate measures, practices and policies, including change management and security procedures, for establishing, publishing and maintaining the trusted list to ensure that the information provided in the trusted list is timely, accurate, complete and authentic.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 612 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1892791a-f2b6-4c83-be2a-5cf7433e0daf .

camssa:74c3b096-2114-4bf9-8297-4c5838fa422b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ADMS is a vocabulary based on DCAT for the description of Assets, specifically interoperability solutions). In this sense, the ADMS helps the publication and reusability of solutions and their data.\r
\r
ADMS on Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/about\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:29e39b66-e8d8-41da-b0e6-1ad659abf591 .

camssa:74c7c5af-6cbf-4d70-88c6-fc9598d32373 a cav:Score,
