        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of NUTS is not related to data portability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, History of NUTS section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/history'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab7c529c-9e05-46d2-b267-15540c232a8a .

