camssa:74d8f6b9-787f-4af4-a999-7a5381252eaa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"While OpenTelemetry is not directly related to enabling the secure exchange of data, the OpenTelemetry Collector defaults to operating in a secure manner, even though it is configuration driven. A section of the specification is dedicated to reported Common Vulnerabilities and Exposures (CVEs) across all repositories in the OpenTelemetry organization on GitHub and how to report and respond to any security incident that impacts OTel's Community. 

OpenTelemetry Security: https://opentelemetry.io/docs/security/
\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5cd899c7-7edd-4d52-acc2-f637c1e7c9ea .

camssa:74d96606-4325-4068-a738-3c58247697d7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 can be found on the specifications and standards repository of its standards development organization, the European Telecommunication Standards Institute (ETSI).  \r
\r
ETSI standards repository:\r
https://www.etsi.org/committee/1399-esi'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:330eecb4-e0b4-43f4-8f23-825cd0a20b66 .

camssa:74d98e64-d451-49d0-a991-2e8ef153e50a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As it happens with all the e-Government Vocabularies, it has the SEMIC action from the ISA2 as responsible for the maintenance of the development.\r
\r
SEMIC in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:297b2482-feec-421a-aee8-b1b0349a4a9c .

camssa:74da5dcf-2f61-4e9b-964e-649a482daff3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing studies assessing HTTPS in terms of effectiveness. Among some of the studies found there can be mentioned a survey of the implementation of HTTPS in Android Apps or an assessment of the legal and technical solutions to secure HTTPS.\r
\r
Security Collapse in the HTTPS Market: Assessing legal and technical solutions to secure HTTPS:\r
https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/2668152.2673311\r
\r
A Survey on HTTPS Implementation by Android Apps: Issues and Countermeasures:\r
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2210832716300722\r
\r
An Empirical Study of the Cost of DNS-over-HTTPS:\r
https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/3355369.3355575'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7015e166-4990-4f3a-a1cf-3bbc61304de1 .

