camssa:75129ecf-7f7a-4b32-a50f-0b1c47eacd14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a mail format specification, MIME is a valuable tool for sharing information through the internet between administrations and stakeholders. It allows sharing data and information in a specific format, it fosters the visibility of administration data and services. MIME fosters the collaboration between public administrations and it eases the decision-making process of institutions.\r
\r
MIME reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e9d3df51-78c0-4ce8-9463-eb7c274d9d6e .

camssa:7514bb9b-2440-4cd3-989e-99a6cadd282a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b122f4f42ca2089ee158a31d932d6a0332aa3a4d04acce1e2e7aa140815a0ec ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:751f6538-c5b5-4b84-88a2-41453f6f7e6e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OCSP defines a protocol useful in determining the current status of a digital certificate without requiring\r
CRLs (certificate revocation list). Therefore, it can simplify the delivery of any European public service.\r
\r
OCSP reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2560'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1c4ea2d7-e6d2-4ac9-a825-0d5f00451805 .

camssa:75231df5-fea5-4b66-a45b-d202405606a4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ffdbd22af1ff3c1ebb100043d062a3df160007af761caf0a8c9f50f02e609c9e ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:75250f04-8fdd-46eb-9b44-eea4dd2d3236 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TGF provides guidelines for designing and implementing cross-organisational processes and services, as well as for developing interoperability agreements between public and private organisations. The TGF aims to promote the alignment of business objectives, processes, and IT systems, enabling organisations to work together in a coordinated and effective way.\r
\r
TGF specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html"'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28e5d096-aa3d-403d-ac8f-a0773a6bc230 .

camssa:75268793-d8ad-4277-b8cc-4edade31d98a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XACML indirectly contributes to data processing accuracy by providing robust and detailed access control, 
ensuring that only authorized and qualified individuals can access and modify data.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:59ae2477-7bf2-42f2-ae7f-6c4097a8bc34 .

camssa:75277d10-78c1-4867-b052-1a831d983792 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 14533-1:2014 (CAdES) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html \r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:209c4fdd-0fa3-4d66-9018-ed4cf3c4498c .

