camssa:75519068-7950-485a-8841-a2d1ed7ac23e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is included in two Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. These Member States are The Netherlands and France.\r
\r
\r
National catalogue France: \r
http://references.modernisation.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf\r
\r
National catalogue Netherlands:\r
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/lijst\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards	\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06c13b6c-125b-4fe5-bbfe-ec18cffe8a45 .

camssa:7551c5f6-ca3b-4755-bd1b-f695d956539f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'First of all ISAE 3402 provides a guarantee in the context of the security and confidentiality of information for \r
users and companies. Therefore, when a public administration contracts a service from a private company, it \r
can request the ISAE 3402 to ensure that their data complies with adequate confidentiality and security, \r
\r
ISAE 3402 handbook reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c9611c5f-97d5-4535-9c1b-910e96c6be52 .

camssa:75556ffa-79ad-48b5-ae9f-d1ff288b9382 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:755d4b9b-2496-4a96-a7fe-427c6e26ab58 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The OASIS Security Services Technical Committee, in charge of the development of SAML 2.0, operates under RF on RAND Mode of the OASIS IPR Policy. The specification is licensed on a Royalty-free and (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/security/ipr.php \r
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/ipr"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8cda7c5c-a5be-4549-84b5-151d0c293e27 .

camssa:755d854e-c603-447a-aa1d-f2268c6b61ab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the second star corresponds to the availability of data as structured data. Schema.org is a structured data mark-up schema enabling search engines and other information systems to query data in a structured manner. Then, this specification supports the publication of data as open data.\r
\r
Schema.org reference, Getting started section:\r
https://schema.org/docs/gs.html\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f088b6f2-2643-458e-99b1-a6f75ae9697b .

camssa:757353b2-5a39-4954-bdd9-4dafa29e67e6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Technical Committee (TC) CYBER (Cybersecurity) is encharged of the development and maintenance of the EN 303 645 specification. As other ETSI technical committes, the TC CYBER contributes to the report writing. Participation is open prior a registration process and a financial contribution (see ETSI Directives' Rules of Procedure).\r
\r
ETSI Directives, Rules of Procedure:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/Resources/ETSI-Directives\r
\r
ETSI TC CYBER press release reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/committee/1393-cyber\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:22a9a50c-9a08-4c77-b6eb-10365eca7986 .

camssa:75754d57-8c03-4d9d-9159-056535b97529 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As defined on the OASIS ebXML Registry Technical Committee (TC), only this TC is involved in the release \r
lifecycle of the specification. External contribution to this committee is possible through the Comment List, \r
where potential contributors may provide their feedback to members of the OASIS ebXML Registry TC. All \r
contribution from TC members and others regarding the release lifecylce of the specification is publicly available in the TC archive.\r
\r
OASIS ebXML Registry TC, Mail Lists and Comments section:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=regrep#feedback\r
\r
Comment List reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/comments/index.php?wg_abbrev=regrep\r
\r
OASIS ebXML Registry TC archive reference:\r
https://lists.oasis-open.org/archives/regrep/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:01da9acb-34fd-4ab1-a134-26cc5bae6e93 .

