camssa:7587be84-995a-4df6-b365-4e17c58c8488 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification was officially established in 2012, and the ELI ontology version 1.3 was published in July
2020, incorporating the experience and expertise of Member States collaborating closely to refine the
specification. On the ELI homepage, various materials are available to aid in visualizing and comprehending
the evolution of the specification. These resources assist Member States in implementing ELI seamlessly,
enhancing interoperability, and ensuring cost-efficiency.

The ongoing contributions from Member States play a crucial role in the continuous evolution of the
specification, allowing it to adapt to the changing needs of users.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html

ELI highlights:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:47c58f67-c87f-408c-bbc6-2be99a7a8957 .

