camssa:7603bad2-41ce-4184-9013-e07e876c90f8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Syslog can provide some mechanisms for authentication and can support the authenticity of the roles involved in data transactions to a certain extent. Implementing secure authentication mechanisms, such as TLS (Transport Layer Security) or other secure transport options, enhances sender identification and helps ensure that the syslog messages are genuinely coming from the claimed source.

Syslog Protocol: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c117f519-6efd-4169-80bb-97ae04f4c519 .

