        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSS can be found for free along within the European Collaborative Platform, Joinup.\r
\r
CSS in Joinup platform:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/cascading-style-sheets/distribution/cascading-style-sheets"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bd2662c6-156c-4cb7-ad39-b33632a9050c .

