camssa:7781a540-b310-4581-912d-fa1c4c35880d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The "xsl:evaluate" feature in XSLT adds flexibility by allowing dynamic evaluation of XPath expressions. To ensure secure processing of data, it's crucial to use this feature with caution. By validating and sanitizing input expressions, only enabling dynamic evaluation for trusted sources, and configuring the processor to disable unsafe operations, you can mitigate security risks like code injection attacks.

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ed215535-5af1-478b-93b0-d9eeffc7fdb7 .

