camssa:77842318-4a5a-4357-bf4a-f6199d6cdc1a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData is maintained and developed by OASIS, which is an international community developing open standards; specifically, by the Technical Committee (TC). The specification maintenance is transparent, and even if its development and the approval process is restricted to the specification TC, anyone can contribute by submitting feedback to the mailing list. All the contributions are publicly available.\r
\r
Developer community OASIS: \r
https://www.oasis-open.org/org/\r
\r
OData Technical Committee:\r
http://www.oasis-open.org/committees/odata/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edd55d48-7fc3-433f-8bcd-9c371aabb39d .

