camssa:77a8ed3e-5592-43fa-b838-e510baf71019 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification extends XML standard. In this context, XML is technology agnostic, therefore ebXML can also be considered  as a technology agnostic specification.

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0a447497-6e05-46b6-9b7e-d0697cd22836 .

camssa:77ac9c7b-91ae-4e4f-8a78-191eae9501cd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is not related to ensuring and enabling data processing accuracy. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8d10dd1-f5ce-48fa-8238-e5311fcbd65f .

camssa:77adec24-d5ca-4022-a0aa-ff6fb2add9c1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ESPD is designed to be technology-agnostic, meaning that it can be used with a variety of different digital\r
solutions and services. The ESPD is available in a range of formats, including electronic forms, and structured data formats such as XML, which allows it to be integrated into a wide range of digital systems and platforms. Such is the case of the Spanish service-based "registro de licitadores".\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html\r
\r
Spanish service DEUC:\r
https://visor.registrodelicitadores.gob.es/espd-web/filter?lang=es'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07716648-134f-4f66-b996-e01f65b4a624 .

