        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OSI is not related to privacy and as such is not included in any initiative both National and European level. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9c2cdbe2-2022-423d-a0f2-f50e8fc54c0d .

