camssa:78e4ffba-a62b-4b13-ad43-4cf50aca9ec7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS 1.3 does not facilitate organisational interoperability agreements, instead it provides a secure, reliable and interoperable channel that enables organisations to securely comunicate and exchange data, which is essential for the implementation of interoperability agreements and the operation of European public services.

TLS 1.3 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:43250b40-9d15-4e4b-b50a-888f58b25ccc .

camssa:78e802aa-1f66-471a-955e-3af76936581f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 19944-1 can indirectly contribute to data portability efforts by providing a classification scheme, promoting consistent data management practices, and encouraging interoperability considerations within cloud computing environments. \r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ee7fa094-604a-49cf-879d-438c0864f7b6 .

