camssa:79491af9-6136-44e3-a4ee-830b80d274c7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES Baseline Profile is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, PAdES Baseline Profile can define the interoperability aspects of “e-Seal Creation Service”, “e-Seal Verification and Validation Service”, “e-Signature Creation Service”, and “e-signature Verification and Validation Service” ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9aab1340-10b1-433b-979b-941a64984680 .

