    cav:value "1" .

camssa:7969a2b1-36c7-41eb-89aa-6d6d61186c41 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As a Reference Architecture, EIRA is meant to be used in early stages such the analysis, where the requirements for solutions developments are sets. In this sense, the EIRA provides a set of architecture building blocks, and also flexibility to extend it, ensuring that an e-Accessibiilty from design can be followed, ensuring that Digital Public Services that start from EIRA to its implementation can be accessible. 

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9247df16-22ea-426e-a80f-43c3aff6cb38 .

camssa:7971426d-080c-4a51-b6f9-b7fb27fb69e5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Dublin Core Ontology may enable digital service delivery channels. European Legislation Identifier (ELI) is using DCMI  in some of its use cases, increasing the access to legislative documents. ELI is adopting the DCMI Legislation vocabulary.\r
\r
DCMI About:\r
https://www.dublincore.org/about/\r
\r
ELI-Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eli-european-legislation-identifier/solution/eli-legislation-extension-schemaorg/about\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b8961af-c102-4a81-8a29-1696717dd64c .

