camssa:7983464a-4f63-4ce8-bb28-eebc2b1b264c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """This document sets out Best Practices tailored primarily for those who publish data on the Web. The Best Practices are designed to meet the needs of information management staff, developers, and wider groups such as scientists interested in sharing and reusing research data on the Web.\r
\r
W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8a51e3df-e94b-48fd-a2d9-c7988cc21ce1 .

