        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing the publication and discovery of web services, UDDI helps to reduce administrative burden avoiding administration and stakeholders to spend time searching for web services and improving the results while integrating services and exchanging data. 

UDDI OASIS reference:
https://www.oasis-open.org/standard/uddi/'"""@en ;
