camssa:79a3d42a-95f2-4534-af8b-7dfb4808926c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification allows for extension. The specification is designed to be modular and extensible, which enables implementers to add new elements, attributes, or namespaces to the existing XML schema to meet specific requirements.\r
\r
Implementers can extend the Akoma Ntoso specification by defining their own modules or components that incorporate new functionality or modify the behavior of the specification. These extensions can be developed in accordance with the guidelines and best practices provided by the specification, which help to ensure interoperability between different implementations.                                                                                                                                                                    \r
\r
AKN4EU reference: https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1c62eec7-84d3-4e6e-87cb-a63d2956534b .

