camssa:7a655b14-435e-4c9b-993f-9829f3d628fe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The European Interoperability Reference Architecture is based on ArchiMate, an open standard. Also, it is modelled using Archi, an open-source tool that is also based on ArchiMate and TOGAF. It provides Open Exchange Formats (xml based) that allow users to use it in out of Archi tool. 

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA 

Archi - Archimate Modelling Tool: 
https://www.archimatetool.com/

Archimate: 
https://www.opengroup.org/archimate-forum/archimate-overview'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f90bdc95-7129-4fc2-adf3-e8fed5e34a03 .

camssa:7a66401f-704d-4b84-af17-6645f79c1864 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ADMS, as a vocabulary, can be implemented and reused independently of the amounts of data without hampering the scalability or the interoperability of systems. The reuse of the specification for the description of Interoperability Solutions or assets would ease and enhance the interoperability. \r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0fb766c2-79f2-4095-8648-a49b8b0f02df .

camssa:7a6bf2a5-7b46-4e9c-82a9-93c3cb706add a cav:Score,
