camssa:7a7bb4f7-651d-4db1-bb23-e8679f4c1d13 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Publiccode.yml does not include a real conformance testing suit, however, within the documentation there are explicitly stated which elements are mandatory or not, allowing the users to check and correct their publiccode.yml files accordingly. Moreover, there are different YAML syntax validator that can help to ensure files are properly built.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html

Section "The Standard":
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/schema.core.html#

YAML Validator Checker:
https://yamlchecker.com/

YAMLint:
https://www.yamllint.com/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:88ed4b0c-7a00-43d2-998d-36bf6945e3cc .

camssa:7a7fd3b3-23bf-4e6f-ab84-844dc2670aef a cav:Statement,
