camssa:7a9d0b83-65b3-4eae-b247-0b022acf792f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of LegalDocML is to provide a format for long-term storage and access to parliamentary, legislative and judicial documents that allows search, interpretation and visualization of documents. Concequently, it can be said that the specification fosters data portability between systems and applications.\r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b083a139-8664-4969-b45a-1d9bf247c12e .

