camssa:7aa8ca31-b25a-4048-8116-b829ce6c2b5b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Cryptographic algorithms are the basis of e-signatures encryption. ETSI TS 119 512 is furthermore developed for trust service providers for the storing and retrieval of information and data that require a high degree of security in their processing and exchange.  \r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b4ab4188-b872-4cae-b814-c6ad7acf992c .

camssa:7aab5a21-462d-4e04-90e7-e0f9ec8b3f64 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no Member State that includes PAdES (ISO 14533-3:2017) in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:94e2e902-ba34-4a33-9d76-8e6f029efad4 .

camssa:7aac69b7-40c2-4c51-b038-1414c396387b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP is in itself a tool that provides detailded guidelines for the development of e-archiving systems, establishing common understanding of the requirements which need to be met in order to achieve interoperability of information packages, therefore, it is a tool to assess the correct implementation of the aforementioned systems.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d69a2358-7995-4b36-9f52-4c2281282265 .

