camssa:7ace8175-0498-4593-91b9-d1ffe41bde10 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has specific provisions regarding data integrity since the main purpose of the specification is the sharing of the manufacturing assets. In this sense the specification provides reference to the IEC 63278-4 as a means to protect the data from unauthorised changes.

Data integrity in the AAS:
https://admin-shell-io.github.io/aas-specs-antora/IDTA-01004/v3.0/introduction.html#_integrity_protection

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e207191a-e8de-4831-94ea-991f85db6ce0 .

