camssa:7aeaa5f5-0980-4a6e-a4ba-19144bb5b157 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, LDAPv3 has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision and included in the European list of ICT Standards for eprocurement. The specification can also be found in the Joinup repository. 

ICT technical specifications:
https://single-market-economy.ec.europa.eu/single-market/european-standards/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en?prefLang=es'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:347067f1-139e-4608-ba4b-f588a41d1d81 .

