    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7b8b98c6-199a-4001-b2f0-7f58085cc057 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData offers a way to both break down data silos and increase the shared value of data. The specification contributes to creating an ecosystem where data consumers and producers can interoperate more than ever, allowing more applications to make sense of a broader set of data. In this sense, the specification promotes comprehensibility, for example through the OData data model. However, no evidence was found in terms of promoting and supporting the comprehensibility of European public services.\r
\r
About ODP - OASIS Open Data Protocol (OData) TC (Joinup):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/ict-standards-procurement/solution/odp-oasis-open-data-protocol-odata-tc/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e68043e5-0a4e-4628-ae00-a3e183722d18 .

camssa:7b8c1021-c411-45f4-981b-66b9b311f6ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although ISAE 3402 is not developed by European Organisations that are following the European \r
Standardisation Regulation, it is being recommended by ENISA according to the report for Security \r
certification practice in the EU.\r
\r
ENISA webpage:\r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/security-certification-practice-in-the-euinformation-security\\x02management-systems-a-case-study/at_download/fullReport '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bec2b670-1c64-4d74-b588-ba4ea654c306 .

camssa:7b91428e-07e5-4c75-9dfb-42c1d7a38ca8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of DNS is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:79c902a7-26b3-4fa4-ad98-f90ef37bcb24 .

camssa:7b9465d8-39e8-4207-abf4-94d3eceee2c5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-17bea234285e6e633e4e21105358610ad5f5f0eaaf82f4bd50cb64ec11538984 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:7b951c64-1d72-4332-89ff-f342aea6490e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of XML is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:266deb18-c7bd-4420-af3f-b344365b1e42 .

camssa:7b95669f-6953-4c4d-857d-0a95248fc56d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OData is not related to the organisational interoperability agreements per se, but given that it is recommended by Microsoft it can be argued that OData can serve as a baseline to facilitate interoperability agreements since the main strength of the specification is the semantic interoperability.


OData reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.01/odata-v4.01-part1-protocol.html#_Toc31358832
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:863a4d52-5a34-40a6-9324-95a473c6c12a .

camssa:7b9ade4d-c686-41d2-95bf-f5dae9cd6b5e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-19598487b8ba278c3438dcfd74b74d9aad51beac08c53dbf40bf108ed09e72b2 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:7ba12635-64e6-485a-823c-c9e9977b6c3f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:7ba2b8d8-c9c7-4e24-a47c-047d603836cf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Effective data management practices, as encouraged by ISO/IEC 19944-1, can contribute to an improved comprehensibility of administrative procedures, rules, data, and services within cloud computing environments. By categorizing and organizing data according to the provided classification scheme, organisations can enhance the visibility and accessibility of their data assets, including administrative procedures and rules. Additionally, ISO/IEC 19944-1 promotes effective governance and management of cloud services, which can indirectly contribute to the comprehensibility of services within cloud computing environments. By adopting the recommended practices outlined in the specification, organisations can establish clearer governance structures, define service management processes, and ensure the appropriate comprehensibility of services.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:917ebf80-afa4-4518-ad11-449a92e51719 .

camssa:7ba3fcc3-9830-4588-93d7-5f8843bb6e39 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DPV provides a taxonomy of technical and organisational measures for representing information about how the processing of personal data is technically and organisationally protected, safeguarded, secured, or otherwise managed. By referring to what measures are in place (such as GDPR) DPV directly addresses issues about the secure processing of data pointing to the compliance of legal obligations to ensure data protection.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c979a7e1-b220-4076-a858-0af44da234f8 .

camssa:7bb25ed8-d3c8-4767-a796-d97cf89ad37f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4db1d06d-de7b-423d-ba29-c1ee01b05efd .

camssa:7bb5d899-3872-413f-8c7e-dcdba8dc826c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C provides a test suite for free to assess SHACL implementations.\r
\r
See:\r
https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/data-shapes-test-suite/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5aa8ccc0-3bf9-446d-8659-eed3686f7682 .

camssa:7bb6e998-63dd-4475-9472-8c0e5aa57ff1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-847f0d7b5b56f9491b75fadd87efa1d6bdb112bcbb660d2ec7b6d786d403360f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7bb6f5c4-a066-4dcb-935d-e5ae8d24f275 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAIS provides a comprehensive framework for protecting information against unauthorized changes, helping to ensure that digital objects and metadata remain authentic, reliable, and trustworthy over time.\r
\r
OAIS specification:\r
https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/650x0m2.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d5f53ed7-a361-4c0d-b4a4-c8eafb99cfad .

