camssa:7bd6395d-43a4-4f44-afcc-ae1912c73d03 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Better Regulation Toolbox (as a part of the Better Regulation framework) is a European Commission resource designed as a complement to the Commission's Better regulation guideline. Even though it could be extended or modified to fit other business requirements at the National level, for instance, there are no implementations that evidence the possibility of extension to other business domains other than the development of public policies and laws.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf.\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:77107d42-29d6-42dd-bc50-5ae4bf27513a .

camssa:7bd647b3-f16c-4b0b-8d6a-ad59c35832a1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d12b846c487e7201dbcf395866b5abc0bb5fa040b1f519127b6a5f56d447257 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7bda9dfd-56f4-4f4e-ba73-9a768e31ce66 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 can be used as part of a larger strategy for secure processing of data. UTF-8 can be used to encode data that is being transmitted over a secure channel or stored securely in a database, but additional security measures such as encryption, access controls, and authentication are necessary to ensure the secure processing of data.\r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4b64d080-f1fc-46ee-8436-bf87a63d2239 .

camssa:7be07a1f-66d6-41b1-8e1c-1f321eb8b6ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As RDF defines a common framework to express information that can be exchanged between applications without losing meaning, it fosters the trustworthy data exchange between administrations and stakeholders."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f4ed4e35-ab58-4851-9f31-648ca1653856 .

camssa:7be09f40-01b5-4370-aa42-bc99d460e5e7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """RegOrg is publicly available for its use and implementation. It is available for everyone to study with no cost on Joinup webpage. Moreover, it is also available on W3C webpage.\r
\r
RegOrg Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/registered-organization-vocabulary\r
\r
RegOrg W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8ff23ad8-76ba-4b48-812b-3bdce6f8073d .

camssa:7be35721-9ca0-4751-8764-3e5a37f79460 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 allows for extensions to add support for additional characters or optimize the encoding for specific use cases, but any extensions must be defined and documented to ensure compatibility with other systems that use UTF-8.\r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:53ddb670-fa92-4e1c-8d02-21ee90795eba .

