        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPsec is available at the ICT Standards for Procurement Joinup for its use and implementation. \r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/ietf-rfc-4301-2005-security-architecture-internet-protocol/distribution/ietf-rfc-4301-2005-security-architecture-internet-protocol"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:55df31c5-238c-48ae-8d04-e145db4ff8f5 .

