        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-39ffef052c31580b50b418f3991e9de7db4dc182fcf96f5a447d7f8e09560612 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:7c3e8c8b-2183-459d-a4d4-bbee8785c6df a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-483e8900c47b40bc67a6bd1cbfce07884b9ac5f2c85e0214f334cc37e4e65c35 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:7c3f6a6a-257c-4302-aa49-3a3d20c7caff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Several implementations are assessing the usefulness and exploring how the usage of this specification can enhance the accessibility to digital platforms. Some of them are React Aria and Mozilla. However, this does not extend to the European Public Service.\r
\r
Mozilla reference, Accessibility section:\r
https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/Accessibility\r
\r
React Aria reference, home page:\r
https://react-spectrum.adobe.com/react-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0f9ca96c-6e47-434c-8bf2-3b54236bf495 .

camssa:7c42d313-d46a-4a22-a9c6-8be565f8f672 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are document of the European Commission assessing the suitability of XSLT specification.\r
\r
See:\r
 https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html#_xades_profiles"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9b843033-15a8-41a3-8762-1ef0076001c1 .

camssa:7c42dd9e-9e32-40cb-b8ed-e2a7dff0e2ac a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7c4418ae-d48d-4bdd-86ae-ccb95ab18476 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8eb17470327d32b3bb523447fe72ee5c60ddb03e81dae318b485fbe05f48a844 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:7c461910-2d34-4963-bbfa-9b7a93ff6912 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"EN 303 645 is associated to the consumer IoT device and the data security domain. EN 303 645 is a comprehensive, single-purpose specification that manufacturers and IoT stakeholders need in order to meet basic security requirements (see EN 303 645 homepage, 'International alignment and adoption' section). European directives are currently making an effort to verticalise the consumer IoT industry (see EN 303 645 homepage reference, about the vertical standard concept), opening up new possibilities to other domains (see Europe Plans on IoT reference). However, there is no evidence of the use of the specification in other domains, nor in the public sector.\r
\r
EN 303 645 homepage, 'International alignment and adoption' section:\r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/consumer-iot-security\r
\r
EN 303 645 homepage, 'Vertical Standard' section:\r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/consumer-iot-security\r
\r
Europe Plans on IoT reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation/internet-things\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bd393397-2c9f-4524-bd24-f532129ad210 .

camssa:7c573cb5-5a61-44d1-ba67-6cf368844ccb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SMTP is not related to organisational interoperability.  Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e8fc4db8-2572-4f28-84f5-cfd87992bffc .

camssa:7c57d975-dfc1-4842-bc03-ff878cea19ec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 primarily focuses on the physical and data link layers for Ethernet networks, and it does not directly address multilingualism. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2766e2c0-e921-46c6-84ba-1f86d6953716 .

camssa:7c5974f7-8b56-4270-a423-838ad8511626 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, PNG can define the interoperability aspects of the "Representation" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f474dbe3-26ad-419b-a3c6-792f1c11446e .

camssa:7c5c1239-1fb4-4732-9300-56062bc2cf58 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard, including a public review.

W3C Process document:
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2d137cd3-7aad-4dd9-b3cb-edf106684c85 .

camssa:7c5f713f-0de6-4b00-bf12-d2ae77f34a58 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of e-signature is a mean that allows administrations and stakeholders to exchange digital data reducing the amount of non-digital documents exchanged. Additionally, it fosters the reuse of data across borders, which as well takes part in the administrative burden reduction. \r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 401 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319401/02.03.01_60/en_319401v020301p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:076fcd34-466b-4e85-a14c-b0b89a965827 .

camssa:7c61303d-1c8c-4e45-97f7-94c0f0080e9b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XACML specification can be found in the DSSC catalogue, classified as a Data Sovereignty and Trust
standard.

DSSC catalogue:
https://dssc.eu/space/SE1/185794711
/Data+Sovereignty+and+Trust+standards+and+technologies+landscape'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc1da55c-4dd9-4645-a93e-8c255ee1d237 .

camssa:7c61608a-1c2d-42eb-92a8-751dd1ede188 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7c61a560-cafb-47ac-a80a-19bd7736e3ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """LegalDocML is XML based, however, it is not dependent on any other technology or platform, so it can be implemented independently from specific technologies or platforms.\r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:378dc108-0ef8-41a1-9cd6-77b1f1ceb570 .

camssa:7c65b10b-1c43-4ebf-8476-5c6cce0ec965 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Genericode is designed to be technology agnostic. It is defined using XML, which is a widely adopted and platform-independent markup language. XML can be processed and interpreted by a variety of programming languages, frameworks, and tools, making genericode usable across different technology stacks and platforms.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ba5c06f-6bda-4be6-a974-d35cfe9f0ade .

camssa:7c669975-dc8b-48e6-993e-c1779b191283 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7c68bbda-2ac6-403d-8263-50e74fe62813 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The only way the information can be long-term preserved is if it gets a PDF file copy of the REM Message \r
containing it.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cacbe5ba-2ef0-4cf1-8dc8-9fe98b9f2425 .

camssa:7c715e1c-f79a-469c-b6e5-bf6066aac3a6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cc272cd8a2e3e9c5e4edaa5ac7d59735c377a9db89d6958335a2cf0538761ab3 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7c727f65-e17e-46c2-bcb3-38792bcabc44 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:value "79%AssessmentScoreAverage",
        "85%StrengthOfAssessmentScoreAverage" .

camssa:7c754c5d-fee3-42e6-9f25-cc12090a1e19 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has specific provisions regarding encryption of data shared among partners that allow the confidentiality of data. Furthermore the specification also allows third party extensions to conform to more strict encryption.

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e7f88d2e-1ce3-4ca1-b712-d65eb413c5ea .

