camssa:7c7e3861-7cee-4333-873f-d09f188d6c37 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is included in an initiative at European level covering privacy aspect. As an example, the implementation of CESOP Legislative Package , which monitor the payees of cross-border payments and transmit information.\r
\r
XSD Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2012/REC-xmlschema11-1-20120405/\r
\r
Legislative Package CESOP Reference:\r
https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/taxation-1/central-electronic-system-payment-information-cesop_en\r
\r
Electronic system of payment information to combat fraud regulation Reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32022R1504'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9dbabc25-340b-4085-ab1f-1213709918cc .

