camssa:7c83f010-8e6e-40a3-ae66-04ea63757683 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'To maintain the confidentiality, integrity, and availability of financial information, ISAE 3402 implements\r
controls that trace the movements of that data as well as preserve it.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 UK website reference:\r
https://isae3402.co.uk/isae-3402'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:40dce5a8-4ace-4724-98f5-12f6f24b29cf .

camssa:7c84d974-08a7-402f-9306-b5ca7eae6179 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "After searching in the different official European websites, there is no evidence of any cross-border project that use CLV nor explicit agreements involving the usage of the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d79eaa87-af70-4ee1-9712-8b1158f2340b .

