        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT-AP is available on Joinup, the collaborative platform created by the European Commission to share and reuse IT solutions and good practices.\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/releases"""@en ;
