camssa:7cd12086-df29-4599-81cf-4bca3d040a74 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV allows for the documentation of metadata concerning the provenance and sources of data. By providing details about where data originates and the process through which it was collected and processed, DQV helps to establish the authenticity of the data. Knowing the provenance can assure users that the data has not been altered inappropriately and remains true to its original source.

DQV reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/#DimensionsOfISOIEC25012'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91e9a1b9-10b2-44d8-86b4-7fe3cec5003a .

