camssa:7d2c0a21-5e7c-47e4-80af-47739fe6a84f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The information on (new) standardisation activities is widely announced via the IETF websites and working group activities. There also is a mailing list one can subscribe to for announcements. This so-called IETF Announce list receives announcements about IETF meetings, the activities and actions of the IESG, the RFC Editor, the NomCom, and other announcements of interest to the IETF community.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.ietf.org/how/lists/announcement/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:af12fd79-5eed-4985-a290-138b05f0dbd6 .

