camssa:7d4d2873-26a2-4da3-bb06-608fd377b4e9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 7498:1 is primarily a conceptual framework for network communication and does not explicitly address the reuse of information in terms of data or content. However, the principles of modularity and layering within the OSI model indirectly support the reuse of relevant information.

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:369e1551-fdd2-4dd6-86d8-7e6f27f5f350 .

