camssa:7d562b69-8b0d-4c6f-9437-90c4bbcb0dd4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xforms 2.0 is publicly available for implementation and use for free on W3C's webpage. Therefore, it can be reused by the organisations, administrations, open communities, etc. that developed it.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:81f2819a-a326-4426-99d1-557fd0e613a1 .

