camssa:7d6b76af-65ad-4f97-a834-1b3f1b4bff42 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Digital service delivery channels involve the use of digital technologies to provide services to users or customers. These channels can include websites, mobile applications, APIs, and other digital platforms. The OSI model, as a conceptual framework, contributes to the development and interoperability of protocols that may be used in creating these digital service delivery channels.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d9459d39-cbe4-4fd9-9061-d3d3c52c00d9 .

