camssa:7d938be5-c0c6-4fcf-af2e-c65866a6599f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While SCIM provides a foundation for managing user identities, the secure processing of data goes beyond the scope of the SCIM specification. Instead, the secure processing of data relies on the implementation of SCIM in conjunction with various security practices and mechanisms.

SCIM: https://scim.cloud/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3a0188b7-5298-4e59-b748-9c3e92281283 .

camssa:7d98c52b-4f01-4131-a585-69851fd35162 a cav:Score,
