camssa:7da4b438-1df6-4adf-b064-9ec801891be3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The CPSV-AP allows describing public services in a standardised human and machine-readable format. This fact fosters the discoverability of the datasets containing information about public services. Therefore, it enhances its reuse and visibility.\r
\r
CPSV-AP Joinup webpage:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile/release/22\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cabfedea-5103-45cd-9a1f-fe304d28d59b .

camssa:7da97706-e949-48cf-8be9-a3314915ab22 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:7dab9434-1e10-4bff-9bfa-11318ad1ba6d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Due to its machine-readable nature, iCalendar has become a widely adopted standard for exchanging calendar data across various platforms and applications, making it an essential tool for automating calendar-related tasks and enabling seamless integration between different software systems. Moreover, the iCalendar format is designed to be easily shareable and disseminated across the internet, making it a good choice for publishing calendar information on websites or web-based applications.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bdbb616a-e6a8-4562-8eff-f94412243bd9 .

camssa:7dac050b-b028-499a-8ba1-f8d3596b9a1e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The GraphQL specification preserves the information as long as you mantain the API where the information is maintained. If it gets deleted so will the data in it. GraphQL clients can use HTTP caching to easily avoid refetching resources, and for identifying when two resources are the same.                                                                                                                                     \r
\r
GraphQL FAQ Website: \r
https://graphql.org/faq/#why-should-i-use-graphql\r
\r
GraphQL Caching: \r
https://graphql.org/learn/caching/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:95ed51db-22e4-46e1-9823-2e7d7e702947 .

camssa:7db3b64f-89b7-40d5-917e-8f6f91c2f97f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e370a4af17e89cbb70bb5079082a1e21cdee85435c8fc30b12a8987f18db367f ;
    cav:value "1" .

