camssa:7df87c32-60e5-48e3-a562-0563ed8f1dab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'9 Member States are recommending XHTML in their ICT National Catalogues. This Member States are
Cyprus, Estonia, France, Germany, Greece, Norway, Poland, Slovenia and Spain.

National Catalogue of Cyprus:
https://dits.dmrid.gov.cy/dmrid/dits/dits.nsf/all/B83AA8E4EB4EFD19C225855800288B10/$file/Cyprus%
20eGovernment%20Interoperability%20Framework_new%20EIF_v2.0-To%20Publish.pdf

National Catalogue of Spain:
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio
/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0cfbbf72-36cd-45a5-adf4-e62fa2da7e29 .

camssa:7dff0c96-6bac-4af8-a4e2-0681d6ee744d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After searching for a certification or conformity test to validate possible implementations or contributions to the specification the Foundation for Public Code has established a common method for validating and certificating those new codebase elements. However, there is no automated tool for users to test conformity or reach certifications. \r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a8afd637-d3f5-4186-b2e0-904d6a8b3297 .

camssa:7dff3c55-7621-4c00-a0f2-a097b22d402f a cav:Score,
