https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dc138ad7-8291-4fde-a1c2-603dcd1bae6d .

camssa:7e2df9a2-fd12-4a80-9ee7-264ae40112f1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 511 is being used in the eIDAS project, which focuses on the creation of e-signature services\r
aiming to enable secure cross-border transactions. eIDAS is based on the Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 of\r
the European Parliament and of the Council of 23 July 2014 on electronic identification and trust services for\r
electronic transactions in the internal market.\r
\r
Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 23 July 2014 on electronic\r
identification and trust services for electronic transactions in the internal market:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=uriserv:OJ.L_.2014.257.01.0073.01.ENG\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:628a63bd-632e-4ccb-b2e4-f2378651ad74 .

