        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The objective of the Open Systems Interconnection (OSI) is the creation of a common basis for the coordination of standards development for the purpose of systems interconnection and its expansion.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:59107ed5-bd51-4fea-821a-7f469308842a .

