        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is recomended by the Data Office of Spain. DIDs is mentioned in the Action plan for the deployment of data spaces. In this report, DIDs is mentioned as an specification for the implementation of sovereignty and trust funcionalities.

Action plan for the deployment of data spaces:
https://portal.mineco.gob.es/RecursosNoticia/mineco/prensa/noticias/2024/OdD-Plan_actuaciones_despliegue_espacios_datos_v1-0.pdf'"""@en ;
