camssa:8062f2f0-ee60-4960-b6b4-fff1de32f5be a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Verifiable Credentials enable digital service delivery channels as a good asset for digitalisation and administrative simplification. For instance, government-issued identity documents, such as national ID cards, can be verifiable credentials, which can be easily managed and verified while the individual maintains control over their personal data.\r
\r
Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2f6a1edf-261a-4bc5-99e3-82daa7905c29 .

camssa:8065f056-23e6-4358-9a4b-69869137d249 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is maintained by International Data Spaces Global (IDS-G) and any user can contribute by proposing discussions on the IDS-G GitHub Discussion channel.\r
\r
IDS-G Discussions: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/discussions'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d5105d9-4c64-4ae4-a7fa-35f957b8746c .

