camssa:807e9d3e-f002-47d3-99e7-33eb71d8b4e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While not a direct feature of OpenTelemetry, applications instrumented with OpenTelemetry can incorporate internationalisation (i18n) support to handle multilingual content and user interfaces effectively. OpenTelemetry can capture telemetry data related to user interactions with multilingual content, providing insights into how different language versions of an application are used.

OpenTelemetry Languages: https://opentelemetry.io/docs/languages/other/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:da0b3101-9283-4743-b297-e1982fa2fd0f .

camssa:8080df39-259f-4084-8ef2-8a0dadb99604 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Core Location Vocabulary defines a core data model that allows the description of locations, geographical elements in a common way. This fact ensures a trustworthy reuse and data exchange among administrations and stakeholders.  \r
\r
CLV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-location-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:025c2224-8493-41db-a12c-9df5ce5e7833 .

camssa:8084b849-21bb-4331-be7d-bebcefc69ebe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TGF has not been found included in any initiative covering privacy aspects.\r
\r
TGF specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ffc41913-d5ac-4c46-a72f-7f6c4d1591f6 .

camssa:80850277-cf76-4778-ae54-b03c85fa97a8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTP Cookies provides a way of addressing the secure exchange of data by adding the "httpOnly" attribute to prevent access to Cookies via JavaScript, or by setting the "SameSite" attribute to "strict" when it is necessary to authenticate sensitive information from the user. In browsers that support SameSite, this ensures that the authentication cookie isn't sent with cross-site requests.\r
\r
HTTP Cookies security reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6265#section-8'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2bd1cfec-d859-4e1e-aab3-25411ba625ad .

