camssa:81c9d276-901f-4604-89d0-9fe89b09ef38 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox encompasses a set of requirements, recommendations and principles that need to be taken into account when planning, developing and also when implementing public policies. Within the different tools described in the Better Regulation Toolbox some aspects that take into account interface issues (regarding end-user interfaces but also institutions access to interfaces) are present.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Guidelines reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/d0bbd77f-bee5-4ee5-b5c4-6110c7605476_en?filename=swd2021_305_en.pdf

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdff'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:38754a07-ab50-4abf-892c-84bd837d1e75 .

