camssa:81d67b39-f7d4-4a84-b83e-f2905cdbe48b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XSLT specification is mature for developing digital solutions and services, with comprehensive features and detailed documentation. W3C has a clear and structured methodology to publicly share documentation, and specifically the change management and release management.

Test suite for XSLT:
https://dvcs.w3.org/hg/xslt30-test/

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab2da35e-aa42-41e8-9bfd-a94e100d8197 .

