camssa:81f4d182-e71b-4cbc-8bbc-8530d3f4d94e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OCSP specifies the data to be exchanged between an application that checks the status of one or more\r
certificates and the server that provides the corresponding status. However, no evidence was found supporting its implementation in any European public services.\r
\r
OCSP reference, section 2:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2560'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0cb08a41-5734-4bae-a10f-e87bea849780 .

