camssa:825fc6f2-f5cd-4950-a48d-4f564a0bf47d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'NFVI is intended to be used in virtualised ecosystems. Because the NFVI is a distribution set of NFVI-nodes in multiple locations that supports the locality and latency requirements of NFV use cases, the specification can be used in any domain and is domain-agnostic.\r
\r
NFVI Deliver, Infrastructure Overview:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/NFV-INF/001_099/001/01.01.01_60/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:83f4932f-9db6-4cb3-9901-9a89fd12b673 .

