camssa:82645578-9c4e-45df-90ef-411977959970 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of the specifications is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. In the case that there would be an interface with HTML, this specification could help to ensure the availability of interfaces giving the correct format.\r
\r
CSS v2.1 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2011/REC-CSS2-20110607/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c2e2d0de-67f7-4525-a5de-f19fe68d1c55 .

