camssa:82a665e0-e8dd-4ba4-8ade-257d75b04dea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP appears in the Commission Implementing Decision "on the identification of ICT technical \r
specifications eligible for referencing inpublic procurement". In this document, LDAP is said to be a stable \r
technology that has the potential to increase interoperability and constitutes a de-facto standard for \r
authentication, For that matter, the LDAP standard can facilitate organisational interoperability agreements.\r
\r
Commission Implementing Decision of 3 April 2014 on the identification of ICT technical specifications eligible for referencing in public procurement:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32014D0188'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a793b623-3cba-45ca-8e0a-5def14633560 .

camssa:82a71d47-ff2c-4a9f-888b-b14581760357 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8954ddabf37f4899562b9ea4c8f0bbf204f3e48c9203043bc231f368092396a2 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:82a8e3da-10a9-4497-b9b2-4b674d9e0470 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Core Public Organisation Vocabulary facilitates the information sharing. It enables G2G (Government-to-Government), G2B (Government-to-Business) and G2C (Government-to-Citizen) information sharing. Moreover, CPOV can be complemented with other security specifications which guarantee the secure interactions between users.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary/distribution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary-version-100-pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c36056c6-190c-45d0-9920-0f2ded1b8b9a .

camssa:82aa6438-da4a-41ae-a4cd-8ace10d07f37 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b00b9b74de866ed2278d14d1b9d7ecf2c06950d296bb2f17013c7b710d6de41 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:82b9a187-1f7f-49bb-9d51-726b5418f5b3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:82ba0254-c289-4c45-9ce8-49b05c766f71 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification defines a profile for the time-stamping protocol and the time-stamp token defined in IETF \r
RFC 3161. It defines what a time-stamping client supports and what a time-stamping server supports. \r
Time-stamp validation is out of scope and is defined in ETSI EN 319 102.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8dd3c051-63ff-4de2-930c-b7ba40cc1273 .

camssa:82bccf59-18b9-4fd6-b843-1b77c59fa14b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0c9dd43038136296b52f50e05f9d6eef39f7b8018517224007990b15be2eb19e ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:82c2571d-3af5-4386-9c4f-d4c8e5102094 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """JSON strongly supports Tim Berners Lee's 5-star schema for open data. The adoption of JSON fosters the publication of data as open data by means of providing structured data and the usage of non-proprietary formats. Moreover, it helps to link data by means of embedding metadata. \r
\r
See: \r
https://www.europeandataportal.eu/sites/default/files/european_data_portal_-_open_data_goldbook.pdf\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70cd0115-3ca8-4036-a180-2d147f879d96 .

camssa:82c4424d-729c-4ca7-8410-80bb434ea920 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "80" .

