        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of WS-BPEL is not related to the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
The specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/wsbpel/2.0/OS/wsbpel-v2.0-OS.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:18203ae0-6567-47d3-9ba4-26460bf3b8c3 .

