camssa:83113404-5a0e-474b-924c-902066c05c71 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPv6 allows data exchange between systems and it is compatible with the previous version IPv4. \r
\r
Furthermore, he European Union fosters del IPv6 to ensure "The goals of the Digital Agenda for Europe and the Digital Single Market Strategy are based on stable and reliable data networks."\r
See: https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/ipv6_framework_for_european_governments_0.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d3410f9a-fc43-48f8-a116-a21bff533f8e .

