camssa:8354767b-67db-491a-914c-19fab59f366f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of ISO 639-2 within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en\r
\r
CENELEC and CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CEN:105::RESET::::'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a35cb706-db38-4e8f-a775-fd0d1792a32d .

camssa:8355dd3a-aca3-4a06-858b-2eaa3e20dd84 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is not related to the facilitation of organisational interoperability agreements, \r
therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3d36b375-0267-4ccb-a317-29a02622806d .

camssa:8358337e-59be-4606-9079-8b4dffbe3b06 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of SVG within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0faf5110-d208-41b0-a65f-4a8fd51bc15c .

camssa:835f17d8-da7d-4ff0-8836-3965a44ed6be a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of TLS 1.2 is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c550152-2025-41a9-ab87-3bf7e829d73d .

camssa:8361dfa7-c1ea-4d3b-a21f-22f832ce0d82 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the PROV family of documents does not specifically facilitate organizational interoperability agreements, its adoption and use can indirectly support such agreements by providing a common data model, semantic interoperability, standardized formats, and a framework for defining relationships and dependencies.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV Ontology:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-o-20130430/\r
\r
PROV Data Model:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-dm-20130430/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d718371a-db7b-4e0d-a5f6-40f04fcd9abb .

camssa:836b45f4-6e07-4fff-a5c0-db55b5a4282b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of SHACL is not related in any way to the long-term preservation of electronic records and other kinds of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fae1b52c-875d-49c9-97a6-ff23f67502b6 .

camssa:836ed980-7c51-49fd-8c3d-25a8de70e342 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is not related to enabling the visibility of administrative procedures, rules data and services, therefore it does not promote or hinder it.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab6d7a16-b5fb-415c-bb00-b3e57fe3e52b .

camssa:8375e92e-1748-40af-ac54-72f2d997c548 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The primary purpose of HTTPS (HTTP Secure) is to establish a secure and encrypted connection between a client (such as a web browser) and a server. This secure connection ensures that data exchanged between the client and server remains protected and cannot be intercepted or tampered with by unauthorized parties.\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3f0d9a30-8c69-45ad-af32-7e7678abf121 .

camssa:837efcd5-fbc8-4740-b5b7-fa6b09a9309a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:8380cb9d-b17a-4710-aaab-59d4aeda6f87 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The specification eases the access to information via webpages. Therefore, it reduces administrative burden for citizens, businesses and public administrations."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1e5ea51-b781-44ca-afd4-fcc67c04b10d .

camssa:8381395f-14dc-408c-8950-b3317b7c2b07 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The European Commission is the main organiser of communities focused on data sharing and results. In this sense the maintainer is the one encouraging via the specification to create these communities.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3e658ac7-9c52-4ab8-b49f-5161de5305a3 .

camssa:838950de-3e99-4148-8cf4-a55837be7853 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OSI is not related to data protection as such, but the specification addresses the protection of data against unauthorised changes during the transfer of data between systems, in particular on the Application Layer, where on the Connection-mode facilities data integrity can be protected via agreements on security aspects.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1c0f4dd7-873f-4703-bd1a-7e0aa215de4b .

camssa:838a4d71-82fd-4843-ba74-683fe71be723 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:838c671a-eae6-40f5-8eb4-24565e8e788f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Currently OData is used in the context of Datalab  (formerly known as Open Government Data Initiative), a cloud-based Open Data Catalogue for organisations that provide access to government data, including browse, visualise, analyse & download in multiple formats.
It is also used in the context of agricultural data by the agricultural ministry of Rumania, the Date Deschise AFIR project. 

Date Deschise AFIR project reference
https://opendata.afir.info/Home/About

Datalab reference:
https://github.com/openlab/OGDI-DataLab

OData Ecosystem:
https://www.odata.org/ecosystem/ 
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c7dbd29b-304e-4ce4-80dd-3d375683eaf0 .

camssa:8398f607-ad01-4838-a6d3-a64a5bdcd36e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-583a0f52df591048a41be40620830a70260e77855364174d91ba159970d8488e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:83997c79-296e-4e68-8ccb-40a4e6e552a7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PNG is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2a38d445-8a98-4a15-8b6a-e1456fffa049 .

camssa:839a31a9-f746-498a-b064-658385694aaa a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3b3b2febe9a7e3ad44bdefc47b0bbcafc7a2e677e9570d6ad822efbe1f7d41e2 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:839a394d-13b6-494e-b8b6-c714d314874b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS over HTTPS (DoH) can contribute to data portability between systems and applications as it secures DNS (Domain Name System) queries by encrypting the communication between the client and the DNS resolver, which is crucial in security and privacy matters. It allows secure access to data, avoids censorship filters, and improves overall privacy allowing for a secure environment for data portability.

DoH specification: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8484'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7ce9121c-b6e6-4d22-adb5-c0f03500a426 .

camssa:839cf43f-0d63-4f1b-9a91-feebd5620998 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The CPOV eases the description and publication of datasets including information of different public organisations, their services and responsibilities. These descriptions are done using human and redeable formats which ease the reusability and the information exchange across-borders. \r
\r
CPOV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:02974bad-d610-4937-9fd6-a7befac1e63f .

camssa:839e1de2-1dc4-4ca6-b20c-9f83f74ffd11 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:83a12bf8-055d-469d-ade6-94617b2a1bab a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-497a81dae06c1d53b4cfe96c1f998f6f65d46354d68a83d29a2950c984fc1166 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:83a90544-0ca8-4725-9588-6c049c289dd6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI is a European standards development organisation, and as such, all the specifications developed within the organisation are available and can be accessed through its website repository.

ETSI standards repository:
https://www.etsi.org/standards#page=1&search=ETSI%20TS%20319%20422&title=1&etsiNumber=1&content=1&version=0&onApproval=1&published=1&withdrawn=1&historical=1&isCurrent=1&superseded=1&startDate=1988-01-15&endDate=2022-07-25&harmonized=0&keyword=&TB=&stdType=&frequency=&mandate=&collection=&sort=1'"""@en ;
