camssa:83d0cf71-b797-4b18-8800-1c1e131a0db0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Genericode is included in the electronic Common Technical Document (eCTD) 4.0 Implementation package. eCTD is the standard norm for industry submissions maintained by the International Council for Harmonisation of Technical Requirements for Pharmaceuticals for Human Use (ICH). The package contains the updated eCTD v4.0 EU M1 Implementation Guide and the as well updated controlled vocabulary lists in machine-readable genericode format.

ICH eCTD v4.0: https://www.ich.org/page/ich-electronic-common-technical-document-ectd-v40'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9e49ebf0-6b47-47ee-a3c9-8fe9af62be04 .

