camssa:83e21399-b456-47ee-81cc-faca30131acb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The implementation of ELI helps to make legislation available for different stakeholders from governments. On one hand it supports the interoperability between European Public Administrations fostering data exchange and enhancing the visibility of administrations data. On the other hand, it also helps to make legislations available, fostering that citizens and business follow the work done by public administrations. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4e9b643d-a55b-4d28-afac-388d0dcaea0d .

