        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary does not provide an access control mechanism. The main purpose of the specification is to define a standardised way of describing organisations that have gained legal entity status through a formal registration process. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:af201d35-9c3b-4421-858a-79bc3e087934 .

