camssa:845d244e-1b67-48cd-9bf7-d04d8cf29d16 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The efficiency of SCIM is often assessed based on several factors that relate to its performance, scalability, and practical implementation. For instance, a 2023 paper by the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineering (IEEE) talks about how efficiency is heavily reliant on shared resources in a modern cloud computing culture and how SCIM can be a solution for the challenges presented in access management in centralized and decentralized identity governance.

A Survey on IdAM for Cross-Domain Dynamic Users: https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/10132479'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aba6b1ac-13eb-4546-8cdd-43668c0a41b9 .

