camssa:84799cb1-de18-4491-bf0c-a844b02eac1a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, DNS has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision. During the evaluation process, all the Member States are invited to share their doubts. The positive evaluation of DNS and its identification is considered an interoperability agreement.\r
\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d83cee57-2fdb-40b8-9a86-1d5b857659d5 .

