camssa:84a0b762-ad02-42f2-88cf-558067c67ace a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, the Publication Office of the European Union has listed it within EurVocabularies with all the specifications and resources produced and used by European Institutions. \r
\r
EU Vocabularies: \r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies\r
\r
Joinup post linked to the EuroVoc reosurces: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eu-semantic-interoperability-catalogue/news/eurovoc-freely-available"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:32d5eae9-91fc-4e02-a675-2ca5d707a7cd .

