camssa:858f39b6-95dd-47a5-9e8e-303451aeb352 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SHACL is included in 3 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Belgium, Malta and the Netherlands. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Belgium and the Netherlands are 
aligned with at least 3 out of 4 scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring according to the National Interoperability 
Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.

CAMSS list of standards:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standard

NIFO Factsheets:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2024

National Catalogue of Belgium:
https://www.belgif.be/page/specifications.en.html

National Catalogue of the Netherlands:
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/lijst

National Catalogue of Malta:
https://mccaa.org.mt/Section/Content?contentId=1243

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:88404f7a-87e9-4f2c-8d3c-9ca634887c9a .

