camssa:85df76bc-ef29-4f37-b730-abca8625c4c0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing documentation and studies assessing the effectiveness and efficiency of LDAP. It is a \r
comparison between LDAP 2 and LDAP 3. As well, the study shows the improvement of the different \r
versions over time as resulting in more efficient protocol.\r
\r
Difference between LDAP2 and LDAP3:\r
https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/desktop/ldap/differences-between-ldap-2-and\\x02ldap-3\r
\r
Assessment of LDAP services in high availability environment:\r
https://www.infona.pl/resource/bwmeta1.element.baztech-32ec800f-6db2-4a4a-be0a-bcb3fae16d23/tab\r
/summary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:68183c59-632e-4551-8315-04f581bb542c .

camssa:85dfdb5b-d816-4024-ab55-46abf20f2abc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The security section of OpenTelemetry asserts that receivers/exporters should use encrypton and authentication of their identity. They should also limit exposure of servers to authorised users and may pose a security risk if configuration parameters are modified improperly. In addition, any incoming or outgoing communication should leverage TLS and authentication.

OTel Security Best Practices: https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-collector/blob/main/docs/security-best-practices.md'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ba5e18a3-1a26-476c-9c6b-7899fc7b9792 .

