camssa:862692f2-7dd7-4040-9cc5-3e5258a03cf2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SCIM could contribute to simplifying the delivery of European public services by providing a standardized and interoperable way to exchange identity information. This can be valuable in scenarios where multiple systems and services need to collaborate, ensuring a consistent and efficient exchange of identity-related data.

SCIM: https://scim.cloud/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:94876fdc-7637-4659-8704-74b4fecac4cd .

camssa:863017e5-fda8-478f-a031-6a49e5826b51 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The ISO specifications are published to be able to respond to a market need which represent a consensus of an expert group. It was launched in 2012 as a proprietary solution. These facts demonstrate the maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services. \r
\r
XAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/56025.html\r
\r
XAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101900_101999/101903/01.04.02_60/ts_101903v010402p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4d129293-0f65-437d-97a9-4cd95da0d37d .

