        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The main purpose of ETSI TS 119 511 is to provide all the policy requirements needed for trust service providers providing long-term data preservation services of e-signatures and of general data.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
