        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT is maintained by W3C which is an international community developing open standards. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/Consortium/                                                                               https://github.com/w3c/dxwg/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:71bb0b06-aaaf-4fc3-a627-cf9b7c1a7ac9 .

camssa:8644d469-89fa-447b-86e2-7b14e5c5c006 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is available for its use and implementation at the XIPH webpage defined in several RFCs. Moreover, all Ogg RFCs have a mirror copy in IETF's webpage.\r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt\r
\r
Ogg Media Types XIPH reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5334"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:48e9131d-5869-4f84-a514-b83d487465a9 .

