'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8ddc44fe-df3d-4002-ac99-0115badf670b .

camssa:866a0a51-cefc-4dd3-bb76-e2e636b92787 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Domibus, as an open-source messaging platform focused on secure and standardized message exchange, is designed to work with various underlying technologies. It is not tied to a specific technology and can be integrated with different components and systems depending on the implementation requirements.\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus'"""@en ;
