camssa:866faafb-ab38-4804-9f98-2bb976da7a82 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAS can enable the delivery of European public services in the sense that it conveys a clear structure and procedure for the creation of APIs that can provide services that reduce the administrative burden.  Using OAS, is a way to keep APIs documentation and source code synchronized, while the consumers are found to understand the capabilities of each operation on the API, and subsequently, interact without comprehending the implementation logic.\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e7dcdefe-8418-4768-a262-a327164158c6 .

camssa:86757610-eb4f-4ec1-8f44-6029cac65ce0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The version 1.0 of the specification, which is the previous version of the SMP, was identified within the List ICT technical specifications as reusable, meaning that the Service Metadata Publisher is considered. Even though the version being assessed is not the one identified, it can be considered that the SMP is listed within this repository at European Level.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5996ac21-0510-4668-8c9c-8d1e1f7e4b26 .

camssa:867a3064-1049-4cb6-92a4-e9756191af9b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT is included in the catalogues of five states, among which there are the Netherlands and Spain.\r
 \r
Netherlands National Catalogue Reference: \r
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/lijst \r
\r
Spanish National Catalogue Reference:\r
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/dam/jcr:9e2c2877-5103-4934-8440-c60ba2e10c48/Catalogue_of_Standards_NIF_Spain.pdf '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5e2733cd-8239-4ee0-b132-8529e013179a .

