        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The TGF specification provides a framework for ensuring the security and integrity of information, but its effectiveness in guaranteeing these protections will depend on how it is implemented and used in practice.\r
\r
TGF specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c78d3c6a-a030-4fa2-8f96-27f5d1577d1a .

