        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of BFO is not related to secure exchange of data since the specification not provide any reference to security considerations.

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1955251-f8ed-4943-9392-49c078316aa0 .

camssa:86cdf15a-2203-4f93-b3dd-3da78e289d42 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ELI is publicly available for its implementation and its use for free on ELI's webpage. Within ELI home page there are implementation resources, best practices and guidelines to ensure its proper implementation.\r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d0fa567f-dd82-41b4-b197-94c1850a3bf3 .

camssa:86cfc683-8232-48f2-95b7-198cb86b8a88 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Few DID methods support portability accross verifiable data registries. Moreover, DIDs  can enhance portability, allowing users to seamlessly transfer their identifiers and related data between different platforms. Therefore, become system- and network-independent and enable entities to use their digital identifiers with any system that supports DIDs and DID methods.

DIDs W3C github:
https://w3c.github.io/did-imp-guide/FPWD/2021-08-26/#verifiable-data-registry

DIDs W3C:
https://www.w3.org/TR/did-core/#design-goals'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8fcea240-d07d-4522-90a6-a9e5239bc78c .

camssa:86d0b318-a14d-4435-a846-3a7246c9406a a owl:NamedIndividual,
        dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL "http://data.europa.eu/w21/9bda1f9f-a9a9-4e9d-b9d3-82b1742330a1"^^xsd:anyURI .

camssa:86d22095-f1f4-4902-ac2c-c28184adf379 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTP is a protocol exclusively designed for the  transfer of files which does not secure the traffic.\r
\r
However,  there are existing extensions of FTP that secure the information delivery. For instance,  FTP over TLS, known as FTPS, uses the Transport Layer Security (TLS) to secure FTP communications over a network.\r
\r
See: \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc959 \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4217"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9e63a096-4f42-4bb3-b2ef-aa0ab70f86fd .

camssa:86d2a973-2477-4984-b122-c1aec5cdfea5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-1cd71a7b6d54631ba58cc8b0655a443d696f49ec74a0f4cccc871de7789d6a60 ;
    cav:value "1" .

