        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OSI is not related to the protection of personal data managed by Public Administrations since the specification does not provide any privacy considerations.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5f31a202-747a-475e-8ffb-df2746dec23e .

camssa:86d5beab-f41d-4b99-850c-eb43f0834e20 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:86d5d1b3-13e5-4c3f-86bb-6892e44e4151 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are several success stories and implementation examples that provide visibility on the effectiveness of
implementing ELI. It allows the description of legal resources and increases the shareability across borders
enhancing the cooperation amongst European Institutions removing barriers.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html

ELI highlights:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/index.html

ELI Testimonials:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/testimonials.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e06c1e0b-af70-4194-935d-1c7dbdaf0362 .

camssa:86da8a0c-4994-4074-96b2-9bd04835e19c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The dependency on different transport mechanism, such as HTTP, SMTP or LDAP, when sending an OCSP\r
request in specific rollout scenarios suggests that the specification is not technology-agnostic.\r
\r
OCSP reference, section 4.1:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6960#section-4.1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50cc83d2-3e29-4d15-bfe2-03b01a829efa .

camssa:86e3e8d1-3959-4d26-a3a1-7e46adde7dba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is independent from any particular software, hardware, or operating system. So, it can be said that EuroVoc is independent of any specific platform. \r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c0c45d2e-a45e-48de-964f-c530558d2b3f .

camssa:86e49720-838c-4556-9db1-45dbfa0c5955 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Within the Roy Fielding dissertation of REST ou can find a chapter that addresses the experience and lessons learned from applying REST.  REST's efficiency, as stated in the dissertation, is mainly based on its architectural constraints, which captures all of those aspects of a distributed hypermedia system that are considered central to the behavioral and performance requirements of the Web.\r
\r
R. Fielding dissertation.  Chapter 6: experience and evaluation.\r
https://www.ics.uci.edu/~fielding/pubs/dissertation/evaluation.htm\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:54ad3110-1c4a-4c7d-bd69-527889f70726 .

camssa:86e4bc9e-5b84-4051-8520-068f3a8ab77d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI, the SDO/SSO that created and currently maintains the specification, explains that most ETSI test 
specifications are developed according to the well-proven methodology defined in ISO/IEC 9646. This standard, which covers the entire test development process, provides an excellent basis for the production of 
high-quality test frameworks and specifications.

ETSI Conformance Testing: 
https://portal.etsi.org/Services/Centre-for-Testing-Interoperability/ETSI-Approach/Conformance

ISO/IEC 9646: https://www.iso.org/standard/17473.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a171b80d-1a44-4488-b703-6fa06279a626 .

camssa:86e51d4e-7bf3-4bbd-827d-c4ce9f2b0afb a cav:Score,
