        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is available for its use and implementation at the EITF's webpage defined in several RFCs. \r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc791 \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc1349\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2474\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6864"""@en ;
