camssa:875d771e-d7da-4678-ab4a-3a8ab040549c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Publiccode.yml is a specification developed by the Italian Government. Even though the specification can be reusable and potentially included at European level as an asset, at the moment of the assessment it is not considered a European Standard.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:68b1fd70-8356-4288-977b-a3035ef031d9 .

