    cav:value "100" .

camssa:8782e8da-dc32-4b10-9b11-4c87a05f2a69 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As a vocabulary, the implementation of CPOV can be tested using methods like SHACL shapes and using semantic reasoners to ensure that the implementation is well-formed. These validation mechanisms can be used with open source tools or lite versions of tools like GrapghDB or Protégé.

SHACL validation: 
https://graphdb.ontotext.com/documentation/free/shacl-validation.html#what-is-shacl-validation

Semantic Reasoners List: 
http://owl.cs.manchester.ac.uk/tools/list-of-reasoners/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:57212e2f-a4ab-4ead-b5ae-59dd6e665a1c .

camssa:8789f4e6-3bb7-4c0b-b48d-56386df9f876 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a81c4b8658f57e819297eb0b7977407f8d814c6fe749c74a8ac497277ca7d9d8 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:878af7b5-50a0-4bdf-ae66-da84a4bbbd83 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-138786a6e7517e10b94e83ec3b3e7ac79b4c49dcbeaef8d8e993c8df0d173529 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:878c16cf-2cee-4088-a2c2-32e37a6cdbdb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The EN 16234-1 e-CF framework is intended to serve as a device to represent the European e-Competence Framework, which focuses on skills and competences of the ICT professional workforce. There is no possibility of partial implementation of the specification, as EN 16234-1 e-CF has a single purpose.\r
\r
CEN reference, CEN/TC 428 - ICT Professionalism and Digital Competences (Published standards), EN 16234-1 e-CF:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=205:110:0::::FSP_PROJECT:67073&cs=15E62ED24D608A5F10D6BEE8E6D50FA10'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:271d6703-825f-4cad-af48-5859be761154 .

camssa:878d32aa-f9ed-4ee7-9f5b-10bee030dfd1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 primarily focuses on the physical and data link layers of Ethernet networking, helping to build a more efficient infrastructure capable of supporting European public services. This is why it has been included in the ICT Rolling Plan.

Rolling Plan for ICT standardisation:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8c10ffb3-6344-4a10-9b7a-aaa00e6c21be .

camssa:87927f6b-57c7-4679-b8ce-249ab0d8c6ea a cav:Score,
