        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Several developer platforms discuss XACML extensively, one prominent example being Stack Overflow. 
Stack Overflow operates as a community-driven forum where developers can ask questions, share insights, 
and provide solutions related to XACML.

Stackoverflow XACML:
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/2893247/who-uses-xacml'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8f54b2ad-ddce-49db-a398-519152972ad9 .

