camssa:87c1e53e-6ef6-434a-ad2b-e503f658ec98 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification in itself acts as a method to ensure that policies and laws are developed, implemented and monitored and enhanced following a standardised method that includes, guidelines, recommendations and requirements to reach the objective of exhaustive and comprehensible laws and policies.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox on European Comission webpage:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/law/law-making-process/planning-and-proposing-law/better-regulation-why-and-how/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox/better-regulation-toolbox_en"""@en ;
