        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TSP can be implemented in any platform and it is independent of any platform.

TSP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:25381f87-8092-443d-8ea6-c514f67c4a41 .

camssa:88087106-fa1f-4a01-8f31-2fabc595730b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TSP is used in many European Member States, using TSA for time stamping services. One of the countries in which TSA is used is in Spain, where the sealing service allows electronic document stamps to be issued by the bodies supplying the service.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards 

Spain TSA reference: 
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/ctt/verIniciativaPInfoAdificional.htm?idIniciativa=tsa&idioma=en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a60e75e8-3eee-4d37-841a-fe92babf2617 .

