    cav:value "100" .

camssa:881be9fa-96d8-49fd-bb3d-58fb2424800d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDES is currently a powerful tool covering data interoperability aspects in the configuration of data spaces. Given that  the technology is well-positioned to support the interoperability, real-time data sharing, and data sovereignty goals of data spaces. Moreover, it can be found in the Data Space Support Center (DSSC) standards catalogue.

LDESspecification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes

DSSC Standards catalogue:
https://dssc.eu/space/SE1/185794608/Data+Interoperability+standards+and+technologies+landscape'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0094c30b-829b-4d4b-bb19-e7e68739e57d .

