camssa:882f8522-bed8-460c-b697-4afe99fd17d8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Domibus, as an eDelivery Access Point (AP) solution, is primarily designed to facilitate secure and reliable message exchange between different entities, particularly within the context of eGovernment services and cross-border data exchange. While Domibus itself focuses on message exchange, it can indirectly contribute to enabling the visibility of administrative procedures, rules data, and services by providing a platform for standardized communication.\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c3cda876-4785-486f-88f4-7ac8180f6cf4 .

