camssa:88c9f12a-546b-4ac1-982e-d4e8bf620e0b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'At this moment, even though the specification is developed by the European Commission, since it is not developed by any of the European Standardisation Bodies, it cannot be considered a European Standard. However, since the European Commission works and develops specifications under the standardisation regulation, the EIRA meets the requirements set under the regulation, which make it a good option to use in procurement process and in the public sector in general. 

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:24934779-5770-4464-bbf1-a249af6a99cd .

camssa:88d5f62f-1897-467e-8646-8d854ed3e458 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Xforms is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:090716f7-1532-49ff-a733-9ff55e9cfb5d .

