camssa:8941c3bc-0c44-4ff6-9b88-3a5b9955fa7d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV Family of Documents are the final output of the Provenance Working Group chartered to specify a representation of provenance of data and information to facilitate its exchange over the Web. Since its first publication, the Working Group has continuously been updating the specifications and correcting errata. The group finished its liaison with W3C on 2013 as it can be seen in the WG Charter, along with all the related activities to the development of the specifications.\r
\r
PROV WG Charter:\r
https://www.w3.org/2011/01/prov-wg-charter\r
\r
PROV errata:\r
https://www.w3.org/2011/prov/errata.html\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a37b0e2-178a-4183-a621-c81f9c621e3a .

camssa:8944a567-e479-43b0-bb49-b8d084cec598 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including ODRL.\r
\r
W3C patent practice: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1884a751-e672-49cb-be64-081bb3624a89 .

