camssa:895346a0-cc08-4aaf-b723-895a9bcb1968 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Nowadays, at the moment of performing the assessment WSDL is wide used specification involved in the implementation of the Service-Oriented Architectures (SOAs). SOAP along with REST are the main ways to build web services, the first one uses WSDL to describe services and guaranteeing access to them. Therefore, WSDL is involved in the development of solutions, including innovative ones."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d2f43991-dd1b-480a-8109-78db8de8597d .

