camssa:89a1ce44-0d2c-4e18-b859-b3422469bcff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing individuals to control their own digital identities, DIDs can help avoid administrative burden. With DIDs, citizens  can manage their own data, share it selectively, and authenticate their identities without dependence on centralized authorities, which can be regarded as a good service simplifier.

DIDs W3C:
https://www.w3.org/TR/did-core/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3f53cbff-ddb3-4b57-bc04-1d69bb122c1b .

