        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification Asset Administration Shell (AAS) clearly mentions that the designator elements (properties of the asset) need to be properly defined in the metamodel in order to reuse the information of the assets, if this condition is met the info can be shared once and reused as needed.

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:026fc91e-f676-48db-9676-2da034990705 .

