camssa:8a18eaad-9616-411b-90a7-fad35046b4d5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Ogg was designed to create an open source multimedia container which it is independent of any vendor. However, Ogg is dependant of some open source technologies that make it up. The audio layer is most commonly provided by Vorbis format or its successor Opus. Lossless audio compression formats include FLAC, and OggPCM.\r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91e81698-789c-47c6-b9c4-4a2248f51d82 .

