/Data+Sovereignty+and+Trust+standards+and+technologies+landscape'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:173c07ff-c1b0-4fed-9dd3-5b01f36564eb .

camssa:8a3b97dd-a6df-480a-84b5-66b88144c220 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has been found few academic papers addressing the effectiveness and efficiency of E-ARK tools. One of them describes It describes E-ARK eco-system, analysing the E-ARK Specifications for Common Information Package, and shows some success stories from its implementation.\r
\r
Metadata profiles for interoperability : the E-ARK specifications for e-archiving:\r
https://www.torrossa.com/it/resources/an/5004900'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:058161b3-c5f1-4477-8d82-aea60f35755f .

camssa:8a3d7c6b-090d-4265-aa10-b98c719d26f1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-6bedf555bffb837990b9eb353447fa116eb9d2384770b1dd3de46d3c5901d4f4 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:8a43e45a-3ab8-4341-9be9-a6994110d61a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing documentation and studies proposing the usage of ODRL as an efficient method for representing more fine-grained access policies for Linked Data. \r
\r
Moreover, there are studies that also checked the completion of the specification and its actual implementation and providing other formal semantics to improve the application of the specification and its purpose. \r
\r
Defining Expressive Access Policies for Linked Data using the ODRL Ontology 2.0:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Simon-Steyskal/publication/266652655_Defining_expressive_access_policies_for_linked_data_using_the_ODRL_ontology_20/links/565dc7a408aeafc2aac88d98/Defining-expressive-access-policies-for-linked-data-using-the-ODRL-ontology20.pdf\r
\r
Formalising ODRL Semantics using Web Ontologies: \r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/235902060_Formalising_ODRL_Semantics_using_Web_Ontologies'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1e0b43e-62e5-43ab-ae03-a6365b817bd7 .

camssa:8a49bb0d-9f3a-4f21-b446-f95da08b6bc9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of XSD 1.1 is not related to delivery of multilingual European public services. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a886c274-d571-43a9-a662-0462b11af033 .

