    cav:value "1" .

camssa:8ab5e5ea-067a-4177-a654-d7382ae27487 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification purpose is to enable communications over the Internet. IPv6 is the new version of IPv4 which is a widely used protocol, thus it is not dependent of any specific technology. Consequently, the adoption of IPv6 does not hamper the interoperability. 

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6fee925b-557a-4837-83f8-fd5a570e86da .

camssa:8abd527b-5400-409d-b008-e59bb2b25e98 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This Core Vocabulary helps public administration with the publication of datasets that includes criteria and evidence. So, it is aligned with the principles of Linked Open Data.\r
\r
Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary reference (v1.0.0):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/release/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary-v100  \r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4036db9-31fa-4d27-9f49-e5f1a4a03229 .

camssa:8ac519aa-6d4d-49ce-9f2a-50259db5aa58 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:8ac59a38-af01-45b1-ab01-594070ed50d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "JSON sector agnostic specification that can be reused in any business domain requiring a common format to exchange data between different programs."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4d50b00d-0781-4d57-b621-cfe3a645c115 .

camssa:8aca5ff8-3612-44c3-a051-b8a1ab6f2ded a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'When comparing SOAP architectures with RESTful architectures, SOAP provides more built-in features and standards for modeling and executing complex business processes. When it comes to modeling and executing complex business processes with built-in features and standards, SOAP architectures provide a more comprehensive and established framework. RESTful architectures, while suitable for simpler interactions and resource-based APIs, may require additional layers or tools to achieve the same level of process modeling and orchestration capabilities.\r
\r
\r
SOAP Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/soap12/\r
\r
Difference between SOAP and REST:\r
https://aws.amazon.com/compare/the-difference-between-soap-rest/?nc1=h_ls'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a5ac50c2-9123-4a60-a2c6-dcf718aba47a .

camssa:8ad12850-46d1-48f4-8bfd-1a4dc4afc253 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'JSON is already associated with EIRA  ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, JSON can define the interoperability aspects of the "Machine to machine interface" ABB of the EIRA Technical View, the "Data Quality Service" and "Data Quality Component" of the EIRA Technical Application view, the "Legal Act Representation" , "Representation" and "Open Data" of the EIRA Semantic view.\r
\r
ELIS reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v501\r
\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e77cd1d2-6218-46b4-acbc-7a7dfdfcee8e .

camssa:8ad31151-f96a-483e-9f07-5c397fb45e40 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d12b846c487e7201dbcf395866b5abc0bb5fa040b1f519127b6a5f56d447257 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:8ad58aff-01ed-42d2-b00d-7d6d3aa4f78d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fef5941bab92019b7692f8544de94715a42ed9ff76d89cbec4fb6f9821611925 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:8ad68964-5d85-47dc-bbd4-b57ed36c0565 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI is a European standards development organisation, and as such, all the specifications developed within the organisation are available and can be accessed through its website repository.

ETSI standards repository:
https://www.etsi.org/standards#page=1&search=ETSI%20TS%20319%20422&title=1&etsiNumber=1&content=1&version=0&onApproval=1&published=1&withdrawn=1&historical=1&isCurrent=1&superseded=1&startDate=1988-01-15&endDate=2022-07-25&harmonized=0&keyword=&TB=&stdType=&frequency=&mandate=&collection=&sort=1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0aad3eaa-4fa2-46b8-8686-e794908956f4 .

camssa:8ade9305-2d12-401e-acf3-3e78af5b5d5a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, SMTP is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. SMTP is therefore licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:74598dfd-2c3a-4d1f-93b3-2dbc0a317b0f .

camssa:8adeada3-e229-4131-9949-401585f2ffb8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Zaragoza's city council is using HTML5 to developments services in an independent way from the platform used by the citzens.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/2012/12/html5-cr.html.en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6f014fbf-d093-4311-8a17-bdd550c3feab .

camssa:8ae1e6bf-6817-4d28-b42b-75a8f8e0e73e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Specification has the support of many communities listed in the following link as "Supporting Organizations", \r
including Universities, private and public companies.\r
However, there are not any community sharing data and results on national platforms.\r
\r
Portal ETSI reference:\r
https:// portal.etsi.org/webapp/workprogram/Report_WorkItem.asp?WKI_ID=56725'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2afe87f1-c932-434a-96e9-b7dee64c243f .

