camssa:8ae6d791-cc24-4159-ad9a-ef9976ab8caf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPv6 specification is mentioned in the "Commission Implementing Decision of 3 April 2014 on the identification of ICT technical specifications eligible for referencing in public procurement".
In this decision, the IPv6 specification is set as one of the ICT technical specifications that may be eligible for referencing in public procurement.

"Commission Implementing Decision of 3 April 2014 on the identification of ICT technical specifications eligible for referencing in public procurement" reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32014D0188'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1df854c2-7968-46bd-aa45-2bd341e35759 .

camssa:8aed6a27-a8e0-49d1-afed-e70e75cc2611 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-838030847fa0adf54939e3feaac0ac2510924c54035e1cb671b223b54b02fd70 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:8af6f567-3ee2-4d62-a532-89f39693edd5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DPV is a Core Vocabulary, and as such, the specification enables data portability and the transmission of personal data in an interoperable way. Personal data and open data are compatible in the sense that users can decide where to store their data and what use this data might have.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2f495f78-73ef-4114-aa72-0be876f9ffec .

camssa:8afca8f7-c3bb-4d13-b896-85c52833d03d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are several studies assessing ShEx effectiveness when it comes to modelling and validating RDF graphs.  An interesting study assesses the effectivenes of ShEx  when describing and validating FHIR (Fast Healthcare Interoperability Resources)  RDF data; pointing out the benefits of using ShEx RDF validator.\r
\r
Modeling and validating HL7 FHIR profiles using semantic web Shape Expressions (ShEx):\r
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1532046417300345\r
\r
Using Shape Expressions (ShEx) to Share RDF Data Models and to Guide Curation with Rigorous Validation:\r
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-21348-0_39\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f6ed44b-0f3e-45ea-b5a7-1bad1e604ddc .

camssa:8afd3f56-90fe-482e-beaa-20e461a47822 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Advanced Encryption Standard is already associated to EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, Advanced Encryption Standard can define the interoperability aspects of the "Integrity Verification" ABB of the EIRA Technical View.

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v610

AES Standard Reference:
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:62db3f41-792a-4f46-b5af-7bc956d3eff6 .

camssa:8aff82de-0ccd-4df0-b2c0-0e7fa31746a8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:8b06954a-43a1-402f-8f9a-61ce80f2af71 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Assessments of the efficiency of genericode primarily involve evaluating the performance, scalability, and practicality of implementations. For instance, a 2017-paper related to identification of further research fields related to the combination of standardised and regulatory data pools with public data feeds in financial data mentions that genericode is one of the 5 aggregated standards chosen by the Frankfurt Group Technical Workshop (FGTW) on Data Standards Interoperability in this matter.

Overview of international experiences with data standards and identifiers applicable for big data analysis:
https://files.stample.com/stample-1587417530204-ifcb44c.pdf
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f6bf25b1-6c3d-4cb9-bf59-83d65eb4f105 .

camssa:8b0f4716-3e7a-466c-b667-990347a36068 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including this specification.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60b1efc2-ee5d-40fe-bb10-242e9a657ecf .

camssa:8b123776-357e-4e8d-8e8a-0e86d7c290a9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of the E-ARK CSIP guidelines can contribute to the simplification of public services delivery by improving information management, interoperability between information sharing systems, and by laying the basis for the long-term preservation and reuse of data within public administration, a clear example of its implementation in European Public Services is the CEF eArchiving solution.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction\r
\r
CEF eArchiving:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/egovernment/solution/cef-earchiving/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d03d76f9-d73c-49a1-a779-ac092d7b6a69 .

