        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox does not contemplate data integrity measures as an element to define regulatory elements. Therefore, the criterion is not applicable.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:217a277c-0e96-47ba-a5e6-8ba59ad3a641 .

camssa:8b1f3913-7612-49eb-9e25-720f78f84d10 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, CSV has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:43d66670-6ce7-4345-9e32-23677ec13952 .

