camssa:8b2f40dc-34aa-4fcd-b483-610e00fb1062 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox fosters the secure and trustworthy data exchange between citizens, businesses and public administrations by proposing methods to ensure that ICT systems and solutions developed under the scope of public services in the EU include security regarding personal data exchanged between parties. In this sense, the Tool 28 covers this element extensively.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4feff71b-d4e4-4a24-8773-4f4023310c36 .

