        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of XAdES is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
XAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/56025.html\r
\r
XAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101900_101999/101903/01.04.02_60/ts_101903v010402p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d7232f5-52fd-4b7e-8de7-b86ec8f8fa4c .

