        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The E-ARK CSIP specification is not related to te provision of access control mechanisms. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c2f28dab-46da-4357-aea9-f011b8264af9 .

