camssa:8d190fc8-f817-4a9e-bfcb-f69e704d43fe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The ISO 15000-3:2023 standard is protected by copyright, and its official version must be purchased from ISO or authorised bodies. While it can be implemented in systems, use of any embedded patents may require licensing under FRAND terms. Reproduction and distribution of the standard's content is restricted without permission. Thus, its application involves both access limitation and potential royalty considerations.

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html

ebXML RegRep ISO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/83479.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:83c3f8a1-f52a-4cec-a8dc-23e0367e385a .

camssa:8d1e8c70-3595-4224-8bde-379529cf58cd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SMP 2.0 specification enables digital service delivery channels. By providing a standardized approach to service metadata publishing and discovery, the specification supports the integration and utilization of digital services across different platforms and channels.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1161034-38f3-4a2d-913c-a7f40c9a7368 .

