camssa:8d393b1a-df61-43cd-92c4-0cd0a8f7bded a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Syslog can contribute to data portability between systems and applications supporting the implementation or 
evolution of European public services as it provides a standardized protocol for message logging, which is crucial in security and traceability matters.

Syslog Protocol: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:72e63360-75b2-498e-ad23-d1063628406c .

