camssa:8d5f8418-fff6-4e89-aa9e-00b86f3d2973 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of HTML4 within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4350096-b9c1-46e2-97b3-82c4d92c7c6e .

camssa:8d62b94f-0bd4-4f7c-832e-18c1491ad9f6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TGF is not tied to any specific software or operating system, given that it is intended to provide guidance and best practices for the delivery of government services.\r
\r
TGF specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dfcf4e7f-a1e1-4386-ae74-249281bb271e .

