        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Data on the Web Best Practices is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
W3C Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:778f9373-a351-4666-861c-4701b545532c .

