camssa:8ed21e30-8e77-42eb-8980-2525c03835ac a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ODRL Information Model does not directly express sensitive personal information such as the identity of \r
the existence of Assets containing such data related to Parties. However, ODRL vocabularies (such as the \r
ODRL Common Vocabulary and ODRL Profiles) may define terms that may relate to personal information. \r
These specifications should inform implementations that produce or consume such ODRL expressions to \r
take steps to communicate to all relevant users the manner in which the policy is being used, the identity of \r
any other party with whom that policy is being shared, and the reason the policy is being shared with other \r
parties.\r
\r
SERAMIS:\r
https://cordis.europa.eu/docs/projects/cnect/2/612052/080/deliverables/001-D55v4GDPR.pdf\r
\r
ODRL Information Model 2.2:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-model/#privacyConsiderations'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bb63fad1-55bc-406c-ba79-175832e7ecd3 .

camssa:8edc36eb-2ab5-4e24-b94a-8c46f4bec11e a cav:Score,
