camssa:8eeb8ce2-bdb7-45af-acc9-b65c3e615fed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The use of the ESPD in conjunction with other digital solutions and services can help to increase transparency and comprehensibility in public procurement processes. For example, e-procurement platforms and tools can provide a centralized location for publishing procurement-related information, such as contract notices, tender documents, and evaluation criteria, which can improve access to procurement-related data and services.\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2cf50ed4-3fdb-459c-94e0-9c7f16512115 .

