camssa:8eedbd6d-d52c-4cde-a5dd-75f7506b5858 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The message returned by a Service Metadata Publisher service is signed using one or more XML-Signatures. Moreover, the purpose of the specification is to ease and ensure the discoverability of different parties to exchange the desired information. The specification defines a set of requirements regarding the authentication of parties that ensures secure and trustworthy processing of data.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ecbfe56c-ac3c-4cef-9442-1ffcac92a351 .

camssa:8ef4a7d2-0a4a-4b0a-a451-21585424a4cc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a1eafd9c95081eeabe19f0511239b88139f02f95e2349049eeea058a89c80f49 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:8efc3400-5023-4b5a-9efc-b4abe1d682bc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2cedd44f05183dae5548108bdeace2c092b84c7c5d89c475b0741ddae7fc7b2 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:8f02dffc-5888-4286-b1e9-2bf86788df83 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "By providing necessary compliance requirements for the implementation of AdES signatures in the context of the European internal market, the selection and implementation of CAdES Baseline Profile does not hamper the interoperability of systems. In fact, it has been developed to ensure the interchange of digital documentation on electronic procedures and communications across borders. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c823d36a-448f-4527-861d-d51423316635 .

camssa:8f0d9830-a3b9-4d53-9f5c-eabb58e3a4ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of TSP is not related to organisational interoperability.  Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ac83b24a-6bed-4915-aff9-78a7feaf805a .

camssa:8f115e4b-8a1c-4395-8022-441863b4bef6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of PDF 1.7 is not related to the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31c65ff1-a356-4566-bade-a51fd1638f45 .

camssa:8f1644e5-c030-40a0-8830-1e654d1860d0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-58010a47630ff9ea23336bf3fc558deff59905e0292551fcabc95740082cb378 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:8f186451-d8b7-48ca-99e3-f96aa3ad82af a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The fact that the specification has been adopted by different organisations demonstrates that the specification has sufficient completeness and consistency for the use and development of products and services. \r
Additionally, the quality of the specification is evidenced by the fact that its underlying specifications are known, well adopted and stable exchange formats. This will allow further interoperability with systems implementing them.  \r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2a8ac55c-f5f6-40af-ab44-f27b2ec84eb9 .

