camssa:8f72ffa1-4ab5-4695-9360-f8e61c7b01b0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included within the EIRA Interoperability Specification Library (ELIS) listed as a possible specification to be used for implementing two of EIRA's ABBs. \r
\r
Also, IETF 3161 Time Stamp Protocol (TSP) is considered as the basis of the European Standard Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI); Time-stamping protocol and time-stamp token profiles from ETSI. Within the document, it is recognised as the basis to which ETSI standard applied constraints.\r
\r
ETSI Catalogue: \r
https://www.etsi.org/standards-search#Pre-defined%20Collections\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422:\r
Electronic Signatures and Infrastructures (ESI);\r
Time-stamping protocol and time-stamp token profiles \r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1858053c-bb82-431b-bd7e-b39234081ae3 .

camssa:8f77ee43-99c1-4910-91e1-ca6a8d3becdc a cav:Score,
