    cav:value "80" .

camssa:8f77fce0-3389-4e19-b963-aabff426b654 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Information about the three versions of the SHACL specification is provided on the W3C website. Additional details can be found on the W3C GitHub and other GitHub pages that assess the SHACL specification. 
Furthermore, SHACL has integrated some parts of the SPARQL 1.1 specification, showcasing its richness through detailed documentation and even mentioning a SPARQL implementation. All information about SHACL, including documentation and references to SPARQL and RDF specifications, has been published by the W3C organisation.

sparql should be only a proof of richness of shacl since it publish detailed documentation and goes even further by mentioning a sparql implementation.

SHACL github W3C reference:
https://w3c.github.io/data-shapes/shacl/

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6fb478a9-bb69-4aef-bd7a-5910d130782b .

