camssa:8fb875b4-ffdf-44e9-9af5-c0bd62888f07 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTTP is already associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, HTTP can define the interoperability aspects of the "Network Service", "Network Component" "Private Network" and "Public Network" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e7a49a5a-d8d8-4512-ad2f-cbb9f9ad1a5a .

