camssa:900474b6-8b4a-49d0-b8a5-5bdf33c258f6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OData protocol provides support for both user and version-driven extensibility by means of different extension methods, through a combination of versioning, conventions and explicit extension points.

OData reference on extensibility:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.01/odata-v4.01-part1-protocol.html#_Toc31358848'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b36e6072-608e-4e1a-a6a8-21351df85bbc .

