camssa:900bc688-bfeb-4b45-a1f7-d8d33ffbd580 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Genericode is maintained by the OASIS Code List Representation Technical Commitee (TC), which requires registration and membership approval. According to OASIS' guidelines for the TC process, members of OASIS Technical Commitees come together to develop specifications using their open process and IP policy. Even so, external contribution to this committee is possible through open channels.

Technical Commitee (TC) Process: https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/tc-process-2017-05-26/

OASIS Code list Representation TC: https://groups.oasis-open.org/communities/tc-community-home2?CommunityKey=7558fd85-f7ac-4dd7-b57b-018dc7d3f6f7\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:efac976a-4631-437e-89d2-b6dc2c3a0f9e .

