camssa:901b922f-209f-4771-a0fb-5bca4c6792b5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The efficiency of the ebXML specification has been assed by the Institute of Electrical and Electronics Engineers, dedicated to standardisation and development in technical areas. In the "ebXML and Web services" study, it is seen an overview of the ebXML and the Web services architecture (WSA) specifications. In this sense, it is also offered a comparision between both specifications.

"ebXML and Web services" study:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/1200304

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e7528d2e-963f-4000-a317-f708f8ecca58 .

camssa:902413d4-9f6e-4f4e-ab7c-e88c3b6a4e89 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specification is not related to the availability and comprehensibility of public administrations data."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d82e0d8c-36a1-4fef-bd30-471e618161ec .

camssa:9029d233-edd6-4002-acac-d9d5a2c67151 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'At the time of elaborating this assessment, FTP does not foster the creation of innovative solutions. Since its development in 1971, it has been used in combination with other specifications in order to enhance security (e.g. TLS & SSL). However, there are other FTP alternatives, such as SFTP and HTTPS, that are highly recommended as they are much easier to configure. \r
\r
Five Alternatives to FTP - Secure File Transfers:\r
https://pro2col.com/blog/five-alternatives-to-ftp-secure-file-transfers\r
\r
Securing FTP with TLS Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4217\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:95e84183-6cbb-49f7-87de-29f4a00606e4 .

