        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "By ensuring that XML files are well formed and valid, XSD fosters the digital exchange of information between administrations and stakeholders. At the same time, it avoid the non-digital information exchange helping to the reduction of administrative burdens. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7c94bb07-6e8b-417b-9c90-a77a55ba1638 .

