camssa:904f48ee-0d42-4661-94e8-662c92061952 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no mention of SFIA in any official document stating its conformance in regards to Regulation 1025/2012.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/european-standards/ict-standardisation/ict-technicalspecifications_en\r
\r
CENELEC and CEN search tool catalogue:https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CEN:105::RESET::::'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16c3d239-6295-4df1-94e3-ff2fb8aa5784 .

camssa:904f85df-b967-429a-a83f-715d221d550b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PAdES is to foster the use of electronic signature. Therefore, it is clear that it reduces the administrative burden by making signing possible electronically.\r
\r
PAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/67937.html\r
\r
PAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:29f3655a-d6f7-46cd-b158-83a5f5f70fd1 .

