camssa:909fc2f0-0bc4-4013-a01a-0807130211e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xforms 2.0 can be used independently of any other technical specifications or operating system. However, Xforms is based on XML, so it can be dependent on conventions and rules for the correct XML usage. \r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7eea1a22-ab3c-4889-b506-1e8eb80207da .

