camssa:91e5b624-3472-43a5-bbe7-fb1a893e5d13 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, IPv6 has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision and included in the European list of ICT Standards for e-procurement.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9aa16472-f3d8-4d66-bc82-ecab578f9a68 .

camssa:91e65b69-d224-4a09-9e06-a21430d98af8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TrainingDML-AI does not directly facilitate the publication of the data on the web but it is used to train, validate, and test AI/ML models defining a UML model and encodings consistent with the OGC Standards baseline to exchange and retrieve the training data in the Web environment. Nonetheless, we consider this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

TrainingDML-AI OGC reference:
https://docs.ogc.org/is/23-008r3/23-008r3.html#_ba9834c4-89de-4391-8aba-042e48d74fa1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0b03a50d-06c5-4231-af7f-c055d6453886 .

camssa:91e81698-789c-47c6-b9c4-4a2248f51d82 a cav:Score,
