camssa:92081a45-c3e9-4d10-aea6-dae5da179554 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing documentation and studies assessing the efficiency of IPv6. The "IPv4 and IPv6 Protocols: A Comparative Performance Study" aims to perform a comparative study on the performance of IPv4 and IPv6 on voice and video network traffic flow using performance metrics such as jitter, typo, and packet loss.

"IPv4 and IPv6 Protocols: A Comparative Performance Study" reference:
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/335863969_IPv4_and_IPv6_Protocols_A_Comparative_Performance_Study'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:435f475c-6641-4059-8273-33dde1d04e99 .

camssa:9209e3f0-9148-475a-a355-7f16d788a37e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TGF has not been found included in any repository/catalogue at European level.\r
\r
TGF Specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:73ebf4cd-9303-46bd-a51b-e5377afac659 .

camssa:92114ff0-8ea3-45e4-8877-cbfd37f25f2a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "PAdES Baseline profile provides four levels of conformance that are linked with different types of documents and their functional requirements. Each level of conformance is defining a profile, these profiles are listed from less specificity to the maximum level. Therefore, the specification can be implemented according to the necessities of users without hampering interoperability. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e93f269d-c3e9-4c6a-b0a6-d43474a83c84 .

