        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though ODRL is a powerful tool for public administrations and the development of valuable public services for citizens and bussiness, the specification does not impact positively the implementation of the once-only principle. \r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core"""@en ;
