        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTPS is included in 7 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Croatia, Cyprus, France, Germany, Greece, Portugal, and Sweden. \r
\r
CAMSS List of standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards\r
\r
National Catalogue of France:\r
https://www.numerique.gouv.fr/uploads/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8cdb077a-8e2b-4896-bd72-536b8f0603b3 .

