camssa:92824565-1a6a-4f93-a769-ba051e1b7080 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WSDL is a markup language based on XML and uses some conventions, features, and constraints coming from it. Despite this, XML is widely adopted and well known and this fact allows to not hamper the interoperability. \r
However, WSDL is involved in the SOAs implementation, along with UDDI and SOAP. In this performance, WSDL relies on SOAP to invoke services. """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9ef29597-956a-46e1-b405-2557c5da4b01 .

camssa:92883ec3-caa2-4acb-827b-04598be7113d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OpenPM2 is a public asset designed and developed by the European Commission and can be accessed and reused without any payment conditions. Therefore, it can be considered that the specifications is licensed under royalty-free basis and (F)RAND basis. \r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127  """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3016c936-6bc3-4604-9e3b-842388c9344e .

