camssa:931a3c27-afc0-465a-9c15-1c85c9147930 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS is included in 9 national catalogues of recommended specifications. Some of these catalogues are: France, Germany and Spain. The National Interoperability Framework of France, Germany and Spain is fully aligned with the 3 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.

NIFO Factsheets France:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/inline-files/NIFO_2024%20DPAF_France_vFinal_rev.pdf

NIFO Factsheets Germany:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/inline-files/NIFO_2024%20DPAF_Germany_vFinal.pdf

NIFO Factsheets Spain:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/inline-files/NIFO_2024%20DPAF_Spain_vFINAL.pdf

CAMSS list of standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3e75a37b-4de9-44cc-b729-d41baf792688 .

camssa:932008b5-9861-401a-89db-3794f8de3d27 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:10ee9796-3ebe-4d5e-ba9c-a6d54eca8c55 .

camssa:93214f48-03c4-40f5-a625-c7adb64039a9 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:9323a619-d2df-4789-9756-1332c246834c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML is a markup language to develop web resources to share content. By allowing to exchange data via online websites, HTML fosters the secure and trustworthy data exchange between administrations and stakeholders. \r
\r
HTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d9c6f984-0bcd-4e44-9c4a-7ee14d9b87d2 .

camssa:9327fb0e-08fc-4b80-b134-0b8d325380f8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:93285995-624a-4ef7-9548-02e51eb53a7b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification can prevent unauthorised data access by establishing authorisation and authentication mechanisms. As described in the Oracle document about security features,using these settings, organisations can ensure that data cannot be accessed by non-verified users, making it trustworthy and confidential.

ebXML security:
https://www.oracle.com/technical-resources/articles/enterprise-architecture/ebxml-security1.html

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5c2f4df7-1070-42db-9b2c-e6b63a97eb5d .

camssa:93329537-c797-47e2-96e6-b17db4493b69 a cav:Score,
