camssa:93735853-9373-4cdd-bc87-5d1bf740cf7b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WAI-ARIA is primarily focused on improving the accessibility of web content, especially for users with disabilities, by providing additional information about the semantics and behavior of user interface components in web applications. It is not designed as a tool for publishing or structuring open data in the way that formats like JSON, XML, or RDF are. However, improving accessibility can indirectly contribute to the openness and inclusivity of web content, which aligns with broader principles of open data. 

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:908a4c0d-c32a-4627-b6a9-2c42ac45c812 .

