camssa:94115be2-92b1-4075-bfe9-b58432b1df47 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are many documents and studies around the JPEG, functionalities, and effectiveness, and efficiency. An example of this is an article in The International society for optics and photonics. It is published in the SPIE Library, and it is about the evolution of the standard and the different capabilities of the specification in terms of image representation.\r
\r
SPIE Library: \r
https://www.spiedigitallibrary.org/journals/journal-of-electronic-imaging/volume-27/issue-04/040901/JPEG-1-standard-25-years--past-present-and-future/10.1117/1.JEI.27.4.040901.full?SSO=1"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f35fea52-8250-4aa7-8b92-64171656904d .

camssa:94161d80-9267-4e3c-9a7f-948abf6d5d26 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-6bedf555bffb837990b9eb353447fa116eb9d2384770b1dd3de46d3c5901d4f4 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:941c6048-a2a7-43dc-9a39-6f5c88e2768f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSV can be considered a facilitator to publish public administrations data as open data. As 5 Stars Open Data model of Tim Berners-Lee states, CSV makes sure content is available on the web, structures data and makes it usable in a non-proprietary open format.\r
\r
See:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2cf8c58e-60e7-40cd-a873-6ca409ec266b .

camssa:94210199-e0d0-428d-ae8b-6b3382f63ee6 a cav:Score,
