camssa:943366f3-8c5a-4ea6-81c4-61bd87a4a82d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By helping administrations to access and reuse information across borders, the implementation of XHTML and other standards from HTML family can help to foster and ease the Once-Only Principle.\r
\r
XHTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2affbe13-cb2b-4577-893a-113266841a36 .

