        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'MIME allows for customization through the creation of custom content types, headers, and encoding methods to adapt to specific requirements while following certain standards.\r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:390f1a88-233f-46b9-9a21-692b802308cc .

