    cav:value "1" .

camssa:949a3723-3f8d-4c50-b682-03d23fb983e1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are numerous studies that have been conducted to evaluate the effectiveness of TLS 1.3, offering detailed insights into how this version addresses critical security challenges, optimises performance, and meets modern technological demands. 

TLS 1.3 in Practice: How TLS 1.3 Contributes to the Internet by Hyunwoo Lee, Doowon Kim, and Yonghwi Kwon:
https://dl.acm.org/doi/fullHtml/10.1145/3442381.3450057

The Era of TLS 1.3: Measuring Deployment and Use with Active and Passive Methods by Ralph Holz, Johanna Amann, Abbas Razaghpanah, Narseo Vallina-Rodriguez:
https://arxiv.org/abs/1907.12762
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8cb543c0-9e53-4486-be99-10ac8a240407 .

camssa:949b7b25-2f4e-4ba6-b497-c5fe20caf5e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are several reports assessing how DCAT-AP is effective and efficient for the publication of open data. For example, the study of DCAT-AP representation of Czech National Open Data Catalog and its impact, or an assessment of the application of DCAT-AP in the European Data Portal.\r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200\r
\r
DCAT-AP representation of Czech National Open Data Catalog and its impact:\r
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/abs/pii/S1570826818300532\r
\r
Linked Data in the European Data Portal: A Comprehensive Platform for Applying DCAT-AP:\r
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-27325-5_15'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5b0a24ae-23f6-4fbf-818a-7c60be798f93 .

camssa:949f1ee4-b147-4fd2-a37c-6bbabd1bcd5f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OSI is a reference model that provides a common basis for the coordination of standards development for the purpose of systems interconnection. The OSI model has been included in the Interoperable Europe Portal catalogue of ICT standards, encouraging the creation of communities along with the sharing of their data and results as its purpose is to improve cloud computing portability and interoperability, thus improving communication between different actors.

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ae8b4e18-7cac-4e98-ab98-192238cff770 .

