camssa:9560d61e-4813-4378-8fd7-aae13d0da678 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Core Public Service Vocabulary Application Profile is a business domain agnostic specification that can be reused in a cross-domain way.\r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:adab9534-1980-444a-ac4b-64864ad95d89 .

camssa:9561de5d-eefb-45c7-8148-b43f0a4bff83 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is existing documentation and studies assessing the effectiveness of Extensible Forms Description Language. The "XFDL: Creating electronic commerce transaction records using XML" study, discusses the issues surrounding the creation of legally-binding electronic transaction records on the Internet and outlines an XML-based solution called XFDL. Moreover, digital signatures and existing Web-based technology are studied, and finally, XFDL is explained in detail.
However, in the 'Sustainability of Digital Formats: Planning for Library of Congress Collections' report, it is mentioned that there are simpler technologies preferred nowadays.

"XFDL: Creating electronic commerce transaction records using XML" study:
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1389128699000286

"Sustainability of Digital Formats: Planning for Library of Congress Collections" report about XFDL:
https://www.loc.gov/preservation/digital/formats/

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0fd785eb-a371-43ce-8ab5-4364321479fc .

camssa:956248bb-6959-4918-aa44-28c3c27f1027 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of REST is not related to the protection of personal data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cf7cf1ea-6192-485e-b49e-8580f163c0dc .

camssa:95663efe-be2f-4adb-882c-dc9bf90079ce a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xforms 2.0 is an XML markup for a new generation of forms and other applications on the Web. An XForms-based application gathers and processes data using an architecture that separates presentation, purpose and content.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f3b30ddf-78b9-491b-9a67-3442377cff80 .

camssa:956e40c2-d1e0-46ba-9fad-41fff57a8630 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT-AP is made available by SEMIC for free on Joinup, the collaborative platform created by the European Commission to share and reuse IT solutions and good practices.\r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1c8785d-20be-4bdf-8144-d30547c8c96f .

