camssa:9586755d-32d9-4b51-810f-776c8ac5c881 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"NUTS can contribute to the comprehensibility of administrative procedures, rules data and services, since this classification narrowly reflects the territorial administrative division of the Member States and supports the availability of data and the capacity to implement national and European policies by using interactive maps like the GISCO's database, which eases the understanding of these divisions.\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Principles and Characteristics section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/principles-and-characteristics\r
\r
GISCO's database reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/gisco\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1991a8ce-869c-4d3d-8bb9-1b559c892cb1 .

