camssa:9609fdfb-96e5-4a4c-b1e3-de2f36c0d9c1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISAE 3402 was developed to provide an international assurance standard for allowing public accountants to\r
issue a report for use by user organizations and their auditors (user auditors) on the controls at a service\r
organization that are likely to impact or be a part of the user organization’s system of internal control over\r
financial reporting.  The main purpose of ISAE 3402, therefore, is to assure the integrity of data and preserving the confidentiality of the information being exchanged, thus, ensuring the protection of personal data. \r
\r
ISAE 3402 overview webpage:\r
https://www.isae3402.com/ISAE3402_overview'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4422cd0a-a473-44b7-a79d-9e592f91f8dd .

camssa:960c2eed-8ba3-4665-8305-8705a2719b44 a cav:Statement,
