camssa:9637f557-d9e3-4618-a662-b3376669ab0a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification provides a conceptual model of roles, states and properties that can be used to increase the accessibility and interoperability of web content and web applications. In this sense, the specification eases the development of European public services.\r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:363ec1b3-a41a-40d3-91ae-f14ab7edb437 .

camssa:963ef2c6-7830-4a78-ae1f-e464ff62fa3e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ODRL provides a standardized format for expressing digital rights, which can contribute to interoperability \r
between systems that support the specification. This interoperability might be beneficial in digital service \r
delivery channels where different platforms or services need to exchange information about digital rights.\r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37acd93a-73c9-4713-9ef6-15daa1274e85 .

