camssa:96cb952e-7d0b-49ed-8535-7dead8d1b6e6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification allows user to access and maintain distributed directories information over the Internet, which reduces the administrative burden of the system administrators and the users. By ensuring the access to different directory services, it fosters the implementation of digital services, supporting the principle of digital-first. \r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:227c6137-84f2-4dd6-a39d-a244e67d1d43 .

