camssa:9710bd99-3b25-49e6-8d65-36dff7dc2166 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, LegalDocML is considered by the European Union as part of the standarisation activity. And, at the same time, it is used by LEOS, the European Project for Legal Texts Development. So LegalDocML can be considered as an asset to build innovative solutions.\r
\r
The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-single-market/en/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation\r
\r
LEOS: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/justice-law-and-security/solution/leos-open-source-software-editing-legislation"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d1d220b-0e93-48e6-bedf-803311e4918a .

