        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 7498:1, defining the OSI (Open Systems Interconnection) model, does not mention extension of the specification. Even so, extension would be most likely possible as long as it does not interfere with the main requirements of the specification.

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91c33fb0-392f-4cfd-8853-9310bc14530f .

