camssa:978bca87-a693-40e3-9550-c300b5f76442 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like other vocabularies, ADMS reuses components from other vocabularies. (e.g. foaf, dcat), and also the resource Description Framework (RDF). This causes a dependency that can hamper the interoperability in those cases where new releases of the reused vocabularies are not backward compatible. \r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b67de1e4-8cd6-4914-a1f1-dfe1a12c3cfa .

