        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As the specification is a profile of DCAT , it can be interpreted that it allows extension of the specification it comes from.\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:43f8e044-f851-48bd-8a76-3e0909e1258d .

