camssa:97beba44-4124-4219-ad52-5829e4b3c855 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TrainingDML-AI Standard’s efficiency has undergone a internal rigorous review and approval process. The
effectiveness of the standard would likely depend on factors such as its adoption rate, the performance of AI
/ML models trained using data prepared according to the standard, and feedback from the user community.

OGC TrainingDML-AI Standard:
https://docs.ogc.org/is/23-008r3/23-008r3.html

OGC TrainingDML-AI approach for making EO training datasets ready in deep learning frameworks paper:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/10233498'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4e9412f1-5991-4cea-b9c2-1993f6df533c .

