camssa:97c35641-4799-4b46-8edc-077d7f14e16c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EN 16234-1 e-CF is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, the e-CF can define the interoperability aspects of the Interoperability Skill ABB of the EIRA Organisational View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v110 '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0cb4674c-0d43-40b0-a1e5-9525e4866602 .

