        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPsec is included in the Spanish catalogue of standards. Spain complies with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the EIF according to the NIFO factsheets.\r
\r
See:\r
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3f4c1ff0-5e1d-4fba-9fb9-94da09ae9e39 .

