camssa:97d321f5-e276-4b99-9474-4bab54a13c6a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """eDelivery SMP 1.10 does not define a cross-sector reusable data model per se, this profile defines a set of implementation guidelines for the OASIS SMP Specification applied to eDelivery. However, OASIS standard defines a data model for the retrieving interface. \r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eDelivery+SMP+-+1.10\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v1.0/bdx-smp-v1.0.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:031b3e9e-cd2e-4b96-ae81-f8ffece7816b .

