        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PDF/A is not related to the implementation of the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a46670d5-83f6-4e45-ac90-28f88395499f .

