camssa:97dd9699-e68a-4043-b822-4b2033e39ed9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The purpose of ETSI TS 119 612 is not related to enabling the exposure of interfaces to access the public administration's services. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

ETSI TS 119 612:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2d6f48de-dae3-4ece-b038-a8e8face437b .

camssa:97e22a57-a209-4f57-9e7b-a33b99fb6e34 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS follows strict standards to ensure the global consistency and interoperability of domain name resolution.

