DSSC catalogue:
https://dssc.eu/space/SE1/185794711
/Data+Sovereignty+and+Trust+standards+and+technologies+landscape'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4123a5cc-a118-4019-957a-312a7bb1aeac .

