camssa:97fc23f6-1db2-4afc-8e60-b6d9bc3339b5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, CAdES is recommended by the European Union as an eSignature standard to ensure that electronic signatures can be created and validated anywhere in Europe. So, CAdES can be considered as an asset to build innovative solutions.\r
\r
eSignature standards:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eSignature+standards\r
\r
CAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/64756.html\r
\r
CAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101700_101799/101733/02.01.01_60/ts_101733v020101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a34d09c4-7814-431d-b4ca-035c15e50be1 .

