camssa:97fe8bcb-7003-42f9-88e1-ca10d61e7716 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are existing mechanisms to carry out WS-Security conformity. For instance, Weak WS-SecurityPolicy: Insecure Transport, Weak WS-SecurityPolicy: Insufficient Supporting Token Protection and Weak WS-SecurityPolicy: Tokens Not Protected\r
\r
See:\r
https://github.com/YalcinYolalan/WS-SecurityAT"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eb28d377-8931-4b04-8916-ede066859172 .

