camssa:9821ea9b-b7a2-4291-b920-156930275971 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Confidentiality is mentioned as a security matter in DQV. It is a quality dimension described as the degree to which data has attributes that ensure that it is only accessible and interpretable by authorised users in a specific context of use.

Confidentiality in Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/#DimensionsOfISOIEC25012'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9c33d199-3930-431d-83ad-288c0f7c4e0a .

