camssa:984d5614-c18f-4da6-893e-99e46d526ff2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ELI specification allows for customization and partial implementations. It’s designed with modularity,
enabling implementers to select and prioritize components based on their needs. The ELI Task Force
provides resources like the ELI annotation tool, an open-source solution that can be customized and used to
create and publish vocabularies in SKOS format. Thus, ELI offers a flexible framework tailored to individual
requirements.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html

ELI annotation tool reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/resources.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a2f535bc-fb02-48b2-80fc-a6b018ccd080 .

camssa:984e92aa-9249-448f-a28b-18576dc2f5cf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of PDF 1.7 is not related to ensuring the availability of interfaces with internal information systems of a public administration. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f739eab0-fe60-4d99-85f4-0319881efbc5 .

