    cav:value "20" .

camssa:98ae920b-107e-42a0-ad23-e4f9011b699e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Web Services Description Language (WSDL) itself does not inherently address or influence e-accessibility. WSDL is a specification designed for describing the interfaces and operations of web services, focusing on the technical aspects of communication between software systems.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f38edfc6-d4b4-49b7-9484-9a1398b4626e .

camssa:98b3a504-54d4-4fb0-bfa3-91b7ffbad7bf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """\r
At the time of elaborating this assessment, this specification is not included in any EIRA ABB in the current EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Although, this Core Vocabulary is included in a supranational catalogue of standards. \r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c5a377b0-9757-49dd-9e03-7c26ad82a6a0 .

camssa:98bc9186-bb12-41a5-b34a-5907d5d6bf56 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d310596912dbc916997008f4aed16a81cf5e708cd907e3c53a2e4207468b468b ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:98c3c41f-25e2-45c7-8a0d-84e35bdf0d38 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:53adc2b2-0b49-4b08-aacc-ae9783a5136e .

camssa:98c839e8-6122-4370-942f-8d1d6b504343 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification was published by the W3C Verifiable Credentials Working Group as a method to help solve problems related to integrity and privacy of personal information on the Web. For this reason, W3C recommends the wide deployment of this specification as a standard for the Web. \r
\r
W3C Verifiable Credentials: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7e15eb8d-6e20-4181-ba23-1290bf153dae .

camssa:98cf5349-a0d2-43be-b522-b96aadf4b320 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The standard provides security features that foster the trustworthy data exchange between administration and stakeholders. PDF/A protects in itself data integrity, but also provides capabilities to protect with passwords and user roles the access to the document. \r
\r
PDF/A reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/38920.html\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/50655.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aa696b6b-7a3f-4ce5-8c36-0c5b53c229f9 .

camssa:98cf6ee4-412c-41c3-8436-b3f9aa949dad a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification can be implemented partially, the REM introduction side can be implemented without the \r
Electronic Signature part of the message.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9d1ac70d-7ed7-4831-9d13-529646acf5c3 .

camssa:98d5c2cf-7a5b-440d-944a-a46fdd7b7355 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of OWL2 is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
\r
OWL2 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-overview/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2093891a-d272-41f8-8618-5c37f28b5592 .

camssa:98d7e2a1-0305-483c-b158-a16598d42d4e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Core Location Vocabulary can be related with the INSPIRE project. In this context, the CLV is specifically designed to aid the publication of data that is interoperable with EU INSPIRE Directive.

INSPIRE in CLV:
https://www.philarcher.org/isa/locn-v1.00.html

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ef24ad15-cd78-44dc-b474-6d67877e3bf3 .

camssa:98e06acf-af25-4fb5-b3d1-4947198ab986 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 provides a comprehensive framework for Ethernet networking. It includes standardised protocols for clear communication, extensive documentation for implementation and management, and ensures interoperability among equipment from multiple vendors. While it supports administrative procedures and data management indirectly, its primary focus is on technical specifications.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8d847e27-6b43-4aa8-a4f4-e065a4f5a68e .

