camssa:98f2dbef-1fe5-470e-a157-9f61c107cc44 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Genericode supports custom extensions to accommodate additional requirements beyond the standard specification. Users can introduce custom elements or attributes to extend Genericode's functionality according to their specific needs and include additional metadata elements alongside code values. This metadata can provide further context, descriptions, or usage guidelines for the codes within code lists, enhancing the richness and utility of the data.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:99228864-3732-4689-ba6d-ff3c22d928d8 .

