camssa:99213ace-0ec0-47a6-8a28-c3d074d9993e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification was created and is continuously developed by the IETF working group. Because of this development, the specification has reached version 6.0.0 and includes many implementations and extensions. Moreover, although it is not an organisation itself, people discuss implementations and how to use them in various forums.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html

IETF organisation:
https://www.ietf.org/

Netgate IPsec forum:
https://forum.netgate.com/category/17/ipsec'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80536dbb-d432-42d3-bfe0-b7dc5ed41f9c .

