        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The specification is a key enabler of trusted connections and data exchange across borders, between administrations or business. The eSignature is method increasing lately thanks to its benefits reducing burdens. PAdES Baseline profile is involved in the electronic signature of PDFs documents, and as an asset to ease secure and trustworthy data exchange between parties it foster the creation of solutions, including innovative solutions. "@en ;
