camssa:99e35303-a66e-4cff-be59-bc8aa160135a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XACML is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, XACML can define the interoperability aspects of the "Access Management", "Authorisation", 
"Digital-ready Policymaking", "Public Policy" and "Agreement on Privacy" ABBs of the EIRA Technical, Legal 
and Organisational View.

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications camss
/solution/elis/distribution/elis-v600xlsx'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f050501c-7dcd-4a73-9371-85e95b2f5576 .

