UNE digitalisation report:\r
https://www.une.org/normalizacion_documentos/Informe%20Transformaci%C3%B3n%20Digital_20201127.pdf\r
\r
ILNAS Technical standardisation report:\r
https://portail-qualite.public.lu/dam-assets/publications/normalisation/2022/report-technical-standardization-cloud-computing.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:58b16159-052b-46aa-b2c4-a179edda6233 .

