        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The flexibility provided by UDDI allows its use in a public or internal way. The information model is widely adaptable to user needs, what means that UDDI nodes and registries can be modelled following Informational model guidelines. The implementation of UDDI does not hamper the scalability of systems. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2e2d3863-06e1-409c-bce8-31ad2d1655c0 .

