        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of the specifications is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4c66508-8e44-41ca-b5ba-0af870962e6e .

