camssa:9a64b574-88bc-4290-a7a7-d174d7ee3aab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There have been found some assessments directly addressing CPSV-AP effectiveness.  Below two examples: the first one of CPSV-AP being evaluated for comprehensiveness and compliance with EU policies, and the second one, a study on the use of CPSV-AP to publish public service descriptions as linked open data.\r
\r
Public Service Models: A Systematic Literature Review and Synthesis:\r
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/8823991\r
\r
On using CPSV-AP to publish public service descriptions as linked open data: https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s11761-022-00344-6'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e6272f29-5756-45b7-a54b-dcd39af77d1b .

camssa:9a654c1e-8bb8-4fb8-b3d1-14a6c3f33e02 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While it may not specifically facilitate the modeling of business processes, it can provide valuable information about the assets involved in business processes, such as data models, ontologies, vocabularies, and other related resources. These assets can be utilized in the modeling and implementation of business processes, but the ADMS specification itself is not designed explicitly for business process modeling.\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/\r
\r
ADMS in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/adms  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80a97971-d835-4b81-b4cf-ae5028c0868e .

camssa:9a67db45-9833-43c3-af21-8b84cd98003f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAREF itself does not explicitly include mechanisms for ensuring or enabling data processing accuracy. The responsibility for ensuring data processing accuracy lies with the implementers and the systems that use SAREF.

SAREF: 
https://saref.etsi.org/core/v3.1.1/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:25ce1ab6-9c0a-4baf-8f09-e88e74e72533 .

