        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification was formally defined between 2015 and 2017 with the experience and the expertise of the Member States that were closely working together to consolidate the specification. This fact demonstrates that guidelines have been agreed taking into account the experience from different stakeholders and it ensures its maturity by the time being.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf """@en ;
