camssa:9be8b735-f274-442b-b445-6dcb44a4914e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OCSP is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More\r
specifically, OCSP can define the interoperability aspects of the Trust Registry Component, Trust Registry\r
Service and Trust Registry Provisioning Component ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v110'"""@en ;
