        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are many testimonials from OASIS consistories that are a reliable example to know that WS-BPEL is a cross-sector reusable data model as it uses several XML specifications :WSDL 1.1, XML Schema 1.0, XPath 1.0 and XSLT 1.0. XML Schema type definitions provide the data model used by WS-BPEL processes.\r
\r
The specification:\r
