camssa:9c2f8e20-0888-4c17-ba90-e87157fecd9e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is not widespread known and used. However, it is a national initiative from Italy, which is encouraging to use from its Digital transformation team. Publiccode.yml issued in Italy to describe the software created in the country. This has permitted the creation of a national catalogue of software by crawling the content of the publiccode.yaml available within the software repositories. Moreover, the specification is also applied in opencode.de, Germany’s registry for open-source software in public administration.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html

Italian National Software Catalogue:
https://developers.italia.it/

Open CoDE:
https://opencode.de/en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1d2c3514-6914-4126-8bd7-aef48454fb78 .

