    cav:value "20" .

camssa:9cb17118-e5de-468e-8899-7a197c184641 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The conformance of the ELI specification’s implementations can be assessed using the ELI validator. This
online tool checks the compliance of ELI metadata with the ELI ontology requirements. In addition to the
validator, the ELI specification also includes an annotation tool. This open-source tool enables the labeling of
different legal resources, description, and publishing of metadata in machine-usable format.

ELI's annotation and validator tool:
https://webgate.ec.europa.eu/eli-validator/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dc5bd380-db3b-439a-a52f-6a5527d44313 .

camssa:9cb6add0-74ee-4be9-84ff-e655865bb582 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d28663fdb5deb361d5ad773d7b7ece3c6acf8d2eb7a1222a60cb08df4c93aac ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:9cb6f953-ee3e-4f39-8eb1-4dfe16de8c1a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XAdES ensures the interoperability of electronic signatures when the documents they authenticate are transferred and processed through different systems and it can be preserved for a long term.\r
\r
XAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/56025.html\r
\r
XAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101900_101999/101903/01.04.02_60/ts_101903v010402p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f6c32028-0d0d-4701-af57-da3e2a349e2b .

camssa:9cb6fe9e-9a83-4b06-82e8-954d45ef0b72 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-33b5b305bcc0a995fd3c592dc8a6f52d0749a6e817aa85844f3e4f31c7dea344 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:9cb9f7ad-6e37-4177-9481-a1831bf2a542 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """All XIPH standards are under BSD-style license which is a specific license for open source specifications. More specifically it is a free-software license with only minimal restrictions on how the software can be used, modified, and redistributed, usually including a warranty disclaimer.\r
\r
XIPH documentaiton:\r
https://wiki.xiph.org/index.php/Main_Page"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5ba5de8e-ec06-47c8-a9ba-e4b687fc7439 .

camssa:9cbb3323-ea16-4db8-907d-617b4e4412f8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "There is no national or European platform with the specification TIFF/IT available for free."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c06311b9-a296-4295-a4e0-b1d4caad7105 .

