camssa:9cd18367-8bee-4c0b-88ac-a07e3a622865 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Any organisations can customise and adapt ISO/IEC 19944-1 scheme to align with their specific circumstances. Customisation can involve various aspects of ISO/IEC 19944-1, such as the classification categories, the criteria used for categorisation, or the specific data elements within each category. Organisations can tailor the classification scheme to accommodate their specific data types, regulatory requirements, business objectives, and industry-specific considerations.  An example can be found in the Windows diagnostic data, which  provides references to equivalent definitions for the data types and examples from ISO/IEC 19944-1.\r
\r
Windows diagnostic data\r
https://github.com/MicrosoftDocs/windows-itpro-docs/blob/public/windows/privacy/windows-diagnostic-data.md\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4edbf5b0-4031-4d7a-ac39-582d8aca19cf .

camssa:9cd3f9be-bca3-4d5a-8f96-149ecf20a75b a cav:Score,
