camssa:9d1416a0-ef4b-4f8f-ac59-788a4fd4af89 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Functionalities of ShEx are well stated in its primer document, and there are known implementations, such as for the sharing of RDF data models and to guide its curation with rigorous validation, although, being a validator for RDF graphs, there haven't been found many market uptake indicators.  \r
\r
ShEx primer document:\r
https://shexspec.github.io/primer/\r
\r
ShEx Community Group:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/shex/\r
\r
ShEx Github:\r
https://github.com/shexSpec/spec/issues\r
\r
Using Shape Expressions (ShEx) to Share RDF Data Models and to Guide Curation with Rigorous Validation:\r
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-21348-0_39\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:82fe4b8f-db86-4b2b-95af-5ab8a215b54f .

