camssa:9d64e47b-71dc-472e-86b7-c5ad0536dff4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData builds incrementally. Customers can easily build a very basic standards-compliant service. Only additional work will be needed to support extra or or add-on capabilities.\r
\r
OData, 2 Overview:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/errata03/os/complete/part1-protocol/odata-v4.0-errata03-os-part1-protocol-complete.html#_Toc453752201'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab64538a-1ba7-4a30-a1b4-974923c7cff7 .

camssa:9d68b9b5-da1e-448a-bcb7-37d1f9748053 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"DIDs are globally unique and language-neutral, consisting of an alphanumeric string that remains consistent across different languages. This consistency ensures seamless interoperability, regardless of the user's preferred language. 

DIDs structure W3C:
https://www.w3.org/TR/did-core/#a-simple-example\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1b9df4a-978f-4bbd-9009-8f360114c673 .

