    cav:value "20" .

camssa:9dad9cd2-699f-45f2-b306-ee483c82cb0b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 is highly usable beyond the business-specific domain, enabling its application across various sectors due to several key factors. The specification offers a versatile and reliable foundation for networking needs across multiple domains, enhancing its usability and effectiveness in diverse settings.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:839e1de2-1dc4-4ca6-b20c-9f83f74ffd11 .

