camssa:9dcd38d4-f046-403c-a8b9-4f4224db3d6e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv6 incorporates some improvements in terms of security and flexibility to its predecessor, IPv4. The specification guarantees better security by making it safer against cyber attacks. The specification is being used by some countries such as Germany, and also by some companies to continue improving their privacy. In addition, it helps in the creation of more IP adresses, which is necessary to support all the new devices connected to the internet.
Therefore, the IPv6 has sufficient market acceptance and creates new solutions to the new problems.

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460

National catalogue of Germany: 
https://www.cio.bund.de/Web/DE/Architekturen-und-Standards/SAGA/SAGA%205-aktuelle%20Version
/saga_5_aktuelle_version_node.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:603b60b1-ef28-4aad-a786-527e8d1e46f6 .

camssa:9dceab70-865e-4000-869f-d6a15188effc a cav:Score,
