camssa:9e1e9baa-25e3-442e-8b41-4b1a751e31e6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no evidence of the inclusion of Registered Organization Vocabulary within any European catalogue 
of standards at supra-national level. However, the specification is being migrated to the Core Business Vocabulary. Consequently, this vocabulary can be found on the SEMIC website, within the Interoperable Europe Portal.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

ICT technical specifications:
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1cb38c07-73f7-4b9e-98aa-fa7ffd6b10d4 .

camssa:9e1f9ab8-4771-4201-b8b5-47421567036a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents does not provide direct means for authentication. Authenticity and authentication are typically implemented at the system or application level through security mechanisms, authentication protocols, and authorization frameworks. These mechanisms determine who has access to specific information and under what conditions.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a5acc938-2746-4979-85a8-767d61528b41 .

camssa:9e21f0d0-8b60-4d42-8610-7a94fbd0fcf6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s Intellectual Property Rights Policy is based on Standard Essential Patents (SEP). The policy implemented by the standardisation organisation seeks to reduce risks and ensure that the standards are available under (F) RAND basis and Royalty-free, it means with no cost or fee to be paid when possible. \r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d7c93cba-11d9-4ab9-9fce-61b81af3ab09 .

camssa:9e2218c9-d038-4552-b3fc-a837fb0c86cd a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b00b9b74de866ed2278d14d1b9d7ecf2c06950d296bb2f17013c7b710d6de41 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:9e256965-b2b9-4d20-ace9-ca3f45c82442 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP License Agreement grants developers a broad set of rights to encourage widespread distribution and implementation of AMQP. The TC grant a worldwide, perpetual, royalty-free, non-transferable, nonexclusive license to copy, display, distribute, and implement the AMQP specification.

AMQP Licence Reference:
https://www.amqp.org/legal/amqp-license

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:54aab06d-ce4a-4d88-b59e-1d372ff37d4b .

camssa:9e317cf8-852f-4cce-a2e1-ae2ab4d2cb0e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ECMA International's purpose is to make available the developed standards and specifications in a non-discriminatory and free of charges. Therefore, JSON is licensed under (F)RAND and Royalty-free basis. Terms and conditions for IPR disclosures can be found in ECMA's webpage. \r
See:\r
http://www.ecma-international.org/memento/Ecma%20IPR%20policies.htm"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31b8fec5-53cf-4145-90ce-8c60bac47922 .

camssa:9e319b38-77ab-4663-87f1-8c14418268b9 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-549e39fc635763b9466e09688714b2908fcf7a349d4f4f0fe2a761bd6f502733 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:9e347809-3f5a-4916-96d3-3515791f59e5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPsec is not related to the modelling of business processes. IPsec is primarily an internet protocol designed to enhance security in communications between Public Administrations, and it does not inherently focus on modelling business processes.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3ca644d4-eab9-45ea-a36e-4a954adea93f .

