camssa:9ea7b216-b290-4ad2-996b-fa75281cbf2d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 19944-1 supports the implementation of secure processing of data through its emphasis on security controls, data classification, and data governance. Nonetheless, organisations should complement ISO/IEC 19944-1 with relevant industry standards, best practices, and legal requirements to ensure the secure processing of data within their cloud computing environments.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16e7d31c-0cd9-4a5f-998d-ab23659356ab .

