        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:9f06ea6c-13b2-4180-9ff2-733b7f48b067 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'MIME allows for extension through the creation of new MIME specifications and profiles. These extensions can introduce additional content types, headers, or encoding methods to support evolving requirements and technologies in internet communication.\r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1dc82a2-37b8-4354-ae53-5322ce0a7355 .

camssa:9f09a5bf-989a-4021-8a27-ddd64d97049d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification is domain-agnostic as it can be implemented or used in any domain. The focus of ISO/IEC 19941:2017 is on the broader aspects of cloud computing interoperability and portability thus, it is applicable across different domains.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e05ae977-b3a7-4102-8504-16ec46e087f2 .

camssa:9f14094b-ab03-4091-9ed2-d2a2ca60922a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to section 4.4 of the ETSI TS 119 512 specification document, the Profile element outlines the 
technical details of a preservation profile, allowing a client to use the preservation interface to communicate 
with the preservation service. Full implementation of specific provisions is achieved when combined with its 
companion documents, ETSI TS 119 511. This combination enhances the visibility of administrative 
procedures, rules, and services.

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf

ETSI TS 119 511 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:01014e18-17ee-498d-a58e-984f288d52b9 .

camssa:9f194609-0f21-4dcf-aac3-cff06a334398 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:9f1981d0-2477-452d-8844-ee67d7ecc833 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"This specification's releases do not foresee public reviews. While the life cycle of ISO/IEC 7498:1 is completely 
public, its content is not published on the web.

ISO/IEC 7498:1: 
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:487d5189-9921-487a-9e71-161bd9c1e4e9 .

camssa:9f1c5ec8-3066-489c-a25e-b9657ca8b4dc a cav:Score,
