        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, UDDI can define the interoperability aspects of the "Service Discovery Component", "Service Discovery Service", "Service Registration Service "and "Service Registry Component" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.

