camssa:a02b4daa-1545-4083-8fb6-4ff520e5a345 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'When it comes to the preservation mechanisms, ETSI TS 119 512 specifies a data structure "EvidenceExchange", which contains preservation objects and preservation evidences to support seamless export and import from one preservation service to another one, using evidence records; therefore enhancing interoperability between systems and ensuring data portability.

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28ea8b09-a083-40f0-a14a-1f689483c02a .

