        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Ogg is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. However, Ogg as an open multimedia container, could add subtitles as text to foster the delivery of multilingual in media files.\r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a36d00cc-3057-48a2-a00d-f68c3fd24f96 .

camssa:a11b5bdd-1116-4265-8d64-d76db321bb71 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Joinup offers several services that aim to help e-Government professionals share their experience with each 
other. Joinup supports them to find, choose, re-use, develop and implement interoperability solutions. CPOV
appears in many Joinup entries as a discussion topic, and the specification is distributed and can also be 
found in the platform.

Joinup discussion CPOV: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary/discussion/boundaries-cpov

Joinup distribution CPOV:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6102fb00-51fd-497b-8d73-a2b2f7b30cb2 .

