camssa:a144d02d-d818-45d0-97a8-ece86b97e7ef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specifications that form the Dataspace Protocol are organised in 5 documents, all of which can be 
implemented separately, depending on the purpose of implementing the protocol. Specifications can be used 
for dataspace modelling, common functionalities, cataloguing, contract negotiations and transfer processes. 

IDSA Dataspace Protocol Specification: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9cd3f9be-bca3-4d5a-8f96-149ecf20a75b .

camssa:a146722a-5c35-41d6-910e-79f74fc4b0ab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are already existing documents and studies about the XACML performance in different environments. An example of this is the research article "A Performance Analysis of the XACML DecisionProcess and the Impact of Caching", which analyses the performance of XACML involved in the decision process of web services developed in the cloud and the impact of caching. Also, there is an article focused on the testing of XACML policies, which provides different approaches to improve effectiveness and effectivity.\r
\r
A Performance Analysis of the XACML DecisionProcess and the Impact of Caching: \r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/283307011_A_Performance_Analysis_of_the_XACML_Decision_Process_and_the_Impact_of_Caching\r
\r
Approaches for Testing and Evaluation of XACML Policies:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/279192661_Approaches_for_Testing_and_Evaluation_of_XACML_Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aa002061-68aa-4261-af72-5326a2248c15 .

camssa:a14b1a22-ed98-4cdb-9b0c-13556834bc85 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Throught the example of DFKI using HTML5 that fosters the multilingual web, it can be said that it promotes the former.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/2012/12/html5-cr.html.en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3cdc6df0-5043-4035-a7cf-eb03b1947a82 .

camssa:a155222e-3471-402c-8dd1-83e3af606b98 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 27001 can be found in the EIRA Library of Interoperable Specifications (ELIS), more specifically to the "Security Framework" ABB in the Organizational view.\r
\r
ELIS referenece:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v110'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16054638-7112-434d-8fc9-747c34cd6d32 .

