        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The last version of the specification was launched in 2013 by the European Telecommunications Standards Institute. The fact of being a European Standard maintained and promoted by ETSI, provides value on its maturity and market acceptance to be used in the development of products. "@en ;
