camssa:a19504e7-25dd-45e6-a781-af56fbddeaf2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Annex E of CIM NGSI-LD API contains an RDF-compatible specification of NGSI-LD meta-model, which facilitates the publication of data on the web and does not require propietary software for the processing of its related data. The standardisation that CIM NGSI-LD API provides promotes interoperability and facilitates the sharing and publication of data on the web in a consistent and understandable manner.

GS CIM 009: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/CIM/001_099/009/01.07.01_60/gs_CIM009v010701p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1c739742-57ad-4e26-9a53-c58d9ab8836d .

