camssa:a1b41f60-8d4e-4fd8-b3be-9270f8d781d7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 19944-1 can indirectly contribute to the effective management and governance of cloud services, including those related to public administration. By adopting the recommended practices outlined in the specification, organizations can establish clearer governance structures, define service management processes, and enhance data management practices.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d2947394-7bfb-483d-b4e6-32348b2806dd .

