        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary does not enable the secure processing of data. The main purpose of the specification is to define a standardised way of describing organisations that have gained legal entity status through a formal registration process. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ad035a97-d558-4d8d-bfad-ef2b626e1967 .

camssa:a1cfe231-cec1-4fc5-85f6-90e0d0d71d14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """MIME is a business domain agnostic specification that can be reused in a cross-domain way. It can be used for the exchange of files addressing any domain.\r
\r
MIME reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b68695e3-72e3-4b66-a55d-daa953396b9d .

