    cav:refersTo camssa:a950669e-4ba1-49bd-a7e6-6f19e3ace62d .

camssa:a1fc7aa0-26ee-4cc3-a3a0-d87bc335ac6e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "IETF defined the first version of TLS in 1999 and the current version is TLS 1.3 defined in August 2018. This evidences that the specification is mature, in the sense that it has been developed for a sufficient period of time to overcome most of its initial problems. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e3eca172-bdfa-4031-a2c5-ee7198c0964e .

camssa:a2045a8a-1ca8-4d3b-a045-2aeb2fb76bde a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Anyone can contribute to OpenTelemetry documentation, which includes improving existing content, creating new content, updating the OTel Registry and improving the code that builds the site. Before you can contribute, you will need to sign the Contributor License Agreement. To contribute, you need to be familiar with the following techs and tools: git, GitHub, Markdown (CommonMark) and YAML.

OpenTelemetry Contributing: https://github.com/open-telemetry/community/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e40dd37b-6414-47c3-b2a8-33a6e51b56e6 .

camssa:a2059175-b2b7-47fc-ad70-37ceb5d09229 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WS-Security is being used in the Delegated Regulation (EU) N° 885/2013 of 15 May 2013 with regard to the provision of information services for safe and secure parking places for trucks and commercial vehicles\r
\r
