        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification does not explicitly address whether it includes an access control mechanism. Regarding
data quality and provenance, the specification likely incorporates elements to ensure data reliability.

OGC TrainingDML-AI Standard:
https://docs.ogc.org/is/23-008r3/23-008r3.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:faf31111-6def-4642-bf62-9b431df832d4 .

