camssa:a28b4f79-53ac-4e45-b9d7-5cb94ca2ca02 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP is maintained and developed by IETF which is an international community developing open standards. In addition, the Open LDAP Foundation is a community which is centered in the maintenance and the distribution of the open source version of the specification, with the feedback of the community people.

Developer community IETF:
https://www.ietf.org/about/

OpenLDAP website:
https://www.openldap.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e0a801c6-cd66-4943-8a23-aa671d58f272 .

