        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Github repository is a developer community that hosts many discussions around UBL implementation in domain-specific business contexts.  These discussions also share their data and results and are open to contributions.\r
\r
UBL in Github:\r
https://github.com/oasis-tcs/ubl'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31ed9672-2b68-4220-acf4-819ffad0f0c6 .

