        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'NUTS has been developed and deployed by the European Commission; therefore, the specification is a European Standard.\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Principles and Characteristics section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/principles-and-characteristics'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab4b159d-3810-40dc-9e88-81ad1f70e33d .

