camssa:a31185ad-db36-4a4c-ace7-5f5f50c1a46d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Within the specification there is section 4.3 that indicates .... such as S/MIME (RFC3851). This section also defines the structure of a REM message bases on MIME format, and a REM message does not exist as a sel-standing object, therefore, justifies the fact of not being technology agnostic. \r
\r
S/MIME Message Specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8551\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ae6b1a1f-8790-491f-ad3c-2e387ba86b2f .

camssa:a3142a40-6533-4ec7-abac-5fb990827b0e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Despite the openness provided by eDelivery Governance Space, which purpose is to enable different parties to get involved in the development of the Building Blocks and all their components, a public review is not part of the decision-making-process.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eDelivery+SMP+-+1.10"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97340a8a-887e-48b7-a711-bcba20df548c .

