camssa:a3355412-398d-45d2-9cfa-645b383a818c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Domibus is designed to ensure the protection of personal data during the process of electronic message exchange. As an eDelivery Access Point (AP) solution, Domibus follows messaging standards such as the AS4 (Applicability Statement 4) profile of the ebMS (ebXML Messaging Service) standard, which includes features and mechanisms to enhance data security and privacy. \r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus\r
\r
AS4 Profile of ebMS 3.0:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ebxml-msg/ebms/v3.0/profiles/AS4-profile/v1.0/AS4-profile-v1.0.html\r
\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cb75914c-13cb-4b3f-8a34-dfa6ea821b9c .

camssa:a34176f7-efcb-4be2-98d8-4df17d84eb00 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The publiccode.yml specification does not directly support business process modelling, as its primary focus is on metadata for cataloguing public sector software rather than process documentation. However, by establishing a standard for software documentation, it can indirectly contribute to organisational interoperability. The shared metadata framework allows public administrations to organise and align software-related information, which can complement business process models and support a cohesive approach to delivering European public services.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:54ab91ab-f31f-494b-b38d-edbac6bdc785 .

camssa:a343253d-3b06-4439-863d-44826054a6e5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CAdES is independent of any technology or platform. Moreover, it is independent of any environment, so it can be applied to any environment, for example, smart cards, GSM SIM cards, special programs for electronic signatures, etc. \r
\r
CAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/64756.html\r
\r
CAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101700_101799/101733/02.01.01_60/ts_101733v020101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a16feedb-6629-44d8-8634-9e65e2e308f0 .

camssa:a346b0da-b7b0-470c-aced-bcbfe25f7bd3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC Publicly Available Standard (PAS) such as  ISO 19944-1 go through a systematic review process every three years, during which the members re-assess the standard and propose updatings.\r
\r
ISO public review guide:\r
https://www.iso.org/files/live/sites/isoorg/files/store/en/PUB100413.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:79965a64-0bde-4897-acc4-9572f4396689 .

camssa:a34aaf3c-3d19-4da0-a5ad-6ff1940dfd31 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Domibus is not related to the secure processing of data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus\r
\r
AS4 specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ebxml-msg/ebms/v3.0/profiles/AS4-profile/v1.0/AS4-profile-v1.0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a46952ab-6607-420f-b5cf-4b416cf24788 .

