https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/sites/display/DIGITAL/Standards+and+specifications

ETSI TS 119 612:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15621a29-2365-46ad-9330-ea40be2ca4d8 .

