camssa:a41b09b7-3807-43a1-a28c-7813948b8a71 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SVG is supported by several products and services like WordPress, HTML, or different versions of CSS. Also, it is widely used for the development of the icons with different purposes as logos for webpages or as part of the content of these web pages. Moreover, it is a step further from other graphical representation specifications by allowing a better description and representations of vectors and d mixed vector/raster.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:966221c3-9cde-4cee-ba54-d4a4f25b1e1a .

