camssa:a479fc39-0f9d-4244-8282-34ea6efbb1a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification was produced in 2019. The standard evolution involves many public technologists, policymakers, however, it is an ongoing work that can be further improved. At the same time, it can be implemented for the creation of products and services as part of the improvement process. Although the specification maturity has room for improvement, it is important to consider the option when developing products and services.\r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net"""@en ;
