    cav:judgement """There is no national or European platform with the specification PAdES (ISO 14533-3:2017) available for free. However, there are some free documents in Joinup that cover PAdES.\r
\r
PAdES Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/electronic-signatures-and-infrastructures-esi-pdf-advanced-electronic-signature-formats-pades-part-2"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:868c06ab-1975-493f-a799-247a377360f8 .

camssa:a4965530-0ccc-4e20-8b5d-7fa8407fcead a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is to support the exchange of information between organisations that define criteria and organisations that respond to these criteria by means of evidences.\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28217b30-d222-4ada-a4c8-fcc44a714f21 .

