        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PNG is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:880c62a6-32f1-4a3a-99c4-30e0d2f13e00 .

