        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SFIA Foundation provides and organises webinars, conference and trainings where users of country-specific platforms can share their data and results on the use of the SFIA specification.\r
\r
SFIA reference, Get Help section, SFUA partners:\r
https://sfia-online.org/en/get-help/partners'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1307480b-18d5-40be-87f3-7b44a6597ed9 .

