camssa:a4ded5d9-8154-44c6-9f0d-e706e4953b69 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Web Services Description Language (WSDL) itself does not provide mechanisms for guaranteeing the authenticity and authentication of the roles or agents involved in data transactions. WSDL is primarily a specification for describing the interfaces and operations of web services, focusing on the technical aspects of communication.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:943aee80-5bbe-4e69-96ee-feb1e768f5ac .

camssa:a4e9a01b-b102-498d-940f-14ee4e298435 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes WAI-ARIA in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories 1. Conceptual model for integrated public services provision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0e616020-cc72-4df6-ab22-12e291da2de3 .

