        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The six architectural constraints of REST emphasize the scalability of interactions between components, uniform interfaces, independent deployment of components and the creation of layered architecture to facilitate its usage across business domains.  \r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b10f32d1-978d-428a-9951-a4a369876a93 .

