camssa:a6404424-8456-4e37-955b-f17e384b6de4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'"At the moment of performing the assessment, Linked Data and Open Data repositories and initiatives are a key point, and public administrations are putting efforts to develop a cross-border environment for open data exchange and reuse. \r
\r
Many initiatives and projects are raising using RDF as a foundation to collide their purpose and objectives. The creation of Linked Open Data solutions can be considered as innovative solutions as they help to evolve the eGoverment.\r
\r
RDF primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3a361116-2fd3-467f-b837-f444421703ac .

camssa:a647294c-e5bd-46bb-980c-145460703386 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a64aa4ba-b2b7-4e6b-8bee-a418eb5292d4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a64dd419-17ef-4d8c-aec4-a8d24a6269b1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 can enable visibility of administrations when combined with other specifications, notably Internet protocols (e.g. Domain Name System, DNS) or those specifications inherent to the interface of a given public service. For example, the specification prompts visibility of administrations in e-procurement (see CEF Digital home reference, eProcurement section) by allowing, for instance, the display of data associated to the country or territory where a user is submitting an ESPD (European Single Procurement Document) form.\r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html\r
\r
Internet Assigned Numbers Authority (IANA) reference, DNS section:\r
https://www.iana.org/domains\r
\r
CEF Digital home reference, eProcurement section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/CEFDIGITAL/eProcurement?msclkid=1d426d24aa8311ec89f38d676363e47d\r
\r
ESPD reference, Legal framework and context section:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/3.0.1/xml_business_handbook.html#_i_1_1_legal_framework_and_context'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:939ff037-3f2f-4433-8619-6f29c214f1a5 .

