camssa:a6a02511-92fa-4f98-94be-02b43a499e99 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As most of the vocabularies, DCAT reuses several existing ones (e.g. \"adms\", \"foaf\", DCAT) and the Resource Description Framework (RDF). This  results in a dependency that can hamper interoperability, especially in the case where new releases of the reused vocabularies are not backward compatible."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ab30092-b7b2-4576-8b7c-02f6b4b8b874 .

