        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 5 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Examples of Member States including CAdES in their catalogues are France or Spain.See:\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db6ba6e3-af47-46ff-8eb7-7882f4ba705f .

