    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a6b70324-87a7-4d57-8533-2347b5a5b9e4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ODRL is a standard language that makes digital content rules clear, uniform and easy to automate across \r
systems ensuring transparent and controlled access to content or services. ODRL also provides a flexible \r
and interoperable information model, vocabulary, and encoding mechanisms for representing statements \r
about the usage of content and services. By implementing it, enables visibility of administrative procedures, \r
rules data, and services depending on the implementation and usage within different systems and \r
applications.\r
\r
W3C specification: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:56fea0fb-4e5c-47ea-9bad-2794d90bdc99 .

camssa:a6b90d48-ae1c-4e2f-891e-9eb46967a8ab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By allowing the exchange of digital graphics, it improves the representation of information avoiding sharing non-digital documents and therefore helps the reduction of the administrative burden.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ab4f4fcf-a3fb-4273-abc3-f6ca29ebc027 .

camssa:a6bc7f01-e16d-46ea-bcb3-01bdc64a929c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8954ddabf37f4899562b9ea4c8f0bbf204f3e48c9203043bc231f368092396a2 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:a6c0aa05-2b27-4d30-b6b7-8adc9e7d47ac a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a6c10eef-0cef-4756-9c6f-9708186c97f2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification acts as an interface and enables the business transaction level data being shared and\r
reused in different systems - internal or external.\r
\r
https://unece.org/fileadmin/DAM/cefact/cf_forums/2019_Geneva/Conf_AccountAudit/PPT_1_2_XBRL_Koskentalo.pdf\r
\r
http://www.xbrl.org/GLWGNotes/XBRL-GL-WGN-FAQ-2007-08-01.htm\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c5fe4dbf-5c42-4dde-a77b-1eb3d65bf953 .

camssa:a6c1f872-d2ea-480c-90d0-60e1ae769f4b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although the specification has been implemented in some projects at European level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of the specification in an open repository or catalogue of standards at European level.\r
