camssa:a6db96d5-8766-4b59-8e9b-1636afcf4547 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"One of IDS' underlying objectives is to improve data interoperability and integrity. Therefore, it encourages the creation of communities along with the sharing of their data and results at European platforms (e.g. DBSA). Furthermore, IDS-G has public channels such as GitHub where users can discuss and ask any matter at hand.\r
\r
The Data Spaces Business Alliance (DSBA): https://data-spaces-business-alliance.eu/\r
\r
IDS-G DISCUSSIONS: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/discussions\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eecb4e6b-3925-4860-b8d7-b57119be7bd7 .

