        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DPV is not related to the long-term preservation of information; therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:83bf7551-b237-4a31-a551-64359cb9e672 .

camssa:a6e7c3e7-4a29-4094-899c-5415fd08e11f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPv4 is publicly available for implementation and use, and therefore for everyone to study, for free on IETF webpage. \r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc791\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc1349\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2474\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc6864"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bb5aae3d-57b9-4bff-bf08-05600089f6a9 .

