camssa:a6faf00b-5faa-45d3-b190-9c447419157d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OWL2 is an extension of RDF for accessing, importing, sharing and reusing public ontologies. Using OWL2 helps to reduce the administrative burden by easing the publication and reusing the administration's data. _x000D_\r
_x000D_\r
OWL2 W3C reference:_x000D_\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-overview/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1b6689b2-6e3e-42a5-847c-849011d8efae .

