        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Xforms is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/xformsusers/wiki/XForms_2.0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:107d3845-c718-464d-9c23-6567e70a0456 .

