camssa:a75f5d08-6248-4c41-a570-107aa4516d6c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As an internet protocol for data exchange, FTPS can be used for secure exchange of documents over the Internet, which can reduce administrative burden. Moreover, FTPS can avoid the exchange of non-digital documents that are generally source of administrative burden.\r
\r
FTPS IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4217 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:03c0c3b1-c5a9-4f5a-baf8-d625737326b0 .

