        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Spanish data protection agency is recommending DoH for its use in data confidentiality verification, to mitigate the risk of data interception and tampering. 

Spanish data protection agency:
https://www.aepd.es/guides/technical-note-dns-privacy.pdf'"""@en ;
