    cav:refersTo camssa:6e0583e1-ccc6-4132-9f6e-2bb85d538bb2 .

camssa:a7c06af2-bc64-48c6-b63b-958593355d49 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Different documents and studies are assessing the effectiveness and efficiency of the SVG while rendering images and textures. Also, there are other studies and documentation about the usage of the specification in another context such as the creation of graphical content for comics, even though it is not under the scope of this assessment it can demonstrate the potential of SVG for graphical content.\r
\r
eCommons: Feature Based-Textures: \r
https://ecommons.cornell.edu/handle/1813/5648"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a881fcef-2441-4a03-99b8-d1fae0333aec .

camssa:a7c65448-6033-4371-a47e-73f214114733 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAREF is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF has a high performance on interoperability according to NIFO factsheets.

CAMSS List of Standards:
