camssa:a862bf23-0be8-41a8-93d7-7aa160db6c43 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 can be mapped to the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS) in the "Local Area Network", “Physical Communication Infrastructure”, “Firewall”, “Physical Computing Infrastructure”, "Private subnetwork" and “Physical Network Infrastructure” under Technical Infrastructure view. 

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a084f329-3ba6-4a26-8ff0-7e60356fb428 .

camssa:a86e99be-7a67-4af3-b6bf-096d8544ba1f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAS can be a good visibility enabler when it comes to documenting and creating new APIs.  Performing code generation for documentation, clients and servers, OAS contributes to the visibility of administrative procedures given that it facilitates APIs implementation, improving understandability and interaction for clients.\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8aff82de-0ccd-4df0-b2c0-0e7fa31746a8 .

camssa:a86fb344-9164-4947-918b-e5a932595d9b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """JSON highly supports Tim Berners Lee's 5 star schema for open data. The adoption of JSON fosters the publication of data as open data by means of providing structured data and the usage of non-proprietary formats. Moreover, it helps to link data by means of embedding metadata. \r
\r
Moreover, there is an existing extension of JSON which aims to help and support the Linked Open Data environments. The extension has been developed by the W3C working group specifically in charge of JSON-LD development. Additionally, the W3C has developed a syntax for RDF serialisation using JSON, and JSON-LD is recommended. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/json-ld/\r
https://json-ld.org"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a6fd661f-c41e-45eb-81e6-140f08fd00c7 .

