camssa:a888b1f5-33ff-42d5-8d3d-e2ca82c80b4f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 12639:2004 (TIFF/IT) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html \r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:16bd20f9-ca64-4bb5-895e-a971f6f2d85a .

