camssa:a93fffb6-80de-4f8b-84ce-0021182521a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DNS has some core functionalities that can not  be implemented separately. Nonetheless, the 
specification has beed developed to support some requirements that are not mandatory but recommended. 

DNS IETF reference:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8499

Domain Names - Implementation and Specification: 
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1035'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:aba532ab-41e9-4e70-a854-a9b70c6bbb37 .

camssa:a940094b-5200-4387-a28d-d03e3afa7ff8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a9410429-99df-4270-bf7c-e0f6b9aad714 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is maintained by International Data Spaces Global (IDS-G) working groups and any user can contribute by proposing discussions on the IDS-G GitHub Discussion channel.

IDS-G Discussions: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/discussions

IDSA Working Groups: https://internationaldataspaces.org/make/working-groups-and-task-forces/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6301a759-488f-4486-a011-c2923be0396e .

camssa:a94523c6-c831-4b05-8bc5-ada1043fed11 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox is independent from any software, hardware, or operating system since it is a specification for lawmaking. It can be used and applied independently from other standards, or software requirements.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a388c9ea-b456-49fa-8c19-2d967d2613b4 .

camssa:a949c380-7622-45bf-827d-9dc3c4c6ed90 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100" .

