camssa:a95421f7-2896-4f20-8d03-39eb57fb1091 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OASIS decision-making process for the approval of a specification is clearly defined. Decisions are taken based on votes requiring a Simple Majority Vote to pass. Furthermore, a public review is included in the TC process.

Review process OASIS:
https://www.oasis-open.org/policies-guidelines/tc-process-2017-05-26'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:078d2c12-18f8-49ea-89e4-56558d828f05 .

