    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a96177fd-b37f-4d6a-8261-9d30ebb166f5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, ETSI TS 119 612 can define the "e-Signature Creation Service", the "e-Signature Verification and Validation Service" ABB and "Trust Service Provisioning Component" ABB of the EIRA Technical view.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v500'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:49b73596-0186-4f7c-a62b-de44ecc4fc75 .

camssa:a9682c0b-4539-4044-be5e-ed5347a986e2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b37687b8bb3dbd4c6f96969358cf5d70900d1ccd01402cea7668da6303bec4b4 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a96bfc38-9a16-4aed-bc5c-27600c194781 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary provides a foundational set of terms for describing legally registered organisations, it is designed to be flexible and allows for customisation through the creation of application profiles. The application profiles enables the vocabulary to be adapted to specific needs and data exchange scenarios by incorporating external vocabularies and defining additional rules and terms.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f2e0281e-b764-4f81-99f4-6c2e05d06382 .

camssa:a96e535a-bd6f-40f2-8989-4b190d521b7b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:a972499b-0731-4ca5-8e71-dbf131843329 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Standard for Public Code is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1343d6e-105d-46b8-91bb-d7365c2106a0 .

camssa:a972e4bc-b6e3-484e-a031-45b6ab1a9e64 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Douglas Crockford was the creator of JSON. The system was sold to Sun Microsystems, Amazon.com and EDS. The website of the specification was launched in 2002. JSON reuses conventions from other programming languages, in consequence, many libraries of programming use it. Therefore, it is demonstrated that JSON has enough maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of digital solutions and services. \r
\r
JSON.org:\r
https://www.json.org/json-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:93a6b883-189b-4a38-a0ac-95813a44c875 .

camssa:a9746ddc-d8b1-4fe3-9e8f-fe0a60cf34db a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f41cca0d171e6f64dbc2bdeae9fbc87f2ea51ac00185b22114d59ab8a06e78d0 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:a97cab91-f438-4336-ac27-3dda2f5cd452 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:a9815b6a-ac6b-4619-84e5-f6a9ce3f4d48 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of EuroVoc is to facilitate the processing of data of administations mainly European but also National. By allowing to make the data available to other persons or organisations, the EuroVoc Contributes to the development of eGovernment reducing the administrative burden. \r
\r
EuroVoc webpage:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/eurovoc"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85311292-63d2-4ce8-9a41-1cad108c09e9 .

camssa:a9884447-00af-4d93-b0a1-d794d22de980 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification can help to define the framework for working within the organisation regarding data and information security. It also can help to establish a common view and method between administrations providing public services to ensure the proper treatment of information and how it should be done.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 27001 reference website:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/54534.html\r
\r
ENISA reference:\r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/topics/threat-risk-management/risk-management/current-risk/laws-regulation/rm-ra-standards/iso-iec-standard-27001\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6dbad6b3-a1a6-4ed8-aae8-3189aa441cb8 .

