camssa:a99a1a89-226b-45cc-acfb-2453d40af304 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI appears in the Comission Implementing Regulation of 20 November 2018 amending Commission Regulation (EC) No 416/2007 concerning the technical specifications for Notices to Skippers. The WS-I Basic Profile 1.1. guarantee "interoperability guidance for a core set of non-proprietary web services specifications". One of the most relevants standards which is mentioned is UDDI.

Comission Implementing Regulation of 20 November 2018 amending Commission Regulation (EC) No 416/2007 concerning the technical specifications for Notices to Skippers:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX%3A02007R0416-20181229&qid=1712224257609'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c8a16b5e-5ddb-44bd-ba18-eb48866396d8 .

