camssa:a9e47351-e1b7-4976-aca2-237cdbec4e0a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Odata is included in 3 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to France, Malta and The Netherlands.\r
The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of these Member States varies when aligned with the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
National catalogue France: \r
http://references.modernisation.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf\r
\r
National catalogue Netherlands:\r
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/lijst\r
\r
NIFO factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2021'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8be15b69-c3e9-4deb-98bb-b8a02632d74f .

camssa:a9e9f727-78d1-4401-ac3d-ba881b4cc7e3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ETSI and any of its committees, in charge of the development of NFVI, operates under the ETSI Intellectual Property Rigths (IPRs) and IPR Policy. The specification is licensed on a Royalty-free.\r
\r
IPR Policy, ETSI ownership of IPRs section:\r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bef38497-a782-4d85-a09e-1ca942cc86dd .

camssa:a9f101d5-3687-4a99-bb71-34119a2cd159 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of PNG is not related to organisational interoperability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39551bfb-5811-44ba-95d4-62305eee58df .

