        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As a vocabulary to describe assets within a Repository, it provides concepts and properties identifying the content creators and other informative metadata such as dates involved in the release of the solutions described. These facts may increase the protection of the exchanged data. \r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cd42c8c5-2f9b-4af2-9272-37e92ec9c689 .

