        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is a testing section which is about Testing multilingual string types. The Predicate of that Test is the \r
value of the lang attribute which specifies the language of the message.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 614-1 reference, page 9 (Testing multilingual string types):\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/11961401/01.01.01_60/ts_11961401v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:35d0f69b-32c6-4bef-a84a-0398d3ef2bfb .

camssa:a9fe3c8f-8af2-4407-958e-fc804758cb1d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "By providing conformance levels and requirements in order to maintain eSignatures in the context of AdES signatures, it ensures and fosters the trustworthy data exchange between administrations and their stakeholders."@en ;
