camssa:aa133313-fba7-4048-99a5-a16cbf012f6d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the Core Location Vocabulary is to create a reusable and extensible data model that captures the fundamental characteristics related to locations. By providing a set of information to describe data in the sectors mentioned before, it helps public administrations to save and comprehend in an orderly and standardised way, information related to people, locations or business.

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d1faedc8-7b03-44c8-a0e3-2485d64fb143 .

