        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of OCSP is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is\r
not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
OCSP reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2560'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dae90ef7-36c3-4b43-bfd1-0323b91a2848 .

