camssa:aa2cea68-92eb-4ff3-8570-224f97315362 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OWL allows accessing, importing, sharing and reusing public ontologies. OWL2 is based on elements of RDF and it adds more vocabulary for describing properties and classes. RDF is one of the proposed standards for the publication of data as Linked Open Data. So, the specification is highly aligned with the different levels of maturity of Tim Berners-Lee's 5-star schema for Open Data._x000D_\r
_x000D_\r
OWL2 W3C reference:_x000D_\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/owl2-overview/_x000D_\r
_x000D_\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5 star schema for Open Data:   _x000D_\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:093cef79-a8c0-44a2-a97c-49ffc49ebaf6 .

camssa:aa326ad9-bb24-4553-8da3-ac26b3a818bb a cav:Score,
