camssa:aa4d0bb0-d9ef-4efb-b3cf-c62ff878a765 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Some of the specifications that include the PROV family of documents allows for partial implementations, specifically PROV-DM, as long as the implementation and usage are identified as described in the PROV Implementation Report. \r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV list of reported implementations:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/NOTE-prov-implementations-20130430/#implementations'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d860939d-c5e3-4938-a3bb-e3a2ad50afe2 .

camssa:aa5182d8-bb44-4390-a38f-35306ab78bbc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP can enable digital service delivery channels insofar it can be used to create and adapt an archive, or develop applications that need conformance with eArchiving standards, thus enabling seamless delivery of information-related services.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction\r
\r
CEF eArchiving:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/egovernment/solution/cef-earchiving/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b54322b9-81ed-4bfa-95ed-92145bc25c8e .

