        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DPV is not related to e-acceesibility, therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
DPV specification: \r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/dpv/\r
\r
DPV primer document:\r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7b0fc315-b453-4e69-b11e-0319982664c7 .

