camssa:aac848a1-9660-45f6-a48a-50e4f9005b54 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"While DoH plays a crucial role in enhancing the security and privacy of DNS communication, it doesn't comprehensively address or provide visibility into administrative procedures, rules data, or services. These aspects are typically managed through other networking protocols, configurations, and tools at different layers of the networking stack.

DoH specification: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8484\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46ab050c-6c6a-426d-a227-f882722b30eb .

