camssa:abbe04ce-4606-4df3-b8d7-c259917ff01d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """eDelivery SMP 1.10 has the support of CEF eDelivery team which is in charge of the maintenance of the profile. Moreover, the SMP 1.0 is developed by OASIS, one of most relevant international standardisation organisations\r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eDelivery+SMP+-+1.10"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1e55da16-fc5e-4e82-bc2b-d64a2b383c69 .

camssa:abc53572-2b8a-4633-97e2-3ae1147816ae a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of ODF is not related to the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
ODF ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/66363.html\r
\r
ODF OASIS reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de7eed9d-af03-4f28-801a-cbce4ea1320d .

