camssa:ac106cce-9905-4efc-a983-09d6806d22be a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI Specification Technical Committee was composed by members coming from the most important IT companies as are IBM, Microsoft or Oracle. 
Along with SOAP and the WSDL stack, UDDI is the cornerstone of Web services implementation. UDDI is a key enabler for creating an effective service ecosystem. Additionally, the main market share companies support the use and implementation of UDDI, so it is demonstrated its maturity and market acceptance.

UDDI OASIS reference:
http://www.uddi.org/pubs/uddi_v3.htm#_Toc85907974'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cce3a6cb-b533-4c1f-bbb9-3e531568a501 .

camssa:ac1597c0-518b-47ec-8919-7ec501391ca8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "No evidences have been found of the specification being included in a formal interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0e28a7c5-c8ed-408d-9e19-acee0f4a02dc .

