        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CPOV contributes to the accuracy of data processing by providing a standardized and consistent data model. This reduces errors and ambiguities in describing and managing information about public organizations, improving the quality and accuracy of the processed data.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:91b8f02d-1c6c-435b-b8d3-1d813ff0a91f .

