camssa:ac7bd3cb-29a3-4c39-be6c-da17158bec39 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry significantly enhances the visibility of administrative procedures by providing comprehensive observability tools that offer deep insights into system performance, reliability, and behavior. This visibility is crucial for maintaining efficient, compliant, and optimized administrative operations.

OpenTelemetry: https://opentelemetry.netlify.app/docs/specs/otel/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97fe52d2-d10a-4a68-b958-94c02b5416c4 .

camssa:ac7e0441-d825-4e5b-a881-bb6d3761dcbc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a document exchange format, ODF is a valuable tool for sharing information through the internet between administrations and stakeholders. Also, the XML schema allows the transformation of the content using XSLT by XML based tools. Allowing sharing data and information the standard foster the visibility of administration data and services. Fostering the collaboration between public administrations, the specification eases the decision-making process of institutions.\r
\r
UK Sharing and collaborating with government documents \r
https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/open-standards-for-government/sharing-or-collaborating-with-government-documents\r
\r
ODF ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/66363.html\r
\r
ODF OASIS reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0459c509-aef7-4006-a334-5e84fc7e1a39 .

camssa:ac81c502-522f-401c-be4e-0ea403711dfa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification needs both parts, the client and the server to be operative and meet the requirements of the time-stamping. Additionally, the specification defines a set of requirements to be followed that can be complemented with the usage of other specifications or standards.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a3965f5f-2016-456a-afab-4af015140d63 .

