camssa:acc77471-e8c8-44f7-9108-0c9ae308907a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPsec is a business domain agnostic specification, thus can be used in any domain.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8b986719-455a-49b9-a068-fdeec6217f04 .

camssa:acc7a861-5d40-4eaa-a874-12708cff8430 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is delivered in English, therefore here it is limiting multilingualism of itself. However, EIRA foresee some components that are in line with ensuring that digital public services can be provided in different languages. An example is the "machine translation" components.  

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d5b0b117-3d40-4831-92ae-0bf6d9185433 .

camssa:acccefe0-7ade-42ba-99a6-931b062890b6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:acd20a5b-9a21-4835-a863-a7c89743e579 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV allows to show the quality of data security, as well as credibility, but it is not aimed at secure data exchange. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to the specification.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eba98910-68e4-4d19-a5f3-922af8f9ea50 .

