camssa:acd5c4b8-ea68-4375-846a-9459d55b18b6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the 5 star Open Data model suggested by Tim Berners-Lee about how to publish linked data, the forth star corresponds to represent data with URIs. According to the OData home page, OData enables the publication of open data. This specification supports REST-based data services, allowing any resource, as well as open data, to be published and edited via simple HTTP messages.

Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:
https://5stardata.info/en/

OData reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.01/odata-v4.01-part1-protocol.html#_Toc31358832'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50574f01-a473-4a89-a740-d77b540eba29 .

camssa:acdec1f7-e812-4755-8df9-afeb71115d4f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.

W3C Process document:
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:442692f0-e0cc-4ee3-a783-c48acebd850e .

camssa:ace4c3bb-c689-4a12-9b2d-65155319947b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry is not related to providing means for restriction of access to information/data. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

OpenTelemetry: https://opentelemetry.netlify.app/docs/specs/otel/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:df420981-7020-47a1-8298-5037327a5c3a .

camssa:ace6f214-31f7-4493-9445-b6accc138245 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b122f4f42ca2089ee158a31d932d6a0332aa3a4d04acce1e2e7aa140815a0ec ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:ace8b6ff-4f5b-420e-9605-d5f0bb830735 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of ISAE 3402 standard is other than enabling e-accessibility, therefore, this criterion is not \r
applicable to the standard.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 handbook reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:727d26e4-618d-4457-88e1-424cf922fdb2 .

camssa:aceed069-991d-4ee7-be10-bff9129c2255 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The application of the once-only principle in all EU Member States public administrations aims at reducing the administrative burden. To achieve this, interoperability between public administrations is a sine qua non condition. SOAP addresses and facilitates the exchanging of information within cross border services and impacts positively the development of eGovernment.\r
\r
SOAP Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/soap12/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e9802e3e-0de7-4ede-9221-1b786c77e3f8 .

camssa:acf43f5c-4602-4218-bdd1-426962405236 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "\"The specification takes no stance on what technologies are used in the platform it's being used on.\""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9931cc77-3e5c-4b11-bc01-78ec8b9b79fe .

