camssa:ad886b90-0291-44ca-872b-3cae532a84a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to section 8.8 of the protocol "The syslog protocol does not have mechanisms to provide confidentiality for the messages in transit". 

Syslog Protocol Message Observation: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424#section-8.8'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:463c571b-1544-471f-97c2-00d1fdfc769a .

camssa:ad8c4a9c-8278-4ea6-8aef-caaa8c9440d8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specification is not related to the delivery of multilingual services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2924e453-6542-4ec4-a009-cc6d6116165d .

camssa:ad91088d-071d-43c0-bca1-3372d448ffa5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'One common way to extend JSON is by incorporating additional fields within the JSON objects. These additional fields can contain custom data or specific information that goes beyond the standard JSON structure. By adding custom fields, applications can include extra metadata or define application-specific attributes while still adhering to the overall JSON format.\r
\r
JSON specification:\r
https://www.ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-404_2nd_edition_december_2017.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:33cba28f-d847-4adc-8172-2d2c3d971c18 .

camssa:ad921953-a46b-4ff3-914e-2e32a1131cfb a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:ad925eab-53a1-41ab-be1a-7778142f6018 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"As a common data exchange format, CSV comprehensibly fosters the visibility of administration's data. It eases the publication of structured data for the consumption by the different stakeholders. Therefore, CSV fosters the visibility of administrations data. Additionally, it can be used internally easing as well de decision-making process. \r
\r
CSV reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:92654410-a2d4-4014-b73d-f129fb352714 .

camssa:ad95a091-b8f8-4a18-ad24-6e7cc41984d3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are already studies and documentation assessing the specification in terms of effectiveness and efficiency. The topics are different, for instance, there is a study assessing the capabilities of XML Schema for the defense against Signature Wrapped Attacks. \r
Another field of documentation is the XML Schema clustering, and its effectiveness and efficiency for the improvement of user results.\r
\r
ResearchGate XML Schema Validation Reference:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/252053794_On_the_effectiveness_of_XML_Schema_validation_for_countering_XML_Signature_Wrapping_attacks\r
\r
ResearchGate Effectiveness & Efficiency Assessment Reference: \r
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/254858700_XML_schema_matching_balancing_efficiency_and_effectiveness_by_means_of_clustering'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f4d32955-a6fe-4fae-8370-607e66bf2c5a .

camssa:ada2ee24-99d7-44fb-b87c-b131b992799e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) specification is yet to be included in a member state catalogue. 

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1b8997c-8fd5-421f-bb57-32787e5da459 .

