        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Semantic Interoperability Community (SEMIC) has established Working Groups. These Working Groups are open to the participation of everyone interested in semantic solutions working for public administrations in the Member States or in EU institutions.

SEMIC working groups:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06c0eb53-4ec1-4468-b92d-5e054c0d92f8 .

camssa:af6c63ca-24b1-4a94-994c-ef40fa49405f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TOSCA is to be used for a variety of cloud services and is not tied to any specific cloud paradigm. Therefore, the specification is platform-agnostic.\r
\r
TOSCA reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:12a1dac5-9a31-4df2-ba7e-5b913e3c4f83 .

