camssa:af908ad0-22ad-4f8f-99bb-e6b084b9b3c1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Standard for Public Code has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Moreover, the standard is currently evolving and the defined process is open, with complete access and rights to contribute meaning that everyone can participate with suggestions, issues, or problems while contributors can also make changes and document them directly. In this sense, the decision making process is constantly open to the community.\r
\r
The Standard for Public Code webpage:\r
https://standard.publiccode.net/\r
\r
The Standard for Public Code contributing section: \r
https://standard.publiccode.net/CONTRIBUTING.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b13467d-4fa5-4cc7-b971-53435f8fdc8e .

