camssa:afdc96a7-1816-4f00-9a14-625beb88e21b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "e-Delivery SMP 1.10 is part of eDelivery stack, which allows document and data exchange between different parts within a public or private network. The implementation of the specification along with the eDelivery Building Block stack, is a key enabler for data exchange, which allows administrations to reduce administrative burdens. Some of the administrative burdens are the non-digital data exchange or the time that implies these exchanges among others. "@en ;
