        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TLS 1.2 is published on Joinup, the collaborative platform for reusable IT Solutions funded by the European Commission.\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/tls-rfc-5246-transport-layer-security-protocol"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80d5ef59-0597-400d-8c9f-fdc905b259e4 .

