camssa:b09a82aa-ddf1-456c-88d1-eaecc8d00c47 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Despite being involved in several projects, ISO 3166-1 has no evaluations that assess it and no evidence of any technological solutions that indirectly assess the specification has been found. Therefore, there is no assessment of the specification's effectiveness.\r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0bf3df2a-a624-4b70-a96a-e32ef1baa786 .

