        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Currently the Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has not been recommended by any European member state. But the Industrie 4.0 platform is promoted mainly by the German government, and this includes the AAS specification.  

etails of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f431f737-fbcf-4003-9ff4-ce2eb03bcae2 .

