        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Given that the aim of the DPV is to become a standard data model and vocabulary to be used across Europe, it is designed to support most of the languages used in the European Union.\r
\r
DPV specification: \r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/dpv/\r
\r
DPV primer document:\r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/#introduction  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:100c9ca7-b8c1-42a7-bc98-e4260c287fe7 .

