camssa:b1894926-190a-4a0d-b262-bc759e42123e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TLS 1.2 has been widely adopted by public administrations in order to secure the communications over Internet. \r
An example of its use in a cross-border project is the Union Registry from the European Commission "Climate Action, Energy for a changing World". The initiative restricted its use to a web browsers supporting TLS 1.2. \r
See: \r
https://unionregistry.ec.europa.eu/euregistry/EU/index.xhtml"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c22673d8-8cb4-4303-9af3-a208fb8e3eec .

