camssa:b1d028f0-5a7b-439d-b014-9671740bd6f9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of TrainingDML-AI is not related to the secure exchange of data. While it doesn’t explicitly
mention security, the use of standardized protocols and formats can contribute to secure data exchange.

OGC TrainingDML-AI Standard:
https://docs.ogc.org/is/23-008r3/23-008r3.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fdc784f1-82bc-4604-8a3c-85a3b49d202e .

camssa:b1d5e59f-1e3b-4c3b-bbdc-8baacc98e862 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPsec specification ensures the trustworthiness and integrity of tranferred data. IPsec can guarantee that data has not been modified by unauthorised users, that it remains unchanged from its original form when sent, and that it will reliably reach the receiver.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html

IPsec security reference:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/ipsec-internet-protocol-security-tunnel-and-transport-modes/

AH and ESP protocols:
https://netseccloud.com/ah-vs-esp-understanding-the-core-differences-in-ipsec-protocols'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c6d89c54-4a6c-455a-8fbe-2b4e303d0d19 .

camssa:b1e382d2-0a1f-4508-9c3e-72421104a0e0 a cav:Score,
