        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'At least 7 Member States recommends the use of XSLT specification, this Member States are: Cyprus, France, Germany, Greece, Poland, Portugal and Sweden.

National Catalogue of France:
https://www.numerique.gouv.fr/uploads/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf

National Catalogue of Sweden:
https://www.avropa.se/globalassets/dokument/open-it-standards.pdf?_t_id=1B2M2Y8AsgTpgAmY7PhCfg%
3d%3d&_t_q=standards&_t_tags=language%3asv%2csiteid%3a95d515a5-23ca-47bf-87a9-

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:201b1db4-d3df-47f1-afd9-1e155db158c1 .

