camssa:b301ef60-7df2-4e37-ab88-30a4c524bf53 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By providing structure for the registry of web services, the specification acts as a repository that contains web services descriptions, services providers data and information related to how to access these web services. These registries help to administration and stakeholders to provide information and meet each other with the minimum effort. More specifically, the specification contributes to putting together both, requester and provider, minimising efforts and creating effective services ecosystems. \r
\r
Evidence of its implication on the OOP is that SELIS project is included within one of the main Building Blocks for the accomplishment of the once-only principle, eInvoicing. \r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eprocurement/document/secure-electronic-invoicing-service-selis\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/2018/10/25/TOOP%3A+The+Once-Only+Principle"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1286156f-9048-4f39-9ffd-ac23cf570528 .

