camssa:b3ec5572-2346-47c8-b1dc-55247fe03776 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, DNS has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision and included in the European list of ICT Standards for e-procurement.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0859ad18-27da-4641-9bb3-877390d919b0 .

