camssa:b4b334b4-370c-42e1-8a09-84c656588f1a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Indexed Database API specification is designed to provide a way for web applications to store and retrieve large amounts of structured data locally in a browser, without being tied to a specific domain.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:930aed50-d196-4630-8237-9fb447e0c05e .

camssa:b4b48ea3-9c3d-4731-b78f-eae13eda5884 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of PAdES as electronic signature using PDF for signing online documents does not hamper the scalability of systems.\r
\r
PAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/67937.html\r
\r
PAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f030f0cb-e9af-4c22-a69f-efd37c8cbd73 .

camssa:b4b6934c-48f5-46a4-96b3-8440e91b344d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """HTML fosters the comprehensibility of administrative data by helping to understand the data published in various formats that makes the administrative data easier to comprehend.\r
\r
HTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/html401/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0cc68f16-c628-40ce-b909-ba91f2e3b96e .

camssa:b4b7cacb-ca75-46e2-93b2-bc1a34437c96 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "No evidences have been found of the specification being included in a formal interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fb7efaf9-73f3-40f0-adb4-69588c6b10e6 .

camssa:b4bc745e-8a14-4aa6-a340-bf880fdbf286 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SMTP is a business domain agnostic specification that can be reused in a cross-domain way.\r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ae3ebc4-dac6-42e9-81c8-319f589c4a40 .

camssa:b4bc9649-0713-48de-b1cb-f22dfc1ee0ac a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-6f7b3377cc1836eb056d44786260085e36fc1d6856a3aa3d37fe017e16cfc319 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:b4bfb088-34af-4e02-9e34-6ef36369ba9f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SAMM is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6bc3f89d-32ad-43d8-bf2a-c8bf46202da1 .

