    cav:value "100" .

camssa:b4cdb2b1-4125-4133-89a5-025ec347a899 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT does not directly help for the provision of application programming interfaces (APIs) or Web services.\r
However, DCAT aims to ensure consistency by providing a standard description of the catalogues and datasets published by data portals across Europe. This description makes datasets more searchable and accessible for data reuse and encourages the data providers to use open data portals for dissemination of reusable data.          \r
                                                                                                                    \r
DCAT (v2.0.0) reference:             \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:11d4e661-40a3-4b6f-9335-ed030647be70 .

camssa:b4e1a55c-a06b-40dc-bca3-ad5e0910ab49 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 is intended to identify a country, dependencies and special areas of geographical interest. This specification relates to metadata, and can be used in any system that ingests metadata. Therefore, it can be considered technology-agnostic.\r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c2c7b7ef-1b4f-4b17-a4ac-19777175c981 .

camssa:b4e4a675-908e-48bb-9599-4a6752879878 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c967c90bfc7bc13426924eca012de349ae51d4e8f652fe64bfbec2cccc8c8146 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:b4e52bcf-ae65-408b-852e-983d61631eae a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:b4e64948-bf1e-4d71-a9ee-cedb684cb72b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv4 provides addressing and routing mechanisms that allow devices and systems to communicate over the internet. This is essential for digital service delivery channels such as websites, mobile applications, cloud services, and APIs that rely on the internet to deliver services.

IPv4 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc791'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:30aff1df-6710-4e31-9758-f7ee9b9d602a .

camssa:b4e97254-1949-4b7e-9e89-78f83e0c0da1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification explicitly addresses and enables the implementation of features to guarantee confidentiality such as data minimization. Section 8.4 of ISO 19941 directly mentions data policy portability and how these policies dictate shortened data retention periods, de-identification of data and erasure or masking of records not needed to provide the cloud service. \r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f737bde3-d1b1-4fc8-bc9d-432d245d185b .

camssa:b4ee6c49-03b5-41c9-b192-f5cd0e79a955 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP is still excellent with authenticating Linux-based applications including many open source solutions, for \r
example: OpenVPN, Jenkins, Kubernetes. It is often used to complement Active Directory (AD) as a \r
directory services protocol. Therefore, it is demonstrated that LDAP has enough market acceptance for its \r
use in the development of digital solutions and services.\r
\r
LDAP used with OpenVPN:\r
https://openvpn.net/vpn-server-resources/openvpn-access-server-on-active-directory-via-ldap/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:561a2567-151a-46bd-8fdf-c48e879257ff .

