camssa:b54720b9-2282-4158-8d61-23e8779f2f92 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, XAdES is recommended by the European Union as an eSignature standard to ensure that electronic signatures can be created and validated anywhere in Europe. So, XAdES can be considered as an asset to build innovative solutions.\r
\r
eSignature standards:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eSignature+standards\r
\r
XAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/56025.html\r
\r
XAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101900_101999/101903/01.04.02_60/ts_101903v010402p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b3084081-b221-4184-8b5e-b4d7ba260ea5 .

