camssa:b5aeb2a0-c055-40cc-a94e-23e736cdee18 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Although PNG’s purpose is not to foster the visibility administrative data or services, PNG can help to enhance the visualization and visibility of public administrations by providing content more visible and easy to read. In fact, the specification helps to store and to make images readable for the visualization of data of a public administration.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bb43cf67-7c4b-444b-aa00-0d32bab9e2c0 .

