camssa:b63216e6-8690-49bd-b48b-092d08a7a8ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 432 is currently in its 1.2.1 version thus, major releases have been published. In addition, public documentation inside the specification has been published about its supporting process, specifically related to change history and issues regarding every version. Annex D of the specification is dedicated to change history while any release related to ETSI TS 119 432 has been published in the TC ESI domain. 

ETSI TS 119 432: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119400_119499/119432/01.02.01_60/ts_119432v010201p.pdf

ETSI Technical Committee ESI: https://www.etsi.org/committee/esi'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:11bfdce0-2268-44a7-a986-25281ed87d40 .

