camssa:b6484856-1883-4401-b628-fe4e2e6ae606 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ELI was developed in 2017 aiming to help and enhance interoperability across borders when exchanging legal documentation from the different Member States. It has been already implemented by many countries such as Austria, Belgium, Denmark and Finland, amongst others. \r
\r
Within ELI documentation some resources provide visibility on use cases or implementation from several actors.\r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
\r
ELI Testimonials: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/testimonials.ht\r
\r
ELI highlights:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/index.html\r
\r
ELI Implementation Overview: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/implementation.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b8fed772-0a35-4821-9701-bfa97c4ef6eb .

