camssa:b658e7dc-78d4-4f2d-ac69-93e872115587 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of this specification improves the interoperability and portability of data in cloud platforms, which can facilitate collaboration and interoperability among different government agencies and departments. This can lead to more streamlined and integrated public services, reducing redundancy and improving the overall citizen experience.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5eee22b9-8410-4ee0-8f94-4d0405f8722f .

