camssa:b6802cf7-7b50-46df-a263-00454ba8ecef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Semantic Interoperability Community (SEMIC) has established Working Groups. These Working Groups 
are open to the participation of everyone interested in semantic solution working for public administrations in 
the Member States or in EU institutions.

SEMIC working groups:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5a13586f-1f87-4eae-a069-235c02510dc7 .

camssa:b68076ce-ea81-4430-988d-fd3c6721f280 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI has authenticity mechanisms to access, publish and update the data. UDDI, using the AuthenticationMode property and the AutoGetAuthToken property, guarantee an authentication method based on a token system, to publish services in the registry.

Authenticating with a UDDI Server reference: 
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/desktop/aa966219(v=bts.10)

UddiConnection.AutoGetAuthToken Property reference:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/desktop/aa969012(v=bts.10)

UddiConnection.AuthenticationMode Property reference:
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/previous-versions/windows/desktop/aa969010(v=bts.10)'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e7836330-5cab-424d-a59a-e1b1af97b168 .

camssa:b6851fa4-20b6-4838-8f65-21aa189369b1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 432 is maintained by the European Telecommunications Standards Institute (ETSI), a European Standards Organization (ESO) that is recognised as the regional standards body dealing with telecommunications, broadcasting and other electronic communications networks and services.

ETSI TS 119 432: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119400_119499/119432/01.02.01_60/ts_119432v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28a8637f-04dc-4f5d-b5c0-9d0557b548e5 .

