camssa:b6b91cb7-5932-4a14-9368-c856239ce400 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of TOSCA is not related to the implementation of the once-only principle. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification. \r
\r
TOSCA reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fef26cb5-69a4-4e3b-9fe8-6face7722cc9 .

camssa:b6bafc8e-8513-488c-a1ba-ef1d029e20cc a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The application of the once-only principle in all EU Member States public administrations aims at reducing 
the administrative burden. This specification  provides a standardised approach for representing and publishing real-time event data on the web using Linked Data principles, fostering interoperability between public administrations, cross border services and impacts positively the development of eGovernment.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4c13bcfb-7a16-4d3f-ac0b-eaa51cfe58a4 .

camssa:b6bf131d-9bce-4f21-8c43-ca75e8f0c6b7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The DPV taxonomy and data model can be adapted to the business-specific needs, allowing for partial implementations depending on the requirements of any particular context where it is to be applied.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1ae09c9e-e7a7-4cce-9df3-1c3c6f0ff608 .

camssa:b6bf95ff-c4ce-4181-bf0d-7a47b3539b91 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAS takes into account essential safety aspects when it comes to the design of APIs.  Security in OAS is tackled with the "Security Requiremet Object" where security mechanisms are settled in order to authorise requests.\r
\r
OAS Security Requirements Object:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#security-requirement-object\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e652e5d9-55aa-42de-be1c-7114435a8f08 .

camssa:b6c2361c-2c25-4cf9-9f21-d87e88e8dd93 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SAMM is not related to the definition of a resusable data model. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf \r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
