        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of MIME is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4339cb80-a7d9-43b1-a118-b2d1a4bf5d36 .

