        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents is being used by the GDProv project, which is an OWL2 ontology for representing the provenance of consent & data lifecycles with a view towards GDPR compliance. \r
\r
W3C GDPRov WorkingGroup:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/dpvcg/wiki/GDPRov\r
\r
GDPRov ontology:\r
https://github.com/coolharsh55/GDPRov'"""@en ;
