        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SMP seems not to be related to long term preservation of electronic records. Moreover, no information has been found to answer positively or negatively to this criterion. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
