camssa:b7e2efb6-de01-4a4a-bf90-e90e86c81b84 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 19005-1:2005 (PDF/A-1) and ISO 19005-2:2011 (PDF/A-2) are not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html \r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1933b81-6116-4d1b-9745-27e16ad0d159 .

camssa:b7e8875a-1e5b-46a5-a6a0-19e2dbe4986f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP enables the modification or addition of directory entries. Thanks to the authentication methods and access restrictions for certain functions, data accuracy is guaranteed with LDAP.

LDAP IETF reference: 
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511

Geeksforgeeks reference:
https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/lightweight-directory-access-protocol-ldap/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d73b7c9b-6fbb-451b-9d85-1e4ecf7d9bb5 .

