        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification can allow customisation under certain circumstances. In section 7.1 it is indicated that OWL custom datatypes can also be used as well as common identifier types, which can be served as RDF datatypes.                                                                      \r
\r
DCAT (v2.0.0) reference:             \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/  '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:035da302-4161-4ecf-9245-8655708c7de2 .

