camssa:b83e10bc-00e3-4f6c-8abd-26044db55f1e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TIFF/IT is mainly used to store bitmap images that they will be intended to edit. TIFF/IT uses lossless compression, maintaining original quality while reducing in size. However, PSD extension is getting popular to store high quality images for later editing. It uses lossless compression as TIFF/IT and it is supported by any application.\r
\r
TIFF Image file explanation:\r
https://www.canto.com/blog/tiff-image-file/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6fc41e82-47cc-42ba-8f88-86b4ef8d1634 .

camssa:b8437201-4e89-497c-bda1-89c2e2b5768b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of CSS is to give format to web documents, including layout, colours and fonts. Therefore, it allows to improve the visualization so that the information is friendlier and its interpretation is easier.\r
An example of this is EUR-Lex, the cross border gateway to EU Law. It is using CSS to present the different documentation contained in EUR-Lex.\r
\r
Presentation style sheets EU Vocabulary:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/presentation-style-sheets\r
\r
EUR-Lex:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/homepage.html?locale=en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c92261fb-055b-4e0c-949c-4fd0af495384 .

camssa:b845b626-2fdc-44d3-8b98-10140e510748 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification has not been included in any initiative at European or National level covering privacy aspects. \r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07f098e8-c5ff-4ef5-b71a-4f2a8ea7a95d .

camssa:b84ba087-b80c-40ec-9484-d3ac3b9c48e3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ebXML specification can ensure the protection of personal data by establishing mechanisms such as encryption, using XML Encryption. As described in the Oracle document about security features, by using these mechanisms, public administrations can share information among themselves, ensuring that the information cannot be changed and is secured against possible attacks.

ebXML security:
https://www.oracle.com/technical-resources/articles/enterprise-architecture/ebxml-security1.html

XML Encryption:
https://www.w3.org/Encryption/2001/

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:038988f9-3ca3-491b-bf8e-ee93510fe29c .

camssa:b84cb70c-d0ec-4fe6-80d3-94a7dabcbffd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The standard or specification is included in 3 national catalogues. They belong to Member States which comply with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the EIF according to the NIFO factsheets (e.g. the Netherlands, Spain and Sweden)\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f9aca974-4f79-4345-ae0d-f3c6eb947f46 .

camssa:b851f7ed-c25f-4113-96f1-175dbe54a16d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'FTP is a protocol exclusively designed for the transfer of files which does not secure the traffic.\r
\r
However, there are existing extensions of FTP that secure the information delivery. For instance, FTP over TLS, known as FTPS, uses the Transport Layer Security (TLS) to secure FTP communications over a network.\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959\r
\r
Securing FTP with TLS Reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4217'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65a44ef4-d7c5-41b7-a97c-5baba6b498f2 .

camssa:b8598a79-e280-4da1-8ac2-56f4485356a0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cd828c0ec9887027bdb6b981560bde593cda27c080298ab36323ba5441ba4c31 ;
    cav:value "100" .

