        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CLV can be found for free along within the European Collaborative Platform, Joinup.\r
\r
CLV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-location-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc632640-8d0d-4820-ab52-44b5177adb05 .

