        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is not related to the publication of public data as Open Data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

TSP Specification: 
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161     '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97970e92-5d25-4482-bcdf-610887d2f0a5 .

camssa:b93384f3-b7e7-4c3b-8e8b-470914ecf635 a cav:Score,
