        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents is designed to be platform-agnostic, allowing organizations and developers to implement and utilize PROV concepts on various platforms without being restricted to a specific technology or operating system.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07575b6a-4572-432b-b473-bbd577a9276f .

camssa:b943ad4e-cac3-4625-af80-6cc22c89ce75 a cav:Score,
