    cav:value "40" .

camssa:b95c9382-1ec0-48f8-b7ad-2b4e09a34a55 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Registered Organization Vocabulary was developed by and published by the European Commission ISA Programme with support from the Directorate General Internal Market and Services (DG MARKT). Contributors included representatives of Member States of the European Union, operators of national repositories, standardisation bodies and independent experts whose work was published in May 2012.

According to recent discussions on the Core Business Vocabulary GitHub, W3C has discontinued the Registered Organization Vocabulary and the community along with the continuation for the development moved to the Core Business Vocabulary. Currently, it is being used in Open Standards for Linking Organizations (OSLO), but it will be migrated to the Core Business Vocabulary in the near future.

Registered Organization Vocabulary specification reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

Directorate General Internal Market and Services (DG MARKT) reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/about/departments-and-executive-agencies/internal-market-industry-entrepreneurship-and-smes_en

Core Business Vocabulary Github reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/tree/master

Core Business Vocabulary Github Issue 51 - RegOrg maintenance reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/issues/51

RegOrg used in OSLO reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/issues/27'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b6c4d963-7432-4f7d-8f9d-15a65c5a765b .

camssa:b96531a7-654d-4acb-9d80-f9d66650f380 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of the specifications is not related to the visibility of administrative information, data or services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eea77e27-80a0-46ef-9100-74205df45c18 .

camssa:b9661e74-4406-4f59-8e49-acb77fb46cdd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although some APIs are designed for the long-term preservation of data and information, no specific provisions are stated in OAS.  \r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification\r
\r
OAS in Github:\r
https://github.com/OAI/OpenAPI-Specification/#participation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:83b08d7a-316e-4a06-9028-cb5d1ff284a7 .

camssa:b96646ba-cdd5-4250-9ccf-9c69f16a49cf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"As a key enabler for the data exchange and interchange between administrations and stakeholders, JSON enhances the communication and information exchange across borders between public administrations. \r
\r
The flexibility of JSON's hierarchical structure allows for implicit reuse by organizing related information within nested objects. Developers can design their JSON structures to facilitate reuse or referencing based on the specific requirements of their applications or systems.\r
\r
JSON specification:\r
https://www.ecma-international.org/wp-content/uploads/ECMA-404_2nd_edition_december_2017.pdf\r
\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:da90efe8-8c88-4fa6-a7c7-27334fe99dd3 .

camssa:b96fb346-fed8-4478-8307-80450908199f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is done in itself to validate the conformity of the data. Therefore, it is not necessary any external testing platform to allow testing of implementations.

DQV reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b5bb229a-1a16-45c1-82eb-242b0f7e5706 .

