camssa:b9966a9d-7c16-474d-bcd9-aef52fd3a735 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 15948:2004 (PNG) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html\r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:81b29ecd-ae05-46f0-93ce-df1943901130 .

camssa:b996cb79-cb4d-4ef9-bb1d-7899bab532ab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTP includes features that promote information reuse, through caching and conditional requests. However, the specification also highlights limitations and scenarios where reuse is restricted or requires careful handling. For example, when requests involve authentication or shared caches, those accessible to multiple users, are generally prevented from reusing responses unless specific conditions are met.

HTTP /1.1 RFC 2616 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2616.html

HTTP/1.1 Caching, RFC 9111 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9111
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:566a56e6-c992-4730-8e84-e4bcb137ce8c .

camssa:b9986b6d-7d43-4ebc-9fad-a83381b07fd5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a60f86e868fe2bdcf0c5c47111455d1d5b59498172688e36f23a77baa347d916 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:b9a1f156-75b4-4a55-af9f-4533be7000f6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The RDA specifications address and will facilitate interoperability between public administrations and repositories, public and private providers. The 4 specifications listed here as well as the others in the evaluation process are all components necessary and essential for data sharing, access, re-use, preservation, citation, etc. All of them contribute to data interoperability in the new digital economy irrespective of the organisation who implements / uses them.\r
\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:018c0ebe-cfd2-4eca-872c-e2ab5cc50b68 .

camssa:b9af0d0c-99a6-4b2b-874b-a2bc6efd3ba3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:b9b08c9c-946a-4992-893a-8d2598a653af a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:b9b316f8-e131-40c2-bb31-d964e8147f52 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES does not define a cross-sector reusable data model, but defines an electronic signature format using PDF. \r
\r
PAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/67937.html\r
\r
PAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ba97ca5f-fca0-459d-9495-9c0f56eabe12 .

camssa:b9bef65b-eb96-41a3-8c87-57870d7329be a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ODF does not define a cross-sector reusable data model, but it defines an open source file format. \r
\r
ODF ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/66363.html\r
\r
ODF OASIS reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=office"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:82a71d47-ff2c-4a9f-888b-b14581760357 .

camssa:b9bf9390-8bd2-48c8-ad64-cea349643471 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "100" .

