        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-andspecifications-camss/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
