        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """eDelivery SMP 1.10 is not included in the catalogue of recommended standards of Member States that have a National Interoperability Framework fully aligned with the EIF. \r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets"""@en ;
