camssa:baf0d245-3df8-4536-b29e-abbed562d85c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The main purpose of the Registered Organisation Vocabulary, as well as the Core Business Vocabulary, is to support Public Administrations in the creation of interoperable solutions. So, the specification fosters the development of innovative solutions supporting the Digital Single Market. \r
\r
RegOrg Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/registered-organization-vocabulary\r
\r
Core Business Vocabulary reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-business-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b9cc594f-db21-4d76-9f43-a80fd7a416b7 .

