camssa:baf8cd7c-afbf-440c-b611-9850dc66816d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DPV provides a data model of concepts that act as a vocabulary for the interoperable representation and exchange of information about personal data and its processing. It can help to facilitate interoperability agreements when it comes to applying privacy-friendly policies, as it represents concepts associated with privacy and data protection, primarily derived from GDPR.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6627ec6a-1a6e-4966-8a27-10714ec1c67f .

camssa:baf938fb-549d-46e9-a370-39a3b393a1ef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the time of elaborating this assessment, this specification is not included in any EIRA ABB in the last version of the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). However, it has been associated to "Organisational Agreeement" of the Organisational view for the on-going version that is going to be published in May 2021. \r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications v1.0.1 (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v101-0"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:284aeebb-58fb-473b-9df7-0968b1f544e9 .

