camssa:bb07f195-4f4c-450e-8b65-5f13fb8dda0f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "No evidences have been found of the specification being included in a formal interoperability agreement between organisations involved in the European public services provision. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:053d7cc2-7757-4e64-abad-4de6019a903e .

camssa:bb0aa0b9-4e97-4f82-823a-d517bf2252a6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Open API Initiative’s charter created, “an open source, Technical Developer Community (TDC), open to any participant, whether an OAI Member or not. ” The TDC is responsible for overseeing the evolution of the OpenAPI Specification, and for offering suggestions on how to improve it.  \r
\r
OpenAPI participation:\r
https://www.openapis.org/news/blogs/2016/07/you-can-get-involved-creating-openapi-specification-and-heres-how\r
\r
OAS specification:\r
https://spec.openapis.org/oas/latest.html#openapi-specification'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1ae467f-17ce-4130-bbf9-eaa1c96f2563 .

camssa:bb0ded26-3778-4fd8-87ea-5584272271b8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of FTP is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification"@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a4b9a157-90ff-4cbd-9616-13580484819d .

camssa:bb0e05c8-6291-4ccc-847f-40d2cb679ab4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification supports Tim Berners 5-star deployment scheme for Open data since:
1) BFO enables the publication of data on the web under an open licence (owl),
2) BFO makes data available in estructured way (owl),
3) BFO can be used to serialised data in an open format, such as TTL,
4) BFO relies on URIs to denote things,
5) BFO enables linking data in the context of other ontologies

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html

Tim Berners 5-star deployment scheme for Open data:
https://5stardata.info/en/# 
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9784a0ea-084a-4f91-ab6e-9f0b9a1b5895 .

camssa:bb158eff-94b5-4e7d-9297-37a63f0d1d03 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DAPS is not involved in enabling the secure processing of data.\r
\r
DAPS: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/tree/main/Components/IdentityProvider/DAPS'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bc2606d7-c0df-4f58-829d-5344547b4a71 .

camssa:bb15a226-3e7c-41eb-96de-0fcc9753a29e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WSDL has been selected within several cross-border initiatives with the purpose of confirming the description of the services provided in order to enhance the retrieval and support the reuse of the web service by any interested part. \r
\r
An example of a project involving WSDL is the SELIS project. This initiative is focused on eInvocing and its smooth integration within existing accounting software. Moreover, it is included within the framework of the European Digital Single Market and the OOP initiative. \r
\r
Secure Electronic Invoicing Service: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eprocurement/document/secure-electronic-invoicing-service-selis'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9ddbe29d-7946-420e-a769-e9ee679c09e2 .

camssa:bb198f66-804b-449b-8415-f338af82548b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PDF is included in 3 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to the Netherlands, Spain, and Estonia. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of these Member States is fully aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9e0aa879-afab-4ccd-ae0e-bf617f125150 .

camssa:bb1a085a-181b-4672-aa03-b6cbf64ced7d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-549e39fc635763b9466e09688714b2908fcf7a349d4f4f0fe2a761bd6f502733 ;
