camssa:bb1b25be-323d-4bc1-abbf-6a90df573ea5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Nowadays, SOAP 1.2 is a de-facto messaging protocol for exchanging information in a structured way, and invoke web services SOAP-based. It is used in a wide variety of solutions, while REST is widely used as well, SOAP remains as one of the main protocol to implement SOAs, and this fact includes innovative solutions. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:66f32532-8949-41ba-892e-e678fc37a27a .

camssa:bb1d7930-d33d-4915-82bb-b0770f1e3b74 a cav:Score,
