camssa:bb29cb2a-358c-4fca-967a-af55bfd92c01 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The LegalRuleML is XML base, which allows the estructuration of legal documents data and its exchange between systems. This can also be used for instance, to translate the content to other languages in the European Union. Then the collaboration between Member States can be improved using the method for the alignment of legal frameworks. \r
\r
LegalRuleML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/legalruleml-core-spec/v1.0/legalruleml-core-spec-v1.0.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0ef939e4-e3c0-41d5-8ec1-534a7adf1671 .

camssa:bb2cbca0-8917-4c6d-9a3f-0005872f1e1c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:bb2e4166-e03f-4db3-82f4-658982ba0e0b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """FTPS is an extension of FTP that can be easily scaled if 4 principles are taken into account. These principles are explained in the following article.\r
\r
Highly Scalable FTP Site:\r
https://www.ftptoday.com/blog/4-critical-features-of-a-highly-scalable-ftp-site"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8dffe968-91b3-4a73-916f-9827c01adfeb .

camssa:bb357e46-28fa-4370-9291-0fa006d9c136 a cav:Score,
