camssa:bbb7fe54-b5e5-4328-bc94-e31151773130 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS 1.3 brings major improvements over its previous version, making it faster and more secure. One major change is the removal of older, less secure cryptographic algorithms like RC4 and SHA-1 and ciphers, ensuring only modern, robust encryption methods are used.

TLS 1.3 Cryptographic Negotiation Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html#section-4.1.1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:74cb17e3-4e53-417b-ab15-f8337cb83709 .

