        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PDF is document format highly adopted by organisations and administrations in order to make available their information. Almost all the European platforms share the results of studies and communications in PDF format. \r
\r
An example is the Once-Only principle initiative that provides the new steps and reports by means of PDF documents among others. \r
\r
See: \r
http://toop.eu/deliverables\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edfbce50-555a-439a-b176-11b0423db253 .

