    cav:judgement "HTTPS allows the access to websites providing information on administrative rules, procedures and services."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7c03b98c-a1ad-414d-880d-4263b7f51f82 .

camssa:bbd00da6-3e3e-4f8c-917d-d91fd8be1cd8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is currently a living document that evolves through its use. The current version is v0.4.0. It has already been implemented at the national level in Italy, serving as the basis for the creation of a national software catalogue. Furthermore, the specification is not only implemented in Italy; it is mandatory for all software developed in the country to comply with it.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html

Italian National Software Catalogue:
https://developers.italia.it/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42f691db-6c01-404a-967a-944b47f3404c .

