camssa:bbdd05c0-feb4-4939-be17-3da41549261e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As one of the main markup languages for encode web resources, HTML5 is involved in the data exchange. HTML5 files are largely used to exchange information through the web."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0751b269-5249-43fc-92cc-5312d76e7013 .

camssa:bbdf9c3d-33cf-4132-9e67-dc12545fe0b6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'No evidence of direct implementation of DPV in any particular business domain could be found, although use cases can be found in which the DPV vocabulary is intended to be applied, such as online shopping.\r
\r
Data Protection Aspects of Online Shopping - A use case:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/dpvcg/2019/12/12/data-protection-aspects-of-online-shopping-a-use-case/\r
\r
DPV specification: \r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/dpv/\r
\r
DPV primer document:\r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f0e41b2a-a26f-496c-bfcd-900249341c01 .

camssa:bbe3336b-0d8e-4846-9b0c-0461a1dca8d8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 is a sector agnostic specification which means that can be used in any business domain requiring data encoding. \r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:09cc3b73-b2b2-44c6-b9c8-ed3f01b57c3d .

camssa:bbe379c6-0242-47e3-8d4f-422820e2561e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox fosters the secure and trustworthy access to personal between citizens, businesses and public administrations by proposing methods to ensure that any system and solution developing a public services under the EU law include security regarding data access between the parties involved. In this sens, the Tool 3 provides the stakeholders with some solutions in regards the transmission of confidential information (in this case to a third body, the regulatory board).

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5b21803c-c445-4d86-a86e-6909083bfe8d .

camssa:bbe440b5-3393-4bf0-9caf-50f622d6246e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification being assessed is a sector agnostic specification that is able to be reused when structured data needs to be exchanged. Additionally, CSV is designed to enable you to reuse the same schema when publishing multiple CSV files, even if those files are created by different organisations and therefore reside in different places.                                          \r
\r
CSV reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:651eae6c-c32b-40ee-9bcc-6ac3e579ee1c .

camssa:bbe9c893-904c-4c48-ba9c-00aea60cfa68 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XACML specification contributes to the exposure and management of interfaces for accessing public administration services by enabling a common policy interface across different and diverse systems and devices.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9b532837-82ea-49a6-8bcb-c85799a8c744 .

camssa:bbeb5e5d-f7ca-4efc-8430-2342d1bc4009 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d129862d6c9639e131c7d5eef095af16ef94d57ec0d52f955bf909ba8ec688e8 ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:bbeeb456-1e0e-4e03-b5ec-761ca5d56b2b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "TLS is the de-facto open standard for securing internet traffic. It is therefore very important that it is used safely. TLS is used for client-server links and server-server links. Large-scale personal information is exchanged by government parties through these last links. When parties work on (too) old versions of TLS, vulnerable situations arise for the secure exchange of data.  "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:93b97b1f-7dc6-44f9-ba62-e7ee9837969b .

