camssa:bc0a771a-cd22-4d88-bcca-716bca12aff8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV Implementation Report describes how to extend PROV specifications by reusing elements of other vocabularies, as defined in the list of reported implementations, thus enabling organizations or systems to extend the core PROV specifications with additional concepts, relationships, attributes, or constraints to accommodate specific requirements or domain-specific needs. Such is the case of PROV-SAID (Procenance of Social Media Information Diffussion) which enables the modelling of provenance of information diffusion in the context of social media.\r
\r
PROV-SAID:\r
http://semweb.mmlab.be/ns/prov-said/\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV list of reported implementations:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/NOTE-prov-implementations-20130430/#implementations\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5aa54a64-dc53-4b54-97a6-c3ff89e00b70 .

