        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, CCCEV can define the interoperability aspects of the "Core Data Model" and "Data" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d1419135-8585-4f22-ae3c-9efc0c8d0887 .

camssa:bc61aa95-8a5d-4851-9116-733e0574b607 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 9 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Some examples of Member States including JSON on their catalogues are the Netherlands, Spain or Belgium.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ac618c75-cf6d-4970-aae2-99fa17027f3d .

