    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the ESPD is not related to the secure processing of data.  Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
ESPD business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31e83bc4-9c62-439c-8819-f4fcb89553c2 .

