camssa:bd272f04-98d1-4dc5-8a1b-d4d7901c6a6b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The use of UTF-8 encoding can help to simplify the delivery of public services by supporting multiple languages and scripts, streamlining data processing and exchange, and facilitating integration with international standards and systems\r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629"'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:12dd4789-b62e-40e4-b1cc-bc7705aa3bcb .

camssa:bd28b765-3358-4b24-aca1-c34bc9a755d1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is one of the main markup languages to develop web resources. XHTML is aligned with 3 out of 5 levels of maturity of Tim Berners-Lee's 5-star, it makes data available on the Web, it publishes the data in a structured way and it makes data available in a non-proprietary open format. So, the specification is highly aligned with the different levels of maturity of Tim Berners-Lee's 5-star schema for Open Data.\r
\r
XHTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3ac9fe4c-200e-498f-b9a9-aa8cfb9f3da7 .

camssa:bd2f8810-2376-424c-b886-2cbba0636313 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Yes, the specification is  included as part of the solutions and specification in Joinup's collection.                                        \r
\r
Joinup collection reference:                           \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/support-centre/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/release/100\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c9f56999-f430-47ff-9bbe-d36dd494f1fe .

camssa:bd309917-d10e-4f81-b21e-1e00e8fcb760 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are several case studies regarding the deployment of IPv6 in Mexico, Greece, USA.\r
\r
See: \r
https://www.internetsociety.org/deploy360/ipv6/case-studies/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9493deb6-9685-4d74-8c00-a2bc2b9884d5 .

camssa:bd310247-311e-4098-b6a5-ae2cca6a1792 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-6d48464387e608d3022bd07338cd3859acfb0f84139186a979ef3b96baa51086 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:bd37f75f-8901-41e0-8419-6dd43586702a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is specific section in the specification regarding conformance called "Best Practices", which mentions that they are created and published by the International Data Spaces Association and are not considered to be normative. The specification of the Dataspace Protocol itself is normative. Furthermore, IDSA has an interoperability compliance test for technical components to achieve large-scale adoption.

Dataspace Protocol Best Practices: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/ids-specification/tree/main/best.practices

IDSA Reference TestBed: https://internationaldataspaces.org/offers/reference-testbed/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07d94831-ec03-4e0a-8f32-d7ec2e8483ea .

camssa:bd38ecf5-0cc2-4b2e-b528-7b1db8da12e6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a0101cb11c30c1bbf94adb74479472f2a40c53ccc4b442180fece91506c20a9d ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:bd393397-2c9f-4524-bd24-f532129ad210 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:bd3d2719-fa40-41c7-8dfd-6e83e152b11b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "ASiC Baseline Profile does not define a cross-sector reusable data model. The specification is defining the basic set of requirements for the container formats in the context of AdES. In this requirements are included the three levels of conformance that have to be supported in order to validate electronic signatures. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15d2b6da-1fc9-421e-92dd-d6a94b138b78 .

camssa:bd442714-9477-4659-9430-532fcede8243 a cav:Score,
