    cav:judgement """The purpose of this Core Vocabulary is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b3c1fc9f-6334-4f92-bfd6-2bd30d05c17c .

