camssa:beca4d91-38ea-4d2b-8ee2-0919c4b30bf5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GITB provides a framework for conformance and interoperability testing. The test bed increases the efficiency and reliability of interoperable implementation of standards as well as it assures unbiased and objective nature of the standards implementation assessment process. In this regard, there are solutions that include GITB TDL in its implementation procesess, that is  the case of eDelivery and the European Single Procurement Document (ESPD) between others.\r
\r
JOINUP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/interoperability-test-bed-repository/solution/interoperability-test-bed/detailed-information#capabilities\r
\r
GITB document:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/_downloads/0dc573d06adafa1a273edd793577016d/CEN_WS_GITB3_CWA_Final.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1d2f0fb0-8bc5-4f12-bd98-a34cbf4c6ce3 .

camssa:becfd42b-e8f3-4ec8-82d9-50409a0a1ef4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:bed2d756-f48c-4e9a-a296-9caca65828ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAREF is designed to capture the semantics of smart appliances and their functionalities, focusing on interoperability and data exchange within the IoT ecosystem. Therefore, comprehensibility of administrative procedures, rules data, and services are not explicitly within the primary scope of SAREF.

SAREF: 
https://saref.etsi.org/core/v3.1.1/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0baa9922-4771-4606-970d-792253d156ca .

camssa:bed52174-bdf8-4eeb-9942-cd3bb4a72071 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Yes, the specification can provide means for the restriction of access to information/data, although it is not the primary focus of the schema itself. AKN4EU is primarily designed for structuring and representing legislative documents in a standardized format.\r
\r
AKN4EU reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:caa6bac9-8ca0-4fe7-9fac-a34b3ed7f996 .

camssa:bed98f7b-5a14-4ebe-baa2-e70353e45bd5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"DQV allows to publish, exchange and consume quality metadata, for every step of a dataset's lifecycle.  Therefore, the possibility to publish and exchange quality metadata, encourages the implementation of digital services, supporting the principle of digital-first.

DQV reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f12863a4-b792-4388-9532-4fff0ddc9411 .

