        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PDF/A is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, PDF/A can define the interoperability aspects of the "e-Archiving Component" and "e-Archiving Service" ABBs of the EIRA Technical Infrastructure View.\r
\r
