camssa:bef9a29d-a110-4653-920e-9260b7c85d47 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is independent of any software, hardware, or operating system. So it can be said that Core Criterion and Core Evidence Vocabulary is independent of any specific technology or platform.\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
