camssa:bf3a6fc6-faf2-4dbc-bcbd-8e305234433e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Indexed Database API specification indirectly supports interoperability agreements by providing a standardised method for client-side data storage across different web applications and platforms. While it does not directly address inter-organisational data exchange, it helps ensure that web apps across different organisations can store and access structured data consistently.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8c9d575d-cdd2-4a71-9cd2-e7ae75718933 .

