camssa:bf4cd61f-5e11-4729-b509-aa349b6955c7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Every International Standard published by ISO alone, or jointly with the IEC, is subject to a systematic review in order to determine whether it should be confirmed, revised/amended, converted to another form of deliverable, or withdrawn. Moreover, the specification has not been reviwed yet, and it is not a Publicly Available Standard (PAS).

ISO public review guide:
https://www.iso.org/files/live/sites/isoorg/files/store/en/PUB100413.pdf

ebXML RegRep OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/regrep/regrep-core/v4.0/os/regrep-core-overview-v4.0-os.html

ebXML RegRep ISO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/83479.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f001df7a-1b52-4dec-b587-443094a11658 .

