camssa:bfaf2cf7-92a6-42b9-96cb-57820049281d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Dataspace Protocol is mentioned as one of the bulding blocks that exist in the Data Space Support Centre. The technical building blocks provide a view on the capabilities needed in a data space and provide specifications and references to standards which can assist in their implementation. In this case, the specification is part of the process model of the Control Plane.

DSSC Control plane vs. Data plane: https://dssc.eu/space/BBE/178422298/Control+plane+vs.+Data+plane'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07f04f6c-ad9a-41ec-b246-da07d723ce91 .

