camssa:bfb90dc8-c0fa-4ab2-b070-be3a8b08d213 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPsec is not related to comprehensibly administrative procedures, rules data, and services. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bd49d636-9b05-455c-a6c8-226c3390183f .

camssa:bfba7709-b502-41b7-8ef5-54285327b1bd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Although SMTP is widely used in the context of e-mail services, having enough maturity and market acceptance for the development of products and services, no evidence has been found that SMTP contributes to the creation of innovative solutions. Despite the findings on many implementations using SMTP, it is not possible to determine the implication of the specification on the creation of innovative solutions."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:89d9648e-ed7f-41f9-9f18-8b0c74d7d7b3 .

camssa:bfbaa989-6b05-49c7-87ee-c058f7aa15dd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of TLS 1.3 is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to the specification.

TLS 1.3 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8446.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9a29093c-09c6-430c-8c9d-718da2f30322 .

camssa:bfbf8fe3-6cf0-44e0-b2d6-6fe7077bca85 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:bfcccdeb-cd3e-47b2-acf8-06efb2a588f5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While SAREF itself is not explicitly designed for data portability, it contributes to broader interoperability goals within the IoT domain as it provides a common formal language for smart appliances. Standardising and structuring IoT data enables an easier and more efficient data portability across different systems and domains in the IoT ecosystem.

SAREF: 
https://saref.etsi.org/core/v3.1.1/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f33c2e32-7cd1-4ec6-91df-b7aa810e4d17 .

camssa:bfcd9bf8-b70f-4ce6-a9db-ddd53e9f7e93 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:bfd2d5e4-2fca-46bd-a484-88851e416837 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI is a European standards development organisation, and as such, all the specifications developed within the organisation are available and can be accessed through its website repository.

ETSI standards repository:
https://www.etsi.org/standards#page=1&search=ETSI%20TS%20319%20422&title=1&etsiNumber=1&content=1&version=0&onApproval=1&published=1&withdrawn=1&historical=1&isCurrent=1&superseded=1&startDate=1988-01-15&endDate=2022-07-25&harmonized=0&keyword=&TB=&stdType=&frequency=&mandate=&collection=&sort=1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d4d24003-35cd-4071-97f5-50a3d3c2146c .

