camssa:c05b4497-1047-4a66-b677-33fb0c54ec92 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "XSD 1.1 is an open specification that can be used independently from other technologies or platforms. However, XSD 1.1 is defining datatypes which depend on definitions in XML and Namespaces in XML. This fact is not hampering the adoption of XSD as XML is worldwide adopted. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9bc137a6-7e46-447a-9761-6a40911f8c51 .

