        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Indexed Database API has been published and is maintained by the World Wide Web Consortium (W3C). Additionally, a GitHub repository exists where contributors can raise issues, providing a platform for community engagement around the specification.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/

Indexed Database API github:
https://github.com/w3c/IndexedDB'"""@en ;
