camssa:c0bb98d5-4fce-4755-9cb6-f0b5cfac2553 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As a specification used to encode a wide range of resources, it eases the codification of interfaces ensuring its availability, therefore, UTF-8 helps to ensure the availability of internal information systems from public administrations."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42de21ce-0521-4f12-bf84-e64e049e98b4 .

camssa:c0c39306-9653-4532-a31f-ccb52e102424 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The main purpose of CPOV is to provide a reusable data model for describing public organisations in the European Union. The CPOV helps to identify where responsibilities and functions are duplicated or overlapped. So, it helps to comprehend the administrative rules and data of public administration.\r
\r
CPOV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:922dea51-c58b-4b37-b963-5c0ec36b8d3a .

