        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SAML 2.0 specification provides the mechanisms that can enable digital service delivery channels, especially in scenarios requiring identity verification, single sign-on, and access control.\r
\r
SAML 2.0 Reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/security/saml/Post2.0/sstc-saml-tech-overview-2.0.html'"""@en ;
