camssa:c0e3313d-0108-4f49-b779-c8574b647b02 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ELI can help the availability of administrations data in machine-readable format ensuring its reuse and exchange, however, ELI does not help the availability of interfaces with this internal information. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7e0cf065-cec3-4185-b44c-809bf0c9d8bf .

camssa:c0edb81f-a33b-4c46-a4e6-fdc0fc566b24 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"NUTS facilitates organisational interoperability agreements as some of its elements are mappable to other EU Vocabularies elements through the European Legislation Identifier (ELI). However, provisions easing the drafting of such agreements are provided in auxiliary documentation (see ISA Programme-Joinup reference, 'Revise the NUTS RDF model' document).\r
\r
ISA Programme-Joinup reference, 'Revise the NUTS RDF model' document:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/document/supporting-implementation-persistent-uri-policy-eu-institutions\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c145ec81-6ef5-46ba-b452-b7ee94b229da .

camssa:c0efdd07-9906-453d-b1eb-cf56ff392a2e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:c0f669a5-fb5c-4f68-9d18-e9fe0efedd4a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are several studies assessing SOAP 1.2 performance and features in terms of efficiency and effectiveness. As REST and SOAP-based web services are living together nowadays, one of the topics is the performance comparison. Moreover, the comparison between different SOAP toolkits is an exploited topic. \r
\r
Performance and Usage Between REST and SOAP Reference: \r
https://aaltodoc.aalto.fi/bitstream/handle/123456789/29224/master_Makkonen_Joni_2017.pdf?sequence=1&isAllowed=y \r
\r
SOAP Toolkits Assessment Reference:\r
https://dl.acm.org/citation.cfm?id=1033266'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de61877b-ecf2-4c04-b8b2-bda55d8b451e .

camssa:c10238ee-efa7-47f0-8a9d-1d957fed9c77 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "20" .

