camssa:c17d9b60-0d4f-46db-9781-a79788f37d01 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Data protection encompasses data confidentiality, integrity and access control. NFVI proposes specific provisions based on other specifications. These provisions depends on each use case. Some of these data protection techniques are Transport Layer Security (TLS), Internet Protocol Security (IPSec) or Secure Shell (SSH).\r
\r
NFVI Deliver, Infrastructure Overview section 6.7:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/NFV-INF/001_099/001/01.01.01_60/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:82dd18d6-c95a-4535-873d-63017bd5f580 .

