        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TLS is included in the national catalogues of standards of at least two Member States, France and the Netherlands, out of the eight that have recommended it. These eight countries are Cyprus, France, Germany, Greece, Malta, the Netherlands, Norway, and Spain.

