camssa:c1b32db3-643e-4010-9fa4-db19b6f9b712 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As stated in the specification home page and in Joinup, the application is under development and has not reached a major release v2.0. Nonetheless, the new version of the specification (v1.1) is available since 2017 and it has overcome the existing issues from its first delivery (v1.0) in 2014, and a draft version of the following release (v1.2) is also available from December 2021.\r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/\r
\r
WAI-ARIA roadmap reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/roadmap\r
\r
Joinup WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/w3c-standards-and-technical-reports/solution/using-wai-aria-html/about'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fdfe85df-b74e-40ca-99f7-5c32ba690b39 .

