camssa:c1d43a7c-1daa-4f8a-8ddc-4fffa04252eb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification encompasses a set of requirements, recommendations and principles that need to be taken into account when planning, developing and also when implementing public policies. Within this set of principles defined within the different tools, the Better Regulation Process includes ICT aspects that also take into account interface issues (regarding end-user interfaces but also institutions access to interfaces).\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:30574f7b-11ec-46bb-b25f-ab864ff1f1c7 .

camssa:c1d4c7d4-c99d-4a24-bf39-f4ce34735820 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b37687b8bb3dbd4c6f96969358cf5d70900d1ccd01402cea7668da6303bec4b4 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:c1dcbdae-34a1-43c1-b8e6-9c5cc82bb478 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-73a8058bec757a2fdb0f8513c2f11841e982cbef76c3be82af67707c294da8b8 ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:c1dccb91-8523-4876-bed1-4c04afbe99ce a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After searching in different catalogues, there is no evidence found of ETSI TS 119 612 being included in the catalogue of any Member State.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 612 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:63cc38a4-fd4e-40ad-8550-05371908227e .

camssa:c1dd5ea3-c89f-44fe-88e6-7704ee9a963a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG is a raster-graphics file format that supports lossless data compression. It was first designed for transferring images on the Internet in spite of not being the smallest size image format. Most websites use PNG image to publish their data. However, it is not enough to consider PNG as an asset to facilitate the publication of open data. The specification only complies with the first level of maturity of Tom Berners-Lee's 5-star schema for Open data.\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/es/\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:45e46a99-cb8f-4c41-ad5d-21de72d47988 .

camssa:c1de63b4-4c92-4ac9-ac95-6caeded259cd a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d83a73b3287a82d85b1bd3f5b18089e9794b091b6c6457992a77d5be6bc1500a ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:c1e1784d-f4c2-48ba-9ce2-5ba32f5bf083 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "RDF was carried out initially in 1997 by the W3C working group that included representation from several companies with an important market share (e.g. IBM, Microsoft, Netscape, Nokia). RDF has been widely adopted and developed by means of W3C working groups that have worked on the continuous improvement and consolidation of the specification. RDF has strong support as a tool for publishing data as Linked Open Data. This support comes from public administrations but also for companies with relevant market share. This fact demonstrates the maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f46743c4-2091-4461-866b-8a13628fb3ab .

camssa:c1eafdee-7692-49ea-95ad-556c206f2698 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-53abe85b1365f86aa58a25566e54e082ea2d70ee8d9fbaf09ccab20af30f3332 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:c1f0a7e1-387e-4ae5-b3f2-3e0b303e6142 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The purpose of HTTP Cookies is to enable web servers to store stateful information on the user's device or to track the user's browsing activity on a given website. Therefore this criterion is not apicable to this specification.\r
\r
HTTP Cookies reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc6265\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9b225f91-842b-4cd7-9eb2-4dffea6dc98e .

camssa:c1f3bdf4-6727-41a8-b964-da8435fa4551 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is to facilitate the exchange of structured event data. By allowing to make the data available to other persons or organisations, this specification reduces the administrative burden.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:677d5ed5-810a-448a-9127-3853e142daca .

camssa:c1f4f7ad-e4c8-4a5f-bf9d-c8d08e342c45 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard, including a public review.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a6ebc5ce-9b40-4a6a-8d9f-f7bfbeb7da45 .

camssa:c1f84837-77d9-45f3-8d6b-ab0fcfffe510 a cav:Score,
