camssa:c22fd139-f016-4749-bd4e-dbed7bb09f80 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While syslog itself does not have direct features related to e-accessibility, the way syslog is implemented and integrated within systems can have implications for accessibility considerations. For instance, log content accessibility can be improved through this specification. The content of syslog messages can be crafted in a way that is accessible to individuals with disabilities.

Syslog Protocol: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:04e5ebf6-0aad-48b8-aee5-ae22f9da83b2 .

