camssa:c24c0f3c-85a9-4395-a6e1-8536ac28e079 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to section 4.4 of the documentation, ETSI TS 119 511 provides an interface between users and\r
preservation services, however, specific provision are fully achieved if it is combined with its companion\r
documents ETS TS 119 511 therefore, enabling the visibility of administrative procedures, rules and services\r
if combined with other specifications.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf\r
\r
TR-ESOR Preservation of Evidence of Cryptographically Signed Document:\r
https://www.bsi.bund.de/EN/Service-Navi/Publications/TechnicalGuidelines/TR03125\r
/TechnicalGuidelines_03125_node.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b78f55d9-7462-4acb-a9f8-1e14b9b31a29 .

camssa:c24d1855-ff6e-4a86-b0a7-cd19e120d85e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of XAdES is not related  to the long-term preservation of electronic records and other kinds of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8996072a-b790-48ba-8c8b-1ed91d2c047a .

camssa:c2556fe7-dfd1-470c-8f55-4f848170835f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the data transfer is controlled by the Transfer Process Protocol mentioned above, the data transfer itself and especially the handling of technical exceptions is an obligation to the Transport Protocol. This specification does not cover the data transfer process as such.

IDSA Dataspace Protocol: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2ed7b3c4-8d73-4023-853c-f31299ff0a0f .

camssa:c25e7dcd-9775-4415-9d47-01057e64fdb2 a cav:Score,
