camssa:c264153a-ef5c-4318-8bdc-37419a65295f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of XHTML is to publish administrative data on the web. As one of the main languages used in
web development, XHTML helps and fosters the visibility of administration data and services. Moreover, it
also eases the decision-making process by ensuring the data exchange and data reuse among
stakeholders.

XHTML W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2d600bb2-946d-4277-859d-9c38bb52c2ff .

camssa:c26af3f4-47e3-45e6-a70e-52af54598879 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing mechanisms for assessing the conformity of XSD implementations. W3C provides with a XSD test suit that is available for free. \r
\r
Github XSD Test Reference: \r
https://github.com/w3c/xsdtests'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f60504a6-9b28-4d4c-8fa4-e1d4d42d0edd .

