        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of SMTP is not related to the publication of public data as open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321\r
\r
Five star open data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4424a0d7-2147-4e77-91d8-26f75725c937 .

