camssa:c27f81e0-b4e1-41fa-9d11-e16414b172da a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TSP is a cryptographic protocol for certifying timestamps using X.509 certificates and public key infrastructure, but it is not defining a data model. \r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5db0ffbc-c762-46ed-8f7c-0c9187f75bf1 .

camssa:c283faf1-b584-40d3-a633-a1859281808e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are several success stories and implementation examples that provide visibility on the efficiency of
implementing ELI. It allows the description of legal resources and increases the shareability across borders
enhancing the cooperation amongst European Institutions removing barriers.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html

ELI highlights:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/index.html

ELI Testimonials:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/testimonials.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:962e4511-01c9-41b4-a216-72f32fd705e8 .

camssa:c2854d5a-06a6-4cc5-873b-8d0244567e69 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The European Union (EU) Member States are currently implementing the INSPIRE Directive and related regulations, included in the ISA programme. This projects includes the usage of XSLT for each member state of the Union.

Infrastructure for Spatial Information in Europe:
https://ies-svn.jrc.ec.europa.eu/projects/registry-development/wiki/Re3gistry_1_0_documentation#_cp3'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9e319b38-77ab-4663-87f1-8c14418268b9 .

camssa:c28784d9-b627-45ff-a937-656e4b81484a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OpenTelemetry significantly enhances data portability between systems and applications. Its standardised data formats, interoperability, modular design, compliance features, community support, cross-platform compatibility, and dynamic observability capabilities collectively ensure that telemetry data can be easily shared, migrated, and integrated across diverse environments. In fact, one of the main functionalities regarding OTel is to export telemetry data to back-end systems and platforms like ElasticSearch or Prometheus.

Metrics Exporter - Prometheus: https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/metrics/sdk_exporters/prometheus/

OpenTelemetry: https://opentelemetry.netlify.app/docs/specs/otel/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a26ef299-58e8-452e-9822-e6c2a944037c .

camssa:c287e5d2-b1e4-4abd-abc3-af5fb388806a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"ISAE 3402 Intellectual property rights disclosures' are license-free, therefore it is available with any restrictions related to (F)RAND.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf\r
\r
\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:47043efe-51f9-4a48-8b1a-98f9abe127f1 .

