camssa:c29a5bb6-29b4-4c55-995a-179952c13ca6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is excellent for accessing and maintaining distributed directory information services over internet. The main function of LDAP is to help users connect to their IT resources safely. Because of this, they are often used in public administrations and have become staples of the identity management industry.\r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:99ad1b00-1090-4031-8122-68203102fdc2 .

camssa:c29d3689-d557-41fe-accd-cbe25975de1b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-29023937877d658f898d48a06b2648e283306a041137cc58af4f79f061e1de4b ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:c29df259-2aab-47d6-8b40-b18f07046864 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Several documents are stating positive feedback on the Better Regulation initiative at European Level, which include the Better Regulation Toolbox. Below there are few examples of the documentation providing insights on how important is the process, methodology and tools for the Governance of European Public Policies and laws.\r
\r
Study webpage:\r
https://www.bruegel.org/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/MEMO-Better-Regulation.pdf\r
\r
Study supporting the interim evaluation of the innovation principle:\r
https://www.ceps.eu/wp-content/uploads/2019/11/KI0219819ENN.en_.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d19ea6b5-da42-494f-8d9e-44e8747ae021 .

camssa:c29efd55-fdcf-4afe-80cc-5008168a61ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES Baseline profile is included in the Connect Europe Facility’s (CEF) eSignature Building Block which helps public administration and stakeholders to accelerate the creation and verification of electronic signatures. Moreover, it eases interoperability across borders avoiding users to provide information on different occasions. Additionally, there is a service (Digital Signature Service) offered by CEF which aims to help the creation and use of eSignature in the context of the European Internal Market. \r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/Services+eSignature"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:03e800d5-3e7b-47ac-a4e1-93dd2e191183 .

camssa:c2a3592a-f25e-47c7-b94b-c42a2fe45dc4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are several studies assessing the adoption, strengths, weaknesses, effectiveness and efficiency of FTP.\r
\r
Downsides of using an FTP Solution: \r
https://dzone.com/articles/potential-downsides-of-using-an-ftp-solution \r
\r
Evaluate your FTP Assessment:\r
https://themanifest.com/development/how-evaluate-your-file-transfer-protocol-system \r
\r
Risks of using FTP:\r
https://sapinsider.wispubs.com/Assets/Articles/2012/January/Using-FTP-Know-The-Risks '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:04704652-da65-48b1-af9f-4b03ba5b4656 .

