camssa:c2c21cf4-1d5b-426b-9cbd-fa120ffe3fce a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of the specifications is to define technical interoperability aspects. Therefore, the eDelivery SMP 1.10 does not define organisational interoperability aspects. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42c94b14-902a-4c4b-b9dd-56b24bef4802 .

camssa:c2c4ab5c-e5a6-4a52-b190-439302962327 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Using the vocabulary, almost certainly augmented with sector or country-specific information, will facilitate 
the process for institutions publishing data about public organisations to keep track of the evolution of public organizations. Therefore, keeping track of the evolution of public administrations is a way to have information and data available from any time of these public administrations.  Moreover, standardization allows data to be stored in interoperable and reusable formats, which is central to its long-term preservation, just as compatibility with linked data technologies facilitates the maintenance and continuous updating of information.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary/distribution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary-version-100-pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6df7b9cb-a7c3-4d8d-8704-bf4a9879f362 .

camssa:c2c7b7ef-1b4f-4b17-a4ac-19777175c981 a cav:Score,
