camssa:c2ef922a-802d-4117-86ff-8c0afd0143c5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While DoH is not intended for modeling business processes, it is a low-level networking protocol that operates at the DNS layer. It focuses on securing the transmission of DNS-related information between clients and DNS resolvers. Modeling business processes typically involves higher-level concepts and frameworks that go beyond the scope of network protocols like DoH.

RFC 8484: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8484'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f84942b0-40e1-4670-a055-9c04a36ffb04 .

