camssa:c2f47a9c-7091-4539-befe-e07e31beca5e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no Member States recommending PAdES (ISO 14533-3:2017) in their ICT National Catalogues.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ac66c250-a375-43d8-ae99-a5ac7e159eab .

camssa:c2f5e4d5-db11-431d-a6b6-b39aad374934 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox is publicly available and aims to help public administrations in the development of public policies and laws according to real needs while it makes the process and data more transparent fostering the accountability of public administrations. \r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf\r
\r
Objective of Better Regulation Toolbox: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/law/law-making-process/planning-and-proposing-law/better-regulation-why-and-how_en#objectives-of-the-better-regulation-agenda"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:eda04095-d2cc-4199-af0e-c9edaafb6a73 .

camssa:c2f692ed-8221-4cb4-b74b-03e16b9732b7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "By defining schemas for XML documents, which are involved in the data exchange across borders, XSD ensures and eases the implementation of the once-only principle. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d32fd838-7407-4a48-9103-bb36c7947f59 .

camssa:c2f6c110-5b62-46cb-9b74-489669ccd8e5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of BFO is not related to the protection of personal data managed by Public Administrations since the specification does not provide any privacy considerations. 

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1e603b79-55f1-4620-8745-0742eb1309dd .

camssa:c2f72974-e8b1-4fad-b443-27420a5d02ff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15b1d804-d7a6-4322-8265-e8975cda05da .

camssa:c2f7e0dc-eb1b-493a-aa06-3bb8f840e555 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-5a7323988b5d96da801e2abd4d95248af758fe9adbbafd09dd76114629567ff4 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:c2fb49ac-bff6-4543-ad1a-f1ed0619e795 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI is included in 1 national catalogue of recommended specifications. It belongs to France. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of France is fully aligned with at least 2 out of 3 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets. 

CAMSS List of Standards: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards

NIFO factsheets: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets

France National catalogue:
http://references.modernisation.gouv.fr/sites/default/files/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2819d829-b585-4a2c-8d14-640674331638 .

camssa:c2fb5e5a-c1d9-4bb0-8a20-4d9f89f2faaf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at the supra-national level, the European Commission has listed it within Better Regulation Toolbox with all the specifications and resources produced and used by European Institutions.
Even though the specification is not listed in the ICT standards catalogue, it can be considered that is included within a European Catalogue because it is included within the European Commission solutions stack for the development of better digital administrations.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4fdf1ee9-9bbf-4698-9bff-ae610ff573d0 .

camssa:c2fcae99-63d3-41cd-bab0-7bb886ca18d4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TS 119 614-1 is intentionally not linked to any software development platform and is also intentinoally \r
agnostic on implementation strategies. This is one of the reasons why the test assertions set includes tests \r
on the correctness of the structure of all the elements specified by the XML Schemas associated with ETSI \r
TS 119 612.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 614-1 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/11961401/01.01.01_60/ts_11961401v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3caa9d00-eadb-4122-a00c-19d1eddbe2fd .

camssa:c2fd731c-8c35-43fa-be1b-7741cf63be8b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After searching in different catalogues and repositories, there is no evidence found of ETSI TS 119 511\r
being included in the catalogue of any Member State.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:077c6f5c-8704-457b-9ca3-c872a27d2f95 .

camssa:c3005264-bbcd-4675-bac3-4165d79b9be5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0e9bb259b84413d890a0fd548e40f255bb983a3add2eb7a737283f711e23d523 ;
    cav:value "100" .

