        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, the specification is associated with several ABB from the latest version published of the ELIS. More specifically,  Better Regulation Toolbox can define the interoperability aspects of the "Binding Instrument" , "Non-Binding Instrument", "Public Policy",  "Public policy cycle", and  ABBs of the EIRA Legal View.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v100"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fd7964a6-9db6-44fa-b643-f7122f440c00 .

