camssa:c3b4c3e7-26d4-46a9-8dad-1111dffb771d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Core Public Organisation Vocabulary fosters the delivery of multilingual services in European public institutions. In CPOV, the values of all properties with a data type “Literal” may exist in multiple languages. \r
\r
CPOV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:92de2cf8-f17d-4450-9c19-c62bde96dc56 .

camssa:c3b56f5c-8228-4dc1-8632-8bdc0b16da35 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3b3b2febe9a7e3ad44bdefc47b0bbcafc7a2e677e9570d6ad822efbe1f7d41e2 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:c3b70d0e-d15d-4ed7-8e6a-7e518023b29b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9694ffda6be83e507b6d3395cb411581d91419db0107726873a0a9018eab6a54 ;
    cav:value "20" .

camssa:c3bc5650-9042-4cba-8257-5bf942077e88 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WSDL helps to describe and make available administration’s web services, which contain public data and information to be reused. The data is structured as WSDL is an XML based language. Taking into account these facts, WSDL is supporting several maturity levels from Tim Berners Lee’s 5 stars schema for Open Data.  \r
\r
Additionally, there are existing W3C recommendation and notes regarding the semantics on WSDL.  Known as Semantic Annotations Web Services Description Language (SAWSDL). As well, a technical report from the Web Services Description Working Group that maps the representation of the WSDL model in RDF. \r
\r
See: \r
https://5stardata.info/en/ \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20-rdf/\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/sawsdl/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:18b9b58d-cf50-4330-846a-0bace15e1cc7 .

camssa:c3bebaca-ec6b-42d0-817e-9355b4a5c751 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cc5bd9a7d0b2acc7f246522414fd5f5d579b977180bb04fa60a545cb35dae90f ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:c3c14869-4e26-4dad-81bd-3f3d6edba5ca a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As a specification with the aim of helping to represent information which can be documents, persons, physical object or abstract objects, it helps administrations to provide information to stakeholders. Therefore, RDF fosters the visibility of the administration's data and services. As a way to make data reusable, it eases the decision-making process."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:30041601-c5ca-4186-9298-7e7840ca9c35 .

camssa:c3c2a21d-8488-430a-b858-a6de19e14caa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TSP is developed by IETF which is based in the USA. Therefore, the specification cannot be regarded as a European Standard. 

IETF reference:
https://www.ietf.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:465e6d96-e867-41c7-9f30-f6807a399c41 .

camssa:c3c38f2b-34ad-4a24-bfdf-534a282db1ef a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "40" .

