        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of WAI-ARIA is not related to the secure processing of data. Therefore, this criterion is not
applicable to this specification.

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:82599dd2-36af-414d-bac2-8165e37dc793 .

