camssa:c479f0e0-6c95-405e-a899-b5aa34e1ca52 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The main purpose of FTPS as an extension of FTP is to allow the exchange of documents on the internet. So it clearly fosters data portability between systems and applications.\r
\r
FTPS IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4217"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9478b007-9121-42ed-acdd-6387a910b135 .

camssa:c47c4274-fd8c-41ce-978e-1fa0620e5f0b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"EN 303 645 is associated to the consumer IoT devices domain. Prior to some adaptations, the specification could be extended and broaden to specific subsectors. As they state in their official website, CYBER is providing an EN 303 645 template that sets the principles for the specification to be extended. For example, the smart door locks extension is under development and is based on the EN 303 645 specification. \r
\r
EN 303 645, 'Vertical Standard' section:\r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/consumer-iot-security\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d084e2b2-f519-4408-a700-9c10591ce9e5 .

