        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'iCalendar describes conventions for depicting a calendaring and scheduling model, and introduces definitions such as calendaring and scheduling roles that enable the modelling of business processes.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7dd54f60-1546-4c14-986c-688183366e20 .

