camssa:c488646d-f973-4e7f-a064-94201bda718a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAREF is designed to be modular and extensible, allowing for partial implementations based on specific use cases and requirements. The flexibility of SAREF comes from its modular structure and the ability to create domain-specific extensions or profiles. This enables developers to focus on the parts of the ontology that are most relevant to their particular applications without necessarily implementing the entire SAREF ontology.

SAREF: 
https://saref.etsi.org/core/v3.1.1/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9f0494f3-734e-4a9c-9ddc-e0924950f9d1 .

