camssa:c4cb5816-21e1-4815-bd77-ea9131b57cf2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As defined on the OASIS Technical Committee (TC), the OData TC are involved in the release lifecycle of the specification. External contribution to this committee is possible through open channels. Up-to-date, the OData TC has announced three public reviews; however, the topic selection of these reviews is independent of the external contributors.\r
\r
OData OASIS Technical Committee reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/comments/index.php?wg_abbrev=odata\r
\r
OData OASIS Technical Committee, Overview reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=odata#overview\r
\r
OData TC third review reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/2021/12/09/invitation-to-comment-on-odata-extension-for-temporal-data-v4-0-3/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c8ec06dd-2307-43dd-a476-273a75581fd9 .

