camssa:c4e94817-a255-4084-8876-3da0689aff70 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no conformity test coming from the IETF, but there are existing free online documents that will help you validate LDAP specification when it is implemented. However, it is a manual process that does not provide 100% automatic validation. \r
\r
IBM testing LDAP authentication settings:\r
https://www.ibm.com/support/knowledgecenter/SSZQFR_2.2.5/doc/iwd/ldap_test_settings.html\r
\r
Test LDAP configurations:\r
https://docs.microfocus.com/itom/Operations_Orchestration:10.80/Develop/Working_with_API/Testing_LDAP_Configurations"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b4e4a675-908e-48bb-9599-4a6752879878 .

