camssa:c4f07a2c-c44a-4e28-a6b2-1b210764addb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The W3C Data Quality Vocabulary (DQV) specification is designed to be modular and flexible, allowing for partial implementations based on specific use cases and requirements. For instance, it includes modules for defining quality dimensions, metrics, indicators, constraints, and results.

Data Quality Vocabulary: 
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:842bde92-54f6-4298-b673-4887f119f3ed .

camssa:c4f81ed4-3786-45b6-87d7-6750f2832c44 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is not included in any repository or catalogue of standards at European level. Although EUOS along with ETSI collaboration is considering the use of GraphQL in its catalogue, as stated in the SmartM2M initiative.\r
\r
EUOS - Context Information Management (CIM): Information Model (MOD0):\r
https://www.standict.eu/standards-repository/context-information-management-cim-information-model-mod0 \r
\r
SmartM2M - Study for oneM2M (ETSI):\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103700_103799/103715/01.01.01_60/tr_103715v010101p.pdf\r
\r
CAMSS Lists Of Standards: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1e89641-258f-4693-b6ab-f0780b956c33 .

camssa:c4fc6213-5697-4ea0-a89c-0d6381aebdc0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Data Archive Interoperability (DAI) Working Group (WG) working under the CCSDS is the communty in charge of the development and maintenance of the OAIS.  Moreover, the DAI WG addresses all areas of Archive data formats, functions, services, operations, and interoperability for long-term preservation and exploitation for current and future user communities.\r
\r
Data Archive Interoperability Working Group (DAI WG):\r
https://cwe.ccsds.org/fm/Lists/Charters/DispForm.aspx?ID=23\r
\r
OAIS specification:\r
https://public.ccsds.org/Pubs/650x0m2.pdf'"""@en ;
