camssa:c566920e-de99-4367-9ede-f6781071bd17 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'RDF itself does not provide security mechanisms, but it can be used in combination with other technologies and standards to ensure the secure processing of data. This may include encryption of data transmission, access control mechanisms, and data validation and verification.\r
\r
RDF primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:afdff904-693d-4683-814e-609138ee264d .

camssa:c56bd0f9-c2d4-4f77-bacd-6139e7f8b084 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Ogg does not define a cross-sector reusable data model, but it defines an open standard for multimedia files. \r
\r
Ogg XIPH reference:\r
https://xiph.org/ogg/doc/rfc3533.txt"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:11b02d3e-7ade-429e-bb4a-6a0f5cd68145 .

camssa:c56e096d-783b-4d82-894d-ad6426119365 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"This specification is currently not included in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS), but will be included in the next release of the ELIS. The response to this criterion is positive because The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) is mappable to the European Interoperability Reference Architecture (EIRA).
Currently the specification is listed in the following ABB's: Machine To Machine Interface, Digital Solution Component and Service ABBs. 

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-andspecifications-camss/solution/elis/version-610\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:87927f6b-57c7-4679-b8ce-249ab0d8c6ea .

camssa:c56e4298-274b-406b-9235-02687fd4f1cc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-21276471c1781fa2c7e78c8e03851e076b840beddbf5cf64f53b54b8855a01b8 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:c57323ef-a6b3-4686-b673-cac9ed4ad7bb a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-138786a6e7517e10b94e83ec3b3e7ac79b4c49dcbeaef8d8e993c8df0d173529 ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:c57427a0-59a3-40d2-aa16-5ecf47f0995a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'LDAP is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, LDAP can define the interoperability aspects of the “Registration Service” and “Service Registry Component” ABBs of the EIRA Technical Infrastructure View.

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/600
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:58724aae-475f-4fee-bb79-fc81130b8b5b .

camssa:c575e3cc-0108-41c7-ac86-cf45e55a9520 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP is maintained and developed by OASIS, which is an international community developing open
standards; specifically, by the Technical Committee (TC). The specification maintenance is transparent, and
even if its development and the approval process is restricted to the specification TC, anyone can contribute
by submitting feedback to the mailing list. All the contributions are publicly available.

AMQP Organization Community:
https://www.amqp.org/

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:14d228f0-0bfd-4e40-9b9d-54216dc705d2 .

