        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SOAP 1.2 is associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). WS-Security is a SOAP 1.2 extension so it can be mapped in EIRA too.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/release/eira-library-interoperability-specifications-elis/v100-beta"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3767819b-0ffd-4cf0-acee-4fa47c29b009 .

