        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'No evidence nor disclosures have been found in the specification regarding fostering or harming the long-term preservation of information.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:76076e5a-ab7f-434e-88dd-5c2e2fd7a605 .

camssa:c5d6a4fc-2a41-4728-aa27-631eb2aaebb2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The role of TSA is to time-stamp a datum to establish evidence indicating that a datum existed before a particular time. But the TSA can also be used to indicate the time of submission when a deadline is critical, or to indicate the time of transaction for entries in a log. However, for direct data accuracy, it should be complemented with validation checks, error correction algorithms, and quality control processes to ensure correctness and precision of data.

TSP IETF reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc3161'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a39ff42a-7f0f-48f6-8cd9-4793db3119ff .

camssa:c5e33eb9-17bf-4f32-80c0-5ecd09a1f02d a cav:Score,
