camssa:c5f40de9-6e7c-4d01-b05d-b9ba7d21df76 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are no disclosures of ISO IPR Database to identify the licensing under the specification. ISO 14533-3:2017 (PAdES) is not listed in ISO/IEC/ITU Common Patent policy, so it cannot be confirmed that the specification is licensed on a (F)RAND basis.\r
\r
ISO patents:\r
https://www.iso.org/iso-standards-and-patents.html\r
\r
ISO standards and patents IPR database:\r
http://isotc.iso.org/livelink/livelink/13622347/Patents_database.xls?func=doc.Fetch&nodeId=13622347"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:63f5f473-aee1-4eaf-8419-c813554a11ef .

