        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Cloud computing is crucial in the improvement of data processing accuracy. Cloud computing platforms provide scalable resources, allowing users to easily scale up or down based on their processing needs. This scalability ensures that sufficient computing resources are available for data processing tasks, reducing the likelihood of bottlenecks and errors caused by resource limitations.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en'"""@en ;
