camssa:c706afae-c14e-4028-baa9-c6026c7d61e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"While there are mechanisms for public and stakeholder participation -including the 'call for evidence' on the 'Have your say' portal, targeted consultations with experts, and feedback opportunities on legislative proposals -the specification does not establish a process for public or stakeholder review and feedback during its development or update lifecycle.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

European Parliamentary Research Service briefing
https://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/BRIE/2022/699463/EPRS_BRI(2022)699463_EN.pdf

Have your say portal:
https://ec.europa.eu/info/law/better-regulation/have-your-say_en

European Comission webpage:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation_en#stakeholder-engagement\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:586a3a2c-5e0b-4e13-8008-ac4d3f7660ee .

camssa:c70e44b2-cf11-4ba9-99a2-52d10ee01c23 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SHACL is already associated to EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, SHACL can define the interoperability aspects of the "Data Quality" and "Conformance Testing" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View.

EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/solution/elis/release/v610

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c110d527-f57c-488a-96b6-8ce206465c8e .

camssa:c70ffb1e-3eba-4998-8416-498d90bbc5b3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The AMQP specification plays a crucial role in the Harmonised Turbulence project, which delivers turbulence forecast information for air traffic across up to nine flight levels in Europe. This information is retrieved via an AMQP 1.0 subscription, with the message comprising a binary GRIB2 file. 

Additionally, AMQP is utilised in the Data Management Working Group project within the DERA 2.0 Communication Layer module, providing a secure and reliable exchange protocol.

Harmonised Turbulence
https://eur-registry.swim.aero/services/dwd-harmonised-turbulence-amqp-10

Data management Working Group:
https://bridge-smart-grid-storage-systems-digital-projects.ec.europa.eu/working-groups/data-management#:~:text=The%20Data%20Management%20Working%20Group%20is%20dedicated%20to,among%20stakeholders%2C%20to%20formulating%20rules%20for%https://bridge-smart-grid-storage-systems-digital-projects.ec.europa.eu/working-groups/data-management#:~:text=The%20Data%20Management%20Working%20Group%20is%20dedicated%20to,among%20stakeholders%2C%20to%20formulating%20rules%20for%20data%20exchange.

Oasis AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:012c90d2-be43-4b91-bd93-8cfb958afddb .

