        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ebXML boosts digitisation of data exchange and processing within organisations. It is the case of the Open source CPA toolkit, which is a web-service provider that simplifies business transactions, as it enables the creation of Collaboration Protocol Agreements (CPA).\r
\r
Open source CPA toolkit reference:\r
http://ebxml.xml.org/news/open-source-cpa-toolkit\r
\r
Joinup CPA toolkit reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/ict-security/solution/cpa-creation-toolkit'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:48864965-ceb6-4058-a703-f098ce8cd32f .

