        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OpenTelemetry specification is technology-agnostic, enabling it to be used across diverse technology stacks, platforms, and programming languages. Its standardised protocols, broad language support, modular architecture, and extensive integration capabilities make it a versatile and powerful tool for achieving comprehensive observability in any environment. 

