camssa:c77b3310-aaa8-4bd7-b789-17513fc47534 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) does allow for extensions, specially in the designation of assets, since those can have proprietary extensions in terms of characteristics and capabilities (in the industrial manufacturing context).

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
