        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification eases the access to information via webpages. Therefore, it reduces administrative burden for citizens, businesses and public administrations.\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3653f59f-0216-40a8-8970-d9e3c8ac5439 .

