        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPv4 specification allows for partial implementations across various scopes, such as within the IP layer. RFC 791 mentions that there are many IP implementations available that can modify the user interface.

IPv4 IP impementations
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc791#page-31'"""@en ;
