        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP is designed to be platform-agnostic, allowing organizations to select the platforms and systems that align with their requirements while following the standardized guidelines for information packaging, management, and preservation.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e1f2fc95-b5d2-4b8a-8fd6-3dda335356f4 .

