camssa:c8c624e9-84ac-4605-b615-34ba441257d9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of BFO is not related to authenticity and authentication of the roles agents involved in the data transactions. In this sense the specification can be extended using other ontologies available like DCAT. 

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html

DCAT reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-3/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:14fb85fd-906d-415e-8bdc-98662d725dc0 .

