camssa:c97c353d-4a2d-4beb-a1e8-2c1ea72dbf85 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """LegalRuleML has been selected in several European projects for its implementation and help to its evolution. The main example is LEOS a software for drafting legal resources. Also MIREL, an H2020 project  "MIning and REasoning with Legal texts". \r
\r
LEOS: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/justice-law-and-security/solution/leos-open-source-software-editing-legislation\r
\r
MIREL: \r
https://cordis.europa.eu/project/id/690974/results\r
\r
LegalRuleML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/legalruleml-core-spec/v1.0/legalruleml-core-spec-v1.0.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cfee9022-d965-4547-ad7b-f480d08e368c .

camssa:c98343d5-8ae8-4e03-89a1-bd82e015a773 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 has been adopted by different specifications and used in different contexts, indicating market acceptance. For example, at European level the Publications Office (OP) of the European Union has added ISO 3166-1 to the Country code list (compiled in EU Vocabularies). Moreover, the Domain Name System (DNS) of the Internet is based on the ISO 3166-1 standard which is massively used on a daily basis.\r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html\r
\r
EU Vocabularies reference, Country code list:\r
https://op.europa.eu/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/country\r
\r
Internet Assigned Numbers Authority (IANA) reference, DNS section:\r
https://www.iana.org/domains'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:79f32f7f-8d6b-423e-95dc-ebf326bea380 .

camssa:c984fca5-2100-465d-9e4a-d7ec165f0224 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GraphQL has an active and mutually beneficial collaboration with numerous GraphQL implementers. The GraphQL specification continually evolves under the care of the GraphQL Working Group, which consists of GraphQL experts and public contributors. At any given time, updates to the GraphQL specification are clearly documented reports and are accompanied by tests before deploying to production, often on a very large production scale.\r
\r
GraphQL development process:\r
https://graphql.org/community/developers/#how-graphql-is-developed'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8a882dcf-e0ae-4ddf-99ba-e70e2d3e623c .

camssa:c98b0d93-545b-482a-92dd-4e985cb71ed9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ASiC and ASiC Baseline profile are maintained by ETSI, one of the European Agencies for Standardisation. \r
See:\r
https://www.etsi.org/about"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c29279df-cfa3-4701-a5a5-4ac1006d894c .

