        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'E-ARK CSIP allows for partial implementations, enabling organizations to adopt and implement specific components or aspects of the specification based on their needs and priorities. It provides flexibility for organizations to tailor their implementation while considering the potential impact on interoperability and long-term preservation.\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction'"""@en ;
