        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Service Metadata Publishing describes also the binding of the specification with the REST interfaces for the Service Metadata Publication within a 4-Corner network. Therefore, the specification fosters the availability of interfaces containing information from the different parties involved in a 4-corner network.\r
\r
The specification:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505000"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:82f1aba8-5d14-4a17-a479-ac2112f110eb .

