camssa:cac4bf5d-bf8d-4504-a6e5-22c02a8d7eea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s standards-making process has been clearly defined after years of experience. The organisation has adopted the open approach which means direct participation and consensus as a basis to develop standards. All the stakeholders have the opportunity to participate directly in the process of standardisation through the technical committees created to develop ETSI’s technical specifications and standards. The decision-making process includes a public review, where stakeholders involved can provide technical feedback in order to enhance and maximize the quality and accuracy of the standards. \r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/standards/standards-making"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:86b5d9c4-f1e3-437e-b3bf-cabdaf7a99c8 .

camssa:cac5f10f-9cab-4921-9a7b-71287dafa904 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"Some provisions on data storage are depicted in ISO/IEC 19944-1, nonetheless, specific guidelines to enable the long-term preservation of data are not in the specification's scope.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:525d795f-b991-4264-a0ed-27bb59ebd65d .

camssa:cac9b30a-7482-4954-b49c-b910ad799850 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:cacbe5ba-2ef0-4cf1-8dc8-9fe98b9f2425 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-245e5eb8db3a19aebfdf9ccc2c2ac0467bebccc76339696f519452e8bbd393ad ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:cacc356d-a7c7-4654-aa45-38690060c58b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification does not define a cross-sector reusable data model. PM2 is a light and easy-to-implement methodology which project teams can tailor to their specific needs.\r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:038689f9-0334-46f0-8802-d802612b799a .

camssa:cad04c5f-f9c4-4eea-9124-b153bee0ae4e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """RDF N-Triples is a lined-based plain text format that performs encoding RDF graphs, this encoding is carried out by using UTF-8. As RDF is the main technology used to publish Linked Open Data (LOD), therefore, the specification could help to the publication of data as LOD. \r
However, N-Triples presents a tedious process if the purpose is encode big amounts of data. \r
See: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/n-triples/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:03058129-738e-4287-a242-a91430a42a00 .

camssa:cad264ec-3811-4c97-8254-7a3e3564792b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While IndexedDB does not directly aid in modeling business processes, it can be part of a solution that enables the execution and management of business processes, especially in applications where local storage and offline functionality are required.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0ee372b4-f675-446d-a225-ced4887c7386 .

camssa:cad94896-4cc0-4717-8a6a-5604a71a6b90 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI’s Intellectual Property Rights Policy is based on Standard Essential Patents (SEP). The policy implemented by the standardisation organisation seeks to reduce risks and ensure that the standards are available under (F) RAND basis and Royalty-free, meaning its costless or with the most optimum fee for the function that will be used.\r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65f2a7cd-c54e-4eab-a1ee-44fedd210270 .

camssa:cae2175d-4464-4db2-9244-c7dc75c71854 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:cae6b3fa-0875-4a27-942a-13f6aa607ec8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As an extension of DCAT, DCAT-AP by allowing the description of catalogues and datasets, aggregated DCAT-AP metadata can serve as a manifest file as part of the digital preservation process. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:81ca49df-9e69-4ee7-bfc1-82e5fd9bb612 .

camssa:cae7b524-57f2-48bd-957f-7ce1c19ea48a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
