camssa:caef6f8e-1755-482c-8b7e-ae2ead26d3df a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'RDF is developed by W3C, a standard development organisation based in the US.  Moreover, RDF specification does not appear in any of the main European  standard development bodies, therefore, the specification is not a European standard.\r
\r
CEN-CENELEC homepage: \r
https://www.cencenelec.eu/\r
\r
ETSI homepage:\r
https://www.etsi.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3469549b-0e5c-4deb-9d3a-2ed0619250f4 .

