camssa:caf4d11a-7ec8-4588-a0b3-254413e2876b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By nature, LDAP is compatible with different operating systems and devices. However, different LDAP offerings may limit this flexibility; AD, for example, is Windows-centric and often requires add-ons to work seamlessly with additional operating systems.

LDAP IETF reference:
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511

LDAP with Active Directory: 
https://www.solarwindsmsp.com/blog/difference-between-ldap-ad'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f5f6312a-4c48-46e5-b82e-71176d2169cf .

