        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC19944-1 does not directly relate to the modelling of business processes; however, the normative nature of the specification enphasizes the need for defined requirements and standardized approaches in cloud-service management. This way organisations can align their business processes with cloud service management outlined in the specification.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9a1c3b2d-a23d-4b20-9a5e-ccab8c75904a .

