camssa:ccb49107-31a3-4416-9185-57695ddef792 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Belgian Interoperability Framework (Belgif) includes the OSLO framework, which is used for semantic interoperability in Belgium. Within OSLO, various key elements and properties from RegOrg are still being utilised. Therefore, the RegOrg vocabulary is still included in a national-level open catalogue of standards.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

Belgian Interoperability Framework (Belgif):
https://www.belgif.be/page/specifications.en.html

OSLO Smart City Distribution - Application profile Reference: 
https://data.vlaanderen.be/doc/applicatieprofiel/slimme-stadsdistributie/

ICT technical specifications:
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:831bda19-6517-4de2-80d6-7ffec59a695f .

