        "65%StrengthOfAssessmentScoreAverage" .

camssa:ccec7190-79ce-4407-93a9-c15ba01c5465 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The use of the ESPD can indirectly contribute to the development of digital service delivery channels by reducing administrative burden and increasing efficiency in procurement procedures. This can allow public\r
authorities to invest in the development of digital services and infrastructure, which can in turn enable more\r
efficient and effective delivery of public services through digital channels.\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1ae440e-91b0-4233-a944-3fed2ccb74fa .

camssa:cced0c13-56b1-4754-a4f4-a29f4bcef36e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'NUTS is intended to serve as a device to identify administrative zones in the EU and beyond the EU borders. There is no possibility of tailoring NUTS coding system, nor any kind of authorising process is allowed, as NUTS was conceived for a unique purpose.\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Principles and Characteristics section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/principles-and-characteristics'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41103622-3c50-4d21-98e2-59858f7a42e3 .

camssa:ccf38657-3c43-484a-b4c1-c3922dfd009a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "TSL 1.2 has been widely for cryptographic protocol that providing end-to-end security of data sent between applications over the Internet. However TSL 1.3 was created in 2018 which improved many characteristics of the  former, consequently it can be said that it is the 1.3 version that is used for the development of products and services."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cdf0607a-d8ae-48b8-ad20-d99dbc06df50 .

camssa:ccf44263-37cc-482e-850a-d4dde877382e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of FTP is not related to  e-accessibility. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4ebf1cc2-f5dd-4d66-a378-79dd522c9197 .

