        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification has been developed by European Institutions for its implementation across borders to improve the accountability and development of public policies and laws, the specification can be considered compliant with the different European Regulations. Moreover, one of the main goals of the specification is to foster the consistency and proper development of the general public laws and policies.\r
\r
