camssa:cf04aa66-f57c-4392-a899-d16b721eb221 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is excellent for accessing and maintaining distributed directory information services over \r
internet. The main function of LDAP is to help users connect to their IT resources safely. Because of this, \r
they are often used in public administrations and have become staples of the identity management industry.\r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:75d0b695-8fae-4935-a0f1-e22f8d324e1c .

camssa:cf0a2889-6a99-4817-9270-f07acc79c1a5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9274e5fa-b516-4dc9-8b77-6e1f5118ec3c .

camssa:cf11f153-96a6-4b76-89f1-b71d52f0306c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SHACL is publicly available for implementation and use for free on Github. Also, TopQuadrant developped a service available for free in Javascript allowing the use of SHACL features for free.\r
\r
See:\r
https://github.com/w3c/data-shapes \r
http://shacl.org/playground/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:48b3e7b8-c560-41c3-918e-873c878e4545 .

camssa:cf130cb1-ca0d-405b-be4a-6f5b48458f5a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:cf15e28e-91f0-4dfc-a650-268ce2779053 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are already existing documents and studies assessing WSDL performance and its features. The main topic are efficiency while discovering, automatic classification of web services or the poor query results. \r
\r
Improving Web Service descriptions for effective service discovery:\r
https://core.ac.uk/download/pdf/82569095.pdf\r
\r
Towards Effective Service Discovery using Feature\r
Selection and Supervised Learning Algorithms:\r
https://thesai.org/Downloads/Volume10No5/Paper_25-Toward_Effective_Service_Discovery.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d0e38e37-dfb3-4d62-8a45-7b739447e4ce .

camssa:cf15ef6e-80eb-4f4f-99f1-3a29686b2df4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0e9bb259b84413d890a0fd548e40f255bb983a3add2eb7a737283f711e23d523 ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:cf256111-bace-4ebd-ae5d-b3b6b32466dd a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6fa642bc8eceff2b1d333dc1123748399264c028fde2fd78308f0a0209ae21b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:cf2f0d1e-5563-4b81-8810-72e6eaac6c06 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although ADMS’s purpose is not the long-term preservations, it can be used to document and store semantic assets. \r
\r
ADMS on Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/asset-description-metadata-schema-adms/about\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2e0ba839-c4a1-4364-9ffd-906e8c620050 .

camssa:cf310e44-50f6-4faf-aeb7-c7555bd23645 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:cf316e2a-a361-496d-87d8-82703c9697e7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are already existing studies and documents assessing and documenting YAML features, which can help to discover how the specification can be efficient. Speciffically, the paper "YAML: A tool for hardware design visualization and capture" helps to understand how YAML can be used for achieve complex targets using YAML only. This paper describes an approach that helps to capture the structural aspects of a design at a high level of abstraction and enables the system designer to enter designs "schematically" using predefined structural and functional entities conforming to UML notation.

"YAML: A tool for hardware design visualization and capture":
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/abstract/document/874023'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d73fa3b-f24e-4b50-8ddc-d46ec15b9d17 .

camssa:cf3ba306-1d16-4978-8626-699852eb77a6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:cf3d770d-f723-4d92-91d3-f9f9e0b514bf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SHACL enhances the semantic and technical interoperability of ontologies expressed as RDF (Resource Description Framework) graphs, which is a European Standard used by public administrations. By ensuring data validation through SHACL, DCAT-AP (Data Catalogue Application Profile) facilitates the description of public sector datasets, making them easily searchable across borders and sectors. This interoperability and searchability enable public administrations to expose interfaces for accessing their services more effectively, as seen in initiatives like the Open Data Support service by the European Commission.

DCAT-AP specification reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70f6cb48-9a40-4e44-bcbf-4d97aa39b2e7 .

camssa:cf3eb7cc-3b17-4ed2-8ee2-6bd8e166f676 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:cf429787-140d-46d6-9019-7f7049dd6dcb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SMP 2.0 specification developed by OASIS does not explicitly address the protection of information against unauthorized changes. \r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0372967d-46a5-4728-be52-5133daca7c85 .

camssa:cf46ee63-689f-439b-987c-90e9a9260476 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-cd828c0ec9887027bdb6b981560bde593cda27c080298ab36323ba5441ba4c31 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:cf494cd1-6e3c-4538-83fb-587b9a7680cf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPsec is a set of open standards and protocols for securing the exchange of data packets over a computer network. Therefore, it ensures the secure and trustworthy data exchange between different stakeholders.\r
\r
IPSec reference, Where Can IPSec Be Implemented:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4301#page-11'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1c6be7c1-5e91-421b-8087-c5e8b8a48b8c .

camssa:cf4b5336-2488-4b42-a8b1-905ad08a9c56 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of LegalDocMC is not related to the publication of public data as linked open data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
LegalDocML reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/legaldocml/charter.php"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:42ff7828-da82-4c5f-a2ae-4221a3bf1e43 .

camssa:cf5217ab-22c1-41fb-83ac-79292bbf0476 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has not been found any assessment addressing the effectiveness of Domibus implementations.\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4bf66337-b2fe-409d-917f-da9c9e6ea470 .

