        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "After searching in the different official European websites, there is no evidence of any cross-border project that uses Xforms nor explicit agreements involving the usage of the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ef915cbe-f5f3-47cd-83cc-2e96c26d2468 .

