camssa:cfdc25ff-a6fb-469d-9364-aeae182af43b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """EuroVoc was developed for the first time in 1982 and has de full support from the European Union, since it was developed to support and help European and National institutions on their functions. The taxonomy categorises knowledge domains close to the European Institution. Therefore, it can be considered with market acceptance at eGovernment level for the development of products and services.\r
\r
EuroVoc over the time: \r
https://op.europa.eu/es/web/eu-vocabularies/th-dataset/-/resource/dataset/eurovoc?target=About#Time\r
\r
Eurovoc: \r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/eurovoc"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7092a931-1d7e-44ce-86e8-c8302a3edf74 .

