camssa:d00042b5-4638-4285-9eb0-8a21cfaacce3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSLT specification is designed to be technology-agnostic, focusing on data transformation and manipulation without being tied to any specific platform. (See Section 2.9)

XSLT Reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/xslt-30/#extensibility'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1dc95c7-1c0b-496e-b609-5aeb0db9c050 .

camssa:d00069cc-3cd6-421a-996a-1538c787f8ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Currently Microsoft has provided some insights regarding the specification efficiency, but while it is implemented with other specifications, in this case via Microsoft network drivers.

OSI and Microsoft
https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/windows-hardware/drivers/network/windows-network-architecture-and-the-osi-model

OSI reference
https://www.iso.org/standard/20269.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a96e535a-bd6f-40f2-8989-4b190d521b7b .

camssa:d009995f-ed21-4405-9818-f275a20de989 a cav:Score,
