    cav:value "100" .

camssa:d02258a8-af61-403b-b73c-2585542f421a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'FTP is an exclusive protocol created solely for transferring files, but it lacks security for the transmitted data.\r
\r
Nevertheless, there are extensions available for FTP that address this issue by providing secure information delivery. One such extension is FTP over TLS, commonly referred to as FTPS, which employs Transport Layer Security (TLS) to safeguard FTP communications over a network.\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959\r
\r
Securing FTP with TLS Reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4217'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e82e7e22-9ecd-4e8b-97aa-625786bbcae8 .

camssa:d027e457-8e09-4cbd-8782-1aeb6141d957 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:d029a914-dc50-49ed-b8cd-2fd21c382ba5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although HTTPS is not directly related to the reuse of information, in some cases, cache content over HTTPS can provide a mean to reuse information, but not in a consitent manner.\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:96013fe4-1759-48ad-9f56-493128e839c0 .

camssa:d0317767-63ac-449a-bc9d-f564a3581394 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-5839144ecfb6c41a2c3cf5c1e86a6b3ad7a9e3ec9c4efa5650a6e7b9e3586335 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:d03577e0-586b-4133-b7f3-3b8681f129d7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The application of the once-only principle in all EU Member States public administrations aims at reducing the administrative burden. This Core Vocabulary fosters interoperability between public administrations, cross border services and impacts positively the development of eGovernment.\r
\r
CPSV-AP Joinup webpage:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile/release/22'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fdd394e0-b789-4418-9e66-9f5a3bad80ff .

camssa:d039428b-ddc0-460b-9f7b-c794285fc3f7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is built around RDF and is highly dependent from it since its purpose is to  validate RDF graphs. Nonetheless, it has many known implementations that range through a variety of business domains allowing for RDF graphs validation across business domains.\r
\r
ShEx primer document:\r
https://shexspec.github.io/primer/\r
\r
ShEx Community Group:\r
https://www.w3.org/community/shex/\r
\r
ShEx Github:\r
https://github.com/shexSpec/spec/issues\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:59f6c83e-6ff6-409f-bffd-ba332c74a37c .

camssa:d03d76f9-d73c-49a1-a779-ac092d7b6a69 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100" .

