        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DIDs is used in Self-sovereign identity (SSI) in eIDAS project. Self-sovering identity is the next step beyond user-centric identity. Moreover, DIDs is currently being implemented in dataspaces initiatives, which evidences its use in the  development of innovative solutions.

