camssa:d11a28c6-8cf2-48e3-92fc-d053e715b962 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion
of XHTML within any European catalogue of standards.

ICT technical specifications:
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en

CEN search tool catalogue:
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::

CENELEC search tool catalogue:
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1f72eead-b225-42b6-b404-d5570dcf18a3 .

camssa:d1216e65-c5de-4d77-8744-952763216638 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Genericode can facilitate the publication of data on the web by providing a standardised format for representing code lists. It defines a structured W3C XML Schema format for representing code lists. This structured format makes it easy to encode code lists in a machine-readable form, which is essential for publishing data on the web.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:29bbac22-1d1e-44ef-994b-c17a09553775 .

camssa:d124a906-d91d-4b95-b69b-8ae1bd0deeac a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After checking the SFIA Foundation homepage, there is no reference to (F)RAND values in the available documentation.\r
\r
SFIA reference, Choosing a licence:\r
https://sfia-online.org/en/licensing-sfia/choosing-a-licence'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ef611e65-51c1-4635-afe4-78fb9c44e8d4 .

camssa:d12ef92e-04ec-4cbb-9a35-b01a60ae249f a cav:Score,
