        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of FTP is not related to ensuring and enabling data processing accuracy. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d6be59c8-bbe1-4422-b8ef-f0838522bb94 .

camssa:d161fa51-fe5e-42c9-9412-9140b85167e3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData promotes the sharing of data and results, and begs for its approval as an ISO/IEC Standard to help accelerate the specification adoption throughout the international community, particularly within government agencies. In this sense, the specification encourages both the creation of communities and the sharing of their data and results on European platforms.\r
\r
OData referenece, data exchange:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/news/pr/iso-iec-jtc-1-approves-oasis-odata-standard-for-open-data-exchange/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:075d54d4-4b84-491d-bb79-3a6363514c5d .

