camssa:d18c24c8-01f1-4d04-bf3e-6c3464eb0f59 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has not explicitly been found any community sharing their data and results about the implementation of PROV. However, the fact that it is a widely citated specification in scholar papers, and it is also being used as the basis for the development of solutions, gives a glance of its popularity and usefulness, which in turn translates to the creation of communities implementing and discussing the standard.\r
\r
PROV Scholar citations:\r
https://typeset.io/papers/prov-overview-an-overview-of-the-prov-family-of-documents-3hp1wrtnan\r
\r
DCMI Metadata Provenance Task Group:\r
https://www.dublincore.org/groups/provenance/\r
\r
The W3C PROV family of specifications for modelling provenance metadata:\r
https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/2452376.2452478\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8739a8f4-f6d5-4d2f-afa1-f8b4f83cd101 .

