camssa:d240b4a0-50b1-4a49-afeb-4f7ef394e18b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification has been selected within the scope of LEOS project to develop the LEOS software, which aims to ease the drafting and edition of legal documents. \r
\r
Moreover, LegalDocML has been included  within the European Commission's Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation and in the related standardisation activities of the same report.\r
\r
LEOS: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/justice-law-and-security/solution/leos-open-source-software-editing-legislation\r
\r
The European Commission includes in its Rolling Plan for ICT Standarisation:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-single-market/en/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation\r
\r
\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:50d9ac4f-38ff-4bd0-983c-dae11701ecc1 .

