        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTP is more focused on how data is transferred over the web by using a request response functions between servers and clients, the specification itself does not scope comprehensibly administrative procedures, rules data, and services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

HTTP /1.1 RFC 2616 Reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2616.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:99929e0c-4c3c-4848-9245-6aa99952d9d9 .

