camssa:d267bd56-70a7-4d6a-881f-8bed3b44afb8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ELI defines a common data model focused on the description of legal data sets. It allows administrations to reuse documentation in a common and machine-readable format helping to create new services and enhance administrations data and rules visibility. However, it is domain-specific focused on the legal domain. Nonetheless, ELI is based on the Common Data Model (CMD) defined by the Publications Office that could be used instead across the sector for promoting data exchange. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
\r
ELI Technical Documentation: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/technical_information.html\r
\r
Common Data Model EU Vocabularies: \r
https://op.europa.eu/es/web/eu-vocabularies/cdm\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8c68d90c-6c29-4956-823c-b3f5cd4c3332 .

