    cav:value "80" .

camssa:d26b5630-ecc3-49ed-8748-8b9c325f301e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The IndexedDB does not address the protection of personal data; it only addresses the storage of information. However, the specification offers a framework that can help achieve a more consistent privacy of data. In this context, the specification offers tips, such as deleting data when it is not necessary. Thus, the combination of the specification's functionalities and human techniques can achieve a certain degree of data privacy.

Indexed Database API privacy:
https://www.w3.org/TR/2025/WD-IndexedDB-3-20250110/#privacy\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e101d703-9b3f-42fc-b7f0-c8f8e6141cd5 .

