camssa:d2b85bf9-6879-4706-8917-806337acba75 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The integration of Domibus with the broader digital service ecosystem can lead to an imporvement on the delivery of digital services related to messaging and data exchange, ensuring, seamless communication and data exchange between backend and user interfaces. While Domibus itself does not directly enable digital service delivery channels, it can play a role in supporting backend communication and data exchange between different components of a digital service delivery infrastructure. For example, it can be used to transmit messages related to service requests, notifications, or updates between different systems involved in the digital service delivery process.\r
\r
Domibus specification:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/wikis/display/DIGITAL/Domibus'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7458a639-3da4-42ee-9048-5e46f8744d1b .

camssa:d2ba1f5b-6f63-4807-b0bc-f09f9be6b52b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "40" .

