camssa:d3d156b4-813b-46be-a967-73e71131501d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The objective of the LegalRuleML is to extend RuleML with formal features specific to legal norms, guidelines, policies and reasoning. The specification allows the exchange of legal resources under a common framework for its description and modelling. Consequently, it can be said that the specification fosters data portability between systems and applications.\r
\r
LegalRuleML reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/legalruleml/legalruleml-core-spec/v1.0/legalruleml-core-spec-v1.0.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:076207fd-080d-45d9-9094-6276d6b0b4c7 .

