camssa:d3f0a9d5-d6fe-4b1d-8dd4-fde49a9c23b4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of XSD 1.1 is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification. \r
\r
XSD Reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2012/REC-xmlschema11-1-20120405/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85bda7b7-a977-412a-9c66-27a46674a6a9 .

camssa:d3f11edc-921f-4ca8-acf4-f0231d6d7629 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WSDL itself does not inherently address or ensure data processing accuracy. WSDL is a specification used for describing the interfaces and operations of web services, focusing on the technical aspects of communication and data exchange. The accuracy of data processing is a broader consideration that involves various factors at both the design and implementation levels.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:93413f5b-ba66-43ee-978a-fcd1854a2b31 .

camssa:d3f2f6c5-4864-4c27-bf79-eedbcdcf2ae9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has no direct provision for long term data preservation, but it mentions this capability can be implemented via extensions, but is not strictly related to long term preservation. 

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c07f220-e0e1-4f6b-8db5-821c6c2a2a39 .

camssa:d3fb14b7-e1f8-4e89-8f6d-2df015c3c15c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"ISAE 3402 is part of the International Federation of Accountants (IFAC) standard providing companies in the \r
financial sector with an independent assessment tool on user entities' controls over financial reporting. ISAE \r
3402 auditing tool, therefore, does not allow for extensions. \r
\r
ISAE 3402 handbook reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ee7ec5fe-ee3e-4f69-8924-31e9fc98f74c .

