camssa:d44f8ebc-3920-49ff-8617-b07ff17c02e1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The publiccode.yml specification does not directly facilitate the creation of organisational interoperability agreements like MoUs or SLAs. However, by providing a standardised framework for documenting software within public administrations, it indirectly supports organisational interoperability. It helps clarify relationships around software reuse and sharing, which can be an integral part of formalising agreements for cross-organisational collaboration and alignment, as outlined in EIF Recommendation 29.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15a640bb-6a78-4d29-97dd-067691435dc9 .

