camssa:d4703721-0d2f-452f-8f77-195ced1ebfc6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The focus of IPsec is security. Although the specification does not directly prompt security considerations related to personal data management, IPsec enforces security policy for databases management; therefore, the specification ensures the protection of personal data.\r
\r
IPSec reference, Major IPSec Databases:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4301#section-4.4\r
\r
IPSec reference, Security Considerations:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4301#page-72'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ec803f6e-bd61-4bd9-b3bb-84c1eed8add0 .

camssa:d473deb6-d053-4196-888a-001efe82373b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI is a sector agnostic specification that can be used under any business domain. In this regard, UDDI is only a register and a service directory, and does not define aspects of service execution. However, when a service is published in a UDDI register, it can be used in any domain.

Oracle UDDI reference: 
https://docs.oracle.com/cd/E17904_01/admin.1111/e15867/uddi.htm#i1077361'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:44b50041-a6e2-416c-bc1b-9cbaabad12cf .

