camssa:d4bd2e76-11f1-48d6-b81f-fc7a2e4c8830 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Registered Organization Vocabulary provides a flexible framework that does not require a complete implementation of all defined terms. It can implement only the parts of the vocabulary that are relevant to their specific needs and data exchange scenarios.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f6ac04cf-b207-44b4-86d9-49f29e6d79a7 .

