    cav:value "100" .

camssa:d4c1540e-7133-479f-aa27-e15a975e6417 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While DCAT-AP can help to facilitate the discovery and access of data by providing standardized metadata, it does not provide any mechanisms for securing the exchange of data itself. Nonetheless, other standards and technologies can be used in conjunction to support and enable the secure exchange of data. \r
\r
DCAT-AP Specification:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/release/200'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:57361492-93f0-4512-a158-f277e87a9cd5 .

camssa:d4c5a965-4b01-4ba5-ab18-a3fb100f12ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of CSS v2.1 within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en\r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fe789a37-405a-4f3a-aa50-4511abeeefe2 .

camssa:d4c602d1-1877-496c-9825-792e6cebaf37 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAIS is being used in several European cross-border projects and initiatives.  One example could be NEDLIB, which stands for Networked European Deposit Library a project that aims to develop a common architectural framework and basic tools for building deposit systems for electronic publications (DSEP) which is being modelled under the OAIS principles.\r
\r
NEDLIB Project: \r
http://www.dlib.org/dlib/september99/vanderwerf/09vanderwerf.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bafd1c62-4d01-4aea-9d4c-e58cb56e3251 .

