camssa:d4c929ea-4c0c-4979-b8de-d3cd193b09b8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """EuroVoc is a public asset that fosters the reusability of information by helping data processing in a standardised way. Therefore, it lays down the Commission Decision of 12 December 2011 on the reuse of Commission documents.\r
\r
Commission Decision on the Reuse of Commission Documents: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/LexUriServ/LexUriServ.do?uri=OJ:L:2011:330:0039:0042:EN:PDF\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c892d048-06ba-4138-a782-11aaf4e50829 .

