        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 511 is itself a document that specifies the requirements related to policies and legal regulations that have to be applied for the creation of e-signature and long term preservation of data trust services.  \r
\r
ETSI TS 119 511 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119511/01.01.01_60/ts_119511v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:285bbfe0-ea06-4588-8d08-557654c18bb0 .

