camssa:d4fa590f-f119-4636-b689-c246e5875aa0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification partially address the protection of personal data managed by public administrations. It is possible to include additional metadata elements in DCAT to provide information on security, data protection and privacy.\r
                                                                                                                                                \r
W3C Security and privacy indication:        \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2023/WD-vocab-dcat-3-20230307/#security_and_privacy        \r
\r
DCAT (v2.0.0) reference:             \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat/                                                   '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:147867a0-b9ce-480e-83b1-f98ff5708376 .

camssa:d5065cec-c999-4d1b-b7e9-b1742b28f203 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Different existing reports point out the benefits of implementing ISAE 3402. An example of such assessment \r
can be found in the following link:\r
\r
Report o ISAE 3402:\r
https://isae3402.co.uk/sites/default/files/Whitepaper_ISAE_3402.pdf\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a6ee330-ec61-4ee0-ab98-2941b82bca56 .

