        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:d5b6ab46-7533-42c8-9fd9-d7f6cd5e3b41 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Currently, JSON is a widely used specification for data interchange between applications and platforms. It is used in a REST API applications in order to ensure data exchange, this application is extensively used for the creation of solutions, including innovative ones."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:465e4bfd-956e-46c4-99d1-a69b9994181f .

camssa:d5ba7562-6077-4aec-ad4f-03df8d7d76df a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, MIME is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore, MIME is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on the MIME specification (RFC 2045).\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b23744e6-b2d8-47d5-ad1e-63b42d0885f3 .

camssa:d5bcced4-384d-41d4-8bbe-8f4f3b5fb339 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of CPSV-AP is related to the delivery of multilingual public services. All datatype properties with datatype “text” where the value for that property may exist in multiple languages, the property has multiple instances which are tagged with a language identifier for each language in which the value for that property exists.\r
\r
CPSV-AP reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:41a43373-746c-4f86-81d4-a10d789703e3 .

camssa:d5be5578-4714-46a3-88c5-c59ad8b7a699 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0c9dd43038136296b52f50e05f9d6eef39f7b8018517224007990b15be2eb19e ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:d5bf520c-1a33-4862-bf87-812847864e10 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """eDelivery SMP 1.10 is an evolution of the previous e-SENS SMP, which evolves from the PEPPOL SMP specification and was standardised by OASIS. The assessed specification continues strictly related to SMP 1.0 as is an extended profile for eDelivery Building Block. Therefore, these facts demonstrate that eDelivery SMP 1.10 is mature enough to be used in the creation of products and solutions. Additionally, it is supported by Open sources and commercial, which ensures its market acceptance. \r
See:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/Background"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:633dbd40-5ef8-4ac7-8881-a3a8d44a3d31 .

camssa:d5c00470-cafd-4537-a8c0-4ac2fbe442a9 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-73a8058bec757a2fdb0f8513c2f11841e982cbef76c3be82af67707c294da8b8 ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:d5c711d0-f372-4ec8-886e-86f4c7125032 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Publications Office of the European Union publishes European Public Procurement Notices on the TED website. The new generation of these notices, eForms, has been restructured using UBL and the associated genericode files, genericode files in the notices have been made freely available for reuse in EU Vocabularies under the eProcurement Business Collection.

eProcurement Business Collection: https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/e-procurement'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f1c6ad30-e21e-44e2-9e6e-1a0464c1be84 .

camssa:d5cb4b21-a84f-4933-a2e7-bf537ac2eb9c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3c0edf049cd95575b46d688ed31be0ccce7a5822c5bcc22adf05d491f01f2780 ;
    cav:value "40" .

camssa:d5ceafa1-4cd9-447b-bc44-e75f0c50de19 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6fa642bc8eceff2b1d333dc1123748399264c028fde2fd78308f0a0209ae21b ;
    cav:value "40" .

