camssa:d5fca687-ce1d-443f-baa0-1ea7a18d5444 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There have been found some academic papers assessing the use of DPV in terms of efficiency. These documents describe the use of DPV personal data handling policies and information about consent (see Personal Data Handling in Multi-Agent Systems Interaction) or assess the efficiency when it comes to discover the relevant information in privacy policies by means of integrating the knowledge represented in the DPV with the information modelled in BabelNet.

Personal Data Handling in Multi-Agent Systems Interaction:
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-49778-1_5

The role of Vocabulary Mediation to Discover and Represent Relevant Information in Privacy Policies:
http://ebooks.iospress.nl/doi/10.3233/FAIA200851,'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a84f97f8-e8b6-4134-98b1-1bcefcf505b7 .

camssa:d605152d-2f3d-4749-9871-100792462212 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES Baseline profile has been selected within the CEF Digital Signature Service (hereby DSS) along with CAdES, XAdES and ASiC. \r
\r
DSS is a free service that allows interested users to get started in the development of eSignatures according to existing regulations. The initiative is an enabler for the cross borders interoperability between administrations and business. \r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/Standards+and+specifications\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5d628cb6-6bd3-43c6-8fba-bf693bfcd7a4 .

camssa:d60788ed-3625-4bf8-8f5c-64576b0da9e7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xforms 2.0 is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. However, Germany includes a previous version in its catalogue of recommended specifications.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6f563221-73f8-44a7-8247-4aba80877a17 .

