        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is not included in any open repository/catalogue of standards at European level.

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d1951ddd-e008-475b-9dcb-6f539a68e56c .

camssa:d6b220bf-8b24-41cb-ae43-f504c1bb9d71 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Taking into account the initial purpose of the specification, it can be considered that the specification is involved in fostering the comprehensibility of Public Administrations' data as well as relevant data produced for the decision-making process. It is involved by providing consistent methodology for the creation and development of coherent public services and solutions. \r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127  """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f890f437-5d28-4e65-b022-b3119b0b4358 .

camssa:d6b95655-5efc-4c51-9737-c8638f12094a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The NFV project started in 2013, and the first release of the NFVI took place in 2014. All the NFV distribution set underwent through a second release by 2016, and a third release in 2019 including software modifications of this specification. A fourth release in 2020 worked on the lightweight virtualisation support of technology allowing to optimise the NFV specification. An ETSI OnLine (EOL) account is required to access to the ETSI NFV Issuer Tracker.\r
\r
ETSI NFV reference: \r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/nfv/nfv\r
\r
ETSI NFV release 3:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/NFV-REL/001_099/006/03.01.01_60/gs_NFV-REL006v030101p.pdf\r
\r
NFVI Feature Tracker:\r
https://nfvwiki.etsi.org/index.php?title=Feature_Tracking#FEAT03:_NFVI_software_modification\r
\r
ETSI NFV Issuer Tracker:\r
https://nfvwiki.etsi.org/index.php?title=NFV_Issue_Tracker'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f5ecf886-c76f-461f-acc8-0ed3e4611c22 .

camssa:d6be59c8-bbe1-4422-b8ef-f0838522bb94 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
