camssa:d6c056b2-25bd-47d4-b64c-da8abc9640e6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EUROSTAT makes available a Linked Open Data section where the European Commission publishes data and  all kinds of statistical analysis based on the NUTS classification, encouraging the creation of communities around the specification at European level.\r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Linked Open Data section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/linked-open-data'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:49a33aa1-13de-4145-823d-4b0f33e06dce .

camssa:d6c21a92-9970-4ed2-92ef-094cba63be27 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard, including a public review.

W3C Process document:
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ad6f53e6-cf0b-4cfd-806e-4abd500aa5ea .

camssa:d6c62857-10a3-4732-8058-e567a5bd741c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EN 319 532 substituted the previous TS 102 640, which indicates EN 319 532 as an effective service. \r
Also, ENISA is recommending the specification in a Signature Verification document.\r
\r
ENISA document:\r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/events/tsforum-caday-2018/presentations/C03_Rock.pdf\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 532-3 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319500_319599/31953203/01.02.01_60/en_31953203v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f7a7e0d7-bd5b-4e8d-bc27-12502e0c6c48 .

camssa:d6c74930-15cc-44d6-bd86-ad2441dcb4a8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WAI-ARIA primarily addresses web accessibility concerns and is not designed to handle privacy-related matters.Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. 

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#privacy-and-security-considerations'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e503c451-816d-4d72-b526-0f6d184f15f3 .

