        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SHACL is publicly available for implementation and use, and therefore for everyone to study, for free on Github. Also, TopQuadrant developped a service available for free in Javascript allowing the use of SHACL features.\r
\r
See:\r
https://github.com/w3c/data-shapes \r
http://shacl.org/playground/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:64fcd6bf-eef9-4dec-bdec-b6ab8c72ef5b .

