camssa:d739dab7-a190-440c-8a57-7de44ce17228 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a set of protocols involved in the Internet Protocol Suite, IPsec allows a secure data exchange. It avoids the exchange of non-digital documents and therefore reduces the administrative burden. \r
\r
Moreover, IPsec is available for free, reduces vendor lock-in and therefore reduces administrative burden.\r
\r
See: \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4301 \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/ietf-rfc-4301-2005-security-architecture-internet-protocol/distribution/ietf-rfc-4301-2005-security-architecture-internet-protocol \r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a43f8d64-9a9d-4a4e-888d-8a249c8836df .

