camssa:d740103b-3402-4d54-922f-22988229e37f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has at its core the idea of platform Industrie 4.0 that is the delivery of assets among partners and this simplifies the deliver of public services related to manufacturing. 

Industrie 4.0 initiative:
https://www.plattform-i40.de/IP/Navigation/EN/Home/home.html

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b2f6a9bf-2287-451e-afff-30428bf94b3b .

camssa:d7423e0d-f2a7-459e-847d-26197ce3a8fa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CPOV is a European Standard as it was developed and recognized by the European standards 
organisations; it is also maintained by the semic community.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary#:~:text=Core%20Public%20Organisation%20Vocabulary%201%20Description%20The%20SEMIC,publishing%20data%20about%20public%20organisations.%203%20Version%20information '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:00ab4a53-34ae-481f-b8aa-ce4eb37bb9fc .

