    cav:value "2" .

camssa:d74d6a29-99ab-4880-b6a1-e0d6ee606f09 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WSDL helps to describe and make available administration’s web services, which contain public data and information to be reused. The data is structured as WSDL is an XML based language. Taking into account these facts, WSDL is supporting several maturity levels from Tim Berners Lee’s 5 stars schema for Open Data.  \r
\r
Additionally, there are existing W3C recommendation and notes regarding the semantics on WSDL.  Known as Semantic Annotations Web Services Description Language (SAWSDL). As well, a technical report from the Web Services Description Working Group that maps the representation of the WSDL model in RDF. \r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5 star open data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/ \r
\r
WSDL RDF Mapping:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20-rdf/\r
\r
WSDL Semantic annotations:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/sawsdl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a7590d12-db17-4590-8af5-509be501a6ba .

camssa:d74e910a-f6d9-4ff1-bbb2-74fe32073d0c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As a document format, PDF 1.7 helps to make data available on the internet. This fact demonstrates that the standard is supporting the first level of maturity from Tim Berners Lee's 5 stars schema for Open data. \r
\r
See: \r
https://5stardata.info/es/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:501baed8-997c-4a0d-9039-fc48aa22c9af .

camssa:d751d328-ee91-49cf-a13e-46fb610d0fcc a cav:Score,
