camssa:d7d3aef4-7610-4159-8d51-42b234049f13 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"iCalendar focuses on providing a structured representation of events, tasks, and scheduling information, including features such as recurring events, time zones, attendee management, and reminders. While some administrative information can be included in event descriptions and custom properties, iCalendar is not intended as a comprehensive platform for managing or exposing public administration's services.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:904e728e-a8bb-48a9-9435-75b03d67ebfe .

camssa:d7d3f185-1109-4db1-a106-c22dff6a6874 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"There can be found many articles and research papers addressing e-procurement and assessing the efficiency and effectiveness of the ESPD in the context of the digilalisation of e-procurement process. A sample of these assessments can be accessed below:\r
\r
Improving Electronic Public Procurement Using the Once-Only Principle: Connecting the Greek Electronic\r
Single Procurement Document System to the Once-Only Principle Project's Infrastructure, Implementing the\r
eProcurement Pilot:\r
https://dl.acm.org/doi/abs/10.1145/3494193.3494226\r
\r
Employing the Once-Only Principle in the Domain of the Electronic Public Procurement:\r
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-44322-1_18\r
\r
E-Procurement in the European Union:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Sebastian-Bobowski/publication/329322569_EProcurement_\r
in_the_European_Union/links/5c86d5d392851c831973a589/E-Procurement-in-the-European-\r
Union.pdf\r
\r
Accelerating Transparency and Efficiency in the Public Procurement Sector for a Smarter Society:\r
eNotification and ESPD Integration for Developing E-procurement:\r
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-981-19-3112-3_25\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f2520794-1f38-4b30-860d-bbc3c558f85f .

