    cav:value "100" .

camssa:d7f82e44-1579-41ac-8be3-d2bff4541383 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By helping administrations to identify and manage possible risks, ISO/IEC 27001 ensures and fosters the continuous availability of administrations data and information.  In the following link you can see an example of audits in public administration. Financial audits require the review of the IT part and with it the ISO/IEC 27001.\r
\r
Application of ISO/IEC 27001 in public administration:\r
https://core.ac.uk/display/196275557'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:90142c96-581a-4e52-80c6-668a921c1cab .

