https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html\r
https://www.w3.org/wiki/LinkedData\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f35b36e6-c465-4d6d-aa0b-6b6831a14071 .

