camssa:d8789c56-6498-43f1-9d94-32e561d8abf9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'This specification refers to the set of rules for data spaces so that they can be interoperable among them. Given that there are many data space projects with very different domains, requirements and architectures, Dataspace Protocol is inherently abstract and can be implemented and/or used in any domain as long as it fulfills the requirements. 

IDSA Dataspace Protocol Specification: https://docs.internationaldataspaces.org/ids-knowledgebase/v/dataspace-protocol/overview/readme'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46cfccbe-9d3b-4de2-a5e6-3f77c5b6c09e .

