        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """IPv4 is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, IPv4 can define the interoperability aspects of the "Network", "Networking Service", "Private Network" and "Public Network" ABBs of the EIRA Technical Application View.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e53108cf-eb4b-45a4-ab0c-952fffe56165 .

camssa:d9f92ba7-13bb-4df3-bc5b-f0a96437ef38 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:d9f94708-5a10-4bbb-9f48-1f2f158d58f3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XHTML has been assessed by the CAMSS Team under the MSP scenario, which is fully compliant with the European standardisation regulation 1025/2012. However, the assessment under MSP scenario is XHTML 1.1 and in the current assessment is XHTML 1.0.\r
\r
XHTML 1.1 MSP scenario:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/camss-assessment-xhtml-11-msp-scenario"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:453f9cda-5d98-41b2-b0a2-2f2ef54e0acd .

camssa:d9fc9db2-f2f8-4b8c-ae2a-93056914b2e2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'In the section 6 of the specification, there is detailed information about its validation.  Moreover, there exist validation services such as CEF eInvoicing, a test infrastructure that allows solution and service providers and public entities to check the compliance of their eInvoicing solution against the standard in a specific syntax: ISO/IEC 19845:2015 (UBL 2.1) or UN/CEFACT CII.  CEF eInvoicing provides a ready to use testing platform, and supports the users of the CEF eInvoicing Conformance Testing service during the entire testing process. There can also be found the ESPD interoperability test bed platform to validate business rules and requirements.\r
\r
CEF e-invoicing conformance testing:\r
https://github.com/ConnectingEurope/eInvoicing-EN16931/releases/tag/validation-1.3.8\r
\r
ESPD Test bed:\r
https://github.com/OP-TED/ESPD-EDM/wiki/Validation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60d075a6-597d-42e3-a3e9-37dea90d51cf .

camssa:da001317-b4ae-44bf-81b4-692f5342960e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the specification is not related to the facilitation of organisational interoperability agreements, \r
therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 614-1 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/11961401/01.01.01_60/ts_11961401v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85f52f8d-b4ed-4056-90fb-d8362219c7d6 .

