        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are many free online tools that perform numerous checking processes in order to verify the conformity of the ETSI Advanced Electronic Signatures which include PAdES.\r
\r
PAdES conformance testing:\r
https://signatures-conformance-checker.etsi.org/pub/index.shtml"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3912c2d7-3620-4d5a-9c10-4acd81c0f652 .

