        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents has established itself as a key reference for representing provenance on the web. Its acceptance and usage continue to grow as more organizations recognize the value of capturing and utilizing provenance information to improve data quality, transparency, and decision-making processes.\r
\r
PROV WG Charter:\r
https://www.w3.org/2011/01/prov-wg-charter\r
\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1d59567-6c20-4c9e-8eb4-a4f852a3204f .

