camssa:da5900d0-65e2-41f2-8450-d03c5adf1a76 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The SMP is aimed to ease the identification of parties in data exchange. This data exchange can be part of a public service delivered by European Institutions. By easing the discoverability and the connection between parties, the specifications can help and foster the delivery of European Public Services including multilingual ones.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:64f225f6-237a-4440-ad89-1a9c73aa9aa7 .

