camssa:dab79f7a-7b51-4c98-9ecd-2d61a7de56b2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has not been found any community sharing their data and knowledge of ISO19944-1 in national nor in European platforms.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e888e7a6-b4e5-47e8-8e83-1abf5ed94523 .

camssa:dab97985-14ad-478e-89d0-39adaa192c01 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'HTTPS verifies the integrity of transmitted data. By using cryptographic techniques, it ensures that the data remains unchanged during transit. If any tampering or modification occurs, the integrity check fails, and the connection is terminated or marked as compromised.\r
\r
HTTPS specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2818'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f35a8409-2d95-44b1-91e1-821c14e281e2 .

camssa:dabbc8a8-ee87-46f0-8a14-9b6227ea6faf a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:dabd298b-91dc-48a2-8869-2ed54db6598f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of UDDI is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

UDDI OASIS reference:
https://www.oasis-open.org/standard/uddi/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:773735a5-b28e-48ba-a98d-bac088488f50 .

camssa:dac282be-e02c-4767-9468-68dfe8ef0473 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:dac585da-9170-4267-b957-17b023506eba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 19941 defines general requirements for interoperability and portability related to cloud services thus, it does not mention extension of the specification. Even so, extension would be most likely possible as long as it does not interfere with the main requirements of ISO 19941.\r
\r
ISO 19941: https://www.iso.org/obp/ui/en/#iso:std:iso-iec:19941:ed-1:v1:en\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c6fa0baa-c3c4-4991-bad5-d883d5eab77a .

camssa:dac631f9-8622-428f-b7dd-c5838f1f9768 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv4 is maintained and developed by IETF which is an international community developing open standards. In addition, it has support from the different Regional Internet Registries (RIRs) in order to ensure the proper development beyond borders. 

IETF organisation:
https://www.ietf.org/

American Registry for Internet Numbers:
https://www.arin.net/

Regional Internet Registry for Europe:
https://www.ripe.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65668949-2270-4be8-a870-bb80d5a6a698 .

camssa:dac7abc5-6d7c-4340-a8d9-cde8cc97aaf7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DPV has not been found to be included in any open repository or catalogue of standards at European level.\r
\r
DPV specification: \r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/dpv/\r
\r
DPV primer document:\r
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/#introduction\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a132618f-6c0e-4b79-8af6-c4b5111818fa .

