camssa:db3436c2-0714-4f8c-8549-89b6b61c4c03 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EN 16234-1 e-CF could be used in a multilingual context beyond its original purpose, which is the representation of a common and standardised e-Competence Framework at European level.\r
\r
CEN reference, CEN/TC 428 - ICT Professionalism and Digital Competences (Published standards), EN 16234-1 e-CF:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=205:110:0::::FSP_PROJECT:67073&cs=15E62ED24D608A5F10D6BEE8E6D50FA10'"""@en ;
