camssa:dba658f0-2468-4dc3-af95-a35bb6bcc83d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'At present, the publiccode.yml specification is not included within the Open Software Observatory (OSOR) in the Interoperable Europe Portal. It is not included as solution, which is understandable given that it is still in an early stage of adoption. However, considering its potential to support European interoperability initiatives and align with frameworks like the Interoperable Europe Act, the specification could be valuable for future EU projects. It could eventually serve as a foundational component for cataloguing software solutions across European repositories, enhancing discoverability and encouraging reuse at a cross-border level.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dbd62b66-0748-4f16-acd3-7871821a4b27 .

camssa:dbabc843-57a2-4149-bfc9-0b2e3f66eb88 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:dbae0a6d-8330-4c36-abbd-da148c51af17 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As one of the official European Standardisation Organisation, ETSI standards are compliant with the European Standardisation Regulation 1025/2012. \r
See: \r
https://www.etsi.org/about/etsi-in-europe"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f3434563-6d68-4701-bf68-aa9bb91c4951 .

camssa:dbae0d82-9758-4fcc-aeca-51dd07937e4e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'[To improve] The specification is being developed publicly using Github, where the different users can participate. There is documentation available that is updated in a regular basis whenever new updates are made and published. However, there is not a big community or organisation giving active active support, so they act in a best-effort manner.

Publiccode.yaml Github:
https://github.com/publiccodeyml/publiccode.yml

Publiccode.yaml Github Issues:
https://github.com/publiccodeyml/publiccode.yml/issues'"""@en ;
