        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ELI system does not inherently provide an access control mechanism. Therefore, this criterion is
considered not applicable to this specification.

ELI reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html'"""@en ;
