        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPv4 is not related to long term preservation of electronic records. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

IPv4 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc791'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b66f9272-b6cb-45cf-a06b-cf228d3f2e96 .

camssa:dbe216ce-c3ca-4822-8dd0-361cf3f47ef0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though the purpose of the SVG is not the availability of digital services from the administration to the stakeholders, the usage of SVG graphics to represent the information contained in Public Administration webpages can help to do so. It can help the understanding of the information provided allowing all people to access electronic public services. Moreover, the specification includes a few comments on how to improve the accessibility to the content making it more discoverable and accessible.\r
\r
SVG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/access.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:332c11eb-dc1c-4bff-a0f5-0d7e91fe3a5b .

