        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As stated in the specification home page and in Joinup, the application is under development and has not
reached a major release v2.0. Nonetheless, the new version of the specification (v1.2) is available since
06 June 2023.

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/

WAI-ARIA roadmap reference:
https://www.w3.org/WAI/ARIA/roadmap

Joinup WAI-ARIA reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/w3c-standards-and-technical-reports/solution/using-wai-aria-html/about'"""@en ;
