camssa:dbfa86ca-b660-46a0-a64b-8dc8d06b18a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'EN 16234-1 e-CF is a self-contained language intended to represent a common European description of the knowledge, skills and competences of the ICT professional workforce. In this sense, the specification allows relevant information to be reused. There is no evidence of any relation between e-CF and the Once-Only Principle (OOP).\r
\r
CEN reference, CEN/TC 428 - ICT Professionalism and Digital Competences (Published standards), EN 16234-1 e-CF:\r
https://standards.cencenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=205:110:0::::FSP_PROJECT:67073&cs=15E62ED24D608A5F10D6BEE8E6D50FA10'"""@en ;
