        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By allowing public administration to have an online domain where they can publish all types of administrative data, documents, videos, etc, the specification reduces the administrative burden. \r
\r
XHTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:84ed57f1-c736-436e-a834-747f1d746153 .

