camssa:dc5cbf1b-88f0-493d-9419-f95252050659 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "As Internet Protocol Stack, IPv4 has been selected by a wide range of European public administrations in order to ensure the data exchange between its different stakeholders. Therefore, the adoption of IPv4 fosters the administration's data visibility and eases the decision-making process. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6be88cf0-7420-4efc-a7a0-019ac19f6e0f .

camssa:dc61a593-6d6f-41bf-a355-3b2c442d35ae a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The data structure of YAML could facilitate the understanding in different languages. Despite this, the main purpose of YAML is not to be used in multilingual context.

YAML specification: 
https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fa078572-5cc7-4efd-ab83-002667364146 .

