camssa:dc866289-ebc0-4601-b7ae-6cb22b79e38e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is not tied to any specific technology or implementation, allowing it to be used in a wide \r
variety of technology environments. ODRL is expressed using standard data formats such as XML and \r
JSON.\r
\r
W3C specification: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b0177abd-450d-4931-a18d-3c563d91d24b .

camssa:dc883465-f268-438e-9f96-bc19718a3d37 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'10 Member States are recommending LDAP in their ICT National Catalogues. This Member States are Austria, Croatia, France, Germany, Greece, Malta, Netherlands, Spain, Sweden and Cyprus.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8c3f01b4-4043-4b45-bd22-715a7d615012 .

camssa:dc8b5b1f-38db-4710-8d57-dd4a29601477 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "60" .

camssa:dc8c6751-f0b9-46d2-9e5a-2b1dbb0fa7b4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT is an RDF vocabulary for representing data catalogues that allows data owners to provide metadata about the datasets they publish. By describing catalogues, datasets and resources, a publisher makes them easily searchable and discoverable.\r
\r
Following the previous statement it can be said that DCAT can enable digital service delivery channels.\r
\r
DCAT (v2.0.0) reference:             \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dcat-2/    '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf570216-0ffb-4149-b8e7-b53cc9b30bfa .

camssa:dc8d4004-4e45-4d09-aa75-3f872e20e758 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:dc8e7e67-8ef9-4987-9b19-91fe85b6a482 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There has notbeen found any project including RDF covering privacy aspects neither at national, nor at European level.\r
\r
RDF primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf11-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ae26819-97c5-421e-a069-475105c7292d .

