        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing public administration to share information with others in a specific format, it fosters the comprehensibility of data (e.g. Administrative rules, processes etc.) and facilitates public administrations decision-making. \r
\r
MIME reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:413006ee-0265-46ef-9656-7349b93279c1 .

