camssa:dce32dc4-267c-4780-95fe-4ddca56efcb9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification has been evolved as part of its lifecycle and the previous version has been the basis for European Solutions regarding the development of interoperable services. This fact ensures that the specification reaches a proper market acceptance for its implementation for the development of products and services. \r
\r
The specification:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b23d1f8-04c8-40ae-ad2e-0ff1e86bd96f .

