camssa:dd1fe290-255a-4572-bd54-3ea0b6c70437 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of CPOV is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0e0bddaf-06f8-4747-a397-8a8bbce7a6ec .

camssa:dd26efb8-d131-4d9a-9601-a4c6c0aa55de a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The rules on European standardisation allow the European Commission to identify information and communication technology (ICT) technical specifications - that are not national, European or international standards - to be eligible for referencing in public procurement. This allows public authorities to make use of the full range of specifications when buying IT hardware, software and services, allowing for more competition in the field and reducing the risk of lock-in to proprietary systems.\r
\r
After being evaluated compliant with the regulation on standardisation 1025/2012, FTP has been identified by Commission Implementing Decision.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:325974d8-97b2-4a4b-afa7-6bd3c926fe22 .

camssa:dd2748a6-740a-404a-9f5d-19a373618f7c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0e9bb259b84413d890a0fd548e40f255bb983a3add2eb7a737283f711e23d523 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:dd280af0-7fb9-4429-9f52-dfda084b7010 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Joinup platform holds a community of developers and government officials that discuss the implementation of the TGF.  Moreover, there has been done some webinars on the use of the framework for the improvement of European digital public services.\r
\r
Rolling Plan for ICT standardisation:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation/e-government'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fada4aa4-13d3-45f8-9770-3012543cb224 .

camssa:dd2a3963-3a30-49ce-a550-db4328384855 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Working Group may not directly engage in community initiatives, but it lays a strong foundation by promoting collaboration and knowledge sharing through its working groups and conferences. This approach might help to build communities around these technologies and facilitates collaboration among stakeholders, ultimately encouraging open data sharing and interoperability at EU level.

IEEE Working Group Projects:
https://www.ieee802.org/3/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f3ebbd1a-4731-4255-bf6d-6885f973a811 .

