camssa:de189802-290e-49f6-b077-fda6e65f183a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SMP can be implemented in any platform, and it is independent of any technology.\r
\r
The specification:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505000"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:06e48d8e-895c-4813-8cc6-c3f8f85cbd76 .

camssa:de19f09c-b10d-45fb-89f1-0f5691a283ce a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While it uses the EU’s General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) as a guiding source for the creation and interpretation of concepts, the ambition and scope of DPV is to provide a broad globally useful vocabulary that can be extended to jurisdiction or domain specific applications.
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b1f1c15-c298-4293-9900-6a135defbde0 .

