camssa:de5faabc-3923-4bb5-8e70-3fbf0b315112 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By using digital signatures, presents in ETSI TS 119 612, data can be shared securely, ensuring that the information exchanged between public administrations or organisations and citizens has not been modified. This mechanism provides a secure way to exchange information, guaranteeing that data shared for the delivery of public services is both secure and trustworthy.

ETSI TS 119 612:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9a2729a4-7bc8-4ed2-9218-b9ce64ab13b7 .

