        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OTel is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF has a high performance on interoperability according to NIFO factsheets.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards

2023 NIFO factsheets: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital\\x02publicadministration-factsheets-2023'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dda2eb9c-821f-4165-91f2-6bba410c7f84 .

