camssa:dedcc011-35a8-4012-8048-a33f6ae0b6da a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the Public Procurement Directive 2014/24/EU and the Commission Implementing Regulation\r
(EU) 2016/7, the ESPD shall be used and adopted by all stakeholders, thus becoming a European Standard.\r
\r
Public Procurement Directive 2014/24/EU:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:32014L0024\r
\r
Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2016/7:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/PDF/?uri=CELEX:32016R0007'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:328d60bb-e7df-4adf-9734-37e349b573a7 .

camssa:dee4e7db-ff65-4d88-98eb-9cdcb3a4e076 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TSP is publicly available for study and use at no cost on the IETF webpage. \r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6be32303-f13b-4193-9cf2-5862e9985721 .

camssa:dee5769f-65f3-4fc1-b84f-6c86ca606734 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of the Dataspace Protocol is often evaluated through various means, including practical implementations and pilot projects. A 2020-paper discusses about the implementation of the IDS Information Model, which is part of the Dataspace Protocol, on top of standard ontologies as well as the process for its continuous evolution and usage of instances of the ontology with the focus on data control and protection in a federated ecosystem, which demonstrates the effectiveness of the specification.

The International Data Spaces Information Model – An Ontology for Sovereign Exchange of Digital Content: https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-62466-8_12'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9bbabb70-8aab-480a-8dfb-99eb083b1d7e .

