camssa:df1093d7-df4b-4ddc-938d-b405bef8a588 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SHACL can significantly contribute to policy-based access control systems by defining rules that determine whether access to certain data should be granted or denied. These rules can also help ensure data processing accuracy by specifying the conditions under which data can be accessed and modified. By enforcing these conditions, SHACL helps prevent errors and inconsistencies in data processing.

"SHACL-ACL: Access Control with SHACL" study:
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-031-43458-7_4

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2987c3ec-be2b-4dfd-a426-f3bf6e65b351 .

