camssa:df3867c6-313c-4bba-a86d-84641e48ae54 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 19944-1 supports the implementation of secure exhange of data is provided  through its emphasis on security controls, data classification, and data governance. Nonetheless, organisations should complement ISO/IEC 19944-1 with relevant industry standards, best practices, and legal requirements to ensure the secure exchange of data within their cloud computing environments.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e95a9caf-6168-4fe7-81b1-ca5639149514 .

