        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There can be found a DCAT-AP discussion forum on the Githoub platform in Danish.  Moreover, The Joinup platforms hosts a community of developers and implementers of DCAT-AP discussing their results from implmenting the specification, and recommending best practices.\r
\r
DCAT-AP discussions in Joinup:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/search?keys=dcat%20ap&sort_by=relevance&f%5B0%5D=group%3Ahttp%3A//data.europa.eu/w21/ac376c94-74cf-4dd7-ade7-267d6a4ec4dc&f%5B1%5D=type%3Adiscussion\r
\r
DCAT-AP DK:\r
https://github.com/digst/DCAT-AP-DK'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2af4a556-646c-42bd-b794-4d9470171577 .

