        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DNS is not related with data portability. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable for this specification. \r
\r
DNS IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1034  \r
\r
Domain Names - Implementation and Specification:                             \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1035   '"""@en ;
