camssa:df5dd062-c4f4-4758-ab51-d6aaf05b918a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """As part of the "IP Stack", IPsec has been selected by several public administrations for secure data exchange over the internet. By allowing the secure exchange of data, the specification fosters the visibility of data across borders.\r
 \r
An example of its implementation is the TESTA project, which provides a secure cross-border data communication network service for public administrations.\r
\r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/idabc/en/document/2097.html\r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/solutions/testa_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c88d1e01-e066-4786-85a5-57137e46e6ba .

camssa:df63506e-8e3e-4bb1-9bfb-d69df30fbff0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI and ENISA are recommending it within documents about guidelines and best practices for securing solutions and services. \r
\r
ETSI SmartM2M; Security; Standards Landscape and best practices:  \r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103500_103599/103533/01.01.01_60/tr_103533v010101p.pdf \r
\r
ENISA Advancing Software Security in the EU: \r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/advancing-software-security-through-the-eu-certification-framework\r
\r
ENISA Good Practices for Security of IoT - Secure Software Development Lifecycle: \r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/good-practices-for-security-of-iot-1"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a9dbfc7f-aade-440b-8804-bf58ec7bb9a4 .

