camssa:dff8fc2a-b0ae-45cb-a8b4-354183366d3d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI EN 319 422 is a European standard, delivered by a European Standardisation organisation (ETSI), \r
according to the specification documentation.\r
\r
ETSI EN 319 422 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319400_319499/319422/01.01.01_60/en_319422v010101p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8b704e04-08fa-45f1-b60b-4a90c127b778 .

camssa:e00be02a-73f4-4fd2-af17-1366b8e44216 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """OpenPM2 is the open version of the PM2 developed by the Commission, therefore, it is publicly available for its use and implementation. Moreover, it is available for everyone with no cost.\r
\r
OpenPM2 specification reference:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/publication-detail/-/publication/ac3e118a-cb6e-11e8-9424-01aa75ed71a1/language-en/format-PDF/source-83307127"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ac8523fd-4cb6-4074-aa0b-a8bc8bcbcdc1 .

camssa:e00c5afe-9475-4e33-b235-4c455102a2d3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The implementation of the specification relies on the HTML or SVG2 specifications. Therefore, WAI-ARIA is not technology-agnostic.\r
\r
WAI-ARIA reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7df0116f-a169-4394-8528-96f2907cd421 .

camssa:e00d1606-f5f1-4766-ba23-fb0b0858d852 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e00ed47c-95f9-431b-9684-849260048a9c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The developers producing dynamic content applications using the IndexedDB should ensure that the content is accessible to users with a variety of technologies and needs. Moreover, the API does not define or require any a user to generate a user interface to enable interaction with the API. In this context, users can provide user interface elements to support the API.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65d00529-98e9-4d2e-9d65-2a0ec04344ba .

camssa:e013890f-7ee6-408b-8375-a96584147eba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XFDL specification, being based on XML can facilitate organisational interoperability by providing a standardised way to represent data. Organisations and Public Administrations can easily exchange XFDL forms and data, ensuring that systems can read, process, and share information consistently across different platforms.

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60dc3c8b-e187-4514-80cd-4abaaa535066 .

