camssa:e01b35b0-6b6f-4214-a33b-c9c6643756aa a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"By helping administrations to identify and manage possible risks, ISO/IEC 27001 ensures and fosters the continuous availability of administration's data and information.  \r
\r
ISO/IEC 27001 reference website:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/54534.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4f29eae7-09ff-4780-8729-a76c2cd9358c .

camssa:e01dcc4e-36f7-416e-8ac3-6e2a8200ad7d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Genericode is developed by OASIS, a standard development organisation based in the US. Moreover, the specification does not appear in any of the main European standard development bodies, therefore, the specification is not a European standard.

Code List Representation (genericode): https://docs.oasis-open.org/codelist/genericode/v1.0/os/genericode-v1.0-os.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e3ca70ec-c68f-426f-bde1-8ad7db4b152b .

