        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'WAI-ARIA enhances assistive technologies to interact with accessibility APIs and can restructure, simplify, stylise, or rescale content to help a different set of users.

EU Commission accessibility:
https://www.eacea.ec.europa.eu/about-eacea/accessibility_en

WAI-ARIA reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/wai-aria-1.2/#at_support'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:36f4a987-40b8-4557-ba01-249922db2d04 .

