camssa:e05b1d92-cf72-4fb5-8239-6d38781e7e3c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The adoption of CLV as a data model does not hamper the scalability of systems. The use of existing data models for the development of common information systems facilitates the development of those systems and improves their interoperability. Additionally, as it happens with all the Core Vocabularies, it can be extended to properly cover a specific need under a specific domain.\r
\r
CLV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-location-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:46fa92d5-0cf9-4136-80de-442e09d80730 .

