        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The European Union Agency for Cybersecurity (ENISA) has invested in the fifth generation of mobile telecommunication (5G), and includes the NFVI specification as a core element of the 5G implementation.\r
\r
Publications Office (OP), ENISA THREAT \r
LANDSCAPE FOR 5G NETWORKS document:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/home'"""@en ;
