        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TSP is developed and maintained by IETF, a widely recognised open international community developing standards to enhance the internet. \r
\r
IETF Reference: \r
https://www.ietf.org/\r
\r
TSP IETF reference: \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
