        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT-AP is already associated to  EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, DCAT can define the interoperability aspects of the "Data Publication Component" and "Data Publication Service" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
See:                                                                                                                                       https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/distribution/access_url/2019-03/76cb237b-0de8-464c-84ca-1327945eac3e/EIRA_v3_0_0_Overview.pdf               """@en ;
