camssa:e120c178-dd92-407c-b963-3a50ec12ccef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is not related to enabling the exposure of interfaces. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
The Dublin Core Ontology enables the exposure of interfaces. The specification provides sets of data elements, described as application profile schemas, which are derived from one or more namespace schemas and optimised for the local needs.\r
\r
DCMI About:\r
https://www.dublincore.org/about/ \r
\r
DCMI Application Profile:\r
https://www.dublincore.org/blog/2011/application_profile'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9327fb0e-08fc-4b80-b134-0b8d325380f8 .

