camssa:e1461994-893b-4f7b-acfa-2591dba6a5bb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DAPS uses Apache 2.0 license therefore, software developers area allowed to alter the source code of existing software’s source code, copy the original source code or update the source code. Furthermore, developers can then distribute any copies or modifications that they make of the software’s source code. The specification is maintained by International Data Spaces Global (IDS-G) and any user can modify it on GitHub.\r
\r
IDS-G DAPS: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/tree/main/Components/IdentityProvider/DAPS'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b2cc5676-9dce-4e06-8dda-66b8a00c7003 .

camssa:e1479c72-d19c-446d-955b-9986f3b8e587 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UBL is an open standard based on XML.  \r
\r
UBL v2.3 reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data: \r
https://5stardata.info/en/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6dfb4370-222e-4e3d-9854-5e8ac9509d32 .

camssa:e1502c9c-0e09-46ef-a128-ff2807ed3d32 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Since internationalization is not core to context information management, any direct support within NGSI-LD systems is limited. Annex G of the specification proposes a series of best practices for maintaining, querying and displaying interoperable internationalized data. For instance, there are specific provisions to associate an Entity or a Property with a Natural Language.

ETSI Context Information Management (CIM); Security and Privacy:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gr/CIM/001_099/007/01.01.02_60/gr_cim007v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d9f92ba7-13bb-4df3-bc5b-f0a96437ef38 .

