\r
JPEG in Joinup: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/digital-compression-and-coding-continuous-tone-still-images-requirements-and-guidelines"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d99643aa-35b9-445f-a010-074e2e10ce32 .

