camssa:e189a0db-bd3d-425b-8080-e6ebd5fd63eb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is a protocol focused on the transaction of data, specifically on the certification of certain data, information or documents which either exist or not. Even though its relation to the data exchange, the specification is not related to data portability in itself, but the data trustworthy exchange amongst Systems and European Public Services.\r
\r
\r
TSP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3161"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ebe58d2c-f505-485a-8dd4-41bc1b61a635 .

