        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of JPEG is not related to the availability of interfaces with internal information systems. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
JEPG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/18902.html\r
\r
JPEG public reference:\r
https://jpeg.org/jpeg/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:00bf14ce-f236-42fb-9508-088fc1787f7b .

