camssa:e1baeb92-5d25-449c-aa5f-d5f85dca15df a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DQV directly addresses data accuracy by allowing organizations to define and document specific accuracy metrics. It provides a framework for describing how data accuracy is assessed, maintained, and complied with industry standards therfore enhancing data usability, discovery, and trust among users by transparently communicating the reliability and suitability of data for specific purposes.

Data accuracy DQV:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-dqv/#DimensionsOfISOIEC25012'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f5f7f42f-d410-4cc0-8fd4-7911fe4fd895 .

