    cav:judgement """'The purpose of DAPS is not related to enabling digital service delivery channels. Therefore, this criterion \r
is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
DAPS: https://github.com/International-Data-Spaces-Association/IDS-G/tree/main/Components/IdentityProvider/DAPS'"""@en ;
