camssa:e1f1bbb2-e837-425b-9df5-1081350058c5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XSD is widely used when exchanging information in XML is needed. Among others, there are two European initiatives that are using XSD to provide e-procurement services. \r
\r
The first initiative is TED eSentool, a free web service of the Publications Office which is focused in allow eSenders to follow-up the process of their notices until publication. \r
\r
The ESPD, is another cross border initiative using XSD for the validation of the XML documents generated while generating eProcurement process and documentation.  \r
\r
TED eSentool Reference: \r
https://esentool.ted.europa.eu/\r
\r
ESPD Reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/single-market/public-procurement/digital/espd'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:28181222-d0f6-4948-847b-f95488be7015 .

camssa:e1f2fc95-b5d2-4b8a-8fd6-3dda335356f4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9420538a5a92af199b492414dd056ab7134e456f005895261b1a5b15a3f2814e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e1fbf9c2-a551-424a-8c4d-14058ce2ad60 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e201cd57-308f-4f61-abef-d88c7ee0c6cd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ETSI is recommending it within a technical report that provides the standards landscape and best practices on security aspects. Therefore, since the European Telecommunications Standards Institute is recommending its use it can be considered compliant with the European Law of standardisation. \r
\r
ETSI SmartM2M; Security; Standards Landscape and best practices:  \r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103500_103599/103533/01.01.01_60/tr_103533v010101p.pdf \r
\r
ENISA Advancing Software Security in the EU: \r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/advancing-software-security-through-the-eu-certification-framework\r
\r
ENISA Good Practices for Security of IoT - Secure Software Development Lifecycle: \r
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/good-practices-for-security-of-iot-1"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b971f962-df2c-45f7-b495-cf4bf4043693 .

