camssa:e20deed2-51f4-4a64-abdc-3bf9e7ce451b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Data on the Web Best Practices gives some advice on how to publish data on the web. However, it does not support the principles of linked open data.\r
\r
Data on the Web Best Practices W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/dwbp/\r
\r
5-star linked open data:\r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1ce1a61d-8b9c-4608-bbd4-d2d54cea0502 .

camssa:e20f1ebc-405b-4ad0-a73b-a2f10e875290 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the specification does not provide explicit mechanisms for ensuring data processing accuracy, it can indirectly contribute to it.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ddddf3e1-0e32-467b-9fa3-359bc94e9a14 .

camssa:e20fd592-8802-493e-ada1-5d9028900f5a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-138786a6e7517e10b94e83ec3b3e7ac79b4c49dcbeaef8d8e993c8df0d173529 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:e21044e3-65c5-45fb-8e40-8217e5d170fd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By validating data published as RDF (Resource Description Framework), SHACL ensures that the data adheres to predefined shapes and constraints, enhancing its accuracy and reliability. This validation process fosters the comprehensibility of administrative data, making it easier for public administrations to manage and utilise their data effectively.

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4e3a61a1-05a6-440f-b35c-07eb7b2d1093 .

camssa:e2133213-2c5c-4b96-8e61-3ae1679e4c35 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:e215c00a-316b-46b7-8754-e1af375fd1ee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"CPOV is included in 1 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Moreover, OSLO extension is used by Belgium. 

OSLO extension:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/oslo-open-standards-local-administrations-flanders

Belgium Catalogue:
https://www.belgif.be/page/specifications.en.html

Spain Catalogue: 
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/ctt/verPestanaActivosSemanticos.htm?idIniciativa=3351

Joinup Catalogue:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a0b2393-5a0d-4859-b764-c7fd1ca448ee .

camssa:e2163103-b7b8-4076-9c64-d788452440bd a cav:Score,
