    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e21766e7-c7a2-4226-80c8-d57002ea075f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Since the RegOrg is involved in cross-border projects like BRIS, it can be considered that exists an interoperability agreement for the inclusion of the specification as part of interoperable solutions. \r
\r
Core Vocabularies in action:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/sites/default/files/news/attachment/eu_core_vocabularies_in_action_using_core_business_vocabulary_in_the_eu_.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:69f4198b-f8b1-4cd0-927c-d3c7ddeefc9d .

camssa:e219e8c3-0df1-4a05-9075-1af748100094 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-6bedf555bffb837990b9eb353447fa116eb9d2384770b1dd3de46d3c5901d4f4 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:e21e0d99-1102-4616-b777-8030837601a4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no Member State that includes the DPV in their national catalogue with Their National Interoperability Framework (NIF) in alignment with the three categories 1. Conceptual model for integrated public servicesprovision, 2. interoperability layers, and 3. interoperability principles.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards

NIFO Factsheets:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ce4f3574-18c2-42ed-8483-74ec4ad9420b .

camssa:e21f74c3-4af7-4bf4-bc85-719dbbdbde63 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CSV has been developed and maintained by IETF. Additionally, the W3C has published a recommendation enhancing specific features of the specification. Both organisation are International Organisations concerned with the development of the Internet.  \r
See: \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4180\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/tabular-data-model/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:36c21f41-4dc2-4bd8-8a88-3f1243e25a1b .

camssa:e21fc257-e0ec-49b7-97d5-03d31075d43b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of CPOV is not related to the authenticity and authentication of the roles agents involved in the data transactions. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.

CPOV Joinup reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:13b535c1-d00d-4056-83d2-d4d92ee00f0b .

camssa:e2239d8c-01a1-4368-af9a-45471a57a737 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Data Quality Vocabulary (DQV) is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF has a high performance on interoperability according to the NIFO factsheets.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards

2023 NIFO factsheets: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public\\x02administration-factsheets-2023'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9caf4cd1-dfbe-49f7-ac47-d0ef017ac615 .

camssa:e2261dab-3781-46fc-98ca-d6c18658fb7b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9420538a5a92af199b492414dd056ab7134e456f005895261b1a5b15a3f2814e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e233885d-2066-4be8-aca6-6e408749a13f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Xforms can be found for free along within the European Collaborative Platform, Joinup.\r
\r
Xforms 2.0 in Joinup platform:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/w3c-standards-and-technical-reports/solution/xforms-20"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85991f17-9f3f-4e1c-8222-c5580e5d9181 .

camssa:e2397062-cb25-4d77-971a-d3c02411f420 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XACML specification provides robust mechanisms for restricting access to information and data through 
detailed and flexible access control policies. These policies can be based on various attributes, combined and enforced in sophisticated ways to ensure that access is tightly controlled according to the specific 
requirements of Public Administrations or any organization implementing XACML.

XACML OASIS reference:
https://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/xacml-3.0-core-spec-os-en.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:92145b64-dd2d-4e21-8e57-976ea73109ec .

camssa:e23fa233-f165-41d6-b0c0-5070b43966a4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'DCAT-AP is already associated to  EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, DCAT can define the interoperability aspects of the "Data Publication Component", "Data Publication Service", "Metadata Management Component" and "Metadata Management Service" ABBs of the EIRA Technical View; the "Base Registry", "Controlled Vocabulary", "Data", "Data Model", "Data Policies", "Data Set", "Data Set Catalogue", "Data Syntax","Forms Structure", "Hash Code", "Metadata", "Reference Data" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
ELIS Catalogue:  \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/news/new-release-elis-501                                                                                                                              '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1ea1a4cd-ed52-478e-8c50-fecac4d91ef3 .

camssa:e24186bd-d165-45ab-8714-13309b6a0d4b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b6ba3f2f556446c68c55833e72b217be87ad5f0dd07744e2c39c6070aff6c10f ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:e2418f12-b3eb-415e-aedc-cb216af72213 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """EuroVoc was developed to support the processing of documentary information. Besides, since it helps to classify the knowledge domains and subdomains it is helpful fostering the visibility of administrative data and supporting the decision-making process. \r
\r
EuroVoc webpage:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/eurovoc"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e4dceb28-f1c9-49f3-b895-3155ef730ee9 .

