camssa:e262e50a-adfc-4a9f-9855-7cebb14f4c0d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox aim to ensure that EU policies and laws are developed with comprehensive stakeholder involvement. To facilitate communication and interaction with stakeholders and the general public, the Commission organises a consultation process, which is published on the 'Have your say' web portal. As part of this commitment, the Commission ensures that all collected contributions are made publicly available. The guidelines and toolbox outline the framework for both public and targeted consultation activities.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

European Parliamentary Research Service briefing
https://www.europarl.europa.eu/RegData/etudes/BRIE/2022/699463/EPRS_BRI(2022)699463_EN.pdf

Have your say portal:
https://ec.europa.eu/info/law/better-regulation/have-your-say_en

European Comission webpage:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation_en#stakeholder-engagement\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5b6716ba-6b61-4885-a050-16f96a2b2dda .

