camssa:e299ab72-9446-4b7f-baaa-654cdf393f14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By simplifying and standardizing the procurement process, the ESPD can contribute to the delivery of more\r
efficient and effective public services across the EU. The use of a single, standardized document can help to\r
reduce administrative burden and increase transparency in procurement procedures, leading to more streamlined and cost-effective procurement of goods and services for public authorities, therefore, simplifying the delivery of European public services.\r
\r
ESPD Business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a87cc7f-76ac-4909-9d42-dc34c8f9239e .

