        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are already existing studies assessing the efficiency of JSON. For example, the study from 2017 assessing the "Efficiency of JSON for Data Retrieval in Big Data".\r
\r
Efficiency of JSON for Data Retrieval in Big Data:\r
https://www.researchgate.net/profile/Kamir-Yusof/publication/320045078_Efficiency_of_JSON_for_Data_Retrieval_in_Big_Data/links/5a3f14ea458515f6b0456f54/Efficiency-of-JSON-for-Data-Retrieval-in-Big-Data.pdf'"""@en ;
