camssa:e36ff709-852b-437c-b2c7-22114a488390 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Better Regulation Toolbox has the support of the European Commission as a developer community. It is the most powerful party giving support to its development and working to enhance through the experience.\r
\r
Better Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf .\r
\r
European Commission webpage:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/index_en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:32b04d69-4144-40c9-bccf-94375917faa6 .

camssa:e372b370-c045-4933-a2fe-416cedd64d6b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'GITB TDL implementations can be partial by supporting only a limited set of constructs. To support this last point, GITB TDL concepts and constructs are formalised using a published taxonomy that can be referenced to understand the TDL constructs that are used (within a test case) or supported (by a test bed).\r
\r
GITB TDL reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/introduction/index.html#where-is-it-used'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ff81d8bb-062b-4b5e-a0de-2193c00e737f .

camssa:e372f369-432a-43be-bbf4-99dfbb4f3f25 a cav:Score,
