    cav:assignedTo sc:c-41c6fd2dadb03cc64aad82cfa14f545c084f1a955a3ab7a61aab416a138c5dce ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:e376ef16-d3bd-4e28-81dd-1db7ea996126 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """By allowing the exchange of digital images, which can provide sensitive information for administrations and stakeholders, the specification helps to avoid the administrative burden related to the non-digital communications.\r
\r
JEPG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/18902.html\r
\r
JPEG public reference:\r
https://jpeg.org/jpeg/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ccbdc375-5e4e-49ab-9f64-3eb695b6ba51 .

camssa:e377a0ed-7101-44fd-9c27-d6e430006d60 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e37ac440-ae1e-4f05-a359-057984bcf823 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'To transmit files that are discontinuous, FTP defines a page structure.  Files of this type are sometimes known as"random access files" or even as "holey files".  In these files there is sometimes other information associated with the file as a whole (e.g., a file descriptor), or with a section of the file (e.g., page access controls), or both.\r
\r
This type includes an additional header field for paged files with page level access control information. The header length must be 5.\r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b14da6f-cfcc-49fb-8e1e-a45bc76b4bc0 .

camssa:e37c3213-4548-4f7b-a9fc-2c4c716ba29f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The Multi-stakeholder platform (MSP) has identified SHACL as referenceable for its use in procurement. The following step is its recommendation by the European Commission based on the MSP's identification. Although this step has not taken place yet, it will take place with all certainty. Therefore, it can be considered that SHACL has been included in an interoperability agreement between organisations involved in European public service provision."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:523db91d-ee66-442a-9442-3bb191c5f754 .

camssa:e37c605a-7a84-4a8f-bd18-05e26de871ec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'An OCSP client requests status from an OCSP responder and suspends acceptance of the concerned\r
certificates until the responder provides a response. In this sense, OCSP enables the secure exchange of\r
data.\r
\r
OCSP reference, section 2:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc2560'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37dc4db2-27c1-405a-9127-a1ce70e9c861 .

camssa:e37dae31-4c81-4ca3-8aa8-69b925e2afe4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-02333ef99fbcb4f101a106bcf97c9559888756b085b1729b7c2ac9626dc4bc63 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:e37db2f5-07bc-42ad-8117-93dd30ef0140 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e37e72d8-feba-4514-bda9-f821b86e06ec a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ESPD can be found in the Tenders Electronic Daily (TED) Developer Docs website. This website publishes projects related to the development of e-procurement related specifications.\r
\r
ESPD business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html\r
\r
TED Developer Docs:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/home/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:444d8e0a-703b-49f5-9ae3-846420e43858 .

camssa:e38508e5-a18f-40d3-9f82-e2c97efd1f58 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG is included in 3 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Estonia, Spain and Sweden. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of these Member States is fully aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
National catalogue Estonia:\r
https://www.mkm.ee/sites/default/files/interoperability-framework_2011.doc\r
\r
National catalogue Spain:\r
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES\r
\r
National catalogue Sweden:\r
https://www.avropa.se/globalassets/dokument/open-it-standards.pdf?_t_id=1B2M2Y8AsgTpgAmY7PhCfg%3d%3d&_t_q=standards&_t_tags=language%3asv%2csiteid%3a95d515a5-23ca-47bf-87a9-07b10d8ac360&_t_ip=178.139.72.144&_t_hit.id=Avropa_Core_Models_Media_GenericMedia/_ff07d720-f793-44b0-994d-27e79b28f6bd&_t_hit.pos=7\r
\r
NIFO factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2401379f-c9b9-45b3-8035-6cd17ea994b6 .

camssa:e3883e8f-fa7a-42df-9c50-bf1da5c1c730 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e389614f-d374-4400-b148-5d9e34422bd0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is compliant with Tim Berners Lee's principles for the Linked Data and, as well, is highly aligned with the different levels of maturity of Tim Berners Lee's 5 stars schema for open data. In fact, RDF is one of the proposed standards for the publication of data as Linked Data. \r
See: \r
https://www.w3.org/DesignIssues/LinkedData.html\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/ld-bp/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:78ffbc18-138b-4730-87f7-7b2a2b52e558 .

camssa:e38da191-6840-4ea9-8328-5d868c9db657 a owl:NamedIndividual,
