        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XSD is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, XSD can define the interoperability aspects of the "Data Syntax" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
