camssa:e4150404-49e4-4739-b3e4-fa12a25dde69 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv6 allows data exchange between systems and it is compatible with the previous version IPv4. 
Furthermore, the European Union fosters IPv6 to the pursuing of the Digital Agenda for Europe and the Digital Single Market Strategy.

"IPv6 framework for European Governments" Reference:
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/ipv6_framework_for_european_governments_0.pdf

IPv6 IETF:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f638f55a-9871-485d-962b-6e537f3da42c .

camssa:e41a8bd0-638d-497a-a278-d00aacb2f28e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-812668363d8f0cc562041fae6c588e1555372bf0bf5c16835be996dd72070013 ;
    cav:value "20" .

