camssa:e49c3b8b-2d01-416e-9a38-ee49e28eded8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although organisational interoperability agreements on the cybersecurity domain are not formalised (see Cybersecurity Act reference), the EN 303 645 specification establishes a cybersecurity baseline for connected consumer products and is intended to set the basis for future IoT certification systems in Europe (see IoT Policy and Legislation reference). This baseline comprises the set of provisions defined in the specification documentation, but is not specifically designed for establishing these agreements.\r
\r
EN 303 645 reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/303600_303699/303645/02.01.01_60/en_303645v020101p.pdf\r
\r
Cybersecurity Act reference:\r
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/cybersecurity-act#:~:text=The%20EU%20Cybersecurity%20Act%20introduces%20an%20EU-wide%20cybersecurity,see%20their%20certificates%20recognised%20across%20the%20European%20Union.\r
\r
IoT Policy and Legislation reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation/internet-things'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b03bb42c-5118-439a-9a77-472199b8c020 .

