camssa:e4b4b151-bed7-4026-adfe-56f030475500 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing the assessment, PAdES is recommended by the European Union as an eSignature standard to ensure that electronic signatures can be created and validated anywhere in Europe. So, PAdES can be considered as an asset to build innovative solutions.\r
\r
eSignature standards:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/wiki/display/CEFDIGITAL/eSignature+standards\r
\r
PAdES ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/67937.html\r
\r
PAdES ETSI reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/102700_102799/10277801/01.01.01_60/ts_10277801v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9e5115e9-cf7e-4fed-b9c8-3855274913f1 .

