    cav:judgement """'Adherence to AS4 standard guarantees Domibus provision of access control mechanisms that allow administrators to define and manage user roles, permissions, and access rights within the messaging platform. These mechanisms enable organizations to control who can access and perform specific actions within Domibus.\r
