camssa:e52527be-dfec-4084-81ce-dbba75224e45 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification defines how different parties and transactions have to be done in order to allow proper discoverability and data exchanges. Therefore, it is defining organisational requirements for the data transaction between two or more parties.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:967c1017-d3f2-4276-bcf6-8f3a811a2fce .

