camssa:e56f2686-2246-40d2-945b-f40388d60d51 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification covers the need for a top-level ontology designed to support information system interoperability expressed by ontology users in these and other areas. In this sense the specification can promote the visibility of administrations on the specific fields where they are operating, since users will be able to browse through them following the specific categories. 

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1d40ebc-88a3-4817-baeb-380e79c68adc .

