        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including XHTML.\r
\r
W3C Patent practice:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:de4b478f-eee4-40d9-8021-9f37e799781e .

camssa:e57b46b0-80ba-4bfe-8378-4238aa2ae968 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Genericode is recommended by four different European Member States. For instance, it is included in the Dutch ICT National Catalogue as a useful standard for defining code lists.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards

Netherlands Open Standards Catalogue: https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden/aanbevolen'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:893edb10-3029-4b2a-9120-d7191d933c59 .

