        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of ISAE 3402 is not related to the enabling of data portability between systems or applications.  Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
ISAE 3402 handbook reference:\r
https://www.ifac.org/system/files/downloads/b014-2010-iaasb-handbook-isae-3402.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:733949fd-2585-4ac4-9c1a-9f72ade395df .

