camssa:e5ee5a3e-04fd-4363-865b-5e2150d4a81a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although MIME itself does not address data protection issues, it can be extended by the Secure Multipurpose Mail Extension (S/MIME) to enhance the security and privacy of email communications, thus contributing to the protection of personal data.\r
\r
MIME specification:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc2045\r
\r
S/MIME specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5751.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:79b6af3d-13f7-45d5-ae4a-4410c67fd890 .

camssa:e5f10c83-165c-4ac8-9783-f157356beec5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8a34a40e5bc5436b3530d898d75a57cf0488591887b31a5169499fe78952d84c ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:e5f472ab-a075-43e8-b680-59d0b19429b0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is available for its use and implementation at the IETF's webpage defined in several RFCs. \r
\r
SMTP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5321\r
\r
SMTP Service Extension for Delivery Status Notifications:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3461"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:51cad9fc-be2a-453a-8255-974f2413216f .

camssa:e5f845e2-9484-4244-b108-a2cf56989b4b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT is available on Joinup, the collaborative platform created by the European Commission to share and reuse IT solutions and good practices.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/data-catalog-vocabulary-0 """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:438a68a7-dd23-41df-a096-8171d1e1df8e .

camssa:e5fd4959-b5f3-4d1a-b714-849a6ffc41ba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "At the moment of performing the assessment, XHTML is used in some cases to develop web pages. However, with the increasing usage of HTML5, no evidences have been found to consider XHTML as an asset to build innovative solutions."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:dd0fe71f-8420-4cd2-9af9-86592dfa8f74 .

camssa:e6013714-65b4-4588-8b87-a110df2e9be0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPsec, which is included in the IPv6 protocol, guarantees the authenticity and integrity of the sent data. IPsec ensures that the content will not change from the original that was sent by the issuer, and that data will reliably reach the receiver.

IPsec IONOS reference:
https://www.ionos.es/digitalguide/servidores/know-how/ipsec-arquitectura-de-seguridad-para-ipv4-e-ipv6/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e24b2647-d459-462a-a1bf-bb69fbacb318 .

