camssa:e62c4e8f-6aac-44a8-8772-5ae6b9df947b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PROV family of documents provides a standardized approach to the representation of provenance information, which can enhance the publication, discovery, and consumption of data on the web by promoting transparency, accountability, and data quality. Moreover, the PROV Ontology (PROV-O) provides a semantic representation of the PROV Data Model (PROV-DM), which allows for linking provenance information with other related metadata and vocabularies on the web. This facilitates the integration and interoperability of data from different sources, as well as the discovery and exploration of datasets based on their provenance characteristics.\r
\r
PROV Primer document:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/prov-primer/\r
\r
PROV Ontology:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-o-20130430/\r
\r
PROV Data Model:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2013/REC-prov-dm-20130430/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:947c4749-e737-4bed-9a94-1321dc0828f3 .

