        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """SAMM is publicly available for implementation and study for free in its dedicated webpage.\r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf\r
 \r
SAMM model: \r
https://owaspsamm.org/model/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3da7ecc7-5fda-4ecb-8fd1-cab029465b14 .

