camssa:e69dfa1e-c69e-4737-9dd8-4c4ac85849c2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of the specification is not related to the visibility of administrative rules, data, services, and the decision-making process. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification.\r
\r
XACML OASIS reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/xacml/3.0/errata01/xacml-3.0-core-spec-errata01.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80532309-afea-47bc-a423-20dde8684b03 .

camssa:e6a0d43e-55a4-487a-b613-cefc7aee6226 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'As the SPECIAL project example shows, DPV is encouraging the creation of communities in European Platforms through the DPV Community Group where knowledge and data is shared to contribute to the regulation of data privacy.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/

Special contribution in DPV:
https://specialprivacy.ercim.eu/dpvcg/176-special-activity-in-w3c-standardisation'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8061ffaf-a8b7-458d-8c9d-bad2f3fb5161 .

camssa:e6a0f6b2-2c35-4440-b30b-4d80ca9f0d70 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES Baseline Profile is available for free at the ETSI’s Catalogue of Standards.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/103100_103199/103172/02.02.02_60/ts_103172v020202p.pdf\r
https://www.etsi.org/standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85d2ade9-7de3-44c9-be9e-f978c3448066 .

camssa:e6a2af06-b240-4c7e-a867-af869369d534 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is technologically agnostic, is a specification based on YAML focused on the description of solutions, specifically, software.

Publiccode.yaml documentation:
https://docs.italia.it/italia/developers-italia/publiccodeyml-en/en/master/index.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0447a081-dbfc-4f66-9650-e641d1c96f59 .

camssa:e6a2e149-cb5b-4e76-b551-dad0f12fcc2b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Extensible Forms Description Language is not related to secure processing of data. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.

Extensible Forms Description Language reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/NOTE-XFDL'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:45e6aca0-bfec-4f93-be09-61426aeefcab .

camssa:e6a47dbe-ba78-4ad9-b656-bcbad8b59676 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """ADMS’s purpose is the description of Assets within a Catalogue (repository), making them easy to discover and reuse. However, it is not related to foster the one-only principle between administrations and stakeholders.\r
\r
ADMS Specification W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-adms/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60cd4b54-ab42-47ec-8394-1204bf2a01ae .

camssa:e6ad0759-37a9-467d-be7b-67367a00dfa7 a cav:Score,
