camssa:e6e8c36b-c68f-49ca-9944-1c69a87e885d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The EN 303 645 specification ensures the protection of personal data according to the sixth clause of the specification documentation (see EN 303 645 reference, section 6 'Data protection provisions for consumer IoT'). Moreover, as an ETSI specification, EN 303 645 is compliant with all the European Regulations and Policies (see ETSI Role in Europe reference).\r
\r
EN 303 645 reference, section 6:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/303600_303699/303645/02.01.01_60/en_303645v020101p.pdf\r
\r
ETSI Role in Europe reference:\r
https://www.etsi.org/about/etsi-in-europe?highlight=WyJldXJvcGVhbiIsIidldXJvcGVhbiIsImV1cm9wZWFuJ3MiLCJyZWd1bGF0aW9ucyIsImV1cm9wZWFuIHJlZ3VsYXRpb25zIl0=\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9cfa10cf-eb99-48dd-ad11-88e9fa1a0964 .

camssa:e6f06ae9-0d56-4249-b4dd-3b9fd609842e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"UDDI is developed and maintained by OASIS, which is an International Organisation developing Standards. After finishing UDDI's last version (v3) the Technical Committee was closed. 
Furthermore, there is at least another community which provides support to people who uss UDDI. This community is uddixml.org, and it's hosted by OASIS.

UDDI OASIS reference:
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/uddi-spec/doc/spec/v3/uddi-v3.0.2-20041019.htm#_Toc85907967

UDDI XML reference:
https://uddi.xml.org/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3e6f26b1-483d-493a-baa2-4e973fc94484 .

camssa:e6f12ae2-fdf0-4d44-bde7-08eb7f92b69b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The alignment data and information with a standardized vocabulary such as EuroVoc can contribute to smoother data transfer and understanding across different platforms, indirectly supporting aspects of data \r
portability.\r
\r
EuroVoc:\r
https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource\r
/dataset/eurovoc'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:25119528-9162-456f-a1f0-a85c1ab47002 .

