camssa:e6fde127-9d58-4473-9dd8-93bc4c4121dd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Even though the version assessed is a very recent version of the specification, it has a strong community supporting it with a clear process of development that has been working towards the maximisation of quality and usefulness. So it can be used in the development of products and services. \r
\r
SAMM webpage:\r
https://owaspsamm.org/\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:98ad431f-20a6-4121-9b26-eaf3a52a2c01 .

camssa:e70856ef-bd0a-458f-b1a9-bd5cec1bdf53 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The once-only principle is an e-government concept that aims to ensure that citizens, institutions, and companies only have to provide certain standard information to the authorities and administrations once.\r
LDAP fosters the OOP in terms of accessibility by allowing administrations stakeholders to keep the contact and access to different distributed services without providing personal data for authentication more than strictly needed. \r
\r
LDAP IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc4511"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:95284332-7c61-4879-bdc0-aeb933a3d675 .

