camssa:e754cd63-ac80-4d67-8295-2b72a61ef3a0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TIFF/IT is high quality image format, it is used to send data for print-ready pages that have been designed on high-end prepress systems. Also, it uses lossless compression.\r
Although the specification complies with the first level of maturity of Tom Berners-Lee's 5-star schema for Open data, it is not enough to consider TIFF/IT as an asset to facilitate the publication of open data.\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/es/ \r
\r
TIFF/IT ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/34342.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:375e32a0-6f1e-4794-a267-96989d813b99 .

