camssa:ff39ce1d-2e19-4b85-8d5f-8b315f8c69f0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C provides a Markup Validation Service for free to validate XML and other specifications markup online._x000D_
Furthermore, the specification has a set of conformance test suites that can be downloaded separately._x000D_
_x000D_
Extensible Markup Language (XML) Conformance Test Suites:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/XML/Test/_x000D_
