camssa:e7d69965-311a-40c1-88d7-0b4dda6271d6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "On the client-side, TLS 1.3 is supported by the Chrome® and Firefox® browsers. Microsoft®  announced implementation of version 1.3 in Q1 of 2019 for their office products. In addition, the three largest crypto libraries have indicated that they will support version 1.3, which also guarantees support at server level in the future. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7d98c52b-4f01-4131-a585-69851fd35162 .

