        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e8834425-3555-49c6-8188-83fb4c3d661e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of Indexed Database API is not related to secure exchange of data since the specification not provide any reference to security considerations.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:88135b49-768d-418e-a242-a16c707a2c98 .

camssa:e8852fc5-e2b2-4929-9c2f-fffbf6923c16 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC 27001 in itself is a method to audit the information systems.  However, the specification does not publicly provide conformance testing requirements, and both testing techniques and auditing services require payment to third parties.  There are, nevertheless, companies such as Vanta, which provide a resource to enable automated measurement of the compliance with ISO 27001 standard.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 27001 reference website:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/54534.html\r
\r
Vanta website:\r
https://www.vanta.com/products/iso-27001?utm_source=bing&utm_medium=paid&utm_campaign=iso27001_rsu_Spain&utm_term=iso%2027001&utm_campaign=ISO+27001+(RSU)+Spain&utm_source=bing&utm_medium=ppc&utm_adgroup=ISO%2027001%20Head%20Term&hsa_acc=4880914058&hsa_cam=15789616753&hsa_grp=1332609418067234&hsa_ad=&hsa_src=o&hsa_tgt=kwd-83288948889188:loc-170&hsa_kw=iso%2027001&hsa_mt=p&hsa_net=adwords&hsa_ver=3&msclkid=fc00bbfdb553107674c4d9b99642b779'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a8300189-d971-4d2b-9fc8-9385c367eef2 .

camssa:e885ad73-c7c0-4f04-b558-0c66dda8fb92 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'FTP is an internet protocol for the exchange of data over an Internet network. It supports the first level of maturity defined in the Tim Berners-Lee´s  5 stars Open Data deployment scheme, "Make your data accessible on the web". \r
\r
FTP Specification Reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc959\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:\r
https://5stardata.info/en/\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a548c54f-b747-4d94-88c4-14b2ea442a6a .

camssa:e888e7a6-b4e5-47e8-8e83-1abf5ed94523 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-847f0d7b5b56f9491b75fadd87efa1d6bdb112bcbb660d2ec7b6d786d403360f ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:e88999c9-8d76-488b-a10c-160f9abf5058 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Assessments of the efficiency of ETSI TS 119 432 primarily involves evaluating the performance, scalability, 
and practicality of implementations. A 2022-paper about digital signatures offers an overview on the regulation and standards perspective and present a comparison of several implementations of long-term preservation solutions that are available on the market. ETSI TS 119 432 is mentioned as one of the main components that sustain recent digitisation efforts made by public and private institutions, expressing its efficiency.


Long-term Preservation of Digital Signatures: a Need-to-have or a Nice-to-have?
https://jmiltechnol.mta.ro/9/6_ARSENI,%20BUREAC%C4%82,%20TOGAN-min.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d87bc4e2-3654-401a-917b-bb9d0fa17afe .

camssa:e88e7f87-e369-4cd6-b700-4143d2a0e3bd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"LDES is not included in any Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications.

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c0b2d957-f744-4dd4-af06-e32796ddcdcd .

camssa:e88f246f-9a8b-41e3-a18c-1684ac35b64b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-450e8a1f4cffbbf3de202e37bd642f098174559028df90ccc657473a6086bc0b ;
    cav:value "0" .

camssa:e896a792-ccdf-461b-a4f5-5f7fb3535665 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UBL is designed to plug directly into existing business, accounting, legal, auditing, and records management practices, eliminating the re-keying of data required by traditional fax, scanned-image and paper-based supply chains and in doing so provides an entry point into electronic business for small and medium-sized businesses.  This means that UBL is an enhancer of internal and external visibility of administrative procedures and data as well as it eases the deliery of european public services, as is the case of the ESPD project.\r
\r
Developer community OASIS. UBL functionalities:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=ubl#functionality\r
\r
UBL v2.3 reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html\r
\r
ESPD reference, Legal framework and context section:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/3.0.1/xml_business_handbook.html#_i_1_1_legal_framework_and_context'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e5834787-2e9f-416a-acb9-cb021b6cc5bd .

camssa:e898a8b6-6d65-4675-87c5-482874e1bcb9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SMP is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications whose Member State NIF is fully aligned with at least 2 out of 3 sections of the EIF according to NIFO factsheets.\r
\r
NIFO factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2022\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/camss-list-standards '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e41a8bd0-638d-497a-a278-d00aacb2f28e .

camssa:e899367e-e519-4a0f-81ec-524ff4b3fa62 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ESPD is designed to be a modular document, which means that it can be used to collect information at\r
different stages of the procurement process. Once information is provided in the ESPD, it can be reused throughout the procurement process, eliminating the need for suppliers to provide the same information repeatedly, therefore, allowing relevant information to be reused when needed, by means of integrating the CCCEV model. More information can be found in the ESPD Technical handbook.\r
\r
ESPD business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html\r
\r
ESPD Technical handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_technical_handbook.html\r
\r
CCCEV:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2a6581a0-bc32-46b4-8c55-46beaba4b109 .

camssa:e8a0dc4b-a41d-413f-8484-80900f4287c6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b71e04068a444f6ee23c0863df43f19957762528381d6edece40e35c0efab242 ;
