        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """TIFF/IT is an ISO standard and as all ISO standards, they have to be paid to access its content. However, it can be partially checked out in SIS (Swedish institute for standards) website where the content is aligned with the ISO standard.  \r
