camssa:e8b52383-7a1a-4503-9e5a-287fff86d158 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the time of elaborating this assessment, this specification is not included in any EIRA ABB in the current EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). However, HTML5 which is an improved and newer version of the specification is included. More specifically, HTML5 can define the interoperability aspects of the "Human Interface" and "Representation" ABBs from the EIRA Semantic and Technical views.\r
\r
