camssa:e8fda9bb-92b4-43ea-95e5-a39044fc3fa7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The current specification, EN 319 532,  supersedes TS 103 640, which has been in force during years as stated in the ETSI TR 110 000 documentation. It has been used and implemented according to user needs and the specification being assessed takes all the inputs gathered during the usage and implementation of the superseded one to improve it and upgrade according to new user needs.\r
TS 103 640 last update is published by ETSI dated at March 2022, version 1.2.1\r
\r
Technical Report TR 119 000 EN 319 532 (page 32):\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/119000_119099/119000/01.02.01_60/tr_119000v010201p.pdf\r
\r
First release date reference (2018):\r
https://portal.etsi.org/webapp/workprogram/Report_WorkItem.asp?WKI_ID=56725\r
\r
Last release date reference (2019) in right upper side of any documentation page:\r
https://portal.etsi.org/webapp/workprogram/Report_WorkItem.asp?WKI_ID=56725'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d585c367-6c98-4238-8ed1-6abd9b3641a2 .

