https://owaspsamm.org\r
\r
SAMM documentation: \r
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Supporting%20Resources/v2.0/OWASP-SAMM-v2.0.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:84c0be2e-acbe-4cae-ab24-e11321900371 .

camssa:e90c6bf1-3a5d-4e84-a034-f6c9cedffa15 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'YAML is commonly used for configuration files. The specification can be used to create simple configuration files, thus, ignoring more complex features. In addition, it can be adopted and implemented gradually, depending on the organitzation needs.

YAML specification:
https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:547d0ed9-4564-46e5-bd0a-08f044e6cbfd .

