        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UTF-8 is a sector agnostic specification which means that can be used in any business domain requiring data encoding. \r
\r
UTF-8 specification:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc3629\r
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:11e4b58e-1ade-4212-ae4d-e33ea8eae1c9 .

camssa:e94b350a-8756-4e61-a93b-18548173208e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of Standard for Public Code is not related to the modelling of business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. \r
