    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the GITB TDL is to provide a syntax for conformance and interoperability testing. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification.\r
\r
GITB TDL reference:\r
https://www.itb.ec.europa.eu/docs/tdl/latest/introduction/index.html#introduction'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b8f48f0e-08af-479b-947d-c208dd97d8bd .

