camssa:ea9f75cd-7a74-4017-9c09-d92966251a5e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPv4 specification can ensure authentication through an IPv4/IPv6 authentication agent. This mechanism is a software application that securely passes user authentication requests to and from the RSA Authentication Manager. In addition, the IPv4 authentication agent software offers a service (authentication) that processes these requests.

IPv4 authentication agent:
https://community.rsa.com/s/article/IPv4-IPv6-Authentication-Agents-aa7bd0d4'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e30cc9ed-1053-438e-a818-c2953f462ec9 .

camssa:eaa2d71c-3f35-4793-977f-9b4121c99846 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"During the project's duration, the E-ARK CSIP received attention and interest from professionals and organizations involved in the management and preservation of digital information. The project team actively sought feedback and input from stakeholders, and the specification was developed in consultation with experts in the field. This collaborative approach helped ensure that the CSIP reflected the needs and requirements of the archival community. An evidence of its market uptake may come from the fact that The DILCIS Board is supported by the European Commission through the CEF eArchiving Building Block.\r
\r
CEF eArchiving:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/egovernment/solution/cef-earchiving/about\r
\r
E-ARK CSIP specification:\r
https://earkcsip.dilcis.eu/#introduction\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cdeabfb3-464c-4201-86b9-7641d8d6b569 .

camssa:eaa2ed2c-7c4e-4595-9860-f067c5b82791 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
