        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'After searching the different national catalogues, there has not been found any European Member State recommending ETSI TS 119 612.

ETSI TS 119 612:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119600_119699/119612/02.02.01_60/ts_119612v020201p.pdf'"""@en ;
