camssa:eb6a7c35-f4b1-40b1-89f3-3b6f8f310eb0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """No tools assessing the conformity of implementations with the specification have been found\r
\r
However, there are tools developed by the FTP community assessing FTP servers performance. \r
\r
See: \r
https://ftptest.net/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1100cf8d-b389-481a-ba0b-e0f7d32ed463 .

camssa:eb75307b-43e7-4604-b411-6b2b1957dfb1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By creating a standardised taxonomy for data privacy concepts and terms, the DPV is enabling the exposure of interfaces as it is intended to enhance semantic interoperability about personal data processing and enable data portability for data subjects.

DPV specification:
https://w3c.github.io/dpv/primer/
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:314021c2-b4cd-4797-9755-e8542b6f69f1 .

camssa:eb775f25-4ef4-4706-831d-a76932d357bd a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:eb7d25c9-0ffb-49ed-8fd9-30303e81f63a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "HTTP does not defines a cross-sector reusable data model. HTTPS is a transfer protocol used for secure communication over a computer network."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9372b9cd-eb9f-4e66-92bf-e7f3498f3536 .

camssa:eb7f6b0a-23d5-4a5d-8837-5cd2cddd8902 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of Verifiable Credentials is often evaluated through various means, including practical implementations, pilot projects, and community feedback. For example, the effectiveness of Verifiable Credentials is often evaluated based on its adoption in various use cases and the W3C Working Group has published a collection of those:\r
\r
Verifiable Credentials Use Cases: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-use-cases/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5077e316-06d8-47d7-9a20-070d6cab36e1 .

camssa:eb8a64a3-0427-4fff-b3f8-9f42aaf0b032 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "HTTP is the main protocol underlying the world wide web. The protocol supports the exchange of high amounts of data."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b77e818c-b0e7-4533-9a55-536229eef897 .

camssa:eb9475bf-afb0-4631-9217-cf4906a2ff88 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """At the moment of performing this assessment, Linked Open Data portals are innovative solutions adopted by public administrations all around Europe. DCAT-AP fosters the implementation of Five-Star Linked Open Data by allowing users to discover interlinked information from other portals. \r
\r
See:\r
https://www.ontotext.com/knowledgehub/fundamentals/five-star-linked-open-data/\r
https://www.europeandataportal.eu/en\r
http://data.europa.eu/euodp/en/home\r
http://data.jrc.ec.europa.eu/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70555d3c-712e-4a95-94ce-757fe72d694b .

camssa:eb962966-f9de-4131-aa61-03586514804b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The GraphQL specification is not recommended by any European Member State.\r
\r
CAMSS Lists Of Standards: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cd0ac5cf-a2da-4ea2-aca5-b0ea32638411 .

camssa:eb97ffbc-eb13-41b0-bad3-5c43a6dba239 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

