camssa:ebd9a8e5-4640-4842-84a3-68fdcc078013 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SCIM has a specific section that lists SCIM 2.0 and SCIM 1.1 implementations that are directly used to create innovative solutions. For instance, Microsoft uses SCIM 2.0 to develop and plan provisioning for a SCIM endpoint in Microsoft Entra ID.

SCIM: https://scim.cloud/

Azure Active Directory SCIM Provisioning: https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/entra/identity/app-provisioning/use-scim-to-provision-users-and-groups'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0580f481-9b94-4269-85a1-77ff4406e0c1 .

