camssa:ebebaa64-3c54-4160-b2c1-1986083f824d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Linked Data Event Streams (LDES) is designed to be platform-agnostic. The key idea behind Linked Data Event Streams is to provide a standardized approach for representing and publishing real-time event data on the web using Linked Data principles. The use of web standards, such as RDF (Resource Description Framework) and HTTP, contributes to the platform-agnostic nature of Linked Data Event Streams.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3260e37a-3a07-453f-ad91-85abc29ca016 .

