camssa:ec09b8b6-9e58-406d-9f3d-688c0ba6e253 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "JSON in itself does not provide security features, which is a weakness per se. The storage of private date as JSON format is not recommended in order to avoid malicious activities against stored information. Despite this, there are several additional features with the aim of protecting data exchange."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6c2420ff-2d0b-4b83-91ae-eb77568b5541 .

camssa:ec0a7a69-56f3-4ed3-9b09-0c434c856a11 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The Registered Organisation Vocabulary was first developed and published by the European Commission ISA Programme with support from the Directorate General Internal Market and Services. The Semantic Interoperability Community (SEMIC) as an action of ISA², has established Working Groups. These Working Groups are open to the participation of everyone interested in semantic solutions working for public administrations in the Member States or in EU institutions.\r
\r
SEMIC working groups:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/about"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f095bd0a-07dc-4827-91ff-199468e14973 .

