camssa:ec796713-7e89-41fb-a58e-3eccb345adef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SmartM2M (Study for oneM2M) and the European Student Card are considering the use of GraphQL. Furthermore, the VAT4SME initiative is willing to include in their formal agreements with organisations or administrations involved the use of GraphQL as a European public service component.\r
\r
SmartM2M - Study for oneM2M (ETSI):\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103700_103799/103715/01.01.01_60/tr_103715v010101p.pdf\r
\r
European Student Card (Erasmus+):\r
https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/european-student-card-initiative/help-support/technical\r
\r
VAT scheme for Small Businesses reference:\r
https://taxation-customs.ec.europa.eu/vat-scheme-small-businesses_en'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a08bc686-66ec-4167-87ff-cfd4c4e67a0d .

