camssa:ec84dbd4-9438-42d2-957d-aef3b9ea9407 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification of SVG is available for free, at the European Platform Joinup. Also, it can be checked on the W3C official webpage:\r
\r
SVG 1.1 on Joinup: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/scalable-vector-graphics-svg-11-specification/distribution/scalable-vector-graphics-svg-11-specification\r
\r
W3C Specification: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/SVG11/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b44480ab-9554-406a-a68e-ae7e00f3325b .

camssa:ec86df50-8833-4799-86aa-23998f1f145d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:ec87c5e9-091d-46ee-b21b-0683b7bdc8c2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, HTTPS is  a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. HTTPS is therefore licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
See:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:92c1f05d-5c90-4cfd-9a47-b41d1dd2fe76 .

camssa:ec8a9395-9927-47d8-8bd6-a45e60b5677c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"WSDL enables service providers to define the interfaces and operations of their web services in a standardized manner. This can facilitate interoperability between different systems and services, making it easier for European public services to exchange information and functionality. Moreover, the specification helps to make administrations and stakeholders' web services available, with information related to them and endpoints that ease the consumption. This fact supports the reuse of data and web services avoiding administration and stakeholders to carry out unnecessary steps or transactions.\r
\r
W3C WSDL specification:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/wsdl20/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:77338ac5-6c9d-4922-b1c0-3ba38415648a .

camssa:ec8d307a-4967-47eb-9e1e-5d83e6dcc491 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-02333ef99fbcb4f101a106bcf97c9559888756b085b1729b7c2ac9626dc4bc63 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:ec8dd9b8-8db3-478f-82e3-85f9c86e7435 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XML can be used independently from any other technical specifications or operating system.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2006/REC-xml11-20060816/ """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:61ea8725-5e1b-49a5-9c69-d8af5b788fd3 .

