camssa:edd269ec-5f6f-40d3-a09d-6556760299ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ESPD itself does not enable access control mechanisms, but it can be used as part of a wider system\r
or platform that includes these mechanisms.\r
\r
Commission Decision (EU, Euratom) 2017/46 of 10 January 2017 on the security of communication and\r
information systems in the European Commission:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?qid=1548093747090&uri=CELEX:32017D0046\r
\r
ESPD business handbook:\r
https://docs.ted.europa.eu/ESPD-EDM/latest/xml_business_handbook.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2f1358d2-cfe3-4cf9-be52-1abfce4ef2c8 .

