camssa:edd7221e-87c2-4e5f-9e7b-bfa94b468ac6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The use of a shared ontology like SAREF can significantly reduce complexities and barriers in establishing interoperable systems across organizational boundaries. SAREF can be used to technogically maintain a single consistent definition of various concepts in the IoT domain, which can facilitate interoperability agreements in that field.

SAREF: 
https://saref.etsi.org/core/v3.1.1/

SAREF repository:
https://labs.etsi.org/rep/saref/
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:30a4f48e-00ba-4601-a5f2-d6c864e634fd .

