camssa:ee0598f3-8783-4ce0-903c-0e454dc483b5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing the authentication for using services SAML 2.0 can enable the exposure of interfaces to access the public administrations services by simplifying its access. Moreover, it can be used internally by public officers which enhances the decision-making process, but it is not its main purpose.    \r
\r
SAML 2.0 Reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/security/saml/Post2.0/sstc-saml-tech-overview-2.0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7ba12635-64e6-485a-823c-c9e9977b6c3f .

camssa:ee08f21e-9123-44bd-8d03-1b89760e5835 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Like all the IETF standards, MIME is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore, MIME is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3668"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:86d2a973-2477-4984-b122-c1aec5cdfea5 .

camssa:ee0ceaaf-b10d-45b9-961b-a49c54c872e2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """UDDI is available for free for its use and study at OASIS' webpage. \r
See:\r
http://www.uddi.org/pubs/uddi_v3.htm"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bbf3b944-ee9a-4820-824b-771460a2c762 .

camssa:ee0d0e15-710d-4c58-bfc2-b72a9afbe632 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:ee10370e-a7c3-4476-9194-2d70f2506265 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:ee107255-a359-4978-94aa-ad0910d9130a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of the Core Location Vocabulary is to create a reusable and extensible data model that captures the fundamental characteristics related to locations. By providing a set of information to describe data in the sectors mentioned before, it helps public administrations with the visualisation of people, locations or business.

Core Location Vocabulary:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/solution/core-location-vocabulary/release/100'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1392914f-ea1f-488d-bef4-37e11db054ce .

camssa:ee107d3a-d0e2-4b00-aa11-e5ad40da148d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox includes requirements for the alignment with relevant regulations at European level such as eIDAS, GDPR, Cybersecurity Act, etc. Ensuring that the development of policies and laws is aligned with the main legal acts, including the interoperability ones. In this sense, the Better Regulation Toolbox supports the establishment of public services and tools fostering data portability, specifically on Tool 28. DIGITAL-READY POLICYMAKING.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf

eIDAS reference:
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation

GDPR reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/EN/legal-content/summary/general-data-protection-regulation-gdpr.html#

Cybersecurity Act reference:
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=LEGISSUM%3A4398780'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e4c15e1d-ca5b-403d-b606-5c3fa2e0f78c .

camssa:ee115734-111f-4829-9130-7888085734be a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "80" .

camssa:ee2012f8-3688-438b-91ee-ba885f466ef9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Zaragoza's City Town hall using HTML5 exemplifies the promotion of the once-only principle work towards unifying the services offered regardless of the platform.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/2012/12/html5-cr.html.en"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8cf4a8aa-4bb7-49cd-bfe6-1c9f032de00f .

camssa:ee210c2c-de19-4544-9727-067f4fcd4c05 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The purpose of RegOrg is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is considered not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
RegOrg Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/registered-organization-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f4117389-7cd2-4057-badf-c88df8663138 .

camssa:ee25a3c9-fcc7-4253-88c8-bb7366081069 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification can help to ensure the privacy by design, as EIRA foresees and includes specific ABBs related to guarantee that privacy is considered as requirements in the analysis of solutions that will lead to privacy in the implementation phase. To be more specific, EIRA provides the set of specific ABBs in a viewpoint that are key to achieve privacy, and to consider it from the very beginning. Additionally, which the flexibility that provides the specifications, it can be extended and specialised as needed to ensure that specific needs and requirements are covered. 

EIRA reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/european-interoperability-reference-architecture-eira
/solution/eira/release/610

EIRA Github Repository: 
https://github.com/CarTool-EC/EIRA'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc4ac03c-b902-426e-a400-b62b57a8e1e9 .

camssa:ee2a135e-e557-43c6-b9e6-bcf0f561e8b0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'YAML can help enabling the visibility of administrative procedures by listing public administrations services or having a record of interested people. Moreover, configuration management allows to store software configurations to make them more accesible. In addition, it also allows defining automation workflows, making the steps and logic of administrative processes more explicit  and reviewable. 

YAML specification:
https://yaml.org/spec/1.2.2/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4de85f7d-046d-4b1d-ba5c-39030aac985f .

