camssa:ee2cef7a-771f-4caf-8275-e5f997e77761 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Advanced Encryption Standard (AES) allows information protected by AES in one system to be used and understood by any other system that also correctly implements the standard and possesses the appropriate key.

AES Standard Reference:
https://csrc.nist.gov/pubs/fips/197/final'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9cd053d4-12b7-4c00-a225-91bbd0643d10 .

