        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to the NFV home page, services are deployed by complementing Software Defined Networking (SDN) and NFV. However, the NFVI specification does not rely on any operating system, therefore this specification is platform-agnostic.\r
\r
NFV reference: \r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/nfv/nfv'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cf9abc9d-7330-4bf5-8176-4be38e6d8f59 .

