camssa:ee840d54-3dd5-4d40-9587-8091b7769f53 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CPOV is included in 1 national catalogue of recommended specifications. It belong to Spain. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Spain is fully aligned with at least 2 out of 3 sections of the European 
Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) 
factsheets. 

CPOV Spain national catalogue: 
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/ctt/verPestanaActivosSemanticos.htm?idIniciativa=3351

NIFO factsheets:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets

CAMSS List of Standards:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss
/camss-list-standards'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c234ca14-0e34-404c-80b6-93903a40755b .

