camssa:ee9a6366-e11e-43f5-bd7a-970508b4fb5b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Numerous studies have been conducted to evaluate the efficiency of TLS 1.3, offering detailed insights into how this version addresses critical security challenges, optimises performance, and meets modern technological demands. One report worth highlighting is the Encrypted Traffic Analysis by the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity (ENISA) which explores the current state of affairs in Encrypted Traffic Analysis and in particular discusses research and methods in 6 key use cases.

Encrypted Traffic Analysis by the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity:
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/sites/default/files/publications/ENISA%20Report%20-%20Encrypted%20Traffic%20Analysis.pdf

TLS 1.3 ADOPTION IN THE ENTERPRISE by Paula Musich:
https://www.f5.com/pdf/reports/tls-1-3-ema-report.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5d723bbf-c5d9-4334-8b07-af0814546382 .

