camssa:ef0fcfde-49dd-4133-a308-64384b32e6ea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The CPSV-AP specification provides a standard way of describing public services that can be used across different countries and jurisdictions, and it facilitates the exchange of information and data between different systems and platforms.\r
\r
CPSV-AP Joinup webpage:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-service-vocabulary-application-profile/release/22'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0cdf765e-1679-4bd6-a1e7-abf19dc96f72 .

camssa:ef12995a-9c88-4f3b-9374-98043ab8acac a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of SMTP within any European catalogue of standards. However, a variant of SMTP that is safer in terms of network security, DANE for SMTP, is included in the European list of ICT Standards for e-procurement.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f89ab23e-3935-4c00-a401-b6bc4f5d26bb .

camssa:ef154680-d269-4be5-8396-cddc6aaff4ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The secure exchange of data using iCalendar can be achieved by implementing additional security measures, such as encryption, authentication, and using secure communication protocols like HTTPS, when transmitting iCalendar data between systems and applications.\r
\r
iCalendar specification:\r
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc5545'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:33a4e347-179b-470e-b88c-b9080de6f7e3 .

