camssa:f076c6a5-4f1d-451e-b3f8-113b5a507b3d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox is publicly available and aims to help public administrations in the development of public policies and laws according to real needs while it makes the process and data generated more transparent, fostering the accountability of public administrations.

Better Regulation Guidelines and Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/law/law-making-process/better-regulation/better-regulation-guidelines-and-toolbox_en

Better Regulation Guidelines reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/d0bbd77f-bee5-4ee5-b5c4-6110c7605476_en?filename=swd2021_305_en.pdf

Better Regulation Toolbox reference:
https://commission.europa.eu/document/download/9c8d2189-8abd-4f29-84e9-abc843cc68e0_en?filename=BR%20toolbox%20-%20Jul%202023%20-%20FINAL.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:04b8ae39-f58d-41ed-a51c-617eb404bde0 .

camssa:f078152a-2c96-4325-a932-576acada9b67 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CPOV is part of the Core Vocabularies, which allow for extension. One of the extensions available for Core Vocabulary family is the OSLO extension, which extends the Core Vocabularies to include properties and relationships, like family composition, contact details, or persons acting on behalf of a registered organization. Despite this, CPOV its also a simplified, reusable, and extensible data model.

OSLO extension for Core Vocabularies:
https://www.w3.org/2013/share-psi/workshop/berlin/EuropeanInteroperabilityTheISACoreVocabularies

CPOV extension reference:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary/distribution/core-public-organisation-vocabulary-version-100-pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:962f5665-e742-4a31-9e14-ea099208c167 .

