        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Indexed Database API specification is addressed to the storage of information. In this context, the specification allows for the storage of large numbers of objects locally and retrieving them when needed, by using an index. However, the reuse of information is limited to browsers.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:97fbd3ce-ecf4-4f84-9883-99e0df5fbb44 .

