camssa:f0e3e1ae-c817-4909-b1b2-ecd548ad21a9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPv6 allows for implementations and extensions that can be implemented incrementally or separately. There is a recommended command to implement the header extensions, but it is possible to implement them independently.

IPv6 extension headers:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2460#section-4'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7aeb7d23-d9c7-4af8-b661-637615154a02 .

