camssa:f0e67b77-9e16-4017-b579-1764ec1f8e73 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'According to section 4.4 of the documentation, ETSI TS 119 512 provides an interface between users and preservation services, however, specific provision are fully achieved if it is combined with its companion documents ETS TS 119 511 therefore, enabling the visibility of administrative procedures, rules and services if combined with other specifications.\r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf\r
\r
TR-ESOR Preservation of Evidence of Cryptographically Signed Document:\r
https://www.bsi.bund.de/EN/Service-Navi/Publications/TechnicalGuidelines/TR03125/TechnicalGuidelines_03125_node.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cac9b30a-7482-4954-b49c-b910ad799850 .

camssa:f0e75633-1ba1-4a0f-ba30-12e5ca64c870 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The Internet Protocol is a key point in the data exchange through the internet. In its aim to ensure communication over computer networks eases the availability of interfaces with internal information. This fact allows the administrations to exchange and reuse data with each other. "@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d452df62-c564-404f-8c7b-3501a80b925d .

camssa:f0e78924-0b52-40cb-810d-51172075c09f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OAS has been found to be include in the national catalogues of The Netherlands and Malta.\r
\r
National Catalogue of The Netherlands:\r
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden\r
\r
National Catalogue of Malta:\r
https://mccaa.org.mt/Section/Content?contentId=1243'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2de69741-9d64-4183-9e04-1de18ea91aea .

camssa:f0eb0438-fa0a-4c39-976e-f9e802ca2618 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The main objective of the Portable Document Format/A (PDF/A) is to allow text format and images to be independent and work for any software, hardware or operating system. So it can be said that PDF/A is independent of any specific technology or platform."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:679e60c7-e19d-4fe9-af1d-4bb5febeec3d .

