        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification is included in 10 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. This are: Bulgaria, Cyprus France, Germany, Greece, Malta, Netehrlands, Portugal, Spain, Sweden.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1f574378-6dca-4d67-935d-0ff9ad8c33eb .

