camssa:f126004b-4f14-4598-ad0d-35b5c5d5e689 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are existing documentation and studies assessing the effectiveness and efficiency of CSS v2.1. It is a comparison between 3 versions, CSS, CSS2 and CSS3. As well, the study shows the improvement of the different versions over time as resulting in more efficient and faster web designs.\r
\r
Comparison CSS2 and CSS3:\r
https://hackr.io/blog/difference-between-css-css2-and-css3"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6255a5a0-5261-4864-af8e-05a7c88e9df3 .

