camssa:f13b4616-e261-437b-aba2-510d556b97e9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After checking the different standard catalogues at supra-national level, there is no evidence of the inclusion of TIFF/IT within any European catalogue of standards.\r
\r
ICT technical specifications:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/growth/industry/policy/ict-standardisation/ict-technical-specifications_en \r
\r
CEN search tool catalogue:\r
https://standards.cen.eu/dyn/www/f?p=CENWEB:105::RESET::::\r
\r
CENELEC search tool catalogue:\r
https://www.cenelec.eu/dyn/www/f?p=104:107:0::::FSP_LANG_ID:25"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:422e332d-83b1-407a-8047-986a4f7cdf2c .

camssa:f13cb912-ddf6-4f75-8516-276b0e4abce2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
