camssa:f13ef773-df6d-4609-b039-31b7126415b6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """EuroVoc is used for the EU Open Data Portal, the site where EU Institutions publish their datasets for their reuse. In there, it is also used the classification of EuroVoc in order to improve the shareability, researchability and interoperability when processing the data. It helps to link data under knowledge domains.  \r
\r
EuroVoc in EU Open Data Portal:  \r
https://data.europa.eu/euodp/es/data/dataset/building-stock-observatory\r
\r
EuroVoc reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/browse/eurovoc.html?locale=en\r
\r
Tim Berners-Lee 5-star schema for Open Data:   \r
https://5stardata.info/en/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1cb058e0-6f49-48e4-8f14-7134e95b7711 .

camssa:f13fd325-45e9-4ef4-a3f0-524e0c5e689d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """CPOV is a business domain agnostic data model that can be reused in a cross-domain way.\r
\r
CPOV Joinup reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-public-organisation-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:634d8ed0-5284-4b79-b42d-f13bd47889fc .

camssa:f145b354-9afb-4c5e-9afe-d0563e8a7372 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Like all the IETF standards, this specification is a free and open technical specification, built on IETF standards and licenses from the Open Web Foundation. Therefore it is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
No IPR disclosures have been submitted directly on this RFC.\r
\r
Intellectual Property Rights in IETF:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc8179'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:267756c5-6974-4cc9-93b0-f258e94f3882 .

