camssa:f21b8b44-1195-4988-accd-89f75c53d941 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'When facilitating information exchange between systems and applications, the specification contributes to enabling data portability. In this context, it plays a significant role in exporting stored data in JSON format, promoting data portability.

Indexed Database API:
https://www.w3.org/TR/IndexedDB/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a1c1bd3a-f18a-4adc-8f7d-53864718c9f3 .

camssa:f2338adc-b89e-435a-bfc2-888a4af85225 a cav:Score,
