        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-8a34a40e5bc5436b3530d898d75a57cf0488591887b31a5169499fe78952d84c ;
    cav:value "2" .

camssa:f2db68f1-0555-4b0a-aaed-65c8a52ca801 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'One of the key features of LDAP is that it enables a centralized managment of directory information, and the administrators can mantain consistency and control of the data across the organization. Moreover, there are mechanisms that guarantee the confidentiality of data, like SASL or TLS.

LDAP Wirex reference:
https://wirexsystems.com/resource/protocols/ldap

TLS cloudfare reference:
https://www.cloudflare.com/learning/ssl/transport-layer-security-tls/

SASL gnu reference: 
https://www.gnu.org/software/gsasl/manual/gsasl.html#SASL-Overview'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ec1378be-7568-4407-a52d-3731014279a3 .

camssa:f2e0281e-b764-4f81-99f4-6c2e05d06382 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d9b9ce1d270550422a8ea6097d2ffa1d923267fd681c56280e3b7810a14a580a ;
    cav:value "100" .

camssa:f2e1ccc3-7961-4d2c-9672-c7d2c6f321c6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-4a006ad6785e066d16c13daf48a60ee43ec33d1de1b06613c8e656ccf330a6d5 ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:f2e34cb7-d4ab-40df-bad9-6f778d3c4406 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of NFVI is not related to the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
NFVI Deliver, Infrastructure Overview section 4:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gs/NFV-INF/001_099/001/01.01.01_60/ '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:edd0b7a6-c946-4b05-a253-6d9e83601298 .

camssa:f2e8a4fd-2985-4863-b240-e9b49008e935 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Although no evidence of BFO facilitating digital service delivery channels, the specification could enable the migration of services and data across various platforms, making it an efficient and flexible solution for digital services.

BFO reference:
https://www.iso.org/standard/74572.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e2163103-b7b8-4076-9c64-d788452440bd .

camssa:f2e9bb3f-4200-4b0d-84cf-1a97cdb91aef a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UDDI is included in 8 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Bulgaria, Cyprus, France, Germany, Greece, Malta, Netherlands, and Spain. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Spain and Netherlands are fully aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets. 

NIFO factsheets:
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/national-interoperability-framework-observatory-nifo/nifo-factsheets

National catalogue Spain:
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio
/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES

National catalogue Netherlands:
https://www.forumstandaardisatie.nl/open-standaarden
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6a44e1d2-b270-4b58-ad5a-58516d63fef1 .

