camssa:f325ea35-a02f-4ffc-90ca-988733ac8ba4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CSV is a commonly used format for data exchange. It allows to provide data in a simple way. Moreover, as is structured data and non-proprietary format it eases data consumption by different stakeholders. \r
\r
An example of initiative relaying on CSV to provide data to users is ESCO, that allows the download data sets in CSV format.  It can also serve as an example the use of CSV in the Kohesio inititative.   \r
\r
Kohesio Initiative: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semantic-interoperability-community-semic/solution/kohesio-validator/specification\r
\r
CSV EC Reference:: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/esco/portal/escopedia/Comma-separated_values__40_CSV_41_#ESCO_data_in_CSV_files   \r
\r
CSV reference:\r
https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc4180'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:355ae575-7316-4cdc-bb12-b3d45159e335 .

camssa:f333b7b9-2dab-4cb8-b459-e203ebf606f2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7aa038b5496afb8cb229c692be9a2adc175deb2d5d47e35ad67e027c9eac28ba ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:f3359175-3630-4573-8d33-da99c3f1f534 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'REST is an architecture style that defines how different systems should interact. REST APIs generate a way of accessing web services in a simple and flexible way without having any processing thus allowing greater interoperability between clients and servers.\r
The french government website data.gouv.fr which hosts the french governments datasets is built under the REST architectural style.\r
\r
REST reference:\r
https://restfulapi.net/\r
\r
Data.gouv.fr reference:\r
https://doc.data.gouv.fr/api/intro/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a2b3f75e-b1c4-4e1d-98d1-50b71f40d4f9 .

