camssa:f347414c-2e8e-43f6-86b5-0f753bbc185f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """After carrying out an exhaustive research on this topic, no evidence has been found regarding the existence of a formal agreement between European public services providers involving the implementation of eDelivery SMP 1.10. However, the specification appears included within the eDelivery stack in the EU eGovernment Action Plan 2016-2020. The European communication coming from European Parliament, the Council, the European Economic and Social Committee and the Committee of the Regions aims to propose recommendations and actions to be done in order to enhance the interoperability across borders. \r
See: \r
https://ec.europa.eu/isa2/sites/isa/files/docs/publications/eu-egovernment-action-plan-2016-2020_en.pdf """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:05bc52a2-c3df-4b86-a5a9-15b5348bb4e5 .

