camssa:f3681a0e-21de-4721-a27e-6690ffc74b69 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"EN 303 645 is associated to the consumer IoT device and the data security domain. EN 303 645 is a comprehensive, single-purpose specification that manufacturers and IoT stakeholders need in order to meet basic security requirements (see EN 303 645 homepage, 'International alignment and adoption' section). There is no evidence of the use of the specification in the public sector.\r
\r
EN 303 645 homepage, 'International alignment and adoption' section:\r
https://www.etsi.org/technologies/consumer-iot-security\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8c650506-8c81-4338-9ed6-2349fcf11f2c .

