        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """2 Member States are recommending SAML 2.0 in their ICT National Catalogues. \r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39180195-988d-4a9c-9c56-c6772955d080 .

