camssa:f3c392f5-d756-4163-8434-8066ba87b95e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Some aspects of LDES contribute to the authenticity of the data such as the use of linked data principles, and above all, the "immutable event streams" that allows transparent registration and traceability of the data.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a0bef250-7393-48e3-8520-d03bb664b638 .

camssa:f3c6d980-2649-4cbe-9d44-0fd87bf13ed1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OData is a recommendation and protocol for data exchange. Therefore, the specification can contribute to enabling the secure processing of data.\r
\r
OData reference:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/odata/odata/v4.0/odata-v4.0-part1-protocol.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39b43b5b-7e1b-4bdd-8f9c-36efc84261e2 .

camssa:f3dcf51a-cd2d-44e0-9949-b8ed02b3370c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IEEE Std 802.3-2022 is a flexible and adaptable standard that supports new features and capabilities as technology evolves. This is evident in numerous extensions like IEEE 802.3ca and 802.3ch, which introduced higher data rates and support for applications like passive optical networks and automotive Ethernet.

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 extensions references:
https://standards.ieee.org/beyond-standards/new-ieee-802-3-standards-provide-platforms-for-the-next-ethernet-innovations/

IEEE Std 802.3-2022 Reference:
https://ieeexplore.ieee.org/document/9844436'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:20707111-9633-4f9f-b0b8-321248c6d7cb .

camssa:f3dea688-73e2-4942-839d-219d06cf6c3f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The IPsec protocol allows for the encryption of IP packets, making the exchange of information more secure. In addition, encrypting IP packets ensures that all information exchanged by public administrations, or between a public administration and its citizens, is protected and trustworthy.

IPsec protocol:
https://www.cloudflare.com/learning/network-layer/what-is-ipsec/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:608322de-6cdf-4340-b408-9a40a575642b .

