camssa:f4583c06-0f2e-491f-ba3b-9e29249952eb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"TOSCA may simplify the delivery of ditigal public services, but up to date there is no evidence of any specific application in public administrations at European level. It seems that there is still work to do for increasing TOSCA's capabilities in terms of service deployments (see EUBRA-BIGSEA project reference), and this may include public administrations to the extent that there is no evidence of TOSCA as a leading force in European public services.\r
\r
TOSCA reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html\r
\r
EUBRA-BIGSEA project reference:\r
http://www.eubra-bigsea.eu/standards\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9df854a5-4716-4224-97da-513236d678cf .

