camssa:f4621aa3-3935-436f-b5ff-e53adda1f057 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PNG could help understand the data of public administration by adding PNG image. In this sense, the specification can play an active role on the representation of the information in an easier visual way. This fact can consider PNG to foster the comprehensibility of administrative rules and data.\r
\r
PNG W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/PNG/\r
\r
PNG ISO reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/29581.html"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e165e591-9530-4b68-a1a2-d0fc89cdfdf5 .

