camssa:f4d6ebce-4458-4114-bd0c-44dee721e808 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Section 6.4 of the specification explains that in many instances data confidentiality is afforded by the application of encryption to content, although techniques such as path segregation (e.g. VPNs) and the use of secure enclaves in data processing are other measures that can be applied to give assurance of data confidentiality. 

ETSI Context Information Management (CIM); Security and Privacy:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_gr/CIM/001_099/007/01.01.02_60/gr_cim007v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f8905d4b-66cd-40fa-9265-c3aaa90b0172 .

