    cav:value "100" .

camssa:f680f11f-395b-4f18-b12d-562a364cf660 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """This document does not define a cross-sector reusable data model. The specification provides guidance and tools for the development of public policies and law taking into account a holistic perspective.\r
\r
Betterr Regulation Toolbox reference:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/info/sites/info/files/better-regulation-toolbox_2.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:32facd38-4e04-487d-a2c1-1e27f240bf2a .

camssa:f68d5c5a-7cab-40e6-8ef5-a4a09b472000 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'IPsec is included in the Spanish, French, Malta, Greek catalogue of standards. Spain fully complies with the 3 sections of the EIF according to the NIFO factsheets.\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets Spain:\r
https://administracionelectronica.gob.es/pae_Home/pae_Estrategias/pae_Interoperabilidad_Inicio/pae_Normas_tecnicas_de_interoperabilidad.html#CATALOGOESTANDARES\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets France:\r
https://www.numerique.gouv.fr/uploads/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets Greece:\r
http://www.e-gif.gov.gr/portal/pls/portal/docs/1/211041.PDF\r
\r
NIFO Factsheets:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/nifo-national-interoperability-framework-observatory/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2021'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b3245111-3c4a-4853-8c52-13b80fafaa85 .

camssa:f6959a73-358e-409b-8b2e-21e682676069 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'AMQP provides a ubiquitous, secure, and reliable internet protocol for high-speed transactional messaging. AMQP also has been approved as ISO/IEC 19464:2014. A major cloud platform uses AMQP to connect to its cloud IoT hub.

INTERNET OF THINGS Reference:
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/rolling-plan-ict-standardisation/internet-things

OASIS AMQP Reference:
http://docs.oasis-open.org/amqp/core/v1.0/amqp-core-complete-v1.0.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c78d44eb-c4e0-4d70-96f2-c3d6ee10e2d4 .

camssa:f6964ab7-a6ba-4013-be53-e862634d3412 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 612 has been developed by the European Telecommunication Standards Institute (ETSI), an independent, not-for-profit, standardization organization in the field of information and communications.\r
\r
About ETSI:\r
https://www.etsi.org/about/about-us'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d2bf7790-b22d-4274-8975-800d27040bdb .

