camssa:f6cdbf3b-4142-400f-b6f4-05d4361a360d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO 3166-1 is a key component in the development of some European cross-border projects and initiatives. It is the case of the INSPIRE (Infrastructure for Spatial Information in the European Community) project which makes use of ISO 3166-1 to ensure the maintenance of spatial data sets and corresponding data services in the EU (see INSPIRE Legislation reference, Directive 2007/2/EC document, Article 14). \r
\r
ISO 3166-1 reference:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/72482.html\r
\r
INSPIRE reference, Directive 2007/2/EC document, Article 14:\r
https://inspire.ec.europa.eu/inspire-legislation/26'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f42ea7ca-e451-4df2-8ff3-16c566004fdb .

