        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification provides a common vocabulary, semantics, and a set of interoperability agreements that can be used to enable seamless exchange of data between different systems and applications.\r
\r
AKN4EU reference: https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu'"""@en ;
