camssa:f723817e-20cd-4264-9913-159d143696de a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'NUTS was conceived for statistical and decision-making purposes. At the time being the specification can contribute to overcome interoperability barriers and enable the exposure of such interfaces. No evidence was found on this regard; however, in future Regulations, the specification may contribute to the exposure of internal information systems within the GEOSTAT initiative. \r
\r
EUROSTAT reference, NUTS Principles and Characteristics section:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/nuts/principles-and-characteristics\r
\r
EUROSTAT-GISCO reference, GEOSTAT initiative:\r
https://ec.europa.eu/eurostat/web/gisco/gisco-activities/integrating-statistics-geospatial-information/geostat-initiative'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c5232baf-d1ce-4f91-896b-8af68b10d19a .

