camssa:f73fab7c-d14f-42df-9312-257039cc5355 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "Every new version of the specification goes through a defined process with open and public consultations. Request for comments are not restricted to the RDA members but are open to all."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0a1c840d-b924-4b94-9fe2-9a21148dc987 .

camssa:f7421054-cc9a-4308-804e-fa39be360584 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "The purpose of XSLT is not related  to the long-term preservation of electronic records and other kinds of information. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e87b275e-3d9c-4511-a694-96ba9fcc7506 .

camssa:f748d424-a796-4adb-9f6b-8c81252884cb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The main purpose of ETSI TS 119 512 is to provide protocols for trust service providers providing \r
long-term data preservation services of e-signatures and of general data.  \r
\r
ETSI TS 119 512 specification:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1ff9e972-8966-4862-b3cb-040c97d07233 .

camssa:f74e0729-2ce5-4aee-b8df-066a142aefdf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """XHTML is an application of XML, it is based on HTML 4, but it uses XML syntax which defines a well-formed and more restrictive data model. It can be used for exchanging data across sectors.\r
\r
XHTML W3C reference:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/xhtml1/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7048ad6f-1ca3-4069-8119-6d85da5259b7 .

camssa:f751cf9b-bb32-46c1-93d3-da411260512e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The TOSCA Technical Committee provides feature requests to open source projects and results of implementation experience to open source communities; however, not in national platforms.\r
\r
OASIS TOSCA TC reference:\r
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=tosca'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:37bef870-8604-4c77-8690-168b07c244b5 .

