camssa:f8a62b9d-9cc2-4e11-adc5-2afe1377be14 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The conformance of syslog protocol implementations can be assessed based on several factors, and there 
are various aspects to consider to ensure that an implementation adheres to the syslog protocol standards. 
The syslog protocol is defined by several Request for Comments (RFC) documents, including RFC 5424. Assessing the implementation against the requirements and specifications outlined in these RFCs ensures that 
it adheres to the standard.

Syslog Protocol: https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc5424'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a41f8dd4-2c1e-4274-a26f-c923842f513f .

