camssa:f8be7a58-8ceb-4db8-bed6-c213599133b7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Registered Organization Vocabulary defined core concepts and properties for describing registered organisations, laying a foundational understanding in this domain, particularly at an international level. 

However, according to recent discussions on the Core Business Vocabulary GitHub, W3C has discontinued the Registered Organization Vocabulary and the community along with the continuation for the development moved to the Core Business Vocabulary.

Registered Organization Vocabulary reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/vocab-regorg/

Core Business Vocabulary Github reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/tree/master

Core Business Vocabulary Github Issue 51 - RegOrg maintenance reference:
https://github.com/SEMICeu/Core-Business-Vocabulary/issues/51'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5bd7396c-2db1-4168-9a15-09d623aac850 .

camssa:f8c56650-79a6-4747-840b-a67dda65457d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "After searching for a certification or conformity test to validate SVG no tool has been found that assess the conformity of the specification."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d568a0f6-0b0a-4a32-b3d4-32a918a2f0d7 .

camssa:f8c7bdee-beb6-49d1-8005-7fbf2134346f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification is included in 8 Member States' catalogues of recommended specifications. Some examples of Member States including SOAP on their catalogues are the Netherlands, Spain or France.\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:024db721-6af2-4ba1-b029-5b579f6f7fdf .

