camssa:f93278e9-996e-412d-9a3b-11dc9a3328d3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Among others, UBL has been used to develop the PEPPOL specifiaction, a  which enables businesses across Europe to communicate electronically with public buyers in various stages of the procurement process. PEPPOL  provides a set of technical specifications that can be implemented in existing eProcurement solutions and eBusiness exchange services to make them interoperable between disparate systems across Europe.\r
\r
PEPPOL website:\r
https://peppol.eu/what-is-peppol/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bff4fbad-0e8f-48b1-870e-ac9ce63d1d1d .

