        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of HTTP Cookies is other than enabling the e-accessibility, therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
HTTP Cookies reference:\r
https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTTP/Cookies#tracking_and_privacy'"""@en ;
