camssa:f958612a-e446-491f-a60d-b3f99967e88d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is designed to be technology agnostic, which means that it can be implemented using any technology or programming language. It is based on the principles of XML (eXtensible Markup Language) and uses XML-based schemas to represent legal documents.\r
\r
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                    AKN4EU reference: https://op.europa.eu/en/web/eu-vocabularies/dataset/-/resource?uri=http://publications.europa.eu/resource/dataset/akn4eu'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70e5621a-2aae-4441-86db-c14475ed2f49 .

camssa:f9604cd4-2141-4bda-bfe3-ddef8abd28bd a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-1435ad894742693c2b99e329ef12399cd411ed6900f49b9658fd2231de3f201a ;
    cav:value "1" .

camssa:f961ef62-3253-47d1-9bc3-d90f51cbe050 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'All information about IPsec, including details about extensions and implementations that work with IPsec, is published on the IETF datatracker website. Additionally, information about the six versions is provided on the same website. Furthermore, IPsec has been integrated into the IPv6 protocol, for example, providing enhanced security mechanisms. In this sense, IPsec was initially designed as part of the next-generation Internet Protocol (IPv6), but as security became important, it was designed to work with both IPv4 and IPv6.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html

Datatracker IETF:
https://datatracker.ietf.org/

IPsec in IPv6:
https://www.cisco.com/c/en/us/td/docs/ios-xml/ios/ipv6/configuration/15-2s/ipv6-15-2s-book/ip6-ipsec.pdf

IPsec in IPv4 and IPv6:
https://networkengineering.stackexchange.com/questions/37025/ipsec-in-ipv4-and-ipv6'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f6e84e04-fc6e-4ee5-b740-84d547a43f59 .

