        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are many forums discussing the implementation of IndexedDB. In addition, papers assessing the specification and offering new extensions can be found on the internet.

IndexedDB github:
https://github.com/w3c/IndexedDB

IndexedDB StackOverflow forum:
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/7759376/indexeddb-performance

IndexedDB Apple forum:
