camssa:fab15df2-8ca1-4e6c-842a-d766f7c318f5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By allowing the association of information with a domain, DNS facilitate the identification of interfaces. \r
Practically, instead of having a list of interfaces as "IP Addresses", DNS allows the identification "by name" of domain. \r
\r
DNS IETF reference:\r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1034  \r
\r
Domain Names - Implementation and Specification:                             \r
https://tools.ietf.org/html/1035   '"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1341294c-9b98-444d-ba20-491f40c81375 .

