        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The NFVI specification facilitates the modelling of business processes because there exist several NFV models that support businesses to model their activity along with all the NFV components. There is a high level overview of the NFVI domains and interfaces in the specification documentation.\r
