        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'UBL is maintained and developed by OASIS, which is an international community developing open standards; specifically, by the Technical Committee (TC). In addition, it is worth mentioning that its prominence and adoption in the EU also support the development of a European community._x000D_
