    cav:judgement """'UBL is included in 5 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Croatia, Denmark, Greece, Malta and The Netherlands. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of The Netherlands is aligned with at least 3 out of 4 scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets._x000D_
_x000D_
