https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.4/UBL-2.4.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2207e2a2-f838-402c-89fd-03e87c208d3a .

camssa:4967499f-62b5-414c-92af-68a3b0b1fadd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The UBL specification is based on XML, which supports various security mechanisms and complementary specifications that help protect data during exchange. One such mechanism is encryption, which enhances the trustworthiness of data by ensuring that it remains confidential and secure throughout transmission. This prevents unauthorised users from accessing or modifying the information, thereby safeguarding its integrity and authenticity._x000D_
_x000D_
XMLDSig specification:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/xmldsig-core/_x000D_
_x000D_
XAdES specification:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/XAdES/_x000D_
_x000D_
UBL specification reference:_x000D_
https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.4/UBL-2.4.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9c37af88-9e4c-4268-8bfb-13bebc22eb47 .

camssa:49ae6da7-ae2a-4708-9acc-11f04a0086d4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Participation in the development of the OASIS UBL Technical Committee is open to all interested stakeholders. Contributors may actively engage by joining the UBL TC, submitting input, and offering feedback during public reviews of released specifications. Committee members collaborate through the UBL mailing list, which requires TC membership to post messages._x000D_
The OASIS UBL Technical Committee operates under OASIS Open-an organisation that fosters collaboration among individuals, organisations, and governments to address technical challenges through open standards. Participation is open to all who wish to contribute._x000D_
_x000D_
OASIS Universal Business Exchange Technical Committee:_x000D_
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/ubl/charter.php_x000D_
_x000D_
UBL OASIS Technical Committee reference:_x000D_
https://www.oasis-open.org/committees/tc_home.php?wg_abbrev=ubl_x000D_
_x000D_
UBL specification reference:_x000D_
https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.4/UBL-2.4.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bc9f209a-0368-4f5e-8d13-a6e67362788e .

