        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Interoperable Europe Portal platform comprises a large European community of developers, some of whom focus on UBL implementations. Additionally, the specification is also discussed on other forums, such as Stack Overflow, where implementations and questions regarding the specification are addressed._x000D_
_x000D_
UBL Interoperable Europe Portal:_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/ict-standards-procurement/solution/ubl-universal-business-language-ubl_x000D_
