camssa:0747be34-eb08-4011-97cc-11690fa38fd3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI is a European standards development organisation, and as such, all the specifications developed within the organisation are available and can be accessed through its website repository.

ETSI standards repository:
https://www.etsi.org/standards#page=1&search=ETSI%20TS%20319%20422&title=1&etsiNumber=1&content=1&version=0&onApproval=1&published=1&withdrawn=1&historical=1&isCurrent=1&superseded=1&startDate=1988-01-15&endDate=2022-07-25&harmonized=0&keyword=&TB=&stdType=&frequency=&mandate=&collection=&sort=1'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1d0a41da-c7ab-46ef-9c30-b8eca4e48872 .

camssa:075af538-cb98-4291-aca4-6592317df163 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The XAdES specification can be found used in different European projects and also by Member States. Since it is suitable for advanced electronic signatures, it is used by companies and public administrations to sign documents. In this sense, the specification has been selected within the CEF Digital Signature Service (DSS) along with CAdES, ASiC and PAdES Baseline profiles.  _x000D_
_x000D_
Digital Signature Service is an open-source software library for electronic signature creation and validation supporting the interoperability of electronic signatures. The initiative is an enabler for cross borders interoperability between administrations and businesses._x000D_
_x000D_
Applications such as eCoSignature from the Ministry of Industry and Commerce of Spain use XAdES as their base. _x000D_
_x000D_
eCoSignature reference:_x000D_
https://firmaelectronica.gob.es/en/ciudadanos/cosas-deberias-saber/formatos-firma_x000D_
_x000D_
DSS reference:_x000D_
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html_x000D_
_x000D_
eSignatureHub - Digital Signature Service DSS:_x000D_
https://ec.europa.eu/digital-building-blocks/sites/spaces/DIGITAL/pages/467109107/Digital+Signature+Service+-+DSS_x000D_
_x000D_
XAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31913201/01.02.01_60/en_31913201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:14801d29-9e92-4f61-be78-37f56e55e892 .

camssa:0d99f038-fcd0-4725-af3e-67fabb384465 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XAdES is maintained by ETSI, one of the European Agencies for Standardisation, specifically by the ETSI Technical Committee Electronic Signatures and Trust Infrastructures (ESI)._x000D_
_x000D_
ETSI reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/about_x000D_
_x000D_
Electronic Signatures and Trust Infrastructures (ESI) reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/committee/1399-esi_x000D_
_x000D_
XAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31913201/01.02.01_60/en_31913201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f82ac460-6e96-461e-aa45-0ba073d05f81 .

camssa:1101b770-d9e2-420e-b1d1-dbd651796768 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI is a European standards development organisation, and as such, all the specifications developed within the organisation are available and can be accessed through its website repository.

ETSI standards repository:
