camssa:380d0894-e686-4265-9165-54c8aba5f4f9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"XAdES is included in 5 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Croatia, Cyprus, France, Poland and Spain. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Spain and France are aligned with at least 3 out of 4 scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets._x000D_
_x000D_
