camssa:d94681a6-f3d3-4ebe-b228-1cbc52c84263 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI has provided a conformance testing tool for electronic signatures. The conformity testing tool involves different standards applied in the development of eSignatures, including PAdES, CAdES and XAdES and their respective baseline profiles. _x000D_
_x000D_
Conformance Checker reference:_x000D_
https://signatures-conformance-checker.etsi.org/pub/index.shtml_x000D_
_x000D_
