camssa:0cc72b90-c93d-42de-8654-e73dbbf50cd6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES is not related to publication of data on the web. Therefore this criterion is not applicable. _x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference: https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:472eb354-1f34-491d-b617-90a3c3fedaf8 .

camssa:0cdda472-7ac9-4815-a8f1-0faa6eaede3a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES Baseline Profile helps users simplify the usage of electronic signatures in PDF documents with the PAdES Visible Signature method._x000D_
PAdES achieves this by using the PAdESSignatureParameters object that contains an attribute named SignatureImageParameters where the user allowed to customise the visual signature (with text, image or with image and text) on the document. In this sense the specification provides a concise method to represent not only the signature on the document but also other parameters like visual indications where the signature is located. _x000D_
These applications enhance user understanding by visually displaying key information such as whether the signature is valid, the date it was timestamped, and other relevant properties in a simple and straightforward way. _x000D_
A practical example of this is the CEF Digital Signature Service (DSS), which leverages PAdES to provide clear and verifiable electronic signatures. Through DSS, users can easily verify signature validity and timestamp information, helping improve trust and transparency in electronic communications._x000D_
_x000D_
eIDAS regulation:_x000D_
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation _x000D_
_x000D_
DSS reference:_x000D_
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html _x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:35804f7c-7683-4993-8ddf-8c9d6472572b .

camssa:0d68fcf2-fc9e-4a0f-9a71-4d8001461678 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-51782b9aa4b92f4aba322a549b9d3972e304ca68f9353073c29add782502d910 ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

