camssa:146c6eab-37fb-4078-beaf-f83bb4e2b088 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'PAdES is maintained by ETSI, one of the European Agencies for Standardisation, specifically by the ETSI Technical Committee Electronic Signatures and Trust Infrastructures (ESI). _x000D_
_x000D_
ETSI reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/about _x000D_
_x000D_
Electronic Signatures and Trust Infrastructures (ESI) reference: _x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/committee/1399-esi_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:03af8125-7cb4-4e22-98ed-a688646dc8bf .

camssa:1577e055-81df-443b-a513-45f067e0bdea a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b00b9b74de866ed2278d14d1b9d7ecf2c06950d296bb2f17013c7b710d6de41 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:1b072950-c2e6-4028-81ce-a89084f85394 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:1c19b17e-4409-43bb-ba32-1831e6db1a9e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES Baseline Profile is a set of well-defined technical specifications developed by ETSI to ensure both interoperability and legal validity of electronic signatures across Europe, in line with the eIDAS Regulation. The specification includes several signature levels: PAdES-B-B, PAdES-B-T, PAdES-B-LT, and PAdES-B-LT, which can be implemented individually based on the desired properties. These levels are designed to be incremental, meaning that a basic signature (PAdES-B-B) can be progressively enhanced to include additional features like timestamps or long-term validation data, depending on user or system requirements._x000D_
_x000D_
eIDAS regulation:_x000D_
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation _x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3b83a5e7-f4de-406f-ba00-c6671278258a .

camssa:1c9a6ba2-2011-4971-a1fa-9bf14e4504f7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES is not related to data portability of data between systems/applications. Therefore this criterion is not applicable._x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fa0820b2-40b4-4618-8b94-92fe34ba57b1 .

camssa:1cac75b0-f2cf-4003-9429-00c3915c323f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES Baseline Profile function is to facilitate the electronic signature of PDF documents in compliance with eIDAS regulation. In this sense, the specification, in conjuction with other specifications such as CAdES, ASiC and XAdES can enable the visibility of administrative procedures, as shown with the CEF Digital Signature Service (DSS). _x000D_
 _x000D_
eIDAS regulation:_x000D_
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation _x000D_
_x000D_
DSS reference:_x000D_
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db0e5fa9-6c50-41cc-a245-ac920085c360 .

camssa:20c6ba94-9fed-4e24-9cfe-27ece988a60d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-29023937877d658f898d48a06b2648e283306a041137cc58af4f79f061e1de4b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:2288c174-cd22-4047-baa4-0250f15dca26 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d9b9ce1d270550422a8ea6097d2ffa1d923267fd681c56280e3b7810a14a580a ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:26892e3e-94fc-4903-840c-345663418cf9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'PAdES is within the European eIDAS regulation which is legally binding for all EU members states._x000D_
PAdES is also a core element of the EUDI Wallet initiative of the European Union, defined under the revised eIDAS Regulation 2.0. It is a secure, EU-backed digital wallet (typically a mobile application) designed to empower EU citizens, residents, and businesses with a universally recognized, user-centric, and privacy-preserving means of digital identification and authentication across the entire European single market._x000D_
_x000D_
EUDI Wallet reference:_x000D_
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2024/2979/oj_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c53aef79-14ff-43e8-ab92-d06feb682aab .

camssa:26fb6b7f-37d2-4bd6-874b-db87a2b7e4b3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:29fdc18f-11ed-41d9-bd9c-503d6c9333a1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES Baseline Profile main purpose is to provide the stakeholders involved in any electronic transaction with the certainty that the exchanged documents are truthful for all. In this sense the different signature levels (B-B Basic, B-T Time, B-LT Long-Term and B-LTA Long-Term Archive) provide a wide arrangement of security but it is not exhaustive._x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f76dcc82-8ad5-4c1d-b04a-f012382a83c1 .

camssa:34708ec0-e5d5-4259-b4b7-1833078b91cf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'PAdES does not directly define or expose technical interfaces for accessing public administration services. However, the specification provides a standardised, machine and human-readable structure for electronic signatures on PDF documents, which facilitates interaction between citizens and public administrations when submitting information through public administration portals. By using the PDF format, the specification eases this communication between citizens and business by using one of most widely available format for document sharing._x000D_
_x000D_
eIDAS regulation:_x000D_
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation _x000D_
_x000D_
DSS reference:_x000D_
https://ec.europa.eu/cefdigital/DSS/webapp-demo/doc/dss-documentation.html _x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db17b859-a1d1-415e-96bf-c9e4ec75002c .

camssa:3552471f-3c6d-43b5-bf43-291829d015a4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES Baseline Profile function is to facilitate the electronic signature in compliance with eIDAS regulation. The signature of a document can provide the involved stakeholders with the possibility to use the extensions on the signature in order to define specific legal or policy references relevant to the context of the signed document like confidentiality._x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:20c6ba94-9fed-4e24-9cfe-27ece988a60d .

camssa:35804f7c-7683-4993-8ddf-8c9d6472572b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d12b846c487e7201dbcf395866b5abc0bb5fa040b1f519127b6a5f56d447257 ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:361991ff-d665-4585-99ea-c931b8e2a030 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3b3b2febe9a7e3ad44bdefc47b0bbcafc7a2e677e9570d6ad822efbe1f7d41e2 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:376d49f3-9b7e-4825-9fe0-f905753e9181 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'PAdES baseline Profile provides the stakeholders with the certainty that the exchanged documents are truthful for all. In this regard the different signature levels (B-B Basic, B-T Time, B-LT Long-Term and B-LTA Long-Term Archive) that can be embedded on the Document Security Store (DSS) provide a wide arrangement of security levels to guarantee the the correct and secure transmission of data and no tempering of it._x000D_
_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:26fb6b7f-37d2-4bd6-874b-db87a2b7e4b3 .

camssa:37d39d88-2579-4d07-b1fa-e8808237bff6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'While the primary purpose of the PAdES Baseline Profile may not be focused on data integrity, its design supports mechanisms that uphold it. The different signature levels allows stakeholders to incorporate additional fields that can facilitate the detection of unauthorised changes, thereby reinforcing document integrity._x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3c6c1f8a-f4da-4f32-96a7-a8678c57cb02 .

