camssa:8d3ae27e-1937-45b1-b93c-a638a56be5a9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'PAdES is an specification derived from the original PDF specification developed by Adobe (ISO 32000-1) back in 2008. In this regard, PAdES is an adaptation of the general signature format for electronic signatures, CAdES (CMS Advanced Electronic Signatures) to the PDF format. _x000D_
The current version of the specification was developed in 2024 and includes four levels of of signatures addressing increasing requirements for long term preservation and security that are compliant with the EU eIDAS Regulation. _x000D_
In this regard the major difference of the previous release (ETSI TS 103 172) from PAdES is that with the consolidation of the eIDAS Regulation the current specification (ETSI EN 319 142-1) has become an European Standard (EN). This step is taken since ETSI may elaborate European Standards and European standardisation deliverables in response to Standardisation Requests to support the European legislation or policies, in accordance with the amended Regulation (EU) 1025/2012. Therefore, with the eIDAS Regulation taking a more mature status the related specifications like PAdES become  an European standard via the Standardisation Request deliverables Approval Process (SRdAP) and in accordance with the provisions of Article 21 of the Rules of Procedure, and those of Clause 2.2.2 of the Technical Working Procedures._x000D_
This means PAdES is a consolidated and mature enough specification to use in the development of digital solutions/services. _x000D_
Currently there is an ongoing update that will be published in 2027._x000D_
_x000D_
ISO 32000-1 reference _x000D_
https://www.iso.org/standard/51502.html_x000D_
_x000D_
CAdES (CMS Advanced Electronic Signatures) reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/101700_101799/101733/02.02.01_60/ts_101733v020201p.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
eIDAS Regulation reference:_x000D_
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=uriserv:OJ.L_.2014.257.01.0073.01.ENG_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
Regulation (EU) 1025/2012 reference_x000D_
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/legal-content/EN/TXT/?uri=CELEX:32012R1025_x000D_
_x000D_
Standardisation Request deliverables Approval Process (SRdAP) reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/events/714-how-does-etsi-make-standards_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES upcoming version:_x000D_
https://portal.etsi.org/eWPM/index.html#/schedule?WKI_ID=73780_x000D_
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:53407ad9-5f54-45f7-acd3-1b28d2d01635 .

