camssa:bbf2dec1-015b-4b04-a866-e7768d24b25f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The PAdES Baseline Profile guarantees authenticity by cryptographically linking the signature to a specific individual and their certificate._x000D_
In this sense the signature must be applied after the PDF file has been encrypted. So, while the encryption is done beforehand it will be intrinsically tied to the user signing the document. _x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9e6ceb18-6438-4923-a7c7-fd06539a451c .

