    cav:value "0" .

camssa:fb660af6-3c53-4db1-8a41-91df14f5e06b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PDF 1.7 is already associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). Specifically, PDF 1.7 can define the interoperability aspects of the "Document management service" ABB from the EIRA Technical view.\r
\r
See:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6ae94732-b54b-4737-8548-76873e842a9d .

camssa:fb6bcd6d-332c-45a7-a342-9936e6c3f0d7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The European Union (EU) Member States are currently implementing the INSPIRE Directive and related regulations, included in the ISA programme. This projects includes the usage of XSLT for each member state of the Union.\r
\r
See:\r
https://ies-svn.jrc.ec.europa.eu/projects/registry-development/wiki/Re3gistry_1_0_documentation#_cp3"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:cc4e03e9-7fe9-4654-9a06-ac41e75587da .

camssa:fb72d407-bdcb-4632-b8b3-8d44752adf4c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.

W3C Process document:
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:471ae526-7ab1-4e63-bbad-19875adf4b4f .

