camssa:fbb16518-6748-40d1-a8d4-e3d6751aa775 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Data on the Web Best Practices is maintained by W3C which is an international community developing open standards. \r
\r
Developer community W3C:\r
https://www.w3.org/Consortium/"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3639b732-a6ee-4948-b29c-37ad86c4b78d .

camssa:fbb58742-955f-4266-a805-8aee332ef640 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """WS-Security is included in the pan-European electronic registered delivery solutions more specifcally SPOCS LP in the Transport layer, Trust establishment and Message protocol.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_sr/019000_019099/019050/01.01.01_60/sr_019050v010101p.pdf"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7b10b4f7-0549-42d9-b5d9-3fb9504fcbde .

camssa:fbbf88c9-1395-4ffd-9053-db3268f10b44 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The OGC TrainingDML-AI standard, despite being in its early development stages, has attracted significant interest from both the geospatial and AI communities. This indicates a robust market acceptance for its utilization in the development of digital solutions/services. The focus on deep learning and emerging technologies implies that the standard is well-positioned to have a substantial impact on shaping future technological advancements within the geospatial domain.

OGC TrainingDML-AI Standard:
https://www.opengeospatial.org/standards/trainingdml-ai

OGC TrainingDML-AI Implementations:
https://www.ogc.org/resources/implementations/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:26e24976-cec2-4c64-8538-a84ce0ca4a2b .

camssa:fbc0eef2-e3c0-4988-b8f7-484251362a04 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """DCAT is an RDF vocabulary for representing data catalogues that allows data owners to provide metadata about the datasets they publish. By describing catalogues, datasets and resources, a publisher makes them easily searchable and discoverable.\r
\r
In fact, DCAT is used for the publication of datasets in linked open data portals at a National (e.g. ) and European scale ( European Data Portal)\r
\r
See:                                                                                                                                       https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/dcat-application-profile-data-portals-europe/releases"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65f12ea2-1f0b-4658-b306-46a8317ef160 .

