    cav:value "20" .

camssa:fc3948ad-0f62-4388-8f86-76217bd9cb2d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification was developed in 2015, and it has been evolving together with all the related European projects where CCCEV has an active role. Moreover, at the moment of performing the assessment, version 2.0 is being developed in order to ensure that the CCCEV covers the needs of the different cross-border projects (e.g. eCertis, ESPD, etc).\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e219e8c3-0df1-4a05-9075-1af748100094 .

