        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ETSI and any of its committees, in charge of the development of ETSI TS 119 511, operates under the ETSI Intellectual Property Rigths (IPRs) and IPR Policy. The specification is licensed on a royalty-free basis.\r
\r
ETSI ownership of IPRs section:\r
https://www.etsi.org/intellectual-property-rights'"""@en ;
