camssa:fc46efa5-7131-426a-a107-86d93e84a989 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SHACL specification can be used to validate data exchanged between different government systems, ensuring that the data meets the required standards before it is processed or shared. This reduces the need for manual checks and corrections, speeding up service delivery and improving the overall user experience.

SHACL W3C reference:
https://www.w3.org/TR/shacl/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bbdbc683-5919-46e6-a579-097e191002e1 .

