        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The specification's purpose is meant to use or not to use, can not be implemented partially.\r
\r
See:\r
https://www.w3.org/TR/2006/REC-xml11-20060816/ \""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8ffa0b96-0ca8-4c5c-a093-f022164a15b0 .

camssa:fc54f050-a528-43b6-8035-604cd5ae8225 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The specification defines a core vocabulary related to access rights for distributions or sources that can be reused across sectors and extended to cover specific needs for determined purposes.\r
\r
ODRL defines a model that allow the reuse and exchange of data fostering the interoperability between parties. \r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6d4a4725-8152-402b-84da-ad9910fa37e1 .

