    cav:value "1" .

camssa:fd0f10a2-1372-425b-9a66-8b13589e823b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There are existing documentation and studies assessing the efficiency of ETSI TS 119 612 together with other specifications. The "On Migrating from Present Identity Management Services to EIDAS" study, exposes a practical implementation of a sercive similar to eIDAS. This service allows to predict the success of eIDAS at EU level.

"On Migrating form Present Identity Management Services to EIDAS" study:
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-03003-2_16'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f9232f49-ec3e-40ff-af48-ce6e66a0553f .

camssa:fd111116-2bb4-42cd-9e66-f8c23b2cb18e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """W3C has a defined and publicly available Process for the Development and approval process of the specification as a recommended standard. Also, a clear Release Notes tracking the changes of the different versions is archived.\r
\r
W3C Process document:\r
https://www.w3.org/2018/Process-20180201/#Policies """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0b490aff-fac9-40f0-9a87-44c9b5c6d445 .

camssa:fd127cb3-d229-4946-acf5-7fbbb44d0828 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ISO/IEC has not been found available in any repository/catalogue of standards at European level.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 19944-1 specification:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/60545.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:472a1d0f-939f-44cd-93ea-aa415c933821 .

camssa:fd15549c-ad68-48ca-8a1f-915bc3b9ff0f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement "There is no existing study or documentation assessing the specification in terms of effectiveness and efficiency to justify the criterion."@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ea717c55-efbb-453e-a32e-10c263f98023 .

