camssa:fddf737f-2f98-4f72-81e5-9f8e67b33a78 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """One of the RFCs defining the IPv4 is available at the European collaborative platform Joinup. However, the other documents defining the specifications are not available at any European platform. \r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/ietf-rfc-791-1980-internet-protocol/distribution/ietf-rfc-791-1980-internet-protocol"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5592ad54-95c3-45dc-a486-201cce395a28 .

