camssa:fde53534-3780-41b5-827c-2e0431ff43c4 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There is no Member State that includes LegalRuleML in their national catalogue with The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) aligned with at least 4 out of 5 sections of the European Interoperability Framework (EIF) according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets.\r
\r
CAMSS List of Standards:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1131ebb0-1034-4977-bfad-f199c6de4529 .

camssa:fde5fd58-16e4-42cc-b74d-8ba909b89d54 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ETSI TS 119 512 has been developed to provide services for the long-term preservation of data in general. Although its main purpose is not to reuse data when needed, it can be useful for access and use of data in some cases.

ETSI TS 119 512 specification:
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_ts/119500_119599/119512/01.01.02_60/ts_119512v010102p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ba080607-f93c-4f9c-92e2-01fec3722607 .

