        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The Asset Administration Shell (AAS) has specific provisions regarding access control of the stakeholders, in this sense it is at the core of the specification the capability to authenticate the users sharing the assets.

Details of the Asset Administration Shell (AAS)
https://industrialdigitaltwin.org/en/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/06/IDTA-01001-3-0-1_SpecificationAssetAdministrationShell_Part1_Metamodel.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5da7b8f1-2564-4893-8a82-64753a27bd89 .

