camssa:fdf3c319-1e12-4d8d-8e48-694ae91aa847 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """The main purpose of this Core Vocabulary is to support the exchange of information between organisations that define criteria and organisations that respond to these criteria using evidences. So, it facilitates the visibility of administrative rules.\r
\r
CCCEV reference:\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/e-government-core-vocabularies/core-criterion-and-core-evidence-vocabulary"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2fb19c2b-3ec3-4d6f-9f08-f926ccaf9586 .

