        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of IPsec is not related to the long-term preservation of data. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.

IPSec reference:
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6071.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1a9426fe-69d7-4270-a2e7-3a7572bbe0ad .

