camssa:feddd227-fc90-4210-8eda-6a14172faa90 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ODRL can be utilized to express permissions and obligations related to preservation activities. By defining \r
rights and obligations for archival content, may contribute to ensuring that preservation activities adhere to \r
specified rules and conditions.\r
\r
W3C specification reference: \r
https://www.w3.org/TR/odrl-vocab/#vocab-core'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f4dc66c6-fd27-48c7-bb4b-7cec5745ea4c .

camssa:fee72730-0022-4f0e-8ce1-91b917483901 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """There are several success stories and implementation examples that provide visibility on the effectiveness and efficiency of implementing ELI. It allows the description of legal resources and increases the shareability across borders enhancing the cooperation amongst European Institutions removing barriers. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
\r
ELI highlights: \r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/index.html\r
\r
ELI Testimonials: \r
