camssa:fef5c6fc-79d4-4ddd-91a6-d003b2da8e78 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The TGF does not explicitly address data portability between systems. However, one of the basic principles of the TGF is interoperability, a layer for the achievement of which the TGF offers some provisions. Thus, by promoting interoperability, open standards and open data, the TGF can help enable data portability between systems, but no specific requirements or technical considerations are made for such purpose.\r
\r
TGF Specification:\r
http://docs.oasis-open.org/tgf/TGF/v2.0/cs01/TGF-v2.0-cs01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7a4c2531-648c-4014-89df-642d9154a793 .

camssa:fefa4f69-d828-42b2-b7a7-c14fe50d55e1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is focused on the preservation of confidential data and its availability. Therefore this criterion is not applicable to this specification.\r
\r
ISO/IEC 27001 reference website:\r
https://www.iso.org/standard/54534.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:09bf4f49-44e6-4d96-9f84-ddff2d7a958c .

camssa:ff00be2a-e5c5-4f9e-8f72-5abbef9f0b7b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ESPD can be mapped into the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS) covering the\r
eProcurement Evaluating Component and the eProcurement Evaluating Service ABBs from the Technical\r
Application view.\r
\r
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):\r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss\r
/solution/elis/release/v501'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:22c22743-caf0-4492-b944-e11e4b97af0a .

camssa:ff0cc016-a6e4-43e7-b91e-c795b065d728 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """RDF is already associated with EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library Of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, RDF can define the interoperability aspects of the "Data model" and "Representation" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View.\r
\r
See: \r
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/solution/elis/distribution/eliscataloguev100betaxlsx"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4518fd32-3d3a-4b55-86a0-ad46d425c56f .

