camssa:ff221e0d-3e99-4879-9b74-b09fa8b39825 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """PAdES Baseline profile was published in 2013, this demonstrates the maturity of the specification and that it overcame its initital issues. Moreover, this profile of the PAdES Specification is an extension based on the regulation for the Internal Market Enhancing. \r
Additionally, all ETSI’s standards and specifications are strictly related to market needs, which demonstrates market acceptance. Therefore, it is demonstrated that PAdES baseline profile has enough maturity and market acceptance for its use in the development of products and services. """@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0a2ab98a-2486-451b-9e11-5ba0fa0fc37e .

