camssa:ff28a470-1ab0-40bb-86eb-2913d692c996 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'TOSCA is a language for describing a cloud-based web service topology, its components, relationships and the processes that manage them. Although  the specification competes against other cloud-orchestration proprietary formats (such as the AWS CloudFormation Templates), TOSCA v1.3 is contributing to the creation of innovative solutions based on YAML service templates, which has been positively adopted by the market. It is the case of xOpera (within a European project) and the IM infrastructure manager, both open source cloud orcherstrators.\r
\r
TOSCA Simple Profile in YAML reference, section 1.2:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/tosca/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML/v1.3/os/TOSCA-Simple-Profile-YAML-v1.3-os.html#_Toc26969412\r
\r
AWS CloudFormation Templates reference:\r
https://aws.amazon.com/cloudformation/resources/templates/?nc1=h_ls\r
\r
xOpera-Github reference:\r
https://github.com/xlab-si/xopera-opera\r
\r
IM Infrastructure Manager reference:\r
https://github.com/grycap/im'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6b366eae-1417-4600-9bab-82c263569db4 .

camssa:ff28a7b5-3ceb-487a-afab-484ab2917516 a cav:Score,
