camssa:ffd95738-79f0-4d58-a53c-82f5ee9af562 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SMP is a business domain agnostic specification that can be reused in a cross-domain way.\r
\r
SMP OASIS reference:\r
https://docs.oasis-open.org/bdxr/bdx-smp/v2.0/cs02/bdx-smp-v2.0-cs02.html#_Toc30505009'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2b092ab3-96a4-46b1-95c5-8c4c3b75e6d8 .

camssa:ffdb2f71-1030-4501-976e-e65032f07b41 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """Not enough information has been found to answer negatively or positively to this criterion. Moreover, it seems that the specification is not aimed to foster the security and privacy of the data exchange. Therefore, this criterion does not apply to this specification. \r
\r
ELI reference:\r
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli-register/about.html\r
"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:87db1361-6e82-4466-bc17-33284e21916c .

camssa:ffddcaf1-ba39-4acd-85ed-90c62a656eab a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Linked Data Event Streams (LDES) can contribute to organisational interoperability agreements by providing a standardized and machine-readable format for representing and sharing real-time event data. The specification provides standarised representation, common vocabularies, semantic interoperability, real-time collaboration, etc.

LDES specification: 
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/semic-support-centre/linked-data-event-streams-ldes'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4b5a967c-fff0-4ecc-a9ac-dc83f8b88f79 .

