camssa:109876fc-749c-492a-92e2-093dfa9c93a2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CAdES does not directly define or expose technical interfaces for accessing public administration services._x000D_
However, the specification provides a standardised, machine and human-readable structure for electronic signatures on electronic documents, which facilitates interaction between citizens and public administrations when submitting information through public administration portals. In this regard, using another specifications based on CAdES like XAdES or PAdES for the most used fileformats like XML or PDF it becomes more simple to share documents among the stakeholders._x000D_
_x000D_
eIDAS regulation: _x000D_
https://digital-strategy.ec.europa.eu/en/policies/eidas-regulation_x000D_
_x000D_
CAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31912201/01.03.01_60/en_31912201v010301p.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
PAdES reference: _x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31914201/01.02.01_60/en_31914201v010201p.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
XAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31913201/01.03.01_60/en_31913201v010201p.pdf_x000D_
'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c1bd4bab-d513-4571-a266-8667a5920db3 .

camssa:1209eb03-ee53-4648-aac7-44dee6755c89 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The efficiency of the CAdES specification has been assessed on the article from the conference 2024 Innovations in Intelligent Systems and Applications Conference (ASYU) in Ankara. In the conference the authors defined the properties for long term data preservation related to CAdES an its efficiency._x000D_
_x000D_
"Unlocking the Size Advantage of New Standard: CAdES Signatures with Long-Term Validity" reference:_x000D_
https://doi.org/10.1109/ASYU62119.2024.10757034_x000D_
_x000D_
CAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31912201/01.03.01_60/en_31912201v010301p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:81dc8caa-a1e4-41a5-9452-bfbf9f65bcdf .

