camssa:9f61a29f-2b49-43ee-8f88-fc3c299672d2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"CAdES is included in 5 national catalogues of recommended specifications. They belong to Croatia, Cyprus, France, Poland and Spain. The National Interoperability Framework (NIF) of Spain and France are aligned with at least 3 out of 4 scoreboards of the EIF Monitoring according to the National Interoperability Framework Observatory (NIFO) factsheets._x000D_
_x000D_
CAMSS List of Standards: https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards_x000D_
_x000D_
NIFO Factsheets:_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/iopeu-monitoring/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2024_x000D_
_x000D_
France's catalogue:_x000D_
