camssa:a056b999-6918-48cf-98fd-31c55ab670bb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The CAdES Baseline signatures provides the involved stakeholders with a legally binding signature structure to formalise interoperability agreements. In this sense it provides the foundation of any agreement among any kind of participants. The specification also fosters and facilitates agreements by establishing a common method for signing electronic documents and data in a secure and trustworthy manner. This enables documents to be exchanged in an interoperable way, ensuring that all parties can access the documents and trust the information or data contained within them. By providing a standardised approach, CAdES helps to build confidence between parties and supports the reliable execution of digital transactions._x000D_
_x000D_
CAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31912201/01.03.01_60/en_31912201v010301p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:29c3cfd5-40eb-44da-a0e9-fc2898749720 .

camssa:a368557d-13f0-4045-867b-5e7c5f72212c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of the CAdES specification has been assessed in conjunction with other electronic signature specifications in an article on the "Special Issue Advanced Research in Technology and Information Systems" of the "Electronics" publication called "A Comprehensive and Privacy-Aware Approach for Remote Qualified Electronic Signatures". In the article the authors value the specification effectiveness in the integration with other cryptographic resources like blockchain and its eIDAS conformity._x000D_
_x000D_
CAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31912201/01.03.01_60/en_31912201v010301p.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
A Comprehensive and Privacy-Aware Approach for Remote Qualified Electronic Signatures reference:_x000D_
https://doi.org/10.3390/electronics13040757'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e7ca1e49-2fdb-467c-a951-09aafa7b500b .

camssa:a3ff977e-e070-4e53-8a57-f4cf21c07aee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'CAdES baseline signatures provides the stakeholders with the certainty that the exchanged documents are truthful for all. In this regard the different signature levels (B Basic, T Time, LT Long-Term and LTA Long-Term Archive) that can be embedded on the document  provide a wide arrangement of security levels to guarantee the correct and secure transmission of data and no tempering of it._x000D_
_x000D_
CAdES reference:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_en/319100_319199/31912201/01.03.01_60/en_31912201v010301p.pdf'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:44e06c2c-3152-45b8-ba41-7de10071446b .

