camssa:003421d0-d78f-40f3-ab6e-5e9b761be795 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx provides a formal, machine‑readable way to describe and validate RDF data structures, enabling different organisations to agree on common “shapes” as a shared model for data exchange. Moreover, ShEx schemas can be translated into SPARQL queries, meaning that any constraint expressible by a SPARQL graph pattern or data query can be captured as a ShEx shape, making shapes the common agreement on what the data should look like._x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx - Validating RDF data Reference:_x000D_
https://www.weso.es/websem/slides/course2223/03_ShExByExample.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1d319432-f8a5-4ad2-89b5-7228050eec21 .

camssa:01a0daaa-5d9e-4f46-94d9-beb78be2d0a2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:07fec51d-65d4-4c9d-9fec-bdfc6438de6a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx ensures and enables data processing accuracy by rigorously validating the structure and content of RDF data before it is processed. ShEx achieves accuracy by eliminating structural errors, controlling value ranges, and preventing the inclusion of unexpected data, therefore ensuring that processing systems only handle verified, predictable input._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:12faf410-bde4-4a34-bf7c-6f9b362efe62 .

camssa:090de865-f478-4edb-8b31-bc800b6c378a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is not included in any initiative at European or National level covering privacy aspects. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:fbe43801-c30d-4066-a37a-63590421b58a .

camssa:0931c56d-853b-4936-a9b7-d8f93e7ae24a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx allows relevant information to be reused to a significant extent, as it provides a standardised and machine-readable way to define data structures. By specifying the shapes and relationships of data, ShEx ensures that the same definitions can be applied across different datasets, systems, or projects, promoting both consistency and interoperability._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85d565ac-9b77-42d1-bc58-23873994cb12 .

camssa:0bd46856-a645-455a-bc21-d5f654df4865 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:0d04f5fd-ba39-4bac-887d-3e35cb95dda0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b37687b8bb3dbd4c6f96969358cf5d70900d1ccd01402cea7668da6303bec4b4 ;
    cav:value "60"^^xsd:string .

camssa:0d056c45-32f3-4b5d-9627-dda9f4ff6eee a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx main purpose is to define and validate the structure of RDF data. When a change (authorised or unauthorised) is made to the data, ShEx acts as a quality gate to ensure the modified data still conforms to the expected model. Therefore this criterion does not apply to the specification._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8d1b4385-2670-4beb-ad51-40759c4d5b4b .

camssa:0d43c299-4d52-40b6-a1a4-6d678a242043 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is not included in any open repository/catalogue of standards at European level._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15e9ae43-de3e-4b6f-a8c3-413d91a14e80 .

camssa:0e75fc15-3b74-49e9-8126-0230625081a9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ShEx specification is developed by a non-European organisation. In this sense, the specification cannot be considered a European standard._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions Github Reference:_x000D_
https://github.com/shexSpec/spec_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5b56f41a-ec03-443a-9e8a-0485471b2f6c .

