camssa:90c4c6f9-0375-4ee9-800e-bd0b28dd2085 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx specification does not include or define an explicit access control mechanism. The main function of ShEx is limited entirely to describing, validating, and ensuring the structural integrity of RDF data graphs. Therefore this criterion does not apply to the specification._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:948555f4-9e64-4da7-aa10-6d0315898869 .

camssa:91915185-445c-4a74-923b-447dcf11b1b5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The ShEx specification and schemas are publicly available for implementation and use on GitHub. The developer community involved with ShEx uses GitHub to collaborate on the specification, raise issues, and propose solutions for development. Additionally, platforms like StackOverflow serve as key channels where developers can ask and share technical questions, advice, and solutions, further supporting the robust growth and adoption of ShEx._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx Community Group:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/community/shex/_x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx StackOverflow Reference:_x000D_
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/shex_x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx Github:_x000D_
https://github.com/shexSpec/spec/issues'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4a27bc1f-ecba-4423-afb4-d7a866d8c234 .

camssa:948555f4-9e64-4da7-aa10-6d0315898869 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a16c678a586cf542d2ae1d6cd8a987bd6ed0b2af52ba0e04d8872fe616a9b7bd ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9aa84525-a82f-411d-bcc7-62b58723ef0d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-583a0f52df591048a41be40620830a70260e77855364174d91ba159970d8488e ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a08cc598-320b-44b6-92a9-8d877fc9fdb0 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of the ShEx specification has been assessed by multiple health institutions. In the study, "Modeling and validating HL7 FHIR profiles using semantic web Shape Expressions (ShEx)," researchers evaluated the specification's efficacy in describing and validating FHIR (Fast Healthcare Interoperability Resources) RDF data, which highlighted the considerable benefits of employing the ShEx RDF validator in that domain._x000D_
_x000D_
Modeling and validating HL7 FHIR profiles using semantic web Shape Expressions (ShEx):_x000D_
https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S1532046417300345_x000D_
_x000D_
Using Shape Expressions (ShEx) to Share RDF Data Models and to Guide Curation with Rigorous Validation:_x000D_
https://link.springer.com/chapter/10.1007/978-3-030-21348-0_39_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2ae3edae-5953-4f43-848e-73b1d3736e72 .

camssa:a228128d-6356-41ac-bd4e-87003dfde1b8 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b71e04068a444f6ee23c0863df43f19957762528381d6edece40e35c0efab242 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a3b67283-1a25-45a5-869e-ef4c8555bc69 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of ShEx is not related to e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0d04f5fd-ba39-4bac-887d-3e35cb95dda0 .

camssa:a8b6896c-f735-433f-8b97-82aaa0abced3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"ShEx can simplify the delivery of European public services by ensuring that data conforms to specific structural and value constraints (e.g., properties exist, data types are correct, values fall within a range)._x000D_
 _x000D_
For instance, a system that processes job applications might use a ShEx rule to ensure the applicant's date of birth field adheres strictly to the standard date format and verifies that the age falls within the eligible range (e.g., 18 to 65). This prevents bad data from entering the service's processing pipeline, directly reducing system errors, exceptions, and crashes that require complex error handling. By providing this common structure, ShEx can eliminate the need to manually verify the data from public administrations._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:70190da0-768a-498f-bb2e-e4e0adf7d438 .

camssa:b226750e-ce64-4e76-bdaa-705aa5546a87 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9420538a5a92af199b492414dd056ab7134e456f005895261b1a5b15a3f2814e ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:b3d2590d-cbb1-4201-a1b3-ec39c4b97e5f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'W3C provides the ShEx Simple Online Validator, an online tool that allows performing RDF data validation using Shape Expressions._x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx Simple Online Validator:_x000D_
https://rawgit.com/shexSpec/shex.js/master/packages/shex-webapp/doc/shex-simple.html_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:205fa391-dc12-41ae-ab6f-06475e75337c .

camssa:b436bf8a-d37f-49f3-9d7a-cffabfc5fe94 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-812668363d8f0cc562041fae6c588e1555372bf0bf5c16835be996dd72070013 ;
    cav:value "20"^^xsd:string .

camssa:b517a6be-1a6f-4946-a498-6a5a4240ad6c a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a60f86e868fe2bdcf0c5c47111455d1d5b59498172688e36f23a77baa347d916 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:b7625c1c-7eb6-4de1-899a-a9df8f9d5b4b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is fully dependent on RDF, which serves as a domain-neutral data model. As a result, the specification is inherently reusable across business domains that represent their information in RDF. Its structural validation mechanism can be applied to any RDF-based dataset, whether in public administration, healthcare, research, or other sectors._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C RDF Concepts and Abstract Data Model Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf12-concepts/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:febd33f1-3a49-4a5b-a1e3-3f58ed245b8a .

camssa:b98c85f4-6381-4bfb-99d5-52b848057f90 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:ba7ee1ca-accc-4a07-9a23-73c452366a93 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx enables data portability as it provides a common language to describe and share data structures between different systems or interfaces, making it easier to transfer data across platforms and understand it more easily._x000D_
_x000D_
An example of ShEx in use is the Hercules ASIO project, which aims to build a Research Management System (RMS) based on semantic open data. This system provides a unified view of research information across the Spanish University System (SUE), helping to improve management, analysis, and collaboration among universities and the public. In doing so, it also supports the development of European public services._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
Hercules ASIO Project ShEx Reference:_x000D_
https://datos.gob.es/en/blog/hercules-asio-initiative-integration-publication-and-consultation-linked-open-research-data'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a228128d-6356-41ac-bd4e-87003dfde1b8 .

camssa:bb8506e6-dcd8-4f09-8e70-4a4e8236c1ed a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The efficiency and utility of the ShEx specification have been assessed and demonstrated by multiple health institutions. In the study, "Development of a FHIR RDF data transformation and validation framework and its evaluation," researchers evaluated the specification's effectiveness at enhancing data quality and interoperability in both open and domain-specific contexts. ShEx has been successfully applied in areas such as healthcare and digital libraries, demonstrating its value for ensuring data consistency, validation, and reusability across diverse systems._x000D_
_x000D_
Development of a FHIR RDF data transformation and validation framework and its evaluation:_x000D_
https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/33781919/_x000D_
_x000D_
A Shape Expression approach for assessing the quality of Linked Open Data in digital libraries:_x000D_
https://www.semantic-web-journal.net/content/shape-expression-approach-assessing-quality-linked-open-data-digital-libraries_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ec7d89ef-4a41-490b-91d0-2127da5f3e51 .

camssa:bc832166-d8a9-4035-86d6-e496cc5385af a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is already associated to EIRA ABBs in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, ShEx can define the interoperability aspects of the "Conformance Testing" and "Data Quality" ABBs of the EIRA Technical-Application View, and "Semantic interoperability agreement" ABBs of the EIRA Semantic View._x000D_
_x000D_
ELIS referenece:_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/611_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9aa84525-a82f-411d-bcc7-62b58723ef0d .

camssa:c0544088-6c01-44c2-b49c-d0b13698f527 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:value "100%StrengthOfAssessmentScoreAverage"^^xsd:string,
        "84.32%AssessmentScoreAverage"^^xsd:string .

camssa:c09792b2-e9e8-46dd-ad4e-a9cc7927c3a7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx does work as a data validation and structural constrain language that can enforce precise rules when needed, to protect data quality and preventing errors that could expose sensitive information. The ShEx schema prescribes specific conditions that RDF data graphs must meet to be considered "conformant". This means data managers can ensure that data adheres to established privacy requirements (e.g., ensuring a record for a specific entity is complete or correctly linked)._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2e593e11-db37-4b0b-8ba6-647717634534 .

camssa:c136207f-eaa7-4324-b36a-489be3befcea a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx main function is to facilitate data exhange in RDF format by providing the means to validate RDF data graphs and does not directly enable the secure exchange of data. ShEx is a schema and validation language, not a security protocol, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4ab50526-8ce1-41cf-96e0-70cc98e0ac15 .

camssa:c76ea2c0-7ea4-4b11-bbce-657514180c05 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d9b9ce1d270550422a8ea6097d2ffa1d923267fd681c56280e3b7810a14a580a ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:c9643163-5f0e-42d8-8d4b-3a27456c0e53 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The W3C Royalty-Free IPR licenses granted under the W3C Patent Policy apply to all W3C specifications, including this specification.

W3C Patent practice:
https://www.w3.org/TR/patent-practice#ref-AC'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15d16800-9890-4caf-8aba-1589d2ba3e1c .

camssa:cdd34661-e542-4cdd-b373-aa125090c193 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx is the product of the ShEx Community Group from the W3C organisation. ShEx was first introduced in June 2014, as Shape Expressions 1.0 Primer (https://www.w3.org/submissions/2014/SUBM-shex-primer-20140602/). Moreover, the Shape Expressions Community Group (ShEx) was initiated in January 2017 on the W3C Community and Business Groups page. Since the release of this specification, several releases have been launched._x000D_
_x000D_
In this sense, in march 2017, the group launched the Shape Expressions (ShEx) Primer, a draft community group report, accompained by the ShapeMap Structure and Language release (ttps://shex.io/shape-map/). Since this release, different releases of the ShEx specification have been launched, being the latest one on the December 2022._x000D_
_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx Community Group Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/community/shex/_x000D_
_x000D_
ShEx Github Reference:_x000D_
https://github.com/shexSpec/spec/issues'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d5d75d9c-82e2-4043-b345-eabd0321d31a .

camssa:d239a148-b761-473f-84a4-6f251ee996f1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of ShEx is not related to enable the long-term preservation of data/information/knowledge (electronic records included. Therefore, this criterion does is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:316deea2-c270-4a1c-8164-1da832dbc06d .

camssa:d3925d94-c75a-44ed-9b7d-440b6acd06a3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a2e2820561158593079cf28230b73b9b7f1cb83da49b04d2317790e20c0c706f ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:d5d75d9c-82e2-4043-b345-eabd0321d31a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:d8f6410b-f18e-4cbd-9c21-831aabd01070 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx schemas ensure data is well-structured for release as open data because they are used for validating instance data, communicating interface parameters, defining complex data structures, and facilitating transformations into other formats. ShEx supports serialisation using ShExJ, a JSON-LD syntax, which is itself considered an open standard developed by the W3C._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
RDF Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/RDF'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0eb2f754-35ed-4103-85d7-d3da091bc873 .

camssa:dde24c96-886c-4c43-95a1-4e8bbf71ebeb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"ShEx is being used in projects such as the Hercules-ASIO Initiative. Furthermore, by 2019 ShEx Community Group, announced that Wikidata's support for ShEx moved from testing to deployment. Using a new Wikidata extension, ShEx schemas are stored in ShEx compact syntax on wiki pages and linked to a tool for checking selected data, which clearly demonstrates its value and effectiveness._x000D_
_x000D_
Hercules-ASIO Initiative:_x000D_
https://datos.gob.es/en/blog/hercules-asio-initiative-integration-publication-and-consultation-linked-open-research-data_x000D_
_x000D_
Wikidata W3C Announcement: _x000D_
https://www.w3.org/community/shex/2019/06/18/wikidata-infrastructure-supports-shex/_x000D_
_x000D_
Wikidata Schemas Reference:_x000D_
https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Wikidata:WikiProject_Schemas_x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5596078d-899e-4f23-b526-8a2dbe585f9b .

camssa:ebef6646-7d74-47a7-b6e9-fd43ac7444fb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx provides a schema mechanism for RDF data, enabling precise validation and documentation of data structures. While it does not directly expose or implement service interfaces, ShEx can support their development by ensuring that the RDF data exchanged through APIs or datasets is consistent and well-structured._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C RDF Concepts and Abstract Data Model Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf12-concepts/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:53f6c999-65dd-4add-9983-72246a72d9f3 .

camssa:ec7d89ef-4a41-490b-91d0-2127da5f3e51 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:f5b19c2c-82ee-4bdb-8794-b8a88d3cb6e3 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'ShEx can be applied in data model development (creating new ones and refining existing ones) and is useful for reviewing or validate data, as it identifies and corrects issues before the data enters a business workflow._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:17c22c66-c8e0-444e-8e9d-ac368cd244b9 .

camssa:f8bcab39-bfa5-4fd6-9a68-a54b50287b9d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'Since public administration procedures, rules, and services are often represented in RDF, ShEx can be applied to validate these datasets. By enforcing consistent and complete structures, ShEx ensures that all relevant elements of administrative procedures and services are correctly represented._x000D_
_x000D_
Shape Expressions (ShEx) 2.1 Reference:_x000D_
https://shex.io/shex-primer/_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C RDF Concepts and Abstract Data Model Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/rdf12-concepts/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8a4859f7-0216-48f2-bb4e-58858b0c26c6 .

camssa:fbe43801-c30d-4066-a37a-63590421b58a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-497a81dae06c1d53b4cfe96c1f998f6f65d46354d68a83d29a2950c984fc1166 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:febd33f1-3a49-4a5b-a1e3-3f58ed245b8a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
