camssa:026fb412-17f6-4cac-b071-eea6536b8bf7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XBRL GL is build on the XML standard, which is an open, text-based data format. This ensures that XBRL GL files are inherently portable and can be created, processed, and consumed on any operating system  or hardware architecture without modification. The specification defines the structure of the data itself, not the platform or environment used to handle it, guaranteeing interoperability across different technological platforms._x000D_
_x000D_
XML specification:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/xml/_x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2015 reference: _x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2015-03-25/GLTFTA-REC-2015-03-25.html_x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2017 reference:_x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2016-12-01/gl-framework-2017-PWD-2016-12-01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f3508a91-6ce7-4507-b565-6ea6f04288d4 .

camssa:06bb02dc-1894-467f-a6f9-6532d058683d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XBRL is an open standard, with our specifications freely available and freely licensed. It adopt policies that are Fair, Reasonable, and Non-Discriminatory (F/RAND) to encourage widespread, open adoption and implementation of their standards. This ensures that no single entity is unfairly advantaged or restricted from using the specification._x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2015 reference: _x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2015-03-25/GLTFTA-REC-2015-03-25.html_x000D_
 _x000D_
XBRL 2017 reference:_x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2016-12-01/gl-framework-2017-PWD-2016-12-01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:35e6b838-9038-443e-970a-be0514bbdeb4 .

camssa:0c12aaa9-6703-44d3-ada4-d7fa9f355a04 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ceebc7042ff4b3525981f67e306167d9711ac0bce6ea07a067cdb4881854db97 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:0c520616-91fd-46b0-a803-f4df7f402b16 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is developed as a common interface. XBRL GL facilitates the publication of open data in many ways. A primary goal of open data is that it be usable, and usability is enhanced by reliability. As an important facilitator of a seamless audit trail, XBRL GL is able to represent data from initial source events, activities or documents through to summarisation. As such, it can represent data at any level of detail, and standardise the communication of data appropriate to be open._x000D_
XBRL GL provides a single framework for information both quantitative and qualitative related to business_x000D_
reporting at any level of detail. In conjunction with any standardised code sets, it provides a single structure_x000D_
for expressing the representation of data._x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2015 reference:_x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2015-03-25/GLTFTA-REC-2015-03-25.html_x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2017 reference:_x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2016-12-01/gl-framework-2017-PWD-2016-12-01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:80400180-e163-4ce4-b4d1-06fa6fbb6a82 .

camssa:0ffeda01-6805-42c1-9f0d-87b472b154fa a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-549e39fc635763b9466e09688714b2908fcf7a349d4f4f0fe2a761bd6f502733 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:1687095e-266d-4796-8eaf-71ce50e42110 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'By providing a common, machine-readable format for complex data, XBRL GL allows public administrations to build automated digital channels (such as web portals and APIs) to replace manual, paper-based processes. A good example could be the European Single Electronic Format (ESEF), where companies use a digital channel to submit their annual reports in XBRL._x000D_
_x000D_
European Securities and Markets Authority (ESMA) - ESEF:_x000D_
https://www.esma.europa.eu/policy-activities/corporate-disclosure/european-single-electronic-format_x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2015 reference: _x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2015-03-25/GLTFTA-REC-2015-03-25.html_x000D_
 _x000D_
XBRL 2017 reference:_x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2016-12-01/gl-framework-2017-PWD-2016-12-01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:75eca306-17e7-4af0-89d9-79c648aabf95 .

camssa:16db7899-11a4-4e03-a63d-5c4f791a4664 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

