camssa:7034cc9c-983e-47a0-a4db-525c230258a9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The specification is designed to be customisable. Users can customise it by choosing to implement only the optional parts they need. But it also allows users to add their own unique business terms, making it highly adaptable to specific needs._x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL Essentials (Extensibility section):_x000D_
https://specifications.xbrl.org/xbrl-essentials.html_x000D_
_x000D_
