camssa:77cf5077-0bf7-4d42-bc4a-e84070e33407 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XBRL GL specification is included in an open repository at the European level. It is mandated by the European Securities and Markets Authority (ESMA). This mandate is published in the Official Journal of the European Union (via EUR-Lex), the official and permanent repository for all EU law and referenced standards._x000D_
_x000D_
European Single Electronic Format (ESEF) Regulation:_x000D_
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg_del/2019/815/oj_x000D_
_x000D_
