        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XBRL International has a public reviewing period for all of its specifications._x000D_
XBRL GL consultations can be conducted by XBRL International members and " volunteers" using the _x000D_
"public working drafts"._x000D_
_x000D_
