camssa:e58e8a71-a885-408c-8281-20835338c104 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'XBRL 2.1, which XBRL GL is based on, is referenced in "Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2016/120 of 28 January 2016 on the identification of the eXtensible Business Reporting Language 2.1 for referencing in public procurement". In this Implementing Decision, the XBRL 2.1 specification is identified as an ICT technical specification eligible for referencing in public procurement._x000D_
_x000D_
Commission Implementing Decision (EU) 2016/120:_x000D_
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/dec_impl/2016/120/oj/eng_x000D_
_x000D_
XBRL 2015 reference: _x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2015-03-25/GLTFTA-REC-2015-03-25.html_x000D_
 _x000D_
XBRL 2017 reference:_x000D_
https://www.xbrl.org/int/gl/2016-12-01/gl-framework-2017-PWD-2016-12-01.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:812bcd97-aac5-463b-872e-4ebe16a85536 .

camssa:e7a48ea3-ee23-4587-b3ff-1225d2258ec4 a cav:Score,
