camssa:557f63e1-8b62-43c8-ab20-5a7aef4487a2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:58313c67-ab3a-4b30-a434-2e3307f1ef08 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC effectiveness is demonstrated through its widespread adoption, interoperability certifications, security evaluations, and successful use in industry and public sector projects. Projects like eIDAS 2.0 pilots and EBSI evaluate OIDC’s effectiveness for public sector authentication under European frameworks. Moreover, the extensive use of OIDC by major identity providers (Google, Microsoft, Apple) and government services indicates its effectiveness in providing secure, interoperable authentication._x000D_
_x000D_
ESBI OIDC Authorisation endpoint:_x000D_
https://hub.ebsi.eu/apis/conformance/conformance/v3/get-authorize_x000D_
_x000D_
OIDC²: Open Identity Certiﬁcation withOpenID Connect_x000D_
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/378896695_OIDC2_Open_Identity_Certification_With_OpenID_Connect_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:27fdba46-3db3-45ac-a536-f5798a1dddc8 .

camssa:58c31c81-eecd-4a45-81c3-f9beab88d1ba a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC specification introduces a secure and standardised authentication layer that supports organisational interoperability agreements, especially in environments requiring both authentication and delegated authorisation._x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bc5cd6b3-24aa-44cf-b5c0-f483ccadada5 .

camssa:5e134691-9bd3-40bc-a359-068710e423a4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3dd3a1fb1ac7d78d162dab36230e70a34459f38a795e765cc5fdd304c8c04907 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:60aa4a3b-a727-4260-b088-b9a780f681bc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b00b9b74de866ed2278d14d1b9d7ecf2c06950d296bb2f17013c7b710d6de41 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:619f5e64-bd21-40f1-bbf1-d8ae42a3af5f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC ensures the authentication and authenticity of users involved in data transactions by providing a standardised framework for verifying identities through trusted identity providers. It supports mechanisms such as signed ID tokens, standardised claims, and token validation, which allow relying parties to confirm that the user is who they claim to be. In addition, OIDC can authenticate applications or clients requesting data, ensuring that only authorised services can access user information._x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification Authenticity and Authentication reference:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html#IDToken_x000D_
_x000D_
How OKTA and OIDC works together:_x000D_
https://www.okta.com/openid-connect/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c77fa3f8-35a8-4aa4-a7bb-96b1d73a9153 .

camssa:63de7d5b-2bad-421d-a8b8-2f3f3da125db a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-497a81dae06c1d53b4cfe96c1f998f6f65d46354d68a83d29a2950c984fc1166 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:65c56466-f2bf-4350-857f-7e0ac1cbb1d4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-f53dee88cf8529a93a68be781005e903c270057da1a72e2f89e8cb154be0c51b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:67e87186-0a63-404e-9795-5db45308accd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC specification ensures long-term stability for public services. The OpenID Foundation (OIDF) follows a strictly documented process where every update must pass through three distinct stages: Draft, Implementer’s Draft, and Final Specification. Each stage requires mandatory public review and formal approval gates, ensuring that changes are predictable, backward-compatible, and consensus-based. This transparency guarantees that the specification evolves safely without sudden, disruptive changes._x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Foundation:_x000D_
https://openid.net/foundation/_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Foundation Approving Specifications:_x000D_
https://openid.net/wg/resources/approving-specifications/_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification reference:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:65c56466-f2bf-4350-857f-7e0ac1cbb1d4 .

camssa:6823456a-9072-4558-a38a-20c306280967 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'1 Member State is recommending OIDC in its ICT National Catalogues. This Member States is France._x000D_
_x000D_
CAMSS List of Standards:_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:380b9daf-8f8a-4ebf-8705-1216d13455b1 .

camssa:6945a80f-583c-43f7-8788-4f2964f6c34d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-549e39fc635763b9466e09688714b2908fcf7a349d4f4f0fe2a761bd6f502733 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:6b214b91-bc21-452f-a19d-4d7a1743532f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC may be used freely and without royalties, with no restrictions on implementation beyond compliance with the specification and any applicable trademark guidelines. The OpenID Foundation (OIDF) grants to any Contributor, developer, implementer, or other interested party a non-exclusive, royalty free, worldwide copyright license to reproduce, prepare derivative works from, distribute, perform and display._x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Foundation OIDC Working Group:_x000D_
https://openid.net/wg/connect/_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Foundation Intellectual Property & Contribution Agreements:_x000D_
https://openid.net/intellectual-property/openid-foundation-contribution-agreements/_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification reference:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:60aa4a3b-a727-4260-b088-b9a780f681bc .

camssa:6eb91dac-9834-44da-9a1f-8df43e72c115 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "60"^^xsd:string .

