camssa:924b8168-4fe3-4573-af90-f598af94e641 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC is already associated to an EIRA ABB in the EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS). More specifically, DNS can define the interoperability aspects of the "Cloud Private Network" ABB from Technical view - Infrastructure and "Authentication" and "Identificaction" ABB from Technical view - application._x000D_
_x000D_
EIRA Library of Interoperability Specifications (ELIS):_x000D_
https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/solution/elis/release/v610_x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9ad73985-6bc2-485c-9b01-75badb6f76b7 .

camssa:96c18055-3581-40ef-9cb5-41b5a52d8628 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'OIDC simplifies the business processes by providing secure user authentication and identity verification. It enables users to sign in to services such as cross-border public administration platforms, eGovernment portals, and EU digital identity initiatives using trusted identity providers._x000D_
_x000D_
OpenID Connect specification:_x000D_
https://openid.net/specs/openid-connect-core-1_0.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4571526e-245d-4b70-99f2-30a196d5173a .

