camssa:dfb257b9-f4df-4445-9534-08ba190be8e8 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'JWT is developed by IETF, a non-European organisation. However, it is used by many European countries and has also been adopted in different European projects, such as the EUDI Wallet. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
JWT Reference:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7519.html_x000D_
_x000D_
IETF Organisation:_x000D_
https://www.ietf.org/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:89086190-abab-4466-a143-e334791e6ba8 .

