    cav:judgement """'SD-JWT is not related to the publication of data on the web, as it is designed to securely transmit information between parties. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SD-JWT Reference:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9901.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c86413e-f9dd-47eb-bfc3-f27d9f1429b0 .

