involved in the data transactions. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:728c03bb-8b67-414d-92fe-ffff363e0409 .

