camssa:2703f008-dcf4-4f8d-91a9-b0c095e49e3d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is a flexible framework designed to improve software security across any type of organisation. Because it focuses on the security of the development process rather than the specific purpose of the software, it can be applied equally to health, business, legal, or government sectors._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3345fe36-d1d5-4dc4-84ac-6c8739d81d70 .

camssa:2de12ebc-c688-4ae9-9063-6bd9700f5528 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3b3b2febe9a7e3ad44bdefc47b0bbcafc7a2e677e9570d6ad822efbe1f7d41e2 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:300a4c3e-bd02-43c3-bffe-8b809ea7d8d0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:31cd91d6-0c63-4137-a490-9c384d5aa97f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a60f86e868fe2bdcf0c5c47111455d1d5b59498172688e36f23a77baa347d916 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:3345fe36-d1d5-4dc4-84ac-6c8739d81d70 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-50ab6a29689585b917f7b2972d2c41e8c8c52723c2d58eb9b92109c938d4e825 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:346784f4-1ff3-41ad-a0ec-d158c977227d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of SAMM is not related to facilitate the publication of data on the web. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a383ddcf-f9a4-44f6-901e-f61cf5f030e4 .

camssa:362166fb-9712-4d2b-afe0-e13d7fa20fe9 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is a framework designed to help organisations build better security into their software. It includes specific requirements for access control within its "Data Protection" and "Security Architecture" practices. While it does not provide the technical tools to perform access control, it explicitly defines the rules and maturity levels that organisations should follow to ensure only authorised people can access or change data._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Data Protection Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/operations/operational-management/stream-a/_x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Security Architecture Practice:_x000D_
https://codific.com/implementing-the-secure-architecture-practice-in-owasp-samm/#:~:text=It%20is%20the%20practice%20of%20application%20security%20architecture,an%20architectural%20solution%20as%20well%20as%20technological%20implementation._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f1bf6b01-53d5-4cdc-a292-bb8b918b6a48 .

camssa:39a3496a-5a25-4412-bdc8-d67874098f20 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-497a81dae06c1d53b4cfe96c1f998f6f65d46354d68a83d29a2950c984fc1166 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:3c08b46a-2a2f-4a82-bd11-4c1bf5f98b2f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of this specification is not related to enable the e-accessibility. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification. _x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0c354a20-7b17-4568-8076-82b557edd91f .

camssa:451110c0-0413-441c-be05-4c0c864ababe a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SAMM specification is maintained by the OWASP Foundation, which is an international organisation based in the United States. While it is not developed by a European-based SDO, it is widely used and recommended in several relevant European initiatives and guidelines. Because it is an international standard applied within the European context, this criterion is considered not applicable._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:adb4a318-5b57-4acb-878c-922feaac3c0d .

camssa:464c4263-f531-4661-8147-d4bcd8b0c6b2 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:4b95c236-e5b9-41ce-8d21-99fb99b60fb7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM helps different organisations work together by providing a common language and a standardised structure for software security. It includes specific practices like "Policy and Compliance" that help set clear expectations and security goals between parties. This makes it much easier for organisations to reach agreements on security standards._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Policy and Compliance Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/governance/policy-and-compliance/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:db8e9301-0e2c-46c7-98dc-2ec42492b5b0 .

camssa:4c2b987d-720a-4a0a-8c0f-62d328e997dd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM’s purpose is focused on helping and improving security capabilities within organisations and software development. By applying SAMM, public administrations can work towards ensuring secure and trustworthy data exchange with all stakeholders. The model includes a specific "Data Protection" practice that guides organisations on how to safeguard sensitive information and a "Policy and Compliance" practice to help them align with external regulatory requirements. While it provides the framework to ensure data remains authentic and intact, it focuses on the management processes rather than the specific technical implementation for data transmission._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Data Protection Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/operations/operational-management/stream-a/_x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Policy and Compliance Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/governance/policy-and-compliance/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:84c53a4e-a7b4-419d-967d-4b11b48f8035 .

camssa:4c353330-0c80-4250-b1cd-c7e738d362c5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is recognised in European initiatives as a key framework for building secure and private software. The European Union Agency for Cybersecurity (ENISA) highlights the importance of using maturity models, such as SAMM in its reports on cybersecurity best practices. This helps organisations across the EU follow a structured approach to protecting data and meeting high security standards._x000D_
_x000D_
ENISA - Good Practices for Supply Chain Cybersecurity:_x000D_
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/good-practices-for-supply-chain-cybersecurity_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:39a3496a-5a25-4412-bdc8-d67874098f20 .

camssa:4c35ca88-0883-47a9-956f-2138b06b9807 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is licensed under CC, which essentially means that the commercial use of the work and possible derivative works is allowed, the distribution of which must be done with a license equal to the one that regulates the original work._x000D_
_x000D_
Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International (CC BY-SA 4.0):_x000D_
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a02acf34-155c-4b7d-b926-9b403ffe1f21 .

camssa:4e7dbe1d-91a6-406c-bcca-cc1b4fc3d1a0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b122f4f42ca2089ee158a31d932d6a0332aa3a4d04acce1e2e7aa140815a0ec ;
    cav:value "20"^^xsd:string .

camssa:54b62132-eb90-44b7-9671-f368f9beb84b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-7d12b846c487e7201dbcf395866b5abc0bb5fa040b1f519127b6a5f56d447257 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:563b7fc8-4ed2-41d3-9aeb-59a77d32652e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"The SAMM specification follows a community-driven model where any interested stakeholder can join the working group, participate in discussions, and contribute to the model's evolution. Participation is primarily managed through public platforms such as GitHub, and there are no fees or restrictive registration processes required to contribute to the development of the specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM GitHub Contribution:_x000D_
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Current%20Releases/head/contributing-to-git.md_x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP Foundation Membership and Participation:_x000D_
https://owasp.org/membership/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:211cf441-444b-4b33-a0e5-5fb2dc563426 .

camssa:580634b9-1139-4dca-be3b-013efe12d5bb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SAMM specification includes requirements for the proper protection and management of data throughout its entire lifetime. Within the "Data Protection" practice, the model specifically guides organisations on how to handle data retention and disposal over time. While it does not provide the technical storage tools itself, it ensures that the necessary rules and processes for preserving information are built into the software development lifecycle._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Data Protection Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/operations/operational-management/stream-a/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:72f16aa0-ce7e-46d4-8015-fb87bed1f247 .

camssa:586274cc-b5b1-4147-9c74-4017cc20746e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM was first released in 2009 and has since become a leading framework for managing software security. It is highly relevant today as it helps organisations meet the high security standards required by European regulations, ensuring that digital services are built to be safe and reliable from the start._x000D_
_x000D_
The most recent major release, SAMM v2.0, marked a significant milestone by completely modernising the framework to align with modern development practices, such as Agile and DevOps. It is a stable, well-documented standard that gives organisations a clear and mature way to plan and measure their security programmes._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM v2.0 Release Announcement:_x000D_
https://owasp.org/2020/02/11/SAMM-v2_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM GitHub Repository (Release History):_x000D_
https://github.com/owaspsamm/core/releases_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:796d5aef-0a7c-4829-ae3b-b1a5da8b1ef3 .

camssa:59702c95-8506-4d22-abf0-a025703ce676 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of SAMM is not related to enable the comprehensibility of administrative information, data or services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification. _x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:54b62132-eb90-44b7-9671-f368f9beb84b .

camssa:5aa19cbe-4412-4784-8aba-977d081662e5 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
