camssa:7ad00efd-770d-41b5-82f0-8ff0ac388907 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'There is no evidence of SAMM being included as a formal standard. However, the specification is highly recognised and recommended by European agencies such as ENISA and ETSI within their guidelines and best practices for securing digital solutions._x000D_
_x000D_
ETSI SmartM2M; Security; Standards Landscape and best practices:_x000D_
https://www.etsi.org/deliver/etsi_tr/103500_103599/103533/01.01.01_60/tr_103533v010101p.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
ENISA Advancing Software Security in the EU:_x000D_
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/advancing-software-security-through-the-eu-certification-framework_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9a9a244d-da04-43a9-abab-5db654eaee66 .

camssa:7cba5089-ed37-4ff5-b0ce-1c5debd24ce5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is designed with a modular structure that explicitly allows incremental implementation. The model is divided into five business functions and fifteen security practices, enabling organisations to prioritise and implement specific areas based on their unique risk profile and available resources. This ensures that the framework can be adopted in stages, allowing a tailored approach to improving software security maturity over time._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:c5a1467d-52f2-4246-8e80-7a9799058938 .

camssa:80e58a4c-401d-4cf4-bd71-2fad87c05bf2 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is actively used in several European cross-border initiatives to improve software security. For instance, the European Union Agency for Cybersecurity (ENISA) recommends it as a reference framework for secure software development lifecycles. This helps organisations across the EU adopt a common approach to building resilient and trustworthy digital services, ensuring that security standards are consistent across borders._x000D_
_x000D_
ENISA - Advancing Software Security in the EU:_x000D_
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/advancing-software-security-through-the-eu-certification-framework_x000D_
_x000D_
ENISA - Good Practices for Security of IoT:_x000D_
https://www.enisa.europa.eu/publications/good-practices-for-security-of-iot-1_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e200e3ca-1926-42ee-9a5a-da93cc377bc1 .

camssa:84c53a4e-a7b4-419d-967d-4b11b48f8035 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3dd3a1fb1ac7d78d162dab36230e70a34459f38a795e765cc5fdd304c8c04907 ;
    cav:value "60"^^xsd:string .

camssa:85bb3afe-3cb0-44d8-b58e-e0ac23e1d7ba a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9b3cb1ef128e2a87386258a5812c05b520024e6e4a404d1f1d6f0e35707e8a7b ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9267d218-73a9-4581-ad4e-1edbbac5b21b a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM simplifies the delivery of public services by providing a clear and standardised roadmap for software security. Instead of each department creating its own security rules from scratch, they can follow this proven model to build digital public services more efficiently. This fact helps public administrations to create and implement secure digital public services without wasting time and means. _x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1821bc96-0bb1-47da-bcf8-b43fec437bfe .

camssa:950adae0-e0ca-4ab3-9049-174b9b1f68eb a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-29023937877d658f898d48a06b2648e283306a041137cc58af4f79f061e1de4b ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9823b15c-ba20-49e8-a92d-ef6f1828be3f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d9b9ce1d270550422a8ea6097d2ffa1d923267fd681c56280e3b7810a14a580a ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9a9a244d-da04-43a9-abab-5db654eaee66 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-549e39fc635763b9466e09688714b2908fcf7a349d4f4f0fe2a761bd6f502733 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9d87e0d1-a338-45fe-9fc7-187eb8a91726 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b71e04068a444f6ee23c0863df43f19957762528381d6edece40e35c0efab242 ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a01421d0-d499-448f-8a7f-ddbe8d5d542f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is supported by official resources that allow organisations to measure how well they are following the model. The OWASP Foundation provides the "SAMM Toolbox", which includes assessment spreadsheets and calculators designed to check and validate an organisation's security maturity levels. These tools ensure that the assessment process is structured and consistent, making it easy to track progress and measure results._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM Assessment Tools:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/assessment/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ecdb87c0-5fe2-45e6-a4e1-91cb98d81140 .

camssa:a02acf34-155c-4b7d-b926-9b403ffe1f21 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b00b9b74de866ed2278d14d1b9d7ecf2c06950d296bb2f17013c7b710d6de41 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a383ddcf-f9a4-44f6-901e-f61cf5f030e4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a6c7009b-bb35-4e12-b3ea-4fbc9cb75db1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3beae22dd24b0dbc955ce74a9fe755390983d8436a45b401461ceaaa7a5d1609 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a86525cf-933c-4571-9eef-1046356c7417 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is not included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications._x000D_
_x000D_
CAMSS List of standards_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards_x000D_
_x000D_
DPA Factsheets_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/iopeu-monitoring/digital-public-administration-factsheets-2025 _x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:05562294-57ca-4508-9244-fff8e495c916 .

camssa:ab31e97b-f090-4548-ad73-8d93e8c63dad a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:value "100%StrengthOfAssessmentScoreAverage"^^xsd:string,
        "87.65%AssessmentScoreAverage"^^xsd:string .

camssa:ad67f0a9-ba79-4dce-ba9e-e132b4600cf7 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is technology agnostic as it focuses on security practices and maturity levels rather than specific technical implementations. It is designed to be applied to any software development project, regardless of the programming language, framework, or technology stack being used._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:7a895069-2007-4c60-8fa8-d118333330d2 .

camssa:adb4a318-5b57-4acb-878c-922feaac3c0d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-17a2b7a0ca372f407c300b69049faf9d92cbf274964290ba278b18cf10bf5dbf ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:ae025a86-f3b8-485d-a008-91bec62abc86 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SAMM specification enables digital service delivery channels by providing a clear framework to secure the software used for public services. This allows administrations to move in-person procedures online with confidence, ensuring they are safe from cyber threats and reliable for the public._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:d89c9d47-e9c4-4639-a70a-f6b04fb00284 .

camssa:b444f0b2-2cda-4f18-a12f-cb2c10f973f5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is designed to be flexible, allowing organisations to pick and choose the security practices that are most relevant to them. While the overall framework is fixed, users can customise their implementation by prioritising specific areas and setting their own maturity goals based on their unique risks and resources._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9823b15c-ba20-49e8-a92d-ef6f1828be3f .

camssa:ba46ce92-6667-4deb-b1c7-a82135b0ed38 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"SAMM is maintained by the OWASP Foundation. There is a dedicated project team and a large global community of volunteers who work together to keep the model updated and provide support to users. They manage the specification through public platforms, such as GitHub, ensuring that anyone can get help or contribute to the project's maintenance._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP Foundation:_x000D_
https://owasp.org/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM GitHub Repository:_x000D_
https://github.com/owaspsamm/core_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:07813d27-1afc-4bfd-b4ce-80b37e66325b .

camssa:bf2f188a-aea7-4395-b970-553c4115ad00 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-847f0d7b5b56f9491b75fadd87efa1d6bdb112bcbb660d2ec7b6d786d403360f ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:c5a1467d-52f2-4246-8e80-7a9799058938 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ec3f8a897147f530040ab94fb9bbee9fdad56e7256b2ce6fbb63cf1465315d91 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:c86775f0-d8e8-46aa-8504-573c1fe08995 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SAMM specification follows an open development lifecycle where public review is a fundamental step for both major and minor releases. Before any version is officially finalised, drafts are made available for community feedback. This process is primarily conducted through GitHub, where all comments, suggestions, and discussions are publicly visible, ensuring a transparent and collaborative release process._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM GitHub Issues (Public Review and Feedback):_x000D_
https://github.com/owaspsamm/core/issues_x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP Project Governance and Transparency:_x000D_
https://owasp.org/www-policy/operational/projects_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2de12ebc-c688-4ae9-9063-6bd9700f5528 .

camssa:ca4ad7be-1552-4b55-a650-6b603592eb47 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is not currently included in any national catalogue of recommended specifications._x000D_
_x000D_
CAMSS List of Standards:_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4e7dbe1d-91a6-406c-bcca-cc1b4fc3d1a0 .

camssa:ccdc180f-b3ca-45b8-ad5c-14b964a001bb a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9420538a5a92af199b492414dd056ab7134e456f005895261b1a5b15a3f2814e ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:d6d02a0d-b925-4cd6-b8e3-cb0c141261f4 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        dcat:Distribution ;
    dcat:accessURL "https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss"^^xsd:anyURI .

camssa:d77d3d56-e11c-494b-a886-e36e85034acd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is designed to help organisations improve their security, and a big part of that is making sure only the right people can access sensitive data. It includes a dedicated "Data Protection" practice that requires organisations to set up access controls and manage data confidentiality. While it doesn't provide the technical code to restrict access, it gives a clear set of requirements to ensure these protections are built into the software development process._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Data Protection Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/operations/operational-management/stream-a/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:950adae0-e0ca-4ab3-9049-174b9b1f68eb .

camssa:d89c9d47-e9c4-4639-a70a-f6b04fb00284 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:db210f69-b347-42a5-a77f-4e614f4290fb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of SAMM is not related to enable the secure exchenage of data. Therefore, this criterion is not_x000D_
applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a6c7009b-bb35-4e12-b3ea-4fbc9cb75db1 .

camssa:db8e9301-0e2c-46c7-98dc-2ec42492b5b0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-51782b9aa4b92f4aba322a549b9d3972e304ca68f9353073c29add782502d910 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:dd6a00fd-87b3-43d9-8686-1cc10858bf25 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM was first created in 2009 and was later adopted by the OWASP Foundation as a flagship project. It has grown into a globally recognised standard that helps organisations build a clear strategy for software security, with version 2.0 being the most recent major update._x000D_
_x000D_
The model is very relevant for modern digital services, helping them stay secure and compliant with international standards. Its market acceptance is proven by its use in major initiatives, such as the SAMM Benchmark project, which tracks how different organisations across the globe are successfully implementing the framework to protect their software._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM Benchmark Project:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/benchmark/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:31cd91d6-0c63-4137-a490-9c384d5aa97f .

camssa:e200e3ca-1926-42ee-9a5a-da93cc377bc1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6184fb705cfed44856c7b9594b492926f7a63a128a5a2be7b896294d8c79838 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:e55cb4ea-cb52-4176-af28-caa902f2c119 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d2c939f8f97b2a02c254da4add5fcbea1311d465178344adc029d82366a0f642 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:e7cee7ad-ff64-4104-8159-fe267af8b816 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"SAMM is supported by a very active community that shares ideas and solutions on platforms like GitHub. Instead of traditional forums, developers and security experts use GitHub to discuss the model's implementation and suggest improvements in real-time._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM GitHub Repository:_x000D_
https://github.com/owaspsamm/core_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bf2f188a-aea7-4395-b970-553c4115ad00 .

camssa:ecdb87c0-5fe2-45e6-a4e1-91cb98d81140 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6fa642bc8eceff2b1d333dc1123748399264c028fde2fd78308f0a0209ae21b ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:f0c5c3db-0130-4411-b098-6d5bd2da392f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM introduces a "Data Protection" practice that focuses on maintaining data integrity and preventing unauthorised modifications. Additionally, the "Requirements Testing" practice encourages thorough checks to make sure the software handles information correctly according to business rules._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Data Protection Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/operations/operational-management/stream-a/_x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Requirements Testing Practice:_x000D_
https://github.com/OWASP/samm/blob/master/Current%20Releases/v2.0b/core/design/d-security-requirements.md_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:85bb3afe-3cb0-44d8-b58e-e0ac23e1d7ba .

camssa:f1bf6b01-53d5-4cdc-a292-bb8b918b6a48 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a16c678a586cf542d2ae1d6cd8a987bd6ed0b2af52ba0e04d8872fe616a9b7bd ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:f1ce4ef4-f932-42c2-91a2-d2498c1d5edb a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The scalability and broad character of the specification can make possible the creation and the availability of solutions fostering the reuse and availability of information between administrations and citizens. This fact demonstrates that the specification can foster the implementation of the once-only principle while ensuring the security and trustworthy data exchanges. _x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0dab3e1d-8c70-4910-bae6-af487e083b53 .

camssa:f3ec27cb-00b8-479d-ab62-6de0a7f53d34 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SAMM specification is a framework designed to measure and improve software security maturity, rather than a language for modelling business processes. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to this specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:6541a282-2f88-40e4-ae05-3031af7d5fc3 .

camssa:f48933e5-22f7-46df-9b6e-b12753014da5 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM allows organisations to extend the model by adding their own security activities or mapping it to other specific standards. This flexibility means that the specification can be adapted to include new functionalities or requirements that are not part of the core model, ensuring it remains relevant for different technical environments._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:08787a6f-05e9-4f45-9c75-a68571e51ad1 .

camssa:f7de6078-282d-4831-b134-ce55a1d1cbd6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The effectiveness of the SAMM specification has been assessed by researchers from the University of Maribor. In the "A Maturity Model for Sustainable Software Development: A Case Study of the OWASP SAMM" study, the SAMM specification is proposed as a framework to measure and improve the security of software development, facilitating the identification of security gaps and the implementation of better security practices._x000D_
_x000D_
"A Maturity Model for Sustainable Software Development: A Case Study of the OWASP SAMM" study:_x000D_
https://www.mdpi.com/2071-1050/15/12/9337_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:262137c0-6c1d-41bb-9583-d5fdd7365201 .

camssa:f9d21fbc-9ed2-4ba2-94b4-4108e36950a6 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The purpose of this specification is not related to enable the delivery of multilingual public services. Therefore, this criterion is not applicable to the specification._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:72defbd3-d523-48be-8e3b-9c04396b85dc .

camssa:fba12ae4-c860-4fbf-9265-1e21907c8da1 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM is platform agnostic as it is not tied to any specific operating system, hardware, or cloud environment. It is designed to be a universal framework that can be applied by any organisation, regardless of the platforms they use to develop or host their software._x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:ccdc180f-b3ca-45b8-ad5c-14b964a001bb .

camssa:fc827899-f563-44ed-8fe2-deb1e53ae574 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SAMM includes a specific "Data Protection" practice that focuses on protecting data from unauthorised changes. It also covers "Secure Build" activities, which involve using mechanisms such as code signing to verify that software has not been tampered with. While SAMM does not provide the technical tools itself, it introduces the necessary requirements to ensure data integrity is maintained throughout the development process._x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Data Protection Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/operations/operational-management/stream-a/_x000D_
_x000D_
OWASP SAMM - Secure Build Practice:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/model/implementation/secure-build/_x000D_
_x000D_
SAMM reference:_x000D_
https://owaspsamm.org/about/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:15f91fda-4eaa-4df6-b58d-c225f1d90cd0 .

