    cav:judgement """'REST specification conformance can be manually assessed by following its architectural constraints to help_x000D_
in obtaining a uniform interface and guiding the behaviour of components. No conformance testing platform has been found, however, there are accessible assessment online guides._x000D_
_x000D_
