camssa:5eb613fa-889f-4109-b5df-fe445456cf17 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'REST is the core architectural style that powers the modern web. It is built on open, standardised protocols like HTTP and URI, which are maintained by the IETF. This approach allows data to be shared in structured and non-proprietary formats, making it accessible to everyone without needing special software. It also follows Tim Berners-Lee’s 5-star open data principles by using URIs to identify information and allowing different pieces of data to be linked together._x000D_
_x000D_
IETF - HTTP Semantics:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9110.html_x000D_
_x000D_
API REST advantages:_x000D_
https://www.bbvaapimarket.com/es/mundo-api/api-rest-que-es-y-cuales-son-sus-ventajas-en-el-desarrollo-de-proyectos/_x000D_
_x000D_
The 5-star of Tim Berners-Lee can be found in the following link:_x000D_
https://5stardata.info/en/_x000D_
_x000D_
REST reference:_x000D_
https://restfulapi.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9b55a727-3401-46c8-9212-6f0d6c780ab9 .

camssa:636d98aa-45d4-4cc5-8835-e5d549b2713e a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'REST was first defined in the doctoral thesis of Roy Thomas Fielding and has since become the most popular architectural style for web services. While  there is no single organisation dedicated solely to supporting the REST architectural style. Instead, support is found through a vast network of public online channels where users share knowledge and help each other. Platforms such as Stack Overflow and GitHub host millions of discussions regarding RESTful implementations, ensuring that developers have access to a wealth of community-driven expertise._x000D_
_x000D_
Roy Thomas Fielding Doctoral Thesis:_x000D_
https://dl.acm.org/doi/book/10.5555/932295_x000D_
_x000D_
Stack Overflow - REST Community Discussions:_x000D_
https://stackoverflow.com/questions/tagged/rest_x000D_
_x000D_
GitHub - REST API Topic:_x000D_
https://github.com/topics/rest-api_x000D_
_x000D_
REST reference:_x000D_
https://restfulapi.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2425e2dc-ba7a-4e31-aefe-7fbe0a02bc18 .

camssa:693b54b6-ff88-430b-a98d-fa055914c98e a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

