camssa:ff0c1177-2c43-4fda-acfa-b91113ad381a a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The efficiency of the REST specification has been assessed by researchers. In the "Best Practices in REST API Design for Enhanced Scalability and Security" study, the REST specification is proposed as a set of architectural principles for building scalable web services, facilitating the optimisation of data handling and improved system performance through efficient resource management._x000D_
_x000D_
"Best Practices in REST API Design for Enhanced Scalability and Security" study:_x000D_
https://www.researchgate.net/publication/383599280_Best_Practices_in_REST_API_Design_for_Enhanced_Scalability_and_Security_x000D_
_x000D_
REST reference:_x000D_
https://restfulapi.net/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:73f5e3d2-a0f5-496d-a501-ecde9dea15b0 .

