https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:bb015013-622d-46bd-b513-1198dc8a375a .

camssa:833413df-24e7-4360-8053-ab92838d202b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b71e04068a444f6ee23c0863df43f19957762528381d6edece40e35c0efab242 ;
    cav:value "40"^^xsd:string .

camssa:8399e8e7-a849-4e94-9068-729295f4e682 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-69e927013383f3944a629c01e930a6663b8304aa5f3137b9a5de3c02d34da401 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:83e16490-f49a-4ce5-926e-4ebc3c7bba47 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26aeec3cf5b3b4879325e85fcd751d0c17f62c6c3113109fb100883a553ec0af ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:86038970-7c8d-4773-9bd1-c9e8cfb9e9fc a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3dd3a1fb1ac7d78d162dab36230e70a34459f38a795e765cc5fdd304c8c04907 ;
    cav:value "60"^^xsd:string .

camssa:87e77a33-4247-4355-a5fd-a0a5987d5418 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH is a low-level, binary-transparent transport protocol designed for secure remote login and command execution: its primary function is to provide an encrypted tunnel for communication, but does not manage, store, or define the structure of administrative data or citizen information, nor does it provide an information model for such data. Therefore, it does not directly address the Once-Only Principle, which aims to ensure that users are asked for relevant information only once by public administrations._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a4b4b45e-9f88-404b-b784-27eaeac2b1e4 .

camssa:8b2f15c0-2bb8-45ab-ab12-3c0587942c72 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-fb2c0a4ddb03b09ecd5450c5a1d6aeed4e51c2a0387709a95a89cd850a7dd180 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:8e376462-033d-4253-8a8d-32e2fd4b3bb6 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:90356ad7-ee72-4459-9dfe-55a6a9eaf2f1 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a6184fb705cfed44856c7b9594b492926f7a63a128a5a2be7b896294d8c79838 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:97d2e4df-7837-4551-b2ed-685a91ca7a5f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH does not natively facilitate the publication of data on the web, as its primary purpose is to provide secure remote login and other secure network services over insecure networks. The protocol is a low-level secure transport and connection multiplexing protocol that does not define the metadata schemas, content formats, or web-based discovery mechanisms (such as W3C standards) typically used for data publication._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:9fd879a3-a655-4769-b27b-532c43b0c17f .

camssa:98a9c119-ea6b-4131-a6d3-4214b64b9a86 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH is designed specifically to provide secure remote login and other secure network services over an insecure network. It enables the secure exchange of information by establishing a transport layer that provides strong encryption, server authentication, and integrity protection for all data transmitted between the client and server._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:2cc8a042-6cad-4ef4-a823-658f22d32222 .

camssa:990ae32a-181a-476c-854e-be8030fd4028 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a16c678a586cf542d2ae1d6cd8a987bd6ed0b2af52ba0e04d8872fe616a9b7bd ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9b54f3b0-4a48-4615-8d93-9ec55757435d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-3b3b2febe9a7e3ad44bdefc47b0bbcafc7a2e677e9570d6ad822efbe1f7d41e2 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:9c6c325f-7f06-45c4-9df0-7eff617c8e4f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH is a foundational technical enabler for the digital delivery channels used by the European Commission and other public administrations. Its Connection Protocol enables the multiplexing of several logical channels into a single encrypted tunnel, which explicitly supports the secure tunneling (port forwarding) of arbitrary TCP/IP protocols, including HTTP._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:b1869a77-958b-4886-8734-65809b62a465 .

camssa:9ceff5f6-f1be-4146-ad38-690323f57707 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'The SSH Transport Layer Protocol protects information against unauthorized changes by mandating the use of a Message Authentication Code (MAC) for every packet sent. This MAC is computed from a shared secret, packet sequence numbers, and the message content, ensuring that any attempt to modify data in transit will be detected and cause the connection to be terminated._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:274cce80-d671-4583-84bd-0bc89a22c5bd .

camssa:9e1a1d74-7a88-4e12-abe0-21103f755068 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH simplifies the delivery of European public services by providing a standardised and secure framework for remote login and other secure network services over an insecure network. By establishing a reliable, encrypted transport layer that handles server authentication and data integrity, it allows public administrations to manage digital infrastructure and perform administrative tasks remotely and securely._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:a81575d6-697f-4eca-adc4-079a04a51a9d .

camssa:9fd879a3-a655-4769-b27b-532c43b0c17f a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-b433a6dd6682476829a60de6a4fb771395c4baf637aa496ba6bca9bd6766d933 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a147ed8c-3d93-478b-ac5c-3b7d9153c16a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-17a2b7a0ca372f407c300b69049faf9d92cbf274964290ba278b18cf10bf5dbf ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a2a18fc2-1096-4cce-a9a6-e1ff5e4b6676 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH is considered not applicable to this criterion since the delivery of multilingual public services is a low-level technical security framework designed for encrypted communication. It generally does not pass text that is intended for direct display to an end-user. However, the specification includes robust technical provisions to support internationalization and multilingualism whenever text exchange occurs._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:8e376462-033d-4253-8a8d-32e2fd4b3bb6 .

camssa:a362a836-6d55-4ff5-8ee0-4a13e256a0a9 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d520eae57650560dd54723cdcdd166243c9a0b1458a4afdc331175b5c1cada7e ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a4991e9d-9caa-416a-a894-d3108467c845 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-d83a73b3287a82d85b1bd3f5b18089e9794b091b6c6457992a77d5be6bc1500a ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a4b4b45e-9f88-404b-b784-27eaeac2b1e4 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-ceebc7042ff4b3525981f67e306167d9711ac0bce6ea07a067cdb4881854db97 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:a4ecdff5-0ae3-4ff0-9432-3a5c6d138690 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """"SSH is included in a French open repository and catalogues of standards at the national level (French Référentiel Général d’Interopérabilité, RGI), which serves as a national repository and catalogue of standards to ensure interoperability within public administration systems. _x000D_
_x000D_
This inclusion validates SSH as a recognised technical specification for providing the secure remote login and encrypted transport services necessary for national digital infrastructures. Its presence in such a catalogue aligns with its status as a mature, Internet standards track protocol suitable for the security requirements of modern public services._x000D_
_x000D_
Référentiel général d'interopérabilité (RGI) Reference:_x000D_
https://www.numerique.gouv.fr/uploads/Referentiel_General_Interoperabilite_V2.pdf_x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html\""""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:f86e0f5a-765b-4d0d-9331-d5d4507ad017 .

camssa:a81575d6-697f-4eca-adc4-079a04a51a9d a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-e225f44a0b0939b1b30a1ab03b2f38baeca8699c0cd44b4e39adbe19ffbb3542 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:ab2aa571-609e-4d6d-be25-621f238c1dff a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH specification is a technical framework for secure communications and does not manage or define the contents or logic of the data being processed. While its integrity mechanisms ensure that data is transmitted accurately (i.e., it is not modified in transit), it does not provide features to ensure the logical accuracy or completeness of the data processing performed by the applications using the protocol._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4d0f0ddb-16e4-49e4-a613-103027e5df1a .

camssa:ac8da26a-2756-471d-a40e-00f6b61e62bf a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH guarantees the authenticity of both parties involved in a data transaction through a multi-layered approach. The SSH Transport Layer Protocol provides cryptographic server host authentication to verify that the client is talking to the correct host. Simultaneously, the User Authentication Protocol authenticates the client-side user to the server using a suite of secure mechanisms, such as public key authentication, passwords, or host-based authentication._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:e3c912a4-e025-4010-8553-b36a963a9320 .

camssa:adb1f6ce-b2b1-470c-b75f-50481d42a3fd a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH is a low-level, binary-transparent transport protocol designed specifically for secure communication and remote access over insecure networks. Its primary function is to provide an encrypted tunnel for data in transit; it does not define, manage, or provide mechanisms for the long-term storage, archival, or preservation of electronic records, information, or knowledge._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:0169a8fc-dc94-4ab0-8a90-3e6028fd3f01 .

camssa:b1869a77-958b-4886-8734-65809b62a465 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:b1983dfe-84fe-4912-b4e8-1c8df76271e0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-0b00b9b74de866ed2278d14d1b9d7ecf2c06950d296bb2f17013c7b710d6de41 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:b19fb1b7-b5be-491e-9eae-39233351c715 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'SSH is inherently domain-agnostic, as it is designed as a general-purpose tool for secure remote login and other secure network services over insecure networks. It provides a versatile foundation for a wide range of purposes, such as interactive shell sessions, remote command execution, and the tunneling of arbitrary TCP/IP ports, making it usable across any business domain requiring secure communication._x000D_
_x000D_
SSH Transport Layer:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4253.html_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4254.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1177746c-9716-470e-96be-ad730cc8ed76 .

camssa:b325de36-b57d-4bf4-8efd-2269aec4175a a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-22c3c5b40201f4ab2cb64a2d34b7665f8d0d1562f2a3e1a493dd3312608c7537 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:b4a01603-3bdc-470b-b890-911d32a0bfb0 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
