camssa:58064492-daf4-41a6-8a00-4ffaa335100f a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'VC DM 2.0 allows relevant information to be reused by enabling credentials to be issued once and later presented and verified across different systems and services. The data model  ensures interoperability and enables the same trusted data to be reused in different contexts without the need for re-issuance or manual re-entry._x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Verifiable Credentials 2.0 reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model-2.0/_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Linked Data Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/ldp/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:5fb64479-dd93-4358-b216-6c4f91efd0ca .

camssa:5fb64479-dd93-4358-b216-6c4f91efd0ca a cav:Score,
