camssa:e632bad6-1667-473b-8925-65807a007c3c a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'VCDM was first published as a public working draft in 2017 and has since evolved through two major versions, v1.0 and the current v2.0, supported by additional governance and maintenance documentation._x000D_
_x000D_
VCDM is also referenced in Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2024/2979. Although the regulation explicitly refers to VCDM 1.1, it effectively points to the current evolution of the specification, VCDM 2.0, as the regulation has not yet been updated._x000D_
_x000D_
VCDM 2.0 enhances the security and trustworthiness of credentialing with greater precision than VCDM v1.1 and v1.0. One of its key advancements is the flexibility to support selective disclosure, including zero-knowledge proofs, allowing holders to reveal only specific parts of a credential without exposing the entire content, particularly certain asserted claims._x000D_
_x000D_
_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Recommendation Track: _x000D_
https://www.w3.org/2021/Process-20211102/#rec-track_x000D_
_x000D_
General Requirements for Technical Reports: _x000D_
https://www.w3.org/2021/Process-20211102/#recs-and-notes_x000D_
_x000D_
Commission Implementing Regulation (EU) 2024/2979_x000D_
https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg_impl/2024/2979/oj/eng_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Verifiable Credentials Data Model 2.0 Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model-2.0/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:3827812f-a6cf-4fc2-9991-b274ae33da1f .

camssa:eb2d2b78-58f5-4656-8b7f-78c5becfdd48 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-a16c678a586cf542d2ae1d6cd8a987bd6ed0b2af52ba0e04d8872fe616a9b7bd ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:ef022754-a461-4956-b540-9c25527a5e59 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-26d7b17ff73e55cbf2e7b90ec0eaca8627f132b000e1c8f2de8e5157d8ebe216 ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:f78683bb-bde9-4d56-974b-88b79fef2446 a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'VCDM 2.0 enables the secure processing of data by enabling credentials to include cryptographic proofs that allow systems to verify the authenticity and integrity of the information during processing. By working together with Verifiable Credentials Data Integrity (VCDI) and JSON Web Signature (JWS) specifications, it ensures that data can be validated before it is used._x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Verifiable Credentials 2.0 reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model-2.0_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Verifiable Credential Data Integrity reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-integrity_x000D_
_x000D_
JSON Web Signature Reference:_x000D_
https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7515.html'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:1430fbc7-b7b0-42bc-83ca-4b58e3a4a46b .

camssa:f8f5dd51-4ebe-4d61-94f9-e7565c344f9b a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-9c03a344765a6b8da57c4a7d40647791b737e3e1feecc14e3d59f2c69bdb246b ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:f950e7f2-4a0d-4f00-ad80-c2aa9ce6bb21 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-bb5b5da7c1dc98a64c6a6f22f8fc539a8f80702f896697e985dd2c06d4ab68aa ;
    cav:value "80"^^xsd:string .

camssa:fb91ec4b-5330-4464-beaf-5fcccb526de3 a cav:Score,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:assignedTo sc:c-c2d03f19521389763921ce9c758a3697caa22bed98c2c11c3b10344b11c468bb ;
    cav:value "100"^^xsd:string .

camssa:fdb5f66f-f136-44b2-b28f-9c262d7f4a6d a cav:Statement,
        owl:NamedIndividual ;
    cav:judgement """'VC DM 2.0 is not currently included in most Member States’ catalogues of recommended specifications. However, they are already being adopted in national initiatives. For example, Spain is using VC DM in its digital age verification system for access to online adult content. In this initiative, verifiable credentials are used to prove that a user is of legal age without revealing their identity, exact date of birth, or other unnecessary personal information._x000D_
_x000D_
CAMSS List of Standards:_x000D_
https://interoperable-europe.ec.europa.eu/collection/common-assessment-method-standards-and-specifications-camss/camss-list-standards_x000D_
_x000D_
W3C Verifiable Credentials 2.0 Reference:_x000D_
https://www.w3.org/TR/vc-data-model/'"""@en ;
    cav:refersTo camssa:4388cb91-23fa-4291-ab97-eb350959ba86 .

